<p. 1a>

oṃ namaḥ śrīkālikāyai |

yasyāḥ sṛṣṭimidaṃ kulākulagataṃ tatvena saṃpāditaṃ |
bhūtaṃ paṃcarasojvalaṃ ca nigamāścatvāra eva kramāt || 1 ||

būtādyaṃ kilasāgareṇa sahitaṃ nityaṃ jaganmaṇḍale tasyai sādhakasiddhidāna 
vimala prakhyāta kīrtyai namaḥ ||

vande jñānavarapradānanirataṃ pādāraviṃdaṃ gurordivyaughe prabhṛteśca 
vighnani ca yadhvaṃśalaṃvodaraṃ |
taṃtrāṇāṃ racanākaraṃ paśupatiṃ guhyeśvarīṃ kalikāṃ 
brahmopeṃdramaheṃdravaṃditatarāṃ vajrādikāṃ yoginīṃ ||

nepālādhipateḥ samastadharaṇīyānīndra cuḍāmaṇernānādānatapovratādi 
kavitāśīlasya vidyānidheḥ |
bhūpālendradharādhipasya navamī siṃhastvamātyaḥ
kramaṃ nirṇīyā śuvudhaiḥ samaṃ vitanute śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇiṃ ||

cedgraṃthalāghavadhiyātra nigūḍhaguptiḥ kāryā tadāvudhajane mama mugdhatā 
syāt |
tasmād rahasyakathanaṃ dhruvamasti loke prākaṭyadoṣaśamanaṃ kuru devimātaḥ ||

he dhīrā paramārthadattamanasaḥ siddhiṃ 
parāmīpsavastattaddaivatasadrahasyamakhilaṃ jñātuṃ ca cedutsukāḥ |
tat paśyaṃtu bhavaṃta eva mamataṃ graṃthaṃ madīyaṃ 
muddharnānātaṃtravilokanot sukatayānāyāsayadhvaṃ mataḥ ||

maṃtrāṇāṃ vacanaṃ yeṣāṃ graṃthesmin prakaṭī kṛtaṃ |
teṣāṃ nāmāni taṃtrasya utpatti kathanaṃ punaḥ ||

ādhikyamāgamānāṃ ca sṛṣṭyutpattiḥ kramastataḥ |
kālikā kṛṣṇayostārā rāmayoścaikarūpatā ||

nirṇayo daśavidyāyāḥ śivaśaktyo rūpāsanā |
śyāmāyāḥ sarvamūlatva muktamādye prakāśake ||
 
maṃtroddhāra krameṇaiva vāmadakṣiṇalakṣaṇaṃ |
vidyā svāmnāyake mārganirṇayaśca pṛthak pṛthak ||

āvaśyako makāreṣu cāśrāyādhīnatastuyaḥ |
guruṃ vinā taṃtra maṃtreṇādhikārī nirūpaṇaṃ ||

dīkṣā praśaṃsā gaditā dvitīye tu prakāśake |
śrīguroḥ śivatulyatvaṃ gurulakṣaṇa nirṇayaṃ ||

guruṃ vinopadeśau ca strīṇāṃ vāme svanāyakāt |
lakṣaṇālakṣaṇe śiṣya tayorāmnāya nirṇayaḥ ||

tyājyātyājya vivekaḥ syādupadeśāṃtaraṃ tayoḥ |
vaidikādiṣu maṃtreṣu strī śūdraunādhikāriṇau ||

<p. 1b>

jātirmanośca viprādau deyā deyā vivecanā |
eteṣāṃ tu sthitirjñeyā prakāśe tu tṛtīyake ||

turya prakāśe saṃskārāḥ ṣoḍaśaiva tu maṃtriṇaḥ |
tatra nāma prādānākhye cakrāṇāṃ likhanaṃ kṛtaṃ ||

maṃtrāṇāmadhi saṃskārāḥ ṣoḍaśaiva pracoditāḥ |
madhyeśāya pradānaha paṃcame tu prakāśate ||

māsādi nirṇayaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ prakāśe tu prakīrtitaḥ |
dīkṣāvidhirddhanādyādau paridhā grahaṇe bhuvaḥ ||

vāstuyāgavidherādau tasyotpattiḥ prakīrtitā |
tanmaṃṇḍalaṃ ca śāstroktaṃ tatra deva vinirṇayaḥ ||

valimaṃtrāśca taṃtrokta vāstumaṇḍala daivate |
prakāśe saptame prokte cāṣṭametha nigadyate ||

diksādhanaṃ maṇḍapasya kuṇḍāderllakṣaṇāni ca |
aṃkurā ropaṇaṃ proktaṃ navame tu prakāśake ||

gurornimaṃtraṇavidhirdaṃtakāṣṭa śubhāśubhaṃ |
svapnaḥ saṃprārthana vidhirvahneḥ sthiti vivecanaṃ ||

kuṇḍasaṃskāra pūrvaṃ hi vahnisaṃsthāpanaṃ punaḥ |
dīkṣāyādi na kṛtyaṃ ca tadaṃgaha vanaṃ tataḥ ||

maṃtrapradānabhedosti vāmadakṣiṇamārgayoḥ |
upadeśaḥ kulastrīṇāṃ dīkṣābhedopadeśakau ||

upāsanāvidhiḥ svapnalabdha maṃtrasya nirṇayaḥ |
manorgurośca devasyatyāgodaśa prakāśake ||

ācārā daśadhā proktā mahānīlādayaḥ kramāt |
śyāmādi vidyā viṣaye trayodaśa prakāśake ||

divyavīra paśūnāṃ ca bhāvāvālā prapūjane |
yogyāyogya vivekosti caturdaśa prakāśake ||

sātvikādi prabhedena pūjā bhinnāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
pṛthak mokṣapradaṃ karma prātaḥkṛtya vidhistataḥ ||

ajayāyā vidhānaṃ ca snānaṃ nānāvidhaṃ smṛtaṃ |
vibhūtidhāraṇaṃ saṃdhyā caṃdanaṃ ca kramāt punaḥ ||

gāyatrīṇāṃ samuddhāraḥ prakāśati smasaṃkhyake |
pūjāprasaṃsā dvārārcāsanaṃ bhūtāpasāraṇaṃ ||

bhūtaśuddhirmātṛkādiḥ kalāsaṃkhyā prakāśake |
aṃtaryyajanakarmāṇi cārghyādi sthāpanevidhiḥ ||

dravyāṇi yaṃtralikhane pīṭhanirṇayameva ca |
sālagrāma śilāyāśca utpattirlakṣaṇāni ca ||

harīṃśādrisutā sūryagaṇeśa dikpatigrahāḥ |
eteṣāṃ bhedato bhedaḥ samyagukta pṛthak pṛthak ||

<p. 2a>

mudrāḥ sarvopacāreṣu pratyekaṃ lakṣaṇādikaṃ |
nityahoma vidhirbhūta valirā rātrikaṃ tataḥ ||

devatā bhedato bhinnā karamālā pracoditā |
brahmārpaṇādikaṃ sarvaṃ saptadaśa prakāśake ||

kulamārga samutpattiḥ paṃcaśuddhirvidhistataḥ |
śaktiśuddhistu kaulāderviśeṣanyā sa nirṇayaḥ ||

dravyadāna vivekastadutpattiḥ pākakarmaṇi |
māṃsādernirṇayaḥ samyaṅmakārasyānu kalpakaṃ ||

āntarīya viśeṣastu saṃskāraṃ kathanaṃ kramāt |
pātrasaṃkhyā prakathane mānaseṣṭhādinirṇayaḥ ||

mahāpātrasya ca punaḥ sādhanaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ śuciḥ |
śrīpātrasthāpanādiśca tarpaṇaṃ tatvaśodhanaṃ ||

vaṭukādi valiścāṣṭhā daśamesti prakāśake |
pūjopacāra maṃtraśca kuladravyāṇi sevanaṃ ||

ūnaviṃśati saṃkhyesmin prakāśe prakaṭīkṛtaṃ |
bhojanādi vidhiḥ sāyaṃ tannīya kṛtyalekhanaṃ ||

śivāvalirnniśākṛtyaṃ nityabheda vinirṇayaḥ |
likhito viṃśatitame prakāśe sarvasaṃmate ||

śyāmā pūjākramastveka viṃśatyādya prakāśake |
stotrādi likhanaṃ samyak viṃśati prakāśake ||

mahākālādi nityānāṃ maṃtroddhārādikaṃ punaḥ |
trayoviṃśati saṃkhyesmin prakāśe prakaṭāyate ||

tārārcana kramoveva viṃśatyādya prakāśake |
pracaṇḍa caṇḍikā pūjā paṃcaviṃśati saṃkhyake || 

śrīvidyāyā kramaḥ samyak ṣaḍviṃśati prakāśake |
bhairavī ca mahālakṣmī mātaṃgī bhuvaneśvarī || 

dhūmāvatī ca vagalā tāsāṃ pūjā pṛthak pṛthak |
saptaviṃśati saṃkhyesmin prakāśe pratipāditaṃ ||

cakrapūjā pūrva kṛtyaṃ sāmagrī lakṣaṇaṃ tataḥ |
dvividhaṃ yajanaṃ tatra dūtānāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ pṛthak || 

daśavidyā krameṇaiva dūtīyāga vidhistataḥ |
cakrācāraḥ kṛtopyaṣṭā viṃśatyādya prakāśake ||

prastārādiśca yaṃtrāṇāṃ kramād dakṣiṇa vāmayoḥ |
pratiṣṭhādvividhā proktā ūnaviṃśat prakāśake ||

calācalādvidhā mālā devatāmnāya bhedataḥ |
pṛthak pṛthak valā proktā rudrākṣa saṃbhavādikaṃ ||

mahāśaṃkhādibhirbhinnā mahāphalavinirṇayaḥ |
grathanādi vivekastu saṃskārādi vidhāstathā ||

mahāmālā vinirmāṇaṃ saṃskārau mukhyabhedayoḥ |
jāgratīkaraṇaṃ tasyāḥ proktaṃ triṃśat prakāśake ||

<p. 2b>

kālacārthastatoṃgānipuraścaraṇakarmaṇaḥ |
vighnarājavidhirvidyā viśeṣāmnāyanirṇayaḥ ||

krameṇa daśavidyāyā japasaṃkhyādi nirṇayaḥ |
sarvasiddhipradaṃ sthānaṃ devatānāṃ pṛthak pṛthak ||

pīṭhānāṃ ca samutpaktiḥ kṣetrasya grahaṇe vidhiḥ |
kūrmacakra parijñānamabhiṣekavidhistataḥ ||

kāryākārya vicārastu saṃkalpakaraṇaṃ tataḥ |
japasya kālakathanaṃ rahasyamatu sūtake ||

maṃtravidyā vibhedena prabodhakāla nirṇayaḥ |
tayorbhede maṃtraśikhā maṃtra caitanyakaṃ tataḥ ||

krameṇa daśavidyāyāḥ kullukā vidhirīritaḥ |
setu viprādibhedena nirvāṇa kathanaṃ tataḥ ||

śāpotkīlanayorbhedaḥ sāpoddhāro sitāmanoḥ |
maṃtrasya hṛdayaṃ cārthanirṇayorna viśeṣataḥ ||

japasyāraṃbha bhedādi punarvīrapuraskriyā |
śāvarasya ca stotrādeścaika viṃśat prakāśake ||

maṃtrasiddherupāyāśca citāsādhana karmadha |
vīrasādhana bhedāśca vidyāyāṃ ca pṛthak pṛthak ||

japasaṃkhyā pramāṇaṃ ca yugma triṃśat prakāśake |
naimittikasya kālādi kulākula vinirṇayaḥ ||

grahaṇaṃ dvividhaṃ proktaṃ vāhyābhyaṃtarabhedataḥ |
damanāropaṇot pattirddamanāropaṇe vidhiḥ ||

pavitrāropaṇotpattiḥ pavitrāropaṇe vidhiḥ |
graṃthirbhedo devatā yā trayastriṃśat prakāśake ||

śāradīyavidhānaṃ ca catuḥstriṃśat prakāśake |
paśudāne vivekastu paśubhedādi nirṇayaḥ ||

devatā tṛptikālaśca paśorlakṣaṇavīkṣaṇaṃ |
narāṇāṃ prokṣaṇaṃ khaḍgalakṣaṇaṃ pātranirṇayaḥ ||

śubhāśubhaṃ ca naivedyaṃ paṃcatriṃśat prakāśake |
kumārī pūjanavidhau tāsāṃ lakṣaṇa nirṇayaḥ ||

śubhāśubhādi saṃketaḥ ṛtutriṃśat prakāśake |
sāmānyataḥ kāmyavidhiḥ ṣaṭkarma kramanirṇayaḥ ||

teṣāṃ prakīrṇakathanaṃ āsanādi nirūpaṇaṃ |
maṃtragrathanabhedādi mālā kuṇḍādi nirṇayaḥ ||

homadravyapramāṇaṃ ca saptatriṃśat prakāśake |
krameṇa daśavidyāyāḥ prayogaśca pṛthak pṛthak ||

prāyaścitta vidhiḥ paścādaṣṭa triṃśat prakāśake |
sāmrājya mudrikā paśyan yaṃtrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ kramāt ||

<p. 3a>

maṃtrīṇāṃ dhāraṇāyo na catvāriṃśat prakāśake |
pratyekaṃ mātṛvarṇa dhyānādīnāṃ nirūpaṇaṃ ||

krameṇa daśavidyāyāḥ maṃtrabhedāḥ prakīrtitā |
nānāprayogamaṃtrāḥ syuścatvāriṃśat prakāśake ||

kumārī yoginī kālī vārāhi kubjikā parā |
nārāyaṇī muṃḍamālā cāmuṇḍā bhuvaneśvarī ||

gautamī samasūtrāmaṇirvijayamālinī |
leelāvatī guhyasiddhirmālinī parameśvarī ||

pracaṇḍa caṇḍikā śaṃbhū nityā kātyāyanīti ca |
phetkārī bhairavī bhūtasiddhi siddheśvarī tathā ||

merunīlamataṃgāśca śaktisaṃgama bhairavī |
sākhyāyanaṃ kiraṇākhyaṃ gaṃdharva bhūtabhairavau ||

vīrārddanaṃ vīrabhadraṃ rudrakālānarottare |
siddhisārasvataṃ hāhārāvo maṃthānabhairavaḥ ||

siddheśvaro viśvasārastathā vauddhāyanaṃ punaḥ |
māheśvara mahāhārau kālāgniśca mṛḍāṇyapi ||

eteṣāmaṃ tato jñeyāstaṃtraśabdaḥ pṛthak pṛthak |
siddhanātho mahākālo dakṣiṇāmūrtireva ca ||

surendra brahmagorakṣā vai śaṃpāyanameva ca |
naṃdikeśvara vāyavyau vārāhī śāṃbhavīti ca ||

sanatkumāraḥ śrīkaṇṭhopyagastyastatvasārakau |
vasiṣṭa punareteṣāmaṃ tasyācchaṃhitābhidhā ||

brahmaviṣṇurudrasiddhadevyumācaṃdraśaktayaḥ |
eteṣāmaṃ tato jñeyā yāmalaṃ cāṣṭasaṃjñakaṃ ||

kulavīra maṃtrabhāva cūḍāmaṇibhirīritaḥ |
hayagrīvaṃ nāradābhyāṃ mahākapilato bhavet ||

paṃcarātra tato devī śaivaliṅgāgamāni ca |
kumārī vijayā kālī tārākalpāśca viśrutāḥ ||

mātṛmaṃtra jñānāni kulaguptā kulāni ca |
māghaścetebhyaḥ śabdebhyopyarṇavaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||

rahasya kramataḥ kullolinī śrīmatakālayoḥ |
uttaraṃ ca padaṃ jñeyaṃ caṇḍī pīṭhaṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

nityāhnikomā tilake coḍḍīśaṃ kulapūrvakaṃ |
svāyaṃbhuvaḥ somaśaṃbhustathaiva piṃgalāmataṃ ||

ṣaḍanvayo mahāratna navaratneśvarāvapi |
kāmadhenumataṃ kuṃbhakulasaṃbhavasaṃjñakau ||

kālikramomatsyasūktamudayākara paddhatiḥ |
yoginī hṛdayaṃ ceti kālī hṛdayameva ca ||

triśaktiratnakaṃ somabhujaṃgā valireva ca |
kulāvatārakaṃ padyavārāhī harapūrvataḥ ||

<p. 3b>

gaurī saṃvādakaṃ jñeyaṃ samākarṇyakamātṛkā |
tūrṇāyāgaśca lalita svacchaṃdaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||

kulaprakāśakaṃ ceti kulāmṛta pradīpikā |
navadurgā kalpasaṃjñaṃ kulamūlāvatārakaṃ ||

taṃtrarājaśca kāmākhyā śabdāt paṃcāsikāḥ smṛtā |
kularatnadyotakaṃsyādetebhyaḥ graṃthamadhyataḥ ||

vacanāti samānīyaṃ likhyate kriyate na tu ||

jātīkadaṃva karavīra kuśeśayādi puṣpebhya makaraṃda kaṇāprasiddhā ||
ānīya saṃcayatiyanmadhumakṣikā sā gṛhnaṃti daivata vidhau vibudhāna kiṃ tat || 

śrīdevyuvāca ||

trāhi trāhi mahādeva śaraṇāgatavatsalaḥ |
sāhaṃkārāvayaṃ mūḍhā īśvarā iti vādinaḥ ||

mahākālaḥ kathaṃ jñeyaḥ kathaṃ muktirbhavecchiva |
muktayaḥ katidhādeva śreṣṭhā kā kiṃca sādhanaṃ ||

yadāsmākaṃ yadi kṛpā devyā viṣṇau sureṣu ca ||

śrī(-)īśvara uvāca ||

jñāyate tatprabhāveṇa sakalaṃ vedavākyataḥ |
devebhyaḥ sāramuddhṛtya yat kṛtaṃ śaṃkareṇa vai ||

vedādhikatayā devīścāgama parikīrtitaḥ |
āgataṃ śivavaktrebhyo gataṃ ca girijāmukhaṃ ||

malatraya vināśitvāttasmādāgama ucyate |
āgamotpatti saṃkhye ca kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ||

sārddhavarṣāṣṭako brahmā yadā jātastu devatāḥ |
ahaṃkārīṃ mahān jātastaṃtra vidyā prabhāvataḥ ||

tadā tasmin kaliyuge śiśnodara parāyaṇāḥ |
nādṛtāstaistu vedādi smṛtayā vai vṛthāgame ||

khānaṃ pānaṃ maithunaṃ ca deśe deśe pure pure |
na kaścinmanyate viṣṇuṃ gaṇeśaṃ naraviṃśivaṃ ||

matvā sarvaṃ jagacchāktaṃ bhagapūjāṃ prakurvaṃte |
tadā vaṭukarūpeṇa mayā mṛṣṭāḥ pitāmahaḥ ||

brahmaṇādiśyatāṃ dharmovayaṃ yena tarena hi |
tadā tu brahmaṇā proktaṃ mamorddhva mukhanirgataḥ ||

āgamaḥ paṃcamo vedo bhuktimuktipradāyakaḥ |
tadādya kalisadye tu mayā proktaṃ pitāmahaḥ ||

brahmaṇerdatvayā vācyaṃ sṛṣṭikartā sadāśivaṃ |
tadā pitāmahe proktaṃ kartāhaṃ cāpi rakṣakaḥ ||

mamorddhvamukhato jātaṃ manyase cānya āgamaḥ |
evaṃ tadācāra niṣṭāyāsyaṃti maramāṃgatiṃ ||

cadustvaṃ vetsino saukhyaṃ khānapānāṃganābhavaṃ |
iti śrutvā brahmavaco dharmasaṃsthāpanāya tu ||

<p. 4a>

yugatrayastadājātaḥ krodhasaṃraktalocanaḥ |
avajñāṃ vīkṣya dhātuśca prakhareṇa nakhena ca ||

śiro nipātitaṃ dhātuḥ karāṃgulyāddharātale |
tanmukhā paṃcamo vedo mamadehelayaṃ gataḥ ||

tasmādāgamakartāhaṃ vedakartā pitāmahaḥ |
paṃcāśadvai mahāpadmāhyāgamaṃ graṃtha īritaḥ ||

taṃtra maṃtrā mahādevi sarvepi supratiṣṭhitaḥ |
triṃśannikharvaṣaṭ vṛṃda navatyarvudakoṭayaḥ ||

maṃtrā proktā maheśānihyāgamaṃ kutra kiṃ sthitaṃ |
tacchṛṇutvaṃ maheśāni yadyahaṃ tava vallabhaḥ ||

mahat paṃcāśapadme tu ṣaṭviṃśati bhuvisthitaṃ |
caturdaśasthitaṃ svarge daśapātāla gocaraṃ ||

evaṃ krameṇa deveśihyāgamaḥ kathito mayā |
āgame sarvaśāstrāṇi hyāgame sarvadaivataṃ ||

āgame sakalaṃ puṇyaṃmāgame kiṃ na labhyate |
āgamaṃ sakalaṃ jñānaṃ vidyāḥ sarvāḥ pratisthitāṃ ||

atha sṛṣṭikramaḥ ||

maṃtraśāstrasya siddhyarthamāvirbhavati pārvatī |
anādi vidyā kālī ca mahātārābhidhā parā ||

ṣaṭśāṃbhaveśvarī vidyā vācyā tītā parākalā |
mahāpralayamāsādyakoṭi brahmāṇḍanāyikā ||

śivaśaktimayaṃ dehamekī kṛtya sadāsthitā |
koṭivaktrā bhavādyāstu brahmāṇaḥ pretarūpiṇaḥ ||

tachmaśāne pranṛtyaṃtī gāyaṃtī dhyāna saṃkulā |
citirakṣā svarūpatvaṃ prāpyatiṣṭhati pārvatī ||

māheśvarāṇāmānaṃtyaṃ saṃti viṣṇoranekatāḥ |
śakrādīnāṃ tu gaṇanānāstyeva priyavādinī ||

nadyāṃ tu vālukāyāvattāvadiṃdrāpureritāḥ |
kīṭādbrahmāṇḍaparyaṃtaṃ sthāvaraṃjaṃgamādikaṃ ||

ekaikavāramiṃdratvaṃ gataṃ tatpunarapyalaṃ |
anaṃtakoṭi brahmāṇḍe yāvataḥ paramāṇavaḥ ||

tāvaṃtaḥ saṃsthitaṃ bhūmau citirūpistha rūpataḥ |
māheśvarī sametānāṃ brahmāṇī koṭikoṭayaḥ ||

tiṣṭhaṃti devadeveśi caturvedāḥ śavāsmṛtā |
yutāśca śavarūpeṇa saptapretagatā parā ||

sāmarasyaṃ samāsādya sarvarūpā samāhitāṃ |
vinduvyāpaka rūpeṇa svarūpaṃ vibhratīparaṃ ||

ekasminneva kāle tu svaviṃvaṃ paśyatī śivā |
tadbimbaṃ tu bhavenmāyā tatra mānasikaṃ śivaṃ ||

<p. 4b>

sṛṣṭerutpādanārthaṃ tu bhartṛrūpama kalpayet |
ādināthaṃ tu manasā kalpātīta svarūpiṇaṃ ||

taṃ vilokya maheśāni sṛṣṭyutpādana kāraṇāt |
ādināthaṃ mānasikaṃ svabhartāraṃ prakalpayet ||

viparītaratiḥ kṛtvā mahāśūnyaṃ vidhāya ca |
triṃśadarbudaṣaṭvṛṃda paṃcāśat padmakoṭayaḥ ||

yugāni parameśāni viparītaratā bhavet |
viparīta ratau deviviṃdureko bhavetpurā ||

biṃdudhvani sakāśācca pratyekaṃ varṇajātayaḥ |
mātṛkarṇāstadā jātā akṣareti tadā bhave ||

dhvaninā vyāptamakhilaṃ jagadetaccarācaraṃ |
adyāpi jāyate devi kādaṃvaryyā dhvani śrutaḥ ||

tatraikā tu sakhī jātā mahālāvaṇya kālikā |
śrīmahāsuṃdaraṃ rūpaṃ vibhratī paramākalā ||

tasyānāma mahākālī suṃdarīti prakalpayet |
tāṃ vilokya mahākālo mahāmoha paro bhavan ||

kālīṃ prativacaḥ kālo vāṇīṃ garvānvitāṃ parāṃ |
uvāca suṃdarī kālo mahākāla priyepare ||

trailokyasuṃdarī kālī kāruṇyā mṛtasāgare |
dvitīya vākyaṃ deveśi kālīmuvāca śaṃkaraḥ ||

mahāghore śivārāve krūra daṃṣṭrā karālinī |
lalajihve bhīmanāderdūdṛśaṃ vacanaṃ vadan ||

īdṛśaṃ vacanaṃ śrutvā nirguṇā paracaṇḍikā |
anādirūpā śrīkālīsomotpādana tatparā ||

kālo mohavaśaṃ jātaḥ kālikā māyayā śive |
anādi sṛṣṭorutpattiḥkāraṇārthaṃ maheśvarī ||

brahmāṇḍānāmatheśastvaṃ māyayā kathitaṃ kṣaṇāt |
kālasya māyāṃ jñātvā tu svayaṃ vyāpyatvatāṃgatā ||

kālastu cakito jātaḥ sā vai kutra gatā priyā |
hāhāprāṇapriyākālī sā vai kutra gatā priyā ||

iti mohavaśaṃ yātaḥ śmaśānāṭana tatparāḥ |
evaṃ mohavaśaṃ jāto bhrāṃtacittastadā bhavet ||

darśanārthaṃ tapastepe paṃcāśat padmakoṭayaḥ |
yugāni tatra jātāni na kālīdarśanaṃ śive ||

kālasya jātaṃ deveśi mārgabhraṣṭa parāyaṇaḥ |
iti jñātvā mahākālaḥ jñānaṃ dattaṃ maheśvarī ||

ākarṣaṇākhyā buddhistudattā kālāya pārvatī |
bhaktipriyā mahākālī śrīmahādakṣiṇāmatā ||

varadāneṣu tvaritā tenedaṃ dakṣiṇā smṛtā |
ākarṣaṇaṃ kṛtaṃ tena jātaṃ tatkṣaṇa mātrataḥ ||

kālyā jñānaṃ maheśāni mārgavyaktiparāyaṇaḥ |
kālo jāto maheśāni mahābhakti priyovacaḥ ||

<p. 5a>

śivākarṣaṇakaṃ karma mithunatva pradāyakam |
iti jñātvā maheśāni āgatyaṃ tu śivāṃtike ||

tadā svamanasā vālāṃ śaktiṃ kṛtvā maheśvarī |
ānīyādācca kālasya mārgābhyāsārthameva tu ||

mārgaṃ vinā maheśāni gatiratra kathaṃ bhavet |
tatrābhyāsa yutaḥ kālaḥ kuṇḍalī dhyāna tatparaḥ ||

manuṣyāṇāṃ kuṇḍalī tu sārddha trivalayā smṛtā |
śrīdevyāḥ kuṇḍalī devī svecchayā guṇitā śive ||

triguṇāśrī triśaktiśca yadā vedaguṇā bhavet |
caturvarṇā caika jaṭā caturvedeśvarī parā ||

yadā paṃcaguṇā devi mahogrā tu tadā bhavet |
yadā ṣaṭguṇitā śaktiḥ siddhi kālī prakīrtitā ||

yadā saptaguṇāṃ śaktiḥ saptārṇā kālasuṃdarī |
yadāṣṭaguṇitā śaktiraṣṭārṇā bhuvanāṃvikā ||

yadā navaguṇā śaktirnavārṇā caṇḍikeśvarī |
yadā daśaguṇā jātā daśavidyāsvarūpiṇī ||

yadā rudraguṇā jātā śmaśānakālikā bhavet |
yadā sūryaguṇā devi dvādaśī caṃdrabhairavī ||

yadā kāmaguṇā devī kāmabhedā ca tāriṇī |
caturddaśa guṇā jātā mahāpaṃcadaśī smṛtā ||

kalāguṇā yadā śaktiḥ śrīmahāṣoḍaśī tadā |
kalātītāguṇā devī chinnamastā tadā bhavet ||

aṣṭādaśaguṇāḥ proktā mahāmadhumatī bhavet |
ūnaviṃśadguṇādevī mahāpadmāvatī tadā ||

guṇitā viṃśati yadā viṃśadvarṇā ramā bhavet |
ekaviṃśadguṇādevi proktā śrīkāmasuṃdarī ||

dvāviṃśadguṇitādevī dakṣiṇā kālikā tadā |
trayoviṃśadguṇādevi vidyeśī tu tadā bhavet ||

guṇitā tatva saṃkhyābhirgāyatrīsyā tadā bhavet |
paṃcaviṃśadguṇādevī paṃcamī suṃdarī tadā ||

ṣaḍviṃśadguṇitāśaktiḥ ṣaṣṭhividyā prakīrtitā |
saptaviṃśadguṇādevi mahāratneśvarī parā ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā sā vai guṇitā paramā kalā |
aṣṭāviṃśatyakṣarī sā mṛtasaṃjīvanī parā ||

ūnatriṃśadguṇādevī mahānīra sarasvatī |
triṃśadguṇā yadā vidyāvasorddhārā tadā smṛtā ||

ekatriṃśadguṇā devī trailokyamohinī bhavet |
dvātriṃśadguṇitā cetsyāttrailokya vijayā smṛtā ||

trayastriṃśadguṇā cetsyācchrīmachrī kāmatāriṇī |
catustriṃśadguṇā śaktiraghorākhyā tadā bhavet ||

paṃcatriṃśadguṇādevī saṃgītamohinī bhavet |
ṣaḍtriṃśadguṇitā vidyā vagalākhyā tadā bhavet ||

<p. 5b>

saptatriṃśadguṇāśaktiḥ proktā vidyātvaruṃdhatī |
aṣṭātriṃśadguṇā cetsyādannapūrṇeśvarīmatā ||

guṇito na catvāriśannakulī parikīrtitā |
catvāriṃśadguṇāśaktiḥ proktā vidyā trikaṃṭakī ||

guṇitā ekacatvāriṃśat tadā rājeśvarī kalā |
dvicatvāriṃśadguṇitā trailokyākarṣaṇī tadā ||

tricatvāriṃśadguṇitā rājarājeśvarī smṛtā |
catuścatvāriṃsadguṇitā kukkuṭī parikīrtitā ||

catvāriṃśat ṣaṣṭaguṇāḥ proktāḥ śrīmṛtyuhāriṇī |
catvāriṃśa muniguṇā mahābhogamatīmatā ||

catvāriṃśadvasuguṇā vāsavī parikīrtitā |
ūnapaṃcāśadguṇitā phetkārī parikīrtitā ||

paṃcāśadguṇitā devī mahāśrīmātṛsundarī |
paṃcāśaccaṃdra guṇitā mātṛkotpatti suṃdarī ||

ekaika mātṛkā varṇaṃ pratividyāḥ sakāśataḥ |
utpannā parameśānisvotpattiṣuparāyaṇā ||

yo bhāvo yasya vai proktastadbhāve saṃsthitā śivā |
svecchāyā varayaṃ kṛtvā yathā kuṇḍalinī sthita ||

tathā vidyāsu saṃjātā akṣobhya munirūpiṇī |
sārddha trivalayādevī manuṣyasya prakīrtitā ||

evaṃ vidyā samutpannāḥ kuṇḍalīto maheśvarī |
yena tuṣṭāsu yāpūrvā sa tasyā ṛṣirīritaḥ ||

upāsakāstadanyesyuriti saṃkṣepato mataṃ |
athāto brahmadeve śiṣyāṣyāsyāmi yathā kramaṃ ||

vījāṃkura sphaṭijavā brahmeti parikīrtitaṃ |
tadidaṃ brahma cākhyātaṃ kālakālīmayaṃ paraṃ ||

dāvadhi varṇito vākyaṃ tāvatsaguṇatāgataṃ |
tadeva saguṇaṃ brahmavarṇanā śaktigocaraṃ ||

varṇanāyāmaśaktirhi yadā jātā maheśvarī |
tadeva nirguṇaṃ proktaṃ saguṇaṃ vācyagocaraṃ ||

vāgbhavaṃ mukhamityuktaṃ mukhāduccāryate ca tat |
avācyaṃ yadbhavedbrahma tatkathaṃ mukhagocaraṃ ||

svāśaktyā yaṃtritacca tasmācchakte pradhānatāḥ |
śaktikoṇe maheśāni brahmāṇḍānāmanaṃtakaṃ ||

sarvaṃ tiṣṭhati deveśi jagadetaccarācaraṃ |
tasyā kuṇḍalinī śakti rakṣobhya nāgarūpiṇī ||

svecchayāguṇitādevi svecchāvarṇaḥ svarūpiṇī |
brahmāṇḍagolā deveśi kālyā tasmai pradarśitaḥ ||

<p. 6a>

brahmagolā viṣṇugolā rudragolastṛtīyake |
lokeśa goladeveśi deva golastataḥ śive ||

tato hi ṛṣigolo hi kramādgolāśca koṭiśaḥ |
paraṃbrahma ca prakṛtiḥ pratibimbaḥ svarūpiṇī ||

mahattatvaṃ tato jātamahaṃkārastataḥ paraṃ |
ākāśastu tato jātastato vāyuḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

tatogni pūjātogra agnerāpaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
pānīyāt pṛthivī jātā tatohyauṣadhayaḥ śubhāḥ ||

auṣadhībhyo bhavedannaṃ annātprāṇaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
prāṇājjīvo hi saṃjāto jīvātmā paramātmakau ||

brahmaviṃvāt sarvametajjagadetaccarācaraṃ |
ata eva bhavedbrahmajagadetaccarācaraṃ ||

satvaṃ rajastama iti brahmaviṣṇuśivādayaḥ |
ye cānye vahavo bhūtāḥ sarvaṃ prakṛti saṃbhavāḥ ||

saiva devī mahāśaktiḥ śyāmā dakṣiṇakālikā |
saiva prasūyate viśvaṃ viśvaṃ saiva prayāti ca ||

saiva saṃharate viśvaṃ jagadetaccarācaraṃ |
ādhāraṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ saiva rogārtihāriṇī ||

icchākriyā tathā jñānā brahmaviṣṇuśivātmikā |
tridhā śaktiḥ svarūpeṇa sṛṣṭisthityaṃtakāriṇī ||

sṛjati brahmarūpeṇa viṣṇurūpeṇa pālyate |
saṃhared rudrarūpeṇa jagadetaccarācaraṃ ||

yasyā yonau jagatsarve madhye pravartatekhilaṃ |
yasyāṃ pralīyate viśvaṃ yasyāṃ tajjāyate punaḥ ||

yāṃ samārādhya trailokyaṃ saṃprāptaṃ padamuttamaṃ |
tasmādbhedaṃ pravakṣyāmi sāvadhānāvadhāraya ||

kadācidādyā lalitā puṃrūpā kṛṣṇavigrahā |
lokaḥ saṃmohanārthāya svarūpaṃ vibhratīparā ||

veṇunāda samāraṃbha sarvasaṃmohana kṣamā |
kadācidādyāḥ śrīkālīsaiva tārostipārvatī ||

kadācidādyāḥ śrītārāpuṃrūpārāmavigrahā |
rāvaṇasyavadhārthāya devānāṃ sthāpanāni ca ||

daitya saṃhāraṇārthāya puṃrūpaṃ vibhratī paraṃ |
ādyā tārā mahāśaktiḥ saivakālī maheśvarī ||

yā mahāvaiṣṇavī māyā sā mahāsuṃdarī matā |
naiva strī na pumāneṣā naiva cāgni napuṃsakaṃ ||

yadyacchurī ramādhatte pūjyate tena tena sā |
kadācijjāyate sā strī kadācidapi sā pumān ||

tāṃ tāṃ tanuṃ vitanute līlārthamarimarddanī |
sarvabhedāḥ kālikāyā saivādyāḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi siddhividyādi nirṇayaḥ |
tatvaṃ kathaya deveśa yadimekaruṇā tava ||

<p. 6b>

śrīśivovāca ||

caturyuga krameṇaiva bhedabhedāṃtare śive |
satye kālī ca śrīvidyā kamalā bhuvaneśvarī ||

siddhividyā maheśāni triśakti vagalāśive |
mahāvidyā satyayuge mātaṃgī bhairavīśive ||

dhūmāvatī ca vidyāsyāt tretāyāṃ śṛṇu pārvatī |
kālītārā suṃdarī ca siddhividyā prakīrtitā ||

mātaṃgī bhuvanā lakṣmī mahāvidyā prakīrtitā |
dhūmāvatī bhairavī ca vidyātvena maheśvarī ||

dvāpare kālikā tārārodhinī bhairavī tathā |
siddhividyā maheśāni suṃdarī bhuvanā ramā ||

dhūmāvatī mahāvidyā mātaṃgī kamalā tathā |
vidyātvena maheśāni kalaukālī tu kevalaṃ ||

kālītārā chinnamastā siddhividyā kalau matā |
suṃdarī bhairavī lakṣmī mātaṃgī bhuvaneśvarī ||

mahāvidyā maheśāni dhūmā ca vagalā śive |
vidyātvena maheśāni kalau saṃkīrtitā mayā ||

kālikāyāṃ mahākālaścā kṣobhyastāriṇī manau |
tripurāyāṃ tu rājeśo vagalāyāṃ ca tryamvakaḥ ||

mātaṃgyāṃ tu maheśaśca bhuvanesyāṃ maheśvaraḥ |
nārāyaṇo mahālakṣmyāṃ mahādevaṃ śṛṇu priye ||

chinnāyāṃ tu karālasyāt siddhāyāṃ kukkuṭeśvaraḥ |
dhūmrāyāṃ tu aghoraḥ syāditi saṃkṣepato matāṃ ||

śaktyā vinā śive sūkṣme nāmadhāma na vidyate |
śivaṃ vinā citkalāyāṃ na kalātvaṃ kvacidbhavet ||

bijāṃkuranyāya yogācchiva śaktyātmakaṃ mahaḥ |
sadā jāgarti deveśi nānārūpāṇi darśayat ||

sarvābhāve tu vaṭukto mahākālastathaiva ca |
tāriṇāṃ vaṭukaḥ proktaḥ kālyāṃ kālaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

kalau kālī kalau kalī kalau kālī tu kevalā |
sādhitā kālanāthena pratyakṣā kālikā valau ||

kalau kālīṃ vihāyātha yaḥ kaścin mokṣakārmukaḥ |
sa bhojanaṃ vinā sūnaṃ kṣūnnivṛttimabhīpsati ||

kalaukālīṃ vihāyāthayaḥ kaścicchāṃtimicchati |
sahiśīta nivṛttyarthaṃ himaśailaṃ niṣedhite ||

kalau kālīṃ vihāyāthayaḥ kaścinmokṣakārmukaḥ |
sa siddhānnaṃ parityajya viṣabhojanamicchati ||

kalau kālīṃ vihāyātha yaḥ kaścitkāvyamicchati |
sa tu duḥkhanivṛttyarthaṃ pāpāni kurute sadā ||

sa daridro mahāmūrkho mamadrohī sa eva tu |
yugatrayeṣu deveśi kalipūrveṣu tatvataḥ ||

<p. 7a>

anyā vidyāmapi bhajan siddhimāpnoti mānavaḥ |
kalau kālī sparśamaṇirnānyā vidyā kadācana ||

śrīmahākālikā vidyā kalau pūrṇaphalapradā |
ajñānādjñānato cāpi salīlaṃ vā sahelayā ||

smṛtāpi siddhidā kālī sakṛdeva maheśvarī |
caturyugānāṃ rājñī vai kālikā parikīrtitā ||

vidyārājñī siddhi vidyā kalau śīghraphalapradā |
nāmaikyādrūpa sāmyārddha mahāvidyā prakīrtitā ||

mahāvidyā siddhividyā vidyābhedaiḥ pratiṣṭhitā |
upavidyādibhedaiścakālikā saṃsthitā bhuvi ||

tārādyāḥ sakalā vidyā kālikāyāṃ ajāyata |
sarvavidyā kālikāyāṃ saṃsthitā eva pārvatī ||

śaktiḥ śivaśaktirbrahmā śaktirviṣṇurjanārddanaḥ |
śaktiriṃdroraviḥśaktiśaktiścaṃdro grahāḥ dhruvaṃ ||

śaktirūpaṃ jagatsarvaṃ yo na jānāti nārakī |
teṣāṃ madhye prajātaṃ tu kālīrūpaṃ manoharaṃ ||

viśeṣataḥ kaliyuge narāṇāṃ bhuktimuktidaṃ |
kalirhigrasyādāsasya pādapūjāṃ karoti hi ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau sṛṣṭikramanirūpaṇātmaka prathamaprakāśaḥ] || 1 ||

atha dakṣiṇakālyāstu maṃtramuddhārayāmyahaṃ |
yadekacārasmaraṇāt kiṃ tad yatnakaresthitaṃ ||

krodhi saṃvahni saṃyuktaṃ trimūrtīṃduḥ samāyutaṃ |
trilikhet parato devi hūṃkāradvayameva hi ||

māyādvayaṃ samālikhya atriḥ saṃvarta sūkṣmayuk |
ne kālike saptavarṇān pūrvavat parameśvarī ||

svāhāṃteyaṃ mahāvidyā dvāviṃśatyakṣarī parā |
manasā viśvavijñānaṃ trāṇaṃ saṃsāravaṃdhanāt ||

yataḥ karoti saṃsiddhi maṃtra ityucyate tataḥ ||

atha vidyāmāhātmyam ||

nātrasiddhādi ciṃtāsti nāri mitrādi lakṣaṇaṃ |
tayā prayāsa vāhulyaṃ na kāyakleśa saṃbhavaṃ ||

asyāḥ smaraṇa mātreṇa siddhayoṣṭau bhavaṃti hi | 
evaṃ samastavidyānāṃ rājñīṃ stotuṃ na śakyate ||

navakoṭi sahasraistu jihvākoṭi śatairapi |
sarvasiddhipradā devī aniruddha sarasvatī || 

tasmādasyā jñānamātrāt siddhayaḥ saṃbhavaṃti hi |
aniruddha sarasvatyā jñānamātreṇa sādhakaḥ ||

pāṇḍitvaṃ ca kavitve ca vāgīśa samatāṃ vrajet |
tasya pāṇḍitya vai dagdhaṃ vicitrapadyakalpanāt ||

devā api vilajaṃte kiṃ supturmānuṣādayaḥ |
api cet tvatsamānārīmatsamaḥ puruṣosti cet ||

aniruddha sarasvatyāsamo maṃtrastadā bhavet |
ya etāṃ ciṃtayen maṃtriḥ sarvakāma samṛddhidāṃ ||

<p. 7b>

tasya haste sadaivāsti sarvasiddhirna saṃśayaḥ |
gadyapadyamayī vāṇī sabhāyāṃ tasya jāyate ||

brahmahatyā surāpānamagatyāgamanāni ca |
sarvamāśrutaratyeva dakṣiṇāmeva ciṃtayan ||

vāgīśvaraḥ samovācīdhanena dhanadopamaḥ |
caṃdrasūryaḥ samo bhūtvā vaset kalpāyutaṃ divi ||

ityādimādikaṃ caiva vahuḥ kiṃ kathyate punaḥ |
na tasya durlabhaṃ kiṃcidyaḥ smareghorakālikāṃ ||

aśvamedhaiśca gomedhairnaramedhaistathāparaiḥ |
dānaiśca vividhairanyai homairnānāvidhairapi ||

anekapuṇya saṃbhārairyadi saṃprāpyate parā |
vidyārājñī ghorakālīhya niruddha sarasvatī ||

jñātvaiva muktimāpnoti kiṃ punaḥ kathyate paraṃ |
maṃtrasya jñānamātreṇa vijayībhuvi jāyate ||

tasyā loka na mātreṇavādinoniḥ prabhāmatāḥ |
rājānopi hi dāsatvaṃ bhajete kiṃ pare janāḥ ||

vahneḥ śaityaṃ jalastaṃbhaṃgatistaṃbhaṃ vivasvataḥ |
divārātri vyatyayaṃ ca sa kartuṃ bhavati kṣamaḥ ||

asyāstu jñānamātreṇa jīvanmuktaḥ prajāyate |
bṛhaspati samo vāgmī dharaṇī sadṛśaḥ kṣamī ||

śrīrāmasadṛśo vīryerūpe kāma samaḥ smṛtaḥ |
samudra iva gāṃbhīrye tejasā bhāskaropamaḥ ||

durvāsā iva śāpādau krodhādau sa yamopamaḥ |
sṛṣṭau prajāpatiḥ sākṣāt sthitau viṣṇuḥ samastathā ||

laye haraḥ samohyeṣaḥ etāṃ yovetti tatvataḥ |
vahunā kimihoktena samāno nāsti bhūtale ||

asyā japo brahma japo dhyānamasyātmaciṃtamaṃ |
yoga saṃdhāraṇaṃ samyak dhyānamasyā na saṃśayaḥ ||

mahāpadi mahāpāpe mahāgraha nivāraṇe |
mahābhaye mahotpāte mahāśoke mahāmaye ||

mahāmohe mahāsārthe mahādāridra saṃkaṭe |
mahāraṇye mahāśūnye mahājñāne mahāraṇe ||

duradhve ca durāvāse durbhikṣe durnnimittake |
samastakleśa saṃghāte smaraṇādeva nāśayet ||

asyā jñānaṃ jñānameva dhyānamasyātma ciṃtanaṃ |
tasmādasyā samāvidyāḥ nāsti taṃtrena saṃśayaḥ ||

brahmādi bhavane tasya na samaḥ kimucāpare |
sa eva sukṛtī loke sa eva kulabhūṣaṇaḥ ||

dhanyā ca jananī tasya yena devī samarcitā |
gāme ca tuṃvuruḥ sākṣāddānekarṇaḥ samopamaḥ ||

dattātreya samo jñānī yena devī samarcitā |
medhā prajñā tathā lakṣmīvallabhaḥ sarvajaṃtuṣu ||

<p. 8a>

asyāḥ smaraṇamātreṇa deha jñānaṃ prajāyate |
kṛte caivāpi tretāyāṃ paraṃ carcā pare yuge ||

pratyakṣā devatāḥ sarvābhaktādhīnā hi devatāḥ |
guruṇā karuṇā siṃdhuvīreṇa cakitāsitā ||

sevitā śuddhabodhena pratyakṣā kālikākalau |
sarvasiddhipradā sākṣānmahāpātakanāśinī ||

devairdevatva viṣaye siddhaiḥ khecarasiddhaye |
pannagairākṣasairmatyairmunibhiśca mumukṣubhiḥ ||

kāmibhirddharbhiścārthamīpsubhiḥ sevitā sadā ||

atha tārāmaṃtraḥ ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi tārāmaṃtrāt kavitvadaṃ |
oṃ māyā trīṁ hūṁ phaḍiti paṃcavarṇo manurmataḥ ||

atha chinnāyāḥ ||

praṇamaccaramāṃ lajjāṃ bījadvaṃdvaṃ ca vāgbhavaṃ |
vajravairocanīye hrīṃhrīṃphaṭ svāhāṃtarākṣaraḥ ||

atha ṣoḍaśī ||

śrībījaṃ śaktibījaṃ ca kāmabījaṃ ca vāgbhavaṃ |
vālāṃtaḥ saṃsthitaṃ vījaṃ praṇavaṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ ||

śaktibījaṃ ramāṃ caiva vidyāṃ ca parameśvarīṃ |
lopā vā kāmarājaṃ vā trikūṭāmatha cāparāṃ ||

vinyasya punarādyāni vījāni paṃcasuṃdarī |
viparīta krameṇaiva vinyaset ṣoḍaśī parā ||

atha bhairavī |

vipadbhṛgu hutāśastho mauktiko biṃduśeṣaraṃ |
viyattadādi kendrāgni sthitaṃ vāmākṣi viṃdumat ||

ākāśabhṛgu vahnistho manuḥ sargendukhaṇḍavān |
paṃcakūṭātmikā vidyādevī tripurabhairavī ||

atha lakṣmī ||

aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ klīṁ samuccārya hasarādrauyutāḥ punaḥ |
visargāṃtāḥ paṃcamaṃ tu vījametadudāhṛtaṃ ||

jagatprasūtyai hṛdayaṃ dvādaśārṇo manurmataḥ |
praṇavādirayaṃ maṃtraḥ syāt trayodaśavarṇakaḥ ||

atha mātaṃgyāḥ ||

praṇavaṃ ca tato māyāṃ kāmavījaṃ ca kūrcakaṃ |
mātaṃgī ṅeyutā cāstraṃ vahnijāyā vadhirmanuḥ ||

atha bhuvaneśvaryāḥ ||

atha vakṣye maheśāni bhuvaneśī manūttamāṃ |
na kulīśo'gnimārūḍho vāma netrārddha caṃdravān ||

atha dhūmāvatyāḥ ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi dhūmāvatyā manuṃ paraṃ |
dhūṁ dhūṁ dhūmāvatī svāhā maṃtroṣṭākṣara īritaḥ ||

atha bagalāyāḥ ||

tāraṃ māyāṃ samuccārya vadecca bagalāmukhī |
tadagre sarvaduṣṭānāṃ tato vācaṃ mukhaṃ padaṃ ||

staṃbhayeti padaṃ jihvāṃ kīlayeti tataḥ paraṃ |
buddhiṃ vināśaye hrīṁ oṃ svāhā ṣaṭtriṃśadarṇakaḥ ||

ityevaṃ kālikābhedād daśavidyā udīritā |
devyā dakṣiṇa saṃjñāyā pravakṣyāmi yathā vidhiḥ ||

<p. 8b>

kṛte śrutyukta mārgaḥ syāt tretāyāṃ smṛtibhāṣaṇaṃ |
dvāpare vai purāṇoktaḥ kalā vāgaṃ sa saṃbhavaḥ ||

aśuddhāḥ śūdrakarmāṇo brāhmaṇāḥ kalisaṃbhavāḥ |
teṣāmāgamamārgeṇa siddhirnaśraunna vartmanā ||

āgamokta vidhānena kalau devān yajet sudhīḥ |
na hi devāḥ prasīdaṃti kalau cānya vidhānataḥ ||

upāsanā tridhā proktā śreṣṭhā tatva tu sāttvikī |
yasyāṃ ca mānasī pūjā japau mukhyatamau smṛtau ||

rājaso dakṣiṇo mārgaḥ pratimāyāṃ ca pūjanaṃ |
bāhyopacāraiḥ puṣpādyaistadādyānāṃ viśiṣyate ||

tāmasopāsanaṃ proktaṃ pīṭhādau validānataḥ |
vāmamārgeṇa taccādyaṃ varṇe hitvā praśasyate ||

eṣā vyavasthā saṃproktā vāmadakṣiṇayoḥ parā |
ācāro dvividho devī vāmadakṣiṇa bhedataḥ ||

paṃcamudrādi rahito dakṣiṇācāra saṃjñakaḥ |
madyaṃ māṃsaṃ tathā matsyaṃ mudrā maithunameva ca ||

makāre paṃcakairdevī yonau kaulaḥ prapūjayet |
vāmahastāt pānapūjā kramādvāni prakīrtitāḥ ||

dakṣahastātyānayogādvāmahasta pratarpaṇāt |
dakṣahastāt pūjanāddhikaula ityabhidhīyate ||

kevalaṃ dakṣahastena pūjanād dakṣiṇābhidhaḥ |
upāsanā dvidhā proktā sā kāmākāma vicyutā ||

mokṣabījaṃ tu niḥkāmā sakāmo bhavabījakaṃ |
paṃthā tu dakṣiṇeṃ śreṣṭho vāmaṃ śreṣṭhataromataḥ ||

yastu vāmaṃ vijānāti sa eva paramoguruḥ |
ahaṃ jānāmi saṃpūrṇaṃ pādonaṃsanakādayaḥ ||

arddhaṃ cāpi vaśiṣṭhādyāḥ śakrādyāḥ pādasaṃmitaṃ |
jānaṃti māthāḥ ṣaṣṭhāṃśaṃkoṣṭhaṃśamitarejanāḥ ||

pataṃti koṭayaścātra jāyaṃte kṛmi yoniṣu |
taṃ mārge ye vijānaṃti te muktānātra saṃśayaḥ ||

śrīkṛṣṇo vāmamārgaṃ tu phālguṇyāyopadiṣṭavān |
mayā ciṃtaya tādṛṣṭo munibhyaśca nirūpitaḥ ||

cāṇḍālo vā turuṣko vā brahmahāvātha maskarī |
śrotriyotāmasamārgīṃ bhuktimuktyoḥ sabhājanaṃ ||

vāmadakṣiṇamārgo hi kālītārāvidhau smṛtaḥ |
chinnāvidhau vāmamārgo vagalā vāmadakṣagā ||

suṃdarī vāma divyā ca dakṣe mārgepi saṃsthitāḥ |
vālāvidyā dakṣavidyāmātaṃgī vāmadakṣiṇā || 

<p. 9a>

kevalā bhuvanā lakṣmī dhūmā dakṣiṇamārgagāḥ |
sumukhī vāmasaṃtuṣṭā vaṭuko vāmadakṣiṇaḥ ||

bhairavī vāmayogasthā bagalā vāmadakṣiṇā |
pūrvāmnāye dakṣavāmau dakṣiṇe divyavāmake ||

kauladakṣau paścime tu kaulavāmau tathottare |
ūrddhva divyau maheśāni pātāle vāma eva ca ||

yadīśādyāḥ sarvavidyāḥ kāminī yoganāyikā |
vāmamārgena siddhyaṃti nānyathā siddhidāḥ kvacit ||

vāmadakṣiṇayogena ubhayācāra tatparā |
śaivaśākte gāṇapatye saurasvāyaṃbhuve tathā ||

cāṃdracīne pāṃcarātre vaiṣṇave vaidikepi ca |
vāme cāṃte bhaviṣyaṃti kaledvaijāti jātayaḥ ||

evaṃ darśaṇamārgepi na hi vāmaṃ karotti cet |
tasya siddhirnnadeveśi mama vairī prakīrtitaḥ ||

sarvasmādadhiko vāmadharmaḥ proktaḥ kulāgame |
tatrāpi kālikā tārā vidhau priyataraḥ smṛtaḥ ||

kāpālike maheśāni vāmamārgotrakāraṇaṃ |
vāmamārga prakāreṇa sarvaṃ siddhyaṃti nānyathā ||

vāmamārgaṃ vinādevī na hi siddhyaṃti devatāḥ |
uttarāmnāya saṃproktā devāstuṣyaṃti paṃcamaiḥ ||

ūnaḥ padārtha ekaścet sādhakaṃte śapaṃti ca |
paścimāmnāya devānāṃ surāpānaṃ kṛtā kṛtaṃ ||

maccatuṣṭayamicchaṃti taṃ vinā praśapaṃti ca |
pūrvāmnāyokta devānāṃ tanmāṃsaṃ ca kṛtā kṛtaṃ ||

āvaśyakaṃ matrayaṃ ca taṃ vinā praśayaṃtite |
ūrddhvāmnāyokta devānāṃ te matsyāśca kṛtā kṛtāḥ ||

āvaśyakaṃ madvayaṃ ca vinā taṃ praśayaṃtite |
dakṣiṇāmnāya devānāṃ niṣiddhaṃ sa catuṣṭayaṃ ||

menaikena vinātepi praśayaṃti hi sādhakaṃ |
kaulikaṃ kūrcataḥ karmavaidikaṃ nābhidhīyate ||

vaidikaṃ kūrcataḥ karmakaulikaṃ nābhidhīyate |
viruddhāddubhayaṃ naṣṭaṃ tathā eka pathā caret ||

vāmamārgī yadā dakṣaṃ praviśet tat suraiḥ sa tu |
vighnāṃte pīḍyate cāpi na siddhimadhi gacchati ||

dakṣamārgī yadā vāmaṃ praviśet tatsurāstadā |
lokadvayādvyāpayaṃtitaṃ grasaṃti ca vāminaṃ ||

tasmāt svakulamārgaṃ tu jñātvā kuryāddupāsanaṃ |
yadṛcchayā śṛutaṃ taṃtraṃ chadmanāpi valena vā ||

pareritaṃ tavā gāthā tajjapedyadyanarthakṛt |
na śāstramālokve devannācarenna japedapi ||

<p. 9b>

na paśyennopadiśyecca na kuryānnaiva sādhayet |
pustake likhitān maṃtrānālokya prajapaṃtiye ||

brahmā hatyā samaṃ teṣāṃ pātakaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
tasmāddīkṣāṃ prayatnena sadā kuryācca tāṃtrikīṃ ||

athātaḥ prathamato dīkṣāṃ pravakṣyāmi viśeṣataḥ |
dīyate jñāna vijñānaṃ kṣīyate pāparāśayaḥ ||

tena dīkṣā iti proktā prāptā ca sadgurormukhāt |
adīkṣitānāṃ martyānāṃ doṣaṃ śṛṇvaṃ tu sādhakāḥ ||

annaṃ viṣṭā samaṃ tasya jalaṃ mūtra samaṃtathā |
adīkṣitaṃ kṛtaṃ śrāddhaṃ śrāddhaṃ cādīkṣitasya vā ||

gṛhītvā pitarasteṣāṃ narake ca mudāruṇe |
pataṃtyeva na saṃdeho yāvadiṃdrāścaturdaśaḥ ||

sahasrai  (***)(?) raiśca bhaktiyukto yajedyadi |
tathāpya dīkṣitasyārthāṃ devāgṛhnaṃti naiva ca ||

karmākhilaṃ vṛthā yasmāt tasmāda dīkṣitaḥ paśuḥ |
tasmādaṃ dīkṣitaṃ dṛṣṭvā kiṃcit kāryaṃ na sādhayet ||

dīkṣāgrahaṇakāle tu pāparāśiḥ parāyate |
nirvāṇapada saṃyukto vahirgacchati tatparaḥ ||

tadā deva pitṛṇāṃ tu kāryārdhye bhavati svayaṃ |
anyathā yatkṛtaṃ karma hutaṃ bhasmani havyavat ||

sarvāśrameṣu dīkṣāyāṃ nityatvaṃ paricakṣate |
anīśvarasya maṃtrasya nāsti trātā yathā bhuvi ||

tathā dīkṣā vihīnasya nehasvāmī paratra ca |
na tapobhirjapairhomairvividhairvāpi sādhanaiḥ ||

na kriyācitkadācittu dīkṣāhīnasya siddhyati |
dvijānāṃ manupūtānāṃ svakarmādhyayanādiṣu ||

yathādhikāro nāstī hasyāccopanayanādiṣu |
tathā cā dīkṣitānāṃ ca maṃtra devārcanādiṣu ||

nādhikārostyataḥ kuryādātmānaṃ maṃtra saṃskṛtaṃ |
dīkṣāmūlaṃ jagatsarvaṃ dīkṣāmūlaṃ paraṃ tapaḥ ||

dīkṣāmāśritya nivasedyatra kutrā same japan |
adīkṣitaśca maraṇe raurave narake vrajet ||

ato dīkṣeti sā proktā deśikaistaṃtravedibhiḥ |
yāvanna prāpyate dīkṣā puruṣārtha phalapradā ||

sarvasiddhikarī dīkṣā sarvasaṃpatpradāyinī |
pratibhā svaravarṇāni kāṃtiḥ puṣṭidharāṇi ca ||

mohanastaṃbhanā kṛṣṭi māraṇoccāṭanāni ca |
vaśīkāryaṃ sukavitā buddhiśca dhāraṇā yutā ||

tāraṇaṃ ca samudrasya vahneḥ śaityaṃ raṇejayam |
vipine cā bhayaṃ caiva śokaduḥkhāpahaṃ tathā ||

<p. 10a>

dharmārthakāmamokṣāṇi dadāt yeṣāṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
aneka koṭi saṃtrebhyastathā vidyātya eva ca ||

ekaṃ gurumukhāllabdhaṃ sarvasiddhi pravartakaṃ |
gurupadeśato labdhaṃ japetyāsārcanādikaṃ ||

paścāt tat sādhayet sarvaṃ sadā tadbhāvabhāvitaḥ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau 
śrīśyāmādividyoddhāropāsanāvaśyakatāpūrvakamāhātmyakathanaṃ nāma 
dvitīyaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 2 ||

yaḥ śivaḥ sarvagaḥ sūkṣmaśconmano niṣkalovyayaḥ |
vyomākārohyajānaṃtaḥ sa kathaṃ pūjyate priye ||

ata eva śivaḥ sākṣādguru rūpaṃ samāśritaḥ |
dīnānukaṃpayā devīparyyeti pṛthivīmimāṃ ||

manuṣya carmaṇānarddhaḥ sākṣāt paraḥ śivaḥ svayaṃ |
atrinetraḥ śivaḥ sākṣāda caturvāṅguracyutaḥ ||

acaturvadano brahmā śrīguruḥ kathitaḥ priye |
nara vadṛśyate loke śrīguruḥ pāpakarmaṇāṃ ||

śiva ca dṛśyate sākṣānnarāṇāṃ puṇyakarmaṇāṃ |
śrīguruṃ paramaṃ tatvaṃ tiṣṭhaṃtaṃ cakṣuṣāgrataḥ ||

maṃdabhāgyā na paśyaṃti aṃdhāḥ sūryamivoditaṃ |
guruḥ sadāśivaḥ sākṣāt satyameva na saṃśayaḥ ||

śiva eva gururno cedbhuktimuktiṃ dadātikaḥ |
sadāśivasya devasya śrīgurorapi pārvatī ||

ubhayoraṃtaraṃ nāsti yaḥ karoti sa pātakī |
yathā ghaṭaśca kalaśaḥ kuṃbhaścaikārtha vācakaḥ ||

tathā devaśca maṃtraśca guruścaikārtha ucyate |
na guroḥ sadṛśaṃ vastu na devaḥ śaṃkaropamaḥ ||

na ca kaulāt paro yogo na vidyā kālikā samā |
gakārājñāna saṃpattirakārastat prakāśakaḥ ||

ukārācchiva tādātmyaṃ dadyāditi guru smṛtaḥ |
yadyapyadhītanīgamāḥ ṣaḍaṃga sahitāṃ priye ||

āgamādyāni śāstrāṇi jñānaṃ nāsti guruṃ vinā |
tasmādguruṃ samālocya bhajate yaḥ pumān śive ||

yogaṃ jñānaṃ sphuṭaṃ tasmai bruvate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
tārakaḥ kohi saṃsāre prāṇināṃ sadgurorvinā ||

asadguruḥ svayaṃ naṣṭaṃ kathaṃ pālayate paraṃ |
dhanārthinastu guravaḥ śiṣyāḥ siddhyarthinaḥ kalau ||

tasmānna cobhayaḥ siddhirdevatānāṃ vidaṃvanaṃ |
bhaktiḥ śraddhānvitau śiṣya guru saṃpūrṇa lakṣaṇau ||

<p. 10b>

sarvopi mārgastatkālaṃ bhuktimukti pradāyakaḥ ||

athāto gurulakṣaṇaṃ ||

tasmādādau pravakṣyāmi lakṣaṇaṃ guruśiṣyayoḥ |
śrīguruḥ parameśāni śuddhaveśo manoharaḥ ||

sarvalakṣaṇa saṃyuktaḥ sarvāvayava śobhitaḥ |
sarvāgamārtha tatvajñaḥ sarvamaṃtra vidhānavit ||

lokaḥ saṃmohanākāro devavat priyadarśanaḥ |
sumukhaḥ sulabhaḥ svaccha iṃjñitākāraveṣṭavit ||

aṃtarmukhā bahirdṛṣṭiḥ sarvajño deśakālavit |
ājñā siddhastrikālajño nigrahānu graha kṣamaḥ ||

vedavedāṃta vichāṃtaḥ sarvajīva dayāparaḥ |
svādhīneṃdriya saṃcāraḥ ṣaḍaṃga vijayakṣamaḥ ||

atra gaṇyoti gaṃbhīraḥ pātrāpātraṃ viśeṣavit |
nirmalo nityasaṃtuṣṭo nirdvaṃdvo nityaśaktimān ||

sadbhaktavatsalo dhīraḥ kṛpāluḥ smita pūrvavāk |
bhaktapriyaḥ sarvasamodayāluḥ śiṣyaśāsakaḥ ||

sveṣṭadeva manuḥ prājño vanitā pūjanotsukaḥ |
nityanaimittike kāmye etatkarmaṇya niṃditaḥ ||

rāgadveṣa bhayakrodha daṃbhāhaṃkāra varjitaḥ |
yadṛchālābha saṃtuṣṭo guṇadoṣa vibhedakaḥ ||

strīdhanādiṣṭanāśaktoduḥsaṃgavyasanojritaḥ |
alorūpā hiṃsakaśca pakṣapātī vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

vittavidyādi maṃtrajño yaṃtra taṃtrādya vikrayī |
niḥsaṃkalpo nirvikalpo nirṇītārthoti dhārmikaḥ ||

tulye niṃdāstutirmaunī nirapekṣo niyāmakaḥ |
śuddhacittodayāluśca brāhmaṇo vedapāragaḥ ||

atha kulaguroḥ ||

kulīnaḥ sarvavidyānāṃ madhikārīti gīyate ||
dīṣā prabhuḥ sa evātra sarvamaṃtrasya nāparaḥ ||

akulaṃ śiva ityuktaḥ kulaṃ śaktiḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
kulākulānusaṃdhāna nipuṇaḥ kaulikaḥ priyaḥ ||

kulabhaktān kulācārān kulajñānān kulavratāt |
prīto bhavati yo dṛṣṭvā kaulikaḥ sa tu me priyaḥ ||

tatva trayaḥ svīkaraṇān mūlamaṃtrārtha tatvavit |
devatā gurubhaktaśca kaulikaḥ syāttadīkṣayā ||

kulācārasto nityaṃ kulaśāstra prayojakaḥ |
śāṃtaḥ svādhīna sarvajño lobhamoha vivarjitaḥ ||

krodha moha sadā tyāgī virāgī vīravaṃditaḥ |
sarvāśraya parityāgī lalanārcana tatparaḥ ||

<p. 11a>

ityādi lakṣaṇopetaḥ śrīguruḥ kathitaḥ priyaḥ |
nāti vālo na vṛddhaśca na khaṃjona kṛśastathā ||

nādhikāṃgo na hīnāṃgo na khalvāṭo na daṃturaḥ |
kṛtajñaṃ vāgminaḥ śūraṃ pratiṣṭāgama pāragaṃ ||

vāstu vidyā kṛtābhyāsaṃ śalyoddhāra vivekinaṃ |
kriyānu kramavettāraṃ mudrātaṃtra vivekinaṃ ||

svavidyānuṣṭhā na tapo dharmāṇāma prakāśakaḥ |
varṇāśrama jñāna tapodharmāṇāṃ ca prakāśakaḥ ||

ṣaṭkarma su susiddho yo dātā bhoktā na yācakaḥ |
sa eva kaulikācāryastvanyaḥ kula viḍaṃvakaḥ ||

piṃḍapadaṃ tathā rūpaṃ rūpātītaṃ niraṃjanaṃ |
yastu samyag vijānāti sa guruścorddharet paraṃ ||

pāśastaṃbhaṃ vedhadīkṣā paśugrahaṇameva ca |
trividhaṃ yo vijānāti sa guruḥ kathitaḥ priye ||

paśupāśa paśūnāṃ ca rahasyārtha vidhānavit |
yo jānāti varārohe sa guruḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||

ghṛṇā śaṃkābhayaṃ lajjā jugupsā ceti paṃcamī |
kulaṃ śīlaṃ tathā śaktiraṣṭau pāśāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

pāśabaddhaḥ paśuḥ proktaḥ pāśamukto maheśvaraḥ |
tasmāt pāśaharop yatra sa gururnānya ucyate ||

mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ saptāṃ bhojadaleṣu ca |
jīvācāraphalaṃ vetti sa gururnāparaḥ priye ||

atha asadgurulakṣaṇaṃ ||

kulakṣaṇaṃ ||

vahvāśī dīrghasūtrīya viṣayādiṣu lolupaḥ |
hetu vādarato duṣṭo vāgvādī guruniṃdakaḥ ||

aromāvakuromā ca niṃditā śramameva ca |
kāladaṃto'sitoṣṭhaśca durgaṃdhaḥ śvāsavāhakaḥ ||

duṣṭalakṣaṇa saṃpanno yadyapi svayamīśvaraḥ |
vaṅgapratigrahāsakta ācāryaṃ śrīkṣayāvahaḥ ||

aputro mṛtaputraśca kuṇḍaśca vāmanastathā |
kunakhīdīrghadaṃtaśca strījitaścādhikāṃgakaḥ ||

hīnāṃgaḥ kapaṭīrogī vaṅgavallī ca kubjakaḥ |
etairdoṣairvihīno yaḥ sa guruḥśiṣyabhājanaḥ ||

svanāmnā na guruḥkāryo bhāryā ca mātṛnāmikā ||

atha deśabhedādgurorbhedaḥ ||

kumārī himavanmadhye śvetakṛṣṇa mṛgānvite |
deśe jātastu yo vidvānācāryatvamathārhati ||

augyanyā madhyadeśārca kaurukṣetrāścalāṭajāṃ |
aṃtarvedī pratiṣṭhānā cāvaṃtyā guravo varāḥ ||

rāḍāvāreṃdrakāstairāgaurya rāmāgadhāstathā |
aṃgajātodbhavāśceti saptaite madhyamā smṛtāḥ ||

<p. 11b>

āṃdhrāḥ kāliṃgakārṇāṭā mahārāṣṭrāśca ṭhakvajāḥ |
vīrajāḍāviḍāpauṃḍrāstvaṣṭau te guravodhamāḥ ||

kāmarūpāśca caṃpākāme pālotthāśca saiṃdhavāḥ |
vāṃgā gāṃdhārapauliṃgā saptaite cādhamādhamāḥ ||

kāṃcijāḥ kauśalāḥ kāsthākāvelāḥ kaukaṇo bhujāḥ |
saurāṣṭrā devarāṣṭrāśca aṣṭaute niṃditā bhṛśaṃ ||

aśeṣakāmadā śreṣṭhā madhyamā bhūtihāpitaḥ |
adhamātya śubhenaṣṭā āryādarbhā na doṣabhāk ||

catuṣpadā strirodhāśca ṣaṭpadārtha vibhūṣitāḥ |
gotragocara saṃyukto samayādyukta lakṣaṇāḥ ||

dīkṣāsthā svapnasaṃpūrṇaṃ yo jānaṃtyavya saṃhitāṃ |
ācārāste tu vijñeyā cāpare lokadāṃbhikāḥ ||

sarvadravyā tiriktaṃ tu ātmānaṃ vettiyo naraḥ |
sarvalakṣaṇa hīnopi sa gururnnāmrasaṃśayaḥ ||

piturdīkṣāyaterdīkṣāyādīkṣāvanavāsināṃ |
viviktāśramiṇāṃ dīkṣā putrāyurddhana nāśinī ||

pramādādvā tathā jñānāt pitṛdīkṣāṃ samācaret |
prāyaścittaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā punardīkṣāṃ samācaret ||

tyaktāgnayaḥ kriyāhīnāya tathoniḥ parigrahāḥ |
vanasthāstādṛśā eva varṇā nyūnāśramī yataḥ ||

atasteṣāṃ nādhikāro dīkṣānānya maheśvarī |
yaterdīkṣāṃ gṛhītvā tu kadācidapi mohitaḥ ||

prāyaścittaṃ dhenurekā trirātra vratameva vā |
prāyaścittaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā punardīkṣāṃ samācaret ||

yadi bhāgyavaśādeva siddhavidyāṃ labhet priye |
tadaivatāṃ tu dīkṣeta tyaktvā guru vicāraṇāṃ ||

sveṣṭavidyā pradāne tu na kuryādguru ciṃtanaṃ |
kṣatraviṭ śūdrajātīnāṃ kṣatriyonugrahakṣamaḥ ||

vaiśyaḥ syāttena kāryaḥ syādvaye nityamanugrahaḥ |
sajātīyena śūdreṇa tādṛśena mahāmate ||

anugrahābhiṣekau ca kāryau śūdrasya sarvadā |
varṇoptame'tha ca surasati vā viśrutepi vā ||

svadeśatothavānyatranedaṃ kāryaṃ śubhārthinā |
vidyamānekuyaḥ kāryādyatra tatra viparyayaṃ ||

tasyahā mūtranāśaḥ syāttasmācchāstroktamācaret |
vipra eve dṛśaḥ kāryo gururnocettadedṛśe ||

kṣetraviṭ śūdrajātīyaḥ prātilosyaṃ na dīkṣayet |
ācāryamātulau ṛtvik pitṛṣyaḥ śvaśuro nṛpaḥ ||

<p. 12a>

iti ṣaṅguravopyatra proktā maṃtra viśāradaiḥ |
nirvīryeḥ syāt piturmaṃtraṃstathā mātāmahasya ca ||

sodarasya kaniṣṭhasya vairipakṣā śritasya ca |
nirvīryo hi piturmaṃtraḥ śaivaśāktena duṣpati ||

dakṣe mārge tu nirvīrye piturmātāmahasya ca |
sodarasyā gṛhasthasya vāmamārgeti vīryavān ||

na patnīṃ dīkṣayedbhartā na pitādīkṣayet sutāṃ |
na putraṃ ca tathā bhrātābhrātaraṃ ca na dīkṣayet ||

striyo dīkṣā śubhā proktā mātuścāṣṭaguṇāḥ smṛtā |
sādhvī caiva sadācārāṃ gurubhaktā jiteṃdriyā ||

sarvamaṃtrārtha tatvajñā suśīlā pujane ratā |
gurudyogyā bhavet sā hi vidhavā parivarjitā ||

mātrā dīkṣā pradeyā vai strīṇāṃ satyena śāmbhavī |
devī paraṃparā prāptā dīkṣā strīṇāṃ śubhā matā ||

devī paraṃparā jātu viśeṣaṃ śṛṇu sādaraṃ |
devī paraṃparodiṣṭaṃ pāraṃparya kramāgatā ||

strīṇāṃ dīkṣāparaṃ jātā devī dīkṣā śubhā matā |
tat paraṃparayā prāptā dīkṣā siddhipradāmatā ||

puruṣāṇāṃ tatsakāśāt dīkṣā jātā paraṃparā |
mukhyaṃ śṛṇu mahādevī strīṇāṃ niyamo mataḥ ||

niyamaḥ puruṣo jñeyo na yoṣitsu kathaṃcana |
śākte vikalpa sahite kathaṃ dīkṣā bhavet priye ||

guroḥ sakāśācceddeyā tadā sā bhaginī matā |
svayaṃ vai yadiceddeyā tadā kanyā prakīrtitā ||

anyato dāpanīyā cetmārgaṃ bhraṣṭā tadā bhavet |
maṃtraśāstre vahuvidhāmārgā devimayeritā ||

tadarthaṃ saṃkaṭe cittaṃ kiṃkāryaṃvada śaṃkara |
svasaṃpradāye yaḥ śreṣṭastatsakāśāttudīkṣaṇaṃ ||

śubhaṃ proktaṃ mahādevi hyabhāve śṛṇu sādaraṃ |
trayodaśyāṃ kṛṣṇaṃpakṣe caṃdra vā sarasaṃyute ||

tālapatre manurlekhya saṃskāra daśakaṃ caret |
daśa saṃskārayogena siddhamaṃtro bhaviṣyati ||

taddine pāyasaṃ kṛtvā dakṣiṇāmūrti sannidhau |
pāyasādi nivedyārtha vilvaiḥ saṃpūjya śaṃkaraṃ ||

iti vācamanīya (*)(?) maṣṭottara sahasrakaṃ |
saṃjapya homayeddevī tattanmaṃtroktavartmanā ||

vācane nāsti cechaktistadā kiṃ vā vidhīyate |
putradvārā vā camanīyaṃ sa putro gurureva tu ||

evaṃ gṛhīta maṃtrastu siddhirhi bhavati priye |
athacānyaḥ prakāreṇa dīkṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ||

nadyāṃ samudragāmīnyāṃ śubhelagne śubhedine |
saṃpradāyaṃ purā dṛṣṭvā śrīsūryamaṇḍalaṃ likhet ||

<p. 12b>

sāṃgaṃ sāvaraṇaṃ sūryaṃ saṃpūjya prāṇavallabhe |
tāraṃ phaṭ manumālikhya vācayet tatsakāśataḥ ||

śatāṣṭavāraṃ sadvācye nāṃkānāṃ vā manogatiḥ |
tatra sūryaṃ guruṃ pūjya sarvasiddhīśvaro bhavet ||

idaṃ paśuparaṃ proktaṃ na tu vīra paraṃpriye |
vīrāṇāṃ kaulikānāṃ tu bharttā dīkṣaṇamācaret ||

bharturdīkṣāpradāne tu na doṣaḥ kālikāgame |
śivena dīkṣāpūrvaṃ tu gauryai dattā śubhāvahā ||

sā ca putryathavā bhāryā tadvadatrāpi pārvatī |
na putrī gaditā sā tu vīrabhāryā prakīrtitā ||

atha śiṣyalakṣanaṃ ||

sacchiṣyaṃ taṃ kuleśāni sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutaṃ |
samādhi sādhanopetaṃ guṇaśīla samanvitaṃ ||

śuddhadehaṃ tayā vaṃdyaṃ dhārmikaṃ śuddhamānasaṃ |
dṛḍha vrataṃ sadācāraṃ śuddhabhakti samanvitaṃ ||

kṛtajñaṃ pāpabhītaṃ ca sādhusajjanasaṃmataṃ |
āstikyaṃ dānaśīlaṃ ca sarvabhūtahite rataṃ ||

viśvāsa vinayopetaṃ vittaśāṭhya vivarjitaṃ |
asādhyasādhanaṃ śūraṃ valakāṃti samanvitaṃ ||

anukūla kriyādyuktaṃ apramattaṃ vicakṣaṇaṃ |
sakṛduktagṛhītārthaṃ caturaṃ buddhivittaraṃ ||

gṛhatalyā samotsaṃga nirvikāramasevakaṃ |
vimṛṣyakāriṇaṃ dhīraṃ manodāridryavarjitaṃ ||

sarvakāryāti kuśalaṃ dhīraṃ sarvopakārakaṃ |
alpārthe paraniṃdāyām sumukhaṃ vimukhaṃ priye ||

jiteṃdriyaṃ susaṃtuṣṭaṃ maṃtrajñaṃ brahmacāriṇaṃ |
tyaktvādhikyāti cāpalyaṃ duḥśaṃkātaṃka varjitaṃ ||

gurudhyānastuti kathā sarvadā bhajanotsukaṃ |
gurudaivatabhaktaṃ ca kāminī pūjanotsukaṃ ||

sarvajñā pālakaṃ devi gurukīrti praśaṃsakaṃ |
guruvākya pramāṇajñaṃ gurusuśrūṣaṇerataṃ ||

cittānuvarttinaṃ prekṣyakāriṇaṃ kulanāyike |
lajjābhimānagarvādivarjitaṃ gurusannidhau ||

nirapekṣaṃ gurudravye tatprasādābhikāṃkṣiṇaṃ |
rūpadhyānādinirataṃ mokṣamārgābhigāminaṃ ||

ityādi lakṣaṇopetaṃ guruḥ śiṣyaṃ parigrahet ||

atha duṣṭaśiṣyalakṣaṇaṃ ||

duṣṭānupāpinaṃ duṣṭaṃ guṇahīnaṃ virūpiṇaṃ |
paraśiṣyaṃ ca pākhaṃḍaṃ dhūrtaṃ paṇḍitamāninaṃ ||

hīnādhikāvikārāṃgaṃ vikalāvayavānvitaṃ |
paṃguṃ ca vadhiraṃ caiva malinaṃ vyādhipīḍitaṃ ||

<p. 13a>

ucchiṣṭaṃ durmukhaṃ cāpi svecchāveśadharaṃvitaṃ |
durvidagdhaṃ kuceṣṭaṃ ca kucailaṃ bhīmavīkṣaṇaṃ ||

nidrālasya yutaṃ taṃdrādyūtādi vyasanānvitaṃ |
kapāṭa  kudvyastaṃvādau tirohitatanuṃ sadā ||

paiśunyayuktikaṃ kṣudraṃ śraddhābhakti vivarjitaṃ |
kimetivādinastabdhaṃ preṣakaṃ ca palaṃ śaṭhaṃ ||

dhanastrī śuddhirahitaṃ niṣedhavidhivarjitaṃ |
rahasyabhedakaṃ cāpi devakāryārthaghātakaṃ ||

mārjāravakavṛttiṃ ca raṃdhrānveṣaṇa tatparaṃ |
māyānvitaṃ kṛtaghnaṃ ca pracchannottaradāyakaṃ ||

viśvāsaghātakaṃ devadrohiṇaṃ pāpakāriṇaṃ |
aviśvāsamavadyāṃ gamanartha siddhikāṃkṣiṇaṃ ||

ātatāyi namādiṣṭaṃ kutsitaṃ kūṭasākṣiṇaṃ |
sarvatra yācakaṃ devi sarvot kṛṣṭābhigāminaṃ ||

asatyaviṣṭaṃ vā śaktaṃ grāmyādi vahubhāṣiṇaṃ |
durvicāra kutarkādi kārakaṃ kalahapriyaṃ ||

vṛthā kṣepakaraṃ bhrāṃtaṃ pratyakṣe priyavādinaṃ |
vāgukṣavādinaṃ vidyā vacasānu prasaṃśakaṃ ||

guṇāḥ sahiṣṇuṃ sahitamati krodhasamanvitaṃ |
cārvākaṃ durjanasakhaṃ sarvalokavigarhitaṃ ||

piśunaṃ parasaṃtāpa sarvaprāṇi bhayaṃkaraṃ |
akleśavādinaṃ mitradrohiṇaṃ bhrātṛvaṃcakaṃ ||

jihvopastha paraṃ devi taskaraṃ paśuceṣṭitaṃ |
akāraṇadveṣa hāsyakleśa cakrādikārakaṃ ||

atihāsyasya karttāraṃ sātaraṃ parihāsakaṃ |
kāmukaṃ cāti nirlajjaṃ mithyāduśceṣṭa śūcakaṃ ||

asūyāmadamātsaryadaṃbhāhaṃkāra saṃyutaṃ |
īrṣyā paiśunyapāruṣyakāryaṇya krodhaśāsinaṃ ||

adhīraṃ dūṣitaṃ dveṣyamaśaktaṃ tanuvarjitaṃ |
aprahvamati mūḍhaṃ ca ciṃtādalitamānasaṃ ||

bhraṣṭalobhaṃ punarddīnamatuṣṭaṃ sarvayājakaṃ |
vahvāśīnaṃ kapaṭinaṃ bhrāmakaṃ kuṭilaṃ priye ||

bhaktiśraddhādayāśāṃti dharmācāra vivarjitaṃ |
mātṛpitṛguruprājñamahatāṃ hāsyakārakaṃ ||

kuladravyādi vībhatsaṃ gurusevābhimāninaṃ |
strīduṣṭaṃ samayabhraṣṭaṃ gurusaptaṃ kuleśvarī ||

ityādi viguṇopetaṃ guruḥ śiṣyaṃ parityajet ||

srīdevyuvāca ||

asiddhaguruṇādattomaṃtraḥ śiṣyāya vā guruḥ |
siddhomaṃtrāṃtare deva naiva siddhotha vā guruḥ ||

bhinnāmnāyo yadā śiṣyastadbhinnāmnāya devatāṃ |
sevate tatra deveśa kīdṛk siddhistu tadvada ||

<p. 13b>

īśvara uvāca ||

gurustu dakṣiṇāmnāyo sarvāmnāyeṣu dīkṣitaḥ |
ūrdhvāmnāyī tathānyeṣu pūrvāmnāyī pareṣu ca ||

dvayostu paścimāmnāyī duttarastvadhare bhavet |
adhareṇaiva kutrāpi gurutvaṃ pāralaukikaṃ ||

dakṣiṇopāsakaḥ kāle ūrddhvaḥ sāyujya māpnuyāt |
devatāyā tathā pūrvaḥ sārupyaṃ labhate paraḥ ||

sāmīpyaṃ cottare lokasadhogastvaihikaṃ phalaṃ |
lobhatyāgaiścopakārāhyadhomārgepyudarkakṛt ||

maṃtrāṃtare ca saṃsiddho gururmaṃtraṃ prayacchati |
yathoktā caraṇāttasya siddhiḥ śiṣyasya jāyate ||

kṛpāvaśāt siddhamaṃtraṃdātādhi ca paro guruḥ |
vinā japaṃ vinā pūjāṃ siddhayastat karesthitāḥ ||

guruśiṣyā vubhau mohāda parikṣaparaṃparaṃ |
upadeśaṃ dadan gṛhan prāpnuyād vai piśācataṃ ||

snehād vā lobhato vāpi yadi gṛhnāti dīkṣayet |
tasmin gurau sa śiṣye tu devatā śāpadāpayet ||

tasmādevaṃ vidhaṃ śiṣyaṃ na gṛhnīyāt kathaṃcana |
yadi gṛhnāti mohena tatpāpairvyāpyate guruḥ ||

maṃtripāpaṃ ca rājānaṃ patiṃ jāyā kṛtaṃ yathā |
tathā śiṣya kṛtaṃ pāpaṃ prāyo gurumapi spṛśet ||

jñānena kṛpayā cāpi guruśiṣyaṃ parīkṣayet |
saṃvatsaraṃ tadarddhaṃ vā tadarddhaṃ vā tadarddhataḥ ||

uttamānaddhamāṃ kāryaṃ jīvānuttama karmaṇi |
prāṇadravye pradānādyairdaśasya samamānasaiḥ ||

unmarma sūcakairvākyairmāyābhirguru ceṣṭitaiḥ |
pakṣapātairudāsīnairanekaiśca muhurmuhuḥ ||

ākṛṣṭaḥ pīḍitaścāpi yoniṣādena yācati | 
guruḥ kṛpāṃ karotīti sadā saṃciṃtayet sadā ||

śrīguroḥ smaraṇe cāpi kīrtane vāpi naṃdane |
paricarya yamārgeṇa preṣaṇen veṣaṇe priye ||

ānaṃdakaṃ paromāṃ ca smaranetrādi vikriyāṃ |
teṣāṃ syāttetrayogāḥ syurmaṃtra siddhirapīśvarī ||

vodhakatvaṃ ca vijñāya śiṣyobhūyānna cānyathā |
ādimadhyāvasāneyānyāyaḥ śaktinipātitaḥ ||

adhamāmadhyamāśreṣṭāḥ śiṣyā devi prakīrtitāḥ |
ādau bhaktirbhaveddevi dīkṣārthaṃ saṃvadaṃti ye ||

punarviluptabhāvāste ādiyogyā itīritāḥ |
dīkṣāsamaya saṃprāpya jñānavijñāna varjitāḥ ||

tasmāt pradhvasta vīryāye madhyayogyā itīritāḥ |
ādau bhakti vihīnoyaḥ madhye bhaktosti vānavā ||

aṃte ca pratibhaktiḥ syādaṃta yogyā bhavaṃtite |
kurvannācārya suśrūṣāṃ manovākkāyakarmabhiḥ ||

<p. 14a>

śuddhabhāvo mahotsāho voddhā śiṣya iti smṛtaḥ |
sa bhūpadeśyaḥ putraścivyatyayī vasudastathā ||

guruḥ suśrūṣayā vidyā puṣkālela dhanena vā |
atha vā vidyayā vidyā caturthonopa padyate ||

nityaśaḥ kāyavāk cittaistridvaikāvṛddhikāvadhi |
parīkṣya saparigrāhyasyādyaḥ saṃyatamānasaḥ ||

tayorvatsaramātreṇa jñātānyonyaṃ bhaviṣyati |
gurutā śiṣyatā vāpi nānyatheti viniścayaḥ ||

śiṣyaśca sadgurormaṃtraṃ gṛhītvātaṃ parityajet |
gurutyāgakaraḥ śiṣyaḥ prāyaścittī bhaveddhruvaṃ ||

yadi daivātpaśorvidyālabhyate kulajairnnaraiḥ |
dvijaṃ tu kaulikaṃ prāpya punarvidyāmupā labhet ||

yo gṛhnāti paśorvidyāṃ tasyādhirgātrapīḍanaṃ |
bhavatyeva na saṃdeho vaṃdhūnāṃ caiva vā bhavet ||

sadguruṃ tu samāśritya gṛhnīyāt saṃskṛtaṃ manuṃ |
śrīguruṃ lakṣaṇopetaṃ saṃśaya chedakārakaṃ ||

labdhvā jñānapradaṃ devi na gurvīramāśrayet |
anabhijñaṃ guruṃ prāpya saṃśaye ṣaḍvikārakaṃ ||

śiṣyāgurvaṃtaraṃ gatvā taddoṣairnāmulupyate |
guravo vahavaḥ saṃti kumaṃtrauṣadhavedinaḥ ||

nigamāgamaśāstrokta maṃtrajño durlabhe bhuvi |
avijñoścorddharenmūrkhaṃ na mūrkhomūrkhamuddharet ||

śilāṃ saṃtārayennau hi na śilātārayecchilāṃ |
madhulubdho yathā bhṛṃgaḥ puṣpāt puṣpāṃtaraṃ vrajet ||

jñānalubdhastathā śoṣyo gurorgurvaṃtaraṃ vrajet |
na maṃtre cādhikārosti śūdrāṇāṃ niyamaḥ paraḥ ||

maṃtrābhāvāda maṃtreṇa bhāṣituṃ sarvamarhati |
yā vaddhanāni maṃtrāṇāṃ śūdrāya pratipādayet ||

tāvaṃtyoḥ brahmahatyāḥ syustasmāt saṃskārayeccataṃ |
hāhākāreṇa rahitaṃ dadyāt yaścācca tāṃtrikaṃ ||

svāgamoktena mārgeṇa strīśūdrairapi pūjanaṃ |
kartavyaṃ saṃskṛtaistaiśca āgamoktena vartmanā ||

śūdrasya vācano devīccadhikāro hi vartate |
taṃtroktaṃ praṇavaṃ devī vahnijāyāṃ ca pārvatī ||

vācanaṃ dhāraṇaṃ devī kartavyaṃ satataṃ priye |
purāṇoktaṃ maheśāni yo japecchūdrayāmarayḥ ||

sadā sa pacyate ghore yāvadiṃdrāścaturddaśa |
praṇavaṃ vahnijāyāṃ ca na śūdropyuccaret kvacit ||

praṇavoccāraṇāddhomāchālagrāma śilārccanāt |
brāhmaṇī gamanāccaiva śūdraścāṇḍālatāṃ vrajet ||

śūdrasya praṇavoccāraṃ purāṇe samatāṃ priye |
tasmād yatnena kartavyaṃ taṃtroktaṃ śūdrajātināṃ ||

<p. 14b>

mahāvidyā prabhāveṇa śūdrovaiśyatvamāpnuyāt |
praṇavādi maheśāni gṛhnīyācchūdrajātayaḥ ||

etaddīkṣāparaṃ tatvaṃ sugopyaṃ parameśvarī |
brāhmaṇāḥ kṣatriyā vaiśyāḥ śūdrāḥ paulastya jātayaḥ ||

paṃcadhā manavāḥ khyātāḥ pradoṣāścānulomataḥ |
māyābījaṃ brāhmaṇaḥ syācchrī bījaṃ kṣatriyaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

kāmabījaṃ bhavedvaiśyo vāgbhavaṃ śūdra īritaḥ |
caturbījaṃ parityaktvā maṃtra paulastya saṃjñakaḥ ||

caturbījaṃ brāhmaṇānāṃ kṣatriyāṇāṃ tribījakaṃ |
bījadvayaṃ tu vaiśyānāṃ śūdrāṇāṃ tveka bījakaṃ ||

hīnavarṇāyano dadyānmaṃtraṃ tvadhikavarṇakaṃ |
umā maheśvaraścaiva dakṣiṇāmūrtyaghorakaṃ ||

hayagrīvaṃ ca vārāhaṃ maṣṭākṣaramataḥ paraṃ |
praṇavādyaṃ vāsudevaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇaṃ tathā ||

varṇa traye ca dātavyaṃ nānyavarṇe kadācana |
pāśupataṃ nārasiṃhaṃ tathā caiva sudarśanaṃ ||

varṇadvaye ca dātavyaṃ nānyeṣāṃ caiva karhicit |
agnimaṃtrāśca ye kecit sūryamaṃtrāścayetathā ||

tārādi ghṛṇimaṃtrāśca dātavyāśca trivarṇake |
ānuṣṭubhaṃ śaktimaṃtrāstathā viṃdhyanivāsinī ||

nīlasarasvatī caiva dātavyā cādi varṇake |
mātaṃgīnyugratārā ca kālikā śyāmarā tathā ||

chinnamastā ca vālā ca dātavyā sarvavarṇake |
tārādistu gaṇeśaśca haridrā saṃjñakastathā ||

trivarṇeṣṭeva dātavyāḥ puraṃ dhrīṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
praṇavamāyāṃ lakṣmīṃ ca vāgbhavaṃ cānya bījakaṃ ||

etadbījena saṃyuktaṃ dātavyaṃ cādi varṇake |
māyāṃ lakṣmīṃ vāgbhavaṃ ca dātavyaṃ kṣatriye vapi ||

lakṣmīṃ ca vāgbhavaṃ cāpi kathitaṃ vaiśyavarṇake |
vāgbhavaṃ cānya bījaṃ ca śūdrāṇāṃ ca samīritaṃ ||

hṛdādi hūṃphaṭkārādi śaṃkarāṇāṃ praśasyate |
kalpoktāvaikā vipradeyā viṃdhyanivāsinī ||

brāhmaṇe kṣatriye cāpi devyāḥ pāśupatābhidhā |
saudarśanā nārasiṃhā kārtavīryasya nānyataḥ ||

varṇatrayepi dātavyaṃ dakṣiṇāmūrtya ghorakaṃ |
aṣṭākṣaraṃ hayagrīva mumāmāheśvaraṃ tathā ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇaṃ cāstra devīṃ tārāṃ varāhakaṃ |
agneḥ sūryasya ghṛṇayastārādyāśca gaṇeśvarāḥ ||

sarvavarṇeṣu dātavyāḥ kālikā śyāma (*)(*)(?) thā   |
chinnamastā ca bālā ca mātaṃginyugratārikā ||

<p. 15a>

yoginīnāṃ yakṣiṇīnāṃ traipurā vadukādayaḥ |
śāvarāśca pulastyāni na japyādvija janmani ||

paṃthāno vahavaḥ proktā maṃtraśāstre maṇīṣibhi |
svagurormatamāśritya śubhaṃ kāryāṃ na cānyathā ||

atha maṃtro japyamānastvanyācāruṣu tatparaḥ |
saṃpradāyena saṃbhinnaḥ sarvadoṣa samanvitaṃ ||

evaṃ te kathitaṃ devī lakṣaṇa guruśiṣyayoḥ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau guruśiṣyamaṃtranirṇayornāmastṛtīyaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 3 || 
śrīdevyuvāca ||

śataśotrajanā devataṃtra mārgeṣu saṃsthitāḥ |
siddhirnarddhaśyate kvāpi kiṃ paratra bhaviṣyati ||

yadi karmapradhānaṃ ca devatārādhanena kiṃ |
devatārādhanaṃ satyaṃ sādhakā duḥkhi na kathaṃ ||

etanme saṃśaye siddhi kiṃ cakraiścāpi mātrakaiḥ |
saṃskārācca kathaṃ kāryā sādhakānāṃ vadasva tat ||

īśvara uvāca ||

garbhe karmatrayaṃ kuryājjātamātre tathā daśa |
tataḥ karma trayaṃ ceti saṃskārāḥ ṣoḍaśaḥ smṛtāḥ ||

dvijātīnāṃ tathā maṃtre kuryāt karmatrayaṃ guruḥ |
daśaśiṣyastataḥ kuryāt siddhamaṃtrepunastrayaṃ ||

ṣaḍeva janmasaṃskārāḥ proktāḥ strīśūdrayorapi |
tathaiva maṃtrasaṃskārāḥ ṣoḍaśaḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||

cāṇḍālādiṣu catvāro maṃtretāvaṃta eva hi |
trayaśca yavanādīnāṃ tanmaṃtreṣṭha pite trayaḥ ||

vāmadakṣiṇabhedena teṣāṃ kartavyatāṃ śṛṇu |
ājyasthāne surāṃ vāme homādyarthaṃ prakalpayet ||

yā kādyeṣu ca māṃsaṃ syāḍhyekādauti mayaḥ smṛtāḥ |
maithunaṃ brahmacaryasya mudrā tatkarmakāstathā ||

atha garbhādhānasaṃskāraḥ ||

garbhādhānaṃ svakalpoktā vartmanā prathamaṃ bhavet |
dakṣiṇānāmatho vāme dūtīyāgaṃ samācaret ||

saṃtarpyayedaṃ gaṃge va maṃtrairyoniṃ ca tīrthataḥ |
tasyāṃ aṃge devatāyā maṃtranyāsaṃ samācaret ||

sarvānyāsān sva svadehe bhāvayettāṃ ca bhairavī |
svayaṃ ca bhairavo bhūtvā ratikarma samācaret ||

mukhāsanastho bhagagaṃdhvajaṃ kṛtvā japedamuṃ |
maṃtraṃ paṃca sahasraṃ tu yatheṣṭaṃ labhate sutaṃ ||

lakṣmī prāṇeśvarī ceti mama pāhi na vākṣaraḥ |
tasyāḥ some tasya sūryagarbhastiṣṭheddharājale ||

atha puṃsavanākhya saṃskāraḥ ||

atha dvitīya saṃskāraḥ kāryaḥ puṃsavanābhidhaḥ |
tṛtīyemāsi kurvīta atha puṃsavanaṃ budhaḥ ||

<p. 15b>

tṛtīyemāsi kurvītai vedokta divase svakalpoktena vartmanā ||

tatra vaidika mukhyasya homasthāne svadevatā |
juhuyāt kāraṇe naiva caturāhuti saṃkhyayā ||

tadāvaraṇa devānāṃ puruṣāṇāṃ dvayaṃ dvayaṃ |
ekāstrīṇāṃ vāmamārge śeṣaṃ pūrvavadīritaṃ ||

sa tīrthaṃ sa paśuṃ pātraṃ niśāyāṃ bhairavo baliḥ ||

atha sīmaṃtākhya saṃskāraḥ ||

atha tṛtīya saṃskāraḥ sīmaṃtākhyaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
caturthe ṣaṣṭhāṣṭameṣumāḥ suḥsanmadhyamādhamāḥ ||

jyotiḥ śāstroktadivase svakalpoktena vartmanā |
vāmī tu devatā maṃtraṃ sīmaṃte suru vā likhet ||

nyāsaṃ kuryāt tagaṃgeṣu sūtirugrohahāriṇaṃ |
tato na gacchettāṃ bhāryāṃ devatāśāpabhītitaḥ ||

kāmena vā mohena duḥkāle vā vidhānataḥ |
anyena vā kṛtaḥ saṃgaḥ sīmaṃtaḥ svadadyāvahaḥ ||

atha jātakarmākhya saṃskāraḥ ||

atha caturtha saṃskāraḥ kuryāt strī śūdrayorapi |
jātakarmābhidhaṃ vipra svakalpoktena vartmanā ||

kanyā janmani viprāṇāṃ śūdrasya suta janmani |
tūṣṇīmeva kriyāṃ kuryād viṣṇu smaraṇa pūrvakaṃ ||

vāmācārī na kurvītamedhājanana saṃskṛtiṃ |
kiṃtu svarṇasya lekhanyā vilikhet kāraṇāyayā ||

tāludeśe mūlabījaṃ rasayānāṃ tathā manuṃ |
devatāṃ tarpayet paścādan yatkarma tu dakṣavat ||

atha nāmapradānākhya saṃskāraḥ ||

atha paṃcamasaṃskāraṃnāma karmādvayorddhavaṃ |
sarveṣāmayamuddiṣṭaḥ sūtakāṃte śubhedine ||

svakalpokta vidhānena nāmakarma samārabhet |
taṃtreṣu yā niyoktāni mātrā cakrāṇi ṣoḍaśaḥ ||

vicāryatāni kurvīta nāmayat saphalaṃ bhavet |
na kṛtaṃ cedatra nāma tādṛśaśced gurustathā ||

pūrṇābhiṣeke kurvīta tat sabījaṃ nirūpyate |
yasmādṛśca guṇaiḥ siddhirviprāṇāṃ saṃprajāyate ||

atha nakṣatra cakraṃ ||

tārā cakraṃ pravakṣyāmi vālānāṃ maṃtrasiddhaye |
a āhaye dvayameva ī u ū vahni homatāḥ ||

ṛ ṝ ḷ ḹ caro hiṇyāṃ e mṛge śivabhe ca ai |
o au punarvasuḥ puṣpakarau sarpaścabhe khagau ||

pitṛvaghaṅau bhāgye ca āryamaṇecchajau matau |
hastedgajaṭaṭhautvāṣṭhe svātyāṃḍodvīśabheḍhaśau ||

<p. 16a>

tathadā anurādhāyāṃ jyeṣṭhāyādhotha mūlabhe |
napaphā pūrvaṣāḍhāyāṃ vakārobhastu vaiśvabhe ||

maḥ karṇetha dhaneṣṭāyāṃ yarolaśatatārake |
vaśau tu pūrvabhādrāyāṃ ṣasahāsyurupāṃtime ||

laṃ kṣaṃ aṃ aścarevatyāṃgaṇyāṃ maṃtrākṣarārkṣataḥ |
sādhye nāmādi varṇarkṣa trirāvṛtyāni phalāni tu ||

sthānanāśaḥ satāṃ saṃgo vahumaitrī mṛteḥ samaṃ |
ādhiṃ vācyādhimāpnoti sādhakāt kāryasiddhayaḥ ||

vahubhiḥ śatrutākṣepo vipattiṃ saṃpadātyayaḥ |
etastu tārā cakrasya phalaṃ jñātvā caredidaṃ ||

atha gaṇacakraṃ ||

tārokta mātṛkābhirbhairjñātvā sādhakasādhyayoḥ |
strī puṃsāṃ vā vyastathośca gaṇacakraṃ vinā vicārayet ||

sthirāṇi vimaghogrāṇi raudraṃ naragaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ |
hayatyamitrāditīduvātyajya karaghoṭakāḥ ||

devāśvarākṣasāḥ syu (*)(?)  sādhyasādhakayoḥ phalaṃ |
nṛdevayoḥ phalaṃ śīghraṃ vyastayoḥ kaṣṭataḥ phalaṃ ||

nṛdaityayormanugrāhāvyastayormaraṇaṃ bhavet |
devadānavayoryuddhayastayorniḥphalaṃ bhavet ||

atha rāsicakraṃ ||

grahopagraha maṃtreṣu rāsicakraṃ vicārayet |
vedārāmātrayoryugmaṃ yugmaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃti mauśaṣaṭ ||

saḍvargāśca tataḥ ṣaṣṭunāma varṇasthalātmanoḥ |
bhavedyatrādimāvarṇaḥ phalaṃ tatra bhavedidaṃ ||

iṣṭodāsaḥ poṣakaśca rogakṛt putradaḥ śubhaḥ |
strīsaukhya kṛdvātakārī bhāgyadaḥ kāryasiddhakṛt ||

lābhakṛdvyakṛcceti proktoyaṃ rāsimātrikā |
strīśūdrepatilomānāṃ nāmamaṃtrairūpāsanāṃ ||

pūrvoktā rāśayorjñeyāmīnādyāśca dvijāditaḥ |
varṇo tatsomanugrāhyo vaidikotra viśeṣataḥ ||

atha paṃcabhūtacakraṃ ||

vakṣyetha kaulike mārge siddhi kṛtyāṃ ca bhautikaṃ |
yāvagni bhūjalākāśa paṃcacatvāri vinyaset ||

dvau dvau svarau tale lekhyau ekārādyāstataḥ punaḥ |
kādikāścāpi ṣaḍvargāṣakṣalāsaśca hastathā ||

punaḥ punarnāmalekhyaṃ maṃtrākṣara samomanuḥ |
tasmāt punarmanu lekhyo yugapat syāt karātmakaṃ ||

iṣṭedhikelpakaṣṭe tu maṃtrasādhanamācaret |
kurvaṃti bhūtavetālāḥ piśāce cānyathā naraṃ ||

mahīsalilayormaitramanilānalayorapi |
sāmānyamagni bhūtyāṃ tu salilānilayostathā ||

śātravaṃ vaiparītyena cakraṃ syātyāṃ ca bhautikaṃ ||

<p. 16b>

atha akadumacakraṃ ||

siddhādi cakraṃ vakṣyehaṃ yaddhātvā nāmakārayat |
dakṣiṇopāsanāmārge svamaṃtraṃ svasya devatā ||

dvādaśāre tathā cakre kūṭaṣaṭkaṃ vivarttayet |
ādihāṃtāllikhedvarṇān pūrvatoyāvadīśvaraṃ ||

svanāmākṣaramārabhya phaṭyo maṃtrākṣarāvadhi |
siddhasādhyaḥ susiddhāririti jñeyaṃ punaḥ punaḥ ||

siddhaḥ siddhyati kālena sārdharaṃ siddhyati vānavā |
susiddho grahaṇādeva ripurmūlaṃ nikṛṃtati ||

atha siddhāricakraṃ ||

atha vakṣye mahāviyā sādhane siddhamātṛkāṃ |
mūlakrameṇa vijñeyā tatra koṣṭāni ṣoḍaśaḥ ||

kramādi teṣu kāṣṭeṣu mātṛkāṇāṃ suvinyaset |
kaḍīsāṃ kadvyaddhi sūryadikaṣaḍaṣṭaṃdayā vṛṣā ||

paṃcāṃgatithi viśve ca koṣṭakāstatra kīrtitā |
ādau jñeyaṃ catuṣkeṣu siddhādyaṃ vidisāsu ca ||

tatsthāna samakoṣṭhātu punargaṇya gurūktitaḥ |
siddhaḥ siddho japāt siddhet siddhasārddhyedvisaṃguṇāt ||

siddhaḥ susiddhaḥ saṃprāptaḥ siddhārirhaṃti gotrajān |
sāddhyaḥ sidhyeti saṃkleśāt sādhyasādhyoti duḥkhakṛt ||

sādhyaḥ susiddho bhajanān sādhyāriḥ svastriyaṃ haret |
susiddhaḥ siddhorddha japāt vahu jāpyārca tatpare ||

atidruṃtaṃ dviḥ susiddhaḥ susiddhāriḥ kulāpahaḥ |
arisiddhaḥ sutaṃ haṃnyādariḥ sārddhastu kanyastaṃ ||

ariḥ susiddhaḥ pālaghno arghariḥ sādhakāpahaḥ |
atra prasiddhanāmaḥ syāt prasuptoyena jāgṛṣāt ||

atha prakārāṃtaramāha ||

prasiddhaṃ yadbhavennāma kiṃ vāsya janmanāma ca |
jātīnāṃ puṣpapātena guruṇā yatkṛtaṃ bhavet ||

viśliṣya tasya vai varṇān varavyaṃ janabhedataḥ |
tathaiva maṃtravarṇastu tataḥ śodhana mārabhet ||

viṃdudviviṃdukopa dhyānīya jihvāgra saṃbhavaḥ |
saṃhatoccāraṇaprāptamadhikākṣarameva ca ||

aputraṃ sākṣaraṃ lakṣau tyaktvā khaṇḍa catuṣṭayaṃ |
maṃtrākṣaraiḥ sahaikaikaḥ nāmavarṇān viśodhayet ||

vyaṃjanairvyaṃjanānyeva svarairsārddhaṃ svarāstathā |
ādyamādyena saṃśodhyaṃ dvitīye ca dvitīyakaṃ ||

maṃtrevāpyatha vā nāmnivarṇāḥ syurviṣamā yathā |
tadā maṃtraṃ samārabhya samaṃ yāvat prapūrayet ||

ādyaṃ tayosmiyadvaṇamiṃtrayasmin varānane |
acireṇaiva kālena sa tāvat sarvasiddhidaḥ ||

<p. 17a>

sādhyāṃtādiputojastusoti kṛcchreṇa siddhyati |
ādāvaṃte susiddhastu sarvakāma vibhūtidaḥ ||

ādāvaṃte ripuryasya bhavatyājyasma maṃtrakaḥ |
ādau siddhauṃ'tyasaudhyāyo dviguṇena sa siddhyati ||

ādau siddhaḥ susiddhāṃto yathoktāt siddhyate japāt |
ādau siddhāṃ'ta śatruścet satyājyo maṃtrisattamaiḥ ||

sādhyaudiścaiva siddhāṃta striguṇāt siddhyate japāt |
ādau sāddhyaḥ susiddhāṃte prokta mārgeṇa siddhyati ||

susiddhyādistu sādhyāṃtaścaturguṇamapekṣate |
susiddhādiścāṃta śatrursadhyamaḥ  parikīrtitaḥ ||

āghāriścāṃta siddhāriḥ sopityajya trikarmaṇi |
ādau madhye tathā cāṃte siddhaḥ śubhaphalapradaḥ ||

sarvasādhya udāsīnaḥ proktastaṃtre svayaṃbhu vā |
sthāna tritaya su siddhassarvānarthāṃśca sādhayet ||

sthāna tritayagatārirmaṃtraumṛtyurnnasaṃśayaḥ |
siddhādi sādhya yugmāṃto vyartha ityucyate budhaiḥ ||

siddhādiddhi susiddhāṃte sarvakāryārtha sādhakaḥ |
siddhādirari yugmāṃto nāśakaḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||

śatrurhati yadā madhye siddhastadaṃtake sādhyaḥ |
kaṣṭhena kāryasiddhistasya phalasvalpameva bhavati ||

aṃte yadi bhavati ripuḥ prathame madhyeti ca bhavati sādhya yugaṃ ||

kāryaṃ vilaṃvi tasyāt praśasyati kṣipramevāṃte |
ādyaṃtaṃ yoryadā sādhyā madhya siddhiḥ prajāyate ||

ādyaṃ tayoryadā siddho madhya sādhyaḥ prajāyate ||

tāvubhau sādhyasiddhau hi japādhikyena siddhyati |
arisaṃpratitaṃ siddhiḥ susiddho hi tathā bhavet ||

sarvanāśakaro jñeyaḥ sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ |
siddhenāṃtaritaḥ sādhyaḥ susiddhāṃtarito'thavā ||

śīghraṃ siddhyati maṃtroyamīśānaḥ svayamatravīt |
siddhenāṃtaritaḥ śatruḥ susiddhenāpi cedbhavet ||

nāsau ripurbhavenmaṃtraṃ kiṃtu kaṣṭena siddhyati |
sādhyāṃtaritu siddhastu susiddhopi tathā yadi ||

īdṛśaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ dṛṣṭvā dūrataḥ parivarjayet |
ripuṇādūṣito maṃtro naiva deyaḥ kadācana ||

eṣu doṣeṣu sarvatra māyākāmamathāpi vā |
kṣiptvā cādau śriyaṃ dadyāddoṣāṇāṃ ca vimuktaye ||

atha ṣaḍdalemātṛkācakraṃ ||

yastu bījātmako maṃtrastatra ṣaṭdalamātṛkā |
vijñeyā tatra padmaṃ tu racayet ṣaḍdalaṃ śubhaṃ ||

<p. 17b>

tatrarnyasaṃmātṛkāṇāṃ kūṭaṣaṃḍha vivarjitān |
svanāmādyakṣaraṃ yatra tadārabhya vicārayet ||

saṃpaddāridryadhairyāṇi vaṃdhuvigrahasaṃśayau |
sarvanāśaḥ kramādetat nāmnādyarṇasya koṣṭhataḥ ||

kathaṃ maṃtrasya siddhiḥ syādetadarthamahaṃ dhruvaṃ ||

atha ṛṇidhanacakraṃ ||

dhaṃnāśamātṛkā tatra ṣattridvivyagaṣaṭ kṛtāḥ |
vahnyabhrātṛbhruvālekhyā aṃkā ekādaśaḥ svarāḥ ||

tattadrekārcaṭhātkacca lekhyā varṇaharonmikā |
tadadho dvikusaptārcciṣaḍtrisapteṣu sāgarāḥ ||

ṣaṭpaṃca sādhakasyāṃ kāmaṃtrāṃkāḥ pūrvamīritāḥ |
svaravyaṃjanabhinnānāṃ maṃtrārṇānāṃ pṛthak pṛthak ||

aṃkayogastathā kāryaḥ sādhakasya tu nāmajaḥ |
nāgaśeṣāvubhau sthāpyau yāvannānāṃtakaṃ manuḥ ||

adhikastatsādhakasya deyaṃ maṃtreṇa sādhitaḥ |
maṃtro yadyadhikokaḥ syāt tadā maṃtraṃ japet sudhīḥ ||

samepi ca japenmaṃtraṃ japet tadṛṇādhike |
śūnye mṛtyuṃ vijānīyāt tasmācchūnyaṃ parityajet ||

tāvatsaṃkhyāṃ samādāya na sādhyānapi sādhayet |
hīnāśca grahayogena tathādikṣūpa pattitaḥ ||

puraścaryāṃ punaḥ kuryānmaṃtra saṃdīptaye punaḥ |
ṛṇī tu sādhako jñeyaḥ sādhakāṃkoṃ yadādhikaḥ ||

yāvatsyādadhikastāvat saṃkhyakāni yadā caret |
puraścaraṇa saṃjñāni tadāsya samatā bhavet ||

puraścaryāṃ punaḥ kṛtvā tadāsyāt kāryasādhakaḥ |
ekasmin saṃdhite kārye punaryāti sa kuṃṭhakāṃ ||

tāvajrayaṃ punaḥ kṛtvā caika kārya kṣamā bhavet |
tatvamaṃtraḥ prakaṭitaṃ sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ ||

iti krameṇa saṃproktaṃ ṛṇīdhana viśodhanaṃ |
ṛṇaṃ dhanaṃ ca vijñāya nāmadadyānmaheśvarī ||

anyathā nāmadāne ca nāmānurūpakaṃ phalaṃ |
na bhavat parameśāni bhraṣṭo bhavati sādhakaḥ ||

svamukhatvaṃ na jānāti devadoṣa puraḥ kalau |
sarvamevaṃ tu vijñāya nāmājñādāpayadguruḥ ||

vijñāyaṃ tadguru mukhānmāma karma samācaret |
bhāvaśuddhirvaiṣṇavānāṃ koṣṭhaśuddhiḥ śivasya ca ||

rāśiśuddhistraipureṣu gopārekadama smṛtāḥ |
pratyaṃgirā siddhilakṣmyā kulākula vicārayet ||

<p. 18a>

kālikāyāśca tārāyāstārāścakraṃ viśasyate |
atra cecchastamaṃtrāṇāṃ nānya cakraṃ vicārayet ||

kālikāyāṃ ca tārāyāṃ kullukāyāṃ trikaṇṭake |
tathaikākṣara kūṭe ca śivapaṃcākṣare tathā ||

ṣaḍakṣare tu tasyaiva viṣṇoraṣṭākṣarepi ca |
nṛsiṃhārka varāhāṇāṃ prāsāda praṇavasya ca ||

piṇḍitākṣara maṃtrāṇāṃ siddhādīnnaiva śodhayet |
haṃsasyāṣṭākṣarasyāpi tathā paṃcākṣarasya ca ||

napuṃsakasya maṃtrasya siddhādīnnaiva śodhayet |
ekākṣare tathā kūṭe mālāmaṃtre tribījake ||

svapnalabdhe striyādatte siddhādīnnaiva śodhayet |
viṃśatparṇādhikāmaṃtrā mālāmaṃtrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

athānnaprāśanasaṃskāraḥ ||

annaprāśanasaṃskāraḥ ṣaṣṭasārvajanīnakaḥ |
svakalpokta vidhānena śūdrādināma maṃtrakaḥ ||

pitarastatra saṃpūjyā vāmamārge tu bhairavāḥ |
sveṣṭa devasya cakrasya pūjāṃte svavaśeṣitaṃ ||

sa tīrthaṃ sa paraṃ dadyāt mūlamaṃtramudīrayet |
evaṃ kṛta vidhānasya kṣudvipattiṃrnajāyate ||

atha caurākṣasaṃskāraḥ ||

atha saptama saṃskāraṃ caurākṣa śṛṇu pārvatī |
sarveṣāme taduddiṣṭaṃ bālyapātakanāśanaṃ ||

bauddhānāṃ plavanānāṃ ca śikhātasthāpyatena ca |
strīṇāmapi ca kartavyaṃ saubhāgyārogya vṛddhaye ||

vāme cūḍāstu dhartavyā maṃtrabījasamāḥkacāḥ |
tīrthe kṣiptvā kharedbhūmau viśeṣā vāmimāmiti ||

atha mauṃjīvaṃdhākhya saṃskāraḥ ||

athāṣṭhaṃ maṃtrasaṃskāraṃ mauṃjīvaṃdhamahaṃ bruve |
guroḥ samīpe nayanaṃ taccopanayanaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

svakalpokta vidhānena tat kuryād brahmavarcase |
vāmācārairdvijaiḥ pūrvaṃ kartavyaṃ kuladīkṣaṇaṃ ||

paścāddīkṣā tu sā vimāṃcyatyā sā satito bhavet |
dīkṣā tu laghudaivatyā prākyaścān mahatastathā ||

mṛhaddaivatamaṃtre tu siddheḥ kṣudrāḥ svayaṃ vaśāḥ |
teṣāṃ grāhyā yatra dīkṣā puraścaryā samācaret ||

prayogāṃśca prakurvīta na svoṣṭasya kadācana |
sacchiṣyaṃ vā suputraṃ vā vinnyaṣṭaṃdāpayenna ca ||

lobhādbhayādvāṃ kāmādvāyodadyāt siddhamaṃtrakaṃ |
śiṣyasya jāyate siddhi guroḥ śāpaṃ prajāyate ||

<p. 18b>

yasyā yasyāṃ devatāyā praśastiryatra yatra ca |
tattanmārge praśastāsya svarājyarājavadbhavet ||

taṃtrāṇyaṣṭottaraśataṃ mayā proktāni pārvatīḥ |
yena yena tu yatpṛṣṭaṃ tasyādhikyaṃ tu varṇitaṃ ||

niḥpakṣapātaṃ vakṣyāmi merutaṃtre yathārthataḥ |
sarvebhyo vaidikaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ nyūnaṃ smārtaṃ tataḥ smṛtaṃ ||

tatastāṃ ca tu tatrāpi saṃhitā arṇavāstataḥ |
yāmalāsaṃgamāstaṃtramuḍḍīśāni ca tāḍave ||

iṃdrajālaṃ kacchapuṭāvaudhaṃjainaṃ ca śāvaraṃ |
kramādapacitaṃ jñeyaṃ yathāyogyaṃ samucyatāṃ ||

nīce uccasya jātaḥ syāñtīva uccātyate dhruvaṃ |
jñātidādyāya sarvepi svācārāt karmakurvate ||

idaṃ paśumataṃ proktaṃ vakṣyenyat kaula vāmayoḥ |
sarvebhyo vaidikaḥ śreṣṭho vaidikod vaiṣṇavaḥ paraḥ ||

vaiṣṇavādmāṇayaḥ śreṣṭo gāṇapāt saura uttamaḥ |
saurācchaivaḥ śreṣṭhataraḥ saivācchāktaḥ paromataḥ ||

śāktebhyo dakṣiṇaḥ śreṣṭho dakṣiṇād vāma eva tu |
vāmādvīraḥ śreṣṭhataro vīrāt kaulāvadhūtakaḥ ||

kaulāvadhū tataḥ kaulaḥ kaulāt parataraṃ na hi ||

atha prājāpatyavratākhyasaṃskāraḥ ||

saṃskāraṃ navamaṃ viṃdyāt prājāpatyaṃ vratābhidhaṃ |
svakalpoktena mārgeṇa vaidikastāṃtrikaḥ punaḥ ||

etadvratasya saṃskāre gāṇapatyo manuḥ smṛtaḥ |
vakratuṇḍādikā dakṣe ucchiṣṭādyāstu vāmake ||

atha saumyavratākhyasaṃskāraḥ ||

saṃskāraṃ daśamaṃ saumya vrataṃ vaidikamācaret |
svakalpokta vidhānena tatsthāne tāṃtrikaḥ punaḥ ||

gṛhṇīyād bhairavaṃ maṃtraṃ vadukākhyasya vāmake |
kālabhairava bhedasya yasya kasyāpi dakṣiṇe ||

puraścaryo pāśakānāṃ nāśako bhairavo yataḥ |
daridraiḥ sādhakairgrāhyaḥ svarṇākarṣaṇabhairavaḥ ||

atha āgneyākhyasaṃskāraḥ ||

ekādaśaṃ tu saṃskāramāgneyākhyamataṃdritaḥ |
kuryād gṛhyokta mārgeṇa tasmin sthāne tu tāṃtrikaḥ ||

gṛhnīyādaṃga devānāṃ maṃtrānādau gurormukhāt |
pūjādimatrāṃtacchikṣāṃtaddravya niyamāṃstathā ||

atha devākhyasaṃskāraḥ ||

dvādaśaṃ cāpi saṃskāraṃ vaiśvadevaṃ vratābhidhaṃ |
tasmin sthāne bhaveddīkṣā sveṣṭaṃ maṃtrasya tāṃtrike ||

atha godānākhyasaṃskāraḥ ||

trayodaśaṃ tu saṃskāraṃ godānākhyaṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
tatsthāne tāṃtrikaḥ kuryāt sarvapāpa vimokṣaṇaṃ ||

<p. 19a>

satsthale tu samāsīna ādarśaṃ vā ghaṭodakaṃ |
sthāpyāgre satpayā vācāstataḥ saṃprārthayediti ||

puraścaraṇa kāmohaṃ pāpaṃkṣayi tu mudhyataḥ |
aparāhnaṃ japaṃ kurve devatāḥ saṃtusākṣiṇaḥ ||

pṛthivyāpteja(-)ākāśavāyuḥ sūryendubhāni ca |
yāvaccharīre pāpāni tiṣṭhaṃti mama devatāḥ ||

tāvacca pratibiṃbāme malinebhāṃ tu pātake |
śāṃte pāradamadhye ca yathā saṃdṛśyatāṃ tathā ||

śuddhaḥ saṃcinmayo bhūtvā ciṃtayet pāpapūruṣaṃ |
dakṣakukṣi sthitaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ maṃguṣṭha parimāṇakaṃ ||

viprahatyā śiro yuktaṃ kanakasteya vāhukaṃ |
madirāpāna hṛdayaṃ gurutalpa kaṭīyutaṃ ||

pāpasaṃyoga yadvaṃdvamupayātakaromakaṃ |
khaḍgacarmadharaṃ duṣṭamadhovaktraṃ suduḥsahaṃ ||

evaṃ saṃciṃtayitvātha japaṃ kurvan viciṃtayet |
dīyamānaṃ pāpanaraṃ japāṃte prekṣayet punaḥ ||

ādarśādi padāsvacchā sarvachāyā pradṛśyate |
tadā tu nirgataṃ pāpaṃ puraścaraṇayorgatā ||

atha samāvartanākhyasaṃskāraḥ ||

caturdaśaṃ tu saṃskāraṃ samāvartana mucyate |
tasya sthāne puraścaryā kartavyā tāṃtrikairjanaiḥ ||

ādau saṃkṣepa pūjā tu dine kṛtvā tu kaulikaḥ |
āsāyaṃ tu japaṃ kuryāccakrapūjāṃ tathā niśi ||

śaktibhiḥ sahitaḥ paṃcamakārādi samanvitaḥ |
evaṃ siddhimavāpnoti nānyathā japakoṭibhiḥ ||

atha vivāhākhya saṃskāraḥ ||

vivāhaḥ paṃcadaśamaḥ sarveṣāṃ sa vidhīyate |
vidhavāyā vivāhastu picchale naiva jāyate ||

sarvapāpa vinirmuktā sā tu viṣṇupadaṃ vrajet |
abrāhmaṇī dvijā kuryādanyamekaṃ tathā patiṃ ||

atha pitṛmedhākhya saṃskāraḥ ||

ṣoḍaśaḥ pitṛmedhākhyaḥ svagṛhyoktena vartmanā |
vaidikastāṃtrikastatra devasthāne svadevatāṃ ||

sthāpayitvā carecchrāddhaṃ brāhmaṇāmṛtapaṃthinaḥ |
athavā yajamānasya mārgasthastadabhāvataḥ ||

āmaśrāddhaṃ prakurvīta vāmī tu palapaitṛkaṃ |
śaktiyuktādvijāḥ kaule bhojyāścakrārcane tathā ||

varjayet tulasīṃ tatra bhṛṃgarājena pūjayet |
pākaḥ kaulikavastūnāṃ piṇḍāśca rudhirokṣitāḥ ||

<p. 19b>

etaiḥ ṣoḍaśa saṃskāraiḥ saṃskṛtaḥ sādhakottamaḥ |
jīvanmuktastadājñeyaḥ sāmarthyaṃ devatārcane ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau sādhakānāṃ garbhādhānādi ṣoḍaśa saṃskāranirṇaye 
nāma caturthaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 4 ||
atha maṃtrama (*) (?) ṣoḍaśa saṃskāraḥ ||

atha ṣoḍaśa vakṣyehaṃ saṃskārān maṃtrasaṃsthitān |
śāpairmaṃtrā vimucyaṃte yān kṛtvā daivanirmitaiḥ ||

athādau sarvamaṃtrāṇāṃ tayoranyatra jāgratiḥ |
prabodhakāle saṃjapto jāgrato jāyate manuḥ ||

athavā saṃpuṭī kṛtya jātānādyān sa viṃdukān |
punaśca savisargāṃstān kṣakāraṃ kevalaṃ paṭhet ||

evaṃ japtopadiṣṭāṃ cet prabuddhaḥ śīghrasiddhidaḥ |
atha sāvaraṇa maṃtrāṇāṃ jāgratiṃ śṛṇu pārvatī ||

kāṃsyabhājanamānīya śuddhaṃ bhasmādibhiḥ kṛtaṃ |
prajaped ravirātrau tu yā meyā me śatāṣṭakaṃ ||

khādiryā tāḍayed yaṣṭhyā kāṃsyapātraṃ vadediti |
jāgrato bhavamaṃtrastvaṃ bhāṣayātha turīyake ||

yāme dadyādvaliṃ kālyāḥ maṃtrajaṃ bhairavasya tu |
kukkuṭaṃ cānya deveṣu sphoṭayantārikerakaṃ ||

atha sarve maṃtrāḥ kathaṃ śāpitā ityapecchāyāṃ tadvījamāhā ||

surayā mūrddhayā pūrvadevādevā vimohitā |
yadā tadā tu bhagavān provāca madhusūdanaḥ ||

kaḥ pūjyo bhavatāṃ madhyekaḥ śreṣṭhastaṃ nigadyatāṃ |
unmattāstu tadā devāḥ śreṣṭhohamiti cāsuvan ||

kiṃ viṣṇustān sa bhagavān mohayannātmamāya vā |
ityavocadyasya vākyaṃ sāpeyānugrahekṣamaṃ ||

sa eva devaḥ śreṣṭhāgre pūrvo vāpya paropi vā |
iti śrutvā vaco viṣṇo sa śāpaśca parasparaṃ ||

maṃtrarūpāṇyato devī saṃskāraiḥ śāpamokṣaṇaṃ |
vinā tu śāpamokṣeṇakaḥ siddhiṃ prāpnuyājjanaḥ ||

devyuvāca ||

śāpaḥ kena kathaṃ dattaṃ śapte japte ca kiṃ phalaṃ |
niḥśāpatvaṃ kathaṃ teṣāṃ siddhiḥ syāditimevadā ||

śivovāca ||

ādi madhyāvasāneṣu vāyuryasya vyavasthitaḥ |
caturādyovaika vījonaikadhāṃ yatra saṃgamaḥ ||

kenāpi ca samākrāṃtaḥ sa maṃtracheditosinā |
kārtike yena tajjāyāchidyatesya manorathāḥ ||

ādau madhyevasāne vā bhūvīja yugalaṃ bhavet |
ādau yadvādvidhāvakra tridhā madhyaṃ tatodvidhā ||

<p. 20a>

rudvau śakrasya śāpena bhuktimukti vivarjitau |
jātau maṃtrau vā madakṣamārgayorapi sevitau ||

hrīṁ moṁ phreṁ śrīṁṣvekatamaṃ yatra bījaṃ na dṛśyate |
hraṁkāro vā sa maṃtrastu śaktihīnaḥ kṛtaḥ suraiḥ ||

etādṛśaścet saṃjaptaḥ sāmarthyaṃ haṃti maṃtriṇaḥ |
śaktihīnasya vāmasya maraṇaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

nādau hrīṁ na ca madhye klīṁ kroṁ te vā naiva dṛśyate |
asauparāṅmukho maṃtro jātaḥ sūryasya śāpataḥ ||

parāṅmukhaṃ bhajenmaṃtraṃ devatā syāt parāṅmukhī |
daivāt kāryepi saṃsiddhe lokasyācca parāṅmukhaḥ ||

ādāvaṃte yathā madhyehaṃ vāsaṃ vā na dṛśyate |
vidhirāste kṛtā maṃtrā devācāryagaṇāpi ca ||

japte tu vadhire maṃtre vismṛtistasya jāyate |
jāyate vadhiro nūnaṃ mahākālena bhāṣitaṃ ||

sūryabījaṃ hakāraḥ syāccaṃdrabījaṃ tu saḥ smṛtaḥ |
rephogniṃ bījamuddiṣṭametannetra trayaṃ mamaḥ ||

paṃcākṣare yatra maṃtre yatraikamapi nāsti cet |
mama śāpānnetrahīno duḥkhaśokabhayapradaḥ ||

nādau madhyena cāṃte vā  hsauṃ vāhaṃ savātha hauṃ |
aiṃ vā phreṃ vāthavā hrūṁ vā namo vā hrīṁ manuḥ sa tu ||

śāpena kīlato netro rājadevena pārvatī |
japtastu kīlito maṃtro na siddhimadhigacchati ||

madhye e kolakāro vā phaṭ voṃtela dvayaṃ yadi |
phaṭ dvayaṃ cātrayaṃ vāṃ tena cetsastaṃbhito manuḥ ||

śāpena bhairaveṇāsmāt siddhaṃ bhavati śobhanaṃ |
kadāpi naiva duḥkhaṃ ca prāyaśo bahulaṃ bhavet ||

ādau tu yasya maṃtrasya kramāt saptākṣarāṇi cet |
repheṇa vā yakāreṇa saṃyuktāni manuḥ sa tu ||

vāyvagnikāya saṃdagdhaḥ sādhakaṃ paritāpayet |
tasmāt saṃskārayeddevī siddhaye sādhakottamaḥ ||

dvābhyāṃ tribhirathā ṣaḍbhiraṣṭabhirvā pradṛśyate |
yadākṣarairaṃtaritaḥ phaṭkāraḥ sa nigadyate ||

nārasiṃhasya śāpena trastaḥ saṃtrāśayet sadā |
svapnādau sādhakaṃ naiva siddhiḥ saṃdṛśyate kvacit ||

oṁ vā haṃ vā sakāro vānādau bhīto manuḥ sa tu |
brahmaśāpāddhīna siddhirbhavedatyaṃtakaṣṭadaḥ ||

ādi madhyāvasāneṣu militvāma catuṣṭayaṃ |
sa maṃtro malino māyāśāpānmālinya kārakaḥ ||

<p. 20b>

hūṁ cādau vā maṃtramadhye cāṃte phaṭ yugalaṃ bhavet |
tiraskṛto rudraśāpāt sādhyaṃ kuryāttiraskṛtaṃ ||

ādau tāradvayaṃ cāṃte vaṣaḍvā atramādale |
kraduṃva kalahaṃ kuryādvālā śāpena bheditaḥ ||

hakāreṇa sakāreṇa rahitastryakṣarastu yaḥ |
suṣuptaḥ siṃhaśāpena proktābhīṣṭa phalāpahaḥ ||

aṣṭādaśākṣarādiryaḥ paṃcaphaṭkārapūrvakaḥ |
cāmuṇḍā śāpato jāto madonmatto na śobhanaḥ || 

madhye vetyaṃ ca phaṭkārā kālikā śāpataḥ sa tu |
mūrchito mūrchitaṃ kuryādvāminaṃ tu viśeṣataḥ ||

evamaṃte ca phaṭkāra paṃcakaṃ sa tu raṃbhayā |
hatavīryastu śāpena kṛtaḥ kṣīṇasvakārakaḥ ||

catvāro yatra phaṭkārā ādimadhyāṃ ca sānikā |
aṣṭādaśākṣaro hīno hāniṃ bhairavaśāpataḥ ||

ekonaviṃśatparṇaśce hrīṁ kroṁ māṁ kāra saṃyutaḥ |
pradhvasta kāmaśāpenadhvaṃ sayet kāmakāraṇāt ||

saptavarṇā manurvālaḥ kumāroṣṭākṣaraḥ smṛtaḥ |
ṣoḍaśārṇastu taruṇaḥ prauḍho vyomā vivarṇakaḥ ||

triṃśat kalāśataṃ vedakāṣṭāvarṇāstu yatra tu |
sakṛddhi ete kālena sadā duḥkāni kurvate ||

navārṇa oṃkārayutaścāmuṇḍā śāpato manuḥ |
niḥstriṃśa sādhakaṃ chiṃdhyāni striṃśena na saṃśayaḥ ||

aṃte namo vā svāhā vā nāsti vā yasya madhyataḥ |
vaṣaṭ vauṣaṭ sa hūṁ phaṭ ca etadvānāstyasau manuḥ ||

nirbīja iti saṃśapto bhuvanesyāsya sādhakaḥ |
sevāṃ kurvallabhedvaṃśanāśaṃ varṣatrayāditaḥ ||

ādi madhyāvasāneṣu phaṭ phaṭkārāstu yasya tu |
kaumāryāstu sa śāpena siddhi hīno na siddhikṛt ||

daśākṣaro yastu maṃtraḥ sa gaṇeśasya śāpataḥ |
maṃdo japtastu mūrkhatvaṃ kuryājjanmani janmani ||

ādivyaṃjana saṃyoga eka eva svaro bhavet |
tatkūṭaṃ kūṭato hāni mātaṃgyāḥ śāpataḥ smṛtāḥ ||

dvivarṇasatvahīnaḥ syādāśvineyasya śāpataḥ |
nāśayet sādhakavalaṃ rājñaḥ sainyaṃ vināśayet ||

caturvarṇaḥ kekarastu jātaḥ sarpāliśāpataḥ |
japitvā kekaraṃ maṃtraṃ cākṣuṣā naiva paśyati ||

ṣaḍakṣarā bījahīnā jātā rāvaṇaśāpataḥ |
vaṃśavṛddhirnatajjāpādanyathā strīsukhaṃ na hi ||

sārddha trisaptasūryāṇāṃ dhūmāvatyāśca śāpataḥ |
dhūmītā vyākulaṃ cittaṃ jāyate sādhakasya tu ||

<p. 21a>

viṃśat tathaikaviṃśacca triṃśadvarṇastu tārayā |
sapta āliṃgitaścāyaṃ japāt saptaṃ na termṛtiḥ ||

dvāviṃśatyakṣaro maṃtraḥ sarasvatyāstuśāpataḥ |
mohitaḥ sādhakaṃ kuryātyānādivyasanākulaṃ ||

caturviṃśati varṇoyaḥ saptaviṃśati varṇakaḥ |
kṣudhārtā rājamātaṃgyāḥ śāpāddāridryakārakaḥ ||

trayoviṃśatrayaṃ rudrāvarṇāḥ kaulikaśāpataḥ |
maṃtrā dṛptāstajjaptena chāṃdasorjāyate janaḥ ||

ṣaḍviṃśadekonatriṃśatriṃśatṣaḍtriṃśadakṣaraḥ |
pūṣṇaḥ śāpādaṃgahīnaḥ kāmanārūpako na hi ||

aṣṭāviṃśadeka triṃśadvarṇo naṃdīśaśāpataḥ |
atikrūraḥ sādhyanāśaṃ kṛtvā naśyacca sādhakaḥ ||

aṣṭatriṃśākṣaro maṃtro mātṛkāṇāṃ tu śāpataḥ |
ati kruddhasta japena svakṛtesvasya saṃkṣayaḥ ||

catvāriṃśat samārabhya triṣaṣṭiyāvadakṣaraṃ |
savrīḍāmālikāśāpāt sa vrīḍā tasya sādhakāḥ ||

paṃcaṣaṣṭyakṣarāyesyurmaṃtrāsteśāṃtamānasāḥ |
kāmaśāpena tajjāpādudyogasya palaṃ na hi ||

ṣaṭṣaṣṭhitonavanavatiparyaṃtaṃ kujasya tu |
svāna aṣṭāstu śāpena jātāstādṛkvasādhakaḥ ||

dhātidhṛtirddhātridhṛtikvaṃkayugmaṃ dvigokarāḥ |
śatatrayaṃ yatra varṇāḥ śāpitācchinnamastayā ||

yūyaṃ bhavaṃtu niḥsnehā sādhakānāṃ bhayāvahā |
niḥkāmairyatibhirjaptāḥ saṃsāraḥ snehanāśanāḥ ||

catuḥśatānyathārabhyayāvadvarṇa sahasrakaṃ |
ativṛddho yajñaśāpāt pauṣṭikādiṣu varjitāḥ ||

sahasrāṇādhikāmaṃtrā daṃḍapāṇestu śāpataḥ |
daṃḍakākhyāpīḍitāśca tajjapāt kaṣṭamāpnuyāt ||

dvisahasrāṇādhikāmaṃtrā bhārgavasya tu śāpataḥ |
khaṃḍīkṛtā saptadhā te siddhi khaṃḍakarāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

anyacchṛṇvaṃ tu bhodevā munīnāṃ japatāṃ yadā |
siddhirnajātā tu tadā dattaḥ śāpaḥ sudāruṇaḥ ||

āśvāsanaṃ devatānāṃ jātaṃ siddherakāraṇāt |
upadeśe guruḥkuryāttasmāttanmaṃtraśodhanaṃ ||

tatprakāraṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇvaṃ tu sakarāsurāḥ |
guruḥ siddhāsane saṃsthogudameḍhrāṃtaraṃ dṛdhaṃ ||

vāmena pārṣṇi nāpīḍya tasyopari tu vinyaset |
pādaṃ tu dakṣiṇaṃ gulphaṃ graṃthyoranyonyamarddanaṃ ||

yathā syāt tatprakartavyaṃ tato daṣiṇapārṣṇinā |
liṃgamūlaṃ viniṣpīḍyasthirakāya upāviśet || 

<p. 21b>

gudamākuṃcyapavanasapānākhyaṃ tadā guruḥ |
utthāpayet tataḥ prāṇāmadhu samyaṅnirodhayet ||

apānaḥ prāṇayoḥ kuryāt saṃghaṭṭaṃ caika dṛṅmanā |
mūlādhārecit svarūpaḥ kuṇḍalyāṃ paramātmani ||

jātadoṣaṃ svasya maṃtraṃ ciṃtayet tatra sadguruḥ |
tasya maṃtrasyākṣarāṇi kramādekaikaśastutaḥ ||

suṣumṇāyā tu mārgeṇa mūlādhāre praveśayet |
svādhiṣṭhāne tataścakre maṇipūrehyanāhate ||

viśuddha ājñā cakre ca bhitvā bhitvā praveśayet |
evaṃ nītvā brahmaraṃdhraṃ tatranyāt somamaṇḍalāt ||

nirgatā mṛtasaṃsiktamaṃtrāṇāṃ su vibhāvayet |
punaḥ suṣumṇā mārgeṇa ājñā cakre ca tārayet ||

viśuddhe nāhate cāpi maṇipūre ca cakrake |
svādhiṣṭhāne tato bhedānmūlādhāraṃ praveśayet ||

tatastanmaṃtramṛṣyādinyāsaḥ pūrvaṃ japenmanuṃ |
uktaśāpādvinirmuktaṃ paścādupadiśeccataṃ ||

alpapuṇyatayā pāpādhikyāt pāpaḥ kalauyuge |
āśīrvādaphalaṃ stokaṃ pūrṇapāpādijaṃ phalaṃ ||

vācikānāṃ tu śāpānāṃ nāśādyartha mathocyate ||

atha maṃtrāṇāṃ jananādi saṃskārāḥ ||

śrīparṇyo vā caṃdanasya pīṭhe cūtādikasya vā |
kastūrī kuṃkumābjaiśca vilikhet pāṃcabhautikaṃ ||

cakramāvāhayet tatra mātṛkākhyāṃ sarasvatīṃ |
yathoktavidhinā pūjāṃ kṛtvā cāṣṭhottaraśataṃ ||

japitvā mātṛkāṃ tasyā madhyāt svābhīṣṭamaṃtrakaṃ |
svaravyaṃjana viṃduśca sargayogākṣarāṇī ca ||

pṛthak pṛthagathodvṛtya caikīkṛtya gurūktitaḥ |
gṛhītaṃ jamayet maṃtraṃ proktaṃ saṃjananaṃ tvidaṃ ||

ādyaṃtaṃ praṇavaṃ kṛtvā praṇavāṃ taritāṃ japet |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ maṃtraṃ varṇānetattu jīvanaṃ ||

rocanā kuṃkumābhyāṃ ca bhujapatre likhenmanuṃ |
pratyakṣaraṃ śataṃ vāraṃ tāḍayeccandanāṃbhasā ||

samuccaran vāyubījametattāḍanamucyate |
kuṃṭhitāḥ śāvarāḥ maṃtrāḥ tāḍitāḥ siddhikārakāḥ ||

pūrvoktapīṭhe saṃlikhya tanmaṃtrākṣara saṃkhyayā |
ādāyakaravīrasya puṣpāṇpatha samuccaran ||

pratyakṣaraṃ ca taiḥ puṣpaiḥ śatavāraṃ hunediti |
uccaran vahnibījaṃ ca vodhanaṃ tvetaducyate ||

prāgvat pīṭhe ca tairdravyaiḥ padmamaṣṭadalaṃ likhet |
tatkarṇikāyāṃ mālatyā likhet kalikayaikayā ||

<p. 22a>

ekaikārṇaṃ tu maṃtrasya tanmaṃtrākṣara saṃkhyayā |
aśvattha pallavaṃ gṛhyatamevaṃ maṃtramuccaran ||

abhiṣiṃcāmyamuṃ maṃtraṃ nama ityabhiṣecayet |
nānāsugaṃdhito yena pallavaiḥ kena cākṣaraṃ ||

ekamaṣṭottaraśatamabhiṣekastvayaṃ smṛtaḥ |
abhiṣeko maṃtraśuddhiṃ kuryānnṛṇāṃ yathā jalaṃ ||

jyotirmaṃtraściṃtanīyāmūlādhāregnimaṃḍale |
saṃskartavyaṃ manuṃ tasya urdhvamevaṃ vibhāvayet ||

āṇavāṣyaḥ sāhajikaḥ āgaṃtuḥ kārmaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ |
yogākhyāmāyikaḥ proktaḥ svamaṃtre tu malatrayaṃ ||

jyotirmaṃtreṇa nirdagdhamekameka viciṃtayet |
evaṃ tu vimalo jātaḥ svamaṃtra iti ciṃtayet ||

jyotirmaṃtrastu vedādi hauṁmitidyakṣaro mataḥ |
vimalīkaraṇaṃ tve tatprayogāṃ tepi kārayet ||

prāgvat pīṭhe kuṃkumādi dravyairmaṃtraṃ vilekhayet |
tāmrādipātraṃ karpūra vā sitena jalena ca ||

śuddhenāpūryalikhitamaṃtreṇāṣṭottaraṃśataṃ |
abhimaṃtryajalaṃ tena maṃtreṇa kuśabiṃdubhiḥ ||

pratyakṣaraṃ prokṣayet tade tadāpyāyanaṃ mataṃ |
puraścaryā kleśitānāṃ samāvartanavatvidaṃ ||

kastūryādyaistāmrapātramadhye maṃtraṃ vilekhayet |
pātrāṃtare ca karpūrādikavāsita sajjalaṃ ||

gṛhītvā cārghyapātreṇa paṭhamaṃtramimaṃ manuṃ |
tarpayāmi namoṃ tena tarpayediti tarpaṇaṃ ||

oṃ hrīṃ śrīṁ pūrvakaṃ maṃtraṃ japedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
japedetaddīpane syāt sarvamaṃtreṣvapīṣyate ||

japyamānasya maṃtrasya gopanaṃ tvaprakāśanaṃ |
saṃskārā daśasaṃproktā sarvataṃtreṣu gopitā ||

evamekādaśa proktaḥ saṃskārā atha paṃca ca |
pratimaṃtraṃ vakṣyamāṇo japahomaśca tarpaṇaṃ ||

mārjanaṃ bhojanaṃ cāpi dvijānāmiti ṣoḍaśaḥ |
proktāḥ maṃtrasya saṃskārāḥ devaśāpādi mocakāḥ ||

dīkṣākālaṃ pravakṣyāmi tacchṛṇuṣva varānane ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇaumaṃtrāṇāṃ jāgaraṇādi ṣoḍaśasaṃskāranirṇayannāma 
paṃcama prakāśaḥ] || 5 ||
atha māsaphalaṃ ||

īśvarovāca ||

caitre duḥkhāya dīkṣāsyād vaiśākhe ratnasaṃcayaḥ |
maraṇaṃ bhavati jyeṣṭe cāṣāḍhe vaṃdhunāśanaṃ ||

samṛddhiḥ śrāvaṇenūnaṃ bhaved bhādrapadakṣayaḥ |
prajānāśo'thāśvine tu bhaveccā śubhameva ca ||

jñānaṃ syāt kārtike saukhyamārgaśrīrṣa bhavetkila |
pauṣe jñānakṣayomādyebhave medhā vivarddhanaṃ ||

<p. 22b>

phālguṇe sarvasiddhiḥ syāt malamāsaṃ vivarjayet |
niṣiddhamāse tu tat tadviśeṣo śṛṇu bhedattaḥ ||

ṣaṣṭī bhādrapademāsi tathāśvina caturdaśī |
kārtikī navamī śuklāmārgo śuklātṛtīyakā ||

pauṣe ca navamī śuklāmāghe śuklā caturthikā |
phālguṇe navamī śuklā caitre kāma trayodaśī ||

vaiśākhe cākṣayā caiva jyeṣṭhe daśaharātithiḥ |
āṣāḍhe paṃcamī śuklāśrāvaṇe śuklapaṃcamī ||

etāni devaparvāṇi tīrthakoṭi phalaṃ labhet |
ninditeṣvapi kāleṣu dīkṣoktā parvaṇī śubhā ||

atha pakṣaphalaṃ ||

bhuktimuktipradaḥ śuklakṛṣṇa mokṣapradaḥ smṛtaḥ |
vāmācāravatāṃ śuklo na satkṛṣṇaupi madhyamaḥ ||

titheḥ phalaṃ buddhināśaḥ kramād jñeyaḥ susiddhaye |
agaurīmāṃtrikātraṣṭā vigaṇeśāśca duḥkhitā ||

siddhyaṃti maṃtrāḥ sarvepi na siddhyaṃti kadācana |
samṛddhirdrutasiddhiśca mūrkhatā duḥkhanāśanaṃ ||

jaḍatāriktanāśaśca sarvapūrṇaṃ bhavet phalaṃ |
śuklāśreṣṭhā naiva kṛṣṇā śubhāśubha narāhareḥ ||

siddhiḥ syāt sarvamaṃtrāṇāmaśaivānāṃ mahābhayaṃ |
siddhirhātu viśeṣeṇa putrahāniḥ pitṛnṛte ||

amāvāsyā somavāre bhaumavāre caturdaśī |
saptamī ravivāreṇa sūryaparvaśataiḥ samā ||

atha vāraphalaṃ ||

ravivāre bhavedvittaṃ somaśāṃti bhavetkila |
āyuraṃgārakehaṃti tatra dīkṣāṃ vivarjayet ||

budhaḥ sauṃdaryamāpnoti jñānasyānna bṛhaspatau |
śukre saubhāgyamāpnoti ca śo (******) (##?)

atha nakṣatraphalaṃ ||

kramāddīkṣāphalaṃbhānāṃ samatā ca yathā vipat |
manastāpaḥ priyāsaukhyaṃ saukhyaṃ maṃtrasya siddhayaḥ ||

siddhiśca krūramaṃtrāṇāṃ śaktimaṃtrasya siddhayaḥ |
sarve maṃtrāḥ prasiddhyaṃti sarpamaṃtrasya siddhayaḥ ||

nidhanaṃ rājadaṇḍaśca vaśitvaṃ sarvasiddhayaḥ |
rudradaivatasaṃsiddhiḥ śīghraṃ siddhiḥ śubhāmati ||

devamaitrī sarvehāniḥ kalahaśca mahābhayaṃ |
saṃpadrogojapātsiddhiḥ kṣobhaḥ saṃtāpa īśatā ||

sarvasiddhiphalaṃbhānāṃ kramāddakṣatha vāmake |
caturaste tvadhaḥpāto dagdhāliṃgitadhūmite ||

<p. 23a>

adhomukhe śubhebhe ca caṃdraśuddhau viśeṣataḥ |
kṛṣṇe tārābalaṃ kuryāṃt svanāmādi viciṃtanaṃ ||

atha yogaphalaṃ ||

yogāśca prītirāyuṣmānsaubhāgyaḥ śobhanaḥ śubhaḥ |
śukarmā ca dhṛtirvṛddhirdhruvaḥ siddhiśca harṣaṇaḥ ||

varīyāṁśca śivaḥ siddho brahmā iṃdraśca ṣoḍaśaḥ |
viṣkaṃbhādika yogānāṃ nāmatulyaṃ phalaṃ bhavet ||

ānaṃdādika yogānāṃ sarvatrā vikalaṃ phalaṃ |
śubhāni karaṇānyāhurdīkṣāyāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ ||

atha karaṇaphalaṃ ||

vavavālagataittilaścavaṇijastadanaṃtaraṃ |
karaṇānyetāni śubhānyeva sarvataṃtreṣu bhāvinī ||

śakunyādī niviṣṭiṃ ca viśeṣeṇa vivarjayet |
viṣṭiṃ vihāya karaṇevare siddhirdrutaṃ bhavet ||

sarvasiddhirviṣṭipucchesthire tu sthiratā bhavet ||

atha lagnaphalaṃ ||

atha lagnaphalaṃ devādhanaṃdhānyaṃ samṛddhayaḥ |
mṛtyurvātha bhaveddhāniḥ paśupatya vināśanaṃ ||

rājyaṃ vā devatā siddhirhānirmedhā vināśanaṃ |
ratnādi lakṣmīlābhaśca dhanaṃdhānyaṃ ca siddhayaḥ ||

pūrṇasiddhiḥ pratāpaśca hānirvijñānanāśanaṃ |
putraprāptirmaṃtrasiddhiḥ paśavorvipulaṃ dhanam ||

sadāduḥkhaṃ tathā hānirvāmitāṃ mithunaḥ śubhaḥ |
vāgināṃ yavanānāṃ ca viruddhaṃ vahudhā śubhaṃ ||

atha kālaphalaṃ ||

dharmataḥ prātakālaḥ syāt saṃgame rājyadāyakaḥ |
madhyāhne sarvasiddhiḥ syāt sāyāhne madhyamo bhavet ||

rajanī maṃtradāne tu niṣiddhā deśikottamaiḥ |
caraḥ sarvovivarjaḥ syāt sthirarāśiṣu saukhyadā ||

sthiralagnaṃ viṣṇumaṃtre śivamaṃtre caraṃ śubhaṃ |
dviḥ svabhāvagataṃ lagnaṃ śaktimaṃtre praśasyate ||

tṛtīyaikādaśaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ daśamasthaḥ śubhaḥ śaśī |
janmacaṃdraḥ śubhaḥ proktā janmanakṣatra varjitaḥ ||

śuklapakṣe dvitīyastu paṃcamo navamastathā |
gocare ye grahāḥ śuddhāstairyuktopi śubhaḥ śaśī ||

śubhamadhyasthito vāpi caṃdramā śubhado bhavet |
paṃcāṃga śuddhedivase svādaye caṃdrasūryayoḥ ||

guru śukrodaye caiva śasyate maṃtrasaṃskriyā |
śukrosto yadi vā vṛddho gurvādibhyo bhavedyadi ||

meṣavṛścika siṃheṣu tadā doṣo na vidyate |
asvādhyāya bhūmikaṃpe saṃdhyāgarje ca bhairava ||

ulkāpāte ca divase tatra dīkṣāṃ vivarjayet |
śikṣati janmanakṣatre saṃkrāṃtau viṣuve'yane ||

<p. 23b>

anyeṣu puṇyayogeṣu grahaṇe caṃdrasūryayoḥ |
paṃcaparvayugādyāsuvyatīpātādi vāsare ||

atra dīkṣā śubhā proktā nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
yanmāsatithivārādiśodhanaṃ proktameva hi ||

maṃtradīkṣā paraṃ tatra vijñeyaṃ sādhakottamaiḥ |
vidyādīkṣāparaṃ naiva tithimāsādi śodhanaṃ ||

yadaivecchā tadā dīkṣā gurorājñānusārataḥ |
pausukṣavau pratyathana kālādi niyamaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

niṃdyānitāni sarvāṇi praśastāni vimuktaye ||

śaśidivākarayorgrahaṇe janmani śiṣyasya makarasaṃkrāṃtau ||

karuṇāsamaye ca gurornakṣatrādīpyate tena dīkṣāyāṃ ||

saṃtīrtherkavidhugrāse tattudāmana parvaṇoḥ |
maṃtradīkṣāṃ prakurvāṇo māsarkṣādīnna śodhayet ||

ravisaṃkramaṇe caiva sūryasya grahaṇe tathā |
tatra lagnādikaṃ kiṃcinna vicārya kadācana ||

mahāṣṭamyāṃ viśeṣeṇa dhanakāmārthasiddhaye ||

sūryagrahaṇakāle tu nānyadanveṣitaṃ bhavet |
sūryagrahaṇakālena sāmānyo nāsti kaścana ||

tatra yadyatkṛtaṃ sarvemanaṃta phaladaṃ bhavet |
na māsatithi vārādi śodhanaṃ sūryaparvaṇi ||

dadātīṣṭaṃ gṛhīyattattasmin kāle gurornṛṣu |
siddhirbhavati maṃtrasya vināyāse navai tataḥ ||

kartavyaṃ sarvayatnena maṃtrasiddhimabhīpsubhiḥ |
caṃdragraha sahasreṇa sūryagraha samo bhavet ||

tato lakṣaguṇaṃ proktaṃ grahaṇaṃ nijavāsare |
tatra sūryagrahaḥ śasto na tu caṃdragrahaḥ kvacit ||

caṃdragrahe tu dāridryaṃ śaure sarvasamṛddhaye |
sūryagrahaḥ śivaḥ proktaḥ caṃdrākhyaḥ śaktireva ca ||

sūryagrahe śaktidīkṣā paśudīkṣā na kārayet |
caṃdragrahe viṣṇudīkṣā paṃcarātraṃ na kārayet ||

caṃdrasūryagrahe dīkṣā sarvadīkṣā śubhāmatā |
caṃdragrahe śaktidīkṣā sarvadīkṣottamottamā ||

navāratithiṛkṣādinamāsaniyamastathā |
na yogakaraṇaṃ nāpi na vicāraṃ samācaret ||

devī bodhaṃ samārabhya yāvatsyā navamī tithiḥ |
kṛtā tāsu budhairdīkṣā sarvābhiṣṭa phalapradā ||

bodhane naiva durgāyāḥ kālākālaṃ na kārayet |
aśokākhyāṣṭāmī yatra rāmākhyo navamī tathā ||

yugādyāyāṃ janmadine vivāhadivase tathā |
viṣuvā'yanayordvaṃdve naiva kiṃcid vicārayet ||

<p. 24a>

ayane viṣuve caiva yugādyāsu tathaiva ca |
grahaṇe ca mahātīrthena kālasyā vicāraṇaṃ ||

tulasīnikaṭe vilvamūledhātrītale tathā |
anādidevasānnidhye mahākṣetre gavāṃ gṛhe ||

devī pūjādine vāpi nāsti kālasya nirṇayaḥ |
tithiṃ vinā vidīkṣāyā viśiṣṭāvasaraṃ śṛṇu ||

durlabhe sadgurūṇāṃ tu sakṛtsaṃga upasthite |
tadanujñā yadā labdhvā sa dīkṣā savaro mahān ||

grāme vā yadi vāraṇye kṣetre vā divase niśi |
gurāvaśruta dṛṣṭe ca siddhakṣetre suśobhanaṃ ||

āgaccheti gururdaivād yadā dīkṣā tadā bhavet |
yadaivecchā tadā dīkṣā gurorājñānurūpataḥ ||

na tithirna vrataṃ homā na snānaṃ japaḥ kriyā |
dīkṣāyā kāraṇaṃ kiṃtu svecchā vāpte tu sadgurau ||

śiṣyānāhūyaguruṇā kṛpayā yadi dīyate |
tadā lagnādikaṃ kiṃcinna vicāryaṃ kathaṃcana ||

sarvevārāḥ grahāḥ sarve nakṣatrāṇi ca rāśayaḥ |
yasminnahani saṃtuṣṭā guruḥ sarvasukhāvahaḥ ||

puṇyatīrthe kurukṣetre devā pīṭhe catuṣṭaye |
prayāge śrīgiraukāśyāṃ kālākālaṃ na śodhayet ||

dvayoḥ parāge harivāsare ca arddhodaye caiva mahodaye ca |
dīkṣā praśastā kathitā śivena siṃhastha doṣo na hi manyate ca ||

gayāyāṃ bhāskarakṣetre vireje caṃdraparvate |
catvare ca mataṃge ca tathā kanyāśrameṣu ca ||

na gṛhṇīyāt tato dīkṣāṃ tīrtheṣve teṣu pārvatī |
iti te kathitaṃ devī dīkṣākālaṃ sureśvarī ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau dīkṣākālanirṇayenāma ṣaṣṭhaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 6 ||
śrīdevyuvāca |

vāmamārge kathaṃ dīkṣā dakṣiṇe ca kathaṃ bhavet |
kiṃ tatrāvaśyakaṃ keṣāṃmitime nirṇayaṃ vada ||

īśvara uvāca |

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ |
dīkṣāvidhiṃ paṃcavidhaṃ tadrājñāmuttamottamaṃ ||

uttamaṃ mahādāḍhyānāṃ sāmānyānā tu madhyamam |
brāhmaṇānāmalpamuktaṃ yatīnāmapi cālyakaṃ ||

tasmādādau pravakṣyāmi tubhyaṃ yaccottamottamaṃ |
yasmin jñāte cottamādi bhedānāṃ viṣayo bhavet ||

tatra vakṣyāmi dīkṣāṃgaṃ vāstu yāgapuraḥ saraṃ |
tatra bhūmīparīkṣyeta vāstujñāna viśāradaḥ ||

<p. 24b>

tatra prathamato bhūmiparīkṣā |

plavasthānaṃ ca gaṃbhīraṃ dīrghatoyāśayaṃsaraḥ |
agniśālāgni hotṛṇāṃ puṇyasthānaṃ pariśrutaṃ ||

dvijānāṃ sa vratānāṃ vā āśrayaḥ svāśramotha vā |
dīkṣāyāmatiśastāni sthānānyetāni pārvatī ||

mahānadīnāṃtīrāṇi gaṃgāsāgarasaṃgame |
praśastāni ca tīrthāṇi kṣetrāṇi cāśramāṇyapi ||

araṇyāni ca sarvāṇi parvatāḥ sakalā api |
sanirjuropyupagirirdevatāyatanānyapi ||

atha niṣiddhāni |

na ca dīkṣāṃ prakurvīta nikuṃje gahane vane |
dvisīmnice mahāraṇye mātsaryamṛgasevite ||

sphuṭitā ca saśalyā ca valmīka rohiṇī tathā |
dūrataḥ parivarjyābhūḥ karturāyurddhanāpahā ||

sphuṭitāmaraṇaṃ kuryādduṣarādhanavāśinī |
saśalyā kleśadā nityaṃ viṣamā śatruvarddhinī ||

īśakoṇa pravāsā ca kartuḥ śrīdāsuniścitaṃ |
pūrvaplavāvṛddhikarī varadā bhūttarahlavā ||

dakṣiṇaplavayā bhūmi nityaṃ mṛtyubhayapradā |
gṛhakṣayakarī sā ca bhūmiryā nairṛtaplavā ||

dhanahānikarī pṛthvīkīrtitā varuṇaplavā | 
vātaplavā tathā bhūmirnityamudvegakāriṇī ||

prathame bhūpradeśe ca parīkṣāṃ kārayedbudhaḥ |
brāhmaṇībhūḥ kuśopetā kṣatriyāsyāccharākulā ||

kuśakāśākulā vaiśyā śudrāḥ sarvatṛṇākulā |
kuṃdeṃdugopahemālivarṇāyā brāhmaṇāditaḥ ||

brāhmī sarvārthasiddhaḥ syāt kṣatriyā rājyadā tathā |
dhanadhānyakarī vaiśyā śūdrā tu niṃditānune ||

mṛttikā gaṃdhamāghrāya śubhāśubha nirūpiṇaṃ |
nānāgaṃdhān mahāśokāmāṃsagaṃdhāndhaneśvaraḥ ||

kaṭugaṃdhā bhavedrogī viṣṭāgaṃdhā ca niṣphalā |
maṃdyagaṃdhānnirogīsyā durgaṃdhī bhayamādṛśet ||

siddhirnagaṃdhasaṃbhūte sudhā ca vaṇijāyatā |
kṣāragaṃdho tathā nāśopāni gaṃdhā śubhāvahā ||

punaḥ svādaṃ vadivyāmi śubhāśubhagataṃ tu va |
āmlāvighnī tathā bhūmiḥ kaṣāyā hi nirogitāṃ ||

lavaṇena mahānāśotiktenāpi nijo ripuḥ |
viśeṣaḥ svādamāsādya maṃtrī tasyāni rūpyate ||

bhūme parigrahaṃ kuryādyā vadāyatanaṃ bhavet |
śalyādi śodhanaṃ kuryāttuṣāṃgārādi dūrayet ||

śarkalā yatra vidyaṃte kleśo bhavati mānavaḥ |
aṃgāreṇa tathā rogā lohanāyāsa jāyate ||

<p. 25a>

dagdhādinā ca kāṣṭena rājabhītiḥ prajāyate |
tṛṇena jāyate śokaḥ iṣṭakeṇā sthirī bhavet ||

vetaśāvaṃdha vairvyāptaṃ vaṃśena maraṇaṃ bhavet |
viṣṭayā vaṃdhanaṃ prāptaṃ śūnyabhāṇḍena śunyatā ||

carmaṇā kalahaṃ vidyāt karpaṭe dhananāśanaṃ |
asthināṃ ca bhavenmṛtyumasthinā jñāyate bhuvi ||

mṛttikā snigdhapatraṃ ca yaḥ sa bhāgabhavennaraḥ |
vālukā yatra vidyaṃte tatra vidyā mahāsukhī ||

pāṣāṇaṃ ca mahābhāgī sphāṭikā niḥśriyo bhavet |
maṇināroganāśaśca hiraṇyairddhanavānbhavet ||

viśeṣajaṃ tu savare pravakṣyehaṃ śubhāśubhaṃ |
urageṇāsthirābhūmirmaṇḍūkena dhanāgame ||

pippalīkā bhavecchokā mukhakairdhānyavardhayet |
chuchuṃdarī mahānāśo kaumyeṇa dhanavān bhavet ||

śalabhairogitāṃ yāṃti pataṃgeṇa mahābhayaṃ |
hidiṃgikā mahātrāsovicchikaṃ maraṇaṃ dhruvaṃ ||

gṛhagodhau mahāsiddhiḥ kṛkalādbhayanāśane |
evamādīni jaṃtūnāṃ śubhena śubhadā bhavet ||

aśubhenāśubhaṃ vidyā jaṃtūnāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ |
bhūmistu khananāchodhyā sveṣṭakuṇḍādi karmaṇi ||

khanyamāne jalaṃ yāvacchalya doṣo vinaśyati |
dūre yatra sthiraṃ vāriḥ khanituṃ naiva śakyate ||

paṃcahastaṃ ca kātavyaṃ śalyadoṣopaśāṃtaye |
asthikīṭāṃgāramalādikahīnaṃ śubhāvahaṃ ||

anyathātaṃ mṛdaṃ tyaktvā pūrayeccha bhayāmṛdā |
grāmād vahisthayā tatra viprādyaiḥ svasvavarṇayā ||

śalyoddhāraṃ tataḥ kṛtvā pūrayet su samaṃ yathā |
etadakaraṇe maṃtrī na kiṃcit phalamāpnuyāt ||

evaṃ saṃkṣepataḥ proktaḥ śalyoddhāra kramo mayā |
evaṃ viśodhyatāṃ bhūmiṃ kāryādvāstu prapūjanaṃ ||

smārtā ca tāṃtrikī cetidvividhāsannigadyate |
carasthira prabhede ca dvidhā vāstuḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

gṛhaprāsāda kūpānāṃ maṇḍapasya jalasya ca |
apareṣvapi kāryeṣu yoga homādikeṣu ca ||

tūtane vigrahe kāryon yathā mahadupadravā ||

atha vāstu puruṣotpattiḥ ||

vāstunāmāpurā kaścida surobhūn mahābalaḥ |
trailokyaṃ nirjitaṃ tena tripaṃcāśacca devatāḥ ||

yeraṇe saṃmukhe jātāstena teti nipīḍitāḥ |
punaḥ punarjitā yuddhe sa evāsit prajāpatiḥ ||

divyavarṣa sahasrāṃte devāḥ śaraṇamāgatāḥ |
viṣṇormamāti pārvatyā deveṃdreṇāpitacchrutaṃ ||

<p. 25b>

yoddhukāmaḥ sobhyadhāvantāradena pracoditaḥ |
kṛtaṃ yuddhaṃ tena sārddha mallābhirvarṣapaṃcakaṃ ||

tato daityo madotsikto viṣṇumāyā vimohitaḥ |
uvāca vacanaṃ tuṣṭo vrīyatāṃ vrīyatāmiti ||

nendreṇa na kubereṇa mamatoṣakaraṃkṛtaṃ |
sasainyenāpitadyuddhaṃ tvayā tu jaṭilena hi ||

kṛtaṃ viṣṇusahāyena pārvatyarddhīgadhāriṇā |
tenāhaṃ tuṣṭi māpannastrailokya parameśvaraḥ ||

adeyaṃ nāsti me kiṃcidyāvayaṃ tu trayopi ca |
ityākarṇya vacastasya śivayorbhrūḥ pracoditaḥ ||

hariḥ prāhamahādhanyadaityendratvatsamostikaḥ |
satyaṃ trivākyaṃ kuruṣu tadā vācyo ca romayā ||

śivenāpi ca pārvatyā eka evā paro na hi |
triṣu vā ca tadā daityastadā viṣṇurvyatijñipat ||

yathāte tvaritaṃ mṛtyuḥ sa upāyaḥ pradarśyatāṃ | 
viṣṇoḥ chalamiti jñātvā daityeṃdraḥ samabhāṣataḥ ||

avaśyameva gaṃtavyaṃ sa vaiḥ kālamukhehare |
tathāpi svapratijñārthaṃ yogacchati sa jīvati ||

paraṃ tvekonamevaṃ śayaiścamat sevanaṃ kṛtaṃ |
tasya mārgaṃ darśayitvā deho yaṃti papātyatāṃ ||

kāle tasmiṃśca bhodevā vāgravā cāśarīriṇī |
daityeṃdra kurumāśokaṃ bhūmerjanmatavā bhavet ||

tatraiva tvaṃ layaṃ yā hitvattoṣārthaṃ varaṃ śṛṇu |
ye varṇāḥ svasya bhogārthaṃ kariṣyaṃti navaṃ gṛhaṃ ||

tatra tvadutsavamṛte nānāduḥkhairupahutāḥ |
kālakarṇyādikā dāsyo vināyaka mukhāścate ||

sevakāpīḍayiṣyaṃti ityājñāpa rāmeśvarī |
ityākarṇyavayaḥ sopi gataṃ kṛtvā mahītale ||

praviveśa tato devairmat pāṣāṇaiḥ prapūritaṃ |
ye naye nirjitā devāḥ punarudgamasaṃkayā ||

tasyorddhaṃ tu tripaṃcāśannivāsaṃ ca kurudyatāḥ |
mūrddhavyagni samādiṣṭo mukhe cāpaḥ samāśritaḥ ||

pṛthvīdharorvyamā caiva talasthānamadhisthitau |
vakṣasthale cāpa vatsuḥ pūjanīyaḥ sadābudhaiḥ ||

netrayorditimajjanyauthotrerditi jayaṃtakau |
sarpeṃdrauskaṃdhasaṃsthaut pūjanīyau prayatnataḥ ||

satyarogādayastadvadvāhya paṃca ca paṃca ca |
rudreśvarājayakṣmā ca vāmahaste samasthitaḥ ||

sāvitraḥ savitā tadvaddhaste dakṣiṇamāstitau |
vivasthānatha mitraśca jaṭharesaṃ vyavasthitau ||

<p. 26a>

pūṣā ca pāpayakṣmā ca hastayormaṇibaṃdhake |
tathaivā suraśeṣau ca vāmapārśve samāsthitau ||

pārśve tu dakṣiṇe tadvadvitathaḥ sagṛhakṣataḥ |
uccāryamā vubhau jñeyau jāṃghvo gaṃdharva puṣpakau ||

jaṃghayorbhṛṃga sugrīvausphiddhasthau dauvārikau mṛgaḥ |
jayaśakau tathā meḍhrapādayoḥ pitarastathā ||

madhyena ca pado brahmā hṛdaye sa tu pūjyate |
tasmāda vaśyaṃte pūgṛhavā sa mukhecchayā ||

śṛṇvaṃ tu tadvidhiṃ devā vāmadakṣiṇamārgataḥ |
bhadrabhūmi praśodhyaṃte daśadaṇḍa samālikhet ||

adhodhautiryakādau ca tenekāśihikoṣṭakaṃ |
vāstu maṇḍalakaṃ kāryamaṣṭahastaṃ tu nāparaṃ ||

ekāśīti padaṃ cakraṃ vaidikastatra devatāḥ |
madhyakoṣṭeṣu nava sutvādau brahmāṇamarcayet ||

apavatsaṃ tadīśāne prāgaryannaṃ trikoṣṭake |
āgneya savitāraṃ ca vivasvaṃta mayāktiṣu ||

indraṃ nairṛtya digbhāge mitraṃ paścimagaṃ triṣu |
vāyavye rājayakṣmāṇaṃ sumeruṃ cottaratraye ||

vaidakoṣṭheṣu vaiśyanyāmīśakoṇācca devatāḥ |
śikhīparyaṇa śrāpaścaditiḥ proktoṣṭhayordvayoḥ ||

kramādete paṃcadevāḥ jñātavyāḥ savyamārgataḥ |
jayaṃtendroḥ sūryasatyabhṛṃgā āgneyakoṇake ||

aṃtarīkṣaṃ tathā vātaḥ pūṣā sāvitra eva ca |
catuṣka īśato devāstato dakṣiṇa paṃcake ||

yugme kramā ca vitatho bṛhatkṣatayamo yathā |
gaṃdharvo bhṛṃgarājaśca nair(-)ṛtīstha catuṣkake ||

īśānato jayanṛpau pitṛdau vārikau tathā |
tataḥ paścādvike paṃcamugrīva puṣpadaṃtakaḥ ||

varuṇā suraśeṣāśca vāyavye īśatastva hi |
rudraśca pāpayakṣmāśca rogaścottara paṃcasu ||

saravyau bhallāṭa somau ca bhujaścāditistathā |
devā ete paṃcacatvāriṃśadarvāśca bhaktitaḥ ||

uktānamiti devānāṃ padānyāpūryapaṃcabhiḥ |
madhye padānāṃ navakaṃ mārjayitvā prapūrayet ||

sitena rajasā bhūyastaddikṣu catasṛṣvapi |
ṣaṭkaṃ saṃsājya rajasā raktena paripūrayet ||

śiṣṭhāni ca padānyatra yathāsthānaṃ prakalpayet |
vicitrāṇi tato madhye brahmāṇaṃ saṃprapūrayet ||

rathobhistadyatho tebhyaḥ pāyasānnairvaliṃ haret |
pāyasairmadhuraiḥ sarvān saṃyajenmadhurānvitaiḥ ||

tattaddravyaivāmatimān pūjayeddoṣaśāṃtaye |
pāṣāṇe pratimāyāṃvā vāstopateḥ pratijāni ||

iti vaidika maṃtreṇa tasyā vāhana pūjanaṃ |
nāmamaṃtreṇa cānyeṣāṃ pūjāṃ kṛtvā prapūrayet ||

atha tāṃtrika mārge tu catuḥ ṣaṣṭipade tathā |
koṇayoḥ sūtrayugalaṃ madhye brahmāṇa nirccayet ||

<p. 26b>

catuḥkoṣṭheṣu tatpūrvādyāsu koṣṭha dvikedvithike |
āryakaṃ ca vivasvaṃtaṃ mitramanyaṃ mahīdharaṃ ||

sāvitraḥ savitāśakra induttidrudratarjayau |
ayāyavatsakauceti śaivyāḥ koṇārddhakoṣṭayoḥ ||

sarvaṃ grahaścāryamāṇaṃ bhaṃjakaṃ pilipicchakaṃ |
carakiṃ ca vidārīṃ ca pūtanā pūrvato dvayoḥ ||

īśānaścārthaparjanyojayaṃtaḥ śakrabhāskarau |
saṃvyovṛṣoṃtarīkṣaśca pūrvāśākoṣṭagāstathā ||

agniḥ pūṣā ca vitathoyamotha gṛharakṣakaḥ |
gaṃdharvo bhṛṃgarājaśca mṛgodakṣiṇadiggatāḥ ||

nair(-)ṛtiśca tathā dauvārikaḥ sugrīvakastathā |
varuṇaḥ puṣpadaṃtaścāsuraḥ sopākhyarogakau ||

paścādathottare vāyurnāgo mukhyastataḥ paraṃ |
somabhallāḍhārgalākhyā aditirditiruttare ||

brahmasthānaṃ raktavarṇairdiśaḥ pītairvidiksitaiḥ |
tato diśastu haritairvidiśaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇakaiḥ ||

aruṇaḥ paridhiḥ kāryaḥ suṃdaraṃ maṇḍalaṃ bhavet |
uktānāṃ sarvadevānāṃ svarūpaṃ ca nigadyate ||

akṣamālāṃ varaṃ dakṣe vāme daṇḍa kamaṇḍalu |
dadhānamaṣṭa nayanaṃ yajenmadhyembujāsanaṃ ||

sarve caturbhujādevā vāstudehe vyavasthitāḥ ||

atha vāstu dhyānaṃ |

ākuṃcitakaraṃ vāstumuttānamasurākṛtiṃ |
smaren pūjāsu kudryādiniveśetva dharānanaṃ ||

jānunī kūrparāśakte diśivāta hutāśayoḥ |
yaidryāpādapraḍhau raudryāṃ śirosya hṛdayāṃjaliḥ ||

kṛtāṃjalipuṭā ūrddhve khaḍgakheṭakapātayaḥ |
brahmāṇaṃ sannirīkṣyeta tadvaktrābhimukhāścate ||

svasvasthāna sthitāścaiva sādhāraṇamudāhṛtaṃ |
marīciḥ śvetavarṇaḥ syādvivasvā ekavarṇakaḥ ||

śātakuṃbhenibhomitraḥ kṛṣṇavarṇastu bhūdharaḥ |
savittīnīlavarṇābhaḥ sāvitro dhūmavigrahaḥ ||

iṃdraścāruṇa varṇābhaḥ śuklaścendra jayastathā |
rudraḥ pravāla sadṛśaḥ pīto rudrajayastathā ||

āpo gokṣīradhavalaḥ āpavatsojavādyutiḥ |
īśānaḥ kṣīradhavalaḥ parjanyāṃ janasannibhaḥ ||

jayaṃto janasaṃkāśo maheṃdraścāmaladyutiḥ |
ādityo raktavarṇaḥ syāt satyakaścitravarṇakaḥ ||

vṛṣo vaṃdhūka puṣpābhaḥ kuṃdābhaścāṃtarīkṣakaḥ |
udyaddinakarābhogniḥ pūṣālaktāktasannibhaḥ ||

<p. 27a>

vitathaśceṃdra cāpābho vidyudvarṇo gṛhakṣataḥ |
yamaścāṃ jana saṃkāśo gaṃdharvaḥ padmarāgavat || 

bhṛṃgarājastu bhṛṃmābhomṛgojīmūtasannibhaḥ |
nir(-)ṛtiḥ pāvakākṣaścapīto dauvārikasmṛtaḥ ||

sugrīva nīlakaṇṭhābhaścaṃdrābhaḥ puṣpadaṃtakaḥ |
varuṇaḥ sphaṭikābhaśca bhṛṃgābhaścāvaromaromataḥ ||

śeṣāścotpala saṃkāśo rogaścaiveṃdra nīlavat |
vāyuḥ kṛṣṇātravarṇaḥ syurnnāgaḥ śaṃkhendusannibhaḥ ||

mukhyā mauktikasaṃkāśo bhallāṭa śvetapadmavat |
somaḥ sphaṭika saṃkāśo'rgaloraktotyalaghutiḥ ||

diti kuṃdeṃdu dhavalā kapilā aditiḥ smṛtāḥ |
carakī śaṃkhasadṛśī vidārī pāvakādyutiḥ ||

pūtanā hima saṃkośo meghābhāpilapicchakī |
khaḍgaṃ ca pāśapātraṃ ca churikāṃ kartakāṃ tathā ||

dadhānā bhīmarūpāstārākṣasya parikīrtitāḥ |
sitāraktaśca pītaśca kṛṣṇaḥ skaṃdādikā grahāḥ ||

vajraṃ śaktiṃ ca khaḍgaṃ ca pāśaṃ ca vikṛtānatā |
dadhānābhīṣaṇāḥ proktā grahāḥ skaṃdādi kāścate ||

homādikaṃ tathā kuryāt svaiḥ svaiścāhutimādadet |
vrīhimuṅgayavaiḥ kṣaudraḥ ghṛtadugdhaplutaiḥ kramāt ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ cāṣṭottara viṃśatimeva vā |
pratyekaṃ tairhuneddravyairmaṃtraistadvacca pāyasaiḥ ||

valiṃ ca teṣāṃ kurvīta pāyasairvyaṃjanātvitaiḥ |
sasitairdugdhakadalīphalāpupādisaṃyutaiḥ ||

valivadāya yet pūrvaṃ pūjayet sādhakastataḥ |
annādibhiśca saṃyuktaṃ māṣabhaktyādi maṇḍitaṃ ||

gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ brahman vāstudoṣaṃ praṇāśayaḥ |
gaṃdhādi śarkarāpūpapāyaso parisaṃyutaṃ ||

āryakākhya gṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya |
caṃdanādyarcitanāthaḥ karpūrā gurumaṇḍite ||

vivasvadvai gṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya |
saguḍaṃpāyasaṃ nātha puṣpādi susamanvitaṃ ||

gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ mitraśāṃtiṃ prayacchame |
māṣodanaṃ samāṃse ca gaṃdhādikṣīra saṃyutaṃ ||

gṛhāṇemaṃ mahībhṛtvaṃ sarvadoṣa praṇāśaya |
evaṃ madhye tu saṃpūjya īśānādi valiṃ haret ||

puṣpādi kuśakanīyaṃ śarkarā guru vā sitaṃ |
sāvitra vai gṛhāṇemaṃ śāṃtimāśuprayacchame ||

<p. 27b>

piṣṭakaṃ saguḍaṃ nāthaṃ raktagaṃdhādi śobhitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ sūrya vighnamāśu praṇāśayaḥ ||

śītamatraṃ tathā puṣpaṃ kuṃkumādi samanvitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ śakradeva namostute ||

odanaṃ ghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ vastragaṃdhādi maṃḍitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyamiṃdra jananamostute ||

pakvāpakvamidaṃ māṃsaṃ vastrapuṣpādi saṃyutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyarudradeva namomyahaṃ ||

samāṃ saghṛta saṃpakvagaṃdhapuṣpādi saṃyutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ rudrajayasvasti namostute ||

kṣīrakhaṇḍa samāyuktaṃ puṣpādibhiralaṃkṛtaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyamāpaśāṃtiṃ prayacchame ||

dadhidaṃguḍasaṃmiśraṃgaṃdhādibhiḥ susaṃyutaṃ |
gṛhāṇe valiṃ vatsa vighnametvaṃ pranāśaya ||

saghṛtaṃ māṣabhaktaṃ ca raktagaṃdhādi saṃyutaṃ |
baliṃ gṛhāṇa sarvatvaṃ rakṣavighnaṃ vināśayaḥ ||

māsaṃ puṣpādi saṃyuktaṃ māsabhaktopasaṃyutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ skaṃdarakṣavighnaṃ vināśaya ||

svamāṃsaṃ piṣṭakairyuktaṃ pakvamāṃsodakānvitaṃ |
aryaman vai gṛhāṇemaṃ sarvavighnaṃ vināśaya ||

raktamaṃsodanaṃ matsyagaṃdha dhūpasamanvitaṃ |
jaṃbhakatvaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣavighnaṃ vināśaya ||

chāgakarṇānvitaṃ māṃsaṃ vastragaṃdhādi saṃyutaṃ |
pilipiccha gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣavighnaṃ vināśaya ||

ghṛtena sādhitaṃ māṃsaṃ vastragaṃdhādi saṃyutaṃ |
carakitvaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣavighnaṃ vināśaya ||

raktapuṣpaṃ samāsaṃ vai raktavastrādi saṃyutaṃ |
vidāri vai gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣavipraṃ vināśaya ||

pittaraktāsthitaṃ yuktaṃ raktagaṃdhādimaṃḍitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ pūtanatvaṃ rakṣavighnaṃ vināśaya ||

saghṛtaṃ cākṣataṃ puṣpavastra gaṃdhādyalaṃ kṛtaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ tvīśa vāstudoṣapahārakaḥ ||

utpalaṃ pāyasairyuktaṃ vastrādika samanvitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ devarāja namostute ||

paṃcahastaṃ supītaṃ ca dhvajaṃ saṃkādimaṇḍitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃtiṣṇusuta namostute ||

odanaṃ ghṛtasaṃpūrṇaṃ paṃca (*)(*) (?) di maṇḍitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ devarāja namostute ||

raktapuṣpayutaṃ bhaktaṃ raktagaṃdhādibhiryutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ megharāja namostute ||

vitānaṃ dhūmravarṇābhaṃ gaṃdhādi suśobhitaṃ |
raktayuktaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ satya namostute ||

<p. 28a>

idaṃ tu māṃsa bhaktaṃ vai vastragaṃdhādi pūjitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ vṛṣa valiṃ vāstudoṣaṃ vināśaya ||

idaṃ śārdūla māṃsaṃ tu naivedyādi susaṃyutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ vyomaśāṃtiṃ prayachame ||

suvarṇaṃ piṣṭakaṃ cātha vastragaṃdhādibhiryutaṃ |
ghṛtānvitaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ saptajihvanamostute ||

kṣīraṃ lājā samāyuktaṃ gaṃdhapuṣpādi saṃyutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ pūṣadeva namostute ||

māṃsaudanaṃ gaṃdhamālyayutaṃ vastrādibhūṣitaṃ |
vitathena valiṃ gṛhna vāstudoṣaṃ vināśaya ||

matsyamāṃ sa yutaṃ bhaktaṃ gaṃdhapuṣpādyalaṃkṛtaṃ |
yamarāja gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ śāṃtiṃ prayacchame ||

pakvamāṃsaudana navanītaṃ vastrādi maṇḍitaṃ |
prītikaraṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ gṛhana rakṣa namostute ||

nānāgaṃdha samāyuktaṃ raktadhūpādibhiryutaṃ |
valiṃ gṛhāṇa gaṃdharva sarvadoṣaṃ pranāśaya ||

imāṃ tu sākunīṃ jihvāṃ māṣabhakto paristhitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ bhṛṃgarājaṃ valiṃ śāṃtiṃ prayacchame ||

evaṃ tilaghṛtoyetaṃ gaṃdhapuṣpādibhiryutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ mṛgadev anamostute ||

śarkarāmaṇḍitaṃ khaṇḍaṃ vastragaṃdhādyalaṃkṛtaṃ |
prītovaliṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣarāja namostute ||

caṃdanā gurukākhaṇḍa vastragaṃdhādibhiryutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ dauvārikaṃ namostute ||

idaṃ tu pāyasaṃ nātha gaṃdhapuṣpādi miśritaṃ |
sugrīva vai gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ śāṃtiṃ prayacchame ||

yavāgvalaṃ kṛtaṃ dugdhaṃ bhaktoparisamarpitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ jaladeva namostute ||

māṣabhaktaṃ kuśasthaṃ ca ghṛtagaṃdhādi saṃyutaṃ |
puṣpadaṃta gṛhāṇemaṃ vāstudoṣaṃ pranāśaya ||

madhunā sādhitaṃ piṣṭaṃ gaṃdhādyai rūpaśobhitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ roga sarvadoṣa praṇāśaya ||

sa ghṛtaṃ maṇḍakaṃ vedamaṃtrādyairupaśobhitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ mṛgavāhanamostute ||

idaṃ tu kṛśarānnaṃ me dugdhagaṃdhādi sādhitaṃ |
pātāleśa gṛhāṇemaṃ vighnamāśu praṇāśaya ||

nārikelādikaṃ bhaktaṃ pītavastrādi saṃyutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ mukhya vāstudoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

dadhigaṃdhādibhiryuktaṃ pītapuṣpasamanvitaṃ |
valiṃ pragṛhyatāṃ somaḥ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

odanaṃ ghṛta saṃmiśraṃ gaṃdhapuṣpa samanvitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ bhallāṭakanamostute ||

<p. 28b>

māṣānnaṃ tu ghṛtāttyaktuṃ gaṃdhapuṣpādimaṇḍitaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyamargalākhya namostute ||

pālikāṃ madhusaṃmiśrāṃ vastragaṃdhādi saṃyutaṃ |
gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ hṛdyaṃ devamātarnamostute ||

kṣīrakhaṇḍa samāyuktaṃ nānāpūjāpaśobhitaṃ |
daityamātargṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

svargapātāla martyeṣu ye devāvāstu devatāḥ |
gṛhnaṃtvimaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ tuṣṭāyāṃ tu svamaṃdira ||

mātaro būtavetālāye cānye valikāṃkṣiṇaḥ |
viṣṇoḥ pariṣadāye ca tepi gṛhnaṃtvimaṃ baliṃ ||

pitṛbhyaḥ kṣetrapālebhyo valiṃ datvā prakāmataḥ |
abhāvādukta mārgasya kuśapuṣpādibhiryajet ||

vāstuśeṣa kriyā bhūtaḥ sarvarakṣā vibhūtikṛt |
bhūtaprīti pradaścāsmindiśā balirudīryate ||

dikpāla pariṣat sarvabhūtānuddiśyanāmabhiḥ |
pūjā visarjanāṃtāyatsa vijñeyo diśāṃ valiḥ ||

dadhyaṃvu rajanī yutvā jāsaktuṃ tileṃdhasā |
dravyeṇa vitaredikṣu valiṃ dikku sa yorgataḥ ||

surāṇāṃ tejasāṃ caiva pretānāṃ rākṣasāmapi |
devyā jālānāṃ prāṇānāṃ nakṣatrāṇāṃ ca tatpunaḥ ||

vidyānāmadhipānāṃ ca tānyathoktān valiṃ haret |
sa vāhana pada proktā parivārāya śaktaye ||

tatpārṣadebhyaśca tataḥ sarvebhya iti saṃyutaṃ |
bhūtebhyaśca kramādbhūyaḥ prācyāṃdiśi kṣipedvaliṃ ||

dviṣatpiśācavetālarakṣorakṣārthināmiha |
deśāṃvali viśeṣeṇa sarvasaṃpat samṛddhidāṃ ||

devī devaviśeṣāṇi karme kṛtvā su maṃtriṇā |
mahāvali pradānena prasṛte desamaṇḍale ||

kuchālaṃ cāstramaṃtreṇa pūjayet parameśvarī |
khanitaḥ puruṣāyāpi dāpayed dakṣiṇādibhiḥ ||

hīnāṃgavarjanīya ca avatyāṃ caiva varjayet |
tatkṣaṇānmṛttikāṃ bhūmivasudhoddṛtya pūjayet ||

dvibhujepītta dehastu jagadhārikaṃ jāsamaḥ |
viśvakarmāgadāsauyājñānamudrākṣa sūtrabhṛt ||

viśvakarma jagadvyāpi saṃsāra sṛṣṭikārakaḥ |
atra kudālahastatvaṃ viśvakarmā namostute ||

ekāśīkoṣṭha nirbheda cāstau viśvātmakarmakaḥ |
kuddāra gṛhatāṃ maṃtrakhananaṃ kuru sāṃprataṃ ||

bhadramuhūrtamāśritya khanyate vāstu koṣṭake |
svarṇakuddāra rūpatvaṃ bhūmikhanana karmaṇi ||

viśvakarmāyudhaṃ nityaṃ namostu vāstumūrtaye |
kuddārairdāpayittopi kīṭakoṭi śatairapi ||

<p. 29a>

kṣamyato pṛthivī devī viṣṇusthāpana hetave |
śubhāśubhāni vāstūnāṃ krameṇaiva vadāmyahaṃ ||

kakṣāṃtare ca nityaṃ ca sarvatra bhadramādṛśe |
śīrṣe caiva bhavenmṛtyuḥ vakṣaṃ ca duḥkhabhāgināṃ ||

haste caurabhayaṃ vidyāt urayā paśunāśanaṃ |
jñānau videśagamanaṃ pādābhyāṃ ca nirarthakaṃ ||

vāmadakṣiṇa nityevaṃ vāstukṣetamudīrita |
nipuṇaṃ kārayenmaṃtrī kalyāṇaṃ pauṣṇatāṃ kṛtaṃ ||

samāhita samo bhūtvā khanite vāstukakṣate ||

atha visarjanamaṃtraḥ ||

tato visarjayeddevī devān vāstu prapūjitān |
yāṃ tu devagaṇāḥ sarve pūjāmādāya pārthivīṃ ||

iṣṭakāma prasiddhyarthaṃ punarāgamanāya ca |
ityetat kathitaṃ devī vāstuyāgasya rakṣaṇaṃ ||

sarvapāpaharaṃ caiva sarvakāma prapūrakaṃ |
evāsuraṃ ca vāstūnāṃ prakāreṇāga vāstukaṃ ||

ekāśīti pade koṣṭamīśanair(-)ṛtyamaṇḍalaṃ |
īśeśirastathā pucchaṃ maṇḍalākāra vāstu sa ||

koṣṭhe ca devatā pūjyaṃ madhye brahmā prapūjayet |
bhādrapadādi sarvasyāmāsi māsi trayaṃ trayaṃ ||

digānāmiśamādini ca rataṃ ca vidhīyate |
kanyādi saṃkramaṃ jñātvā digānāṃ ca kramoragāḥ ||

tulāmithunapūrvādirāśvinī kārtike tathā |
evaṃ krameṇa saṃyātā mārgaśīrṣaṃ ca pauṣakaṃ ||

māghamāsāṃtakaṃ cakre dhanūrmakarakuṃbhakaṃ |
mīnameṣa vṛṣau caiva phālguṇaṃ caitrameva ca ||

vaiśākhāṃta kramaṃ jñātvā paścimādiṣu vā kramaṃ |
mithune karkaṭaḥ siṃhau jyeṣṭhāṣāḍhāṃ ca śrāvaṇaṃ ||

evaṃ kramaṃ prabudhyaṃ tanāgānāṃ vāstu saṃkramaṃ |
prayaṃtrayopi māsāni catuṣṭaya diśākrama ||

svapitaṃ vāma pārśvaṃte dvibhujaṃ navabhiḥ phaṇā |
ekāśikoṣṭha cāṃgāni vyāpakaṃ nāgavāstu sa ||

khanitaṃ grīva vāmāgre nipuṇaṃ kārayetsudhīḥ |
evaṃ nāgasya vāstūni jalakārya viśeṣataḥ ||

athavā nirmite gehe vāstu pūjāṃ samārabhet |
nair(-)ṛtyakoṇe gehesyahesya caturasrākṛtiṃ śubhāṃ ||

kṛtvā samatalāṃ bhūmiṃ vitastyuccāṃ ca vedikāṃ |
vistārāyāmato hastamātrāṃ tatra likhedbudhaḥ ||

ekāśīti pade koṣṭhe lekhayecchuchabhumiṣu |
svaiḥ svaiḥ maṃtrastu vāstvādān pūjayet pūrvavat sudhīḥ ||

evaṃ siṃhagate bhānau pūrṇāyāṃ prativatsaraṃ |
svagehe vāstu pūjāṃ yo maṇḍapeṣu samācaret ||

<p. 29b>

navālamaraṇaṃ vyādhi bhūtapretādikāni ca |
na sarpapīḍāmanyonya kalahādya śubhāni ca ||

putrapautra dhanārogya paśudāsī samṛddhibhāk |
arogī vijayīkhyātaściraṃ jīvati tadgṛhe ||

rājaveśmasu sarvatra tathā ca mahiṣī gṛhe |
sacivāmātyasenānībhavaneṣu pure tathā ||

vidadhyāt prativarṣeaṃ tu prokta siddhyai tu deśikaḥ |
na ceduktānyathā rūpaphalaiḥ kleśo niśaṃ bhavet ||

bhairava kṣetrapālānāṃ yoginīnāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
vāmācārairvaliḥ kāryā mahiṣairvāpi kukkuṭaiḥ ||

ārādhitāstu vāmena jāyaṃteti vubhukṣitāḥ |
devatā valimicchaṃti taddhīnaṃ haṃti sādhakaṃ ||

madyamāṃsa pramattāste proktanena pracoditāḥ |
kadācicchubhamicchaṃti tasmāt sadbhinna vāmataḥ ||

kriyatebhyarcanaṃ tāsāṃ ghātastu nikaṭe yataḥ |
śubhaṃ bhavati vā no vādyathā śāstre tathājane ||

yāvanna madyamāṃsāsījanastāvada valolupaḥ |
bhukte tasmin tanmanāḥ syāt kvajapaḥ kvacaṃ devatāḥ ||

madyamāṃsādikatyāgāttasyāvāti niṣevaṇāt |
dṛśyate tulyarūpoyaḥ sa siddhonyastu pātakī ||

evaṃ parīkṣya kartavyā siddhānāmapi saṃgatiḥ |
tatsaṃsargī paṃcamoyamanya saṃgena gaṇyate ||

kālarūpeṇa kalanāgītā gītāgāthāvidheḥ puraḥ |
mayyadhairyādvṛṣo naśyettṛṣṇayādvau vinaśyataḥ ||

dhāturvādāṃ trayaṃ naśyet sarvanāśastu vāmataḥ |
iti saṃciṃtya bhodevāḥ svadharmaḥ śreyase bhavet ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau vāstuyāganirṇayo nāma saptamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 7 ||

vāstu śāṃtiṃ vidhāyaivaṃ sadasadjñāna hetave |
tataḥ samīkṛtāyāṃ tu bhūmaudivasā dhanaṃ caret ||

sūtrakarkaṭakīlāni gṛhītvā ca niśāṃtare |
ādyaṃtaraṃ ca saṃyuktānalikā dhruvavedhiyā ||

yāmyottarāsā tanmadhye keṃdrāvṛttaṃ samālikhet |
rekhāṃ tato vṛttamadhye te makarkāṭakena tu ||

dhanuḥ kuryāttataścāyaṃ tataḥ kuryāddhanuḥ punaḥ |
evaṃ cāpāni ṣaṭ tatra padmaṃ bhavati ṣaḍdalaṃ ||

saumye yāmya trayaṃ kṛtvā datvānāṃ madhyadeśataḥ |
dīrghārekhākṛtā sā tu bhavet pūrvā parābhidhā ||

yāmya paścimayoḥ saumya pūrvayoruparisthayoḥ |
cāpayorarddhagaṃ sūtramīśānīrākṣasī bhavet ||

<p. 30a>

anyayoścā payorevamāgneyo vāyavī bhavet |
vidiktaṃ sthāni sūtrāṇi samānyeva hi vṛttataḥ ||

yatheṣṭaṃ vahirānīyanikhanet tatra kīlakān |
vaddhaṃ caturṇāṃ kīlānāṃ mastake dṛḍhasūtrakaṃ ||

samakarṇaṃdigaṃkaṃ tacchuddaṃ syāccaturasrakaṃ |
gaṇeśaṃ pūjayitvādau puṇyāhaṃ vācayet sudhīḥ ||

tataḥ paṃcavinānaiśca maṃḍapaṃ racayecchubhaṃ |
maṇḍapaṃ kuladīkṣāyāṃ kuryādviṃśati hastakaṃ ||

madyamāṃsapuraṃdhrīṇāṃ samāveśo yathā bhavet |
maṃḍapoṣṭā daśakalaḥ siddhāṃte vāmamārgake ||

alpatvāt tatra kuṇḍānāṃ madhikepi sa paṃcake |
vaidikya vahusāmāgryāṃ navakuṃḍe tu ṣoḍaśaḥ ||

kuṃḍālpatāyāṃ sāmagryāmalpayācendrahastakaḥ |
dakṣiṇe vahu sāmagryāṃ sūryahastaṃ tu maṃḍapaḥ ||

alpāyāṃ daśahastaḥ syānnavahastaḥ sadāviśāṃ |
śūdrāṇāṃ saptahastaḥ syācchaṃkarāṇāṃ tu paṃca ca ||

proktaṃ mānaṃ maṃḍapānāṃ sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ |
proktā nānāvidhā hastāstannirṇayamatha śṛṇu ||

yasmindeśe ca kāle ca sapmutpanno yathā yavā |
teṣāmaṣṭādarārṇāsyādaṃgulaṃ tu dvijanmanāṃ ||

samodaraistu śūdrāṇāṃ saṃkarādau tathā rasaiḥ |
avaidikasya viprāderetatsaṃkhyākaśālibhiḥ ||

yatra kartā svayaṃ tatra māname tadanyatonyathā |
ācarya dakṣiṇakare madhyamāṃguli madhyamaṃ ||

parvaṇāraṃtaraṃ dīrghaṃ mātrāṃgulamudāhṛtaṃ |
ucchrāya pratimāyāśca prāsāde (*)(?) stu nirmitiḥ ||

vedikāpīṭha śivikārathādye tatpramāṇataḥ |
vināṃguṣṭhena śeṣābhirmuṣṭiraṃgulibhiḥ kṛtaḥ ||

caturdhā vibhajedekobhāgo muṣṭāṃgulaṃ tu tat |
homāṃgāni śruvādīni kuṇḍasthaṇḍila vedikāḥ ||

yajñopavītamauṃjāḍhyaṃ kuryān muṣṭyaṃgulena tu |
yaṃ kaṃ citpauruṣāyāmaṃ vibhajya daśadhā punaḥ ||

evaṃ dvādaśabhāgaṃ tu kṛtvā teṣṭe kamaṇḍaluṃ |
dehalabdhāṃgulaṃ nāmajānīyāttasya tatpunaḥ ||

ebhiścaturviṃśatibhirhastaḥ syādaṃgulaiḥ punaḥ |
anena pratimāṃgāni satapunmānmeva ca ||

narāṇāṃ cāpi nārīṇāṃ kuryādgopyaṃ prakāśitaṃ |
caturdaśakaraṃ koṭi home saṃpatti saṃyutaṃ ||

anyathā dvādaśakaraṃ rakṣahome tu diktaraṃ |
maṇḍapaṃ navadhā kṛtvā madhyabhāgasyavedikā ||

<p. 30b>

staṃbhāstuvedikākoṇe maṃḍapādhau sthitā vahiḥ |
paṃcamāṃ sanyasedbhūmaupuṣṭatāsāṃśa sūtrataḥ ||

mastake kalaśākāraṃ taddśāṃśena kārayet |
svāyāmoccābhavedvedī navakoṣṭhotthasaṃdhiṣu ||

maṃḍapasya tṛtīyāṃśaṃ dīrghānstaṃbhān suvinyaset |
dvādaśaivaṃ tu paṃcāśo bhūmau kūṭaṃ dadyāṃśataḥ ||

madhyastaṃbhasthitaṃ kūṭaṃ mṛdaṃ yābhaṃ prakalpayet |
vāhyastaṃbhorddhato deyā valayodvādaśairbahiḥ ||

dakṣadīkṣāvidhau padmanibhaṃ kūṭaṃ tu kārayet |
tridhāraṃ vāmadīkṣāyāṃ śaṃkhābhaṃ vaiṣṇavemakhe ||

caturasrā catuḥ koṇāvedī sarvaphalapradā |
taḍāgādi pratiṣṭhāyāṃ padminī patrasannibhā ||

rājñāṃ syāt sarvato bhadrā caturbhadrābhiṣecane |
vivādve śrīdharādevī viṃśatyastra samanvitā ||

vāmamārgeṇa dīkṣāyāṃ guptādyastrā tu vedikā |
staṃbhānāmupūristhāpyānya vraṇāni ṛjūni ca ||

ekajātīni kāṣṭhāni vidyāstaṃbhagalenyaset |
nārikeladalairvaśaḥkaṭairācchādayet punaḥ ||

huṃhā māruta vṛṣṭyādi bhavanaḥ syādyathā tathā ||

pūrvoktasaṃsādhita dikṣu kuryādvārāṇi catvāri tu maṇḍapasya |
paṃcāṃśamānā khalu dehalīsyādvi procchite tatra kapādvaśākhe ||

vāmamārgedvāramidaṃ dakṣiṇe śreṣṭhamaṇḍape |
kuryāddohalikāṃ ramyāṃ sāṣṭhāṃgulakaradvayaṃ ||

(*************)
(***)(?) |
(********)(?) viṣamaṃ caturasrakaṃ || 

vitastyāconnavaśikhaṃ dvārastho bhayapārśvayoḥ |
sthāpayet phalakaudvau tu śreṣṭhamadhye kaniṣṭhake ||

maṃḍapetau dīrghatayā kramāt sārddhakaradvayaṃ |
sapāda dvitayaṃ yugmahasta paṃcāṃśakaṃ bhuvi ||

nikhanedagnimīḍeti gāyatryā pārśvayordvayoḥ |
tatsajātīyakāṣṭena tāvadvistāragarbhakaṃ ||

caturasraṃ tu viṣamaṃ dvayorūpani kīlayet |
darbhamālā ca vadhnīyāt pūrvadvāre vidhisvayaṃ ||

evaṃ tu dakṣiṇadvāre tadvāreplakṣakoṣṭhajaṃ |
iṣetvetinyasenmālāṃ vaṃdhayet pūrvakastathā ||

auduṃvaramayaṃ kuryāt paścimadvāratastvidaṃ |
agnenyā yā hi maṃtreṇa plekṣajaṃ vaidikemakhe ||

prāgvadevaṃ prakurvīta vaṭavṛkṣamayaṃ tathā |
śannodevīti maṃtreṇa saumyadigdvārato nyaset ||

teṣāmuparitiryaksthaḥ kāṣṭhānāṃ madhyato vilaṃ |
kṛtvā toraṇa jātīya koṣṭhe caracayechuddhaṃ ||

<p. 31a>

śreṣṭha madhye jaghanyeṣu śaivayāge triśūlakaṃ |
viśveśagoṃgulaṃ dīrghaṃ taccaturthośa vistṛtaṃ ||

vaiṣṇave dvādaśāṃśe nā śaṃkhacakragadāṃvujaṃ |
prāgādi kramayogena nyaset sauropi vaiṣṇavaḥ ||

ṛjuvai madhyamaṃ śṛṃgaṃ kiṃcidvaktraṃ tu pārśvayoḥ |
evaṃ śūlo gaṇapatiḥ śivādyāḥ śivavatmatāḥ ||

tatastu maṃḍapaḥ syāgre bhūmbūrddhvaṃ daśahastakaṃ |
bhūmau karadvayaṃ vaṃśaḥ svacchavastrā ca guṃṭhitaḥ ||

vistṛtaścaika hastena dīrghaḥ paṃcakarairddhvajaḥ |
maṃtradevaṃ likhet tatra sāyudhaṃ ca savāhanaṃ ||

ghaṃṭācāmarasaṃyuktaṃ devatāvarṇavarṇakaṃ |
sthāpayitvā dhvajaṃ paścād daśadikṣu prakalpayet ||

digīśānāṃ patākāśca dhvajasyārddha pramāṇataḥ |
vedokta tattanmaṃtreṇa tattadvarṇāśca taddiśi ||

trātāramiṃdramiti ca pītavarṇāharediśi |
āgneyyā piṃgalātvanno agnervaruṇa maṃtrataḥ ||

sugaṃdhapaṃthā manunā kṛṣṇavarṇātvayā smṛtā |
asutvaṃtepi manunā nair(-)ṛtyāṃ dhūmravarṇikā ||

tatvāyāti brahmaṇeti vāruṇyāṃsita varṇikā |
ānomiyudbhiriti ca vāyavyāṃ haritā bhavet ||

vayaḥ somavrata iti saumyāyāṃ caṃdravarṇikā |
tamīśānamitīśānyāmativiśvetāpatākikā ||

īśāna pūrvayormadhye śeṣaraktapatākinaṃ |
toyanair(-)ṛtya madhye tu vidhiṃ raktapatākinaṃ ||

vāmamārge vedamaṃtro vajrapāta samaḥ smṛtaḥ |
brahmaṇānāṃ vāmamārgo narakāyaiva jāyate ||

maṃtrābhāvenāma maṃtrān praṇavādyāṃchataṃtakān |
pathe dakṣiṇamārge tu vāme praṇava varjitān ||

maṇḍapo parivadhnīyādatiśvetaṃ vitānakaṃ |
alaṃkuryāt puṣpamālādibhirenaṃ tu veṣṭayet ||

āmrāśvattha dalotpannāyuktayā dīrghamālayā |
staṃbhādukulasaṃveṣṭya madhye kuryācca vedikāṃ ||

iṣṭikābhira pakvābhirhastavistṛti piṇḍakāṃ |
maṇḍapāyāma rudrāṃśa (***)(?) pteṣu rāmakaiḥ ||

aśaiḥ samunnatāṃ vāpi mānamasya vilokya ca |
sāmagryādessamāveśo yathā syāditi maṇḍapaḥ ||

ayutāhuti homastu vidheyaḥ sthaṇḍilopari |
ekahastamitaṃ kuṇḍaṃ daśarakṣāvadhi smṛtaṃ ||

lakṣāṇāṃ daśarenaikaṃ hastahastaṃ vivarddhayet |
daśahastaṃ koṭihomevaidikānāmitīritaṃ ||

<p. 31b>

madyamāṃsādi homastu kuṇḍa eva vidhīyate |
paṃcāśat pramite home prakoṣṭakṛta muṣṭikaṃ ||

kuṇḍasyamānaṃ bhavati śateratni samaṃ bhavet |
sahasraṃ hastamātre syāt dvihastamayutemataṃ ||

caturhastamitaṃ lakṣe ṣaḍdalaṃ daśalakṣake |
koṭi homecāṣṭahastaṃ kuṇḍaṃ vāmairvidhīyate ||

ekakuṇḍavidhāne tu caturasraṃ vidhīyate |
brāhmaṇānāṃ viśeṣeṇa staṃbhane cāpi pūrvataṃ ||

navavidhāne tu vahnibhāge bhagākṛtiḥ |
bhogārthaṃ cāpi putrārthaṃ vāsinā caturasravat ||

arddhacaṃdranibhaṃvānya vaiśyānāṃ sarvakarmaṇi |
anyeṣāṃ māraṇe proktaṃ catuḥkuṇḍe tatheṣyati ||

trikoṇakuṇḍaṃ nair(-)ṛtyaṃ ripughātakaraṃ smṛtaṃ |
vidveṣakārayāṃ caitachūdrāṇāṃ ca viśiṣyate ||

vṛttaṃ mukhyaṃ kṣatriyāṇāṃ sarveṣāṃ śāṃti karmaṇi |
paścimāyāṃ tu tatkāryaṃ vauddhārīṇāṃ ca siddhidaṃ ||

ṣaṭkoṇa muccāṭayati chedeṣu ca viśiṣyate |
vāyavyāṃ kārayet tacca saṃkarāṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

udīcyāṃ pauṣṭike padmaṃ vṛṣṭidaṃ tuṣṭidaṃ tathā |
sarvaprayogeṣṭhanayā paraprītikaraṃ mataṃ ||

aṣṭakoṇaṃ muktikaramaiśānyāṃta vidhīyate |
kārāgṛhāt tathā rogyācciṃtāde mokṣamāpnuyāt ||

aṣṭakuṇḍavidhāne tu kramoyaṃ navakuṇḍake |
navamaṃ caturasraṃ syāt pūrveśā na digaṃtaraṃ ||

vidhāne paṃca kuṃḍānāmīśāne paṃca saṃbhavet |
samakuṇḍavidhāne tu na khāto vedike vahi ||

anyadeka paṃcakoṇamabhicāra vināśanaṃ |
tathānyat saptakoṇaṃ ca kuṃḍabhūta nirkṛtane ||

athādau caturasrasya kuṃḍasya vidhirucyate |
nābhi yoni samāyuktaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ kuṇḍaṃ trimekhalaṃ ||

dvimekhalaṃ tu śūdrāṇā śaṃkarāṇāṃ tu mekhalaṃ |
yāvat kuṇḍasya vistāraḥ khananaṃ tāvadeva hi ||

yāvat kuṃḍamiheṣṭasyāttāvaddiktādhanekṛte |
caturasraṃ samaṃ kuryāt sumakarṇaṃ ca śilpacet ||

ekahastasyayaḥ karṇobhujāste tu karadvayaṃ |
dvihastasya tu karṇasyā trihastabhujasaṃmiti ||

caturhastādike pyevaṃ kaṃṭhaḥ sarvatra bhūsamaṃ |
jinabhāga samāstasya vahiḥ kāryāstu mekhalā ||

dvādaśāṃgu vistārādyot sedhāccaturaṃgulā |
tadurddhamaparādīrghāḥ ṣṭāṃgulātāca dṛccatā ||

<p. 32a>

caturbhiraṃgulairdīrghātāvaduccātadūrddhataḥ |
dairghyāt sūryāṃgulāṃ yonistryaṃśonā vistareṇa tu ||

ekāṃgulocchritāsātu praviṣṭābhyaṃtare tathā |
kuṃbhadvaya samādyuktā cāśvatthadalavanmatā ||

aṃguṣṭha mekhalā yuktā madhye vāhyadhṛtiḥ kṣamā |
yonyāstu paścimebhāge mekhalā tritayā vahi ||

caturasraṃ bhavet pīṭhaṃ kuṇḍaṣaṣṭāṃśa vistṛtaṃ |
tāvaddīrghaṃ tathoccaṃ ca tālaṃ tanmadhyato nayet ||

yoni madhyetha tadvṛttaṃ kuṇḍaṣaṣṭhāṃśamānataḥ |
prāgagnicānya kuṇḍānā proktāyo nirudaṅmukhī ||

śeṣāḥ pūrvamukhāyoni kuṇḍeyoniṃ ca varjayet |
kuṇḍamadhyestha keṃdrā tu kuryāt karkaṭakena tu ||

prasāritenavyāsārka bhāgatulyena tatparaṃ |
ṣaṣṭhāṃśena tu vṛttaṃ syāt pūrvavṛttaṃ tu karṇikā ||

karṇikāgre vāhya vṛttābhyaṃtareṣṭa dalāni tu |
evaṃ ṣaḍaṃgulorccaḥ syānnābhirvedākhamīritaṃ ||

iṣṭasya caturasrasya jināṃśo bhaga ucyate |
sapādaiḥ paṃcabhirbhāgairmadhye sūtraṃ vivardhayet ||

prācyāmatha prakuryācca caturthā caturasrakaṃ |
madhyato bhrāmayet kakāṭakaṃ paścimasaṃsthayoḥ ||

arddhacāpākṛtiṃ rudraṃ vahirdiśyostadagrataḥ |
cihnāṃtaṃ pātayet sūtraṃ hayorapi tadā bhavet ||

aśvatthadalasaṃkāśaṃ yonikuṇḍa mudaṅmukhaṃ |
prāṅmānāścātra kartavyā yonirūpāḥ sumekhalāḥ ||

caturasrīkṛtaṃ kṣetraṃ daśadhāpi bhajedvudhaḥ |
ekamekaṃ tvajedeśamadha ūrddhve ca taṃtravit ||

jyāsūtraṃ pātayedagretanmānāddhāmayet tataḥ |
arddhacaṃdranibhaṃ kuṇḍaṃ ramaṇīyamidaṃ bhavet ||

atra tadyāmya pṛṣṭasyādekaṃ tanmāraṇāya ca |
saumyapṛṣṭaṃ tatonyatra yoniḥ paścimadignatā ||

agraṃ prāktibhuje kāryaṃ laṃvāstulyā trayopi ca |
sāṃtaraṃ sarvataṃtreṣu proktapatra niraṃtaraṃ ||

ekahaste tu hastādyā bhujo bhūddvādaśābdayaḥ |
dvihastadvautrayaṃ paṃcatrihastedyarka bhūmayaḥ ||

caturhastatrayaṃ caṃdraḥ paṃcahaste triśeṣarāḥ |
ṣaḍasredryabdarānāścanagebhyākṛtisāgarā ||

aṣṭahastekṛtā gakṣmādeva viśvāgnaṃyogavi |
vedāti dhṛti yugmāni daśahastabhujā ime ||

vyāsārddhaṃ caturasrasya svasyāṣṭādaśabhāgayuk |
tāvat karkāṭakādvṛttaṃvṛttakuṇḍamihocyate ||

<p. 32b>

racayeccaturasrasyavyāsārddhe nṛpabhāgayuk |
tāvat karkaṭake nāpi kuryādvṛttaṃ manoharaṃ ||

tena karkaṭamānena cihnaṣaṭkaṃ ca pūrvavat |
kṛtvā tatra bhujāndatvā kuṇḍamevaṃ ṣaḍasravat ||

iṣṭasya caturasrasya caturviṃśāṃka kalpanāṃ |
kṛtvā tanmadhyataḥ sūryabhogakarkāṭakena ca ||

vṛttaṃ kuryāt punaḥ sārddhaṃ tithibhāgairdvitīyakaṃ |
digvidikcāṃtarāle ca sūtrāṇyaṣṭau prapātayet ||

tatoṃtarvṛttarekhāyā īśaḥ sūtrāgrasūtrakaḥ |
rekhāṃ nayedvāhyavṛtte pūrvasūtrasya mūrddhani ||

tato dakṣiṇarekhāyāmaṃtarvṛttasya mūrddhani |
tāmānayeddalaṃ tasyādevamaṣṭadalāni ca ||

aṃśavyā sārddhakenāpi yadvṛttaṃ sā tu karṇikā |
tataḥ ṣaḍaṃgavyā sārddhavṛttena tatkeśarāṇi ca ||

vyāsa ṣaṣṭhāṃ samānocca karṇikākeśarāṇi ca |
gurūkta yuktyā nikhanedyathā padmākṛtirbhavet ||

padmākṛtiṃ prakurvīta kaṇṭhamekhalayā saha |
kāryaṃ tathācārukābhiścaturasra samaṃ yathā ||

atheṣṭa caturasrasya vyāsaḥ svadvādaśāṃśayuk |
tenaiva bhrāmayedvṛttaṃ cihnānyatradigaṣṭake ||

kramānnyasettaduparibhujāndadyāt samāniti |
aṣṭāsraṃ jāyate kuṇḍatadvatkaṇṭhaścamekhalā ||

iṣṭasya caturasrasya vyāsārddhasvanagāṃśayuk |
tadvyāsārddhena tat tasyāt tatra cihnāni paṃca tu ||

samabhāgena deyāni teṣu sūtrāṇi dāpayet |
jyārūpāṇi dhanurlopā kuṇḍaṃ paṃcāsrakaṃ bhavet ||

iṣṭasya caturasrasya vyāsārddhaṃ paṃcamāṃśayuk |
bhrāmayettenaṣṭattaṃtu saptādānāṃkanātu tat ||

khyātānyetāni kuṇḍāni tāṃtrike smārtakarmaṇi |
anādhikānyakaṇṭhāni viyonīti śrutīrite ||

ācārya kuṇḍaṃ navamaṃ caturasraṃ tu vedike |
aṣṭāśaktau tu catvāri dikṣu kuṇḍāni tāṃtrike ||

tadaśaktāvekameva caturasraṃ prakalpayet |
śaktyā upāsane vāmapāthyaikaṃ yoni kuṇḍakaṃ ||

amekadoṣadaṃ kuṇḍaṃ mānaṃ nyūnādhikaṃ yadi |
tasmāt samyakparīkṣyedaṃ kartavyaṃ śubhamicchatā ||

khātādhike bhavedrogī hīne dhenudhanakṣayaḥ |
cakrakuṇḍe tu saṃtāpo maraṇacchinnamekhale ||

mekhalārahite śokopyadhikevitta saṃkṣayaḥ |
bhāryā vināśakaṃ kuṇḍaṃ proktayonyā vinā kṛtaṃ || 

<p. 33a>

apatyadhvasanaṃ proktaṃ kuṇḍaṃ yatkaṇṭhavarjitaṃ |
śṛṃgārarahitaṃ yacca kuṇḍaṃ jarjaramekhalaṃ ||

yajamāna vināśāya proccāṭaḥ sphaṭike bhavet |
sūcādhikesu hṛdveṣaḥ sūtrahīne daridratā ||

anāle jaṭhare rogaḥ chidre kuḍetva vācyatāṃ |
yathokta kuṇḍepyutpātādevaṃ jāte phalaṃtvidaṃ ||

ṣaṭvāṇāddhirvahni netramitāḥ syuḥ paṃcamekhalā |
dharmabhede jātibhede vācārya yajamānayoḥ ||

ṣaṣṭīśenāṣṭamāṃśena mekhalā dvitayaṃ mataṃ |
kaulike vāmamārge ca vauddhejaine ca śāvare ||

kuṇḍānāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ proktaṃ sruksruvā lakṣaṇaṃ tataḥ |
prakalpayet sruvaṃ yoge vakṣyamāṇena vartmanā ||

kālaskareṇāmalakī parā śakhadirairapi |
suvarṇarūpya tāmrairvā ayobhirapi kārayet ||

sruksruvautaijasaugrāhyau na kāsyāgra salīsakau |
yajñadārumayo vāpi tāṃtrikau śilpi saṃmatau ||

parṇe vā brahma vṛkṣāderacchidre madhya ucchrite |
dhīparṇī siṃsapākṣīraśākhiṣvekatasaṃ guruḥ ||

gṛhītvā vibhajeddhastamātrāṃ śaṭtriṃśatāpunaḥ |
viṃśatyaṃśairbhaveddaṇḍo vaidikairaṣṭa (***)(?)  ||

ekāṃśenamitaḥ kaṃṭhaḥ saptabhāgamukhaṃ mataṃ |
vedī tryaṃśena vistāraḥ kaṃṭhasya parikīrtitaḥ ||

atra kaṃṭhaḥ samānaḥ syānmukhe mārge prakalpayet |
kaniṣṭhāṃgulamānena sarpiṣo nirgamāya ca ||

vedī madhye vidhātavyo bhāgenaikenakarṇikā |
vidadhīstavahīstasyā ekāṃśenābhito'vaṭaṃ ||

tasya khyātaṃ tribhirbhāgairvṛttamarddhāśato vahiḥ |
aṃśenaikena parito dalāni parikalpayet ||

mekhalā mukhavedyāḥ syānnebhiraddhāśamānataḥ |
daṇḍamūlāgrayoḥ kuṃbhau guṇavedauṃgulaiḥ kramāt ||

daṇḍīyugaṃ yamāṃśaiḥ syāddaṇḍasyānāha īritaḥ |
ṣaḍbhiraṃśaiḥ pṛṣṭhabhāgo vedyākūrmākṛtirbhavet ||

haṃsasya hastino vāpi potriṇo vā likhenmanuṃ |
mukhasya pṛṣṭhabhāge tu saṃproktaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ sucaḥ ||

sauvarṇa sruksruvausyātā saumyakarmaṇi sarvataḥ |
bhavetāmāyasāvetau staṃbhanādiṣu karmasu ||

tadalābhepalāśasya parṇābhyāṃ hūyate haviḥ |
palāśapatre niśchidre ruciresruksruvau matau ||

<p. 33b>

vidadhyādvāśvattha patre saṃkṣipte homakarmaṇi ||

atha sruvalakṣaṇaṃ |

srucaścaturviṃśatibhirbhāgairāracayet sruvaṃ |
dvāviṃśatyā daṇḍamānamaṃśairetasya kīrtitaṃ ||

caturbhiraṃśaisanāhakarṣāhyagrāhitacchiraḥ |
aṃśadvayenanikhaṃ netyaṃke mṛgapadākṛtiḥ ||

daṇḍamūlāgrayorgaṇḍī bhavet kaṃkaṇabhuṣitāḥ |
sruvasyavidhirākhyātaḥ śāstresminmaṃtrasaṃjñake ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau paśupakuṇḍādinirṇayo nāmāṣṭaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 8 ||
athāṃkurārpaṇaṃ ||

pratiṣṭāyāṃ ca dīkṣāyāṃ snāpane cotsave tathā |
saṃprokṣaṇe ca śāṃtyarthaṃ vivāhe mauṃjivaṃdhane ||

sarvamaṃgalakāryeṣu kārayeda kurārpaṇaṃ |
pratiṣṭādi ca sātpūrvaṃ navame saptame dine ||

paṃcame vā tṛtīye vā sadyo vācāṃkurārpaṇaṃ |
puṇyāha ghoṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā brāhmaṇaiḥ sahadeśikaḥ ||

bījāropaṇa karmedaṃ kartavyaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ |
maṃḍapottara digbhāgeśālāṃ pūrvāparāyatāṃ ||

taṃ maṇḍemaṇḍapaṃ kuryādakṣāḥ prāgvaruṇāyataṃ |
vāmyodīcyāṃ yataṃ vāmadīkṣāyāṃ saṃprasaśyate ||

gomayenopaliptāyāṃ bhūmau dakṣetha vāmake |
sa tailataṇḍule naiva sa taila vijayādravaiḥ ||

tatra rekhāḥ paṃcakaradīrghā kāryāstu paṃca ca |
vitastyaṃtaritā rudrarekhā kāryāstathāyatā ||

catvāriṃśat koṣṭhakāḥ syuścaturviṃśati koṣṭhakaiḥ |
brāhmaṇaistatravīthīsyāt purayed raktacūrṇakaiḥ ||

paścāt koṣṭha catuṣkaṃ ca brahmasthānaṃ tadīritaṃ |
āpneya koṣṭhamārabhya īśānnāṃtaṃ prapūrayet ||

pītaraktaśvetakṛṣṇarajñobhiḥ sṛṣṭimārgataḥ |
koṣṭhadvayaṃ tathā vīthī raktenaiva prapūrayet ||

viṣṇusthānaṃ tadagre tu jñeyaṃ koṣṭha catuṣṭayaṃ |
prāgvadrajobhirāpūryatadagrepi ca vīthikā ||

proktaṃ koṣṭha catuṣkayaddudrasthānaṃ tadīritaṃ |
tatpūryaṃ pūrvavadraṃgairāraktaiḥ sarvarekhikāḥ ||

vistāronnati dairghyeṇa hastamātrāstuṃ pālikā |
kāryāḍamarukākārāścatasro viṣṇudaivatāḥ ||

dūrvāmra pallavāśvatthadalopetāśca veṣṭitā |
sūtreṇa viṣṇuḥ sthānasya catuḥkoṣṭhe niveśayet ||

vairavya paṃcamukhyastāḥ kāṣṭajā ṣoḍaśāṃgulaiḥ |
āyāmocchrāya dairghyākhyairyuktā paśyānniveśayet ||

brahmasthāne pallavāṃdi sūtraiḥ prāgvacca yojitāḥ |
pātrāṇi trividhānyāhuskurārpyaṇa karmaṇi ||

pālikāḥ paṃcamukhyaśca śarāvāṃśca catuḥ kramāt |
proktāḥ syusarvatatvajñairharirbrahmaśivātmikā ||

<p. 34a>

eṣāmucchrāyadratneyaḥ ṣoḍaśā dvādaśāṣṭabhiḥ |
aṃgulaiḥ kramaśastāni śubhānyāveṣṭyataṃtunā ||

prakṣālya deśikasteṣu padeṣvāhitaśāliṣu |
sugaṃdhidārbhapuṣpeṣu paścimādi niveśayet ||

pālikā cakravistāraḥ ṣoḍaśāṃgula mucyate |
bhavetkaṃṭhavilaṃ cāsyāt tadaṣṭyaṃgula vistṛtaṃ ||

padepīṭhasya vistāraṃ ṣaḍaṃgulamudāhṛtaṃ |
caturaṃgula utsedhastatsaṃdhiśvāṃgulaṃ bhavet ||

tatsaṃdhestu bhavennābhaṃ padepīṭhārddhameva ca |
bhavet paṃcamukhī caiva ghaṭikā sarvakāmada ||

caturaṃgula vistārāṇyāhurvaktrāṇi paṃcavai |
catvāri ca caturdikṣu ūrddhvamekaṃ yathā vidhiḥ ||

ghaṭikāyāma vistāro dvādaśāṃgula mucyate |
ācāryāḥ kathayatyeke ṣoḍaśāṃgula mucyate ||

ācāryāḥ kathayaṃtyeke ṣoḍaśāṃgulameva ca |
dvādaśāṃgula vistāraṃ śarāvasya mukhaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

caturaṃgula vistāra madhastānmūlamucyate |
sa bhave kanakaṃ rūpyatāmraṃ tomārtikānyapi ||

śaivāḥ śatāvāścatvāro teṣu pātrāṇi vinyaset |
vahnyādīśānaparyaṃtaṃ catuṣkeṣu pṛthak pṛthak ||

prokteṣu teṣu pātreṣu brahmaviṣṇuśivān yajet |
saṃpūjayeccharāveṣu rudracaṃdanapuṣpakaiḥ ||

pālikāmuttathā viṣṇuṃ brahmāṇaṃ ghaṭikāsu ca |
mṛdvālukākarīṣaiścoddhvataḥ pātrāṇi pūrayet ||

brahmādibhiśca kuddālaṃ pūjayitvā dināṃtare |
gītanṛtya samāyuktaṃ gajavāji samanvitaṃ ||

gurvādayorathāruḍhāgajāruḍhāstathā pare |
gatvā tīraṃ taḍāgasya nadyā puṣpaṃ vanasya vā ||

tatra śuddhaṃ bhuvobhāgaṃ darbhaiḥ saṃsṛjya vāstrataḥ |
abhyukṣyacārdyatoyena tattanmaṃtramanusmaran ||

hṛdā bhūmiṃ samāvāhya gaṃdhapuṣpaiḥ samarccayet |
kuddālī maṃtramaṃtreṇa khalvā bhūmimatho mṛdaṃ ||

gṛhītvā vāmadevena pūrayet kāṃsyapātrake |
hṛdāmṛdaṃ ca saṃmṛjya vastreṇācchādya dhārayet ||

puraṃ vā nilayaṃ vāpi sarvamaṃgala niḥsvanaiḥ |
guruḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā maṃḍapatvānayet tataḥ ||

etatkarma divākāle kuryādrātrau na buddhimān |
tataḥ svarṇādike pātre daśabījāni vāpayet ||

vaṁ vījaṃ prajapenmaṃtrī dugdhena kṣālayet tataḥ ||
tāni priyaṃ guhyāmākatilaśarṣapaśālayaḥ ||

muṅjāḍhakī suriṣyā vā khalyomāṣāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
mūlamaṃtrābhijaptāni paṃcaghoṣapuraḥsaraṃ ||

<p. 34b>

āśīrvāgbhirdvijātīnāṃ maṃgalācārapūrvakaṃ |
nirvapatteṣutrāḥ treṣu deśikoyatamānasaḥ ||

bījaṃ mukhyena mūlena prāṅmukho vā gudaṅmukhaḥ |
vāpayet sarvavījāni pālikādiṣṭha tu kramāt ||

bījānāmadhipaḥ somastasmādrātrau tu nirvapet |
bījebhyo daivatebhyaśca sa rātrau kāṃtimān yataḥ ||

tasmādgurustu bījāni niśāyāmeva vāpayet |
skaṃdaṃ priyaṃgau niṣyāca vāyumagniṃ kulutthake ||

āḍhakyāṃ nir(-)ṛtiḥ somaḥ muṅgevaiva svataṃtile |
prajāpatiṃśāli bījetvanaṃtaṃ sarṣayercayet ||

iṃdraṃ śyāme tu māṣe ca varuṇaṃ tu nagātmaje |
somajaṃ pūjayennityamadhi vā sa dināvadhi ||

adhivāsadine prāpte somamudvāsayedguruḥ |
tryaṃvakāya ca śarvāya śaṃkarāya śivāya ca ||

sarvaloka pradhānāya śāśvatāya namo namaḥ |
vikīryānena maṃtreṇa haridrā cūrṇamiśritaṃ ||

toyaṃ pravarṣayetteṣu siṃcettoyairdinaṃ pratiṃ |
haridrābhiḥ samatyajya vastrairācchādyadeśikaḥ ||

valiṃ trividha pātrāṇāṃ dikṣu pūrvāditaḥ kṣipet |
praṇavādyairna mātaiśca rātraurātrīśa nāmabhiḥ ||

bhūtāni pitaro yakṣānāgābrahmāśivohariḥ |
gurupadiṣṭamārgeṇa samyak pātra trayāgataḥ ||

navāhaṃ tu baliṃ dadyāttattaduddiśyadaivataṃ |
saṃdhyayorubhayorarddharātrau cāpi valiṃ haret ||

śālyodanaṃ tilālājāsaktavaḥ prathamedine |
haridrā cūrṇasaṃyukto bhūtebhyoyaṃ valirmataḥ ||

evaṃ dvitīyadivase pitṛbhyastilataṃḍulaiḥ |
tṛtīyasaktavolājā yakṣebhyo dadhi saṃyutāḥ ||

nāgebhyaḥ saktu vasturye nārikelajalaplutāḥ |
dadyāt puṣpākṣata valiṃ paṃcame brahmaṇemudā ||

ṣaṣṭe śivāya cāpūyayuktaṃ bhaktaṃ praśasyate |
guḍaudanaṃ saptamehni viṣṇave vinivedayet ||

viṣṇorevāṣṭamadibhedaddhyodanavaliḥ smṛtaḥ |
kṛśarānnaṃ tu navame viṣṇoreva praśasyate ||

vāmamārge caturdikṣu maṃtrastasya valiṃ caret |
brahmasthāne tu vetālomeṣastasya valinsurā ||

viṣṇusthāne bhairavīsyādajastasyā valirmataḥ |
bhairavastu śivasthāne māhiṣaṃ valimicchati ||

<p. 35a>

gauḍī mādhvī ca yaiṣṭī ca surāstatra kramānmatāḥ |
madyamāṃsaṃ madyayuktaṃ bhūtebhyo valiriṣyate ||

pitṛbhyaḥ sāsavapalaṃ yakṣebhyaḥ kukkuṭomadhu |
bhekoduruvalirnāge vāmamārge valisvayaṃ ||

evaṃ gateṣu navasu divaseṣu vilokayet |
prarūḍhāṇyaṃ kurāṇyanyona vīkṣeta kadācana ||

ācārya eva praviśettacchiṣyovātadājñayā |
yajñamānābhivṛddhyarthamaṃkurāṇi parīkṣayet ||

samyak tasyodgamojātaḥ kiṃnaṣṭaṃ madhyamaṃ ca kiṃ |
samyagatyudgame siddhiḥ kuṃthite vighnamāpnuyāt ||

kīṭabhuktenyaphalaṃ rutite sarvanāśanaṃ |
dhūmravarṇānya pūrṇāni tathā tīryaggatāni ca ||

śyāmalāni ca kubjāni varjayeda śubhāni ca |
avṛṣṭiṃ kurute kṛṣṇaṃ dhūmrābhaṃ kalahaṃ tathā || 

apūrṇajananāśaṃ ca durbhikṣaṃ śyāmalākulaṃ |
tīryagjāte bhavedvyādhiḥ kubje śatrubhayaṃ bhavet ||

aśubhevāṃ kulejāte śāṃtihomaṃ samācaret |
mūlamaṃtreṇa juhuyādgurumūrtidharaiḥ saha ||

aghorāstreṇa cāstreṇa śataṃ vātha sahasrakaṃ |
samyak pūrvaṃ prarūḍhāṇi komalāni sitāni ca ||

siddhiḥ priyaṃgubhirjñeyā śyāmākaiḥ strīsukhaṃ bhavet |
tilaiḥ pūjyajanollāsaiḥ sarṣapairnābhicārakaḥ || 

śālībhiḥ sarvamānyatvaṃ mudgedeva kṛpā bhavet |
catuḥpādāstadāḍhakyāṃniṣyā vā kṣetramaṃdire ||

khalvaiḥ satkarmasiddhiśca māśaiḥ śāṃtirarerbhavet |
sarvaiḥ samudgatairvāmai siddhiḥ pātastvatonyathā ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau aṃkurārpaṇanirṇayonāma navamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 9 ||

atha dīkṣāvidhiṃ vakṣye matrīṇāṃ hitakāmyayā |
vinā tayā na labhyeta sarvamaṃtraphalaṃ yataḥ ||

caturvidhā samuddiṣṭā kriyāvatyādibhedataḥ |
kriyāvatī varṇamayī kalātmāveṣamaryapi ||

tatra kriyāvatī dīkṣā vahusvānna nigadyate |
dīkṣādānāt pūrvadine prātaḥ kṛtyaṃ nivartya ca ||

samalaṃ kṛtyadehaṃ svaṃsvagṛhepūjanaṃ caret |
gaṇeśasya vidhānena puṇyāhaṃ vācayet tataḥ ||

nāṃdīmukhaṃttarpayitvā paṃcavādyapuraḥsaraṃ |
yathoktakṛtasaṃbhārogacchedguru gṛhaṃ prati ||

ācārya ṛtvigvaraṇasaṃbhāro (*)(?) daśāmataḥ |
śrīparṇī vṛkṣapīṭhāmi hastamānānimānataḥ ||

<p. 35b>

aṣṭāṃgula samucchrāya sahitāni samāni ca |
saptaviṃśati darbhāṇāṃ ceṇegre graṃthabhūṣitāḥ ||

viṣṭarāḥ sarvayajñeṣu lakṣaṇaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
sukhoṣṇodaka saṃbhūtāḥ pādyārthe tāmragaḍḍukāḥ ||

śaṃkhā arghyapradānāya gaṃdhapuṣpajalānvitāḥ |
sutāmrasyakamaṇḍalvāḥ ācamyodakapūritāḥ ||

tairyutā madhupakvārthaṃ kāṃsyā dadhyādi pūritāḥ |
mahadarghyāṇi vastrāṇi mudrikādyaṃ subhūṣaṇaṃ ||

mayūrapatra chatrāṇicoṣṇīṣāṇi samāharet |
pādukācāharet tatra carmābharaṇabhuṣitāḥ ||

kṛtvai tat phalamāpnoti mahāyajñārhaṇopamaṃ |
anyebhyo madhuparkasya viprebhyaḥ pūjanaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

bhaktyā tadviguṇaṃ dadyādācāryāya subhaktimān |
anyairdvijaiḥ samaṃ yatra deśikasya prapūjanaṃ ||

tasmin yajñephalaṃ svalpamanāvṛṣṭau yathākṣiteḥ |
evaṃ gurugṛhaṃgatvā praṇamya gurupādukāṃ ||

datvā varaṇasāmagrīṃ saṃkalpya vṛṇuyādguruṃ |
uccāryāmukamaṃtrasya grahaṇāyadvijottamaḥ ||

gurutveneti saṃbhāṣyatvāmahaṃ ca tatovṛṇe |
ityuktvā vṛṇuyācchiṣyo vṛtosmīti tato guruḥ ||

yathocitaṃ guroḥ karmakuruṣveti vadecchiśuḥ |
karavāṇīti coccārya gurorevāhvayātataḥ ||

brāhmaṇān vṛṇuyādaṣṭau vedavedāṃgapāragān |
taddevatopāsakāṃśca ṛtvitkenātha vā yadā ||

catvāri kuṇḍani tadā catvāro ṛtvijaḥ smṛtāḥ |
tataḥ śiṣyeṇa sahito yāyādyāga gṛhaguruḥ ||

upaviśya ca tadvāre parīkṣāmārabhet tataḥ |
guruḥ svayaṃ daṃtakāṣṭhaṃ kṣīravṛkṣādi saṃbhavaṃ ||

athavā cūtavṛkṣasya dvādaśāṃgulamānataḥ |
śiṣyāya mūlasaṃjaptaṃ pradadyāddaṃtadhāvanaṃ ||

daṃtān viśodhya purataḥ sthaṇḍile hastamātrake |
caturasre tyājayeta parīkṣeta tato guruḥ ||

tadagraṃ yaddiśāsaṃsthaṃ tatredaṃ pūrvataḥ phalaṃ |
bhūtirhṛdayasaṃtāpo vaṃdhunāśastathāmṛtiḥ ||

śokaśca vyagratā saukhyaṃ jñānalābhaḥ kramāt phalaṃ |
amaṃgalasthānapāte prāyaścittaḥ samācaret ||

aṣṭādhikaṃ sahasraṃ vā śataviṃśatireva vā |
astrasaṃpuṭitenaiṣāṃ nāmnā svāhanvitena ca ||

doṣājahijahītyevaṃ padaṃ nāmāvasānugaṃ |
kevalājyena juhuyādduḥsvapneyyevameva hi ||

<p. 36a>

daṃtakāṣṭhaṃ punardeyaṃ punarduṣṭe caturguṇaṃ |
tṛtīyamapi duṣṭaṃ cenna grāhyā sā tu devatā ||

vāmamārge sakṛdapi guruśiṣyau vināśayet ||

atha svapnaparīkṣāmāha |

tataḥ svapnaparīkṣyāṃ ca kuryāt tadvidhirucyate |
vedikānāṃ dakṣiṇānāṃ vaiṣṇavānāṃ ca vāmināṃ ||

yajjāgrato devamudaitidaivamātṛbhyamaṃtrān japatastriretān |
divaikabhugdakṣiṇapārśvaśāyīsvapnaṃ parīkṣeta yathopadeśaṃ ||

svapnamānavamāśritya svāpacet pūrvamastakaṃ |
gṛhasthān darbhaśayyāyāṃ pūrvaśīrṣāstra rakṣitān ||

hṛdā sadbhasmaśayyāyāṃ yatān dakṣiṇamastakān |
devasya dakṣiṇebhāge śiṣyaṃtamadhivāsayet ||

ahatāstaraṇāstīrṇe sadarbhaḥ śayane śuciḥ |
maṃtrite ca śivaṃ dhyāyan prāk sirasko niśiḥsvapet ||

śikhāvaddhasya sūtrasya śivayātacchikhāṃguruḥ |
āveṣṭyāhatavastreṇa tamācchādya ca varmaṇā ||

rekhā trayaṃ ca parito bhasmanā tilasarṣapaiḥ |
kṛtvāstra japtaistadvāhyedigīśānāṃ valiṃ haret ||

gurupādārcanaṃ kṛtvā upavāsī jiteṃdriyaḥ |
darbhaśayyāṃgato rātrau dṛṣṭvā svapnaṃ nivedayet ||

bhagavan devadeveśa śūlabhṛdvṛṣavāhanaḥ |
iṣṭāniṣṭhe samācakṣu svapnemūptasya sāṃprataṃ ||

niśāṃte paśyati svapnaṃ śubhaṃ vā yadi vā śubhaṃ |
oṃhṛtsakalalokāya viṣṇave prabhaviṣṇave ||

viśvāya viśvarūpāya svapnādhipataye namaḥ |
svapnamānavamaṃtroyamupavāsī jiteṃdriyaḥ ||

darbhaśayyāgato rātrau svapnaṃ paśyedyathā tathaṃ |
bhuktvāśayītaśayane suśuddhe vasudhātale ||

ardharātre samutthāya pādaśau ca vihāya ca |
ācamya devaṃ saṃsmṛtya saṃpūjya ca sa paṃcakaiḥ ||

śivadaivatayoraikyaṃ bhāvayan prajapedidaṃ |
namojāyatrinetrāya piṃgalāya mahātmane ||

vāmāya viśvarūpāya svapnādhipataye namaḥ |
svapne kathayame nityaṃ sarvakāryamaśeṣataḥ ||

svapnastu prathameyāme saṃvatsara phalaṃ bhavet |
ṣaḍbhirmāsairdviyāmotthastribhirmāsaistriyāmakaḥ ||

caturthe māsamātreṇa prātaḥkāle tu satvaraṃ |
ciṃtārugjālpadīrghaṃ yat tatphalaṃ naiva vidyate ||

vātādhikyādbhavet svapnaḥ sāhasoḍḍīnapūrvakaṃ |
pitrāttejogni pītādiraktaṃ krodhādikaṃ tathā ||

<p. 36b>

adhyāśayetādiśita śayanādyaṃ valāṃsitaḥ |
vāte prātastvaṃgamardaḥ pittāddāhastu netrayoḥ ||

kaphāt prasevate nityaṃ dvaṃ dvaṃ dvaṃ dvaṃ na kiṃ triṣu |
siddhaṃ vā svaguruṃ devaṃ prasannā vā kumārikāṃ ||

gaṃgāṃgāṃ bhāratīṃ bhānuṃ liṃginaṃ liṃgamaiśvaraṃ |
vāraṃ chatraṃ rathaṃ dīpaṃ prāsādā kamalaṃ nadīṃ ||

kuṃjaraṃ vṛṣaṃbhaṃ mālyaṃ samudraṃ phalitaṃ drumaṃ |
parvataṃ projjvaladvahniṃ mamamāsaṃ surāsavaṃ ||

grahādbhānividhaṃ sūryaṃ ratnānyā bharaṇāni ca |
siṃhāsanaṃ vimānaṃ ca dhvajaṃ rājyābhiṣecanaṃ ||

śvetacaṃdanavastrāṇi śālayaḥ kuṃkumaṃ madhu |
lājāsiddhārthakaṃ nāryo navabhāṇḍaṃ ca pāyasaṃ ||

aśvaṃ phalāni siddhānnaṃ dadhivāra vilāsinīṃ |
dugdhaṃ vādyāni cāṣaṃ ca mayūraṃ na kulaṃ mṛdaṃ ||

vaddhameka paśuṃ puṣpaṃ sadvākyaṃ cekṣu maṃjanaṃ |
pūrṇakuṃbhaṃ darpaṇaṃ ca mīnavājyaṃ ca rocanā ||

śaṃvarodanahīnaṃ ca śastrāṇi ca patākikāḥ |
bhāradvāja nṛpālau ca vedaśabdaṃ ca gāyanaṃ ||

kaśāmāṃgalyagītāni cāṃkuśaṃ yaddhṛdaḥ priyaṃ |
svapne dṛṣṭvāni caitāni sādhakaḥ siddhimāpnuyāt ||

vyādhyārddhyarttanāsti duḥkhaṃ sāmānyasukhamāpnuyāt |
yadākarma sukāmyeṣu striyaṃ svapneṣu paśyati ||

kāmayaṃtī nadī siṃdhustaraṇaṃ bhramaṇaṃ cakhe |
bhāskarodayanaścaiva grahaṇaṃ caṃdrasūryayoḥ ||

harmyaṃ prāsādanāmāśca vṛṣaśailāgnirohaṇaṃ |
bhojanaṃ dadhibhaktasyāt pakvamāṃsaṃ ca bhakṣaṇaṃ ||

kṛmiviṣṭānulepaśca rudhireṇābhiṣecanaṃ |
tāṃbūlabhakṣaṇaṃ madyapānaṃ dadhyasi caṃdanaṃ ||

pracaṇḍaḥ kiraṇaḥ svacchaḥ kāryasiddhestu lakṣaṇaṃ |
kṛṣṇāṃ varadharā nārī kṛṣṇagaṃdhānulepanāṃ ||

avagūhatiyaṃ svapnesārātristasya paścimā |
evaṃ tu raktayā vyādhiḥ śokoruṇaḥ samānayā ||

bhinnayā kalahā hatyāpītayā kīrayāni yat |
śvetāṃvaradharā nārīśvetamālyānupanā ||

avagūhatiyaṃ svapne tasya śrīsarvatomukhī |
āsane śayaneyāne salile vāhane gṛhe ||

jvalamāne viṃbudhyeta tasya śrīsarvatomukhī |
sitoragasyadaṃśaścejjāyate dakṣiṇekare ||

daśāhobhirbhavellābho rogīrogād vimucyate |
nigaḍairvāhupāśena vadhyate vā suto bhavet ||

pratiṣṭāvarddhate tasya dugdhapānāddhanātyayaḥ |
surāṃraktaṃ piban vidyāṃ labhed viprodhanaṃ paraḥ ||

<p. 37a>

dadhi dṛṣṭvā bhavet prītirgodhūmaiśca dhanāgamaḥ |
siddhāviṣṭāgataṃ vidyāṃllābhaḥ siddhārthakaistathā ||

dadhilābhā bhavedartho ghṛtalābhāddhruvaṃjayaḥ |
ghṛtāsanāddhanakleśojayastu dadhibhakṣaṇe ||

liṃgādyabhyarcanaṃ dṛṣṭvā vyavahāre jayo bhavet |
yastu madhye taḍāgādebhuṃjīta ghṛtapāyasaṃ ||

niṣkaṃpaṃ puṣkaraṃ patretaṃ vidyāt pṛthivīpatiṃ |
devatāliṃginogāvaḥ pitaro brāhmaṇo nṛpāḥ ||

yaṃ vadati naraṃ svapne tat tathaiva bhaviṣyati |
astraiḥ saṃveṣṭayedyastu grāmaṃ vā nagaraṃ tathā ||

grāme maṇḍalarājyaṃ syānnagare pārthivo bhavet |
caṃdratārārkagrasanaṃ parimārgaṇameva ca ||

bhūmyaṃ vudhīnāṃ grasanaṃ śatrūṇāṃ ca vadhakriyā |
jayo vivāhadyūteṣu śatrūṇāṃ ca tathā jayaḥ ||

vaḍavā mahiṣī siṃhīgohastinyādvidohanaṃ |
prasādo guru vipreṣṭha devasiddhādikācchubhaḥ ||

snānaṃ rājyābhiṣekaśca svaśiracchedanamṛtiḥ |
tīrthodakānāṃ taraṇaṃ tathā viṣa (*)(?)  laṃghanaṃ ||

gohasti vaḍavāsūtirvahnirābhastathaiva ca |
parastryā liṃganaṃ tasyālābha rodanameva ca ||

viṣṭālepaḥ kuṃdajātīvakulakṣeśa darśanaṃ |
raṇadvidyudvimarddeṣu jayonigaḍavaṃdhanaṃ ||

paśumartyamṛgāṇāṃ ca labdhiradhyasanaṃ tathā |
śikhilābhaḥ śvetavastre puṣpacaṃdanedhāraṇaṃ ||

maṇitāla suvarṇādi pātre bhojanakaṃ yadā |
paśyet tadā sādhakasya jñeyā siddhirūpa sthitā ||

kāryārttanāṃ kāryasiddhi ṛṇārtānāṃ dhanāgamaḥ |
vaṃdhyā varmatuṣāgnyāhi lavaṇāṃgāramiṃdhanaṃ ||

viṭklīconmattatailānijaṭilārivasauṣadhaṃ |
rogābhṛśaṃ ca sanyāsī rugnābhyaktau kṣudhāturaḥ ||

vimuktakeśaḥ parito tvagāsṛk śaraṭaḥ kṣutaṃ |
mārjārayuddhaṃ kārpāsogarbhiṇī varajasvalā ||

guḍastakraṃ ca kāṣāyī paṃkaraṇḍā kaligṛhe |
vastādikasya svavalalulāpasavalaṃ tathā ||

aṃdhaḥ kubjo durvacano vadhiraḥ khaṃjakukṣakau |
vamanaṃ ca ghaṭoriktorajakīmalināṃvarā ||

etairdṛṣṭairnakāryaṃ syādrotī mṛtyumavāpnuyāt |
aśokaṃ karavīraṃ ca pālāśaṃ vāpi puṣpitaṃ ||

svapnepi salilaṃ dṛṣṭvā naraśokamayāpnuyāt |
rūpāṃtare praveśaśca dakṣiṇāśāgatistathā ||

<p. 37b>

paṃkenimajjanaṃ snānaṃ putrabhāryā vināśadaṃ |
gohasti dvijaviprādivarjye kṛṣṇena śobhanaṃ || 

raktagaṃdhāṃvaraḥ sranvī kṛṣṇā vā dakṣiṇāmakhaḥ |
kharoṣṭramahiṣārūḍhastrimāsaṃ na sajīvati ||

śvabhre vā patate gehe dvāraṃ vāsyavidhīyate |
navottiṣṭhatiyastasmāttadaṃtaṃ tasya jīvitaṃ ||

cāṃtaṃ mūtraṃ purīṣaṃ ca saṃtānaṃ jananaṃ cyutiḥ |
śukraṃ ca paśyedyaḥ svapne tasyāyurdaśamāsikaṃ ||

tāḍyate vikṛtaiḥ kṛṣṇaiḥ puruṣairudyatāyudhaiḥ |
pāṣāṇaistāḍyate cāpi tasya mṛtyurnna saṃśayaḥ ||

mahiṣoṣṭhu kharārūḍhastairābhyaktaśca muṇḍitaḥ |
dakṣiṇāśāṃ prasthitoyaḥ yasya mṛtyurnnasaṃśayaḥ ||

paśyet prāsādapatanaṃ gṛhasya śaśisūryayoḥ |
parvatānāṃ ca vṛkṣāṇāmadhikārāṣyutirbhavet ||

hāniścaiva svagātrāṇāṃ vyādhinābhibhavastathā |
gṛhasaṃmārjanaṃ lepo gomayena mṛdāpi vā ||

tīrthānadīṃ samāyātastīrenyadvasanaṃ dhṛtaṃ |
rogīrogādvimucyeta hāniḥ svasthasya jāyate ||

puṃnāmāno mṛgakhagāḥ potakīsūkarīralā |
piṃgalāchuchukāpallīvāmāṃ kokilā śivā ||

strīnāmāno mṛgakhagāḥ śrīkaṇṭhāyābharoruruḥ |
chikaro pipalobhāsaḥ dakṣe kākarkṣa kukkurāḥ ||

dṛṣṭāścedrogiṇo roganāśaḥ sādhakasiddhayaḥ |
śvasthasya codyamāllābho digvyatyāsānnaśobhanaṃ ||

atha duḥkhaśca śāṃtiḥ |

trirātraupoṣito bhūtvā haviṣyāsī purohitaḥ |
sakṣīrāṇāṃ ghṛtāktānāṃ samidhānāṃ śataṃ dahet ||

pālāśānāṃ tu gāyatryā śūdraḥ snātvā haviṣyabhuk |
dīpaṃ dadyād vipragṛhe viṣṇorgehe śivālaye ||

evaṃ dṛṣṭvā śubhaṃ svapnaṃ gṛhnīyān manumanyathā |
gṛhīte hānirevasyādvānyaṃ devaṃ viciṃtayet ||

atha svapnanivedanaṃ |

śiṣyastu śucirācāṃte puṣpahasto gurūttamaṃ |
praṇamya śirasā hṛṣṭhastasmai svapnaṃ nivedayet ||

svapnevākṣi samakṣāmvā āścaryasatiharṣadaṃ |
akasmādya divā paśyantākhyātavyaṃ gurorvinā ||

svapnānnidrā phalaghnīsyāt svapno vācyo macānyathā |
evaṃ vicārya sa tato guruḥ pujāṃ samācaret ||

vidhāyā ca manaṃ tatra sāmānyārghye vidhāya ca |
arghyodakena saṃprokṣya dvārapūjāṃ samācaret ||

<p. 38a>

tataśca deśiko vighnāndivyārālokanena ca |
aṃtarīkṣagatānastrodakairutsādayet kramāt ||

pārthivān pārṣṇighātaistu tribhirutsārya yatnataḥ |
aṃgaṃ saṃkocya kiṃcittu śākhāṃ vāma gatāṃ spṛśan ||

utsāritānāṃ viprānāṃ dadanvanvada tu dakṣiṇo |
brahmāṇaṃ cāstvadhīśaṃ ca nair(-)ṛtyāṃdiśi pūjayet ||

carghyāṃvunā ca gavyena yātasthānesu siṃcite |
vīkṣaṇādyaistataḥ śuddhiṃ caturdvārāṃ samācaret ||

saṃvīkṣya mūlamanunāhyastreṇa prokṣayettataḥ |
kuryāttāḍanamaṃtreṇa kavacenā vasevayet ||

śrīkhaṃḍāguru caṃdraiśca dhūpitestreṇasaṃkadhā |
yavāṃścaṃdanasiddhyarthadūrvābhasmākṣatān kuśān ||

salājānvikirenmaṃtrī pratyuhaghnā hi maṇḍape |
mārjayedastramaṃtreṇatān maṃtrīdarbhamuṣṭinā ||

āsanāya tu varddhanya īśānesvāpayeccatān |
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvātha viprāṃnsaṃtoṣya yatnataḥ ||

vedikāyāṃ likhet paścāt sarvato bhadramaṇḍalaṃ |
atha tat saṃpravakṣyāmi kuryāt tāṃtrikakarmaṇi ||

nṛpavarga samākāryā koṣṭhakāścaturasrake |
madhye ṣaḍvarga koṣṭhāni mārjayet tatra saṃlikhet ||

āyāma dvādaśāṃśaṃ ca vahistyaktvātha madhyataḥ |
tato vṛttatrayaṃ madhye samaṃ kuryād yathāvidhi ||

karṇikāmadhyavṛttena dvitīyena tu keśarān |
aṃtarvṛttena patrāṇi patrāṃgaṃ tyaktabhāgataḥ ||

kiṃjalkāgreṣu saṃsthāpyā pārśvatastvarddhacaṃdrakāḥ |
tadagre tu tribhiḥ koṣṭhaiḥ pādān koṇeṣu vinyaset ||

śeṣāṇi pīṭhagātrāṇi parataḥ paṃkti yugmakaṃ |
vīthīṃ kuryānmārjayitvā caturdikṣu ca madhyataḥ ||

kramādvābhyāṃ caturbhiśca koṣṭhairdvāra catuṣṭaye |
koṣṭhatrayena caikena pratyekaṃ dvārapārśvayoḥ ||

śobhābhavaṃtyataḥ koṣṭhairekatastribhireva ca |
upaśobhāstataḥ koṣṭhaiḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ koṇāni kalpayet ||

śuklaṃ taḍulacūrṇaṃ syādutsadhāyāmatastathā |
aṃgulena samākāryāḥ sīmārekhā dalāni ca ||

pīṭhagātrāṇi ca dvāracatuṣkaṃte prapūrayet |
avipre pūraṇīyāni rakte naiva dalānyapi ||

kusuṃbhacūrṇamāraktaṃ pūraṇīyāstu tena tu |
dvāraśobhāḥ pīṭhapādāḥ sarvavarṇairviniścayāt ||

pītaṃ haridrā cūrṇaṃ syāt pīṭhagarbhaṃ ca karṇikāṃ |
upaśobhāśca viprāṇyaḥ pīṭhagarbhaṃ ca kṛṣṇataḥ ||

vilvapatrasya cūrṇotthoharitastena pūrayet |
saṃdhīṃśca kalpavallīṃśca pītaraktena keśarān ||

vīthī catuṣka madhye tu kalpavallī prapūrayet |
patramūla phalākāra maṇḍitā hṛdayaṃgamāḥ ||

<p. 38b>

nānāvarṇa rajobhistrāṃ jayet kuśalī guruḥ |
kṛṣṇavarṇena konāni vahirekhā trayaṃ tataḥ ||

śuklāruṇākhya kṛṣṇaistu rajobhirbhūṣayet kramāt |
sarvataṃtreṣṭidaṃ proktaṃ sarvato bhadramaṇḍalaṃ ||

vakṣyetha devayonīnāṃ sarvatobhadramaṇḍalaṃ |
mārgetha dakṣiṇe tatra koṣṭhākāra vivargakāḥ ||

prāgvadeva tu tanmadhye padmaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśatā śubhaṃ |
ekapaṃktyā bhavet pīṭhaṃ dvāraṃ śobhā ca pūrvataḥ ||

ṣaḍbhiḥ koṣṭhaistu koṇāni raṃjitavyaṃ ca pūrvavat |
pīṭhapādāḥ paridhayaḥ padmādyaṃ pūrvavanmataṃ ||

vāmamārge maṇḍalaṃ syāt koṣṭairapūkavalgitaiḥ |
caturbhiḥ paṃkajaṃ madhye tadvāhye vīthikā tu vā ||

kalpavallī samāyuktā padmaṃ pūrva vadeva hi |
dikcatuṣke tu padmāni caturbhiḥ koṣṭhakaiścaret ||

vidiśāsu caturbhiḥ syuścatuṣṭāveda saṃkhyakāḥ |
catuṣ.ka padmavīthānāṃ madhye svastikasannibhaṃ ||

jāyate taccatuḥkoṣṭhe vidiśo su caturṣvapi |
rajobhiḥ śuklahāridra raktanīlaiḥ prapūrayet ||

svastikā nīlaraktāśca pūrvavat parikalpayet |
uditaṃ maṃḍalaṃ hyetat navapadmaṃ suśobhanaṃ ||

vedyā uparivadhnīyāt phalapuṣpopaśobhitaṃ |
vedikāyāmāsane sa prāṅmukhaḥ saṃviśedatha ||

vaddhapadmāsato maunī ṛjukāyo jiteṃdriyaḥ |
deśikeṃdrastu saṃsthāpya pūjopakaraṇāni tu ||

dakṣiṇe vāmabhāge tu sthāpayet kalaśaṃ śubhaṃ |
sugaṃdhijala saṃpūrṇahasta prakṣālanāya ca ||

paścāt pātraṃ nidhāyātha dīpān prajvālayecchubhān |
vyajanaṃ mukulaṃ chatraṃ cāmaraṃ dikṣu maṃtravit ||

saṃskuryāttāni sarvāṇi vakṣyamāṇa vidhānataḥ |
karaśuddhiṃ vidhāyātha kuryāttālatrayaṃ tataḥ ||

śaramaṃtreṇa digvaṃdhaṃ kuryānmaṃtrī samāhitaḥ |
mahastu tata utpannaṃ rakṣayettaṃ hi sarvataḥ ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā prāṇasthāpanamācaret |
nyāsādikaṃ tataḥ kuryāddeśikoyatamānasaḥ ||

ṛṣiṃ vinyaset tato mūrddhni chaṃdho vaktragataṃ nyaset |
devatāṃ hṛdayenyasya mūlamaṃtrasya deśikaḥ ||

ṣaḍaṃgaṃ vinyasenmaṃtrī paṃcāṃgaṃ ca yathāvidhi |
asya maṃtrasya paṃcāṃgaṃ netraṃ tasya vidhīyate ||

<p. 39a>

aṃgairvihīnasya manoraṃgaṃ te naiva kalpayet |
tattattaṃtroktamārgeṇanyāsānanyān samācaret ||

śarīresvasyamaṃtrajño yogapīṭhaṃ prakalpayet |
dehātmake tataḥ pīṭhe dhyāyen maṃtrasya devatām ||

darśayitvā tato mudrāḥ sthāpayedarghyamuttamaṃ |
jalena pūritāṃ dakṣe prokṣaṇī sthāpayet tataḥ ||

taṃtrātmamalyaṃ śaṃkhāṃṣu tata uttarato nyaset |
pādyamācamanīyaṃ ca madhuparkaṃ ca maṃtravit ||

tato mūlāṃvunā maṃtrī prokṣaṇyadbhiḥ samāhitā |
svātmānaṃ maṇḍalaṃ cānyat pūjopakaraṇādikaṃ ||

prokṣayed gaṃdhapuṣpādyairddeśesvedeśikottamaḥ |
yogapīṭhaṃ samabhyarcyanyāsamārgeṇa maṃtravit ||

pīṭhāṃtaṃ ca tatastatra pūjayediṣṭadevatāṃ |
devatātmātataḥ paṃcakuryācca sumanoṃtalīn ||

śīrṣa hṛdi tathādhāre varaṇe sarvagātrake |
pūjayecca nivedyena rahitaiścaṃdanādibhiḥ ||

sarvopacāraistaṃvesthaṃ gurvādiṣṭena vartmanā |
samāpayedidaṃ sarvaṃ prokṣaṇyadbhiḥ samācaret ||

pāṇīyaṃ prokṣaṇī saṃsthaṃ tyaktvā saṃpūryavpūrvavat |
upacāraiścaṃdanādyairmaṇḍalaṃ pūjayed guruḥ ||

pūjayet karṇikāṃ pūrvaṃ śālibhistaṃḍulaistataḥ |
darbhānyaseduparyeṣāṃ sākṣataṃ kūrcakaṃ tataḥ ||

chinnamūlā kuśādīrghāḥ saptaviṃśati saṃkhyakāḥ |
brahmagraṃthisthitāstvagradeśe kūrca ihocyate ||

yajedādhāra śaktyādīn pīṭhamaṃtrāvasānakaṃ |
svarṇādi racitaṃ tatra kalaśaṃ chidravarjitaṃ ||

dvādaśāṃgula haimaṃ ca raupyaṃ ṣoḍaśameva ca |
mārtikaṃ tāmrakuṃbhaṃ ca ṣaṭtriṃśadaṃgulaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

vittaśāṭhyaṃ na kurvīta kṛte niḥphalamāpnuyāt |
triguṇātmakasūtreṇa veṣṭitaṃ sarvato vahiḥ ||

caṃdanāguru karpūrairmadhye samyaktadhūpitaṃ |
dhruvaṃ japanvidhānena sthāpayed deśikottamaḥ ||

navaratnāni nikṣipya kuṃbhe kūrcamathopari |
pūrvācaṃdana saṃyuktaṃ vinyasedakṣatānvitaṃ ||

puṣpaṃ nīlaṃ ca vaiḍūrya vidrumaṃ mauktikaṃ tathā |
tato marakaṭaṃ vajraṃ gomedhaṃ padmarāgakaṃ ||

proktāni navaratnāni deśikaiḥ taṃtravikramaiḥ |
kṣādyaṃtaṃ kramato maṃtraṃ mātṛkā manasā japan ||

mūlamaṃtraṃ japennaṃte ciṃtayennaikyamātmanaḥ |
ghaṭasya pīṭhābhedaṃ ca ciṃtayet sādhakottamaḥ ||

<p. 39b>

paṃcāśadauṣadhīkkāthaiḥ pūrayet tadanaṃtaraṃ |
ekena sahitāstāśca varṇauṣadhyaścatā imāḥ ||

caṃdanaṃ cāpi raktākhyaṃ caṃdanaṃ cā gurustathā |
kapūrośīrakuṣṭāni vālakaṃ cāpi keśaraṃ ||

kaḥkolakaṃjāti phalaṃ jaṭāmāṃsīmurātathā |
graṃthikaṃ rocanājātī putraṃ pippala vilvayoḥ ||

pṛśnaparśī citrakaṃ ca lavaṃgakabhṛśaṃ tathā |
kaḥkolaṃ cāpi guṃjāsyādudusvarakakāśmarī ||

padmakāṣṭhaṃ śaṃkhapuṣpī mayūrasya śikhā tathā |
plakṣogni maṃthaśca tathā muhuparśī kuśāḥ punaḥ ||

pāṣāṇabhedakaṃ kṛṣṇaḥ śaṃkhapuṣpī ca rohiṇaṃ |
śyonāko vṛhatī caiva pāṭalā mukhakarṇikā ||

tulasī śikharī iṃdravallī bhṛṃgābhidho nṛpaḥ |
tato parājitā tālamūlī cāpi kṛtāṃjali ||

dūrvā śrīdevikanyākhyābhāratho bhadramustakaṃ |
lavaṃgarahitāścaitā paṃcāśat saṃkhyakā iti ||

dugdhaṃ vṛkṣatvayā kvāthairbrahmabhūrukvṛgudbhavaiḥ |
gaṃdhapaṃkaprasthanādi vā sitairvāśubhairjalaiḥ ||

kvāthāditoyairāpūryaśaṃkhaṃ tasminviloḍayet |
gaṃdhāṣṭakaṃ tasya tasya devasyātha vinikṣipet ||

gaṃdhāṣṭakasya saṃyogāt sāmarthyāddeśikasya ca |
saśaktikajjalaṃ kuṃbhe bhavedevaṃ vidurbudhāḥ ||

ādau kṛśānu saṃvaṃdhī kalādaśakamarcayet |
dhūmārciruṣmājvalinījvālinī visphuraṃgiṇī ||

suśrīḥ surūpā kapilāhavyakavyavahedraye |
kalā ṣoḍaśakaṃ sauraṃ pūjayet tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

tāpinī tāpinī dhūmrā marīcirjvālinī ruciḥ |
suṣumṇā bhogadā viśvāvodhinīdhāriṇīkṣamā ||

kalāḥ ṣoḍaśakaṃ cāṃdraṃ yajet paścād gurūttamaḥ |
amṛtāmānadā pūṣā puṣṭituṣṭiratirdhṛtiḥ ||

śaśinī caṃdrikā kāṃtirjyotsnāśrīprītiraṃgadā |
pūrṇāpūrṇāmṛtākāṃtidāyinyaḥ svasyajāḥ kalā ||

bhedāhi bhedasaṃjātāḥ kalāḥ paṃcāśadinduyuk |
sannidhāyya pratiṣṭhāpyābhyarcayet kramaśastutāḥ ||

nivṛttiḥ pratiṣṭhā vidyāśāṃtiṛddhiścadīpikāḥ |
recikā mocikāpārā sūkṣmāsūkṣmāmṛtā tathā ||

jñānadāpyāyanīcānyāpinī vyomarūpakā |
anaṃtā sṛṣṭi ṛddhīkāsmṛtirmedhā ca kāṃtikā ||

lakṣmīrdyutiḥ sthirāsthitiḥ siddhirjarā ca pālinī |
kṣāṃtīścaryauratiḥ kāmāvaradāhlādinī tathā ||

<p. 40a>

prītidīrghī tīkṣṇaraudrībhayā nidrāvataṃdrikā |
kṣukrodhinī kriyotkārī mṛtyuḥ pītāśvetāruṇā ||

asitā ca tathānaṃtā madhye madhye prapūjayet |
ha oṃ saḥ śuci ṣaḍiti prati viṣṇustaveti ca ||

triyaṃvakaṃ ca gāyatrī viṣṇuryoniṃ tathaiva ca |
tārasya paṃcabhedotthakalānāṃ pūjane sudhī ||

kalādaśakamāvāhya sṛṣṭyādyaṃ sannidhāpya ca |
haṃsaḥ śuciṣaḍitpādyāṃ ṛcaṃ saṃjapya pūjayet ||

prāṇasaṃsthāpanaṃ kṛtvā kalānāṃ pūjayeccatāḥ |
evaṃ jarādyāstīkṣṇādyāḥ pītādyāśca vidhānavit ||

nivṛttyādyāścāpi yajedukta yuktyā vicakṣaṇaḥ |
akārokārakau proktau makāro viṃdunāmakau ||

śaktiḥ śāṃtohyamīsaptadhruvabhedāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
aṃtimaudvāvimaubhedaupṛthageva samīritau ||

tataḥ aśvatthapanastha cūtānāṃ pallavāmṛḍaṃ |
vadhayediṃdravāruṇyālatayāsyedyanasya tu ||

kalpavṛkṣadhiyātaṃ ca bhāvayet kalaśopari |
pātraṃ taṃḍula saṃpūrṇaṃ nārikela phalānvitaṃ ||

kalpavṛkṣaphalaṃ hyetatsthāpayedanayādhiyā |
paṭṭavastrayuge nāpi ghaṭaṃ saṃveṣṭayet tataḥ ||

etat pradhānakuṃbhasya sthāpanaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
atha pūrvādikāṣṭhāsu toraṇānāṃ samipataḥ ||

yathecchayā maṃḍalāni kuryādvāṣṭadalāni ca |
tadūrddhaṃśālipuṃjaṃ tu pratidvāraṃ samācaret ||

dadūrddha pūrṇakalaśaṃ tatra ceṣṭāt prapūjayet |
prāgdhruvaṃdharāṃ dakṣe paścādvākyatimuttare ||

vighneśamatha cāgneyādiṣu kuṃbhān suvinyaset |
amṛtaṃ durjayaṃ siddhārthakaṃ maṃgalamarcayet ||

punaḥ pūrvādikāṣṭāsu kramādiṃndrādikānyajet |
lokapālānmaṇḍaleṣu kuṃbhopari ca tadvacā ||

airāvataṃ puṇḍarīkaṃ vāmanaṃ kumudāṃjadau |
puṣpadaṃtaḥ sārvabhaumaḥ supratīkaṃ tadagrataḥ ||

tato guruḥ svavedyāṃ tu gatvā svasyāsane viśet |
saṃciṃtya mūlamaṃtreṇa mūrtiṃ tasmin guruttamaḥ ||

tasyāṃ mūrtau mamāvāhya pūjayediṣṭa devatāṃ |
smṛtvā mūlamanuṃ maṃtrī samyaṅnādī yathā tataḥ ||

nirgamayya ca caitanyaṃ nāsikāgra vinirgataṃ |
aṃjalau mātṛkā padmemahaḥ puṣpānvite guruḥ ||

<p. 40b>

mastakāṃtaṃ samutthāpya tasyāmāvāhayet tataḥ |
saṃsthāpanaṃ sannidhānaṃ sannirodhaṃ tataścaret ||

saṃmukhīkaraṇaṃ cāpi sakalī karaṇaṃ tataḥ |
tato vaguṃṭhanaṃ kāryamamṛtīkaraṇaṃ tataḥ ||

paramīkaraṇaṃ kuryāt kramataḥ svasvamudrayā |
kramādvidadhyācca tata upacārāt prakalpayet ||

āsanāni prasūnāṃtānupacārān prakalpayet |
tattanmaṃtravidhāneṣu proktāṃgāvaraṇānyapi ||

sarvāṃta lokapālānāṃ tadastrāṇāṃ ca pūjanaṃ |
vidhāya pūjāmevaṃ hi dhūpadīpanivedyakaiḥ ||

kṛte nivedya ca tato maṇḍalaṃ paritaḥ kramāt |
pravālāṃkura pātrāṇi sthāpanīyāni maṃtraṇā ||

vedikāyā dakṣabhāge kṛtvā sthaṇḍilamuttamaṃ |
saṃsthāpya vahni saṃskṛtya vaiśvadevaṃ samārabhet ||

yathāvidhi tatastatra gaṃdhādyairdevatāṃ yajet |
tatra praṇava pūrvābhirhutvāvyāhṛtibhiḥ purā ||

juhuyān mūlamaṃtreṇa pāyasena ghṛtena ca |
paṃcaviṃśatibhiḥ paścāddhṛtvāvyāhṛtibhiḥ punaḥ ||

saṃpūjyatāṃ caṃdanādyaiḥ pīṭhamūrtau niyojayet |
agniṃ visṛjya śiṣṭhena pāyasena valiṃ haret ||

pārṣadebhyaścandanādi puṣpākṣata samanvitaṃ |
tata utthāpya naivedyaṃ tatsthalaṃ śodhayet sudhīḥ ||

punaryajeccopacāraiḥ paṃcabhirdarśayet tataḥ |
tarpaṇaṃ vyajanaṃ chatraṃ cāmaraṃmukhavāsakaṃ ||

sahasram ca japenmaṃtrī mūlamaṃtra samāhitaḥ |
devatāyai nivedyāthataṃjapaṃ saṃpade tataḥ ||

īśānadiśiyaḥ pūrve isthāpito vikirotra ca |
suvarṇavastra saṃyuktaṃ karatyaṃ jalapūritaṃ ||

nyasedatra yajedastra devatāṃ ghorarūpiṇīṃ |
paścimāsyāṃ kheṭgakheṭadhāriṇīṃ siṃhasaṃsthitāṃ ||

tiṣṭhansaṃpūjya ca tato gṛhītvātaṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ |
bhramedaṃ tastu dakṣeti lokeśānāmitīrayan ||

nālamuktairnodakena devājñā śrāvaryastataḥ |
svasthānesthāpayettaṃtu puṇyaṃtreṇa tatorcayet ||

upaviśya tu bhūyostu gaṃdhādyairmaṃtravittamaḥ |
proktakuṇḍeṣu vidhivad vahne saṃsthāpanaṃ caret ||

athāgni saṃskāraḥ |

munayaḥ ucuḥ |

agniḥ kva kva ca devāśca hūyategnau surān kathaṃ |
tamprāpnuvaṃtite devābhinnākasmādvadasvanaḥ ||

īśvara uvāca |

na svarge na ca tīrtheṣu nauṣadhīṣu nabheṣu ca |
ṛṣayordevatāḥ saṃti maṃtrāsravaṃ hi devatāḥ ||

<p. 41a>

sādhakānāṃ phalaṃ dātuṃ tattadrūpaṃ dhṛtaṃ suraiḥ |
mukhyasvarūpaṃ teṣāṃ tu maṃtrā eva na cetarat ||

tanmaṃtrairyadrutaṃ vahnau kiṃ taddahati pāvakaḥ |
grahaścinoti tacchreyo yathānāḍyonnajaṃ rasaṃ ||

nirdoṣā tu yathā nāḍī vahedannarasaṃ laghu |
devayogyo grahastacchredyāṃśaṃ vahate sure ||

sūryabhātiṣubheṣṭharkanādryāśreyobhivarddhate |
poṣayen vaidikānmaṃtrā nitarān haṃti cāmavat ||

tatastribheṣu saumyasya nāḍībuddhivilāsakṛt |
tasmāttriṣusitasyāpi vāmināmati puṣṭidā ||

tatastriṣuśane sarve nāśayenmaṃtra saṃcayan |
caṃdrasya sarvamaṃtrāṇāṃ puṣṭikartṛ tatastriṣu ||

tataḥ satriṣvāranāḍīparenyatra vināśakṛt |
tasmāt triṣurgurornāḍī satvaraṃ maṃtrasiddhidā ||

rāhunāḍī triṣu tato na satpaiśācaketare |
triṣṭhataḥ ketunāḍī tu sadbhūte devamaṃtrahṛt ||

tithivāsarasaṃyogāt kṛtaśeṣādṣutāśanaḥ |
khasthekaukutale netre pratyakṣegnau svarūpake ||

mārayet sādhakaṃ khasthoharate bhūtale dhanaṃ |
pratyakṣogniḥ phalaṃ datte śubhameva svarūpagaḥ ||

nityanaimittike durgāhomādau na vicārayet |
vahne tu sthāpanaṃ kuryādvaidikaḥ kalpamārgataḥ ||

tāṃtrikaḥ kuṇḍasaṃskārānaṣṭādaśa samācaret |
mūlamaṃtreṇa saṃpaśyet prokṣayedastra maṃtrataḥ ||

kuśaiḥ saṃtāḍayet kuṇḍaṃ astramaṃtraṃ paṭhan tridhā |
tataḥ kavacamaṃtreṇa kuṇḍasyā bhakṣaṇaṃmataṃ ||

astramaṃtreṇa khananaṃ kuṇḍasyāṃgulamānataḥ |
aṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ tāṃmṛdaṃ maṃtreṇa coddharet ||

punaḥ śuddhamṛdātaṃ ca pūrayeddhṛdayāṇunā |
samīkuryāt tatostreṇa secayet kavacena ca ||

kāṣṭhādinākuṭṭayettanmaṃtreṇasyād yathādṛḍhaṃ |
kuśaiḥ saṃmārjayet kuṇḍaṃ tataśca kavacāṇunā ||

vilepanaṃ gomayābhiḥ kavace naiva kārayet |
kavacenāgni sūryendu kalāḥ kuṇḍe viciṃtayet ||

trisūtrīkṛta sūtreṇa veṣṭayet pratimekhalaṃ |
trivāraṃ varmamaṃtreṇa kuṇḍapūjāṃ tataścaret ||

tāraścāmukakuṇḍāya āsanaṃ tena so iti |
eṣorghya ityādyūhaiśca sakalaṃ pūjanaṃ caret ||

nābheśca mekhalānāṃ ca kuryādevaṃ prapūjanaṃ |
saṃciṃtayet tatostreṇa tat kuṇḍaṃ vajravadṛṭaṃ ||

<p. 41b>

vahnerjvālānilāsāya hṛnmaṃtreṇa kuśaistataḥ |
kuṇḍasya tu caturdikṣu kuryānmārga catuṣṭayaṃ ||

acchinnāgaiḥ kuśairvastramaṃtritaiḥ kuṇḍabhittiṣu |
bhūtapretādidṛṣṭīnāma śucīnāṃ samācaret ||

uccāṭanamime proktāḥ saṃskārā dhṛti saṃmitā |
bhavedanena vidhinā kuṇḍasyāpyakṣa cāṭavaṃ ||

vāmahome tu saṃskārā ādyāścatvāra eva hi |
trisrastihyolikhedrekhāḥ prāśudagrācchadādhunā ||

smṛtāśca prāṅmukhāgrāṇāṃ devāvillīśaṃ vāsavāḥ |
udaṅmukhāgrarekhāṇāṃ brahmasūryaidavaḥ kramāt ||

vilikhedarbhakāṇḍena vāmamārgestu maṃtrataḥ |
trikoṇo pariṣaṭkoṇaṃ trikoṇaṃ citayasya tu ||

viṣṇvīśa vāsavādīmāṃṣaṇḍāṃ tatra tu pūjanaṃ |
vāmamārgetviṣṭa devāstrikoṇe pūjanaṃ bhavet ||

saṃprekṣya praṇavenā yogapīṭhaṃ samarcayet |
tadvidhiḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi maṇḍūkaṃ ciṃtayettale ||

kālāgni rudraṃ tasyorddhaṃ śaktiyuktaṃ viciṃtayet |
tadūrddhaṃ ciṃtayet kūrma tasya pṛṣṭhe vasuṃdharāṃ ||

śvetadīpaṃ tatra ciṃtyaṃ sudhāsiṃdhu suveṣṭitaṃ |
maṃdārān pārijātāṃśca saṃtānān haricaṃdanān ||

kalpavṛkṣāṃśca tatraiva ciṃtayet pūjayedapi |
etādṛśa gṛhe ciṃtyaṃ rasya maṇimayaṃ gṛhaṃ ||

svarṇapīṭhaṃ tu tanmadhye tasya pādānviciṃtayet |
puruṣārthāṃstu dharmādīn dharmajñānaṃ virāgatāṃ ||

aiśvaryamiti cāṃgāni pīṭhasyoktāni tatra tu |
madhyenaṃtaṃ tatra padmamānaṃdamayakaṃdakaṃ ||

saṃchinnālaṃ tasya coktā vikāramayakeśarāḥ |
prakṛtyātmaka pātrāṇi paṃcāśadvarṇakarṇikā ||

sūryasyeṃdoḥ pāvakasya maṇḍala tritayaṃ tataḥ |
tataḥ pūrvādikāṣṭhāsu satvaṃ rajastamastataḥ ||

aṃtarātmā punaścātmā paramātmā tataḥ paraṃ |
māyātatvaṃ ca jñānātmākatvātatvaṃ pratiṣṭhitaṃ ||

vidyātatvaṃ paraṃ tatvaṃ yogapīṭhamitīritaṃ |
svāgrādi prāgdakṣiṇena tatpadmakeśare prabhuḥ ||

madhyāṃtaṃ pūjayedetājayāṃ ca vijayāṃ tathā |
ajitākhyāṃ cāparājitāṃ nityāṃ ca vilāsinīṃ ||

dogdhīmadyorāṃ ca tathā maṃgalāmatha tatra tu |
hrīṁ sarvaśakti kamalāsanāya nama uccarat ||

datvā puṣpāṃjaliṃ kuṇḍe pūjayed bhuvaneśvarīṃ |
āvāhanādi paramīkaraṇāṃtaṃ ca pūjayet ||

<p. 42a>

kāmonmattaṃ śivaṃ tatra devīmṛtumaṃtī tathā |
gāṇeśa śaivaśāketeṣu dhyāyet saṃpūjayediti ||

vaiṣṇe ca tathā śaure lakṣmīmṛtumatīṃ smaret |
nārāyaṇasya saṃyogājjātamagniṃ viciṃtayet ||

araṇyātmaṇito vipragehā vahniṃ kumārikāṃ |
suvāsināsadvastrākṛtaśaucā samāharet ||

pātrāṃtareṇa pihite tāmrapātrādike śubhe |
agnipraṇayanaṃ kuryāccharāve vātha nūtane ||

dadyādaṃtreṇa pātregniṃ kavacena pidhāya ca |
jīrṇeśarāve kāpāle bhinnapātre tatholmuke ||

nāgni praṇayanaṃ kuryād vyādhi hānibhayāpahaṃ |
kravyādāṃśaṃ ca nairṛtye tyajedastreṇa vahnitaḥ ||

devāṃśaṃ mūlamaṃtreṇa sthāpayedagrataḥ sudhīḥ |
paścāttamagniṃ saṃskāraiḥ saṃkuryādvīkṣaṇādibhiḥ ||

pradīpakalikākāraṃ teja āvāhayettataḥ |
aikyaṃ jāṭharavaiṃdavyaṃ vahnibhyāṃ pārthivasya ca ||

smṛtvāgni bījakenātha caitanyaṃ yojayedratha |
oṃkāreṇābhimaṃtryātha dhenumudrā mṛtīkṛtaṃ ||

saṃrakṣa ca śareṇātha kvacenāvaguṇṭhayet |
tataḥ saṃpūjya kuṇḍasyadrāmapatiḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ ||

praśavena tataḥ svasya saṃmukhaṃ sviṣakuṃḍake |
devyāyonau tatra jānuspṛṣṭa bhūmau ca deśikaḥ ||

śivavījamiti dhyātvā niḥkṣipedāśuśukṣaṇiṃ |
devadevyorācamanaṃ maithunītadhiyācaret ||

citpiṃgala hanahana pacapaca dahadaha |
sarvajñā jñāpayasvā hātārādi jinavarṇakaḥ ||

amuṃ manuṃ prabhāṣyaiva kṛśānuṃ jvālayet tataḥ |
maṇivaṃdhau samau kṛtvā karau tu prasṛtāṃgulī ||

madhyame tilite kṛtvā tanmadhyāṃguṣṭakau kṣipet |
iyaṃ sā paramāmudrā jvālanī homakarmaṇi ||

agniṃ prajvalite vaṃde jātavedaṃ hutāśanaṃ |
suvarṇavarṇamanalaṃ samiddhaṃ sarvatomukhaṃ ||

anena jvalite maṃtreṇopatiṣṭheddhutāṃśanaṃ |
mukha naiva dhamedagniṃ mukhā devohyajāyata ||

prādeśamātrāṃ samidhaṃ mulāgradyutasaṃplutāṃ |
tūṣṇīṃ vahnau samutkṣipyajikāyā devatā nyaset ||

vinyasedātmano dehe maṃtrī jihvādavirbhujaḥ |
liṃgapāyu śirovaktraghrāṇa netreṣu sarvataḥ ||

vahnirāghrīśa saṃyuktāḥ sādiyāṃtāḥ saviṃdavaḥ |
varṇāmaṃtrāḥ samuddiṣṭā jihvānāṃ saptadeśikaḥ ||

<p. 42b>

kuśaiḥ palāśādiparṇai vā sa pavitreṇa kenacit |
tataḥ pravinyasejjihvādehe maṃtrī vibhāvasoḥ ||

saliṃgagudamurddhāsya nāsā netreṣu cakramāt |
sa sarvāṃgeṣu jihvāstā vakṣyaṃte trividhātmikā ||

hiraṇyāgagaṇāraktā kṛṣṇā caiva tu suprabhā |
vahu ūpā cātiraktā jihvāḥ saptetisyatvikāḥ ||

padmarāgā suvarṇānyā tṛtīyā bhadralohitā |
lohitānaṃtaraṃ śvetādhūminī ca karālikā ||

rajasyo rasa vā vahnervihitā kāmyakarmasu |
viśvamūrtisphuliṃginyau dhūmravarṇa manojavā ||

lohitānyā karālākhyā kālītāmasya īritā |
etāḥ saptaniyuktaṃte krūrakarma sumaṃtribhiḥ ||

svasvanāma samābhāḥ syurjihvākalyāṇaretasaḥ |
amartyapitṛgaṃdharvayakṣanāgapiśācakāḥ ||

rākṣasāḥ saptajihvānāmīritā adhidevatā |
jihvāsu tridaśādīnāṃtattatkārya samāptaye ||

juhuyādvāṃchitāṃ siddhiṃ dadyustā devatāmatā |
analerāghiṃvaṃdvaṃtāḥ sā diyāṃ tākṣarānvitāḥ ||

maṃtrī pravinyased bhūyā vahneraṃgāni vai kramāt |
sahasrārciḥ svasti pūrṇa uttiṣṭha puruṣastathā ||

dhūmavyāpī saptajihvo havyavāhā tṛtīyakaḥ |
aśvodarajavaiśvānarākhyakaumāra tejasaḥ ||

viśvamukho devamukho mūrtayoṣṭau prakīrtitāḥ |
pradakṣiṇa krameṇaiva saṃsiṃcya ca tato jalaiḥ ||

mekhalo parisaṃśuddhaiḥ punardarbha catuṣṭayaiḥ |
prāgagrairudagraiśca hitvā pūrvāṃ paristaret ||

ekumekhalake kuṇḍe mekhalādhaḥ paristaret |
dvimekhale dvitīyāyāṃ madhyamāyāṃ trimekhale ||

sthaṇḍile sikatānāṃ tu vāstubhūmau paristaret |
nālamekhalayormadhye paridhi sthāpanāya ca ||

raṃdhraṃ kuryāttathā vidvānmadhyamāmekhalopari |
palāśakāśmarī vilvavikaṃkaṭa samudbhavān ||

ekavṛkṣodbhavānārdrān paridhītvāhu mātrakān |
prāṇānāyamya vidhivat paristīrthakuśāṃtaraiḥ ||

svagṛhokta vidhānena vāyudeśācca pūrvataḥ |
sruksruvau ca praṇītāṃ ca prokṣaṇīpātra yugmakam ||

ādyasthālīṃ ca paridhīnidhyā ca kuśamuṣṭayaḥ |
adhomukhāni pātrāṇi homadravyaṃ valiṃ tathā ||

<p. 43a>

gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādīni sarvānyāsādayedatha |
tānyabhyukṣya pavitreṇa cottānāni vidhāya ca ||

prokṣaṇī pātrayugalaṃ paripūrya śubhāṃvunā |
datvā kṣatānpavitraṃ ca tadūtyūyanidhāyayet ||

diśyuttarasyāṃ tatpātraṃ praṇītāṃ pūryate budhaiḥ |
tataḥ kiṃcit praṇītāṃvu prokṣaṇyādhāya tajjalaiḥ ||

yajñasādhanasaṃbhāraṃ prokṣayen mūlamaṃtrataḥ |
vṛṇuyād brāhmaṇaṃ śāṃtaṃ devatāṃ maṃtradīkṣitaṃ ||

kuṇḍasya dakṣiṇebhāge veśayettaṃ kuśāsane |
amukāmukagotrohamamukāmukagotriṇaṃ ||

dīkṣāṃga bhūtahomesmin brahmāṇaṃ tvāṃ vṛṇo iti |
vastrālaṃkārādikena kṛtvātaṃ paripūrayet ||

kuryāt kuśavaddhuṃ cāpi labhyate brāhmaṇo na cet |
kuṇḍamadhye tu ṣaṭkoṇagarbhitaṃ svarṇakarṇitaṃ ||

nānākeśara saṃyuktaṃ caturdvāra samāvṛtaṃ |
ciṃtayedaṣṭadalakaṃ caturasra trayāvṛtaṃ ||

pūjāpīṭhaṃ tu tadvahnestatra maṇḍūka kādikān |
jñānātmāṃtaṃ yogapīṭhaṃ saṃpūjyāṣṭa daleṣu tu ||

prāgdakṣiṇena madhyāṃtaṃ pītāṃ śvetāṃ tathāruṇāṃ |
kṛṣṇāṃ dhūmrāṃ ca pūjayedvisphuliṃginīṃ ||

rucirāṃ jvālinīṃ ceti sarvaṃ pīṭhaṃ prapūjayet |
sarvaśaktiḥ komalāsanāya dṛdvādaśākṣaraḥ ||

samastapīṭhapūjāyāṃ vahnermaṃtra udāhṛtā |
tato hutāśanaṃ dhyāyedvarasvastika śaktibhiḥ ||

abhayena ca saṃyuktairbhujaiḥ samyagvirājitaṃ |
siṃdūravarṇaṃ padmasthaṃ svarṇālaṃkārabhūṣitaṃ ||

trinetraṃ ca jaṭāmaulimaruṇāsragitāṃvaraṃ |
dhyātvaivaṃ manunānena pūjayedupacārakaiḥ ||

vaiśvānaro jātavedo ihāvaha lohitākṣa |
sarvakarmāṇi sādhaye svāhāṃtaḥ praṇavādikaḥ ||

saptaviṃśatyakṣaroyaṃ maṃtraḥ syādvahni pūjanaṃ |
tataḥ ṣaṭkoṇa madhye ca jihvā dhyānaṃ ca pūjanaṃ ||

jihvā jvālārucaḥ sarvāvarābhayakarostathā |
aiśyāṃ hiraṇyā svarṇābhāṃ śāṃtipauṣṭika siddhidā ||

vaiḍūrya varṇā kanakā prācyāṃ staṃbhana kāryakṛt |
vidveṣe tadvaṇādityanibhāraktāgni koṇagā ||

<p. 43b>

kṛṣṇāṃjana ca paprakhyā naiṛtyāṃmāraṇakṣamāḥ |
suprabhā padmarāgā bhāvāruṇyāṃ dhanadāyakā ||

atiraktā jayābhāsoccāṭe vāyurdiśāgatā |
vahurūpā tu ṣaṭkoṇa madhye ṣaḍvarṇa saṃyutā ||

anekakārya saṃsiddhi nāśakartrī ca sāmatā |
yathā kāryaṃ tathā jihvā dṛśyate cet svadiggatā ||

jvālā rūpā tadā siddhiviparye tu viparyayaḥ |
agnīśāsura vāyavyā devāgre cāpi dikṣu ca ||

pūjayecca ṣaḍaṃgāni patre vyāvṛtti devatāḥ |
iṃdrādīnsāyudhānyaścāt saṃpūjyāgniṃ punaryajet ||

tataścādhomukhau kṛtvā sruksruvau tu pratāpayet |
kuśāgraistu tayoragraṃ madhyaṃ madhyaiśca mārjayet ||

mūlaṃ mūlaistridhā caiva mārjayitvā pratāpayet |
dhṛtvātau vāmahastena prokṣayet prokṣaṇī jalaiḥ ||

dakṣiṇeṇa karāgreṇa punaḥ saṃtāpayeccatau |
kuśānkṣiptā tato vahnau svadakṣatau kuśāstare ||

saṃsthāpya sruksruvau paścādghṛta saṃskāramācaret |
samādāya ghṛtasthālī maṃtramaṃtreṇa secayet ||

ghṛtaṃ tatra samāpūrya vīkṣaṇādi susaṃskṛtaṃ |
vāyavye vāhyatāṃgāvot kṛtvā teṣu hṛdānyaset ||

tāpanaṃ tu samuddiṣṭaṃ kuśadvayamataḥ kṣipet |
ājye prajvalitaṃ vahnau vinyasetadghṛtānvitaṃ ||

pavitrīkaraṇaṃ darbhadvayena jvalito hṛdā |
varmaṇājyaṃ ca nīrājya vahnau darbhadvayaṃ kṣipet ||

abhidyotanametatsyādudyotanamathocyate |
kuśaṃ prajvalitaṃ cākṣye darśayattaddhṛdā kṣipet ||

vahnābuddhāsya ca ghṛtamaṃgārānagniṣu kṣipet |
ayaḥ saṃspṛśya maṃtrajñaḥ kuryādutplavanaṃ tataḥ ||

astre maṃtraṃ japaṃ maṃtrāṃkuśau prādeśamātrakau |
aṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ ca gṛhītvā ghṛtamutplavet ||

tato dṛḍhaṃ kuśābhyāṃ tu svābhimukhyena saṃplavet |
ghṛtaṃ tatsyāt saṃplavanaṃ ṣaṭsaṃskārā itīritāḥ ||

uttamaṃ goghṛtaṃ proktaṃ madhyamaṃ mahiṣī bhavaṃ |
adhamaṃ chāgalī jātaṃ niṣiddhaṃ tveḍakādijaṃ ||

krītaṃ yadāpaṇe cājyaṃ svāducedgavyavattu tat |
kuśadvayaṃ ghṛtenyasya tataḥ prādeśa saṃmitaṃ ||

sa graṃthikatvāhvāgnaudvau śuklakṛṣṇau viciṃtayet |
pakṣau vāma iḍāṃ dakṣe piṃgalāṃ madhyatastataḥ ||

<p. 44a>

suṣumṇāṃ saṃsmarenmaṃtrī tato homaṃ samācaret |
dakṣabhāgātsruveṇākṣyaṃ pragṛhnīṃyā hṛdādhunā ||

dakṣenetre hutāśasyāgneye svāheti homayet |
gṛhītvājyaṃ vāmabhāgā hṛdā vāmegni locane ||

hunet somāya svāheti tyāgaḥ sarvatra saṃmataḥ |
hṛnmaṃtreṇa gṛhītvājyaṃ madhyato madhyalocane ||

hunettasyāgni somābhyāṃ svāheti ca tṛtīyakāṃ |
dakṣabhāgāt punastyājyaṃ hṛnmaṃtreṇa samāharet ||

agnivaktre'gnayesviṣṭe kṛte svāheti homayet |
satārābhirvyāhṛtibhirājyena juhuyāt punaḥ ||

juhuyādagnimaṃtreṇa trivāraṃ deśikottamaḥ |
garbhādhānādikā vahneḥ samudvāhāvasānikāḥ ||

śubhe karmaṇi kartavyā ājyāhutyaṣṭakaiḥ kriyā |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya karmanāma samuccaret ||

saṃpādayāmi svāheti sarvakarma svayaṃvidhiḥ |
garbhādhānaḥ puṃsavanaṃ sīmaṃtonnayanaṃ caret ||

jātaṃ vāgīśvarī garbhāt prāgvayeddhyo hutāśanaṃ |
jātakarmaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā nālachedaṃ samācaret ||

sūtakaṃ sādhayitvātha kuryānnāma yathāvidhiḥ |
tṛptaye yasya pade tatsyāgnistannāmapūrvakaḥ ||

cauropanayanaṃ vahnermahānāmnī vrataṃ tathā |
mahāvrataṃ copaniṣaddhataṃ godānameva ca ||

samāvartanamudvāhaḥ śākte vāgbhava pūrvakāḥ |
tataśca vahneḥ pitarau devadevyādikau tathā ||

pūjayitvā visṛjyātha mūlāgreṣu ghṛtaplutāḥ |
samidho niḥkṣipetyaṃ ca vahnāvatha ca pūrvavat ||

sa bījarasa nānāmnācaike kāmāhutiṃ hunet |
tataścāṃgāni juhuyād vahnermūrtyaṣṭakaṃ tathā ||

indrāgni lokapālāṃśca āyudhāni tataḥ paraṃ |
maṃtreṇākāra pūrveṇa svāhāṃtena vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

svāhā vasāne juhuyāddhyāyan maṃtradevatāṃ |
caturvāraṃ sruveṇājyaṃ gṛhītvāsuci niḥkṣipet ||

tenaiva tāṃ vidhāyāgnau hunettiṣṭan guruḥ svayaṃ |
vauṣaḍaṃte vahnestu manunāsaṃ yade tat ||

jihvāyāṃ madhyasaṃsthāyāṃ maṃtrī jvālāvalītaroḥ |
tārādyairdaśabhirbhedaiḥ pūrvapūrva samanvitaiḥ ||

<p. 44b>

manunā gāṇapatyena hunetpūrvaṃ daśāhutī |
juhuyācca caturvāraṃ samaste naiva tena su ||

saṃpūjya devatāpīṭhaṃ vahnau samyaktato guruḥ |
agnirūpadharāṃ tatra pūjayediṣṭa devatām ||

ājyena sadhyamanunā paṃcaviṃśati saṃkhyakaṃ |
hunenmaṃtrī cāgnimukhevaktraikīkaraṇaṃ tvidaṃ ||

ātmāgni devatānāṃ ciṃtayennaikyamātmavit |
ekādaśātha mūlena hunedājyena vā hutiḥ ||

rātrīsaṃdhyā name taddi proktaṃ deśikamuttamaiḥ |
aṃgaprabhṛtyāmṛttīmāmekai kāmāhutiṃ hunet ||

pūrvādi dikṣu kuṃḍeṣu sarveṣvapi yathāvidhiḥ |
evaṃ vahniṃ susaṃskṛtya caruṃ gopayasā pacet ||

na caitāmrādike pātre kṣāriteva śarādhunā |
mūlādhunābhimaṃtryātha taṇḍulānśālisaṃbhavān ||

tithi prasṛtimānena śarāṇuṃ prajapan kṣipet |
prakṣālitena pātreṇa yāvadvaktraṃ pidhāya ca ||

hraṁ maṃtreṇa tato mūla manunā deśikottamaḥ |
pacedguruḥ prāṅmukhastasvinnetamabhidhārayet ||

mūlena śruvasaṃsthena ghṛtenāthāvatārayet |
haṃ maṃtreṇāstra saṃjapte kuśastīrṇe vibhajyatāṃ ||

tridhāsvekaṃ devatāyai paraṃ vahnau nivedayet |
śiṣṭaṃ śiṣyeṇasahito gururbhuṃjīta maṃtravit ||

prādeśamātraṃ dvirjaptaṃ yathoktaṃ daṃtadhāvanaṃ |
śiṣyāya dadyāt saradātviśodhyakṣālitaṃ tyajet ||

ācāṃta maṃtraṃ ca yathā vidhitaṃ śikhāyāṃ vaṃdhaiḥ murakṣitamamuṃ 
pravidhāya maṃtrī |
vedyāṃśayītakuśasaṃstaraṇeraṇanyāṃ śiṣyeṇa sārddhaṃ mamunā gadito 
dhivāsaḥ ||

atha dīkṣādinakṛtyaṃ |

samutthāyoṣasi punaḥ snānasaṃdhyādikaṃ caret |
guruḥśiṣyo ṛtvijaśca gacchedyāga gṛhaṃ prati ||

sarve te svasva kuṇḍeṣu juhuyuḥ saghṛtaistilaiḥ |
punaḥ sādhyena manunā jyeṣṭhottara sahasrakaṃ ||

apradīptena hotavyaṃ madhyamenāpyaniṃdhite |
pradīpte lelihānegnau hotavyaṃ karmasiddhaye ||

aṃdho budhaḥ sadhūme tu juhuyādyo hutāśane |
yajamāno bhavedaṃdhaḥ saputra iti ca śrutiḥ ||

yonarviṣijuhotyagnauvyaṃgāriṇi ca mānavaḥ |
maṃdāgnirāmayāvī ca daridraścopa jāyate ||

agneḥ karṇe homatovyādhi vādhānetreṃdhatvaṃ nāsikāyāmathāvidhiḥ |
dravyachedomastakesyānmukhāṃtarhomaṃ kuryāt tena nityaṃ vipaścit ||

<p. 45a>

yatra kāṣṭhaṃ tatra śrotre yatra dhūmastu nāsike |
yatrālyajvalanaṃ netre yatra bhasma tu tacchiraḥ ||

yatraiva jvalito vahnistatra jihvā prakīrtitāḥ |
vaiśvānaraṃ sthitaṃ dhyāyet siddhomeṣu deśikaḥ ||

śayānamājya homeṣu nivarṇaśeṣa vastuṣu |
svarṇasiṃdūravālārka kuṃkumakṣaudrasannibhaṃ ||

savarṇareva sauvarṇaḥ śobhanaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
bherīvāridahastīṃdradhvanirvahneḥ śubhāvahaḥ ||

nāgaḥ caṃpakapunnāgapāṭalā yūthikānibhaḥ |
padmeṃdīvarakalhāraḥ sarpirguggulusannibhaḥ ||

pāvakasya śubhogaṃdho ityuktastava vedibhiḥ |
pradakṣiṇāstyaktakaṃpāśchatrābhāḥ śikhinaḥ śikhāḥ ||

śubhadā yajamānasya rājyasyāpi viśeṣataḥ |
kuṃdendudhavalodhūmo vahneḥ proktaḥ śubhāvahaḥ ||

kṛṣṇaḥ kṛṣṇagate varṇo yajamānaṃ vināśayet |
śvetorājyaṃ nihaṃtyābhuvāya saḥ svarasannibhaḥ ||

svaraḥ svara samovahne dhvaniḥ sarvavināśakṛt |
pūtigaṃdho hutabhujorhyetu duḥkhaprado bhavet ||

chinnavṛttāśikhā kuryān mṛtyuṃ dhanaparikṣayaṃ |
śukapakṣanibho dhūmaḥ pārāvata samaprabhaḥ ||

hāniṃ tu ragajātīnāṃ gavāṃ ca kurute'cirāt |
evaṃvidheṣu doṣeṣu prāyaścittāya deśikaḥ ||

mūlenājyena juhuyān paṃcaviṃśatimāhutiḥ |
śiṣyaṃ snātaṃ paṃcagavyaṃ pāyayen maṃtravittamaḥ ||

kuṇḍasyābhyā samānīya divyadṛṣṭyāvyalokayet |
hṛtpuṇḍarīkā caitanyaṃ tasyātmani niyojayet ||

ācāryastatra cādhvānaṃ ṣaḍvidhaṃ śodhayet kramāt |
śodhanaṃ nāmatatvānāṃ kāraṇaikatva ciṃtanaṃ ||

varṇādīnāṃ kalānāṃ ca tāsāṃ cidaikya ciṃtanaṃ |
gururvahiḥ praviharet saṃskṛteṣūkta vartmanā ||

sarvartvijaścaṃdanādyaiḥ saṃpūjyā prokta devatāṃ |
sarvāvaraṇa saṃyuktau mūlena juhuyustataḥ ||

paṃcaviṃśatidhā sarpiḥ saṃyutena payoṃdhasā |
sruveṇākṣaṃ samityāṇyāsruvā śeṣaṃ kareṇa tu ||

tatrā divyena hotavyaṃ tīrthe vāhyena vā tathā |
dadyādvaliṃgaṃdhapuṣpadhūpapūrvakamādarāt ||

nakṣatrāṇāṃ savārāṇāṃ rāśīnāṃ ca pṛthak pṛthak |
devatābhyaḥ padaṃ proktā divānaktaṃ vadet tathā ||

<p. 45b>

cāribhyaścātha sarvebhyo bhūtebhyaśca namo vadet |
hunenmahāvyāhṛtibhisvato deśikasattamaḥ ||

aṃgaprabhṛtyā vṛttīnāṃ hunedbhūyo ghṛtena vai |
brahmārpaṇākhya maṃtreṇa sarvakarmachidesudhīḥ ||

juhuyādāhutīraṣṭau kevalājyena maṃtravit |
hutvā pūrṇāhutī maṃtrī srutvā mūlāṇunmatataḥ ||

agnisaṃprārthyāgni sāṃgamaṃtreṇaikāhutiṃhunet |
sarpiṣāsru ca māpūrya puṣpaṃ coparyadhomukhaṃ ||

sruguparisruvaṃ datvā puṣpaṃ tatra prapātayet |
savyottara karābhyāṃ ca saṃpuṭābhyāṃ ca śeṣavat ||

saṃgṛhyotthāya saṃlagnau nābhautiryaṅnidhāya ca |
pūrṇādarvītimaṃtreṇa mūlena vasu saṃyutaḥ ||

dadyāt pūrṇāhutīstisraḥ sarvakāma prapūraṇīḥ |
śrotriyasye tadduddiṣṭamanyaḥ pūrṇāhutiṃ caret ||

mūlena vauṣaḍaṃtena svāhāṃtena tu vāmagaḥ |
homaṃ tu māṃsamadyābhyāṃ tīrthājyābhyāṃ ca pūrṇatāṃ ||

kuryāt svāhāṃta mūlena phalājyena tu vaidikaḥ |
dakṣapādaṃ puraskṛtya dakṣaḥ pūrṇāhutiṃ caret ||

śaktihome vāmapādaṃ vāmamārgī ca sarvataḥ |
punaḥ saṃtyajya gaṃdhādyairmūlamaṃtreṇa maṃtravit || 

kuṇḍādudvāsya vācāryo devatāṃ kalaśe nyaset |
sāṃgāṃ śāvaraṇaṃ tatra pūjayecca yathāvidhiḥ ||

saptavyāhatyagni jihvāṃgamūrtīnāmathaikikāṃ |
dugdhena pariṣiṃcyāgniṃ prārthayīta tato guruḥ ||

bhobho vahne mahāśakte sarvakāmapradāyaka |
karmāṃtarepi saṃprāpte sānnidhyaṃ kurusādaraṃ ||

iti maṃtreṇa saṃprārthya vahnimudvāsayedapi |
tato brahmāṇamudvāsya brāhmaṇāya pradāpayet ||

dvāviṃśatyalamātreyaṃ nirmitaṃ tāmrapātrakaṃ |
taṇḍulaistat samāpūrya sahiraṇyaṃ sadakṣiṇaṃ ||

dadyād viprāyatattuṣṭyai pūrṇapātramitīritaṃ |
tataḥ parisarānagnau paridhīn prakṣipennatu ||

nityanaimittikenāstu kṣipeddeśika sattamaḥ |
vastreṇa netramaṃtreṇa śiṣyanetre nivadhyate ||

kuṇḍāhaste samādāya nayanmaṇḍalasannidhau |
sumanobhiḥ prapūryāsya aṃjalī kṣepayerdyade ||

mūlamaṃtroccārapūrvaṃ devatāprītayeguruḥ |
netravaṃdhamayāsyopaveśayet kuśasaṃstare ||

<p. 46a>

tataśca pāṭhayan śiṣyaṃ maṃtramenaṃ gurūttamaḥ |
ajñānatimirāṃdhasya jñānāṃjana śalākayā ||

cakṣurunmīlitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguravenamaḥ |
aṃtaḥ pūjāvidhānena saṃharejjanaṣeccataṃ ||

śiṣyotha tasya maṃtrasya nyāsāṃ deho parinyaset |
paṃcopacārairabhyarcyakalastheṣṭadevatāṃ ||

yathokta vartmanā tatra sakalīkṛtyamācaret |
athopaveśayecchiṣyaṃ bhūṣitaṃ maṇḍalāṃtare ||

kuṃbhāsyastha suradruṃścamūrddhanyasya śiśorguruḥ |
atha paṃcaninādaiśca viprāṇāṃ ca vanaiḥ saha ||

susthitaṃ niyatātmānaṃ siṃcet kalaśapuṣpakaiḥ |
yena prakāreṇa purāyojitaśca sudhāmayaiḥ ||

toyairakṣarasaṃyuktairghaṭasthenaivartmanā |
atha śiṣyaṃ cābhiṣiṃcedāśusaṃpadavāptaye ||

gṛhītvābhyarcitaṃ pūrvaṃ karakaṃ hyastrarūpiṇaṃ |
tattoyairabhiṣiṃcettaṃ rakṣāyai deśikottamaḥ ||

janena śiṣṭena śiśuṃ gururā vāmayettataḥ |
taddevasvarūpeṇa vidadhyāt sakalīkṛtiṃ ||

vāsasī vimale ramye paridhāyājñayā guroḥ |
ācamya nikaṭe tasya samyaktasya manuṃ triśaḥ ||

dakṣakarṇevadedvidvānviprāyodakapūrvakaṃ |
anyebhyastu vade devameva maṃtraṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

dakṣakarṇe triśovidyāmekoccāreṇacoccaret |
eṣuvidhirdvijātīnāṃ strīśūdrāṇāṃ ca vāmataḥ ||

svayaṃ jyotirmayīṃ vidyāṃ gacchaṃtīṃ bhāvayedguruḥ |
agatāṃ bhāvayecchiṣyo na sosmīti viśeṣataḥ ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ śiṣyaḥ prajapedguruṇoditaṃ |
aṣṭāviṃśativāraṃ vāhyaṣṭa kṛtvothavā japet ||

gurudevātma maṃtrāṇāmaikyaṃ śiṣyo vibhāvayan |
praṇāmaṃ gurave kuryāt sādhako bhaktimānmuhuḥ ||

sāṣṭāṃgaścātha paṃcāṃgaṃ pūjākarmasusaṃyataḥ |
hastābhyāṃ caraṇābhyāṃ ca jānubhyāṃ vakṣasā tathā ||

mūrddhyā dṛṣṭyā tathā vācā cittenāṣṭhāṃga īritaḥ |
hastajānu śirovākya (*****) (?) īritaṃ ||

(****) (?) tataḥ kuryāt sadyaḥ śiṣyovicāryate |
alaṃkārāṃśca vāsāṃsidadyādṛtvigmya ādarāt ||

īśvarāvarṇa vudhyānu dvijāsīṃbhiśca naṃdanaḥ |
pradadyādgurave śiṣyaḥ svadhanārthaṃ tadarddhakaṃ ||

daśāṃśaṃ vā pradadyācca vittaśāthya vivarjitaḥ |
gobhūhiraṇya vipinagṛhakṣetrādikaṃ tathā ||

<p. 46b>

akleśādanna vastrādi dadyādvittānusārataḥ |
prākārāṃtaramālaṃvya guruṃ yatnene toṣayet ||

tadadhīnamanānityaṃ tacciṃtana parāyaṇaḥ |
tasyādābja rajobhūṣo bhavet sādhakasattamaḥ ||

tato nānāvidhairbhakṣyairlehyacoṣyaistathā pare |
brāhmaṇān bhojayet samyak pradadyādbhūri dakṣiṇāṃ ||

evaṃ kriyāmayī dīkṣā saṃpadātrī nirūpitā |
rājñāṃ dhanāhya vaiśyānāṃ viprāṇāṃ vyavasāyināṃ ||

atha vīrāṇāṃ viśeṣaḥ ||

kuladravyaiḥ samabhyarcya kulacakraṃ vidhānataḥ |
śiṣyāya darśayet samyagdīkṣerya kaulikīmatā ||

ṛṣyādi (*)(?) sattāmenāṃ likhitvā bhūmimadhyagāṃ |
puṣpādinā samabhyarcya śiṣyāyātha pradarśayet ||

yadi śiṣye mahāprītistadākarṇe vadedguruḥ |
tatopyatitarāṃ śiṣyo guruścedbhaktibhājanaṃ ||

tadāgaṃḍūṣa pūrvāhi dadyādenāṃ gurūttamaḥ |
nirvikalpopi śiṣyastadgṛhnīyāddhṛṣṭhamānasaḥ ||

tadabhāvena siddhiḥ syāddevatāśāpamāpnuyā |
siddhidravyaṃ mukhepūrya paṃcavyomāmṛtānvitaṃ ||

abhiṣiṃcet priyaṃ śiṣyaṃ gaṃḍūṣākhyoyamīritaḥ |
ayaṃ dīkṣākramaḥ prokto bhogayuksiddhimicchatāṃ ||

atha kulastrīṇāṃ viśeṣaḥ |

vīrakāṃtāṃ samānīya suśīlāṃ suyaśasvinī |
kulabhaktaguruṃ prāpya dīkṣayet kuladīkṣayā ||

pārānaṃdarasāghūrṇalocanāṃ kulajāṃ satīṃ |
tāṃbūla pūgapūrṇāsyāṃ guruvākyarataḥ mukhī ||

nijaputrīvadācāryastadbhālapaṭṭake likhet |
śakticakraṃ tridhāvṛtya likhet kāmakalāṃ tataḥ ||

tanmadhye deyamaṃtreṇa darbhitaṃ māmalāṃchanaṃ |
tatra devīṃ samāvāhya dhṛtvā tatra prapūjya ca ||

tatastatputrikākarṇe ṛṣiśchaṃdaḥ samanvitaṃ |
mūlamaṃtraṃ tridhāvṛtya kathayed vāmakarṇakaḥ ||

adyaḥ prabhṛti putrītvaṃ kuladīkṣārcaneratā |
yathopadiśyavidhinā sāmarasyaṃ samānayet ||

ityanujñāṃ gurorlajjādaṇḍavat praṇamedbhuviṃ |
trāhinātha kulācāra padminī padmanāyakaḥ ||

tvatpādāṃbhoruhacchāyāṃ mūrddhni dehi yaśodhana |
gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyāttāṃbūlāruṇalocanaḥ ||

svakulaṃ paramīkṛtya yathoddiṣṭaṃ samarcayet |
aṃgāvaraṇa pūjādauyadina kramate kulaṃ ||

<p. 47a>

tadā mūrddhni guruṃ dhyātvā kulāmṛtarasena tu |
tarpayitvā kulaṃ dhyātvā japenmaṃtraṃ nirākulaṃ ||

atha varṇamayīdīkṣā |

atha varṇamayīṃ dīkṣāṃ śṛṇvaṃ tu jñānadāyinīṃ |
puṃprakṛtvātmakatvaṃ ca varṇānāṃ samudīritaṃ ||

tādṛskaṃ ca śarīrasya proktamevāstideśikaiḥ |
tatastanau śiśornyasye darśāndeśikasattamaḥ ||

saṃharedvaiparītyena varṇān tatsthāna saṃsthitān |
deśikeṃdraḥ svasāmarthyādājñayā devatātmanaḥ ||

devatātmā bhavecchiṣyastadā saṃlīna tatvakaḥ |
tatastu śiṣya caitanyaṃ paramātma niyojayet ||

tānarṇāṃstata utpādya nyasecchiṣya śarīrake |
tasmiṃśca sṛṣṭi kramatastaccaitanyaṃ punarnyaset ||

bhavecchiṣ.yo devatātmā nityānaṃdātmakaḥ śivaḥ |
jñānadārṇamayīdīkṣā kathitāḥ sarvasiddhidā ||

atha vakṣye kalāṃ dīkṣāṃ maṇimādyaṣṭasiddhidāṃ |
veda paṃcakalāṃ dīkṣādakṣeṣṭa trikalāmatā ||

kupaṃcāśat kalā vāme siddhamaṃtra gurostu sā |
grāhyādrutaṃ siddhakartrī viparīte viparyayaḥ ||

kalā nivṛtti pramukhā bhūtānāṃ paṃcaceritāḥ |
śiṣyakāye bhūtamaye vedhayettā kramātsudhīḥ ||

pādādi jānuparyaṃtaṃ nivṛttiḥ saṃsthitāḥ kalāḥ |
jānvoḥ sakāśādānābhiḥ pratiṣṭhākhyāḥ kalāsthitāḥ ||

nābhitaḥ kaṇṭhaparyaṃtaṃ vidyākhyā saṃsthitāḥ kalāḥ |
kaṇṭhatohyālalāṭāṃtaṃ śāṃtyākhyā saṃsthitāḥ kalāṃ ||

bhālācchirāvadhiḥ proktā śāṃtyatītākalāḥ tathā |
saṃhṛtiḥ kramato vidvān vedhayet sthānatonyataḥ ||

sthāne svīyājñayā caiva dīkṣā paṃcakalāḥ smṛtāḥ |
aṣṭatriṃśatkalādīkṣāyuktiṃ śṛṇvaṃ tu devatāḥ ||

krameṇakādikāvarṇāpatra dvādaśa saṃsthitāḥ |
vilomābhādikā yatra tatra sthāna dvaye kalā ||

bhāvanīyāstu sūryasya ṣoḍaśāsuvidhostathā |
yakārādisthale vahnerbhāvanīyāḥ kalādaśaḥ ||

tato varṇa kalānāṃ tu varṇasthānārccamaṃ hṛtiḥ |
punaścajanayecchiṣyaṃ kalādīkṣāvidhiḥ svayaṃ ||

atha vedhamayīdīkṣā |

kaulike vāmamārge ca vedadīkṣā phalapradā |
anyāstāda dakṣiṇemārge'nyathādbhūpatito bhavet ||

<p. 47b>

dīkṣāṃ vedhamayīṃ vakṣyeyāṃ lajjā tyajate janaḥ |
tatkālameva saṃsāraṃ jīvanmuktobhijāyate ||

mūlādhāre tu śiṣyasya dhyāyet kaṃjaṃ caturdalaṃ |
tasyāmadhye trikoṇe tu tanmadhye cāpi kuṇḍalīṃ ||

trirāvartamayīṃ devīṃ vidyutpuṃjasvarūpiṇīṃ |
māhādevamayīṃ sākṣāddhānamātra śarīriṇāṃ ||

aṇoraṇīyasīṃ devīṃ cakraṣaṅka prabhedinīṃ |
suṣumṇā vartmanādivyāṃ yāṃtiṃ śivagṛhaṃ prati ||

sāṃtavādidalasthārṇāt padmasthāne samāharet |
ṣaḍdale kamale taṃtulāṃta vādyarṇayugdale ||

svādhisthāne guruḥ samyagyojayitvā tu vedhayet |
tadarṇānānayedviṣṇauviṣṇuṃtaṃ nābhipaṃkaje ||

phāṃtaḍādyarṇasaṃyukte digdale vedhayet svayaṃ |
varṇān tān yojayedrudrerudraṃtaṃ hṛtsaroruhe ||

kāṃtaṭhādyarṇa patrābjairvedhayedīśvare svayaṃ |
varṇān tānāharedasmin kaṃthapadmevataṃ tathā ||

kalādalamaye padme svarān saṃyojya yatnataḥ |
sadāśivetha saṃyojyatānstadbhrūmadhyapadmake ||

dvidalehakṣa saṃyukte vedhayitvātha deśikaḥ |
śaktyā sa daivamātmānaṃ nayet paraśivāvadhi ||

deśikājñāvaśācchiṣyodagdhā jñānastadākṣitau |
patedavāptavijñānaḥ sarvajño jāyate tataḥ ||

sadāśivaḥ svayaṃbhūyāt satyameva na saṃśayaḥ |
iyaṃ jñānapradā proktā dīkṣāvedhātmikā śubhā ||

atha sparśamayīdīkṣā |

guruḥ svasyaṃ guruṃ dhyāyet svahastai śivarūpiṇaṃ |
mūlavidyāṃ ṣaḍaṃgaṃ ca mātṛkādi manuṃ japan ||

śiṣyasya mastake datvā kṛpayā dakṣiṇaṃ karaṃ |
paścādupadiśet proktā sparśadīkṣāti siddhidā ||

sadāśiveti cidrūpe guruścittaṃ nidhāpayet |
maṃtrānsamastāntajjātān dhyāyaṃtsvayaṃ tadātmakaṃ ||

jāto gurośca kṛpayā kevalohaṃ sadāśivaḥ |
iti dhyāyannupadiśedvāgdīkṣātkiyamīritā ||

nimīlya nayane dhyātvā paramātmani devatāṃ |
taddarśanānaṃda pūrṇanetrābhyāṃ vīkṣayed guruḥ ||

śiṣyaṃ prasannacittaḥ san paścādupadiśoditi |
maṃtrasiddhasya siddhyaisyādṛgdīkṣephalaṃpradā ||

gurorā lokamātreṇa bhāṣaṇāt sparśanādapi |
sadyaḥ saṃjāyate jñānaṃ sādīkṣā śāṃbhavī smṛtā ||

bhuktimukti prasiddhyarthaṃ parikṣya vidhivadguruḥ |
paścādupadiśenmaṃtramanyathāniḥ phalaṃ labhet ||

<p. 48a>

atha upadeśo yathā |

mahādīkṣā tathā dīkṣā upadeśastataḥ paraṃ |
yuge kṛtādau kartavyā upadeśaḥ kalauyuge ||

caṃdrasūryagrahetīrthe siddhakṣetre śivālaye |
maṃtramātra prakathanamupadeśaḥ sa ucyate ||

atha kaulikopadeśaḥ |

nyāsajālaṃ vidhāyādau śaṃkhapātrādi sthāpanaṃ |
kṛtvā devīṃ samabhyarcya makārapaṃcakaiḥ plutaḥ ||

kāraṇaṃ tanmukhe datvā paścādvidyāṃ samuccaret |
kathitoyaṃ maheśāni upadeśastu kaulikaḥ ||

anyāyena ca yodadyādgṛhnātyanyāyataścayaḥ |
dadato gṛhnato vāpi kulaśāpo bhaviṣyati ||

guruśiṣyāvubhau mohoda parīkṣya parasparaṃ |
aśāstrīyopadeśaṃ tu yo gṛhnāti dadāti ca ||

bhuṃjītetāvubhau ghorānnarakānekaviṃśatiḥ |
asaṃskṛtyopadeśaṃ tu yaḥ karoti vimūḍhadhīḥ ||

vinaśyaṃti ca tanmaṃtrāḥ saikateśālivījavat |
anarhamaṃtravijñānaṃ tiṣṭhati kadācana ||

tasmāt parīkṣya vaktavya manyathā niḥphalaṃ bhavet |
sacchiṣyāyāni bhaktāya tadjñānamupadiśyate ||

tatprāpnoti vratī nityaṃ gokṣīrā tu yathā ghṛtaṃ |
dhanecchā bhayalobhādyairayogyaṃ yadi dīkṣayet ||

devatāśāpamāpnoti kṛtaṃ ca vikṛtaṃ bhavet |
atha svapnalabdha maṃtropāsanama kramamāha ||

svapnamaṃtrā mahādevi tridhā vai pariniṣṭitā |
pātāle bhuvirāṭ cakraṃ svargatāṃḍava cakrakaṃ ||

svarge cakradvayaṃ devī tripurākhyaṃ dvitīyakaṃ |
ādau virāṭ tato devi śivatāṃḍavameva ca ||

tṛtīyaṃ tripurākhyaṃ tu svapnamaṃtrāstridhā sthitā |
tatraiva suhṛdaṃto ye te virāṭ cakragocarāḥ ||

astrāṃtāstu maheśāni śivatāṃḍava gocarāḥ |
tripurā cakramadhyasthāḥ vahnijāyāṃti kāmatāḥ ||

ete maṃtrāstvautsukena bhuvi svapnena gocarāḥ |
svapnamārgeṇa deveśi upadiṣṭāḥ śivena tu ||

teṣāṃ tu lakṣaṇaṃ devi śṛṇu yatnena sāṃprataṃ |
pātāla cakraṃ maṃtrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ||

aṃjanaṃ guṭikāguptiścājñā siddhistathaiva ca |
śivatāṃḍava cakrasya lakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu pārvatī ||

khaḍgavetāla siddhiśca parakāya pradeśanaṃ |
carācara gatitvaṃ vahyaṇimādyaṣṭakaṃ tathā ||

<p. 48b>

tripurā cakra maṃtrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu pārvatī |
manorathasya cākleśa tripurācakramaṃḍale ||

ṣaṣṭhisiddhīśvaro bhūtvā bhuvisvarge ca bhūtale |
tatra kiṃ vā prakartavyaṃ kiṃ tatra maṇḍalaṃ bhavet ||

ṛṣiśchaṃdādikaṃ dhyānaṃ pīṭhaṃ nyāsādikaṃ śiva |
yatra noktaṃ mahādeva tatra tat tatkathaṃ bhavet ||

svapnalabdhasya maṃtrasya ṛṣiḥ śiva itīritaḥ |
gāyatrī chaṃdaścidrūpā devatā parikīrtitā ||

kādibījaṃ svarāḥ śaktiravyaktaṃ kīlakaṃ mataṃ |
pīṭhaṃ tu mātṛkāpīṭhaṃ dhyānādi mātṛkoktavat ||

mūlamaṃtrā ṣaḍāvṛttyā ṣaḍaṃganyā samācaret |
svapnalabdhe mahādevī dakṣamūrtiḥ paraṃparā ||

pūjayed dakṣiṇāmūrtiṃ gurutvena maheśvarī |
tadguruśca bhavedviṣṇustadguruścaturānanaḥ ||

tadguruḥ śaṃkaraḥ prokta evaṃ gurukramomataḥ |
jātasūtaka doṣasya vāraṇaṃkenavāṃ bhavet ||

tanmevada mahādeva likhedaṣṭadalaṃ śubhaṃ |
tanmadhye kalaśaṃ sthāpyaṃ tatra vai vaiparītyakaṃ ||

vaṭapatre kuṃkumena likhitvā maṃtrameva tu |
kalaśaṃ purataḥ sthāpya guroḥ prāṇānniveśayet ||

guroḥ sakāśād grahaṇājjāta sūtakavāraṇaṃ |
vinā puraskriyāṃ devi maṃtromṛta itīritaḥ ||

tasmāt kuryāt puraścaryāṃ mṛtasūtakaśāṃtaye |
yo maṃtraścetanāyuktaḥ sumaṃtraḥ siddhidāyakaḥ ||

caitanyaṃ tu puraścaryā caitanyaṃ gurumeva ca |
yaṃtracaitanyakaṃ devi maṃtracaitanyakaṃ tathā ||

gurucaitanyakaṃ caiva caitanyaṃ tṛtaye namaḥ |
caitanyatrayahīnoyaḥ samaṃtraḥ siddhido na hi ||

puraścaryādyanukte tu diksahasraṃ japaṃ caret |
dvāviṃśākṣaraparyaṃtaṃ diksahasraṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

taduttaraṃ mahādevī gajāṃtaka sahasrakaṃ |
svapnalabdhe maheśāni tryaṃgātpuratkriyāmatā ||

japahomau brāhmaṇānāṃ bhojanaṃ tritayaṃ mataṃ |
atha svapnādilabdha ripumaṃtrasyā vivekyādi guroraniṣṭaphaladudevatāyāśca 
krameṇa parityāgarucyate ||

śrīdevyuvāca |

bhagavandeva deveśa guruṇā jñāninā yadā |
lobhena maṃtrā dattaścettena duḥkhamavāpyate ||

tadā kiṃ devakartavyaṃ saukhyaṃ yenopajāyate |
ihaloke paritrāpi yena saṃlabhyate sukhaṃ ||

<p. 49a>

īśvara uvāca ||

prāyaḥ kaliyuge devi guravo lobha saṃyutāḥ |
śiṣyā sukhepsavastena na tayorlabhyate kvacit ||

prāyo maṃtragrahastena duḥkhāyaivopajāyate |
tadarthaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ ||

vikṣiptatā maṃtradoṣe gurudoṣakadarthatā |
ādhirvyādhirdevadoṣe tasmāttaṃ parivarjayet ||

maṃtratyāgavidhiṃ vakṣye yena saṃjāyate mukhaṃ |
vidvānsaṃbrāhmaṇaṃ jñātvā taṃtreṣu pariniṣṭitaṃ ||

prātastasya gṛhe gatvā svīyaṃ duḥkhaṃ nivedayet |
tatastena prakartavyo maṃtratyāgavidhiḥ paraḥ ||

śuciḥ samāhito bhūtvā prārabhet pravaredine |
aśeṣaduḥkhanāśāyadeśikaḥ pravaraṃ vidhiṃ ||

tatrādauramya bhavane kuṃbhaṃ dīkṣāvidhiḥ kramāt |
maṇḍape sthāpayedvidvān pūrayettajjalaiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

viloma maṃtrapāṭhena tatrāvāhyeṣṭha devatāṃ |
sakalīkṛtya saṃpūjyā varaṇāni prapūjayet ||

evaṃ sāvaraṇāmiṣṭvāmaṃtrī maṃtrasya devatāṃ |
hunedvilomamaṃtreṇa goghṛtena sahasrakaṃ ||

aṣṭānvitaṃ śataṃ cāpi tataḥ satarpayet prabhuṃ |
brahmārpaṇena manunā devatābhyo valiṃ tataḥ ||

yavānnaiścāpi dugdhānnairdigvidikṣvadha ūrddhvataḥ |
āyāhīndrasurādhīśaḥ śatamanyo śacīpate ||

namastubhyaṃ gṛhāṇe saṃpuṣpadhūpādikaṃ valiṃ |
āyāhi tejasānātha havyavāhavalaprada ||

gṛhāṇa puṣpadīpādi valimenaṃ prayojitaṃ |
pretanāthatva māyāhi bhinnāṃ janasamadyute ||

valiṃ dalaṃ gṛhītvemaṃ suprīto varatobhava |
namaste rakṣasāṃ nātha nir(-)ṛte tvamihāgataḥ ||

gṛhāṇa valipūjādi mayā bhaktyā niveditaṃ |
paripaścima dikpāla jalanātha namostute ||

bhaktyā niveditāṃ pūjāṃ gṛhītvā sukhamāpnuhi |
prabhaṃjana prāṇapatetvamehi saparicchada ||

mayā prayuktaṃ vidhivad gṛhāṇa valimādarāt |
kuberatārakādhīśāvagacchaitāṃ surottamau ||

puṣpadhūpādibhiḥ prītau ca bhavetāṃ varadau mama |
īśatvameveṃ hi bhagavan sarvavidyāśrayaprabho ||

pūjitaḥ puṣpadhūpādyaiḥ prīto bhavavibhūtaye |
āyāhi sarvalokānāṃ nātha brahman samarccanaṃ ||

<p. 49b>

gṛhāṇa sarvavighnānmenirvartaya namostute |
āgaccha varadāvyakta viṣṇorviśvasyanāyaka ||

pūjitaḥ paramābhaktyā bhavattvaṃ sukhado mama |
tataḥ saparivārāṃśca pūjayen maṃtra devatāṃ ||

maṃtreṇa viparītena puṣpadhūpopacārakaiḥ |
tatastu prārthayed vidvān pūjitāṃ maṃtradevatāṃ ||

ānukulyādyanālokhyamayātaralabuddhinā |
upātto duḥkhado maṃtra taddoṣaṃ vinivartaya ||

pāpaṃ pratihataṃmestubhūyācchreyaḥ sanātanaṃ |
tanotu mamakalyāṇaṃ pāvanī bhaktireva ca ||

iti saṃprārthya maṃtreṇa maṃtrayaṃtra vilomataḥ |
likhitvāmala karpūraścaṃdanena samarcayet ||

kalaśopari saṃsthāpya bhaktyā paramaṃyāṃ yutaḥ |
tadyaṃtraṃ svasya śirasi vadhyāsmāyā ghaṭodakaiḥ ||

maṃtrapūtaiḥ punaścātyaṃ kuṃbhatoyaiḥ prapūrayet |
tanmadhye maṃtramaṃtraṃ ca niḥkṣipyātha prapūrayet ||

taṃ kuṃbhaṃ nimnagānīre śuddhevānya jalāśaye |
visṛjedatha vipraśca yathāśaktyā pratoṣayet || 

itthaṃ kṛtavidhānasya durlabhasya manorujaḥ |
vinaśyaṃti na saṃdehaḥ kramāccittaḥ prasannatā ||

jāyatetī ca saṃpanno varddhate tat kulaṃ kramāt |
evamuktā manutyāgo gurustyāgastathonyate ||

maṃtroyaddevatāyāḥ syāttithau tasyā bhavedvratī |
gurutyāgasya saṃkalpaṃ kuryātta doṣapūrvakaṃ ||

gurvaṃtaraṃ ca saṃciṃtyanaraṃ vā devameva vā |
rāśikūṭena saṃśuddhaṃ devatāṣṭaka madhyataḥ ||

kuryādekaṃ guruṃ tatra pūrvā bhāve paraṃparaṃ |
ādau tu dakṣiṇāmūrtiḥ sūryaścaṃdro hutāśanaḥ ||

maṃtrāvaraṇadevatva jñātidevaḥ kuleśvaraḥ |
deśadeva ime tvaṣṭyai naro vā lakṣaṇānvitaḥ ||

guroryugmaṃ pūjayitvā nāsannata guruṃ dvayaṃ |
devatāmnāya saṃproktaṃ dravyaṃ tannāmato yajet ||

triparṇasya palāśasya prāgramuṣṭiṣu dakṣiṇe |
prādeśa pramitānāṃ ca kuśānāmūrddhvavartmani ||

toyaṃ pūrṇaṃ ghaṭaṃ prācyāṃ dugdhapūrṇāṃ ca paścime |
uttare tu surāpūrṇamāprāyadravyamīritaṃ ||

prāgguroścāpi caitanyaṃ praviṣṭaṃ nūtane gurau |
iti saṃciṃtya maṃtrastu tasmāllabdho viciṃtayet ||

<p. 50a>

aṣṭottara sahasraṃ ca manuṃ japtvā samāpayet |
maṃtrasya varṇasaṃkhyākāndevatā prītikārakaiḥ ||

dravyaistu bhojayedviprān devatārādhanakṣamān |
tadabhāve vaidikāṃśca maṃtrā vedamayāyataḥ ||

tadāmnāya pravṛttān vā tadabhāve tu bhojayet |
evaṃtyāgoguroruktaḥ sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaḥ ||

asiddhoyaḥ svayaṃ śiṣyaṃ kathaṃ saṃtārayiṣyati |
devatyāgaṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ ||

kṛta nityakriyaḥ pūjāṃ devatāyāṃ samācaret |
saṃkalpaṃ ca tataḥ kuryāddhenu tyāgādi pūrvakaṃ ||

parokṣaṃ vā samakṣaṃ vā guroḥ saṃprārthayetsuraṃ ||

trailokyanāthajagadīśamaheśvarastvaṃ 
brahmāṇḍakoṭijaṭharādbhutaśāṃtyaciṃtya |
yastvaṃ mayālpamatinādvibhujādidehī dhyāto parādhaṃ śatakaṃ 
mamatatkṣamasva ||

tvaṃ sūryacaṃdradahaneśagaṇeśaviṣṇurbrahmeṃdraśaktinarayāganagasvarūpa |
dhyāto sivālyaviṣayeparipūjitositanmeparādhaśatakaṃ bhagavan kṣamasva ||

vedopi naiva munayo na ca bhāratītvāṃ jānāti maṃdamatinā svaguruktarītyā |
dhyātastvamevamaparādhakṛtāmayedaṃ duḥkhaṃ 
pralabdhamadhunāśaraṇāgatoṣaṃ ||

dhyānaṃ karomi manasā na ca tehyanaṃta maṃtrākṣarātmakamidaṃ 
paribhāvayāmi |
rūpaṃ tvadīyamiti yatpravadaṃti vedāḥ siddhirjayānna ca vahiḥ kṛtapūjanādyaiḥ 
|| 

evaṃ saṃprārthya deveśaṃ praṇameddaṇḍavat punaḥ |
maṃtrapūtyādikaṃ sarvaṃ gurave tatsamarpayet ||

tadabhāve pūjakāṃtadbhaktāya pradāpayet |
kuryājjapaṃ dviguṇitaṃ sarvatrāpi ca taddhitān ||

prāgvacca bhojayedviprān gurvādīṃścāpitoṣayet |
evaṃ tu devatā tyāgo mayātubhyaṃ niveditaṃ ||

dīkṣāṃtaraṃ maheśāni pratyahaṃ prajapanmanuṃ |
prāṇāṃtepi na vaityājyastyāgācchāpamavāpnuyāt ||

japaṃ pūjā tato jāpyaṃ kuryād yatnena nityaśaḥ |
pūjāṃte prajapen maṃtraṃ na maṃtraṃ kevalaṃ japet ||

pūrṇābhibhiṣekahīnasya pūjāpaṃcopacārikāḥ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau dīkṣāvidhinirṇaye nāma daśamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 10 ||
atha pūrṇābhiṣekadīkṣāmāha ||

<p. 50b>

pūrṇābhiṣekadīkṣā tu caṃdrasūryagrahe bhavet |
suṃdarī tāriṇī kālī kramāddīkṣā trigāminī ||

kramāt pūrṇe maheśāni kramāchaṃbhurbhaviṣyati |
caṃdrāgni pakṣa ṣoḍhākhya parānirvāṇa tatparā ||

ṣaṭsāṃbhavaṃ tato devi cakrasaṃbhedanena ca |
svacakradeha vijñānaṃ parakāya praveśanaṃ ||

etadjñānādbhavenmedhā dīkṣā proktā mayā tava |
hādrāviḍaṃ nigaditaṃ śṛṇukādau maheśvarī ||

cakrāgni rasarājñī ca mahārājñī tataḥ śive |
mahākāmakalākālī guhyakālī tataḥ śive ||

guhyakālī dvidhā proktā sakalā niṣkalā kramāt |
daśavaktrā tu sakalā proktā vā sṛṣṭikā kalā ||

ugrāsaumyā mahākrūrā tridhā sāpi prakīrtitā |
niḥkalāguhyaśaṃśaṃtā kālībhedena kīrtitā ||

kevaleyaṃ bhavenmedhāhuyī sāmrājyarūpiṇī |
caṃdrāgni vedapaṃcārṇā tathā nīlā krameṇa ca ||

haṃsatārā mahānīlā tadaṃte cīna śāṃbhavī |
kevalā tu bhavenmedhā siddhiṛddhi kriyādvidhā ||

tritayā divyasāmrājyamedhā dīkṣā prakīrtitā |
devarūpā divyarūpā maṃtrarūpā mahābalā ||

sarvarūpā sarvapūrvā mahat sāmrājyamedhayā |
siddhiṛddhikrameṇaiva bhedavāhulyamīritaṃ ||

vidyārājyābhidhādīkṣā chinnamastāvidhau smṛtā |
caṃdravahni rasoraktaśyāmā ca ṣoḍaśī tathā ||

paraṣoḍhā saptadaśī tadajātā parā bhavet |
dīpinīmālinī kullākramādvidyādirājyadā ||

vagalāyā maheśāni sāmrājya parameṣṭhatā |
caṃdraveda sūkṣmamerurmaṃtrahīnaṃ śivāṃtaraṃ ||

hṛdayaṃ ca śatārṇāṃ ca paṃcārṇaṃ kullukā tathā |
gāyatrī kramayogena sāmrājya parameṣṭhyaṃ dhṛk ||

etatpaṃcaka saṃyuktaḥ sarvasāmrājya buddhi dhṛk |
śrīdivya sarvasāmrājyadīkṣā sarvottarā bhavet ||

tatopi dīkṣā deveśi nāsti brahmāṇḍa golake |
daśavidyā prabhedāśca mahāvidyā prabhedajāḥ ||

siddhividyā prabhedāśca mahāmaṃtrāstathaiva ca |
tadaṃga maṃtrādeveśi śāvaraṃ deśaśāvaraṃ ||

kālaśāvarakaṃ devi tathaiva siddhaśāvaraṃ |
tridhādarśana maṃtrāśca tathāmnāya kramodbhavāḥ ||

kādihādikahatvena ūrddhvāmnāyāt kalau śive |
tathāyatanamaṃtrāśca yatkiṃcinmaṃtrajālakaṃ ||

sarvādhikāro deveśi etaddīkṣāvidhau bhavet |
etaddīkṣā samāyuktaḥ sākṣācchrī kālikāsvayaṃ ||

<p. 51a>

praharākṣu krameṇaiva daśavidyā svarūpadhṛk |
kāmakalābhidhāvidyāḥ sa bhedā vṛttidevatāḥ ||

aṃgamaṃtrāstathānyepi tasyacāstragatāḥ sadā |
kramadīkṣā maheśāni paṃcavidyāḥ subhedataḥ ||

tadaṃgamaṃtrā gāyatrī kullukā paṃcakaṃ śive |
anyavidyāvidhau proktaṃ rahasyāti rahasyakaṃ ||

kramadīkṣāṃ vinā devi yojayet sādhakodhamaḥ |
sadaridro mahāpāpī sutahārī prajāyate ||

śrīvidyāyāṃ kālikāyāṃ tārāyāṃ parameśvarī |
kramadīkṣāṃ vinā devi yojayet sādhakodhamaḥ ||

sa daridrī mahāghorī lakṣmī hīnastu niṃditaḥ |
aṃdhaḥ kāṇakubjapaṃguḥṣaṇḍhastu kuṣṭayuk (**) (?) ||

sarvarogayuto bhūyādādhi ciṃtā samākulaḥ |
sutahārī ca strīhārī kanyā rājyavināśakaḥ ||

athavā vātulo bhūyonmaṃtraḥ kṣobhamavāpnuyāt |
devatāśāpamāpnoti dāridryaṃ tadgṛhe sadā ||

viśeṣāddevadeveśi strīhārī vikalaḥ sadā |
kramadīkṣā samāyukto rājā bhavati niścitaṃ ||

mahāvibhava saṃyuktaḥ sarvasiddhiḥ samanvitaḥ |
vijayo vinayaḥ sādhuḥ siddhaśca siddhidaḥ śubhaḥ ||

prahṛṣṭātmā sarvavettāḥ trikālajñaḥ kaviḥ mukhīṃ |
koṭi siddhīśvaraḥ śūraḥ suṃdaraḥ kāmamohanaḥ ||

ānaṃdātmā parātmā ca parājita guṇottaraḥ |
rājarājeśvaraḥ sākṣāt mahākālasamaḥ kalau ||

etadvidyopāsakasya dāridryaṃ dīnatā kvacit |
guruhīnā kramātyāgāt saṃpradāya viyogataḥ ||

dāridryaṃ prathamaṃ bhūyānnātrakāryāvicāraṇā |
ciṃtāmaṇi gṛhaṃ yatra yatra ratnasya maṃditaṃ ||

navaratnātmasopānaḥ sarvaiśvaryopasaṃgṛhaṃ |
kalpavṛkṣavanaṃ yatra pārijātavanaṃ tathā ||

sparśamāṇastu prākāro dāridryaṃ tatra kutra vai |
tasmāt kamavihīnasya dāridryaṃ tu pade pade ||

kramayuktaṃ guruṃ prāpya kramaṃ saṃprārthayetsudhīḥ |
anyathā gurumauḍhyena dāridratvamavāpnuyāt ||

alpāyurvābhaveddevinātrakāryā vicāraṇā |
vidherlipiṃ tu saṃmārjya tasyāḥ prakṣīṇato vrajet ||

evaṃ gurūrdīkṣāṃ kuryāt pūrṇābhiṣecanaṃ |
vinā yenābhiṣekeṇasādhakaḥ pūrṇavodhatāṃ ||

ācāryatvaṃ navāpnoti sadgatiṃ ca samīhitāṃ |
tasmādguruḥ priyaṃ śiṣyaṃ vodhayitvābhiṣecayet ||

<p. 51b>

vināpūrṇābhiṣekeṇa paśurūpaḥ śivopi ca |
vināpūrṇābhiṣekeṇa kālīṃ tārāṃ ca yojayet ||

tasya kriyāṃ hariṣyāmi vātulo jāyate naraḥ |
vināpūrṇābhiṣekeṇa gurudharmeṇa pārvatī ||

na japo na tathā homo na pūjā pūrṇa kvacit |
pūrṇābhiṣekahīnastu kauliko mriyaṃte yadi ||

piśācatvamavāpnoti yāvadāhūta saṃplavaṃ |
pūrṇābhiṣeko deveśi daśavidyāvidhau smṛtaḥ ||

pūrvoktamaṇḍape sthitvā gurudhyāna parāyaṇaḥ |
aṃkurāropaṇaṃ vāstuyāgaṃ kuryātyarehani ||

kuṇḍaṃ nirmāya yatnena yathā vihitamādarāt |
homaṃ kṛtvā guru kulaṃ mānyaṃ pūjya yathādarāt ||

vedikāyāmiṣṭadevaṃ gurustṛtayamādarāt |
vastrālaṃkaraṇaiḥ pūjyā guruśaktaya eva ca ||

yathā divyaugha caraṇaṃ siddhaugha caraṇaṃ śive |
mānavaughaṃ maheśāni svagurūṇāṃ catuṣkakaṃ ||

abhiṣeka kriyābhijñastadvartanapuraḥ saraṃ |
snānadvayaṃ yathoktena kṛtvā yatnena pārvatī ||

paṃcapallavayogena durvā vilvaphalaistathā |
vaidikaistāṃtrikairmaṃtraiḥ ṣecayecchiṣyamādarāt ||

ayameva maheśāni pūrṇadīkṣākramaḥ smṛtaḥ |
anyatsarvaṃ maheśāni dīkṣāpaṭalagocaraṃ ||

viracya vipulaṃ cakraṃ maṇḍapeti manoharaṃ |
khārītoyabhṛtaṃ kuṃbhaṃ sthāpayeccakra madhyataḥ ||

anyeṣu kalaśān ratnavastra hemasamanvita |
daleṣu vidhivat sthāpya tatrāvāhyaṣṭadevatāṃ ||

abhyarcya madhyacāṃteṣu sāṃgāvaraṇadevatā |
spṛśaṃ ca madhyakalaśamācāryaḥ prapaṭhediti ||

sāṃgāṃśca caturo vedāntatastena jalena tu |
abhyasiṃcedguruḥ śiṣyamiti pūrṇābhiṣecanaṃ ||

vedebhyaḥ sarvataṃtrāṃśca taṃtrebhyo manavastathā |
yatojātāstataḥ śiṣyaḥ sarvamaṃtraikabhājanaṃ ||

bhavedācāryanāmā ca kuryānnāmāṃtaraṃ guruḥ |
etādṛśasyayo dīkṣā gṛhnīyāt sa tu siddhibhāk ||

sarvamaṃtrapradāneṣu samarthaḥ sa tu jāyate |
sarvedevāvaśāstasya vedapaṃthā tu sātvikaḥ ||

eṣa eva vidhistaṃtramārgesyāddakṣiṇābhidhe |
viśeṣastatratoyānitīrthānāmāharetsudhī ||

<p. 52a>

gaṃgāyā yamunāyāśca sarasvatyā mahodadheḥ |
siṃdhugodāvarīrevākāverībhyaḥ pṛthūdakāt ||

mahendrajāyāḥ sarayūcarmaṇvatyāśca puṣkarāt |
mahānadyā vedikāyā kṣiprāvetravatījalaṃ ||

kurukṣetrasya gaṃḍakyāḥ pūrṇāyāmānasasya ca |
ghaṭedatvā japenmaṃtrānnānātaṃtra gatānapi ||

abhiṣekastu taistoyai siddhāste manavosya tu |
prayogārthaṃ tathānyasya dānārthamathavāmake ||

madhye tīrthaghaṭaṃ sthāpyaśeṣāstoya ghaṭāmatāḥ |
ye ye āvāhitā devā guruṇā tu surāghaṭe ||

te te kurvaṃti sānnidhyaṃ maṃtrarūpāścatanmukhe |
svayaṃ siddhyati vāgasya mūrddhānaṃ naiva nāmayet ||

yadarthaṃ nāmito mūrdhā tasya mṛtyurnasaṃśayaḥ |
vāmamārge gururyasya īdṛksiddho yadā bhavet ||

śiṣyaśca nirahaṃkāraḥ sadā daivata tatparaḥ |
devatārthaṃ yasyanāditrayaṃ bhoge mano na ca ||

sa eva siddho vāmesyādanyonirayabhājanaṃ |
daridro duḥkhito mūrkha ihaloke paratra ca ||

kriyā dīkṣāvidhiṃ kuryādyathā śaktyā gurūktitaḥ |
sajīvamīnayuktena surayā pūritena ca ||

paṃcāmṛtaiḥ susaṃpūrṇaṃ śaṃkhena kalaśena vā |
abhiṣekaṃ tataḥ kuryāt kulavṛkṣottha pallavaiḥ ||

ayaṃ pūrṇābhiṣekotra kulamārge prakīrtitāḥ |
abhiṣiṃcedguruḥ śiṣyaṃ nāmāsmai pradiśetsvayaṃ ||

ānaṃdanātha śabdādaudvyakṣaraṃ caturakṣaraṃ |
niyojyaivāmukosīti gururādautamādvayet ||

yathā nārīpiturgotrāt paturgotraṃ samāśrayet |
tathāśaktyupadeśena kaulogotrāṃtare vrajet ||

athocyate maheśāni kaulānāṃ gotramuttamaṃ |
durlabhaṃ sarvataṃtreṣu śāṃbhavaṃ tatprakīrtitaṃ ||

upapātakalakṣāṇi mahāpātaka koṭayaḥ |
kṣaṇāddahaṃtidīkṣeyaṃ vidhinā guruṇā kṛtā ||

raseṃdreṇa yathāviddhamayaḥ sauvarṇatāṃ vrajet |
dīkṣāviddhastathāhyātmā śivatvaṃ labhate dhruvaṃ ||

gataṃ śūdrasya śudratvaṃ gatā viprasya vipratā |
dīkṣā saṃskāra saṃpanne jātibhedo na vidyate ||

dārvaśmalohamṛdulajātiliṃgaṃ pratiṣṭhitaṃ |
yathocyate mahādevastathā varṇāstu dīkṣitāḥ ||

<p. 52b>

pūrṇābhiṣekaṃ kṛtvā tu yatra kutra mṛtopi cet |
sa eva devīrūpaḥ syāt sa devodhanyatāmiyāt ||

pūrṇābhiṣekayuktasya yatkiṃcidamṛtaṃ bhavet |
tasya kriyā ca saphalā devatā suprasīdati ||

pūrṇābhiṣekayukto hi maṃtrāndṛṣṭvā japecchive |
tatkṣaṇāt siddhimāpnotinā ca kāryā vicāraṇā ||

guruṃ vināpi deveśitvabhiṣekītvayaṃ japet |
taṃ sabhedaṃ sādhayitvā siddhiṃdātu mathārhati ||

kaulāvadhutamārgeṣu tīrthayātrāṃ na ca vrajet |
tīrthāsanaṃ ca saṃnyāsaṃ vratadhāraṇameva ca ||

upavāsaṃ muṇḍanaṃ ca sarvathā parivarjayet |
pūrṇābhiṣeka śirasaṃ tena tatra na muṃḍanaṃ ||

pūrṇābhiṣeka saṃyuktaścāṇḍālopi bhavedyadi |
sa brahmarṣirmaheśāni nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

pūrṇābhiṣeka hīnoya ṛṣivarjyopi pārvatī |
sa brāhmaṇādhamaḥ proktastvabhiṣekī dvijottamaḥ ||

pūrṇābhiṣekī deveśi yasmindeśe virājite |
saṃdeśo dhanyatāṃyāti samaṃtāt koṭiyojanaṃ ||

navyādhirna ca vai mṛtyurna śatrūṇāṃ bhayaṃ kvacit |
pūrṇarūpaḥ śivaḥ proktaḥ śiva eva na saṃśayaḥ ||

kovādehīkasya dehaḥ sukhaṃduḥkhaṃ ca kasya ca |
kojātaḥ komṛto devi sarvaṃ brahmasvarūpakaṃ ||

yasminkāle bhaveddevi maṃtradevasya vismṛtaḥ |
tadevamaraṇaṃ proktaṃ maraṇaṃ maraṇaṃ na hi ||

pūrṇābhiṣeka yuktānāmadhikāro hi sarvataḥ |
pūrṇābhiṣekaḥ saṃyuktastyajedetadvayaṃ śive ||

ahaṃtā mamatā tyāgaḥ prathamaṃ buddhilakṣaṇaṃ |
ahamiti maheśāni prathamodhyā sa īritaḥ ||

mameti ca maheśāni dvitīyodhyā sa īritaḥ |
ahaṃtā mamatā hīnaḥ pūrṇadīkṣāyuto bhavet ||

kullukāyā japenāpi pūrṇadīkṣāphalaṃ labhet |
vidyānāṃ kulapūjyatvāt kullukā tena kīrtitāḥ ||

vidyāsaṃbaṃdhi doṣāṇāṃ bhakṣayitrīyataḥ śive |
vikhyātā kullukā tena sarvadoṣa harā parā ||

kullukājaya yuktānāṃ vidyāsiddhirbhaveddhruvaṃ |

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau pūrṇābhiṣekanirṇayo nāmaikādaśamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 11 
||
<p. 53a>

atha gurubhaktiḥ ||

kulāgamastvayaṃ mārgo guruṇā saṃpradarśitaḥ |
samyagācaritaścetsyābhuktimuktyoṣprasādhanaṃ ||

vipropiguṇayuktopi na bhaktaścennaśasyate |
mlecchāpi guṇahīnopi bhaktimān śiṣya ucyate ||

gurubhaktivihīnasya tayorvidyā vrataṃ kulaṃ |
vyarthaṃ sarvaṃ śavasyeva nānālaṃkārabhūṣaṇaṃ ||

nārāyaṇe mahādeve mātāpitrośca rājani |
yathābhaktirbhaveddevi tathā kāryāṇije gurau ||

ekagrāmasthitaḥ śiṣyastrisaṃdhyaṃ praṇamedguruṃ |
ekaḥ krośasthitaścāpi guruṃ pratidinaṃ namet ||

arddhayojanagaḥ śiṣyaḥ praṇamet paṃcaparvasu |
ekayojanamārabhyayojana dvādaśāvadhi ||

tat tadyojana saṃkhyātairmārgegatvā namedguruṃ |
dūradeśaḥ sthitaḥ śiṣyo bhaktyā tat sannidhiṃ gataḥ ||

tat tadyojana saṃkhyātaṃ māseṣu praṇamedguruṃ |
atidūrasthitaḥ śiṣyo yadecchāsyāt tadā vrajet ||

riktahastastunopeyādrājānaṃ devatāṃ guruṃ |
phalapuṣpāṃvarādīni yathā śaktyā samarcayet ||

gurvagreṇa tapaḥ kuryānna snāyādātma śuddhaye |
na laṃghayed gurorājñāmuttaraṃ na vadettathā ||

apriyaṃ ca tathā kāle kāmakrodhau viśeṣataḥ |
nāpracchannamukhodrūyāguroragre kadācana ||

advaitaṃ devapūjāṃ ca guroragre parityajet |
pādukāyogapaṭṭādi gurucihnāni sādaraṃ ||

na laṃghayet spṛśennaiva tatsamakṣaṃ na dhārayet |
paryyaṃkaśayanaṃ tadvattathāpāda prasarpaṇaṃ ||

aṃgaṃ bhaṃgaṃ ca līlāṃ ca na kuryād gurusannidhau |
chāyāṃ na laṃghayet tasya gacchenna purato guroḥ ||

na kurvīta guroragre prabhāvaṃ śiṣyasaṃgrahaṃ |
ahaṃkāraṃ na kūrvīta nollakṣaṇaṃ dhārayed vapuḥ ||

jātāmāyā yadi braṃśe śapathaṃ gurusaṃjñitaṃ |
na kuryācchivasaṃjñaṃ vā pramādena kriyeta cet ||

tadarthaṃ nirvahedyatnādaṃte pūjājapājapāhutī |
anirvāhetu kāryasya yadarthaṃ śapathaḥ kṛtaḥ ||

prāyaścittaṃ manoḥ kuryānmūlākhyasya sahasrakaṃ |
na niyogaṃ gurordadyādyuṣmadānābhibhāṣayet ||

śrīnāthadevasvāmīti vodhane bhāṣaṇe vadet |
ṛṇadānaṃ tathā dānaṃ vastūnāṃ krayavikrayaṃ ||

na kuryādgurubhissārddhaṃ śiṣyobhūṣṇuḥ kadācana |
guroḥ saṃnihitedyastu pūjayedanyamamvike ||

<p. 53b>

sayāti narakaṃ ghoraṃ pūjā sā viphalā bhavet |
yasmin dravye gurorasti spṛhānānu bhavecca tat ||

avaśyaṃ yadi vāṃchāsyādanu bhūyāt tadājñayā |
atyalpaṃ hi gurordravyemaddattaṃ svīkarotiyaḥ ||

tiraścāṃ yonimāpannaḥ kravyādairbhakṣyatetriye |
gurudravyālāṣī ca gurustrīgamanotsukaḥ ||

patitaḥ syānna saṃdehaḥ prāyaścittannavidyate |
guruḥsthānaṃ saṃpradāyaṃ taddharmaṃ yonicārayet ||

gurubhiḥ sa vahiḥ kāryodaṃḍyovadhyaśca pātakī |
pādukāmāsanaṃ vastraṃ vāhanaṃ chatracāmaraiḥ ||

dṛṣṭvā gurornamaskuryānnatadbhogāya kalpayet |
uktānukteṣu kāryeṣu nopekṣāṃ kārayet priye ||

sadasadya gururvrūyāttat kāryamaviśaṃkayā |
brahmahatyāśataṃ kṛtvā gurvājñāṃ paripālayet ||

nigrahenugrahe vāpi guruḥ sarvasyakāraṇaṃ |
nirgataṃ yadgurorvakrāt tatsarvaṃ śāstramucyate ||

ājñābhaṃgorthaharaṇaṃ gurora priyavartanaṃ |
gurudrohamidaṃ prodgaryaḥ kuryāt sa tu pātakī ||

na viśedāsanedevi devatā gurusannidhau |
jātividyādhanāḍhyo vā dūradṛṣṭvā guruṃ mudā ||

abhimāno na kartavyo jāti (*)(?) vidhanādibhiḥ |
tatpāpaṃ samavāpnoti gurvagre nṛtabhāṣaṇāt ||

gobrāhmaṇavadhaṃ kṛtvā na tatpāpamavāpnuyāt |
daṇḍapraṇāṃaṃ kṛtvaikaṃ triḥpradakṣiṇamācaret ||

gurustadguruyoge tu vaṃdeta praguruṃ priye |
tato namedguruṃ sopi gurvagre tannivārayet ||

praguroḥ sannidhau śiṣyaḥ svaguruṃ manamānayet |
guruktaṃ paruṣaṃ vākye māśiṣaṃ cintayeddhṛdi ||

tena saṃtāḍito vāpi prasādamiti saṃsmaret |
bhogyayogyāni vastuni gurave sarvamarpayet ||

taccheṣamiti saṃciṃtya grāhyaṃ tasyājñayāmudā |
ekākṣarapradātāraṃ yo guruṃtvavamanyate ||

saśca yoniṃ śataṃ gatvā cāṇḍālatvamavāpnuyāt |
guraumanuṣyabuddhiṃ ca maṃtrevākṣarasemuniṃ ||

pratimāyāṃ śilāṃ buddhiṃ kurvāṇo narake vrajet |
guruśaktiśca tatputro tajyeṣṭhaśca guruḥ samaḥ ||

ātmavaccakanīyāṃ saḥ putravat paripālakāḥ ||

atha dakṣiṇācāramāha |

śrīdevyuvāca |

asmin ghore kaliyuge svalpa siddhyatidarpitāḥ |
bhaviṣyaṃjanāsteṣāṃ sthirasiddhiḥ kathaṃ bhavet ||

agrevaṃśādivṛddhiśca vaṃśedevakṛpā tathā |
mokṣaḥ kathaṃ sādhakasya tathāvada kṛpānidhe ||

<p. 54a>

īśvara uvāca |

ahaṃkāra parityāgāt kāmyakarmavivarjatān |
svadharmāccaraṇāt sarvaṃ manāyāsena jāyate ||

etat kartumaśaktaścenniṣiddhaṃ tu parityajet |
vihitaṃ karmakurvīta siddhiḥ syāt putrapautrikī ||

tatrādau kathayiṣyāmi niṣiddhaṃ viddhinā saha |
devasthāne gurusthāne śmaśāne ca catuṣpathe || 

pādukāsanaviṇmūtramaithunāni vivarjayet |
dhanyago gurudevāgni kośapustaka saṃmukhaṃ ||

naiva prasātayelpādau na caitāni vilaṃghayet |
ālasya madanaṃ mohaśāpapaiśūnya vigrahān ||

asūyāmātsasaṃmānaṃ paraniṃdāṃ ca varjayet |
liṃginaṃ vratinaṃ vipraṃ vedavedāṃga saṃhitāḥ ||

purāṇāgaśāstrāṇi kalpāṃścāpi na dūṣayet |
yugaṃ kuśalamaśmānaṃdāmabuhrīmulūkhalaṃ ||

sūryaṃ saṃmārjanaṃ daṇḍaṃ dhvajaṃ vai tūryamāyudhaṃ |
kalaśaṃ cāmaraṃ chatraṃ darpaṇaṃ bhūṣaṇaṃ tathā ||

bhogabhogyāni cānyāniyāgra dravyāṇi yāni ca |
mahāsthāneṣu vastūniyāni vā devatālaye ||

divyoktāni padārthāni bhūtā viṣṭāniyāni vai |
laṃghayejjānu naitāni na caitāni yadā spṛśet ||

yā goṣṭīlokavidviṣṭāyā vatsvairavisarpiṇī |
parahiṃsātmikāyā ca na tāmavataret kvacit ||

pratigrahaṃ na gṛhnīyādātma bhogavidhitsayā |
devatātithi pūjārthaṃ yatnatoppūrjayeddhanaṃ ||

vibhītakakaraṃjārkāsnuhīcchāyāṃ na laṃghayet |
staṃbhadīpamanuṣyāṇāmanyeṣāṃ prāṇināṃ tathā ||

nakhāgrakeśanirddhūtasnānavastra paṭhodakaṃ |
etat sparśaṃ tyajeddūraṃ kharaśvājalajastathā ||

liṃgasthānaṃ ca nirmālyaṃ nādhyānnaiva ca laṃghayet |
nadyāṃ pravāhayet sarvaṃ dadyādvā śivadīkṣite ||

lokodvegakarīyā ca yā ca marma nikṛṃtinī |
sthityudvegakarīyā ca tāṃgiraṃ naiva bhāṣayet ||

ramyamapyujjvalamapi manasopi samīpsitaṃ |
lokavidveṣaṇaṃ veṣaṃ na gṛhnīyāt kadācana ||

taṃtroktān samayācārānaihi kāmuṣṃikocitān |
ācarannādaracchiddhiṃ dīkṣitaḥ sodhigacchati ||

sāmānyasiddhaurakṣārthaṃ pareṣāṃ na kadācana |
prayoktavyaḥ svasya maṃtro mahāpadyapi sādhakaiḥ ||

<p. 54b>

yatra yatra parīvādo mātsaryācchrūyate guroḥ |
tatra tatra na vastravyaṃ pramādāt saṃsmareddhariṃ ||

viṣṇoḥ śivasya śāstrasya vedasyārka gaṇeśayoḥ |
bhavānyā vā yatra niṃdā tasmiṃnsthāne vasetana ||

karmaṇā manasā vācā na hiṃset paradārakān |
sa dīkṣite namokāryaḥ śāpānugrahakarmaṇi ||

na tena maṃtro vaktavyo mudrā vā samayā api |
siddhamaṃtrasya kartavyaṃ trividhaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||

nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kāmyaṃ tatrādau nitya mucyate |
devaguruṃ gurusthānaṃ kṣetraṃ kṣetrādhi devatāḥ ||

siddhān siddhādhivāsāṃśca śrīpūrvaṃ samudīrayet |
dhārayedārjavaṃ satyaṃ sauśīlyaṃ samatāṃ ghṛtiḥ ||

śāṃtirdayāmavasthāṃ ca divyāṃ śaktiṃ ca sarvadā |
gamanāgamanaṃ kuryāt praṇamya gurupāduke ||

paścāt pādena nirgaccht praṇamya ca gurorgṛhāt |
malamūkādirahitaḥ keśaśmaśruviluṃvanāt ||

somasūryāṃtarasthaṃ ca gavāśvatthādi madhyagāṃ |
bhāvayeddevatāṃ viṣṇuṃ guruvipra śarīriṇāṃ ||

maṃtraguptiśca kartavyā satataṃ maṃtrasiddhaye |
gurornāma na gṛhnīyādvadeśavaśyaketviti ||

oṃ śrīpūrvaṃ gurornāmadevanāma taduttaraṃ |
pādaśabda sametoyaṃ na ta mūrddhvāṃjalīyutaḥ ||

jasaṃtaṃ ca dadennāmatithyarṇaṃ ca hareryama |
ayaṃ ca dakṣiṇācāraḥ kathitaḥ parameśvarī ||

atha kulācāramāha |

atha vakṣye kulācāramārge śāstrārthanirṇayaṃ |
kaulikānāṃ kule jāto jyeṣṭho yadi na dīkṣitaḥ ||

kaniṣṭho dīkṣitaścet syāt sakuryāt kulapūjanaṃ |
pūjāṃte śeṣamādāya jyeṣṭhaṃ natvā nivedayet ||

tasyocchiṣṭaṃ tu gṛhnīyāt kaniṣṭa iti nirṇayaḥ |
pūjā madhye guraujyeṣṭhe pūjye vāpi samāgate ||

na svāvrūyāt sthitiṃ śeṣaṃ mācaret tadanujñayā |
nityārcanaṃ divākuryādrātrau naimittikārcanaṃ ||

kāmyārcanaṃ proktakāle vahavo yatrasaṃgatāḥ |
natvā svasvaguruṃ tatra svasvamārgeṇa tarpayet ||

vināśanaṃ vinā snāna gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatānvinā |
vinā madyaṃ vinā māṃsaṃ kulapūjāṃ na kārayet ||

na kuryāt pralayaṃ bhuktvā vinā maṃtre pūjanaṃ |
śaktyā vinā tathā pānamekahastena nārcayet ||

śrīcakramekonokuryādekapātre ca nārcayet |
napi vedekahastena cakreniṣṭīvanaṃ na ca ||

<p. 55a> 

praṇamya praviśeccakraṃ vinirgacchet praṇamya ca |
śrīcakraṃ nāsane tiṣṭennā ca vīrāsane kvacit ||

śrīcakradarśanaṃ nṝṇāṃ netrayoḥ pāpanāśanaṃ |
tannāsti cedvraṇī dvaṃdvaṃ kaulikasyākṣi yugmakaṃ ||

anācārāt sadācārāṃścakrasthān śaktitaulikān |
śivagaurīdhiyāsarvān bhāvayennāvamānayet ||

kulācāryagṛhaṃ gatvā bhaktyā pāpaviśuddhaye |
yācayedamṛtaṃ vānnaṃ tadabhāve jalaṃ pibet ||

kulācāryeṇa vecchaktyādattaṃ pātraṃ tu bhaktitaḥ |
namaskṛtya pragṛhnīyādanyathā narakaṃ vrajet ||

uṣṇīṣī kaṃcukī nagno muktakeśaśca uktavān |
asnātonāti bhaktaśca vivādī ca parāṅmukhaḥ ||

nedaṃ yasya kule jātaṃ yaśca saṃskāramādvijaḥ |
vedādhyāyī kuladravyasevanānnirddhano bhavet ||

yogāmṛtasya niṣṭīvānmadyabhāṇḍa paribhramāt |
ūrddhvanālenapānācca devatāśāpa māpnuyāt ||

ekāsane niviṣṭāye bhuṃjānāścaikabhājane |
ekapātre pivaṃto yetaṃ yāṃti narakaṃ sadā ||

ye sevaṃte kuladravye mekagrāmasthite gurau |
tat kulejñe ca tatputre svahyeṣṭha kuladeśike ||

vinānujñāṃ sa pāpātmā rauravaṃ nirayaṃ vrajet |
paṭhanaṃ dharmaśāstrasyahya kulastrī niṣevanaṃ ||

śrautakarmasyācaraṇaṃ śrotriyāṇāṃ ca saṃgatiḥ |
kāmārthāyuryaśolobhojñānasaukhyādināśakaṃ ||

ripuṇāpi na kartavyo vāgvādaścakra madhyataḥ |
pitṛmātṛsamaṃ paśyettenoktaṃ puruṣaṃ mahet ||

śrīguruṃ kulaśāstrāṇi pūjyasthānāni yāni ca |
bhaktyā śrīpūrvakaṃ vidvān praṇamya parikīrtayet ||

pāraṃparyāgamāmnāya maṃtra cārādikaṃ tathā |
sarvaṃ guru kulālladhvaṃ saphalaṃ syānnavānyathā ||

śrīśāstraṃ pūjayennityaṃ paśugehena niḥkṣipet ||

svadāravanniṣeveta kulaśāstrāṇi sarvaṇi varjayet paradāravat ||

saṃskārārthaṃ chinnabhinnā vyastavarṇāṃśca vaidikāṃn |
maṃtrān paṭhen saṃpradāyāttaiḥ syādatravyavasthitiḥ ||

dharmaśāstraviruddhoya ācāraḥ sa tu kaulikaḥ |
cakreṇākārayedetā daivāt prāptāḥ prapūjayet ||

gamanaṃ naiva kurvīta kṛtvā nirayamāpnuyāt |
mātaraṃ gurupatnīṃ ca bhaginīṃ bhaginīsutāṃ ||

bhrātṛjāyāṃ vīrabhāryāṃ kumārīṃ vratadhāriṇīṃ |
vyaṃgāṃgīṃ vikṛtāṃgīṃ cakṣudhāṃ prītāṃ samāhṛtāṃ ||

<p. 55b>

srūyāṃ sakṛtkāmagatāṃ vṛddhāṃ naivāmanoharāṃ |
manoharāṃ yauvanasthāṃ suveṣāṃ cāruhāsinīṃ ||

raktāṃta nayanāṃ śyāmāṃ pūjayet kaulikāṃgaṇāṃ |
akasmācca na seveta balena kulayoginīṃ ||

cakramadhye svyaṃ kṣudhāṃ vāstvataḥ prārthinīṃ bhavet |
āmaṃ māṃsaṃ surākuṃbhaṃ mattebhaṃ siddhadarśanaṃ ||

sahakāramaśokaṃ ca krīḍāṃ lubdhāṃ kumārikāṃ |
ekavṛkṣaṃ śmaśānaṃ ca samūhaṃ yoṣitāmapi ||

nārīṃ ca raktavasanāṃ dṛṣṭvā vaṃdeta bhaktitaḥ |
guruśaktisuto jyeṣṭhaḥ kaniṣṭhaḥ kuladeśikān ||

kuladarśana śāstrāṇi kuladravyāṇi kauikān |
prerakāt sūcakāṃścāpi vācakān darśakāṃstathā || 

śikṣakān vodhakān yogiyoginī siddhapūrūṣān |
kanyāḥ kumārikānagnā unmattānapi yoṣitaḥ || 

naniṃdenna jugupsetanahasennā ca mānayet |
nāpriyaṃ nānṛtaṃ brūyāt kasyāpi (*)(?) kuyoginaḥ ||

kurūpe sati kṛṣṇeti na niṃde kulayoṣitaṃ |
parikṣayennabhaktānāṃ vīrāṇāṃ ca kṛtā kṛte ||

na paśyet patitāṃ nagnāmunmattā prakaṭastanīṃ |
na divāsevayennārīṃ tadyoniṃ na nirīkṣayet ||

striyaṃśatāparādhāṃ vā puṣpeṇāpi na tāḍayet |
doṣāṃ na gaṇayet strīṇāṃ guṇāneva prakāśayet ||

tiṣṭhaṃti kulayoginyaḥ kulavṛkṣeṣu sarvadā |
tatpatreṣu na bhoktavyamarkapatre viśeṣataḥ ||

na svayet kulavṛkṣādho na copadravamācaret |
dṛṣṭvā bhaktyā namaskuryācchedayenna kadācana ||

śleṣyāṃtakakaraṃjākṣaniṃvāśvattha kadaṃvakāḥ |
vilvovaṭoḍuṃvarau ca viṃcāveti daśasmṛtāḥ ||

prāyaścittaṃ bhṛgoḥ pātaḥ saṃnyāsaṃ vratadhāraṇaṃ |
tīrthayātrādigamanaṃ kaule paṃcavivarjayet ||

aṃhaḥ kaulaṃ vahiḥ śaivaṃ janamadhye tu vaiṣṇavaṃ |
kaulaṃ tu gopayeddevi nārikela phalāṃvuvat ||

guruṃ prakāśayeddhīmān maṃtraṃ yatnena gopayet |
aprakāśaḥ prakāśābhyāṃ kṣīyate saṃpadāyuṣaṃ ||

sarvācāra paribhraṣṭaḥ kulācāraṃ samāśrayet |
kulācāra paribhraṣṭo rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

vāmācāraṃ tu kathayeda kulīnāma sadguruḥ |
ācārāt patitaḥ śiṣye pātakī sagururbhavet ||

<p. 56a>

sarvabhūtahiteraktaḥ samayācārapālakaḥ |
anityakarma saṃtyāgī nityānuṣṭāna tatparaḥ ||

parasyāṃ devatāyāṃ tu sarvakarmanivedakaḥ |
anyamaṃtrārcanaḥ śraddhāmanyamaṃtrasyapūjanaṃ ||

kulastrī vīraniṃdāṃ ca taddravyasyāpahāraṇaṃ |
strīmayaṃ ca jagatsarvaṃ svayaṃtāvattathā bhavet ||

peyaṃ carvaṃ tathā coṣyaṃ bhakṣyaṃ lehyaṃ gṛhaṃ sukhaṃ |
sarvaṃ ca yuvatīrūpaṃ bhāvayedyatamānasaḥ ||

striyodevāstriyaḥ prāṇāḥ striya eva hi bhūṣaṇaṃ |
strīsaṃgiṇā sadābhāvyamanyathā svastriyāmapi ||

taddhastāvucitaṃ puṣpaṃ taddhasta gṛhitaṃ jalaṃ |
taddhastaracitaṃ bhojyaṃ devatābhyo nivedayet ||

kulajāṃ yuvatīṃ vīkṣya namaskuryāt samāhitaḥ |
yadi bhāgyavaśenaiva kuladṛṣṭistu jāyate ||

tadaiva mānasīṃ pūjāṃ tadā tāsāṃ prakalpayet |
vālāṃ vā yauvanonmattāṃ vṛddhāṃ vā suṃdarīṃ tathā ||

kutsitvāṃ vā mahāduṣṭāṃ namaskṛtya vibhāvayet |
tāsāṃ prahāraṃ niṃdāṃ ca kauṭilyamapriyaṃ tathā ||

sarvathā na ca kartavyamanya siddhi (*)(?) rodhakṛt |
gocarmasthaṃ yathākṣīraṃ na peyaṃ syādvijottamaiḥ ||

tathā paśumukhāddharmo na śrotavyastu kaulikaiḥ |
asaṃskāraṃ pibeddravyaṃ valotkāreṇa maithunaṃ ||

svahastena paśuṃ hatvā rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet |
vīrahatyā vṛthāpānaṃ vīradravyāpahāraṇaṃ ||

vīrastrīgamanaṃ caiva tatsaṃyogastu paṃcamaḥ |
mahāpātakamityuktaṃ kaulikānāṃ kulāgame ||

śṛṇu putrarahasyaṃ me samayācāra saṃbhavaṃ |
yena hīnā na siddhyaṃti janmakoṭi sahasraśaḥ ||

manavaḥ kulaśāstrāṇāṃ kulacaryānuyāyināṃ |
udāracittaḥ sarvatra vaiṣṇavācāra tatparaḥ ||

paraniṃdā sahiḥṣṇuḥ syāddupakārarataḥ sadā |
parvate vipine vāpi nirjane śūnyamaṃḍape ||

catuṣpathe jale śūnye yadi daivādgatirbhavet |
kṣaṇaṃ dhyātvā manuṃjatvā natvā gacchedyathā mukhaṃ ||

gṛddhaṃ vīkṣya mahākālīṃ namaskuryādalakṣitaḥ |
kṣemaṃkarīṃ tathā vīkṣyajaṃvukīṃ yamadūtikāṃ ||

kuraṃgaṃśyenaṃbhūkākau kṛṣṇamārjārameva ca |
kṛśodarī mahācaṇḍe muktakeśī valipriye ||

kulācāra prasannāsyenamaste śaṃkarapriye |
śmaśānasthaṃ śavaṃ dṛṣṭvā pradakṣiṇa manuṃsmaran ||

praṇamyānena maṃtreṇamaṃtrī sukhamavāpnuyāt |
ghoradaṃṣṭrekarālāsyekiṭiśabda praṇādivi ||

<p. 56b>

ghoraghoraravāsphāla namaste citivāsini |
raktavastraṃ tathā puṣpaṃ rājānaṃ rājaputrakaṃ ||

hastyaścarathaśastrāṇi phalakān vīrapuruṣān |
mahiṣaṃ kulanāthaṃ ca dṛṣṭvā mahiṣamarddinī ||

praṇamya jayadurgāṃ vāsa ca vighnairnalipyate |
jayadevī jagaddhātrī tripure ca tridaivate ||

bhaktebhyo varade devi mahiṣaghnī namostute |
madyabhāṃḍaṃ samālokya matsyaṃ māṃsaṃ varastriyaṃ ||

dṛṣṭvā ca bhairavīṃ devī praṇamya vivṛṣenmanuṃ |
ghoravighnavināśāya kulācāra samṛddhaye ||

namāmi varade devī muṇḍamālā vibhūṣite |
raktadhārā samākīrṇe varadetvānnamāmyahaṃ ||

sarvavighnaharedevi namaste varavallabhe |
eteṣāṃ darśane naiva yadi daivānna kurvate ||

śaktimaṃtraṃ puraskṛtya tasya siddhirnnajāyate |
vedaśāstrapurāṇāni spaṣṭā veśyāṃganā iva ||

eyaṃ tu śāṃbhavī vidyāṃ guptā kulavadhūriva |
suguptāṃ kaulikācāra manu gṛhnaṃti devatāṃ ||

vāṃchā siddhiṃ prayacchaṃti nāśayaṃti prakāśanāt |
kulapuṣpaṃ kuladravyaṃ kulapūjāṃ kulaṃ japaṃ || 

guruṃ kulapatiṃ cāpi kulamālī kulākulaṃ |
kulacakraṃ kuladhyānaṃ sarvathā na prakāśayet ||

prakāśāt siddhihāniḥ syāt prakāśādvaṃdhanādikaṃ |
prakāśādvalahāniḥ syāt prakāśāddevahiṃsanaṃ ||

prakāśān mṛtyulābhaḥ syānna prakāśyaṃ kadācana |
pūjākālena maheśāni yadikopyatra gacchati ||

darśayedvaiṣṇavīṃ mudrāṃ viṣṇunyāsaṃstathāstavaṃ |
kadācidaṃgahāniḥsyānna ca vyaktaḥ kadācana ||

paraṃ pūjā na kartavyā na ca vyaktiḥ kadācana |
aṃtaḥ śāktā vahiḥ śaivāḥ sabhāryā vaiṣṇavāmatāḥ ||

nānārūpadharāvīrāvicaraṃti mahītale |
dakṣiṇākhyaṃ kulācāraṃ kathitaṃ tava suvrate ||

na kasmaicit pravaktavyaṃ yadīcchet priyamātmanaḥ |
atha vāmakulamārgādhikāritā vivekamāha ||

vakṣyetha prakaṭaṃ dharmaṃ kaulikānāṃ ca vāmanī |
ihaloke paratrāpiyaṃ kṛtvā sukhamāpnuyāt ||

brāhmaṇyaṃ svasya viprastu samyajñātvā samāviśet |
vāmamārgetha vā kaule tatrāpi ca na laṃghayet ||

<p. 57a>

svasvavarṇā samācāraṃ na kuryāt tatpratigrahaṃ |
parastrī dhananiṃdā ca vedaśāstrādi niṃdanaṃ ||

anigrahaṃ cendriyāṇāṃ vacanaṃ guruviprayoḥ |
saṃgaḥ sarvātmanātyājyoguptastiṣṭedguruṃ vinā ||

satsaṃgaśca vivekaśca niścalaṃ nayanadvayaṃ |
yasya nāsti naraḥ soṃdhaḥ kathaṃ vāme sukhaṃ labhet ||

saṃsārikaḥ sukhaṃ proktaṃ vrahmajñosmītivādinaṃ |
karmabhaṃgo bhayabhraṣṭaṃtaṃ tyajedetyajaṃ yathā ||

madyaṃmāṃsaṃ surāpānaṃ matsyāḥ strīṇāṃdhavāstathā |
anekā yatra jāyaṃte tatra vāmo gatipradaḥ ||

sthitvā tu dakṣiṇemārge guptaṃ bhuṃktye palādikaṃ |
sa yāti narakaṃ ghoraṃ viṣṭhāyāṃ jāyate kṛmiṃ ||

vinā valiṃ palāṃ bhuṃktye vinā pūjāṃ surāṃ pibet |
dūtīyajñaṃ vinā gacchet striyaṃ vāmyapi nārakī ||

avudhvā samayācāraṃ kuladharmaṃ caredyadi |
sa guruścaiva śiṣyaśca yoginīnāṃ bhavetyaśuḥ ||

vāmamārgamajānāti mūḍhātmāmokṣamicchati |
pārāvāramapāraṃ sa vāhubhyāṃ tartumicchati ||

sarvakarmavihīnāye varṇāśrama vivarjitāḥ |
kaule vā vāmamārgaṃ te bhuktimukteścabhājanaṃ ||

niṃdaṃ tu vāṃdhavāḥ sarvetyajaṃ tu strī sutādayaḥ |
janāhasaṃtumāṃ dṛṣṭvā rājānodaṇḍadyaṃ tu vā ||

rogadāridrya duḥkhādyaiḥ pīḍitopyaniśaṃ tvahaṃ |
lakṣmīstiṣṭatu vā yātu na muṃcāmiparthatvidaṃ ||

evaṃ yasya dṛḍhā bhaktiḥ sa vāme siddhimāpnuyāt |
nārthalābhānna ca krodhānnaḍheṣānna ca matsarān ||

na kāmānna bhayādvāpimārgaṃ prāptaṃ parityajet |
pratyahaṃ nārcayeddevīṃ mārgesmin vighnamāpnuyāt ||

gurukāruṇya saṃpūto dehanirddhūtakalpaṣaḥ |
kulapūjārato yastu soyaṃ kaulo navetaraḥ ||

parokṣeko na jānīte kasya kiṃ ca bhaviṣyati |
yadvai pratyakṣaphaladaṃ tadevottamadarśanaṃ ||

gurūpadeśa nihitā mahāṃtā iti kecana |
mohayaṃti janān kecit svayaṃ pūrvaṃ vimohitāḥ ||

peyaṃ madyaṃ laṃ khādyaṃ samālokya priyāmukhaṃ |
ityevā caraṇaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ paramāḥ pravadaṃti ca ||

madyapānena manujo yadi siddhiṃ labheta cet |
madyapānaratāḥ sarve saṃsiddhāna bhavetyume ||

māṃsabhakṣaṇamātreṇa yadi puṇyāgatirbhavet |
kravyādānāṃ tadā mokṣo māṃsādanyannabhuṃjate ||

strīsaṃbhogena bhodevī yadi mokṣobhi jāyate |
tadā sarvepi muktāḥ syuḥkasyajanma bhaviṣyati ||

kṛpāṇadhārāgamanādvyāghrakarṇāvalaṃvanāt |
bhujaṃgadhāraṇānnūnamaśakyaṃ kulavartmanaḥ ||

<p. 57b>

vṛthāpānaṃ tu deveśi surāpānamihocyate |
tanmahāpātakaṃ jñeyaṃ vedādiṣu nirūpitaṃ ||

anāṃghre ca mavālokyamanāścādyamapeyakaṃ |
madyaṃ māṃsaṃ paśūnāṃ tu kaulikānāṃ mahat phalaṃ ||

amedhyāni dvijātīnāṃ madyānyekādaśaiva hi |
dvādaśāṃ tu surāmadyaṃ sarveṣāmuttamaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

tasmād brāhmaṇa rājanyau vaiśyaśca na surāṃ pibet |
surādarśanamātreṇa kuryāt sūryāvalokanaṃ ||

tasya saṃsargamātreṇa prāṇāyāma trayaṃ caret |
ājānubhyāṃ bhavet snānaṃ nābhyāmupavasedahaḥ ||

uddhanoce strirātraṃ tu madyasya sparśane vidhiḥ |
surāpāne kāmakṛte jvalaṃtītāṃ prave (**) (?) t ||

mukhe tayā vinirddagdhetacchuddhiṃ samavāpnuyāt |
avidhānena yohanyādātmārthe prāṇinaḥ priye ||

nivasennarakeghore dināni paśuromabhiḥ |
samitāni durācārastiryagyoniṣu jāyate ||

(**) (?) cāpya vidhānena chedayenna kadācana |
vidhivadgāṃdvijaṃ vāpi hatyāpāpairnalipyate ||

sarvebhyaḥ kaulikaḥ śreṣṭhastūrdhvāmnāyī ca vāgamaḥ |
adhikārī bhaktiyuktoyaścamadguru sevakaḥ ||

sa eva kauliko vaṃdya itaremadyapānatāḥ |
smaraṇaṃ kīrtanaṃ tasya darśanaṃ vaṃdanaṃ tathā ||

saṃbhāṣaṇaṃ ca kurute rājasūyādhikaṃ phalaṃ |
sa yatra vasate devāstatra śrīvijayo bhavet ||

(***********) (##?)
dṛṣṭve dṛśaṃ ca praṇamedanyairvarjyaḥ sadūrataḥ ||

pūrvāmnāyaḥ sṛṣṭirūpaḥ sthitirūpaṃ tu dakṣiṇaḥ |
saṃhāraḥ paścimāmnāya uttarenugraho bhavet ||

maṃtrayogaṃ viduḥ pūrvaṃ bhaktiyogaṃ tu dakṣiṇaṃ |
paścimaṃ karmayogaṃ tu jñānayogaṃ tathottaraṃ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau dakṣiṇādyācāranirṇayo nāma dvādaśaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 
12 ||

atha śyāmādi pratyekavidyāyāṃ viśiṣya maṃtrasiddhyaikakāraṇaṃ mahānīlādi 
kramamāha || 

devyuvāca |

deveśaśrotumicchāmi rahasyāti rahasyakaṃ |
daśavidyādikādevaṃ daśavaidyekramāḥ prabhoḥ ||

puraivakathitā svāmintaṃ kramaṃ vada saṃprati ||

śiva uvāca ||

rahasyāti rahasyaṃ ca kathyate tava bhaktitaḥ |
mahānīla krameṇaiva kālikā siddhidāyinī ||

mahānīlakramo devī dvividhā parikīrtitaḥ |
sakalo niṣkalaścetitaṃ kramaṃ śṛṇu pārvatī ||

<p. 58a> 

khaḍgahastaśiranyasta sarvadā muktakuṃtalaḥ |
sadāmāṃsāsavollāsa vijayāghūrṇalocanaḥ ||

siṃdūratilakaṃ bhālepāṇau tu madirārasaṃ |
na karoti naro yastu sa kathaṃ mama pūjakaḥ ||

rātrau paryaṭanaṃ caiva rātrau śakteḥ prapūjanaṃ |
na karoti naro yastu sa kathaṃ mamapūjakaḥ ||

yoni cuṃvanakaṃ karmaśakterāliṃganaṃ tathā |
na karoti naro yastu sakathaṃ mama pūjakaḥ ||

tāṃbūlaṃ yonicakraṃ ca muṇḍamālā śavāśanaṃ |
siṃdūraṃ khaḍgakaṃ caiva saṃvidā savayorasaṃ ||

etāṃvihāyayaḥ kaścit kālīṃ sādhitumudyataḥ |
ihakṣobhamavāpnoti paratra narakaṃ vrajet ||

komurvudayugairdevi na hi siddhyatitāriṇī |
siṃdūraviṃdubhūyugme svayaṃbhū munipatrakaṃ ||

raktacaṃdanajaṃ vāpi tripuṇḍraṃ ca tatopari |
kurvandalekajjalasya viṃdurdeyo maheśvari ||

mahānīla kramedevi tilakaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
śmaśānaśāyī māṃsāsī saṃvidā naṃdamānasaḥ ||

striyaṃ paśyan pṛśan gacchan sarvakālaṃ japaṃ caret |
veśyārataḥ śmaśānastho mṛducūḍaka saṃyutaḥ ||

daṃtākṣamālayādevi rājadaṃtena meruṇā |
mālāṃ kṛtvā japeddevi sadā tāṃbūlacarvakaḥ ||

kapālapātrasaṃpūjā vīrasādhana tatparaḥ |
kapālamālābharaṇo rāmācuṃvana tatparaḥ ||

śaktyānaṃdo netrayugaṃ mukhehālāṃ gṛhāṃgaṇe |
veśyā vālākare mālāśaktilolābhagāṃvuje ||

yonisaṃ cuṃvanaṃ kṛtvā sarvakālaṃ japaṃ kare |
śaktyudbhavāna saṃkāryaḥ sarvametaccarācaraṃ ||

avicārī prahṛṣṭātmāstrībhakto vijiteṃdriyaḥ |
īdṛgvidho naro devī mahānīla kramomataḥ ||

rājadaṃtamayī mālādviradoṣṭrāśca saṃbhavāḥ |
asaktānāṃ niṣkalaḥ syāttaṃ kramaṃ śṛṇu pārvatī ||

pītayādugdhakaṃ pītvā saccidānaṃdamānasaḥ |
sphāṭikīmālikāṃ kṛtvā vihāre japamācaret ||

dikkāla niyamonāstisthityādi niyamo na ca |
na japekāla niyamo mahāmaṃtrasya sādhane ||

yasmin maṃtre sadācārastatra dharmastu tādṛśaḥ |
bhrāṃtistatra na kartavyā svargo vā mokṣa eva ca ||

mṛdukomalakaṃ devi cūḍakaṃ vātha cūḍakaṃ |
śarvavīrāsanaṃ kṛtvā yonitogāsanaṃ ca vā ||

<p. 58b>

kāmarūpāsanaṃ devī muratāsanameva ca |
siṃdūrāsanakaṃ devī parvatāsanameva ca ||

sarovarāsanaṃ ceti tilapuṣpe cakhaṃ jayaṃ |
caṃdraviṃvaṃ sarpiṇī ca cuṃvanāsanameva ca ||

prayāgāsanakaṃ devī mahāprayāgāsanaṃ tathā |
sparśakhaṭvāsaneceti yoni cuṃvanamāsanaṃ ||

niṣkāsparśāsanaṃ devī vāyuḥ sparśāsanaṃ ca vā |
āśreyāsanakaṃ devī tathā muṇḍāsanaṃ tathā ||

śrīmuṇḍamurataṃ vāpi śrīvīramurataṃ ca vā |
paṃcavīrāsanaṃ devī mureṃdrādi diśāḥ kramāt ||

śrīdevyuvāca |

deveśa śrotumicchāmi mahācīna kramaṃ paraṃ ||

śiva uvāca |

mahācīnakramaṃ devī kathyate sāṃprataṃ mayā |
mahācīna krameṇaiva tārāśīghra phalapradā ||

brahmacīno divyacīno vīracīnastṛtīyakaḥ |
mahācīnonikalaścacīnaḥ paṃcāvidhomataḥ ||

mahācīnaḥ kramāddevī dvividhaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
sakalo niṣkalaśceti sakalovauddhagocaraḥ ||

niṣkalo brāhmaṇānāṃ ca dvitīyaṃ śṛṇu pārvatī |
navadvayaṃ tribhuvane sārātsārataraṃ paraṃ ||

mahācīna kramodevī dvividhaiva prakīrtitaḥ |
tatraiva devadeveśi traiguṇyādbhedabhājanaṃ ||

snānādimānasaṃ śaucaṃ mānasaḥ pravarojapaḥ |
pūjanaṃ mānasaṃ divyaṃ mānasaṃ tarpaṇādikaṃ ||

mānaso niyamo prokto mānasaṃdaṃtadhāvanaṃ |
sarva eva śubhaḥ kālānāśubho vidyate kvacit ||

na viśeṣo divārātrau na saṃdhyāyāṃ mahāniśi |
vastrā īmānasaṃ śaucaṃ dehasparśādivāriṇāṃ ||

śuddhiṃ na kārayedatra nirvikalpaṃ manaścaret |
nātraśuddherapekṣāsti navāmedhyādidūṣaṇaṃ ||

ya evaṃ ciṃtayen maṃtraṃ sarvakāmaḥ samṛddhidaṃ |
gadyapadyamayīvāṇī sabhāyāṃ tasya jāyate ||

tasya darśanamātreṇavādino niḥprabhāmatāḥ |
rājānopi ca dāsatvaṃ bhajaṃti kiṃ pare janāḥ ||

sarvadā pūjayeddevīmasnāta kṛta bhojanaṃ |
mahāniśya śucau deśe valiṃmaṃtreṇa dāpayet ||

strīdveṣo naiva kartavyo viśeṣāt pūjanaṃ striyaḥ |
japasthāne mahāśaṃkhaṃ niveśyorddhe japaṃ caret ||

striyaṃ gacchan pṛśan paśyan yatra kutrāpya cūḍake |
bhuktvā tāṃvūlamanyāṃśca bhakṣa dravyānyathārucīn ||

<p. 59a>

māṃsaṃ matsyaṃ dadhikṣaudraṃ saṃvidāsavadyorasaṃ |
bhuktvānyaśeṣabhakṣyāṇi bhuktvā bhakṣyaṃ carejjapam ||

dikkālaniyamonāsti sthityādi niyamo na ca |
na japekāla niyamo nārcādiṣu valiṣvapi ||

svecchā niyama uktotra mahāmaṃtrasya sādhane |
vallāsanaṃghohadehasparśasparśādivāriṇaḥ ||

tailaṃ saṃlāpya deveśi tāṃvūlaṃ bhakṣayan sadā |
nānāvarāṇi saṃdhāryyadehaṃ vastreṇa mārjayet ||

evaṃ snānaṃ careddevi sarvadā tadgatāśayaḥ |
mahācīna kramodevī viprasnānamidaṃ bhavet ||

śuddhiṃ na cārcayedatra nirvikalpaṃ manaścaret |
sugaṃdhiścetalauhityakusumairaktacaṃdanaiḥ ||

vilvairmaruvakādyaiśca tulasīvarjitaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
varjayed vilvapatraṃ ca manuṃ yatnena varjayet ||

keśān saṃvarddhayeddevī sarvadā tailabhūṣitaḥ |
aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ viśeṣadivasaṃ sadā ||

nādharmo vidyate subhrū kiṃtu dharmo mahān bhavet |
svecchā niyama uktotra pravareddhṛṣṭamānasaḥ ||

kṛtārthaṃ manyamānastu saṃtuṣṭo niyamānasaḥ |
harernāmanagṛhnīṃyānna spṛśet tulasīdalaṃ ||

nānya ciṃtā prakartavyo siddhirdivasamātrataḥ |
anyathā naiva siddhiḥ syāt prajapairapi koṭibhiḥ ||

puraścaraṇa lakṣaiśca homādīnāṃ ca koṭibhiḥ |
brāhmībhūte mahācāre nirvikalpaḥ priyestivai ||

bhrūyugme kuṃḍale devi siṃdūraṃ tatdanaṃtaraṃ |
kucaṃdanaṃ tripuṇḍraṃ ca paṃkajaṃ vāsakeśaraṃ ||

muṇḍamālāgaledhāryā kapālapāṇi saṃgataḥ |
ityācāraparonityaṃ mahācīna kramo bhavet ||

sarvadānaṃda hṛdyaḥ sarvadābhakta sevakaḥ |
karṇanetrāṃtarasthoyaḥ mahāśaṃkhaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

paṃcāśanmaṇibhirmālāgonalebhāsthi saṃbhavā |
mālākuryān maheśāni cāṣṭasiddhīśvaro bhavet ||

saivatārā maheśāni nātrakāryā vicāraṇā |
śivaśaṃkaraviśveśaviśvatārakaśāśvataḥ ||

vedahīnā vaidyadharmāstānkathaṃ brāhmaṇaścaret ||

śiva uvāca ||

sādhudevī mahāprājñe priye sādhaka supriye |
tadbhāvanāśramāyatrastadbhāvamādaret priye ||

yathā śrāddhavidhau devimāṃsaṃ mukhyaṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
kalua tacca niṣiddhaṃ syādbrāhmaṇānāṃ maheśvarī ||

<p. 59b>

ātmārthaṃ vā parārthaṃ vā paśūn hatvā paśurbhavet |
yāvaṃti tasya romāṇitāvadyonimavāpnuyāt ||

tathā tadbhāvanāyāṃ tu na ca doṣosti pārvatī |
sa karastu mayā proktā niṣkalaṃ śṛṇu pārvatī ||

maṇivaṃdhādadhapāṇiṃ pādāṃgulyādadhaḥ śive |
mukhaṃ prakṣālayeddevī cīnasthānamidaṃ bhavet ||

jānubhyāmavanīṃ dhṛtvā bhūmau mastaka mānayet ||
cīnamārge namaskārakīrtitastu mayā tava ||

pūrvakramasya deveśi kramaḥ pratinidhirmayā |
snānadānādikaṃ kṛtvā tathā pūjādikaṃ priye ||

tathā snānaṃ name deho na ca pāmanāstivai |
kiṃ snānaṃ kasyacit snānamasnātaḥ kṛtabhojanaḥ ||

sarvameva hṛdaṃbhojemayi sarvaṃ pratiṣṭhitaṃ ||
mayijñātā maṃtrasiddhirmamadevāvarapradā ||

tejorūpaṃ jagatsarvaṃ tāriṇī tatsvarūpadhṛk |
tattejasīsvasyadehaṃ saṃbhāvyajapamācaret ||

bhāvanā ca śamāpanno bhavedyogī mahākaviḥ |
guḍārdrakarasenaiva surā tu brāhmaṇasya ca ||

tadabhāve jalaṃ devi saṃbhāvya pūjanaṃ caret |
tabhāva hṛdayāsannaḥ sadā tadrajamānasaḥ ||

dvaṃdvabhāvaṃ parityajya sarvasiddhīśvaro bhavet |
brahmā caiva vaśiṣṭaśca tathānye ca ṛṣīśvarāḥ ||

niṣkalaḥ kramamārgeṇa bhajaṃti satataṃ śive |
tārābhaktā maheśāni brahmaṇā parikīrtitāḥ ||

brahmavidyā mahāvidyā sarvatra durlabhākalau |
rahasyāti rahasyaṃ ca goptavyaṃ paśusaṃkaṭe ||

devyuvāca ||

chinnamastāvidhau devakramaṃme vrūhi satvaraṃ ||

śiva uvāca ||

divyacīna krameṇaiva chinnamastā varapradā |
kramadvayaṃ maheśāni pūrvamekaṃ prakāśitaṃ ||

etasyāstilakodevi bhrūmadhye cakracaṃdanaṃ |
tadaṃte rocanāpatre tripuṇḍraṃ divyavarṇakaiḥ ||

śmaśānabhasmaviṃdustu tanmadhye dāpayet priye |
mukhe mukhaṃ pradatvā tu sarvakālaṃ japecchive ||

yonicakraṃ samālocya yatkiṃcit kurute naraḥ |
tattadakṣayamāpnotichinnāvidyā prasādataḥ ||

kālītārā chinnamastā tathā ṣaṭśāṃbhavī śive |
dikkālaniyamo nāsti sthityādi niyamo na hi ||

pātāle kuhare durge parvate taṭinī taṭe |
aṃtarīkṣe tathā bhūmau sarvatra japamācaret ||

<p. 60a>

viśeṣaḥ kathitā devīśakti tatvasya pāvanaṃ ||

devyuvāca |

gaṃdharvākhyaṃ kramaṃ deva kathayasvamayi prabho ||

śiva uvāca |

gaṃdharvākhya krameṇaiva suṃdarī bhuvidurlabhā |
gaṃdharvākhya kramaṃ devi kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ||

bhrūmadhye kuṃkumaṃ devi tadaṃte malayāguru |
aṣṭagaṃdha tripuṇḍrasya madhye kastūrikānvitaṃ ||

sugaṃdhaśvetalauhitya puṣpaiḥ saṃbhūṣito naraḥ |
svastikāṃkita dehastho ratnaprākārasaṃyutaḥ ||

aṣṭagaṃdhasya dhūmena nānāsaugaṃdhyabhūṣitaḥ |
raktamālyāṃvaradharo muktāhāropaśobhitaḥ ||

pūrṇābhiṣeka śirasi tena tatra na muṃḍanaṃ |
keśān saṃvarddhayeddevi saugaṃdhya tailabhūṣitaḥ ||

nānāsaugaṃdhya bhojyaiśca rājayogyai maheśvariḥ |
āyāni saṃgataḥ pūtāḥ kiṃ punarvahnitāpitāḥ ||

sadā coṣṇodakaiḥ snāyāt tadabhāve yathodakaṃ |
gṛhaṃ citraistu saṃcitredarpaṇodarasannibhaṃ ||

vitāna dvajabhūṣāḍhyaṃ ghaṃṭhānādopaśopaśobhitaṃ |
paṃcavāditra saṃyuktaṃ nānāghoṣa samanvitaṃ ||

ataḥ sūkṣmāṃ varairyuktaḥ svarṇapātrādi raṃjibhiḥ |
graiveyavalayāṃgulyabhūṣaṇaiḥ bhūṣitaḥ sadā ||

nānāmadhurabhojyaiśca dugdhapākairanekakaiḥ |
nānābhogenasaṃyukto gaṃdharvākhyaḥ kramo bhavet ||

iti saṃkṣepataḥ proktaṃ bhairavākhyaṃ śṛṇu kramaṃ |
svapuṣpaiḥ kramayogena bhairavī bhuvi durlabhā ||

svapuṣpākhyaḥ kramodevi kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ |
taruṇī suṃdarī ramyāṃ tāruṇyāmṛtavigrahāṃ ||

sadāratausābhilāṣāṃ maithunodyatamānasaṃ |
maṃtrayaṃtra samāyuktāṃ samāyuktāṃ maheśvarī ||

nagnāṃtāṃ ca vihāyādau svayaṃ nagno japaṃ caret |
parasparālokanaṃ ca kartavyaṃ ca parasparaṃ ||

avikārāṃ yadā devī sādhanārhonacānyathā |
vikāre bhāvanāne ca sādhako naśyati kṣaṇāt ||

tat kuṃḍaṃ ca maheśāni kṣaṇādvikarṣitaṃ bhavet |
tathāpi svasya dehasya vikāraṃ na hi kārayet ||

sāpi ceddevadeveśi savikārī yathā bhavet |
puṣpiṇī manunādevi palātpuṣpaṃ samānayet ||

drāviṇī manunādevi valādṛṣṭyāḍanaṃ nayet |
ubhayaṃ caiva saṃgṛhya jayaṃ kuryān maheśvarī ||

śaktiśca sādhako devi daṃpatī durlabhau smṛtau |
vagalā suṃdarī tārākālādyāsvapi yatnataḥ ||

<p. 60b>

kramoyaṃ yogyatāṃ samyak nātrakāryā vicāraṇā |
kalidoṣāvaśāddevīnāyaṃ yogobhaviṣyati ||

tasmāt pāśavavetkalpevālāśastādhunā śive |
vālāyāmubhavācārodakṣiṇomukhya eva hi ||

śīghraṃ ca siddhikāmaścedgavākṣāyogamabhyaset |
yatra strīṇāṃ samūhosti nadī na daśamudrake ||

yatra snānaṃ na kurvaṃti gavākṣaṃ tatra kārayet |
tāmālokya prayatnena japaṃ kuryānniraṃtaraṃ ||

sarvāḥ saṃvīkṣyayeddevī svarṇaratnādibhiḥ priye |
iti saṃkṣepataḥ proktaṃ tilakaṃ śṛṇu pārvatī ||

vāmahastatale yaṃtraṃ vilikhyā yatnataḥ śive |
avaśiṣṭena tilakaṃ kārayet parameśvarī ||

bhāle kastūrikā viṃduṃ muniputraṃ sucaṃdanaṃ |
tanmadhye śvetaviṃduṃ ca keśādi pūrvavad bhavet ||

daśavidyāvidhau devi keśavarddhanamīritaṃ ||

devyuvāca ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi kamalā kramanirṇayaṃ ||

śiva uvāca ||

bhrūyugmedyu śṛṇaṃ devī siṃdūraṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ |
sveta tripuṇḍraṃ deveśi tanmadhye keśaraṃ śive ||

snātaḥ śuklāṃvaradharaḥ śuklamālyānulepanaḥ |
śuklabhūṣaṇabhūṣāḍhyaḥ strisaṃdhyaṃ snānamācaret ||

haviṣyāsī bhūmiśāyī madhurānna priyo naraḥ |
bhṛguvāsaraparyaṃtaṃ dvitīyaṃ bhṛguvāsaraṃ ||

dinavṛddhi krameṇaiva kumārīṃ pūjayetsadā |
dvitīya bhṛgubhārabhya hrāsayeddinavṛddhitaḥ ||

pratyahaṃ pūjayeddevi nānāvāditra niścanaiḥ |
dinaṣoḍaśaparyaṃtaṃ pratyahaṃ tu samācaret ||

punastadvimamārabhyataddināṃtaṃ maheśvarī |
pūjayet prayato nityaṃ devatābhāva tatparaḥ ||

pradakṣiṇā prakartavyā kalābhāva krameṇa ca |
dīpāstatra pradātavyā kalāvṛddhiḥ krameṇa ca ||

brāhmaṇān bhojayennityaṃ kalābhāvakrameṇa ca |
ityācāraparaḥ śrīmān viṣṇurūponaro bhavet ||

rājacihnāni sarvāṇi prayataḥ pūjayet sadā |
sarvasāmrājyā lakṣmyāstu nātho bhūyānna saṃśayaḥ ||

dhanadātasya dehasthā rājā ca kiṃkaro bhavet ||

devyuvāca ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi brahmamārga kramaṃ śiva ||

śiva uvāca ||

veśyāyāḥ kajjalaṃ deyaṃ siṃdūreṇa tripuṇḍrakaṃ |
haridrā bhrūyugedeyāśvetapatraṃ samācaret ||

<p. 61a>

raktaviṃduṃ ca tanmadhye sarvadā tadgatodbhavet |
bhojane śayane rātrau maithunaṃ sarvadā bhavet ||

ucchiṣṭahaste deveśi ucchiṣṭe na valiṃ haret |
śaktyucchiṣṭaṃ parocchiṣṭaṃ bhojanaṃ sārvakālikāṃ ||

jape kuryān maheśāni rātrāveva japaṃ caret |
tāmbūlaṃ bhakṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā tāṃbūlī caiva mohayet ||

tāṃbūlabhakṣīṃ māṃsāsī bhuktvācārcāṃ ca kārayet |
gṛhaṃ pralipya yatnena mārjanyā mārjanaṃ caret ||

prajaped yatnato devi nānyathā siddhyati dhruvaṃ |
ucchiṣṭa haste deveśi svadehaṃ procchyate sadā ||

ucchiṣṭahastaḥ prajaped brahmamārgaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
brahmamārgaḥ kramodevi gatitastu mayā tava ||

anena kramayogena siddhamārgaḥ kramo bhavet |
siddhavidyā prabhāvāsyāt pratyakṣā varadāyinī ||

sureṃdropi ca dāsaḥ syānmanuṣyāṇāṃ ca kākathā |
rahasyaṃ kathitaṃ bhadre goanīyaṃ svayonivat ||

devyuvāca ||

vada śrībhuvaneśānyāḥ kramaṃ paramadurlabhaṃ ||

śiva uvāca ||

divyabhāva krameṇaiva bhuvanā śīghrasiddhidā |
hakāro śivarūpitvā ukāraḥ pāpanāśakaḥ ||

ikāraḥ kāmarūpatvāt māyā tena prakīrtitāḥ |
brahmāṇḍa me taddeveśi māyayā veṣṭitaṃ bhavet ||

yasyāṃ māyā vinā devi ma ca kiṃcit prabhāsate |
yadbhāsarahitaṃ kiṃcinna ca kiṃcit prabhāsate ||

yadbhāvarahitaṃ kiṃcinna ca tadbhāsate kvacit |
yadbhāsāsahitaṃ devi jagade tat prabhāsate ||

yāṃ vinā tu maheśāni jagadyatra samaṃ bhavet |
evaṃ krameṇa deveśi sadā tadgatamānasaḥ ||

trailokyavijayī bhūyānnātrakāryāvicāraṇā |
etasyā tilakaṃ devi kathyate yatnataḥ śṛṇu ||

śvetacaṃdanaviṃdustu bhrūmadhye tu pralāpayet |
gaṃdhasāraṃ tadaṃte syāttripuṇḍraṃ divyavarṇataḥ ||

raktākṣatāśca tanmadhye tena siddīśvaro bhavet ||

devyuvāca ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi dhūmāvatyāḥ kramaṃ śive ||

śiva uvāca ||

dhūmāvatyāḥ kramodevi kathyate śṛṇu pārvatī |
bhrūmadhye kajjalaṃ devi bhasmaviṃdustadaṃtare ||

tripuṇḍraṃ ca lalāṭe syācchavabhasmatadaṃtare |
kṛṣṇavastrāṃ varadharo kṛṣṇagaṃdha vibhūṣitaṃ ||

gaṃdhapuṣpeṇa saṃyuktaḥ śmaśānāsanasaṃgataḥ |
dhūmavarṇaṃ jagatsarvaṃ maṃtrī dhūmamayaṃ bhavet ||

kākapicchaṃ vāsanaṃ syāt kṛṣṇa dravyaṃ pradhārayet |
brahmacārī mitāhārī nirvikalpo jiteṃdriyaḥ ||

satyavādī hṛdācāro bhūśāyīkuśaviṣṭharaḥ |
snānaṃ viṣavaṇaṃ kuryāduccāṭana parāyaṇaḥ ||

<p. 61b>

svacittaṃ kākavatkṛtya jagaduccāṭaye dhruvaṃ |
ityācāra paro bhūyāddhūma kramagato bhavet ||

kākakramastugadito kimanyacchrotumicchasi ||

devyuvāca ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi vagalā kramanirṇayam |
saubhāgyārca krameṇaiva vagalā śīghradarśinī ||

pītāṃvaradharo maṃtrī pītabhūṣaṇabhūṣitaḥ |
pītamālyāṃ varadharopītāgehe samāsthitaḥ ||

pītapūjāparaḥ proktaḥ pītānnapītamānavaḥ |
pītadravyopabhogī ca pītāsana samanvitaḥ ||

pītahomī pītapuṣpī pītaśaktiḥ samanvitaḥ |
rocanā bhrūvimaṃ dadyān kuṃkumaṃ munipatrakaṃ ||

haridrayā tripuṇḍraṃ ca tanmadhye khādiraṃ śive |
haricaṃdanadhūpena dhūpitaḥ parameśvarī ||

śaktau sarvaṃ tu saṃpādya kramamārgarato bhavet |
sṛṣṭisthityaṃta saṃhāraḥ pūjā ca trividhākalau ||

kerale sṛṣṭipūjāsyādgarbhekaulāgama kramāt |
arcanaṃ gauḍadeśe tu sthitimārgaṃ kumārakā ||

guptakaulāgamodevi gauḍadeśārcanevidhiḥ |
kāmarūpāgamaṃ devi saṃhāraḥ kramapūjanaṃ ||

gauḍāgameva cāṃcalya sāṃkhyāyana munistathā |
uktā vāmāgamaścaiva sthitya cā śṛṇuputraka ||

sarvāṃgasuṃdarīṃ ramyāṃ sarvāvayava śobhitaṃ |
navoḍhāṃ puṣpiṇīṃ caiva prārthayedviprakanyakāṃ ||

aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ paurṇamāsyāṃ kumārakāṃ |
atha vā bhaumavāre vā niśāyāṃ bhṛguvāsare ||

suvāsitena tailena kuryādanyajanaṃ tathā |
bhūlikātaulpamānīya āstīryodamukhe tadā ||

tasyopari samāstīrya śamaṃtairjāti campakaiḥ |
karpūraṃ caiva kastūrīmiśritaṃ caṃdanaṃ tathā ||

sarvāṃga lepanaṃ kuryāllakṣmīsūktena buddhimān |
paryaṃkoparitāṃ kanyāṃ caṃdanena vilepitāṃ ||

dhruvādyairiti maṃtreṇa kanyāṃ dakṣiṇato mukhīṃ |
unmūkhī śamanaṃ kuryācchrīsūktena kumārakaḥ ||

tasyāḥ pādau prasāryātha guptenārccanamācaret |
nyastvā ṣoḍhā dvayaṃ caiva vagalā paṃcakaṃ nyaset ||

kanyāṃ caiva nyaseddevaṃ tattadaṃgāni saṃsmaret |
janaṃ japapuraṃ caiva mārjayen mūlavidyayā ||

<p. 62a>

gaṃdhadvāreti maṃtreṇa kuryāt kastūri lepanaṃ |
mūlamaṃtreṇa vai tatra puṣpamālāṃ samarpayet ||

nivedayed dravyaśuddhiṃ tatraiva japamācaret |
prayogasiddhidaṃ puṃsāṃ maṃtrasiddhikaraṃ paraṃ ||

etatkramaṃ vinā devi prayogo na bhavet kvacit |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena siddhyarthī deva bhūtale ||

saubhāgyākhya kramaṃ devī vinā siddhiṃ na koṭibhiḥ |
abhimānāṣṭakaṃ tyaktvā tyaktvā vaidūṣaṇaṃ trayaṃ ||

tyaktvā paṃceṃdriyā śaktiṃ saubhāgya kramamācaret |
sukhaduḥkhe same kṛtvā lābhālābhau jayājayau ||

śītoṣṇa samatāṃ kṛtvā saubhāgya kramamācaret |
ṣoḍhādvayaṃ ca na jñātvāyaḥ karotyarcanaṃ bhuvi ||

patitaḥ sa bhaveddevi rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet |
vāhyāṃtarayordevi prabhedajñānayorvinā ||

pītakramo na kartavyo devatāśāpamāpnuyāt |
saṃkalpaṃ ceti kalkena tyaktvā vijñānamānasaḥ ||

pītaḥ kramaṃ tataḥ kuryānno cedbhraṣṭo bhaveddhruvaṃ |
jiteṃdriya sukhaṃ kṛtvā kuryāt pītakramaṃ śive ||

sukhārthaṃ kurute yosau devatāśāpamāpnuyāt |
svasyā deśavidhiṃ caiva vā jñātvā parimeśvarī ||

yaḥ karotyarcanaṃ devi sa vipraḥ patito bhavet |
yastu kanyāmanaḥ kṣobhaṃ karoti yajane śive ||

bhrāṃtacitto bhavet sadyo vācaspatiri vā paraḥ |
notpādayedvadennaiva manaścaiva śarīrayoḥ ||

vedanāṃjana yadyastu sa naraḥ parito bhavet |
sapatnīṃ mātṛpatnīṃ vā gurubhāryāmathāpi vā ||

arcayedbhuvanopetāṃ sāṃkhyāya na samarpitāṃ |
dīkṣāyutāṃ ca rajakīṃ kulālagṛhakanyakāṃ ||

puliṃda kanyakāṃ vāpi golakuṃḍāmṛtamādarāt |
arcayed ṛṣipatniṃ ca pūrvokta lakṣaṇairyutāṃ ||

arcaṇaṃ vidhimārgeṇa pūjādūrvā samomatāṃ |
sarvalakṣaṇa saṃyukto puṣpiṇīmarcayecchive ||

mataṃga muninoktaṃ ca sadyaḥ siddhikaraṃ tvidaṃ |
siddhakramoyaṃ deveśi nāsti siddhirguruṃ vinā ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena gurvājñā paripālakaḥ |
siddho bhavati deveśi nātrakāryā vicāraṇā ||

devyuvāca ||

mahārāja kramaṃ deva kathayasva mama prabho ||

<p. 62b>

śiva uvāca |

mahārāja kramo devi kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ |
nānāvicitra sopāna maṇḍite citramaṃdape ||

saudhoṣṭālaka saṃśobhidhitā na dhvajaśobhite |
nājopavaṃ na saṃyukte haṃsamāyūraśobhite ||

nānāvicitraramye ca gajavāji virājite |
sarvatobhadra saṃyukte nānābharaṇabhūṣite ||

dhūpāmoda samāyukte citradīpena laṃkṛte |
ratnasiṃhāsane ramye ratnābharaṇabhūṣite ||

jātīcaṃpakapunnāgaketakīgaṃdhaśobhite |
karpūrā gurukastūrī rocanā kuṃkumairyutaḥ ||

jaṭāmāṃsyādi saugaṃdhyalepanaiḥ paribhūṣitaḥ |
ghaṃṭhāninādasaṃyuktaḥ sarvadā śuddhamānasaḥ ||

ānaṃdamagna hṛdayodivyavastrairalaṃkṛtaḥ |
divyamālyāṃ varadharo divyabhūṣairalaṃkṛtaḥ ||

tāṃbūlapūrṇavadanodevendra itrarājitaḥ |
vedapātrairmṛtyapātrairbhogapātrairnināditaḥ ||

nṛtyagītaiśca vādinnaścaturviṃśativācakaiḥ |
saṃgītarāgatālaiśca dhvanibhiścanināditaḥ ||

nānādeśopabhāṣābhirgadyaipadyairalaṃkṛtaḥ |
nānāvicitrabhūṣābhirbhāṣitaḥ sādhakottamaḥ ||

samastarājavarṣāṇī mohanādrānnanāyikā |
śrīmahārājamātaṃgī sarvadevapramohinī ||

tasyāstu tilakaṃ devi kathyate śṛṇu pārvati |
kuce dvaṃdvaṃ ca bhrūmadhye gurusārāstadaṃtare ||

kastūrikā tripuṇḍraṃ ca tanmadhye keśaraṃ śive |
mahārāja kramo devi kathitastu mayā tava ||

atha vā devadeveśi svayaṃgāṇa paro bhavet ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau mahānīlādikramanirṇayo nāma trayodaśaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 
13 ||
atha vīrapaśubhāvānnigadyaṃte ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

vīrabhāvo mahādeva kathyate śṛṇu bhairava |
nirdvaṃdvamānaso bhūtvā hṛdā kāmakalā tanuḥ ||

niśā su pūjā pravarāhe tu vyuktā sadaiva hi |
nijaṃ kulaṃ samādhāya svayaṃ bhairava rūpadhṛk ||

kulaṃ ca bhairavī yūyaṃ tadgātrenyāsavistaraṃ |
prasūna tūlikāmadhyeṃ puṣpakara saṃyute ||

nānāgaṃdha samākīrṇe kuladravyeṇa yaṃtrake |
likhitvā pūjayecchaktaughanasthāpanapūrvakaṃ ||

svavāmabhāge ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tanmadhye brahmaraṃdhrakaṃ |
likhitvā tatrakuṃbhaṃ vai sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ tathā ||

tāmraṃ bhūmimayaṃ vāpi mahāloha vivarjitaṃ |
sthāpayet kalaśādhāraṃ kuṃbhaṃ sugaṃdhivāsitaṃ ||

hetu dravyaṃ brāhmaṇādibhedataḥ saṃprapūrayet |
tatra yaṃtraṃ vilikhyādau yadyat kulasamudbhavaṃ ||

<p. 63a>

dhyātvaiṣṭadevatāṃ tatra japedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
dhenuyoniṃ pradarśyātha amṛtaṃ tadviciṃtayet ||

dṛṣṭvā mṛtamupāttaṃ vai nṛtyaṃti yoginīgaṇāḥ |
nṛtyaṃti bhairavāḥ sarve nṛtyaṃti mātaropi ca ||

indrādayaḥ surāḥ sarve nṛtyaṃti madhulolupāḥ |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśādyāṃ nṛtyaṃti harṣatatparāḥ ||

arghabhāṇḍaṃ tridhā kṛtvā gurave caikabhāgakaṃ |
ekaṃ kulāyaṃ vai datvā ekena devatarpaṇaṃ ||

pītvā kularasaṃ nānāvastrālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ |
sākṣādyadi gururnasyāttadātoye visarjayet ||

ānaṃdarūpavān bhūtvā pūjayet parameśvarī |
tat tatkalpavidhānena tattadyatnena pūjayet ||

visarjanaṃ vidhāyātha svakule yojayettataḥ |
tadviṃvara sa pānena amṛtaṃ bhujyate ||

taccakorarasāsvāde saṃmado mama jāyate |
tatphalagrahaṇādeva meru śṛṃgāvarohaṇaṃ ||

latāliṃgena mātreṇa sudhādhauta kalevaraḥ |
mūlayoge kṛte tatra japedaṣṭa sahasrakaṃ ||

yatra jāpe ca home ca yatra saṃkhyā na coditā |
tatreyaṃgaṇanāproktā aṣṭottara sahasrakaṃ ||

jalapūtaṃ havirdravyaṃ gṛhītvā tarpayettataḥ |
vidhāya tarpaṇaṃ deva pradakṣiṇa manu vrajet ||

stutvā praṇamya kalpokta sravena toṣayet tataḥ |
tasmāt kulaṃ samāyogya kṛtvā yatnena saṃjapet ||

kule sākṣādyatastatvaṃ svayaṃ tiṣṭhati tatvataḥ |
sadyaṃ māṃsaṃ tathā matsyaṃ mudrāmaithunameva ca ||

ebhireva kṛtāḥ pūjā kulācāra prakīrtitaḥ |
tena tat kulaśāstrajñaiḥ pūjanīyā prayatnataḥ ||

kulaṃ kulaṃ cāṣṇakulaṃ niścalaṃ saśyavartate |
sa dhanyaḥ sa ca vijñānī kularūpaḥ sa eva tu ||

yatra tatra kujevāre śmaśānegamane kṛte |
pūjāphalaṃ bhavet tatra saptavā sarasaṃmitaṃ ||

caturdaśyāgate tatra pakṣa pūjāphalaṃ bhavet |
na gacchennārya tatsthāne paśureva na saṃśayaḥ ||

nāstyasmādadhikaṃ deva iti ciṃtāparāyaṇaḥ |
madena dravyabhoktā tu bhavet kulaparāyaṇaḥ ||

sādhakekṣo bhayāpanne mamakṣobhaḥ prajāyate |
tasmādyatnīdvīravarobhavet bhāgayutaḥ sukhī ||

bhogena mokṣamāpnoti bhogena kulaṃ sādhanaṃ |
vinā hetukamāsādya kṣobhayukto maheśvaraḥ ||

na pūjāṃ mamasaṃparkaṃ na dhyānamanuciṃtanaṃ |
tasmād bhuktvā ca pitvā ca pūjayet parameśvara ||

<p. 63b>

prakramacyutadoṣostināparaṃ doṣabhūṣaṇaṃ |
yadyadvadati vidrāviyat karoti yadarcati ||

tat sarvaṃ kularūpaṃ tu dhyātvā ca viharet sudhīḥ |
ekākī nirjanedeśe śmaśāne parvatevane ||

śūnyagehe nadītīre niḥsaṃgo viharenmudā |
vīrāṇāṃ japakālastu sarvakālaḥ praśasyate ||

sarvadeśe sarvapīṭhe kartavyaṃ ca na saṃśayaḥ |
vīrasādhanakāryaṃ ca kartavyaṃ vīrapūruṣaiḥ ||

divyairapi ca kartavyaṃ paśubhirna ca pāmaraiḥ |
varaṃ pāmara kāryaṃ ca mayaśoriti niścitaṃ ||

yadyannasatpurā proktaṃ saṃketaṃ maṃtrasādhane |
aṃjanaṃ guṭikādiṃ ca kuryādvīro mahābalaḥ ||

divyevīrenabhedosti yadbhedaṃ tattu kathyate |
śāṃto vinīto madhuraḥ kalālāvaṇya saṃyutaḥ ||

divyaṃ tu devavatprāyo vīraścoddhatamānasaḥ |
vibhūti bhūṣaṇairvāpi caṃdanairvāpilepitaḥ ||

ākāragopano vā pityakto vā kulabhairava |
raktacaṃdanadigdho vā vaiṣṇavaścāpyavaiṣṇavaḥ ||

apamāne ca pūjāyāṃ hṛṣṭapuṣṭaḥ sadā bhavet |
devaniṃdā paro vāpi tattatpūjāparopi vā ||

pūjāratastadrahitaḥ kulākulamatosthitaḥ |
nijabhāva samāyukto devavadviharetkṣitau ||

svakulāṃ puraścaryā rātrau kuryānna cānyathā |
vedahīnodvijedeva yathā na śrutijā kathā ||

viṣṇubhaktiṃ vinādevabhaktirne prabhavedyathā |
śāktajñānaṃ vināmuktiryathāhāsyāya kalpate ||

guruṃ vinā yathā taṃtre nādhikāraḥ kathaṃcana |
patihīnā yathā nārī sarvakarma vivarjitā ||

kulaṃ vinādevavidhīṃ kadāpi mamasādhane |
nādhikārīti kauleya tasmādbhāva paro bhava ||

avinītaṃ kulaṃ yasya sa kathaṃ mamapūjakaḥ |
tasmādyatnāttathākāryaṃ yathāsyādvinayānvitaṃ ||

bhāvābhāvātkuleśāstrenādhikāraḥ kathaṃcana |
tena bhāvaviśuddhastu sādhakaḥ kauliko bhavet ||

paśubhāvaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇuvatsa samāhitaḥ |
yathāvidhi paśurvidyāṃ gṛhītvā bhāvatatparaḥ ||

prathamaṃ pūrvasevārthaṃ yatnataḥ śuddhimācaret |
namatsya bhojanaṃ kuryānnastriyaṃ manasāsmaran ||

na paradravya lobhīsyānnabhogeṣāṃ na saṃbhajet |
siṃdhutīre parvate ca kānane vā surālaye ||

vilvamūle vivikte ca puṇyekṣetre ca śobhane |
na śūdradarśanaṃ kuryāt koṭilyaṃ yatnatastyajet ||

<p. 64a>

devatā śubhavarṇāstu dhyātavyā susamāhitaiḥ |
trisaṃdhyaṃ devapūjā tu trisaṃdhyaṃ japamācaret ||

rātrau maṃtraṃ ca mālāṃ ca na spṛśecca kadācana |
na maṃtramuccaredbhuktvā maunīsyāt sarvakarmasu ||

parvakālestriyaṃ naiva gacchet sādhakasattamaḥ |
puṣpaṃgaṃdhaṃjalaṃ caiva svayamānīya pūjayet ||

maithunaṃ tatkathālāpaṃ tadgoṣṭhiṃ parivarjayet |
ṛtukālaṃ vinā cāpi gacchenna striyamādarāt || 

purāṇaśravaṇe śraddhā vedavedārtha tatparaḥ |
na rātrau bhojayed vidvān tāṃbūlaṃ parameśvara ||

guruṇā yadyadādiṣṭaṃ tatsarvaṃ yatnataścaret |
svajātakusumaṃ caiva hetu dravyaṃ ca bhairavaṃ ||

spṛṣṭvārothā samāghrāya paṃcagavyena śuddhyati |
raktavastraṃ na gṛhṇīyāddevībhaktiparāyaṇaḥ ||

viṣṇutaṃtreṣu kalpāni tadanuṣṭhānameva ca |
kāryaṃ vīrakathālāpaṃ na kuryādvīravaṃdanaṃ ||

nityaśrāddhaṃ mayā śrāddhaṃ saṃdhyāvaṃdanameva ca |
tīrthasnānaṃ pīṭhadeśagamanaṃ dharmatatparaḥ ||

paśustu trividhaḥ proktaḥ krameṇa śṛṇu bhairava |
adīkṣitaḥ kriyāhīno maṃtra taṃtra vivarjitaḥ ||

mahāpaśuritikhyātaḥ sarvatoyaṃ vigarhitaḥ |
dīkṣito niṃdako yastu dvitīyaḥ saprakīrtitaḥ ||

ekākīyā na nirataḥ paśurityabhidhīyate |
asyādhikāraḥ pūjāyā na gurutve kadācana ||

pūrvasyanādhikārosti pūjādeśa gatāgatau |
pūrvastu sarvakaulerhi vahiḥ kāryaḥ svadeśataḥ ||

pūrvadarśanamātreṇa kuladarśanamācaret |
brahmahatyādikaṃ pāpaṃ varaṃ satyaṃ na ca prabho ||

pūrvadarśanamevātra satyaṃ satyaṃ vadāmyahaṃ |
mamātmā sāpi deveśi vibhūrityapi sa prabho || 

tathāpi tatra me śaṃkā jāyate tat padepade |
varaṃ kula parityājyaṃ varaṃ svakulahiṃsanaṃ ||

varaṃ svakulahānistu varaṃ svakulakuṭṭanaṃ |
kāyena manasā vācā varaṃ svakulapātanaṃ ||

na kūrvīta paśoḥ saṃgaṃ svamārgaṃ kṣayakāraṇāt |
kulaśāstre dvayaṃ pāpaṃ gariṣṭhaṃ kulanāśanaṃ || 

svakule mahatī niṃdā parayogāt kuleśvara |
tasmādapi mahāpāpaṃ paśusaṃgāt prajāyate ||

<p. 64b>

sarvathā tatra bhāvaudvaunaprakāśyo kuleśvara |
sabhāvaścavibhāvaśca paśudveṣāt prajāyate ||

daivācca jāyate vīrovīrāddaiva prajāyate |
daive vīrena saṃdehaḥ sāmyamityabhidhīyate ||

bhāvastu mānasodharmaḥ śābdaḥ sahikathaṃ bhavet |
tasmādbhāvo na vaktavyo diṅmātraṃ samudāhṛtaṃ ||

yathekṣu rasamādhuryaṃ rasanairjñāyate prabho |
tathā bhāvavibhāvastu manasā paribhāvyate ||

śṛṇu yatnena deveśi rahasyāti rahasyakaṃ |
vinā madyenamāṃsena puṃścalīsevanaṃ vinā ||

na maṃtraḥ siddhamāpnoti caṃdrasaura kramārcitaṃ |
alināpūritaṃ pātraṃ vanitāpūritaṃ mukhaṃ ||

aliṃ valiṃvarāṃ rāmāṃ kinnasiddhyati bhūtale |
satyametadvināyoṣitsaṃgaṃ maṃtraṃ na siddhyati ||

saṃga eva hi kārtavyo maithunaṃ na kadācana |
pūjanīyā sadāyoṣāmadbhāvakṛta niścayā ||

tasmāttu maithunaṃ devakartavyaṃ mama sādhakaiḥ |
ahaṃ tu jagatāṃ dhātrī jananījanmakāriṇī ||

madbhāvapratiyaṃtrāyāṃ sāhameva suniścitaṃ |
kartavyaṃ maithunaṃ naiva tasyā manavikāraṇaṃ ||

mohādvā guruvodhyādvyā yadā tat kurute sudhīḥ |
vīro vāpyathavā divya avudhyā narakaṃ vrajet ||

gurupatnīṃ dvijapatnīṃ pitṛpatnīṃ prapūjayet |
maithune narakaṃ yāvattāvat koṭiguṇaṃ bhavet ||

ahaṃ ca roṣasaṃpanno nāśayāmitamīśvara |
niraṃtaraṃ rogapīḍā jāyate tasya pāpinaḥ ||
 
kadācit karmasaṃtāpaḥ kadācit karṇapīḍamaṃ |
kadācidapivān yasyāt kadācinnavicarcikā ||

anālokyaṃ ca vādhiryaṃ khaṃjatā kubjatā tathā |
anyepi vividhā rogāḥ kuṣṭyādyāḥ prabhavaṃtihi ||

cakṣunāśocchrutichedo nāśācchedastathaiva ca |
pādacchedaḥ karacheda śirachedopi jāyate ||

paśupīḍā rājapīḍā vahnipīḍā ca jāyate |
kulaṃ tasyātra doṣeṇa mrīyate nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

ete te kathitā doṣāyoṣinmaithuna saṃbhavā |
adhikāravihīnānāmadhikārayutaiścaret ||

śiva uvāca |

mahānmamaivasaṃdeho varddhate jagadīśvarī |
mamānugrahato devi madvaktuṃ ca tvamarhati ||

devyuvāca ||

ahameva paraṃ dhyānamahameva parāśrutiḥ |
mattaḥ parataraṃ viśvaṃ na kiṃcidavalokyate ||

<p. 65a>

ahameva jagatsarvaṃ jagadevāhamīśvara |
madbhāvabhāvitānārī bhaveddetādṛśī śiva ||

evaṃ jñāna viśiṣṭaḥ syādadhikārī bhavecchiva |
brahmādika maheśo vā sarvadeva sadyo hi saḥ ||

jāyamānasya vālasya mātṛyoniḥ svaliṃgayoḥ |
saṃgharkeṇa vikāro hi na tayorjāyate kvacit ||

sādhakasya tathā yasya matiḥ syādadhikāriṇī |
sodhikārī bhavennityaṃ yāgādau sahayoṣitāṃ ||

madbhāva pratipannāyāṃ matsvarūpāhameva sā |
vikāraṃ na hi yoṣāyāṃ tasyāmarpita eva hi ||

evaṃ yasya sthirābuddhiḥ svādhikārī na saṃśayaḥ |
sādhakasya svadehe syāt yatsvarūpeṣṭadevatā ||

tadvarṇasamatejobhiḥ pūrṇaṃ tu vanamaṇḍalaṃ |
bhāvanābhisthirīkṛtya devatā dhyānatanmayaḥ ||

yathāsvarūpavarṇādi ciṃtayedyatamānasaḥ |
evaṃ jñāne samutpanne svacchadaṃ viharet pumān ||

evaṃ yasya mamonāsti tasya pratinidhiḥ smṛtaḥ |
kumāryāmeva kartavyaṃ na kṣaratyāṃ kadācana ||

kumārī bhojanādeva kumārī bhojanādapi |
kumārī ciṃtanādeva trailokyavijayī bhavet ||

śṛṇu devi varārohe rahasya mahadadbhutaṃ |
vinā pūjāṃ striyoyonausaṃgamet sādhakottamaḥ ||

saptajanmadaridraḥ syānnarakekoṭikalpasaḥ |
brahmahatyā surāpānastena gurvaṃ gaṇāgamaḥ ||

evaṃ nānākṛto doṣo jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
vīro vāpyathavā divyo na vuddhyā narakam vrajet ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau bhāvanirṇayo nāmāścaturddaśaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 14 ||

athādau satvādi guṇabhedāt nityādi vibhedamāha ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

dhanināṃ madhyamānāṃ ca daridrāṇāṃ gṛhīsināṃ |
paradeśa sthitānāṃ ca kārāgehādivāsināṃ ||

kāryādau vyāvṛtānāṃ ca yuktānāṃ sūtakādibhiḥ |
kāryāṃge ca svabhāve cā vāmakānāṃ kṛpānidhe ||

ṣaḍāmnāya rahasye na kathaṃ nityakriyā bhavet |
lokalajjāvatāṃ vā dinacaryāṃ vada prabho ||

śrīśiva uvāca |

mahākālena yatproktaṃ yanmahāmāyayāśrutaṃ |
rahasyātirahasyaṃ tat sarvataṃtreṣugopitaṃ ||

<p. 65b>

āmnāyānāṃ rahasyaṃ tadāhnikaṃ procyate mayā |
śṛṇvaṃ tu sarvebho devāḥ sādhakānāṃ prasiddhidaṃ ||

tatra nityaṃ tridhā proktaṃ guṇatraya vibhedataḥ |
adhikāravihīnaṃ cenmānasaṃjñānapūrvakaṃ ||

svasthacittenayatinākṛtaṃ tacchuddhamucyate |
tādṛśaṃ cedgṛhasthena nirdravyeṇātha vā kṛtiṃ ||

ruglena pathikenāpi karāgṛhagatena vā |
bhaktito cāpi tanmiśraṃ vāhyapūjādhikārataḥ ||

śītādibhītyāvāvittaḥ saṃkṣayādalpakāryataḥ |
stryāderniyogādgalitaṃ gṛhīṇomānasaṃmataṃ ||

vāhyapūjādikaṃ yacca ekāṃte niyamena ca |
bhaktyā kṛtaṃ gṛhasthena tacchuddhaṃ rājasaṃmataṃ ||

pūjārthaṃ yadyā ca yitva śraddhābhaktividhāya vā |
lokabhītyā devabhītyā yattadrājasamiśritaṃ || 

pratāraṇārthaṃ lokānāṃ yācitaṃ devanāmataḥ |
dravyaṃ kṛtaṃ tadduddeśagalitaṃ tat tu rājasaṃ ||

vāmamārgaṃ samāśrityakaulaṃ dharmaṃ vicārya ca |
anyadharmasya cādveṣāt kṛtaṃ śuddha tu tāmasaṃ ||

kṛtaṃ yatkāmataḥ karma caihnikaṃ pāralaukikaṃ |
vāmamārgaṃ samāśritya miśritaṃ tattunāmasaṃ ||

jihvālobhena yatsvādyaṃ pānaṃ yat kāmatorataṃ |
athavā māraṇādyarthaṃ galitaṃ tattutāmasaṃ ||

śuddhasatvena mokṣaḥ syāt svargaḥ syānmiśrasatvataḥ |
siddhirgalita satvāsyā daihikī ca manuṣyatā ||

svargaḥ syādrājasācchuddhātkāmaḥ syānmiśrarājasāt |
galigādrājasāttiryagyonāvavi sukhaṃ bhavet ||

sātvikā tāmasāddevayonitvaṃ prāpnuyānnaraḥ |
miśratāmasatoduḥkhīnārakī vāddhytāmasāt ||

karmapaṃcavidhaṃ proktaṃ paṃcadhā muktidāyakaṃ |
prasarpaṇamupādānamījyādhyāyastathādyutiḥ ||

saṃmārjano palepādi saṃskāro devamaṃdire |
bhavārjanaṃ sarpaṇaṃ syāddevasālokyakārakaṃ || 

pūjāsādhanasāmagryāmelanaṃ bhaktasevanaṃ |
tatprītiḥ syādupādānaṃ devatārūpadāyakaṃ ||

pīṭhapūjanapūrvaṃ yat ṣoḍaśādyupacārakaiḥ |
sa yogo liṃgadehasyanāśakaḥ kālayogakṛt ||

atha prātaḥ kṛtyaḥ yathā ||

brāhmyānmuhūrtādvakṣyāmi sādhakasya hitaṃ paraṃ |
kālikāyā maheśāni śayyāyāṃ guruciṃtanaṃ ||

suṃdaryāstu maheśāni rātrivāsaṃ parityajet |
chinnāyādevaṃ deveśi saṃyogī bhūyasaṃsmaret ||

<p. 66a>

tārāyāṃ devadeveśi śaktyā sahaguruṃ smaret |
guruṃ smṛtvā kuṇḍalinīṃ samyagyogena yojayet ||

sādhakaḥ prātarutthāya kulavṛkṣaṃ praṇamya ca |
mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ kulaṃ dhyātvā guruṃ smaret ||

tataḥ samastake ciṃtyaṃ sahasradalapadmakaṃ |
karpūrābhaṃ smerettatra śrīguruṃ nijarūpiṇaṃ ||

iti śrīgurorvidyamānatveśāṃtatvenyaset ||

suprasannaṃ lasadbhūṣāmaṇḍitaṃ śvetacaṃdanaṃ |
varābhaya jñānamudrā pustakairvyāvṛtai karaiḥ ||

yuktaṃ śvetāṃvaraṃ śāṃtaṃ śvetapuṣpavibhūṣitaṃ |
vāmāṃkagatayaḥ śaktyā liṃgitaṃ raṇavarṇayā ||

raktavastrābharaṇa vā raktacaṃdanamālyayā |
vāme līlākamalayāliṃgityā dakṣiṇena ca ||

dhyāyedaṃ tanmukhaṃ śāṃtaṃ śrīguraṃ śivarūpiṇaṃ |
tatpāda padmayugalaṃ srutapīyūṣadhārayā ||

abhiṣiktaṃ svasya dehamevaṃ śiṣyo viciṃtayet |
arcayed gaṃdhapuṣpādyairvādyasthairmānasaistu vā ||

śrīgurormānasayajanamāha |

laṃ haṃ yaṃ raṃ vamuccārya tattadbhūtātmanaḥ padāt |
samarpayāmi saṃprocya namoṃtomānasārcane ||

śaṃvaiśaktyātmane procya tāṃbūlaṃ caiva pūrvavat |
kaniṣṭhā tarjanī madhyānāmāścāṃguṣṭhayogataḥ ||

sarvāsīyojanānmudrā kramāt paṃcavidhāsmṛtā |
aimuktā yoginaṃ mudrāṃ dairśayettāṃvurārpaṇe ||

nāmabhistasya saṃketaḥ saṃsiddhairgurukīrtakaiḥ |
praṇamyatthaṃ hṛnmanunā bhāvayettallayaṃ hṛdi ||

atha strīgurutve viśeṣadhyānamāha ||

aruṇāmaruṇākalpāṃ karuṇāpūrṇalocanā |
varābhayakarāśāṃtāṃ smarāmi mama gauravī ||

nijanātha kareśaśvannija vāmakalevarāṃ |
sa padmakarayāśaśvallīlāṃdolitalocanāṃ ||

atha vīrāṇāṃ viśeṣo yathā ||

mahācīna guruṃ dhyātvā svaguruṃ saṃsmarettataḥ |
paṃcopacāraiḥ saṃpūjya vīradravya krameṇa tu ||

atha kulagurumāha ||

prahlādānaṃdanāthākhyaṃ sanakānaṃdameva ca |
kumārānaṃdanāthaṃ ca vaśiṣṭānaṃdanāthakaṃ ||

krodhānaṃdaṃ sukhānaṃdaṃ dhyānānaṃdaṃ tataḥ paraṃ | 
vodhānaṃda sukānaṃdī dhyāyet kulamukhopari ||

atha mahārasarasollāsahṛdayāghūrṇalocanāḥ ||

<p. 66b>

kulāliṃga na saṃbhinnāścūrṇitāśeṣatāmasāḥ |
kulaśiṣyaiḥ parivṛtāḥ pūrṇāṃtaḥ karaṇodyatāḥ ||

varābhayayutāḥ sarve kulataṃtrārthavādinaḥ ||

atha śrīgurordhyānam ||

nīlāṃvaraṃ nīlavilepayuktaṃ śaṃkhādibhūṣitatanuṃ muditaṃ trinetram || 
vāmāṃgapīṭhasthitanīlaśaktirvadāmivīraṃ karuṇānidhānaṃ ||

vīraṃ dhyātvā mahādevī vīramālāṃ japedbudhaḥ |
aṣṭottara sahasraṃ ca vāmahaste samarpayet ||

atha gurupādukāmāha ||

athavā vāgbhavaṃ māyāṃ lakṣmībījaṃ samuddharet |
hasakhaphreṃ tathā naṃdabhairavākhyaṃ sahakhaphreṃ ||

gurunāma tathā tathāśaktirnāma śrīpādukāṃ smaret ||

daśadhā saptadhā vāpi tridhā vā prajapetsudhīḥ |
japaṃ samarpayet paścāt śrīgurordakṣiṇekare ||

akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ |
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguravenamaḥ ||

ajñānatimirāṃdhasya jñānāṃjanaśalākayā |
cakṣurunmīlitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguravenamaḥ ||

tatastu mūlādhārādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtamudyate |
ādhāraskaṃdamityāhurgudameḍhrasyamadhyagaḥ ||

mṛdvāsane samāsīnaḥ sarvaciṃtā vivarjitaḥ |
caturasraṃ caturyaṃtraṃ vasāṃtaṃ svarṇavarṇakaṃ ||

trikoṇavṛtta tanmadhye icchājñāna kriyātmakaṃ |
sūryakoṭi pratīkāśāṃ caṃdrakoṭiḥ ṣuśītalāṃ ||

sārddha trivalayākārāṃ sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitāṃ |
madhye svayaṃbhuliṃgaṃ tu koṭisūryaḥ samaprabhaṃ ||

tadūrddhve kāmavījaṃ tu kalayā iṃdunāyakaṃ |
tadūrddhve tu śikhākārāṃ kuṇḍaliṃ brahmavigrahāṃ ||

tejodaṇḍaṃ suṣumṇāṃtaḥ sahasraravisannibhaṃ |
tadātmakaṃ mūlamaṃtraṃ dhyātvā tattejasāvṛtaṃ ||

svaśarīraṃ viciṃtyeti prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ caret |
mūlamaṃtreṇa maṃtrasya ṛṣyādinyā samācaret ||

aṃganyā saṃvidhāyātha hṛdidevaṃ viciṃtayet |
mānasairupacāraiśca pūjayitvā manuṃ japet ||

yathāśaktyātha devāyataṃ japaṃ ca samarpayet ||

atha śyāmāyā viśeṣamāha ||

dhyātvā hṛdamvuje kālīṃ dhyānoktāṃ pūjayettataḥ |
mānasairupacāraiśca pūjayitvā manuṃ japet ||

<p. 67a>

gaṃdhādibhiśca gāyatrīmaṣṭāviṃśati saṃkhyakāṃ |
prajapeddaśasaṃkhyāṃ vā śrūyatāṃtāṃ ca bhairavī ||

kāmo'lākṣinādāṃto dakṣiṇāṃgeyutātataḥ |
vidmahe kūrcavījaṃ ca cāmuṇḍau ṅeṃyutā tataḥ ||

dhīmahīti vadettannaḥ kālī pracodayāt tataḥ |
gāyatryeṣāmayā proktā sarvataṃtreṣu gopitā ||

yāṃ vinā sa kalāvidyā na siddhyaṃti kadācana ||

atha japāvidhirucyate ||

vīrahaṃsamayāvidyā saṃkalpaṃ kārayedbudhaḥ |
haṃsākhyā sādhanaṃ vakṣye maṃtrāṇāṃ hitakāmyayā ||

yasya vijñānamātreṇa sarvajño bhuvijāyate |
haṃsātmikāṃ bhagavatīṃ jīvo jayati sarvadā ||

asyāḥ smaraṇamātreṇa jīvanmukto bhavennaraḥ |
asya haṃsasya deveśi nigamāgamapakṣakau ||

agnisomau tathā vāpi pakṣau tāraḥ śiro bhavet |
viṃdu trayaṃ śikhā netre mukhe nāda pratiṣṭhitaḥ ||

śivaśaktipadadvaṃdvaṃ kālāgnī yārśvayugmakaṃ |
ayaṃ paramahaṃsastu sarvavyāpī prakāśavān ||

hakāreṇa vahiryāti sakāreṇa viśet punaḥ |
sayāḥ saṃvodhamātreṇa jīvanmukto bhavennaraḥ ||

prāṇāyāma prabhāvena jīvanmuktastu jāyate |
ṛṣirhaṃso'vyaktapūrvāgāyatrī cheda ucyate ||

devatā paramādistuhaṃsohaṃ bījamucyate |
saśaktiḥ kīlakaṃ sohaṃ praṇavastatvameva hi ||

udāttasvara ityevaṃ manorasya prakīrtitaḥ |
mokṣā'rthe viniyogaḥ syādevaṃ kuryāt sadānaraḥ ||

sūryātmanevahṛddevisomātmane śirastathā |
niraṃjanaṃ śikhājyotirnirābhāsā tathā priye ||

avyaktaṃ netrayornyasya anaṃtostraphaḍaṃ yajet |
evaṃ nyāsavidhiṃ kṛtvā gaṇeśādau samarpayet ||

ṣaṣṭiśvāsairbhavet prāṇaḥ ṣaṭprāṇānāḍikāmatā |
ṣaṣṭhināḍyāhyahorātraṃ japasaṃkhyā japamanoḥ ||

ekaviṃśati sāhasraṃ ṣaṭśatādikameva ca |
prajapet pratyahaṃ jīvo brahmānaṃdamayīṃ parāṃ ||

utpattirjapa āraṃbhomṛtirasya nivedanaṃ |
vinā japena satataṃ jape bhavati sarvadā ||

evaṃ japastu vijñāto gaṇeśādau nivedayet |
ṣaṭśatāni gaṇeśasya ṣaṭsahasraṃ prajāyate ||

ṣaṭsahasraṃ gadāpāṇeḥ ṣaṭsahasraṃ pinākinaḥ |
sahasraṃ ātmane caiva sahasraṃ paramātmane ||

<p. 67b>

sahasraṃ purave caiva saṃkalpoyaṃ yathā vidhi |
raktavarṇe gaṇeśaṃ ca mūlādhāre caturddale ||

vādiveda samāyukte ṣaṭśataṃ ca samarpayet |
svādhiṣṭhānaṃ vidrumābhaṃ ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vādi ṣaṭkakaṃ ||

sāvitryā ca samāyukte brahmaṇe ca samarpayet |
vidyuṃtpuṃjaprabhābhaṃ ca dalaṃbhādi daśākṣaraṃ ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇau vaṃde ṣaṭsahasraṃ nivedayet |
mahānīla prabhe caivakādi dvādaśapatrake ||

umāmaheśvarau vaṃde ṣaṭsahasraṃ nivedayet |
viśuddhe dhūmravarṇe ca kalāpātre svarānvite ||

prāṇaśaktyātmakau vaṃde sahasraṃ ca samarpayet |
ājñāyāṃ vidyudābhāyāṃ śubhau dakṣau niyojīte ||

paramātmani parāśaktau sahasraṃ samarpayet |
stutvā praṇamya devājñāṃ ślokairebhiśca prārthayet ||

śivādikasthalebhāvamūhaṃ sveṣṭasya vācayet ||

trailokya caitanyamayādi daivaśrīśaṃkaratvaccaraṇājñayaiva |
prātaḥ samutthāya tava priyārthaṃ saṃsārayātrā manuvartayiṣye ||

saṃsārayātrā manuvartamānaṃ tvadājñayā śaṃkaradevadeva |
sparddhāti ca skārakalipramādābhayānimāṃmābhibhavaṃ tu nātha ||

iti saṃprārthya deveśamājñāmādāya tasya tu |
prārthayitvādharāṃ śvāsayuktaṃ pādaṃ nidhāpayet ||

samudramekhale devi parvatastanamaṇḍale |
viṣṇupatnī namastubhyaṃ pādasparśaṃ kṣamasvame ||

prātaḥkṛtyama kṛtvā tu yo devīṃ bhaktitorcayet |
pūjā ca viphalā tasya śaucahīnā yathā kriyā ||

atha śaucavidhiḥ ||

tato gṛhādvahiryāmyāṃ nair(-)ṛtīṃ vā diśaṃ vrajet |
pade padesmaredastraṃ dūreyāyāddvijālayāt ||

atītyavāṇamātrāṃ tu bhuvaṃ grāmādvilokya ca |
noṣaṇena śmaśāne ca tripathe vā catuṣpathe ||

gokule rājamārge vā vane copavane tathā |
devatā yatane varjyaṃ goradhyāyāṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

varcco mūtrādikaṃ varjyaṃ yasmādvai kṛttikāsutaṃ |
daśahastaṃ parityājya mūtraṃ kuryājjalāśayāt ||

catvāriṃśat purīṣe tu tīrthe nadyāṃ caturguṇaṃ |
karṇe kṛtvā pavitraṃ ca viṇmūtraṃ kārayet tadā ||

ubhe mūtrapūrīṣe ca divākuryādudaṅmukhaḥ |
rātrau ca dakṣiṇe kuryādube saṃdhye yathā divā ||

chāyāyāmaṃdhakāre vā rātrā vahani vādvijāḥ |
yathā samanmukhaḥ kuryāt prāṇavādhabhayeṣu ca ||

<p. 68a>

uttiṣṭhaṃ vṛṣayodevāgaṃdharvāyakṣarākṣasāḥ |
paritastyajyatāṃ sthānaṃ viṇmūtrotsarjanāyame ||

anena manunāloṣṭha tṛṇairudvāsya devatāḥ |
kuryān malacyutiṃ tatra vā sasākaṃ praveṣṭya ca ||

piṃḍāloko na kartavyastathākāśa nīrīkṣaṇaṃ |
samyak vā vaśyakaṃ kṛtvā vāyuṃ kāṣṭhenamṛjya ca ||

loṣṭena vātha vāmṛjyanāśmanāmṛjyate gudaṃ |
punaḥ śaucaṃ prakartavyaṃ mṛdāmalakamātrayā ||

dvitīyā ca tṛtīyāyātadarddhārdvā prakīrtitāḥ |
śucideśāttu saṃgrāhyāḥ śarkarāśmādi varjitāḥ ||

vipre gaurāmṛdaḥ proktāḥ kṣatreraktāstathoditāḥ |
vaiśyasya haritāḥ proktāḥ kṛṣṇā strīśūdrayostathā ||

yasmindeśe tu yattoyaṃ yādṛkīmṛttikā bhavet |
saiva tatra praśastāsyāttayāśaucaṃ vidhīyate ||

ekaliṃge gude saptadaśa vāmakare tathā |
ubhayoḥ saptadātavyāstisroṃ'ghryoścāpi mṛttikāḥ ||

mūtrotsarge vāmahasteliṃge paṃcaiva mṛttikā |
trikāradvitaye caikāpādayorathavā caret ||

gaṃdhalepa kṣayakaraṃ manoglāniharaṃ paraṃ |
kuryādvādaśa gaṃḍūṣāt pūrīṣotsarjanottaraṃ ||

mūtratyāge tu catura ācamya tristaraḥ paraṃ |
etacchauvaṃ gṛhasthānāṃ dviguṇa brahmacāriṇāṃ ||

triguṇaṃ vāṇaprasthānāṃ yatīnāṃ ca caturguṇaṃ |
divāśaucasya rātryarddhaṃ svasya śaucasya sarvadā ||

tadarddhaṃ rujimārgasthastrī śūdrāṇāṃ tadarddhakaṃ |
śaucaṃ kṛtvā tato mṛdbhistṛbhirjapyairviśodhayet ||

śaucakarma vihīnasya sakalā niṣphalāḥ kriyā ||

atha daṃtadhāvanavidhiḥ ||

tataḥ samāhareddaṃtadhāvanaṃ vihitaidhasāṃ |
te cāpāmārgavadarīnirguṇḍī vilvavāsakāḥ ||

aśokacaṃpakaḥ plakṣaparṇajaṃvudhavaśruvaḥ |
arkanyagrodhakhadirakaraṃjakakubhādikaṃ ||

śīrṣeśauryaṃ vaṭe dīptiḥ kadaṃve vijayīraṇe |
plakṣe sarvārthasiddhiḥ syādvadaryāṃ madhurasvaraḥ ||

khadiremukhasaugaṃdhyaṃ vailvena vipulaṃ dhanaṃ |
apāmārge dhṛtirmedhā prajñākāṃtiryaśastathā ||

āyuḥ śīlaṃ tathā lakṣmīḥ saubhāgyaṃ copajāyate |
arkeṇahanyate rogānarthalābhāśca jāyate || 

audumbare vāgviśuddhiścaṃpakasyādṛṭa śrutiḥ |
jātī vakulamaṃdāraiḥ svapnaṃ tasya na paśyati ||

<p. 68b>

sarvakaṃṭakinaḥ puṇyāḥ kṣīriṇastu yaśaḥsvina |
anyeṣāṃ vṛkṣajātīnāṃ na bhakṣeddaṃtadhāvanaṃ ||

palāśavakulaṃkāśaṃ bhakṣayedyastu sāsapaṃ |
tāvadbhavati cāṇḍāloyāvadgāvaṃ na paśyati ||

sphāṭikaṃ vā tiriktaṃ ca hīnaṃ catvagvivarjitaṃ |
arddhadagdhaṃ pathibhraṣṭaṃ śmaśānasthaṃ tathaiva ca ||

ucchicchaviṣṭā sūtradilagnaṃ yatnāt parityajet |
kanīnyagra samasthaulya praguṇaṃ dvādaśāṃgulaṃ ||

dvādaśāṃgula viprāṇāṃ kṣatriyāṇāṃ navāṃgulaṃ |
aṣṭāṃgulaṃ ca vaiśyānāṃ śūdrāṇāṃ ca ṣaḍaṃgulaṃ ||

caturaṃgulamānaṃ tu nārīṇāṃ vidhirucyate |
cūrṇitāgraṃ tvacāyuktaṃ gṛhṇīyān manunānunā ||

āyurvalaṃ yaśovarccaḥ prajāpaśuvastūni ca |
brahmaprajñāṃ ca medhāṃ ca tanno dehi vanaspate ||

prāṅmukhodaṅmukho bhūtvā upaviśya sukhāsane |
bhakṣayen mukhaśuddhyarthaṃ yathoktaṃ taṃtadhāvanaṃ ||

klīmuktvā kāmadevāya sarvajanapriyāya ca |
namoṃtastithi varṇoyaṃ maṃtrodaṃtaviśodhane ||

prakṣālpaṃ daṃtakāṣṭaṃ ca śuddhadeśe purastyajet |
vaktraṃ mūlānunānityaṃ kṣālayet siddhihetave ||

pratipaddaśe ṣaṣṭhīṣu navamyarkadinaṃ tathā |
caṃdrasūryoparāge ca na kuryāddaṃtadhāvanaṃ ||

abhāvedaṃtakāṣṭasya niṣiddhāyāṃ tithau tathā | 
apāṃ dvādaśa gaṃḍūṣaiḥ kurvīta mukhaśodhanaṃ ||

atha pūjāhomakarmasiddhayesnānamucyate ||

snānapūrvāḥ kriyāḥ sarvāḥ snānaṃ ca daivate bhavet |
prātaḥkāle ca madhyāhne sāyāhne stotrapāṭhake ||

yadā yadā manoglānistadaiva snānamācaret |
vidyoccāraṃ tu yaḥ yakuryādasnātaḥ kṛtabhojanaḥ ||

tasya vidyā bhavennaṣṭā rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet |
aśuciḥ sanmaheśāni vidyoccāraṃ tu yaścaret ||

tasya nāśo bhaveddevi vidyādagdhāṃ bhaveddhruvam |
snānakālācca saṃproktāḥ snānabhedā chṛṇu priye ||

snānaṃ paṃcavidhaṃ proktaṃ yena devīmayo bhavet |
vāruṇe nābhasaṃ caiva tṛtīyaṃ bhasmajaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

caturthaṃ taijasaṃ devī paṃcamaṃ daivataṃ bhavet |
brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ ||

<p. 69a>

ete paṃcamahāsatvāḥ paṃcasnāne vyavasthitāḥ |
parāvaṃtadatītāva tatparā tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

citpadātadatītāva paṃcamī parikīrtitāḥ |
vāruṇaṃ dvividhaṃ proktaṃ vaidikaṃ tāṃtrikaṃ tathā ||

svaśākhokta vidhānena vaidikaṃ snānamīritaṃ |
svasvakalpoktavidhinā tāṃtrikaṃ snānamācaret ||

śaṃkunāstrābhi japtena śucisthānāttumṛttikāṃ |
gṛhītvāstreṇa saṃsiṃcyayā yājjalaniketanaṃ ||

tatrādau jalakūlaṃ tu kṣālayedastravāriṇā |
mṛdaṃ kṛtvā dvidhā tatra ekabhāgopagaṃ tataḥ ||

nidhāyagomayaṃ darbhāṃstilāṃścāpyabhimaṃtritān |
mṛttikāgomayābhyāṃ ca kardyataṃ snānamācaret ||

vahiruddhṛtatoyenamalaḥ snānaṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
vidhāya vaidikaṃ snānaṃ tadaṃgaṃtarpaṇaṃ tathā ||

atha vakṣyāmite vatsaḥ snānaṃ kulamukhāvahaṃ |
kṛṣṇāraktāharirnīlā vividhā mamamūrtayaḥ ||

tatastāṃtrikasnānasya vidhirastreṇamṛttikāṃ |
samādāyāstramaṃtreṇa maṃtrayitvā tṛṇādikaṃ ||

śikhāmaṃtreṇāpahṛtya trirmūlenābhi maṃtrayet |
mūrddhādi pādaparyaṃtaṃ vilipya praṇayejjalaṃ ||

ādhāraḥ sarvabhūtasya viṣṇoratulatejasaḥ |
tadrūpāśca tato jātāstā āpaḥ praṇamāmyahaṃ ||

saṃmukhīṃkaraṇaṃ mudrāṃ vadhvā prāṇaṃ niruṃdhya ca |
nimajya tūṣṇī mutthāya nābhimātre jalesthitaḥ || 

ācāṃtaḥ kuladravyeṇa sadarbhaḥ kulapuṣpakaṃ |
kulapātraḥ sa darbhaṃ ca sa tilaṃ sa jalaṃ tataḥ ||

trividhaṃ kuladarbho hi coditaḥ kālaśaṃtunā |
kathyate tatra deveśi gopanīyā kuleśvarī ||

kulacakroparigatāḥ kuladarbhāḥ mukheṣṭadā |
trayodarbhāḥ samuddiṣṭāḥ suvarṇaiḥ rajataiḥ kuśaiḥ ||

tatra śākte dvayaṃ cānyamanyeṣāṃ tu trayo matāḥ |
suvarṇaṃ rajataṃ caiva japapūjādi karmasu ||

karṣārddhakarṣamātraṃ vā pavitrāya prakalpayet |
kuśakāryakaraṃ proktaṃ na tu vanyakuśāḥ kuśāḥ ||

tarjanyā rajataṃ dhāryaṃ svarṇaṃ dhāryamanāmayā |
eṣa eva kuśaḥ proktoradarbhovarasaṃbhavaḥ ||

<p. 69b>

kūrcāṇāṃ paṃcakaṃ likhyaparitovartamekhalāṃ |
śūlaṃ kapālamālikhya brahmakūrcaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

etasyādhāraṇādevavāṃchā kāryamavāpnuyāt |
tridhādarbhaḥ prakathitaḥ kālikādarbhavartmani ||

gopanīyamidaṃ bhadre sārāt sārataraṃ mahat |
kapālaṃ ca tathā khaḍgaṃ strīvījāni ca paṃca ca ||

anāmāyāmidaṃ dhāryaṃ svarṇavarṇaṃ śubhāvahaṃ |
kūrcādyakālikātārā saptatārādyameva ca ||

sarvavījādyarūpaṃ ca kuladarbhaṃ ca dhārayet |
vidyāśrīkīrtijananaṃ śāṃtidaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ ||

savasauṃdaryadaṃ bhadre vījāsiddhiḥ pradarśakaṃ |
gṛhītvā kuladevasya prītaye snānamācaret ||

tāṃtrikaṃsnāna saṃkalpaṃ māsollekhādipūrvakaṃ |
kṛtasaṃkalpa evāsau kulacakraṃ jale nyaset ||

kṛtvātha mūlamaṃtreṇa prāṇāyāma trayaṃ caret |
vinyasya ca ṣaḍaṃgāni kalpayet tirthamagrataḥ ||

caturasre hastamātretajjale parikalpite |
brahmāṇḍodaratīrthāṇikaraiḥ spṛṣṭāniterave ||

tena satyena deveśa tīrthaṃ dehi divākara |
iti sūryaṃ prārthayitvā kromityaṃkuśamudrayā ||

aṃkuśamudrā yathā ||

dakṣamuṣṭiṃvidhāyātha tarjanyaṃ kuśarūpiṇī |
aṃkuśākhyā mahāmudrā trailokyākarṣaṇa kṣamā ||

mitvārkamaṇḍalaṃ tasyāttīrthānyā vāhayediha |
gaṃge ca yamune caiva godāvarī sarasvatī ||

narmadesiṃdhukāverī jale'sminsannidhiṃ kuru |
eva muktvā tu tīrthāni tasmin toye niyojayet ||

mūlamaṃtreṇātha tīrthaḥ śaktistatra samāhvayet |
arkasya maṇḍalaṃ dhyātvā tanmaṃtreṇa ca pūjayet ||

sarvānaṃdamayīmaśeṣaduritarddhvaṃ sāmṛgāṃka prabhāṃ 
tryakṣāmūrddhvakaradvayenadadhaṃtīpāśaṃ sṛṇī vā mataḥ ||
aṃtaścāmṛtapūrṇahemakalaśaṃ muktākṣamālāṃvarāṃ 
gaṃgāsiṃdhusaridvarādisahitāṃ śrītīrthaśaktiṃ bhaje ||

hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hraiṁ hrauṁ hraḥ ||

iti sarvānaṃdamayeparaṃ ||

tīrthaśakti tathā hiliyugaṃ vahnigehini |
ekaviṃśākṣaraḥ proktastīrthaśaktermahāmanuḥ ||

<p. 70a>

tajjalaṃgāṃgamaṃtreṇa maṃtrayedaṣṭavārakaṃ |
tāro namo bhagavati bhūyādaṃ vetatoṃvike ||

aṃvālike mahāmālinyehyehi bhagavatpatha |
aśeṣatīrthālavālemāyā śrīvījamuccaret ||

śivajaṭādhirūḍhe ca gaṃgegaṃgāmbike dviṭhaḥ |
gaṃgāvidyeyamākhyātā tripaṃcāśadbhirakṣaraiḥ ||

vāme tu gaṃgāmaṃtradhyānayorviśeṣaḥ |
tāro namo bhagavati vāgbhavaṃ ca hilidvayaṃ ||

hilidvayaṃ paṃcagaṃge māṃ pāvayadvitayaṃ vadet |
svāhāṃtastārakāvarṇo manuḥ pāpapraṇāśanaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||

raktāṃvarāṃ raktavarṇāṃ śūlakuṃbhavarābhayān |
karaiḥ saṃdadhatīsmegraṃ kacchapasthāṃ surādibhiḥ ||

tadrūpābhiḥ sapāyasya nāśāyamunisevitaṃ |
bhuvaneśyā samāloḍyāmṛtīkṛtya sudhāṇunā ||

kavacenāvaguṇṭhyātha saṃrakṣāstreṇa maṃtravit |
mūlena devatāṃ tatra sāṃgāṃ sāvaraṇāṃ tathā ||

samāvāṣka jaledhyātvā tatpādadvayanirgataṃ |
dhyātvā tīrthaṃ smaran mūlamaṃtrī snāyājjalairbhṛśaḥ ||

hṛdidevaṃ smaret paścāt siṃcettu kuṃ kuṃbhamudrayā ||

kuṃbhamudrāyathā ||

dakṣāṃguṣṭhe parāṃguṣṭhe kṣiptvā hastadvayena tu |
sāvakāśā caika muṣṭirmudreyaṃ kuṃbhasaṃjñitā ||

tribhiḥ ślokairmūlamaṃtratāravaṃvījapūrvakaiḥ |
simṛkṣo nikhilaṃ viśvaṃ muhuḥ śukraṃ prajāyate ||

mātaraḥ sarvabhūtānāmāpodevyaḥ punaṃtumāṃ |
alakṣmīmalarūpāyā sarvabhūteṣu saṃsthitāḥ ||

kṣālayaṃ tu nijaḥ sparśādāyo devyaḥ punaṃ tu māṃ |
yanmekeśeṣu daurbhāgyaṃ sīmaṃteyaccamūrddhani ||

lalāṭe karṇayorakṣṇorāpastaṃghnaṃtuvo namaḥ |
tataḥ svāhāṃta mūlena trirā ca manamācaret ||

tridhā devaṃ ca saṃtarpya toyamadhyāttato vrajet |
dhautaṃ vastrayugaṃ dhṛtvā prakṣālyānu karau tathā || 

mṛdābhistatra ācāmedeṣa snānavidhiḥ smṛtaḥ |
maṃtrasnānaṃ prakartavyaṃ śītayordeśa kālayoḥ ||

toyābhāve gate durge kārya svāsthye ca vārddhake |
toyābhāve ca yat kāryaṃ durge kāle ca śītataḥ ||

gamane kṣipra siddhyarthaṃ gurukāryeṣva taṃdritaḥ |
prāptāpadyatha viprendra niśābhāge tathā mune ||

prakṣālyapādā vācamya proddhṛtena tu vāriṇā |
sthānaṃ daśadiśaḥ prāgvat saṃśodhyopaviśet tataḥ ||

<p. 70b> 

jalaṃ hastatalenyasya kramānprāsāṃstataścaret |
mātṛkādīṃstathā mūlemaṃtranyāsā na śeṣataḥ ||

nyāsāṃ te saṃspṛśettoyaṃ maṃtrasnānamidaṃ varaṃ |
devalādudakasnānāt saṃskāra parivarjitāt ||

prabhāsādiṣu tīrtheṣu yatphalaṃ snātakasya tu |
jñeyaṃ daśaguṇaṃ tasmānmaṃtrasnānasya niścayāt ||

atha mānasasnānaṃ ||

manasā mūlamaṃtreṇa prāṇāyāmapurassaraṃ |
kūrvīta mānasaṃ snānaṃ dṛṣṭatīrtheṣu bhāvanāt ||

atha taijasasnānaṃ ||

taijasaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi yena siddhyaṃti siddhayaḥ |
gurudaivatamaṃtrāṇāmaikyaṃ saṃbhāvayeddhiyā ||

gurutejo maṃtratejo devatāyāstathaiva ca |
ekīkṛtyā tricaitanyaṃtanmūrtiṃ parikalpayet ||

hṛdaye devatāsthānaṃ kaṇṭhe caiva manurmataḥ |
sahasrāre gururproktāstri caitanyaṃ vibhāvayet ||

tāṃ mūrtiṃ svasyadehe tu yathāsvā vayavottamāṃ |
saṃbhāvayenmaheśāni daivataddarśanaṃpradaṃ ||

taijasaṃgaditaṃ devidaivataṃ śṛṇu pārvati ||

atha daivataṃsnānaṃ ||

mūlādhāraṃ samārabhya virātaṃ parameśvarī |
devatāṃ bhāvayeddevi svamukhe tanmukhaṃ śive ||

tasyāḥ sarvāṃśakaṃ devi svadehesthānayogataḥ |
dvāradeśa maheśāni gaṃgā ca yamunā tathā ||

svadehe bhāvitāyāṃ tu gaṃgayā kiṃ phalaṃ bhavet ||

iḍānāmanāḍīsthitā vāmabhāge tannordakṣiṇe piṃgalānāmanāḍī |
tayoḥ pṛṣṭhavaṃśaṃ samāśritya madhye suṣumṇā sthitā brahmaraṃdhraṃ tu 
yāvat ||

iḍā gaṃgeti vikhyātā suṣumṇā yamunā nadī |
sarasvatī piṃgalā syāt prayāgaṃ dehamadhyagaṃ ||

dehajñānaṃ vinā devī vāhyasnānena kiṃ phalaṃ |
gurupaṃktiṃ sahasrāre aṃgāni bhrūvibhāvayet ||

kaṇṭhamūlāṃtakaṃ devi sarvāvaraṇadevatāḥ |
bhāvayed yatnato devī daivatasnānamīritaṃ ||

anena snānayogena kiṃ tadyannakaresthitaṃ |
snānapūrvāḥ kriyāḥ sarvāḥ śuddhāṃ siddhiṃ prayāṃti ca ||

tasmāt snānaṃ purākuryāddeṣvekaṃ dehaśaktitaḥ |
tatastu tilakaṃ kuryādvarṇajaṃ daivatasya ca ||

brāhmaṇasyorddhvapuṇḍraṃ syāt kṣatriyasya tripuṇḍrakaṃ |
arddhacaṃdraṃ tu vaiśyasya śūdrāṇāṃ vartulā kṛtiṃ ||

<p. 71a>

ūrddhvapuṇḍraṃ mṛdā kuryāt tripuṇḍraṃ cāpi bhasmanā |
keśareṇa ca kastūryā śeṣaṃ śītaṃ yathā ruci ||

vaiṣṇavasyorddhvapuṇḍraṃ syāt tripuṇḍraṃ śivasevinaḥ |
arddhacaṃdrogaṇeśasya devībhaktasya vartulaṃ ||

nārāyaṇa paro yastu caṃdanasya triśūlakaṃ |
bhāle vibhūtivat kuryādbrahmaviṣṇuśivātmakaṃ ||

bhasmanā corddhvapuṇḍraṃ tu tiryak puṇḍraṃ tathā mṛdā |
ūrddhvapuṇḍreti puṇḍraṃ syāt norddhvapuṇḍraṃ tripuṇḍrake ||

brahmahatyā samaṃ proktaṃ munibhirvedapāragaiḥ |
rudrapiṇḍasamudbhūtādvijāmohasamanvitaḥ ||

pitaraṃ tannajānaṃtitedhiveśyāsutā iva |
tripuṇḍraṃ brāhmaṇo vidvān manasāpi na laṃghayet ||

śrutvā vidhīyate yastu satyāgīyājakī bhavet |
vedasyādhyayane śūdronādhikārī yathā bhavet ||

tripuṇḍraṃ na vipronādhikārī śivārccane |
vibhūtidhāraṇaṃ kāryaṃ vaidikaṃ tāṃtrikaṃ tathā ||

kapilāyā sa kṛcchastraṃ gṛhītaṃ gaganeya tat |
na klinnaṃ nāpi kaṭhinaṃ na durgaṃdhi na coṣitaṃ ||

uparyadhaḥ parityajya gṛhṇīyāt patitaṃ yadi |
piṇḍīkṛtya śivāgnau ca tatkṣipen mūlamaṃtrataḥ ||

apakvamatipakvaṃ ca saṃtyājyaṃ vāsitaṃsitaṃ |
ādāya vāsasāloḍya bhasmādhāre viniḥkṣipet ||

bhasmasaṃgrahaṇaṃ kuryāddevenudvāsite sati |
udvāsane kṛte yasyāccaṇḍabhasma prajāyate ||

bhasmaviddhiparaṃ devi satyaloka sukhāhvayaṃ |
bhasmanā sarvapāśānāṃ pāpānāṃ ca sureśvarī ||

bhasmetikīrtitaṃ tena munibhistatvavedibhiḥ |
tatpunardvividhaṃ viddhimukhyaṃ gauṇaṃ tathaiva ca ||

mukhaṃ proktaṃ paraṃbrahma gauṇamāgneya mucyate |
bhasmaṃ tadevamārabhya mukhaṃ tadaparaṃ vudhaḥ ||

āgneya gauṇamajñānadhvaṃsakaṃ jñānasādhanaṃ |
gauṇaṃ nānāvidhaṃ viddhi śubhaprāṇaharemvike ||

agnihotrāgnijaṃ taddhi virajāhomajaṃ śive |
aupānasa samutpannaṃ samidāgni samudbhavaṃ ||

pacanāgni samudbhūtaṃdāvānala samudbhavaṃ |
traivarṇikāṇāṃ sarveṣāmagnihotra samudbhavaṃ ||

virajānalajaṃ caiva dhāryaṃ bhasma na gātmaje |
aupāna sa samutpannaṃ gṛhasthānāṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

<p. 71b>

samidagni samutpannaṃ dhāryaṃ vai brahmacāriṇāṃ |
śūdrāṇāṃ śrotragṛhajaṃ paramāgni samudbhavaṃ ||

anyeṣāmapi sarveṣāṃ dhāryaṃ kavānalodbhavaṃ |
yadā dvijā bhasmakuryuḥ sadyenānīya gomayaṃ ||

vāmena pātre saṃyojyā ghoramaṃtreṇa nirdahet |
puruṣeṇa samuddhṛtya īśānena viśodhayet ||

itthaṃ tu saṃskṛtaṃ bhasma agnirityādi maṃtrataḥ |
tadrudrāyeti yajuṣāmaṃtra vedrudrasaṃjñavā ||

praṇavādyaiścaturmaṃtrairhṛdayaitairnāmabhiḥ priye |
paṃcavarṇādyakṣarādyairbhālāṃsādarahṛtsu ca ||

tripuṇḍradhāraṇaṃ kuryāt mūrddhni paṃcākṣareṇa ca |
ebhiścanāmabhirdhāryaṃ punarbhasma dvijādibhiḥ ||

brahmālalāṭe vijñeyo hṛdaye havyavāhanaḥ |
nābhauskaṃdogalepūṣārudryedakṣiṇavāhuke ||

ādityo vāhumadhye ca śaśī ca maṇivaṃdhake |
vāmadevo vāmavāhau vāhumadhye prabhaṃjanaḥ ||

maṇibaṃdhe ca vasavaḥ pṛṣṭadeśe hariḥ smṛtaḥ |
śaṃbhūḥ kakudi saṃproktaḥ paramātmāśirasmṛtaḥ ||

ābrahmaraṃdhrapādāṃtaṃ yogināmāplavaṃ mataṃ |
nābherūrddhvaṃ gṛhasthānāṃ yatīnāṃ ca viśeṣaṇaṃ ||

idānīṃ tāṃtrikamataṃ tanmenigaditaṃ śṛṇu |
kastūryādi susaṃyuktaṃ bhasmaśāktastu dhārayet ||

maṃtritairmūlamaṃtreṇa śivapaṃcākṣareṇa vā |
anyeṣāmapi sarveṣāṃ vinā maṃtraṃ sureśvarī ||

atha viśeṣastu ||

vibhūtidhāraṇasyāsyamaṃtrasya ca sadāśivaḥ |
ṛṣistṛṣṭup bhavecchaṃdo rudrodevaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

prāsādavījaṃ vījasyāt śaktiṃ kūrcaṃ ca kīlakaṃ |
kṣetrapālaṃ sarvapāpakṣayārthe viniyogitā ||

nyāsaṃ ṛṣyādikaṃ kṛtvā mūlena vīkṣaṇaṃ tataḥ |
saṃsmṛtyetthaṃ dakṣakare vibhūtiṃ vinidhāya hi ||

ācchādya vāmahastena kapotābhi navātmanā |
vakṣyamāṇena maṃtreṇa trivāramabhimaṃtrayet ||

phaṭkāreṇa trirāvṛtyajalena veṣṭanaṃ caret |
paṃcavāraṃ mūlamanuṃjaptvā sodhanamācaret ||

tato dakṣakarādvāmakare bhasmanidhāya hi |
tato mūlena manunājalenālodrayetpriye ||

vartulaṃ maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tasya madhyagaṃ |
trikoṇaṃ tasya cāpyaṃtarmūlabījaṃ dvijottamaḥ ||

dakṣakareṇacāchādyamaṃtramenaṃ japet tataḥ |
prāsādaṃ kūrcabījaṃ ca kṣatrapālaṃ tathāṃkuśaṃ ||

<p. 72a>

vibhūtipadamābhāṣya aśeṣaduritāpahe |
manovākkāyamityuktvā śādhaye dvitayaṃ vade || 

kūrcāstra vahni lalanāyukto maṃtraḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
atra kaścana viśeṣosti śmaśānabhasmadhāraṇe ||

mūlena vīkṣaṇaṃ kuryāt kūrceṇa veṣṭanaṃ caret |
tāramaidhatrayākāmakūrcavarmāstrahṛnmanuḥ ||

anena manunā devi saptavāraṃ viśodhya ca |
paścānmūlamanuṃ japtvā daśavāraṃ sureśvari ||

trivāraṃ saptavāraṃ vā sveṣṭa devyai nivedya ca |
tadaṃte tilakaṃ kuryāddevatā bhāvasiddhaye ||

tripuṇḍraṃ bhasmanā kuryādiṣṭamaṃtreṇa mānavaḥ |
tripuṇḍraṃ kārayedbhāle brahmaviṣṇuśivātmakaṃ ||

madhyamānāmikā caiva tarjanyaiva tripuṇḍrakaṃ |
atisvalpamanādhṛṣyamati dīrghāṃtamakṣayaṃ ||

netrayugmapramāṇena tripuṇḍraṃ dhārayedvijaḥ |
ṣaḍaṃgula pramāṇaṃ tu brāhmaṇānāṃ tripuṇḍrakaṃ ||

nṛpāṇāṃ caturaṃgulyaṃ vaiśyānāṃ tu triraṃgulaṃ |
ekāṃgulaṃ tu śūdrāṇāṃ nārīṇāṃ tu visarjanaṃ ||

brahmāviṣṇuścarudraśca tripuṃḍrasyādhidevatāḥ |
dhyāryaṃ bhasmatripuṇḍraṃ tu gṛhīṇājalasaṃyutaṃ ||

sarvakālaṃ bhave strīṇāṃ yatīnāṃ jalavarjitaṃ |
evaṃ bhasmadhṛtaṃ yena tasya puṇyaphalaṃ śṛṇu ||

mahāpātakasaṃghāśca tathānye copapātakāḥ |
naśyaṃti khalu deveśi satyaṃ satyaṃ ca nānyathā ||

vahunoktena kiṃ bhasmadhāraṇaṃ mokṣasādhanaṃ |
bhūtidā tu vibhūtiḥ syādvidhinā vidhṛtā yadi ||

yathā kathaṃ cidvi dhṛtā bhasmasāt kurute janaṃ |
dhṛtvā bhasma tu yo mohāt karau prakṣālayadbhuvi ||

sa raurave vasenmartyau yāvadā caṃdratārakaṃ |
yāvaṃtaḥ patitā bhūmau bhasmanaḥ paramāṇavaḥ ||

tāvadvarṣa sahasrāṇi naro bhavati kilviṣī |
vibhūtidhāraṇaṃ cādau tilakaṃ caṃdanena tu ||

viśeṣatastu śāktānāṃ dvayamāvaśyakaṃ priye |
ato nivodha vidhivat tadvaccaṃdanadhāraṇaṃ ||

vāme karatale śvetaṃ sthāpayitvā tu caṃdanaṃ |
mūlamaṃtraṃ vilikhyātra tato'nāmikayā nanu ||

gṛhītvā prakṣiped bhūmau paṃcamaṃtrāṃ samuccaran |
tārādyāśca hṛdaṃtyāśca ṅeṃtā api samīritā ||

jñānecche ca kriyāśaktiḥ kāmāḥ sarvakalottarāḥ |
ācchādya dakṣiṇe naiva tataḥ karatalena tu ||

<p. 72b>

gṛṇanmaṃtraṃ vakṣyamāṇaṃ kuryāt tilakamīśvari |
alaṃghayan bhasmarekhāṃ tiryagrekhāṃ vidhānataḥ ||

māyā kāmarūṣaḥ sarvajanamohini voddharet |
sarvādvaśaṃkarītyuktvānāṃ tato rakṣayugmakaṃ ||

astraṃ śiroyuto maṃtro mayā te parikīrtitaḥ |
etat taṃtroditaṃ devi proktaṃ tilakadhāraṇaṃ ||

atha saṃdhyā |

ācamya prāṅmukho bhūtvā upaviśya ca maṃtravit |
vaidikīṃ tāṃtrikīṃ kuryāt tataḥ saṃdhyāṃ samāhitaḥ ||

vakṣyetha tāṃtrikīṃ saṃdhyāṃ mūlenācamanatrayaṃ ||

vidyābhede saṃdhyāsaṃkhyāmāha ||

suṃdaryāstu catuḥkālaṃ saṃdhyāvaṃdanamācaret |
prātaḥkāle ca madhyāhne sāyāhne hyarddharātrake ||

caturvidhā tu gāyatrī japed yatnena pārvatī |
prastārā kṛtirūpā ca upasthānābhidhā tathā ||

vāṃchā kalpalatā devi caturthī parikīrtitā |
ṣaṣṭhī pārāyaṇaṃ prātarmadhyāhne nama saṃjñakaṃ ||

maṃtrapārāyaṇaṃ rātrau niśāyāṃ cakrasaṃjñakaṃ |
kālikāyāmidaṃ proktamupasthānavivarjitaṃ ||

medhādīkṣādirājñītvāt kālyāṃ saṃdhyāṃ catuṣṭayaṃ |
saṃdhyā trayaṃ ca tārāyācchinnāyāṃ trividhaṃ bhavet ||

etāsāṃ na hi bhedosti bhedabhāg narakaṃ vrajet |
śikhāṃ vadhvātha mūlena prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ caret ||

aṃgāni vinyaseddehe karanyāsa purassaraṃ |
amṛtīkṛtya purato jalaṃ vaṃdhenu mudrayā ||

abhimaṃtrya ca mūlena saptavāraṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
akārādi kṣakārāṃtairmātṛkārṇaiḥ sa viṃdubhiḥ ||

pratyarṇaṃ prokṣeyenmūrddhni kuśamūlena ca tridhā |
devaṃ dhyātvātha manuvit bhānumaṇḍala saṃsthitaṃ ||

ādāyatoyamā maṃtryairvījairbhūtātmakaistathā |
laṃ vaṃ raṃ yaṃ haṃ iti ca tānyetaiḥ saptadhārajaṃ ||

maṃtrayitvā punaḥ saptavāraṃ mūlena maṃtrayet |
tajjalaṃ vāmahastena dhāryaṃ tatsruta viṃdubhiḥ ||

dakṣahastena saṃprokṣyakaṃ paṭhanmūlamaṃtrakaṃ |
hastavyabhyāsa nādvāmācārī sevanamācaret ||

nāsāmāśliṣya śiṣṭena tejorūpeṇa tena tu |
praviśyāṃtargataṃ sarvaṃ malaṃ saṃśodhya nirgataṃ ||

dakṣanāsāpuṭe naitat smṛtvā dakṣiṇahastagaṃ |
vāmabhāge dakṣaśilāṃ dhyātvāstreṇa ca tatkṣipet ||

prakṣālyahastā vācamya mūlamaṃtreṇa maṃtravit |
gāyatryāvatha mūlena dadyādarghya trayaṃ tataḥ |

<p. 73a>

sūryamaṇḍala vāsinyai devatāyai tataḥ paraṃ |
arghamaṃjalimādāya gāyatryā ca trirutkṣipet ||

tārāyāṃ tu viśeṣaḥ |

kupītamodra puṣpaṃ ca kulapuṣpaṃ kuśājalaṃ |
akṣatāśca tathā tāmre kṛtvā cārghyaṃ nivedayet ||

mūlāṃte codyadāditya padānmaṇḍala ityapi |
vartinyai śivacaitanyamayyai svāheti tanmanuḥ ||

puruṣāṇāṃ viśeṣaḥ ||

ravimaṃḍala saṃsthāya sveṣṭadevāya cārpayet |
tathā śaktyā japedvidyāṃ gāyatrī tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

aṣṭottaraśatāvṛtyā gāyatrīṃ prajapetsudhīḥ |
mahāpātaka yuktopi prajaped daśadhā yadi ||

satyaṃ satyaṃ mahādevi mukto bhavati tatkṣaṇāt |
śaktāśakta prabhedena gāyatrī daśadhā japet ||

jalena mūlamaṃtrāṃtehyamukaṃ tarpayāmi ca |
uktvā tridhā tarpaṇīyaṃ vāmakaiḥ kāraṇena tu ||

iṣṭadevasya gāyatrīmaṣṭāviṃśati saṃkhyakāṃ |
japedabhāve brāhmī tu vaidikaṃ matamāśritaḥ ||

tāṃtrikaḥ śivagāyaṃvījapetsāthanirūpyate |
oṃ tanmaheśāya vidmahe vāgviśuddhāyadhīmahi ||

tannaḥ śivapracodayāt ||

atha gāyatrī dhyānaṃ pūrvāhne ||

udyadāditya saṃkāśāṃ pustakākṣakarāṃ smaret |
kṛṣṇājīnadharāṃ brāhmīṃ dhyāyettārakitāṃvare ||

madhyāhne ||

śyāmavarṇāṃ caturvāhuṃ śaṃkhacakralasatkarāṃ |
gadāpadmadharo devī sūryaviṃvakṛtāśrayā ||

sāyāhne ||

sāyāhne varadāṃ devīṃ gāyatrīṃ saṃsmaredvudhaḥ |
śuklāṃ śuklāṃ varadharāṃ vṛṣāsana kṛtāśrayāṃ ||

trinetrāṃ varadaṃ pāśaṃ śūlaṃ ca nṛkaroṭikāṃ |
sūryamaṇḍala madhyasthāṃ dhyāyeddevīṃ samabhyaset ||

atha śyāmayā gāyatrī vidhānaṃ ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

gāyatrīyā purā proktā devadeva jagatpate |
ṛṣyādi caivakaṃ dhyānaṃ japapūjādikaṃ tathā ||

sādhanaṃ ca mahādeva kathayasvamayi prabho ||

śrībhairava uvāca ||

kathayāmi mahādeva śṛṇuṣva prāṇavallabhe |
śrīkṛṣṇastu ṛṣistasyāḥ gāyatrī chaṃda eva ca ||

śivaśaktisvarūpā hi devatā parikīrtitāḥ |
dhyānaṃ caiva vadāmyatra śṛṇuṣva devi bhaktitaḥ ||

<p. 73b>

śmaśāne ca mahākālīṃ devīṃ dhyāyeddigaṃvarāṃ |
daṃṣṭrā karālavadanāṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ ||

dakṣiṇorddhe dhanudhatte vāme caiva tathā śarān |
adhaḥ pāśaṃ ca khaḍgaṃ ca tat kramāt parikīrtitaṃ ||

evaṃ dhyātvā mahākālīṃ japellakṣa catuṣṭayaṃ |
rudhirāktairvilvapatraistaddaśāṃśena homayet ||

sādhanaṃ ca mahādevi pūrvavat samupācaret ||

athādyā gāyatrī yathā ||

kālikāyai padaṃ coktā vidmahe tadanaṃtaraṃ |
śmaśānavāsinīdreṃtaṃ dhīmahīti tato vadet ||

tannoghore padaṃ procya pravadecca pracodayāt |
asyāḥ prasādamātreṇa mahāpātakakoṭayaḥ ||

sadyaḥ pralayamāyāṃti sādhakasya na cānyatā |
rāvaṇasya vadhāccaiva rāmacaṃdro vimohitaḥ ||

mātṛvadhāt parśurāmomocito'syāḥ prasādataḥ |
surāpānnācca śrīkṛṣṇodattātreyastathaiva ca ||

brahmaṇaśca śiraḥ chedādahaṃ rudrovimocitaḥ |
evameṣā mahāvidyā gāyatrīdevi suṃdarī ||

mahāpātaka yuktopi prajapeddaśadhāyadi |
satyaṃ satyaṃ mahādevi mukto bhavati tatkṣaṇāt ||

brahmahatyādayaḥ pāpāḥ khaṃḍaṃ khaṇḍaṃ vrajaṃti hi |
nānayā sadṛśī vidyānānena sadṛśo japaḥ ||

nānena sadṛśaṃ jñānaṃ na bhūtaṃ na bhaviṣyati ||

atha tārāyāḥ ||

tārāyai padamābhāṣya vidmahe tadanaṃtaraṃ |
nahogrāyai padaṃ procya dhīmahīti tataḥ punaḥ ||

tannodevi padaṃ procya vadet paścāt pracodayāt ||

atha chinnāyāḥ ||

vairocanyai vidmahe ca chinnamastāyai ca dhīmahī |
tanno devipadaṃ coktvā yojanīyaṃ pracodayāt ||

atha tripurasuṃdaryāḥ ||

vāgbhavaṃ tripurādevī vidmahe tadanaṃtaraṃ |
kāmavījaṃ samuccārya kāmeśvaryai ca dhīmahī ||

tannaḥ klinne padaṃ coktvā vadet paścāt pracodayāt ||

atha bhairavyāḥ ||

tripurā ca tathāṅeṃtaṃ vidmahe padamuddharet |
bhairavyaiśca tataścoktvā dhīmahīti tato vadet ||

tato devī padaṃ coktvā pracodayāddudīrayet |
gāyatrī traipurākhyātā vāgbhavādyaṃ samuddharet ||

atha kamalāyāḥ ||

mahālakṣmīpadaṃ procya vidmahe tadanaṃtaraṃ |
mahāśriyai padaṃ coktvā dhīmahī ca padaṃ vadet ||

tannaḥ śabdācchrīpadaṃ ca tato dadyāt pracodayāt ||

atha bhuvaneśvaryāḥ ||

<p. 74a>

māyāvījaṃ samuccārya bhuvaneśvaryai ca vidmahe |
ādyāyai padamuccārya dhīmahī tadanantaraṃ ||

tannodevī padaṃ procya tato deyaṃ pracodayāt ||

atha mātaṃgī ||

atha vakṣyāmi gāyatrī sādhakasya varapradāṃ |
śukapriyāyai vidmahe śrīkāmeśvarī dhīmahī ||

tannaḥ (******)(?) śyāmādevī pracodayāt ||

atha dhūmāvatī ||

dhūmiti vījamuccārya dhūmāvatīti vidmahe |
vivarṇādevī padato dhīmahī padamuddharet ||

dūmādevyāstu gāyatrī tannoghora pracodayāt ||

atha vagalāmukhī ||

sthiramāyā samuccārya vagalāpadatomukhī |
vidmahe duṣṭayadataḥ staṃbhinī padamuccaret ||

dhīmahīti padasyāṃte tanno devī pracodayāt |
vagalāyā maheśāni gāyatrīyaṃ prakīrtitā ||

atha gaṇeśasya ||

tatpuruṣāya vidmahe vakratuṇḍāya dhīmahī |
tannodaṃtī padaṃ procya vadet paścāt pracodayāt ||

athādityasya ||

saptaturaṃgāya padāt vidmahe padamuddharet |
sahasrakiraṇaṃ ṅeṃtaṃ dhīmahī padataḥ punaḥ ||

tannoraviḥ padaṃ procya tato jñeyaṃ pracodayāt ||

atha nārāyaṇasya ||

nārāyaṇāya vidmahe vāsudevāya dhīmahī ||

tanno viṣṇuḥ pracodayāt ||

japitvā cārpayeddevastutvā natveṣṭadevatāṃ |
sūryamaṇḍalato devaṃ vinyaseddhṛdayesvake ||

tato guruṃ ca praṇamediti saṃdhyā tu tāṃtrikī |
iti saṃdhyā trayaṃ proktaṃ karmiṇāṃ siddhidāyakaṃ ||

trikālamevaṃ kartavyāḥ saṃdhyālopāt phalaṃ na hi |
saṃdyālopaṃ na kurvīta kadācidapi kutracit ||

prātaḥ saṃdhyā sa nakṣatrāḥ sa sūryāśāpamucyate |
muhūrta paṃcakādūrddhaṃ viṃśatye vāgyathā yathā ||

āsannābhijitaḥ kālaḥ śreṣṭhaḥ śreṣṭhastathā tathā |
saṃdhyākālasya mukhyasyalope nāḍītrayāṃtare ||

prāyaścittaṃ tvekamarghyamadhikaṃ saṃpradīyate |
paraḥ saṃdhyākālatorvāgjate kāle tatodhike ||

aṣṭhottaraṃ śataṃ tatra gāyatryā japa iṣyate |
rājñārurddha gadātervāgīvāvaśyaka karmaṇi ||

prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā gāyatryāṣṭottaraṃśataṃ |
yadā tu tāṃtrikaṃ devī tadā mūlaṃ śataṃ japet ||

prāyaścittāyatāṃ kṛtvā kurvīta samayāgatāṃ ||

atha tarpaṇaṃ ||

vaidikaṃ tarpaṇaṃ kṛtvā tatastāṃtrikamārabhet |
prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā mūlena nyāsamācaret ||

ṛṣyādi tritayasyātha purato dhenumudrayā |
vaṃ japannamṛtī kṛtyajalaṃ tatra sa cakrakaṃ ||

maṃtrarājaṃ jale dhyātvā tatra devīnnidhāya ca |
gurupaṃktiṃ ca saṃtarya vaṭukādīśca tarpayet ||

<p. 74b>

mūladevīṃ ca saṃtarpya tarpayet parivārākan |
tarpayed dvārapālādīn tathaivāṃgādi devatāḥ ||

śaṃkhikā suṃdarāṃ paścādaiśyāṃ ca paramaṃ guruṃ |
agnau parāparaṃ caiva nair(-)ṛtyāṃ parameṣṭitaṃ ||

vāyavyādīśa paryaṃtaṃ gurupaṃktiṃ ca tarpayet |
aṅgāni tattatsthāneṣu madhye devīṃ ca tarpayet ||

mūlāṃte cāmukīṃ devīṃ tarpayāmi tataḥ paraṃ |
vahnijāyāṃtako maṃtro devīnāṃ tarpaṇe smṛtaḥ ||

atha puruṣāṇāṃ ||

tarpayāmi padaṃ yojyaṃ maṃtrāṃte sveṣu nāmasu |
dvitīyāṃ teṣu cetyevaṃ tarpaṇasya manurmataḥ ||

ekaviṃśati saṃkhyā vā daśadhā vā tridhāpi vā |
ekaimaṃjaliṃ toyaṃ parivārān pratarpayet ||

devasyāmṛta vudhyā tu tīrthatoyaiḥ pratarpayet |
tīrthodakaistu paśubhiḥ vāmādyaikāraṇena tu ||

aśaktau mūlamuccārya devīmātraṃ pratarpayet |
saṃsmṛtya bhairavaṃ devaṃ mārtaṇḍākhyamumāpatiṃ ||

mūlena manunādevaṃ sūryasya manunātha vā |
māyāvījaṃ samuddhṛtya sohaṃ tu viparītataḥ ||

mārtaṇḍa bhairavaṃ ṅentaṃ prakāśaṃ śakti saṃyutaṃ |
sūryasya matraḥ saṃproktaḥ stridhā cārghyaṃ prakalpayet ||

yāvannadīyate cārghyaṃ bhāskarāya nivedanaṃ |
tāvanna pūjayed viṣṇuṃ śaṃkaraṃ vā sureśvarī ||

saṃtarpya devīṃ svahṛditīrthaṃ sūryavisarjayet |
guruṃ digīśāṃśca khagānnatvā bhāṇḍaṃ kare dadhan ||

jalapūrṇaṃ vrajenmaunī sveṣṭadevaṃ hṛdismaran |
ekāṃtaṃ nirjanaṃ yāyānmanojñaṃ doṣavarjitaṃ ||

digaṃtaraṃ na vīkṣyeta yāvat prāpnoti vai gṛham ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau prātaḥkṛtyādinirṇayo nāma paṃcadaśaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 
15 ||

atha sarvadhāraṇa nityārcanavidhirlikhyate ||

pūrvajanmapraśamanājjanmamṛtyu nivāraṇāt |
saṃpūrṇaphaladānācca pūjeti kathitā priye ||

pradakṣiṇaṃ yajñavāṭaṃ kṛtvā pādau ca hastakau |
prakṣālyācamya pūjāyāḥ gṛhadvārātalesthitaḥ ||

gehe ca dvāradeśesthaḥ praṇamya manasā guruṃ |
praṇamyediṣṭadevaṃsvaṃ dikpālānapi cetasā ||

yatpūrvamarjitaṃ pāpaṃ taddinenyadinepi vā |
tatpāpasyāyanodārthaṃ maṃtradvayamudīrayet ||

he deva prākṛtaṃ cittaṃ pāpākrāṃtamidaṃ manaḥ |
tanniḥ sāraya cittānme pāpaṃ phaṭ phaṭ ca te namaḥ ||

<p. 75a>

sūryaḥ somoyamaḥ kālā mahābūtāni paṃca ca |
ete śubhāśubhasyeha karmaṇo navasākṣiṇaḥ ||

huṃphaḍiti bruvan krodhadṛṣṭyā paśyecca pārśvayoḥ |
evaṃ kṛte prathamaḥ pāpotsādanakarmaṇi ||

yasmāddṛḍhataraṃ pāpaṃ taddūrecāvatiṣṭhatu |
atīte pūjanesthāne svaṃprayāṃ tu punaśca tat ||

yasmādalpataraṃ pāpaṃ tannāśamupagacchati |
pūjanetyakta pāpasya kāmamiṣṭaṃ kṣaṇād bhavet ||

tataḥ prakṣālya pādau ca hastā vācamya yatnataḥ |
dadyādarghyaṃ dineśāya tatprakāra ihocyate ||

gomayenopaliptāyāṃ bhūmau kṛtvā tu maṇḍalaṃ |
siṃdūreṇa tataḥ paścādupaviśya nijāsane ||

prāṅmukhaḥ praṇamediṣṭa devatāṃ bhakti tatparaḥ |
prāṇāyāma trayaṃ kṛtvā sūryamaṃtreṇa maṃtravit ||

hrīṁ hrīṁ saḥ iti sūryasya tryakṣaro maṃtra ucyate |
vinyasya ca tathendrādīn dhyātvā sūryamananyadhīḥ ||

parādvayā bhayavarāndadhataṃ karābjairmāṇikyamaulimaruṇāṃgaruciṃ trinetraṃ 
|
raktāṃvujāsanamaśeṣaguṇaikasiṃdhuṃbhānuṃ samastajagatāṃmadhiyaṃ 
bhajāmi ||

tatkalpoktavidhānena pūjayedupacārakaiḥ |
purato maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā jalena caturasrakaṃ ||

nidhāya tatra sādhāraṃ sajalaṃ tāmrapātrakaṃ |
gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatān darbhān durvāśarṣapa saṃyutān ||

sa tilānukta puṣpāṇi yavāṃścāpi pravinyaset |
sūryamaṃtreṇa tatpātraṃ spṛśannaṣṭottaraṃśataṃ ||

abhimaṃtrya ca tatpātraṃ samutthāya karadvayāt |
mūrddhāṃta sūryamaṃtreṇa dadyādarghyaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

hrīṁ hrīṁ saḥ sa graharāśi nakṣatra padamuccaret |
tataśca yogakaraṇaḥ parivṛttāsaneti ca ||

saṃsthitaḥ śrīsūryāyaiṣaterghasvāhā manuḥ smṛtaḥ |
catuḥ striṃśadakṣaroyaṃ sūryasyārghaṃ nivedane ||

japet tato yathā śaktyā sūryamaṃtra mananyadhīḥ |
tadarghāṃvu plutaṃ sūryaṃ dhyāyandeśikasattamaḥ ||

stutvā praṇamya visṛjen maṇḍalātaṃ divākaraṃ |
tata utthāya vidhivad dvārapūjāṃ samārabhet ||

dvāramarghyāṃvunā prokṣya tanmadhye vighnayaṃ yajet |
taddakṣiṇe mahālakṣmīṃ vāme cāpi sarasvatīṃ ||

dvāraśriyaṃ ca tanmadhye śākhayordakṣiṇānyayoḥ |
ūrddhvabhāgāttaraṃ yāvat paṃcapaṃcavibhāgake ||

<p. 75b>

nāmasyādyakṣaraṃ viṃduyuktaṃ nāma ca ṅeṃtakaṃ |
samuccārya hṛtaṃ taṃ ca devānetān prapūjayet ||

gaṇapatiṃ kṣetrapālaṃ tataśca vasuṃdhārayā |
yuktaṃ śaṃkha nidhiṃ dakṣe vāmeva sumatīyutaṃ ||

pūjayitvā padmanidhiṃ tadadhādakṣavāmataḥ |
māyāśaktiṃ ca cicchaktiṃ gaṃgā ca yamunāṃ tathā ||

dhatāraṃ ca vidhātāraṃdaṃ dehalyai namastvadhaḥ |
ādau tu paścimadvāra pūjāve cedyaṃ prakāśitā ||

naṃdī cāpi mahākālīṃ dvārayordakṣa vāmayoḥ |
saṃpūjyaiva mudagdvāraṃ prāgyāmye ca prapūjayet ||

dvārapālau kramātteṣu gaṇeśavṛṣabhāvapi |
bhṛṃgirīṭṭistathāskaṃda umācaṃḍeśvarau tathā ||

viṣṇornaṃdaḥ sunaṃdaśca caṇḍaścāpi pracaṃḍakaḥ |
valaśca pravalaścaiva bhadraścāpi subhadrakaḥ ||

vakratuṇḍaika daṃṣṭrau ca mahodaragajānanau |
laṃbodaraśca vikaṭo gaṇeśadvārapālakāḥ ||

vighnarājo dhūmravarṇaḥ kramāt paścimadvārataḥ |
devyāḥ sūryasya yoginyoṣṭāvetā dvārapālakāḥ ||

brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā |
vārāhī ca tatheṃdrāṇī cāmuṇḍā ca śriyāsaha ||

atha vakṣye dvāradeva dhyānaṃ taṃtreṣu gopitaṃ |
devadvāraṃ dvāradevāsvayamudghāṭayaṃṭi yat ||

pāśāṃkuśa phalāṃ bhojapāṇiṃ pāṭala tuṃḍilaṃ |
vīraṃ vighneśvaraṃ vaṃde gajavaktraṃ trilocanaṃ ||

padmadvaya varābhīti lasatpāṇī catuṣṭayaṃ |
nirddagdha hemagaurāṃgī mahālakṣmīṃ trilocanāṃ ||

akṣasrak pustakābhīti varahastāṃ trilocanāṃ |
śvetapadmāsanāṃ śuklāṃ śvetavastrāṃ sarasvatīṃ ||

taptakārtasvarobhāsā divyaratnavibhūṣitā |
dvāraśrīrūrddhva padmasthāvarābhayakarāṃbujā ||

sitogajāsyaḥ paraśuṃdaṇḍaṃ pāśaṃ triśūlakaṃ |
bhujaiścaturbhirvibhrāṇo mūṣakoparisaṃsthitaḥ ||

kapālaśūlavibhrāṇāṃ kṛpāluṃ kṛṣṇa vigrahaṃ |
tryakṣaṃ tīkṣṇaṃ bhāvayāmi kṣetreśaṃ kṣatavidviṣaṃ ||

vasudhārāṃdakṣabhujenāliṃgaṃtaṃ su tuṃḍilaṃ |
vāme śaṃkhadharaṃ muktānibhaṃ śaṃkhanidhiṃ bhaje ||

āliṃgaṃ taṃ vasumaṃtī lalāṭe padmacihnitaṃ |
padmanidhiṃ maṇinibhaṃ vāmenotpaladhāriṇaṃ ||

<p. 76a>

varāṃkuśābhīti pāśahastāṃ saṃsāramūlikāṃ |
trinetrāṃ śyāmavarṇāṃtā śyāmāṃ māyāmahaṃbhaje ||

pāśāṃkuśāvarābhītīṃ dadhānāmaruṇa prabhāṃ |
trinetrāṃ citkalāṃ vaṃde gaurīṃ raktāṃvarojjvalāṃ ||

varābhayakarāṃ saumyāṃ somakoṭi samaprabhāṃ |
bhaje gaṃgā mahādevīṃ parāṃ deva taraṃgiṇīṃ ||

varābhayakarāṃ vede kāliṃdī kālavigrahāṃ |
kṛṣṇakacchapamārūḍhāṃ kaṃṭho nīlotpala prabhāṃ ||

kartāraṃ jagatāṃ vaṃde śaṃkhacakragadāṃvujaṃ |
vibhrāṇaṃ garuḍārūḍhaṃ dhātāraṃ kṛṣṇavigrahaṃ ||

raktaṃ raktāraviṃdasthaṃ varābhaya kamaṇḍaluṃ |
haṃsārūḍhaṃ vidhātāraṃ vaṃde tryakṣa samanvitaṃ ||

siṃhārūḍhāṃ śyāmavarṇāṃ khaḍgakheṭakadhāriṇīṃ |
adhasthā dehalī vaṃde paścimasyāṃ sudakṣiṇīṃ ||

paścimadvāramāsādya tālatritaya pūrvakaṃ |
dvāramudvādyacāstreṇa maṃtritān sarṣapākṣatān ||

puṣpayuktāṃstu vikiren maṇḍapābhyaṃtare vudhaḥ |
nārā ca mudrayāsanyagastre maṃtreṇa deśikaḥ ||

apakrāmaṃ tu bhūtāni piśācāḥ pretaguhyakāḥ |
ye cātra nivasatyanye devatā bhuvisaṃsthitāḥ ||

apasarpaṃ tu ye bhūtā ye bhūtā bhuvisaṃsthitāḥ |
ye bhūtā vighnakartāraste naśyaṃ tu śivājñayā ||

ślokayoraṃ tataścāstraṃ paṭhantārā ca mudrayā |
kṣiptvā tānmaṇḍapasyāṃ taṃ tato vighnāṃstu nirgatān ||

svavāmāṃgasya saṃkocān mārgaṃ datvāya sārayet |
astramaṃtraṃ smaran vāmapārṣṇighāta trayeṇa ca ||

bhaumānutsādayettāla tritayeṇāṃtarīkṣagān |
tiryagdṛṣṭyāvalokena divyān vighnānnivārayet ||

dakṣapādaṃ puraskṛtya praviśeddevamadiraṃ |
śāktastu vāmapādena dvāramācchādya vāsasā ||

paṃcagavyārghatoyābhyāṃ prokṣayen maṇḍapāṃtaraṃ |
saṃmārjanopalepādyairdarpaṇodaravat kṛtaṃ ||

vimalaṃ dhūpadīpādi puṣpadāmādiśobhitaṃ |
paṃcavarṇa rajaścitraṃ sthāna śuddhiriyaṃ matā ||

nair(-)ṛtyāmarcayedvāstu puruṣaṃ vaṃdanādibhiḥ |
tatraiva vāstvadhīśāya brahmaṇe nama ityapi ||

raktavarṇaṃ raktavarṇa śaktidvādaśa saṃyutaṃ |
pūjayitvā dīpanāthaṃ bhairavaṃ prārthayediti ||

<p. 76b>

atitīkṣṇa mahākāya kalpāṃta dahanoyamaṃ |
bhairavāya namastubhyaṃ manujñāṃ dātumarhasi ||

aḥ phaḍiti maṃtreṇa pūjāvedīṃ tato viśet |
saṃskuryādāsanasthānaṃ caturbhirvīkṣyaṇādibhiḥ ||

saṃskāre tatra saṃpūjyā vedyāṃtāḥ pīṭhadevatāḥ |
ādhāraśaktimārabhya svāsanaṃ tatra vinyaset ||

pūjāsanamathātmīyaṃ cailājina kuśottaraṃ |
kaṃvale lohite vāpi kṛṣṇe vā vyāghra carmaṇi ||

sanyāsaṃ brahmacārī tu viśet kṛṣṇasya carmaṇi |
vyāghrājināṃ sarvasiddhyai jñānasiddhirmṛgājine ||

vastrāsanaṃ rogaharaṃ vetrajaṃ prītivarddhanaṃ |
kauśeyaṃ puṣṭidaṃ proktaṃ kaṃvalaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ ||

śuklaṃ vādya divā kṛṣṇaṃ viśeṣādraktakaṃvalaṃ |
śvete tu kambale dharmaṃ siddhiraktertha siddhayaḥ ||

pīte kāmo dvijānyeṣāṃ mokṣadaḥ kṛṣṇakaṃ valaḥ |
duḥkhamuktyai raṃjitastu nīlīraṃgo na śobhanaḥ ||

atha niṣiddhāsanaṃ ||

tṛṇapallavakāṣṭhāṇi pāṣāṇaṃ mṛnmayaṃ tathā |
vaṃśāsanaṃ ca vastraṃ ca kevalaṃ kṣitimāsanaṃ ||

evamaṣṭavidhaṃ devi cāsanaṃ parivarjayet |
tatropaviśyavidhivatsmaredviṣṇuṃ guruṃmudā ||

merupṛṣṭha ṛṣiḥ proktaḥ sutalaṃ chaṃda īritaṃ |
pṛthivī devatā proktā viniyogo nijāsane ||

pṛthvī tvayā dhṛtā lokā devitvaṃ viṣṇunā dhṛtā |
tvaṃ ca dhārayamāṃ devi pavitraṃ kuru cāsanaṃ ||

āsanasya catuṣkoṇe gaṇeśaṃ ca sarasvatīṃ |
durgāṃ kṣatrapatiṃ cāpi brahmādiṣu samarcayet ||

udaṅmukhaḥ prāṅmukho vāsvastikāsanamāsthitaḥ |
padmāsanagato vāpi ṛjukāyo namaḥ sthiraḥ ||

atha svastika padmāsanayorlakṣaṇaṃ ||

jānūrvāraṃtare samyak kṛtvā pādatale ubhe |
ṛtukāyaḥ samāsīnaḥ svastikaṃ tadudīritaṃ ||

vāmo rūparidakṣiṇaṃ tu caraṇaṃ saṃsthāpya vāmaṃ tathāyāmyorūpari 
paścimena dvividhinā dhṛtvā karābhyāṃ dṛḍhaṃ |
aṃguṣṭhau hṛdaye nidhāya civukaṃ nāsāgramālokayadetadvyādhi 
vighātakāriyamināṃ padmāsanaṃ procyate ||

sthāpayed dakṣiṇebhāge pūjā dravyāṇi cātmanaḥ |
suvāsitāṃvu saṃpūrṇaṃ savye kuṃbhaṃ suśobhanaṃ ||

<p. 77a>

prakṣālanāya karayoḥ pātraṃ pṛṣṭe niveśayet |
ghṛtādi jvalitān dīpān sthāpayet paritaḥ śubhān ||

darpaṇaṃ cāmaraṃ chatraṃ tālavṛttaṃ ca pādukāṃ |
yathāyathaṃ tu saṃsthāpya saṃskuryāttāni cātmavan ||

puṣpanaivedyagaṃdhādīn hāṁ hīṁ hraṁ phaḍiti maṃtrataḥ |
nārā ca mudrayā dṛṣṭyā samayāṃ ca vilokayet ||

dṛṣṭaṃ vā cātmavijñātaṃ samyak puṣpādidūṣaṇaṃ |
aspṛśyasparśanaṃ vāpi yadanyā yārjitaṃ ca vā ||

tathā nirmālya saṃspṛṣṭaṃ kīṭādyārohaṇaṃ ca yat |
tatsarvaṃ nāśamāyāni naivedyāya ca lokanāt ||

tato ramiti maṃtreṇa śikhāṃ dīpasya saṃspṛśet |
sa tu syācchubhado dīponiṣkravyādaḥ sukhapradaḥ ||

pataṃgakīṭakeśādi dāhāt kravyādasaṃhataḥ |
vasāmajjādi saṃbhūtairghṛtādyairūpayojitaḥ ||

ajñātarūpaṃ tatsarvaṃ doṣasyarśādvinaśyati |
kṣroṃvījamuccaranmaṃtrī devatīrthena saṃspṛśet ||

pānīyaṃghva tu madhyasthaṃ dṛṣṭvā samyak ca sādhakaḥ |
vāmenāpāṇinā dhṛtvā vāmapārśvasthitaṃ ghaṭaṃ ||

pātrādhāreṇa maṃtreṇa saṃskurvan saṃspṛśejjvalaṃ |
svasaṃjñādyakṣaraṃ viṃdu caṃdrārddha pariyojitaṃ ||

tatpātranāma ṅeṃtaṃ ca hṛdaṃ tanyātra maṃtrakaḥ |
yadajñānāda medhyādi saṃsṛṣṭiriha saṃgatā ||

yadanyaddūṣaṇaṃ pātretoya cā jñānato bhavet |
jalāśaya śavaḥ sparśājjalasthānācca saṃgataṃ ||

ityādidūṣaṇaṃ naśyat tatpriye devapūjane |
tataḥ kṛtāṃjali puṭo vāmadakṣiṇa pārśvayoḥ ||

guruṃ gaṇapatiṃ natvā purataḥ sveṣṭadevatāṃ |
sugaṃdhapuṣpānādāya caṃdanāktāni maṃtravit ||

hyauṃ maṃtreṇa karayorastramaṃtreṇa marddayet |
tatpuṣpaṃ vāmahastena samādāya ca mastakaṃ ||

bhrāmayet paritastāraṃ japannāghrāya tatpunaḥ |
hauṁ oṃ pūrvapaṭhet ślokamimaṃ sa ca nigadyate ||

te sarve vilayaṃ yāṭu ye māṃhiṃsaṃti hiṃsakāḥ |
mṛtyuroga bhayakleśāḥ pataṃtu ripumastake ||

astramaṃtreṇa nārā ca sudrayeśadiśi tyajet |
karaśuddhiṃ tatostreṇa kuryāt tāratrayaṃ tataḥ ||

ūrddhvorddhvamastramaṃtreṇa digvaṃdhamapi tena ca |
tenasaṃ janitaṃ tejo vahniḥ prākāramudrayā ||

<p. 77b>

rakṣedātmani mūlena prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ caret |
bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryāt tatprakāramathavruve ||

pādato jānuparyaṃt'm caturasraṃ sa vajrakaṃ |
laṃ yutaṃ pītavarṇaṃ ca bhūsthānaṃ brahmadaivataṃ ||

adhisthitaṃ nivṛtyākhya kalayāsthānamucyate |
utpattestattujīvānāmekaṃ rūpaṃ viciṃtayet ||

jānvoronābhiparyaṃtamayāṃ sthānaṃ sitaprabhaṃ |
arddhacaṃdranibhaṃ śṛṃga dvayaṃ tatpadmalāṃchitaṃ || 

ṣaṭkoṇaṃ viṃdubhiḥ ṣaḍbhiryuktaṃ vaṃ vījasaṃyutaṃ |
pratiṣṭhā kalayā yuktaṃ dhyāyetadviṣṇudaivataṃ ||

nābhyādi kaṇṭhaparyaṃtamāraktaṃ rudradaivataṃ |
raṃ vījayuktaṃ kalayāyutaṃ vidyākhyayā tathā ||

dīptimatsvastikopetaṃ trikoṇākāratāṃgataṃ |
mahāpralaya saṃsthānaṃ vahiḥ tatvaṃ viciṃtayet ||

kaṃṭhād bhrūmadhyaparyaṃtaṃ ṣaṭkoṇākāratāṃgataḥ |
ṣaḍviṃdulāṃchitaṃ vṛttaveṣṭitaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇakaṃ ||

vāyusthānaṃ śāṃtikalādhiṣṭhitaṃ śivadaivataṃ |
yaṃ vījayuktaṃ sarveṣāṃ prāṇarūpaṃ viciṃtayet ||

bhrūmadhyād brahmaraṃdhrāṃtamākāśasthāna mucyate |
vṛttākāraṃ dhūmravarṇaṃ mahoccadvajalāṃchitaṃ ||

śāṃtyatītākhya kalayādhiṣṭhitaṃ śivadaivataṃ |
haṃ vījayuktaṃ dhyātvetthaṃ dehe būtāni vinyaset ||

dharmakaṃda samudbhūtaṃ jñānanāla suśobhitaṃ |
kṛtvā tatkarṇikāsaṃsthaṃ pradīpakalikānibhaṃ ||

suṣumṇā vartmanā jīvaṃ paramātma niyojayet |
yogayuktena vidhinā sohaṃ maṃtreṇa sādhakaḥ ||

tatraiva sarvabhūtāni vilīnāni viciṃtayet |
śarīre vāmakukṣau tu ciṃtayet pāpapūruṣaṃ ||

vāmakukṣisthitaṃ pāpaṃ puruṣaṃ kajjala prabhaṃ |
brahmahatyāśiraskaṃdhaḥ svarṇasteya bhujadvayaṃ ||

surāpāna hṛdāyuktaṃ gurutalpa kaṭidvayaṃ |
tatsaṃsarga padadvaṃdvamaṃgapratyaṃgapātakaṃ ||

upapātakaromāṇaṃ raktaśmaśrū vilocanaṃ |
khaḍgacarmadharaṃ krūraṃ rakṣapāpaṃ viciṃtayet ||

śaivaśākte kremaṇaiva pāparūpaṃ smarecchive |
śaive dakṣe krameṇaiva śākto vāmakareṇa ca ||

vaiṣṇave tadvayatvena pāpa dhyānaṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
tathā saṃśoṣayedenaṃ pūrakādi krameṇa vai ||

nābhideśe ca maṅgāraṃ dhūmraṃ vāyu viciṃtayet |
tena vai śoṣayelliṃgaṃ tanuṃ ṣoḍaśamātrayā ||

<p. 78a>

karmātmakaṃ catuḥ ṣaṣṭyā kuṃbhayitvā samācaret |
dvātriṃśanmātre yodakṣedevamatena vā punaḥ || (?)

raktavarṇaṃ vahnivījaṃ meḍhremūle viciṃtayet |
malāsanātmakaṃ liṃgaṃ śarīraṃ tena dāhayet ||

pūrvokta kramayogena dakṣanāsā krameṇa tu |
deśikastu samāsaṃkhyā vā manāsena recayet ||

vaṃkāraṃ vāruṇīvījaṃ ghaṇṭhikāyāṃ vibhāvya ca |
tenāmṛtaṃ samutpādya sahasradalapaṃkajāt ||

plvāvayet pūrakādīni kṛtvā pādatalāvadhi |
laṃkāraṃ pṛthivī vījaṃ gudamūle vibhāvayet ||

tenaiva kramayogena dhiyā saṃplāvayedvudhaḥ |
pāpapuṇya vinirmuktaṃ śarīraṃ śāṃbhavaṃ paraṃ ||

tenaiva pūrvamārgeṇa sarvaṃ saṃpādayet tanuṃ |
saṃjāte sakale dehe devatopāsane kṣamaḥ ||

ātmalīnāni tatvāni svasthānaṃ prāpayet tataḥ |
ātmānaṃ hṛdayāṃbhojamānayet paramātmanaḥ ||

haṃsamaṃtreṇa vidhivat tejorūpaṃ kalevaraṃ |
devo bhuktvā yajeddevaṃ nādevo devamarccayet ||

tasmādiṣṭa svarūpatvaṃ svasmin bhāvyaṃ maheśvarī |
devatārādhanā yogyamutpannamiti bhāvayet ||

bhūtaśuddhivihīnena kṛtā pūjābhicāravat |
viparītaphalaṃ dadyādabhaktyā pūjanaṃ yathā ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ vidhāyaivaṃ prāṇasthāpanamācaret |
prāṇapratiṣṭhā maṃtrasya munayojeśa padmajāḥ ||

chaṃdo ṛgyajuṣī sāmaprāṇa śaktistudevatāḥ |
ṛṣiḥ śirasi vaktre tu chaṃdāṃsi hṛdidevatāḥ ||

āṁ vījāya namo guhye pade hrīṁ śaktaye namaḥ |
nābhau namaḥ krauṁ kīlakāyanīyogo susthitāviti ||

oṃ āṁ hrīṁ kroṁ aṃkavargaṃ sānusvāraṃ nabho mukhaṃ |
paṃcatatva samuccārya ātmane āṃ hṛdinyaset ||

oṃ āṁ hrīṁ kroṁ iṃ ca vargaṃ tadvacchandādi paṃcakaṃ |
ātmane īṁ samuccārya śirase vahni gehinī ||

tāni vījā uṃ tādṛk ṭavargaṃ śrotrakādi ca |
proktvā tadātmane ūṃca śikhāyai ca vaṣaḍvadet ||

tāni vījāni eṁ tuṃ ca vāgādīni tadātmane |
ai muktā kavacāyeti hruṁ vadet tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

caturvījaṃ ca pūrvoktaṃ oṁ pavargaṃ ca tādṛśaṃ |
vacanādi ca tadvatsyādau netrāya vauṣaṭ tathā ||

<p. 78b>

caturvījaṃ ca aṃtādṛgyavargaṃ manuścādi ca |
tadātmane svaraścāṃtyostrāya phaṭ ceti saṃvadet ||

aṃguṣṭādau hastatalāṃ tanyase devameva hi |
nābhyaṃ dhaścāpi kaṃthādho mūrddhvādhotha tadaṃtakaṃ ||

āṁ drīṁ kroṁ kramato nyasya hṛtpadmāṣṭadaleṣu ca |
pūrvataḥ kramato varṇān karṇikāyāṃ hṛdaṃtakān ||

laṃ raṃ haṃ saṃ vaṃ ca yaṃ ca saṃ śaṃ kṣamiti vargataḥ |
dikṣu nyaset tato dhyāyet prāṇaśaktiṃ hṛdisthitāṃ ||

raktāṃghriyaṃ tāruṇapadmasaṃsthāṃ pāśāṃkuśā vikṣuśarāsanaṃ ca |
śūlaṃ kapālaṃ dadhatīṃ karābjairaktāṃ trinetrāṃ praṇamāmi devī ||

hastaṃ nidhāya hṛdaye vāgvījaṃ yādikāṣṭakaṃ |
haṃsaḥ sohaṃ mamaprāṇāvadedihasthitā iti ||

proktvā tathaiva ca punarmama jīva ihasthitaḥ |
punastaduktvā mama tu vadet sarveṃdriyāṇi ca ||

punastatho mama tu vāṅmanaścakṣuruccaret |
śrotraghrāṇapraṇā ihāgatya mukhaṃciraṃ tataḥ ||

tiṣṭhaṃ tu vahnijāyāṃta muktvātāraṃ tato japet |
vapurjyotimayaṃ dhyāyediti syāt prāṇasaṃsthitiḥ ||

atha prāṇāyāmo yathā ||

prāṇāyāmātṛdhā proktvā stotraṃ vaidikayogikāḥ |
maṃtrasiddhiḥ pāpanāśo yogasiddhiḥ phalaṃ kramāt ||

mātṛkākhyaśca maṃtrākhyastāṃtriko dvividho mataḥ |
mātṛkākhyo japāsyādau japāṃte ca kṛto yadi ||

varṇavyatyāsādi doṣā na śeṣān haṃtitaṃ śṛṇu |
vāmayāpūra yadvāyuṃsvaraiḥ kādyaiśca kuṃbhakaṃ ||

recayedyādibhirdakṣanāsāyāṃ mātṛkādibhiḥ |
yāvacchakyaṃ niyamyāsūnmanasaiva manuṃ japet || 

kaniṣṭhānāmikāṃguṣṭhairnāsāṃ dhṛtvā tu mātrikaḥ |
prāṇāyāmastvayaṃ prokto yadanya manasā kṛtaṃ ||

japapūjādikaṃ tasya doṣameva vyapohati |
gāyatrīṃ śirasā sārddhaṃ saptavyāhṛtipūrvikāṃ ||

pratipraṇava saṃyuktāṃ trirayaṃ vaidikomataḥ |
madhyāmūlādyāvadagramaṃguṣṭhena nipīḍyate ||

mātrā sā procyate saḍbhiryogebhīṣṭaṃ prayacchati |
jānuṃ pradakṣiṇī kuryādyāvat kālena hastakaḥ ||

tāvat kālamitāmātrāsva niḥśvāsa samāpi ca |
jaghanyo ravimātraḥ syājjinamātrastu madhyamaḥ ||

<p. 79a>

śreṣṭhaḥ ṣaḍvargamātroyaṃ yogatraya su sādhakaḥ |
kevale kuṃbhake siddhe siddhiḥ syādrājayogajā ||

vīryāstaṃbhaśca vahvāyurvalīpalitanāśanaṃ |
pūrake kuṃbhake siddheḥ kriyāyogyasya siddhayaḥ ||

pūrvoktaṃ ca na śītoṣṇa vā dhākṣuttṛdbhavāpi ca |
pūrakaḥ kuṃbhakoreko yadā tulyaḥ prajāyate ||

haṭhayoga sadāsiddhohyaṇimādyaṣṭasiddhayaḥ |
īṣat phalaṃ jaghanye tu madhye madhyaparekhile ||

niraṃtarābdatritayābhyāsāt sarvaṃ bhavet phalaṃ |
prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā mātṛkānyāsamācaret ||

ṛṣirgurutvān śirasi varṇatvā chaṃda sā mukhe |
dhāraṇaṃ procyate cittajñeyāptāddevatā hṛdi ||

ṛgatāviti dhātustu ṛvarṇaḥ prāpakomataḥ |
yivarṇādhastu vijñānamatastatprāpakastu saḥ ||

chatīti dhāturicchāyāṃdādirdānārthako bhavet |
ata icchāpradaṃ chaṃdo viśeṣādgaṇavarṇataḥ ||

krīḍārthakāddivo dhātoḥ saṃpūrṇaṃ devatā padaṃ |
sādhakāya dadānāti devatā parikīrtitāḥ ||

rakṣyamāṇo hṛdātmāyaṃ hṛdayasti cidātmakaḥ |
tasmāt tatra namaskuryān mukhyāṃguṣṭena saṃspṛśet ||

svāhayā kriyate samyag viṣayā haraṇaṃ yataḥ |
anāmātarjanībhyāṃ tairākṛṣṭaiḥ keniṣecyate ||

śekhāmahovaṣaṭcāṃgaṃ śikhayātmatanurgrahaḥ |
yasmāt tasmādvaṣaḍiti krīyaṃteṃgulamadhyayā ||

grahaṇārthaṃ kavacadhāturddhūmahastena gṛhyate |
śarīretastu kavacaṃ tarjanyā nāmayāpi tat ||

yathārthajñānakadvau ṣaṭnanntretrābhyāṃ prajāyate |
tasmāduktaṃ tatra vauṣaṭ tarjanyādaistu tat smṛtaṃ ||

ekākṣarāt kuverādi daivateṅeṃtamuccaret |
bhyāṃtaṃ visṇvādike rudrādau tu ne tantrayātmakaṃ ||

ādhyātmikādi rūpaṃ yatsādhakasya vināśayet |
avidyājātamastraṃ tat phaṭ tārābhyāṃ prapaṃcyate ||

prāṇāyāmaṃ mātṛkāyāḥ kṛtvānyāsānsamācare |
te caikaviṃśatiḥ proktā kāmanā bhedatopi ca ||

adhikāri vibhedena nityatvenāpi kecana |
devatā bhedato vāpi tadrahasyaṃ nirupyate ||

puruṣe devate nityā kevalasvaramātṛkā |
yannyāsā brahmacaryādyā dharmāḥ siddhyaṃti sādhake ||

ṛṣirbrahmā devatā tu mātṛkākhya sarasvatī |
halo vījāni gāyatrī chaṃdaḥ śaktiḥ svarāmatāḥ ||

<p. 79b>

vyaktiḥ kīlakamuddiṣṭaṃ niyogobhīṣṭa siddhaye |
dakṣa karatale tasya pṛṣṭe ca karabhe tathā ||

aṃguṣṭhādiṣṭhatho vāme viparyāsena vinyaset |
viṃdu yuktān krameṇaiva svarānyāsoyamādimaḥ ||

ayaṃ vyatyāsatonyāsa saṃhāranyāsa ucyate |
pāpaśatrukṣayādyarthe karmaścādau samācaret ||

sa visargaiḥ svarairyastu kevale nyāsavat kṛtaḥ |
sṛṣṭinyāsaḥ prayogādau kartavyastasya siddhaye ||

vāmā karatalāt tasya kaniṣṭhāṃtaṃ pravinyaset |
aṣṭau svarān ḷkātadīn tathā dakṣatalādapi ||

akārādyānviṃdu sargayuktonāsoyamīritaḥ |
sthityākhyo munidevādi prāgvat kāryasthitāvayaṃ ||

kakārādi ṇakārāṃ tān varṇāt paṃcadaśaivahi |
aṃguṣṭhādi kaniṣṭhāṃtaṃ dakṣahastasya parvasu ||

nyasevinduyutān sarvān vāmepyevaṃ tu tādikān |
aṃguṣṭhādi kaniṣṭhāṃtaṃ hastayugmopi vinyaset ||

yugayatyādikān paṃcavrūyādvarṇa namoṃtakaṃ |
tattatsthāne karaṃ datvā karaśuddhi karastvayaṃ ||

aṃ āṃ madhyekavargaḥsyādi īṃ madhye ca vargakaḥ |
uṃ ūṃ madhye ṭa vargastu eṁ aiṁ madhye ta vargakaḥ ||

oṃ auṃ madhye pa vargaḥ syādaṃ aḥ madhya tu yādikāḥ |
ebhiḥ sa viṃdukairaṃgulyādinyāso hṛdādikaḥ ||

kartavyopyasya ṛṣyādi viniyogosya siddhaye |
ṣaḍaṃga śuddhe krodhādi jātapāpa nivṛttayaḥ ||

tālatrayaṃ ca digvaṃdhaṃ prakuryādastra maṃtrataḥ |
tato dhyāyedvarṇapadmaṃ śvetaṃ svaśirasisthitaṃ ||

karṇikāyāṃ nijaṃ maṃtraṃ saṃsmaret keśarāṣṭakaṃ |
svarayugmaṃ tathā pātreṣvaṣṭasvapi ca kādikān ||

saptavargānaṣṭame tu lakṣāvevaṃ viciṃtayet |
evaṃ ciṃtayato rogādalpa mṛtyurvinaśyati ||

athāṃtarmātṛkānyāsaṃvakṣyetaḥ śuddhikārakaṃ |
yaṃ kṛtvā yoginī cittaṃ pātakena pravartate ||

mūlādhāradvaniṃ śrutvā pravuddhā śaktikuṇḍalī |
jvalatyāvakasaṃkāśāḥ susūkṣmā tejarūpiṇī ||

mūlādhārācchiraḥ padmaṃ spṛśaṃtī vidyudākṛtī |
jayāspṛṣṭhaśiraḥ padmādamṛtaudyaḥ svarūpiṇaḥ ||

nirgatān mātṛkāvarṇān suṣumṇā vartmanā tanuṃ |
sthāpayitvā sthitānetānevaṃ dhyātvā pravinyaset ||

kaṇṭhe viśuddhi cakrākhyaṃ padmaṃ ṣoḍaśa patrakaṃ |
urddhvāsyaṃ prāgdalāttatra saṃsthitāḥ ṣoḍaśaḥ svarā ||

<p. 80a>

evaṃ saṃciṃtya tārādi viṃduyuktaṃ namoṃtakaṃ |
vadet svaraṃ ca sarveṣu varṇeṣvapyeṣu paddhati ||

hṛdayaṃ nāhataṃ cakraṃ dhyāyed dvādaśapatrakaṃ |
pūrvapatrāttaddaleṣu prāgvatkādin pravinyaset ||

maṇipūraṃ tataścakraṃ ciṃtayennābhimaṇḍale |
daśapatraṃ tatra ḍādivarṇān prāgvad viciṃtayet ||

svādhisthānaṃ liṃgamūle cakraṃ ṣaḍdalamucyate |
ciṃtayedvādikāṃstatra ṣaḍvarṇānapi pūrvavat ||

mūlādhārābhidhaṃ cakraṃ padmākṛti caturdalaṃ |
vaṃ śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ tatra ciṃtyaṃ pūrvāśādi daleṣu ca ||

ājñākhyaṃ cakraṃ bhrūmadhye dvidalaṃ kamalākṛti |
haṃ kṣaṃ dhyāyedayaṃ kāryo manasā kevalena tu ||

svadehe vāmayā kāryaḥ puṣpeṇa suramūrtiṣu |
anādilāna ṛṣyādi brahmavaddhyānamasya tu ||

vahirnyāsamatho vakṣye pūrvokta brahmaraṃdhrake |
varṇāraviṃde saṃdhyāyen mātṛkākhyāṃ sarasvatīṃ ||

paṃcāśadvarṇabhedairvihitavadanadoḥ pādayukkukṣivakṣodeśāṃbhāsvat 
kapardīkalitaśaśikalāmiṃdu kuṃdā ca dātāṃ |
akṣasrakkuṃbhacitya likhitavarakarāṃtrīkṣaṇāṃ padmasaṃsthāmacchākalpā 
manucchastanajaṃghanabharāṃ bhāratīṃtāṃ namāmi ||

lalāṭe mukhavṛttekṣi śravornāsā sugaṃḍayoḥ |
oṣṭayordaṃtapaṃktyośca mūrddhni vaktrenyasetsvarān ||

vāhvoḥ saṃdhiṣu sāgreṣuka ca vargaunyasetsudhīḥ |
tadavargaupadostadvatpārśvayoḥ pṛṣṭhadeśataḥ ||

nābhau kukṣau pa vargaṃ ca hṛdaṃśakakuṃdaṃ tataḥ |
nyasyayādi caturvarṇānśādi ṣaṭkaṃ tatonyaset ||

hṛdādikarayoraṃghryorjaṭhare vadane tathā |
nyāsastvayaṃ varṇamātrāhīnapāṭha prapūrakaḥ ||

atha mātṛkāmudrāmāha ||

lalāṭe nāsikāmadhyenyasecca mukhavṛttake |
tarjanī madhyamānāmāvinyaseccaiva netrayoḥ ||

tarjanyanāme saṃpūjya nyāset sādhakasattamaḥ |
aṃguṣṭaṃ karṇayornyasya kaniṣṭhāṃguṣṭakaunasoḥ ||

madhyamāgaṇḍayornyasya madhyamāmoṣṭayornyaset |
anāmādaṃtayornyasya madhyamāṃ cottamāṃgake ||

mukhenāmāṃ madhyamāṃ ca haste pāde ca pārśvayoḥ |
kaniṣṭhānāmikāmadhyānnyastavyā pṛṣṭhatastathā ||

sāṃguṣṭhāstānābhi deśe sarvāḥ kukṣau ca vinyaset |
hṛdaye sādhakaḥ sarvamaṃśayoścaka kutsthale ||

<p. 80b>

hapūrvahastapat kukṣimukheṣu talameva ca |
etāstu mātṛkāmudrāḥ krameṇa parikīrtitāḥ ||

ajñātvā vinyasedyastu nyāsaḥ syāt tasya niṣphalaḥ |
kṣamārabhya akārāṃto nyāsaścatkriyate yadi ||

saṃhāranyāsanāmāsau viṃdunyāsa itīritaḥ |
vāmetra dakṣiṇemārge devatādhyānamucyate ||

akṣasrajaṃ hariṇayotamudagraṭaṃkaṃ vidyāṃkarairucirataṃ dadhatīṃ trinetraṃ |
arddhendu maulimaruṇāmaraviṃdavāsāṃ varṇeśvarīṃ 
praṇamatastanabhāraramrāṃ ||

visargamātṛkānyāso bhavet kevalamātṛvat |
viśeṣastu visargāṃto varṇoccāro bhavediti ||

viṃdusargayutān ḍādiṭhāṃtān varṇānsthitau nyaset |
pūrvoktā evamutpādyāḥ ṣaḍaṃgaṃ dhyānamucyate ||

siṃdūrakāṃtimamitābharaṇāṃ trinetrāṃ vidyākṣasūtra mṛgapotavarāṃ 
dadhānāṃ |
pārśvasthitāṃ bhagavatīmapikāṃvanābhāṃ dhyāyet karābja 
dhṛtapustakavarṇamālāṃ ||

nyāsāḥ kāryāścatuḥ ṣaḍbhiḥsthiti saṃhārasṛṣṭayaḥ |
saṃhārasṛṣṭiḥ sthitayo gṛhasyastu nyaset kramāt ||

vāṇaprasthāścayatayaḥ sṛṣṭisthitilaya kramāt |
nyāsān kuryuriti proktaḥ sthitinyāsaḥ savistaraḥ ||

vakṣye kalā mātṛkāyānyāsaṃ tasya ṛṣiḥ smṛtaḥ |
prajāpatiśca gāyatrī chaṃdanasyāstu devatā ||

sarasvatī mātṛkāsyānniyogobhīṣṭatuṣṭaye |
tāraiḥ ṣaḍaṃgaṃ kurvīta hrasvadīrghāṃtarasthitaiḥ ||

hastaiḥ padmaṃ rathāṃgaṃ guṇamathahariṇaṃ pustakaṃ varṇamālāṃṭaṃkaṃ 
śubhraṃ kapālaṃdalamamṛtalamaddhvema kuṃbhaṃ vahaṃtīṃ |
muktā vidyutyayodasphaṭikamaṇijapāvaṃdhuraiḥ paṃcavaktraiḥ 
stryakṣaivakṣojanamrāṃsakalaśaśinibhāṃ śāradāṃtāṃ namāmi ||

dhyātvaivaṃ tārapūrvātāṃ makārādyāṃ ca mātṛkāṃ |
viṃduyuktā ṅeṃta kalānāmādyāṃ rāmasānvitāṃ ||

pūrvokta śuddhamātrāṇāṃ nyāsasthāneṣu vinyaset |
nivṛttiśca pratiṣṭā ca viyāśāṃtistathaiṃdhikā ||

dīpikā recikā cāpi bhocikā ca varābhidhā |
sūkṣmāsūkṣmāmṛtā jñānāmṛtā cāpyāyanītataḥ ||

vyāpinī vyomarūpā ca naṃtāsṛṣṭiḥ samṛddhikā |
smṛtirmedhā tataḥ kāṃtirlakṣmīrdyatiḥ sthirāsthitiḥ ||

siddhirjarāpālinī vakṣāṃtirīśvarikāratiḥ |
kāmikā varadācānyāktvādinī prīti saṃyutā ||

dīrghā tīkṣṇā tathā raudrī bhayānidrā ca taṃdrikā |
kṣudhāsyāt krodhinī paścāt kriyotkārī sa mṛtyukāḥ ||

<p. 81a>

pītāśvetāruṇā paścādatśinānaṃ tayānvitā |
uktākalāmātṛkaivaṃ sthāneḥ kārādike nyaset ||

tannanādātmano jātāḥ svarajāstu sadāśivāt |
akṣamālā pustakaṃ ca pāśaṃ cāpi kapālakaṃ ||

hastairdadhatyaḥ śvetābhāśvetāṃvaravibhūṣaṇāḥ |
akārādbrahmaṇo jātāḥ ka ca varga kalādaśa ||

pītā akṣasrajaṃ padmamabhayaṃ ca kamaṇḍaluṃ |
hastairdadhatyo dhyeyāstāḥ pītagaṃdhānulepanāḥ ||

viṣṇorukārāt saṃjātāḥ ṭatavargakalādaśa |
śyāmā abhayaśaṃkhāsi varahastāḥ samīritāḥ ||

makārādrudrato jātāḥ payavargakalānava |
śaraccaṃdranibhā hastairabhayaṃ śūlameva ca ||

kapālaṃ ca varaṃ dhyeyādadhatya iti sādhakaiḥ |
ṣakārādika paṃcānāmīśvarādviṃtuto bhavet ||

abhayaṃ hariṇaṃ ṭaṃkaṃ valaṃ ca karapallavaiḥ |
dadhatyo raktavarṇāśca dhyeyānyāse kalāmake ||

keśavādi mātṛkāyāḥ sādhyo nārāyaṇo (**) (?) |
amṛtādyā tu gāyatrī chaṃdo lakṣmīhariḥ suraḥ ||

dviruktaiḥ śakti śrīkāmaiḥ ṣaḍaṃgāni samācaret |
śaṃkhacakragadāpadmakuṃbhādarśābjapustakaṃ ||

vibhraṃtaṃ megha capalāvarṇaṃ lakṣmīṃ hariṃ bhajet |
śaktayastu priyāṃkeṣu niṣaṇāḥ sasmitānanāḥ ||

evaṃ dhyātvānyasechaktiḥ śrīkāmapuṭitākṣaraṃ |
tārādi hṛdayāṃtotha keśavādyāśca śaktayaḥ ||

bhyāṃtā namoṃtā uccāryā sthāne'kārādike nyaset |
kalāmātrā tu śāktānāṃ nityodyaṃ viṣṇusevināṃ ||

keśavaḥ kīrtisaṃyuktaḥ kāṃtirnārāyaṇānvitā |
mādhavastuṣṭi saṃyukto goviṃdaḥ puṣṭisaṃyutaḥ ||

viṣṇuśca dhṛti saṃyuktaḥ śāṃtiyugmadhusūdanaḥ |
trivikramaḥ kriyāyukto (****) (?) sayānvitaḥ ||

śrīdharo medhayā yukto hṛṣīkeśaśca harṣayā |
padmanābhayutā śraddhālajjā dāmodarānvitā ||

vāsudevaśca lakṣmīyuktaṃ karṣaṇasarasvatī |
pradyumnaḥ prītisaṃyukto niruddhorati saṃyutaḥ ||

cakrīgadājayīdurgāśārṅgī tu prabhayānvitaḥ |
khaḍgī tu satyayāyukto śaṃkhīcaṇḍī samanvitaḥ ||

halīvāṇī samāyukto muśalī ca vilāsinī |
śūlāṃ ca vijayāyuktaḥpāṇī virajayānvitaḥ ||

aṃkuśī viśvayāyukto mukuṃdo vinadāyutaḥ |
naṃdajaḥ sunadāyukto naṃdīsmṛtya samanvitaḥ ||

naro ṛddhyānarajitsamṛddhyā śuddhiyuk hariḥ |
kṛṣṇo vudhyābhūtya satyomati yuktyātvataḥ smṛtaḥ ||

<p. 81b>

śaurikṣameśūradamejanārdana umānvitaḥ |
bhūdharaḥ kledinīyukto viśvamūrtiśca klinnayā ||

vaikuṇṭho vasudhāyukto vasudhā puruṣottamau |
valī tu parayāyukto valārujaparāyaṇe ||

vālasūkṣmevṛṣaghnastu saṃdhyāyuktarayāvṛṣaḥ |
haṃsaḥsyād dakṣiṇāmūrti gāyatrī chaṃda īritaḥ ||

arddhādrijāharodevo niyogaḥ sarvasiddhaye |
halovījāni guhye tu pādayoḥ svaraśaktayaḥ ||

hrasvadīrghāntare kṛtvā prāgvadvargān hasaumasaṃ |
ṣaḍdīrghasaṃyutān kṛtvā ṣaḍaṃgādinyasettanau ||

vaṃdhūkakāṃcananibhaṃ rucirākṣamālāṃ pāśāṃkuśau ca varadaṃ nija 
vāhudaṇḍaiḥ |
vibhrāṇamiṃduśakalābharaṇaṃ trinetramarddhāṃvikeśamaniśaṃ 
vapurāśrayāmaḥ ||

hasauṃ te mātṛkā yuktā devā te ca samuccaret |
ṅeṃtaṃ ṅeṃtāṃ ca tacchaktiṃ namoṃtāṃ mātṛkāsthale ||

tvagasṛṅmāṃsamedocchimajjā śukrāṇyasūn vadet |
śaktiṃ krodhaṃ tathātmānaṃ ṅeṃtaṃ yādi daśasvapi ||

śrīkaṇṭhapūrṇodaryaucānaṃto virajayānvitaḥ |
sūkṣmesaḥ śālmalīyukto lolākṣīyuk trimūrtikaḥ ||

amaraśovartulākṣācārvīśodīrghaghoṇayā |
bhārabhūtirdīrghamukhyātithīśo gomukhiyutaḥ ||

sthāṇvīśo dīrghajihvāyugdharaḥ kuṇḍodarīyutaḥ |
ūrddhvakeśyāvadgiṇṭhī śobhautiko vikṛtāsyayā ||

sadyo jāto jvālamukhyānugraholkāmukhīyutaḥ |
akrūre śrīmukhīmahāsane vidyāmukhīyutaḥ ||

krodheśaśca mahākālyā caṇḍaśena sarasvatī |
paṃcāṃtakaḥ sarvasiddhiḥ gauryāyuktaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

śivottameśo vinyasyo yuktastrailokya vidyayā |
ekarudromaṃtraśaktyākūrmeśaścāṣṭa śaktiyuk ||

ekanetro bhūmimātrā yuktothaḥ sa varānanaḥ |
laṃbodaryoyutaḥ proktastvajeśodrāviṇī yutaḥ ||

sarveśo nāgarīyuktaḥ someśaḥ khecarīyutaḥ |
lāṃgalīśaśca maṃjaryādārukeśena rūpiṇī ||

<p. 82a>

vīrīṇyācārddha nārīśohyumākāṃtaḥ punaryutaḥ |
kākodaryā tathāṣāḍhī pūtanāyukta īritaḥ ||

daṇḍīśo bhadrakālī yugatrīśo yoginīyutaḥ |
mīneśaḥ śaṃkhinīyuktomeṣeśastarjanīyutaḥ ||

lohitaḥ kālarātryā ca śikhīśaḥ kurddinīyutaḥ |
chagalaṃḍaḥ kapardinyādviraṇḍeśaśca vajrayā ||

mahākālojayāyukto vālīśaḥ sumukhīyutaḥ |
bhujagorevatīyukto pinākī mādhavī yutaḥ ||

khaḍgīśo vāruṇīyukto vakeśo vāyavīyutaḥ |
śvetovakṣovadhāriṇyā bhṛguḥ sahajayā yutaḥ ||

nakulīśālakṣmiyuktaḥ śiveśovyāpinīyutaḥ |
saṃvartako mahāmāyāyukta etāstumātṛkāḥ ||

śrīkaṇṭhādyāya īśāṃtastatraneśaṃ prayojayet |
sarve rudrāḥ smṛtā raktādhṛta śūlakapālakāḥ ||

śaktayo rudrapīṭhasthāḥ siṃdūrāruṇavigrahāḥ |
raktotpala kapālābhyāmalaṃkṛta karāṃvujā ||

yenopāsyā mahāvidyā daśatasyādhikāritā |
bhuvaneśī vījapūrva mātṛkānyāsanesurāḥ ||

ṛṣiḥ śaktistu gāyatrī chaṃdaḥ syānmātṛkāmayī |
bhuvaneśī devatātha niyogaḥ sveṣṭasiddhaye ||

hrasvadīrghāṃtaragataiḥ ṣaḍvargairdīrghasaṃyutaiḥ |
prāgvaddharaiḥ ṣaḍaṃgaṃ syādaṃguṣṭhādi tathaiva ca ||

udyat koṭidivākaraḥ pratibharāttuṃgorūpī na stanīvaddhārdhendu kirīṭahāra rasanā 
maṃjīra saṃśobhitā |
vibhrājākara paṃkajairjapavaṭīṃpāśau pustakaṃ diśyānnojagadīśvarī 
trinayanāpadmeniyalpāmukhaṃ ||

lajjāvījaṃ pūrvamuktvā mātṛkānyāsa eva hi |
bhuvaneśī mātṛkāṇāṃ nyāsoktairyatra sādhane ||

śrīvījapūrvakaḥ kāryo lakṣmīkāmairgṛhasthitaiḥ |
ṛṣirbhṛguścagāyatrī chaṃdo mātṛḥsvarūpiṇī ||

lakṣmīstu devatā proktā harasthāneśarau kuru |
nyāsārthaṃ tu saḍaṃgāde śeṣaṃ śrīvījapūrvakaṃ ||

vidyuddāma samaprabhāṃ himagiri prakhyaiścaturbhirbhujaiḥ śuṇḍā 
daṃḍasamuddhṛtā mṛtaghaṭairāsiṃcya mānāmimāṃ |
vibhrāṇāṃ karapaṃkajairjapavaṭīṃ padmadvayaṃ pustakaṃ 
bhāsvadratnasamujvalāṃ kucanatāṃ dhyāyejjagatsvāminīṃ ||

kāmanāmātra siddhyarthaṃ kāmavījādi pūrvakaṃ |
kuryācca mātṛkānyāsaṃ muniḥ saṃmohanomataḥ ||

<p. 82b>

gāyatrīchaṃda uddiṣṭaṃ devatā mātṛkāmayī |
saṃmohanīnāmadevī pūrvayuktyā ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ ||

vālārkakoṭirucirāṃ sphaṭikākṣamālāṃ kodaṇḍamikṣujanitaṃsmara 
paṃcavāṇān |
vidyāṃ ca hastakamalairdathatīṃ trinetrāṃ dhyāyet samastajananīṃ 
navacaṃdracūḍāṃ ||

śaktiḥ śrīkāmavījādi mātṛkānyāsato nṛṇāṃ |
śatrutvādyāmaṃtradoṣo naśyaṃti vahuvarṇatāḥ ||

mahāsaṃmohana ṛṣirgāyatrīchaṃda īritaḥ |
saṃmohanīnāmadevīnyāsaḥ prāṅmātṛkāsamaḥ ||

dhyāyeyamakṣavalayekṣu śarāśapāśapadmadvayāṃkuśaśarānnavapustakaṃ ca 
|
āvibhratīṃ nijabhujairaruṇāṃ kurvārtāṃ saṃmohinīṃ trinayanāṃ 
navacaṃdracūḍāṃ ||

sarvavighnanirāsārthamavaśyaṃ nyāsamācaret |
gaṇeśamātṛkāyāṃturmunirgaṇaka īritaḥ ||

nivadgāyatrikācchaṃdo devaśakti vināyakaḥ |
smṛtvā dīrghāḍhyayātvaṃgaṃ kṛtvā dhyāyed gajānanaṃ ||

śūlāṃkuśa varābhīti pāṇiṃ raktābjahastayā |
priyayāliṃgiṃtaṃraktaṃ trinetraṃ gaṇayaṃbhaje ||

evaṃ dhyātvā nyaset svīyavīja pūrvākṣarānvitaṃ |
vighnohrīṃ samāyukto vighnarājaḥ śriyādyutaḥ ||

vināyakaḥ puṣṭiyuktaḥ śāktiyuktaḥ śivottamaḥ |
vighnakṛt sṛṣṭisaṃyukto vighnahartā sarasvatī ||

gamāstu svāhayāyukta ekadaṃtastu medhayā |
dvidaṃtaḥ kāṃti saṃyukto gajavaktreṇakāminī ||

niraṃjano kāminī yukkapardī tu nadīyutaḥ |
dīrghajihvaḥ pārvatīyuk jvālinyāśaṃkukarṇakaḥ ||

vṛṣadhvajonaṃdayāyuk sudyaśāgaṇanāyakau |
gajeṃdraḥ kāmarūpiṇyāsūrpakarṇastathomayā ||

trilocanastejovatyālaṃvodarastu satyayā |
mahānaṃdaśca vighneśyāścaturmūrtiḥ svarūpayā ||

sadāśivaḥ kāmadāyugmādonmadadvijihvayā |
durmukhobhūti saṃyuktaḥ sumukho bhautikāyutaḥ ||

prabhedaḥ sitayāyukta ekapādoramāyutaḥ |
dvijihvo mahiṣīyuktaḥ śūlasyāpi bhujaṃginī ||

vīrovikarṇayāyuktaḥ ṣaṇmukho bhṛkuṭīyutaḥ |
varadorajjayā vāmadevaḥsyāddīrghakoṇayā ||

<p. 83a>

dhanurddharācakratuṇḍau dviraṇḍo jāminīyutaḥ |
senānī rātrisaṃyuktaḥ kāmāṃdhogrāmaṇīyutaḥ ||

mattaḥ śaśiprabhāyukto vimattololalocanā |
mattavāhana cāṃcalye jaṭīdīptiḥ samanvitaḥ ||

maṃḍī subhagayā yuktaḥ khaḍgīdurbhagayā tathā |
vareṇyaśca śivāyukto bhagīyugvṛṣaketana ||

bhaktapriyo bhaginyā tu gaṇeśo bhoginīyutaḥ |
meghanādaḥ subhagayā vyāpī syāt kālarātriyuk ||

gaṇeśvaraḥ kāliketi prokto vighneśamātṛkā |
tvagādi yogoyādīnāṃ pūrvavat parikīrtitaḥ ||

prapaṃcayoganyāsotha vakṣyate bhuktimuktidaḥ |
mahāgaṇeśamaṃtreṇa prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ caret ||

ṛṣiḥ prapaṃcayāgasya gaṇakaḥ chaṃda īritaḥ |
gāyatrī tu nivṛtpūrvā mahāgaṇapatiḥ suraḥ ||

śrīrṣādiṣu nyasettāṃśca gaṃvījaṃ cāpi guhyake |
svāhāśaktiḥ pādayośca niyogobhīṣṭa siddhaye ||

oṃ śrīṁ hrīṁ klīṁ glauṁ gamiti pūrvaṃ ṣaḍdīrghayuktakaṃ |
uccārya kuryādaṃgāni tathāṃguṣṭādiṣu nyaset ||

tālatrayaṃ tathāstreṇa kṛtvā digvaṃdhamācaret |
tarjanyaṃguṣṭhaśabdena daśadikṣvatha ciṃtayet ||

hastīṃdrānanamiṃdu cūḍamaruṇacchādyaṃ trinetraṃ rasādāśliṣṭaḥ priyayā sa 
padmakarayāsvāṃkasthayāsaṃtataṃ |
vījāpūragadādhanustriśūlaśirayuk 
cakrābjapāśotpalavrīhyagrasvaviṣāṇaratnakalaśān hastairvahaṃtaṃ bhaje ||

mahāgaṇapatermaṃtraṃ maṣṭavāraṃ japettataḥ |
gamityakākṣaraṃ vījaṃ gaṇakosya munirmataḥ ||

devo vighneśvaracchaṃdaṃ nivṛdgāya trināyakaṃ |
prapaṃcākhyasya yāgasya sāṃgatā siddhī hetave ||

catuścatvāriṃśat saṃkhyajapārthe viniyojanaṃ |
atha ṣaḍdīrghayuktena kuryādaṃgāniena tu ||

taṃtapāśāṃkuśa varakara akṣaṃ caturdalaṃ |
siṃdūrābhaṃ caṃdramauliṃ sarpabhūṣaṃgalanmadaṃ ||

ekavāraṃ japet paścādgaṇānāṃ tveti vaidikaṃ |
gaṇeśamālāmaṃtrasya munistu gaṇakaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

chaṃdo'mitaṃ gaṇapatirdevatā parikīrtitā |
hrīṁ kroṁ tāro namaḥ sarve ṅeṃtaṃ vidyādhipastataḥ ||

sarvārthasiddhidāyeti sarvaduḥkhapraśeti ca |
tato gaṇapa ehyehi bhagavat svādayeti ca ||

<p. 83b>

staṃbhayeti dvayaṃ hrīṁ gaṁ gāṁ namopyagni gehinī |
kroṁ hrīṁmiti paṃcapaṃcāśadvarṇāmaṃtra ucyate ||

japedidaṃ caturvāraṃ munyādi sahitānyaset |
nyāsaḥ pūrvaṃ trivāraṃ tu mātṛkā dhyānapūrvakaṃ ||

svarādiḥ sasavargaistu grahānsasamudīritaḥ |
prapaṃcayāga maṃtrasya munirbrahmā samīritaḥ ||

paramādyā samākhyātā gāyatrī chaṃda uttamaṃ |
mahaḥ paraṃ samākhyātaṃ devatā cinmayātmakaṃ ||

apyaṃte vodhitaṃ nityaṃ sarvavyāpī niraṃjanaṃ |
vilomagaiḥ paṃcaparaiḥ prapaṃca manusaṃsthitaiḥ ||

hrasvadīrghāṃtasthakādivargaiḥ pūrvaṃ samanvitaiḥ |
tāramāyādikairastrairyuktairhariharākṣaraiḥ ||

ṣaḍaṃgāni prakurvīta jātiyuktānideśikaḥ ||

vedādi paṃcamanubhiḥ paricīyamānaṃ mānairagamyamaniśaṃ jagadekamūlaṃ |
saccitsamastagamanaścaramacyutaṃ tattejaḥ paraṃ bhajatasāṃdra 
kṛpāṃvurāśiṃ ||

vedādimāyayoraṃtekṣakārādyān sa viṃdukān |
pṛthaguccāryahaṃsaḥ soyaṃ svāheti vadan hṛdi ||

vibhāvayedimān varṇānātma vahnau juhomyahaṃ |
evaṃ hutvā akārāṃtamakārādyānpunarhunet ||

visargāṃtān kṣakārāṃtaṃ vinyasen mātṛkāsthale |
evaṃ prapaṃcayāgākhyo mātṛkānyāsa īritaḥ ||

ātmavidyā śivaistatvaistatvanyāsaṃ samācaret |
pādādinābhiparyaṃtamātmatatvaṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

nābhyādi hṛdayāṃtaṃ hiṃ vidyātatvaṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
hṛdayāddviṃduparyaṃtaṃ śivatatvaṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

mūlamaṃtra trikhaṇḍāṃte krameṇaiva pravinyaset |
sarvamaṃtraṃ samuccārya sarvāṃge vyāpakaṃ śive ||

sarvatatvamidaṃ proktaṃ sarvadevatvakārakaṃ |
tithi tatvāni deveśi ātmatatve bhavaṃti hi ||

paṃcaviṃśati tatvāni vidyātatvaṃ bhavaṃti hi |
ṣaṭtriṃśacchaivatatvāni śivatatve bhavaṃti hi ||

atha paṃcāśat tatvāni sarvatatve bhavaṃti hi |
etannyāmāṃtare yogapīṭhākhyaṃ nyāsamācaret ||

tatpūrvamuktaṃ ca tataḥ sveṣṭamaṃtrasya saṃcaret |
prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā mūlamaṃtreṇa sādhakaḥ ||

vinyaset tadṛṣiḥ chaṃdo daivatāni yathāvidhi |
atha ṛṣyādinyāsa krameṇasthānāni mudrāścāha ||

<p. 84a>

ṛṣinyaset mūrddhnideśe chaṃdastu mukhapaṃkaje |
devatāṃ hṛdaye caiva vījaṃ tu guhyadeśake ||

śaktiṃ ca pādayoścaiva sarvāṃge kīlakaṃ smṛtaṃ |
ṛṣyādīnvinyaseddevi caturthī hṛdayāṃtakān ||

athāsya mudrā |

ṛṣiḥ chaṃdo devatānāṃ nyāseyyaṃgulaya smṛtāḥ |
catasroṃguṣṭarahitāḥ śaktyaṃtaṃ vinyaset tataḥ ||

kīlakaṃ vyastahastābhyāṃ sarvāṃge sādhakāgraṇī ||

athavā ||

vināṃguṣṭāmaṃgulibhiḥ saṃyutābhiḥ ṛṣiṃ nyaset |
vāmāgrābhiḥ punastābhi vinyasenmukhapaṃkaje ||

sarvābhirhṛdaye prāktā gude pāde tathāgrataḥ |
karābhyāṃ vinyaseddhīmān sarvāṅge cakramādviduḥ |

aghāṃganyāsamudrā ||

kaniṣṭhāṃguṣṭharahitai stribhistu hṛdi vinyaset |
madhyamā tarjanībhyāṃ tu nyasecchirasi maṃtravit ||

aṃguṣṭhena śikhānyasya daśabhiḥ kavaca nyaset |
hṛdgatairnetravinyāsaṃ vinyaset parameśvarī ||

tarjanī madhyamābhyāṃ tu tatostraṃ vinyaset priye |
ṣaḍaṃgaṃ vinyasenmaṃtrī hṛdayāya namo vadet ||

sva sva maṃtraṃ samuccārya śirasya vahni vallabhā |
skaṃdhamadhye nyaset paścāt śikhāyevaṣaḍityapi ||

kavacāya vāhumūle kūrcavījaṃ samuccaret |
netra trayebhyo vauṣaḍityaṃtaṃ netra tato nyaset ||

karayorvinyasenmaṃtrī astrāya ca phaḍityapi ||

athāsyārthamāha ||

hṛdayāyeti śabdena hṛstho devaḥ sa vigraha |
ucyate nama ityasya jñānaṃ tadviṣayaṃ paraṃ ||

śiraḥ śabdo devatāyā utkṛṣṇatvābhidhāyakaḥ |
svāheti viṣayāḥ sarvedevatāyāṃ samarpitāḥ ||

śikhāyaiva svarūpatvaṃ vaṣaḍapi taducyate |
devatāyā vyāpakatvaṃ kavacāyābhidhīyate ||

hūmapi vyāpakaṃ tejo devatāyāḥ prakāśyate |
netra śabdena devasya prakāśyatvaṃ prakāśyate ||

vauṣaḍapita daivoktā maṃtraśabdena vāraṇāṃ |
aniṣṭasya phaṭ śabdena dāhakaṃ teja ucyate ||

jñātvaiva maṃgamaṃtrārtha maṃganyāsaṃ karoti yaḥ |
pracayāstasya sarvārthāḥ pūjyate stridaśairapi ||

karāṃganyāsamukhyāstu nyāsānanyān samācaret |
āgamokto na mārgeṇa nyāsānnityaṃ karoti yaḥ ||

devatābhāvamāpnoti maṃtrasiddhiḥ prajāyate |
yonyāsaḥ kavacācchaṃdo maṃtraṃ japati yaḥ priye ||

dṛṣṭvā vighnāḥ palāyaṃte siṃhaṃ dṛṣṭvā yathā gajā |
akṛtvā nyāsajālaṃ yo mūḍhātmā kuruttejayaṃ ||

<p. 84b>

vighnaiḥ sa vādhyate nūnaṃ vyāghrairmṛgaśiśuryathā |
nyāsānāṃ pracuratvena phalānāmapi bhūritā ||

ukta nyāso na hi tyājyaḥ tvadhikaṃ kāmataścaret ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau sādhāraṇanityārcanāyāṃ 
pūjāmaṇḍapapraveśanādinyāsajālāṃtanirṇayo nāma ṣoḍaśaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 16 ||

athāṃtarvidhiḥ ||

evaṃ dehamaye pīṭhe ciṃtayediṣṭadevatāṃ |
dhyānaṃ kuryāttato maṃtrī tattatkalpoktavartmanā ||

tadapi dvividhaṃ proktaṃ sa guṇaṃ nirguṇaṃ tathā |
ātmano hṛdayāṃbhoje karṇikā keśarojvare ||

praphulle somasūryāgni maṇḍalena virājite |
svīyeṣṭadevatāṃ tatra yajedāgamavodhitāṃ ||

evaṃ yadvedanaṃ taddhi saguṇaṃ dhyānamucyate |
athāṃtaryyajanaṃ vakṣye dṛṣṭādṛṣṭa phalapradaṃ ||

yogināṃ yena jāyaṃte adhīrā mānavāḥ sadā ||

śrīdevyuvāca |

vāhyapūjāṃ vinā svāmin kathamaṃtaḥ prapūjanaṃ |
pūjājñānaṃ yadājātaṃ tadāṃtaḥ pūjanaṃ bhavet ||

sāmagrī jñānahīṃnatvāt kathamaṃtaḥ prapūjanaṃ ||

śrīśiva uvāca ||

satyametanmaheśāni rahasyaṃ śṛṇu yatnataḥ |
viṣṭhāpūrṇe svādare tu vahiḥ śuddhau tu kiṃ phalaṃ ||

aṃtaḥ śuddhiṃ samāsādya vahiḥ śuddhiṃ samācaret |
vahiḥ pūjāvidhau devi samāgrīdurmilākalau ||

vyaṃgyatā jāyate satyaṃ sarvatra pūjane śive |
tatsāṃgatāsiddhihetoraṃtaḥ pūjā prakīrtitā ||

bhāvanāmātragamyevaṃ koṭiratnāni kalpayet |
aṃtaḥ pūjāvihīnena kṛtaṃ tadaphalaṃ bhavet ||

saṃyogaṃ tu vinā devi yo garbhādhānamicchati |
savāṃtaḥ pūjanaṃ tyaktvā vahiḥ pūjāṃ sa micchati ||

sadaridrī mahāghorī kathamatra sukhaṃ bhavet |
aṃtaḥ pūjāṃ samāsādya vahiḥ pūjāṃ samācaret ||

saṃbhāvya pūjanaṃ svāṃte tathaiva racayedvahiḥ ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

tathyamuktaṃ tvayādeva saṃśayomesti śaṃkara |
vahiḥ pūjanamāsādyacāṃtaḥ pūjāṃ samācaret ||

evaṃ krameṇa deveśi pūjā kinna bhaviṣyati ||

śiva uvāca ||

mṛdapakvaṃ samāsādya yathā devi ghaṭodbhavet |
ghaṭaḥ pakva mṛdādevi pūrvavat kiṃ bhaviṣyati ||

apakvāṃ mṛtsamānīya yathā devi ghaṭo bhavet |
tataḥ pakvaṃ prakartavyaḥ suṃdaraḥ sa tu jāyate ||

<p. 85a>

aṃtarpunarvahiḥ pūrṇaṃ vahiḥ pūrṇatarā bhavet |
anyonyāśraya saṃyogāt pūjanaṃ sakalaṃ bhavet ||

devo bhūtvā yajeddevaṃ nā devo devamarcayet |
tasyāddevatvamāsādya cāṃtaḥ pūjādimārgataḥ ||

gurordhyānaṃ prakurvīta yathā pūrvaṃ viśāladhīḥ ||

iti brāhmīmuhūrtakṛtyaṃ ||

snānaṃ budhastataḥ kuryāt saccidānaṃda siddhaye |
snāyācca vimale tīrthe puṣkare hṛdayāśrite ||

viṃdutīrthe naraḥ snāyāt punarjanma na vidyate ||

iti snānaṃ ||

mūlādhārāt kuṇḍalinīmutthāpya yojayecchive |
śivaśaktyoḥ samāyogo yasmin kāle prajāyate ||

sā saṃdhyākulaniṣṭānāṃ samādhistaiḥ pragīyate ||

iti saṃdhyā ||

caṃdrārkānalasaṃghaṭṭādgalitaṃ yatparāmṛtaṃ |
tenāmṛtena divyena tarpayet paradevatāṃ ||

brahmaraṃdhrā dadhobhāge yaccāṃdraṃ pātramuttamaṃ |
kalāsāreṇa saṃpūrya tarpayettena khecarīṃ ||

iti tarpaṇaṃ ||

ādhāre liṅganābhau hṛdayasarasije tālumūle lalāṭedvepatre ṣoḍaśāre 
dvidaśadaśadale dvādaśārddhe catuṣke |
vāsāṃte vālamadhye uphakaṭha sahite kaṇṭhamūle 
svarāṃścahakṣaukodaṇḍamadhyenya sa tu vimaladhīnyā sa saṃpatti siddhyai ||

ityaṃtarmātṛkānyāsaḥ ||

athāṃtara ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ ||

sahasrāre maṇinibhe sarvavarṇa vibhūṣite |
akathādi trirekhādyairhalakṣatrayabhūṣite ||

tanmadhye paraviṃduṃ ca sṛṣṭisthitilayātmakaṃ |
evaṃ samāhitamanādhyāyennyāsoyamāṃtaraḥ ||

mulādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ viṃdvaṃ dhyāyaiccidātmakaṃ |
viṃdusrutasudhāsāraistarpayanmātṛkāṃnyaset ||

ekaikaṃ varṇamuccārya mūlādhārādbhruvāṃtikaṃ |
namoṃta iti vinnyāsaḥ āṃtaraḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||

hṛdyānmāno hṛdātmāyaṃ hṛdayesyāccidātmakaṃ |
kriyate tatparatvena hṛnmaṃtreṇa tataḥ paraṃ ||

sarvajñādi guṇāttuṃge saccidrūpe parātmani |
kriyayā viṣayāhāraḥ śiromaṃtreṇa deśikaiḥ ||

hṛcchirorūpaviddhāmalayatā bhāvanādṛṭā |
kriyate nijadehasya śikhāmaṃtreṇa deśikaiḥ ||

<p. 85b>

maṃtrātmakasya dehasya maṃtra vāhye tejasā |
sarvato varma maṃtreṇa kriyate'hanyasaṃvṛtiḥ ||

yaddadāti paraṃ jñānaṃ saccidrūpe parātmani |
hṛdayādi mayaṃ tejaḥ syādetannetra saṃjñitaṃ ||

ādhyātmikādi rūpaṃ ca sādhakasya vināśayet |
avidyājālamastraṃ tatparaṃdhāma samīritaṃ ||

atha dhyānaṃ ||

kiraṇasthaṃ tadagnisthaṃ caṃdrabhāskaramadhyagaṃ |
mahāśūnyelayaṃ kṛtvā pūrṇaḥ tiṣṭhati yogirāṭ ||

yajjīva brāhmaṇoraikyaṃ sohaṃsyāmiti vedanaṃ |
tadeva nirguṇaṃ dhyānaṃmiti vedavidoviduḥ ||

iti dhyānaṃ ||

athārccanaṃ ||

arccayedvividhaiḥ puṣpaiḥ tatkṣaṇāttanmayo bhavet |
nyāsastanmayatāvuddhiḥ sohaṃ bhāvena pūjayet ||

kṣamāyāmanahaṃkāramanāgamamadaṃ tathā |
amohakaṃmadaṃ daṃbhamadvevākṣomakau tataḥ ||

amātsaryyamalobhaṃ ca daśapuṣpaṃ vidurbudhāḥ |
ahiṃsā paramaṃ puṣpaṃ puṣpamiṃdriya nigrahaḥ ||

dayāpuṣpaṃ kṣamāpuṣpaṃ jñānapuṣpaṃ ca paṃcamaṃ |
ityuktairuttamaiḥ puṣpaiḥ pūjayet paradevatāṃ ||

ityārcanaṃ ||

mālāpaṃcāśikī proktā sūtraṃ śaktiśivātmakaṃ |
grathitā kuṇḍalī śaktiḥ kalāṃte merusaṃsthitiḥ ||

iti japaḥ ||

atha homaḥ ||

mūlādhāragate kuṇḍe devatāgniḥ samujjvale |
dharmādharmānvite tryasre mūlamaṃtrapuraḥsaraṃ ||

ahaṃ juhomi svāheti pratyekaṃ juhuyāt sudhīḥ |
ahaṃtā'satyapaiśunya kāmakrodhādikaṃ haviḥ ||

mana eva śrūvaḥ prokta unmanī mugudīritā ||

atha mūlāṃte ||

nābhau caitanya rūpāgnau haviṣā manasā srucā |
jñānapradīpite nityamakṣavṛttījuhomyahaṃ ||

svāhā iti prathamāhutiḥ ||

mūlāṃte ||

aṃtarniriṃdhana nivaṃdhana medhamāna māyāṃdhakāraparipaṃthini saṃvidagnau 
|
kasmiṃścidadbhutamarīcivikāśabhūmau viśvaṃ juhomi vasudhādivakhāvasānaṃ 
||

svāhā iti caturthāhutiḥ ||

ityaṃtaryajanaṃ kṛtvā sākṣādbrahmamayo bhavet |
na tasya pāpapuṇyāni jīvanmukto bhaveddhruvam ||

<p. 86a>

ityaṃtaryajanaṃ ||

atha vahiryajanaṃ ||

tatrādāvarghyādi sthāpana ||

mūlamaṃtreṇātha vāmesvasya devāgrataścaret |
vṛttena veṣṭite samyak trikoṇaṃ caṃdanāṃbhasā ||

tadvahiścaturasraṃ ca vidadhyānmatsyamudrayā |
saṃpūjya gaṃdhairdevārghyamaṇḍalāya namodhunā ||

aṃgāni caturagnyādi koṇeṣu puratastathā |
dikṣu cāstraṃ samabhyarcya śaṃkhādhāraṃ pravinyaset ||

ādhāreṇa vinā bhraṃśo na tṛpyaṃti ca mātaraḥ |
tasmādvidhivadādhāraṃ tripadaṃ vā catuṣpadaṃ ||

padmābhaṃ vā trikoṇaṃ vāyonyābhaṃ vā bhujaṃ tu tat |
mūlāṃte vāmukādhārapātraṃ saṃsthāpayāmi ca ||

uktvāśaṃkhādikādhāraṃ maṇḍale sthāpayedathamaṃraṃ dharmapradetyuktvā 
vaded daśakalātmakaṃ |

ṅente vahnermaṇḍalaṃ ca deva nāma ca kīrtayet |
tatorghapātradhārāya namaḥ proktvā prapūjayet ||

vahnerdaśakalāḥ pūjyāstatra ca prokta pradakṣiṇaṃ |
astramaṃtreṇa ca tataḥ kanadrādi vinirmitaṃ ||

arghadi pātramatha vā śaṃkhamastrānunājalaiḥ |
prakṣālyāmukadevārghapātraṃ pratisthāpayāmi ||

evamuktvā tadādhāre saṃsthāpyaivaṃ vadet punaḥ |
arthapradedvādaśeti kalātmane vadet tataḥ ||

sūryamaṇḍalamuccārya ṅeṃtaṃ devasyanāma tu |
arghapātrāya ca namo manunānena pūjayet ||

tatpātramatha tatraiva bhāvayed bhūmimaṇḍalaṃ |
ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tatra cāṃgāni pūjayet pūrvavat tataḥ ||

kalādvādaśa sūryasya proktapātre pradakṣiṇaṃ |
tataḥ sudhāmayaistoyairmūlāṃte mātṛkāpaṭhen ||

vilomāṃ pūrayet tasmin pūjako manunāmunā |
oṃ śaṃkāmapradet yuktvā ṣoḍaśeti kalātmane ||

namaḥ paṃcadaśārṇoyaṃ maṃtraḥ śaṃkhaḥ prapūraṇe |
gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatadyava kuśāgratila sarṣapān ||

dūrvā ityarghya pātrasya proktaṃ dravyāṣṭakaṃ surā |
tatoyaṃ gaṃdhapuṣpādyaiḥ pūjayitvā samarcayet ||

kalā ṣoḍaśakaṃ cāṃdraṃ paścāt sarvakalāsu ca |
praṇapratikurvīta pūjāṃte sādhakastataḥ ||

prāgvattīrthaṃ samāvāhya mūlamaṃtreṇa tatra tu |
saṃyojya netramaṃtreṇa puṣpaṇyasya śikhāmunā ||

pradarśyagālinīṃ mudrāṃ mudrayādhenu saṃjñayā |
amṛtīkṛtya vidhivat sudhāvījena sādhakaḥ ||

dhyātveṣṭa devatāṃ tatra sakalīkaraṇaṃ caret |
aṃganyāsena vāstreṇa kalayecca diśodaśaḥ ||

<p. 86b>

netramaṃtreṇa saṃvīkṣya mudrayā śaṃkhasaṃjñayā |
avaṣṭabhya tato dīpyamudrayā yonirūpayā ||

gaṃdhapuṣpādibhistatra pūjayediṣṭadevatāṃ |
ṣaḍaṃgāni ca saṃpūjyamaṃtrayen mūlamaṃtrataḥ ||

aṣṭakṛtvastataścārghyaṃ chādayet matsyamudrayā ||

gālinyādi mudrā yathā ||

kaniṣṭāṃguṣṭhakau saktau karayoritaretaraṃ |
tarjanī madhyamānāmāsahitābhūgnavarjitāḥ ||

mudraiṣāgālinī proktā śaṃkhasyo paripālitā |
anyonyābhimukhāśliṣṭākaniṣṭhānāmikā punaḥ ||

tathā ca tarjjanī madhyā dhenumudrā mṛtapradā |
vāmapuṣpeṃtareṃguṣṭhaṃ niveśyasanarāṃguliḥ ||

dakṣiṇasya karasyaiva vāmāṃguṣṭhena saṃspṛśet |
śaṃkhamudreyamākhyātā vidvadbhiśca susaṃmatā ||

madhyame kuṭilekārye tarjanyu parisaṃsthite |
anāmike madhyagate tathaiva ca kaniṣṭhake ||

sarvā ekatra saṃyojya aṃguṣṭha paripīḍitāḥ |
yonimudrā samākhyātā trailokyotpattimātṛkā ||

dakṣepāṇiḥ pṛṣṭhadeśe vāmapāṇitalaṃ kṣipet |
aṃguṣṭhau cālayet paścātmudreyaṃ matsyarūpiṇī ||

iti viśeṣārghyavidhiḥ ||

athārghyādi pātrasaṃkhyāmāha ||

arghyasya trīṇipātrāṇi pādyasyāpi trayaṃ bhavet |
tathā ca mana patrāṇi syuradyekataraṃ bhavet ||

eka pātraṃ na kartavyaṃ yadi sākṣānmaheśvara |
maṃtrābhyarānmukhāyāṃti āpadaśca pade pade ||

ihaloke ca dāridryaṃ mṛte ca narakaṃ vrajet |
tataḥ sādhārakaṃ pātraṃ purataḥ sthāpayedbudhaḥ ||

tatpārśve pādyapātraṃ ca tatpārśverghya pradāyakaṃ |
ācamanīyaṃ ca tatpārśve tadvāme madhuparkakaṃ ||

punarācamanīyaṃ ca snānīyaṃ cakramānnyaset |
tacchaṃkhasthaṃ jalaṃ kiṃcit kuṃbhato ye viniḥkṣipet ||

ekaikapātraṃ mūlena jyeṣṭhaṃ kṛtvābhi maṃtrayet |
madhuparkastu sakṣaudraṃ dadhitacca na labhyate ||

dadhidugdhaṃguḍakṣaudreghṛtapratinidhirnahi |
paramaṃ yatpadaṃ devāmadhusaṃjñaṃ taducyate ||

tadāpyete yena karmatatproktaṃ madhuparkakaṃ |
kāṃsasya vātha raupyasya śaiveśaṃkha varoharau ||

mahāśaṃkhe vāmamārge sphāṭikaṃ grahanāyake |
dakṣiṇe prokṣaṇī pātraṃ mādāyābhiḥ prapūrayet ||

<p. 87a>

kiṃcidarghaṃ tu saṃgṛhya prokṣaṇyaṃbhasi yojayet |
punarācamanīyārthaṃ pātraṃ saṃsthāpayet tataḥ ||

pādyaṃ śyāmākadūrvāja viṣṇukrāṃtābhirucyate |
jātīlaṃvaṃgakaṃ kolaiṣkṛtamācamanīyakaṃ ||

kuśapuṣpayava vrīhi vahumūlatamālakaṃ |
dāpayet prokṣaṇī pātraṃ bhasitaṃ praṇavena ca ||

śuddhābhiradbhirvihitaṃ punarācamanīyakaṃ |
dravyābhāve pradātavyāḥ kṣālitāstaṇḍulāḥ śubhāḥ ||

athārghyādi pātrāṇāṃ phalaṃ vakṣye śubhāśubhaṃ |
sarvakāmapradaṃ svarṇaṃ raupyamāyuḥ sutapradaṃ ||

saubhāgyaṃ tāmrapātreṇa dharmavṛddhistu mṛnmaye |
nārikeledevatuṣṭidaṃkāca saṃbhavaṃ ||

lakṣmī prāptirvilvapatra brāhmaṇyaṃ brahmavṛkṣaje |
māraṇoccāṭane lohaṃ staṃbhaḥ pāṣāṇaje bhavet ||

maṃtrasyārādhane kāṣṭaṃ vāmamārge tu tauṃvike |
ratnādīnāṃ tu pātrāṇi śubharekhāṃkitāni ca ||

arghanaivedyapūjārthavalidāne prakalpayet |
pātrāṇāmādaraḥ kāryaḥ pātrāṇyavottamāni tu ||

valihoma kriyādyaṃ hi vinā pātraṃ na siddhyati |
ṣaṭtriṃśadaṃgulaṃ pātraṃ muttamaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||

madhyamaṃ tu tribhāgonaṃ kaniṣṭhaṃ dvādaśāṃgulaṃ |
vasvaṃgula vihīnaṃ tu na pātraṃ kārayet kvacit ||

nāmīvivararūpāṇi puṇḍarīkā kṛtāni ca |
śaṃkhanīlotpalābhāni pātrāṇi praikalpayet ||

śvetādītpatiśastāni viprādīnāṃ krameṇa ca |
secayet prokṣaṇī pātratoyairmūlāstramuccaret ||

ātmānaṃ yāgavastūni pūjādravyāṇi maṇḍale |
darśayeddhenumudrāṃ ca dravyaśuddhiriyaṃmatā ||

yogapīṭhānyāsa devāttadāsthāneṣu pūjayet |
maṇipīṭhe bhāvanayā tataḥ pūjyā svadevatāḥ ||

ātmānaṃ devatārūpaṃ dhyāyenmūlena paṃca tu |
puṣpasyāṃjalayordevāmastake hṛdayegude ||

pādayoḥ sarvagātre ca pūjayeccaṃdanādibhiḥ |
caturbhirūpavaraiśca naivedyaṃ ca nivedayet ||

gurupadiṣṭa vidhināśeṣamanyat samāpayet |
prokṣaṇyādbhiḥ prayuṃjītaḥ sarvametatsamāhitaṃ ||

pūjā cakraṃ samabhyukṣya vahiryāgaṃ tataścaret |
svarṇādi racite pātre kalpoktaṃ yaṃtramālikhet ||

dakṣiṇāvartato lekhaṃ yaṃtraṃ dakṣiṇapūjane |
vāmakrameṇa kaulādau guptame tatprakāśitaṃ ||

pūjāyaṃtraṃ dakṣamārge tattadgaṃdhāṣṭakena ca |
likhedvā keśarahimarocanābhissamālikhet ||

vāmamārge likhedādya puṣpeṇa yadi yaṃtrakaṃ |
yadi tallabhyate devalākṣārasa samanvitaṃ ||

kastūrī kuṃkumāktaṃ ca vaṭī kṛtvā tu gopayet |
yaṃtrarājaṃ samālikhya pūjayedyadi sādhakaḥ ||

<p. 87b>

ṣaṇmāsaṃ pūjanāt tatra tvaritaṃ siddhīmāpnuyāt |
yuvatyā aprasūtāyā abhāve gṛhyate raja ||

tadabhāve taruṇyāstu nīrogāyā rajomataṃ |
drāvaṇāṃvutpatiścaiva saṃyogotthātha vā bhavet ||

tadabhāve tu rudhiraṃ mahiṣasya praśasyate |
tadabhāve tu kusumaṃ grāhye caivā parājitāḥ ||

tasyorddhabhāge niḥkṣipyadyarpitaṃ raktacaṃdanaṃ |
tadāgataṃ mūlamārgāttena yaṃtraṃ samālikhet ||

tadabhāve tu surayāghṛṣṭaraktakacaṃdanaiḥ |
yathoktaṃ vilikhedyaṃtraṃ tuṣṭo bhavati devatā ||

navamo na prakāśosti vāmamārge surottamāḥ ||

atha yaṃtrasyāvaśyakatāmāha ||

yaṃtraṃ maṃtramayaṃ proktaṃ yaṃtrātmādevateti ca |
dehātmanoryathā bhedo yaṃtra daivatayostathā ||

śarīramiva saṃjīvasya dīpasya snehavat priye |
sarveṣāmapi devānyaṃ tathā yaṃtraṃ pratiṣṭhitaṃ ||

ādau likhedyaṃtrarājaṃ devatāyāśca vigrahaḥ |
kāmakrodhādidoṣottha sarvaduḥkhaniyaṃtraṇāt ||

yaṃtramityāhure tasmin devaḥ prīṇāti tatvataḥ |
vinā yaṃtreṇa pūjāyāṃ devatā na prasīdati ||

idamapi kaulavāmayoritikeviṃdvadaṃti ||

tathā ca ||

vāme kaule yaṃtrapīṭhe mūrtau pūjā ca dakṣiṇe ||

atha pīṭhapūjāmāha ||

evaṃ pīṭhaṃ vinirmāya pūjayet pīṭhadevatā |
guruṣaḍbhirudakpūjyā mahāgaṇapateḥ paraṃ ||

pūjayedatalādīni devasyādhastu sapta ca |
maṇḍūkaścāpi tasyorddhe rudraḥ kālānalastataḥ ||

mūlaprakṛtimādhāraśaktiṃ kūrmamanaṃtakaṃ |
vārāhaṃ tasya daṃṣṭrāgre pṛthivīmarcayet punaḥ ||

tasyāṃ sudhārṇavaṃ tasmin dvīpaṃ ca navaratnajaṃ |
svarṇaśailaṃ ca tanmadhye tadūrddhvaṃ naṃdanaṃ vanaṃ ||

tanmadhye kalpavṛkṣāṃśca tanmadhye ratnabhūmikāṃ |
svarṇaprākāramasyāṃtastanmadhye ratnamaṇḍapaṃ ||

tasyāṃtaḥ svarṇavedīṃ ca ratnasiṃhāsanaṃ punaḥ |
vedīmadhye bhāvanīyaṃ pūjayeccaṃdanādi vā ||

pūjācakrādhārapīṭhaṃ siṃhāsanamiti smaret |
tatpādeṣu yajet samyagāgneyādi śivāṃtakaṃ ||

dharmaṃ vṛṣatanuṃ raktaṃ jñānakṛṣṇaṃ ca siṃhavat |
vairāgyaṃ bhūtavatpītamaiśvaryaṃ kṛṣṇa hastivat ||

adharmādīścitravarṇānpīṭhasyādhaḥ samarccayet |
māyāvidye ca tanmadhyenaṃtaṃtalyākṛtiṃ yajet ||

<p. 88a>

tasya mūrddhni yajet padmamaṣṭa prakṛtipatrakaṃ |
ānaṃdakaṃdakaṃ saṃvinnālaṃ vikārakesaraṃ ||

karṇikāṃ mātṛkāṃ rūpāṃ tatpatreṣu kramād yajet |
siddhīnaṣṭau krāmat proktastvaṇimā ca prakāmatā ||

laghimeśitvamahimovaśitvaṃ praptagaurave |
adhodhaḥ karṇikāyāstu somaḥ sūryastathānalaḥ ||

guṇān satvādikāṃstatra tadvadagnitrayaṃ yajet |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśāṃśca tato dikṣu ca madhyataḥ ||

jñānamāyā kalāvidyā parapūrvaṃ ca tatvakaṃ |
keśareṣu tathā madhye pūrvādiṣu yathākramaṃ ||

tattanmaṃtroktapīṭhasya navaśaktīḥ prapūjayet |
pīṭhamaṃtreṇa gaṃdhādyaiḥ pīṭhamadhye tato'rcayet ||

caturthīnāma saṃyuktaiḥ svaiḥ svairdaivatanāmabhiḥ |
madhye puṣpāṃjaliṃ dadyāt pīṭhamaṃtreṇa sādhakaḥ ||

mūlamaṃtraṃ samuccārya ṣaṣṭhyātaṃ pīṭhanāma ca |
mūrtiṃ ca kalpayāmīti mūrtimadhye viniḥkṣipet ||

punarmūlaṃ samuccārya devanāma tataḥ paraṃ |
mūrtiṃ ca pūjayāmīti tāḥ puṣpeṇa samarcayet ||

atheṣṭa devatā prītyai yajedāyatanānyapi |
iśeyeneśajaśivāharāvīśeśajenasā ||

ravāvīśeśajājaubhādevyāṃ viśigabhāskarāḥ |
gaṇeśeyeśabhādevyobhyarcyā īśādi koṇataḥ ||

ekapīṭhe pṛthakpūjāṃ vināyaṃtraṃ karoti yaḥ |
devatāśāpamāpnoti rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

taṃtreṇa pūjayedyaṃtraṃ sadaivaṃ śāpamāpnuyāt |
āvāhya devatāmekāmarcayeccānyadevatāṃ ||

anya yaṃtrenya pūjā vā devatā śāpakāriṇī |
śāligrāmotha vā yaṃtraṃ sthāpya caikatamaṃ śive ||

śālagrāmaṃ tathā yaṃtraṃ dvayamekatra nārcayet |
paṃcāyatana pakṣīce dvitīyaṃ pūjayet sadā ||

divya cakraṃ yadā prāptaṃ jīvacakraṃ tadā na ca |
jīvacakraṃ yadā prāptaṃ vāṇaliṃgaṃ na cārcayet ||

vāṇaliṃgaṃ yadā prāptaṃ śālagrāmastadānavai |
sālagrāmo yadā prāptastadāyaṃtraṃ na pūjayet ||

śālagrāme jīva cakre sarvān devān prapūjayet |
yo bhāvo yasya vai proktastena bhāvena tiṣṭhati ||

pūjanaṃ vahumūrtīnāmeka pīṭhe bhavedyadi |
pṛthak caṃdana puṣpāṇi dhūpadīpādi taṃtrataḥ ||

khaṇḍite sphuṭite dagdhe bhraṣṭamāṇa vīvarjjite |
vyaṃgenahopaśuspṛṣṭhe patite duṣṭabhūmiṣu ||

anya maṃtrārcite caiva patitasparśadūṣitaḥ |
daśasve teṣu no kuryuḥ sannidhānaṃ divaukasaḥ ||

gaṇeśasūryavisvīśadevīnāṃ pūjanaṃ kramāt |
daśasthānāni devānāṃ pūjārthaṃ kalpitāni ca ||

<p. 88b>

sānnidhyaṃ sarvadevānāmavaśyaṃ yaṃtrato bhavet |
maṃtrastu jīvavat proktaḥ pratimādyaṃ śarīravat ||

siddhāyamapi sāmagryāṃ vinā maṃtraṃ phalaṃ na hi |
śivaliṃge maṇau yaṃtre śāligrāme ghaṭeravau ||

sthaṇḍilegnau mūrddhni hṛdisthāneṣṭhe teṣu pūjayet |
bhūmāvapi kṛtā pūjā putrāyurddha na nāśinī ||

īśvarovāca ||

śāligrāma samutpattiṃ śṛṇvaṃ tu paramādbhutāṃ |
gaṇḍakyā prāptapastaptaṃ bhavaṃ tu mama devatāḥ ||

sarvaputrāḥ sukhadātuṃ janānāmiti tejadā |
tasyāstu tapasā hṛṣṭā brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarāḥ ||

varaṃ dātuṃ samudyuktā vraveśā svasya putratāṃ |
aśaktāstaṃ varaṃ dātuṃ tadāśaptāstayākrudhā ||

pratāraṇaṃ mama surāḥ kṛtaṃ yasmāt punaḥ punaḥ |
kīṭayonī prapadyethā krudhāstehyaśayaṃkṣutān ||

avicāryavayaṃ sastvayādyattapasādrute |
tena karma vipākena jaḍākṛṣṇā nadī bhava ||

anyonyaśāpaṃ śrutvetthaṃ mahākolāhalo bhavat |
prakaṃpitā surāḥ sā ca brahmāṇaṃ tevya jijñiṣuḥ ||

brahmanstrāhi mahāśāpādanyonya patitākruddhā |
iti devavacaḥ śrutvā brahmāśaṃkaramavravīt ||

śivaḥ provāca dhātāramahaṃ saṃsārakārakaḥ |
tvaṃ sṛṣṭikartā viṣṇustu pālako buddhimattaraḥ ||

samaṣṭavyo yathā saukhyamubhayoḥ saṃbhavediti |
iti māheśvaraṃ śrutvā vacanaṃ viṣṇura vravīta ||

śṛṇu brahmanmahādeva śṛṇu devi gajānana |
madgaṇau brāhmaṇau grāhamātaṃgau śāpatotra tu ||

bhaviṣyati tayormokṣaṃ kariṣyāmi kalevaraṃ |
śīrṇe bhaviṣyati yadā tanmedomajjasaṃbhavā ||

pāṣāṇīṃtargatāḥ kīṭā vajrākhyāḥ prabhaviṣyatha |
adyaivaṃ gaṇḍakī puṇyā gaṃgātulyā mahānadī ||

gaṇḍakyāṃgirirājasya dakṣiṇe daśayojanaṃ |
vistīrṇaṃtan manuṃkṣatraṃ puṇyakṣatraṃ mahītale ||

cakratīrthamitikhyātaṃ triṣu lokeṣu viśrutaṃ |
śālagrāmagatā devādevadvārāvatī gataḥ ||

ubhayoḥ saṃgamo yatra muktistatra na saṃśayaḥ |
sarvadeva prītikarā bhuktimuktipradāyinī ||

bhavaṃ tvasyāṃ tu pāṣāṇāyetadaṃtargatāḥ surāḥ |
pārthivāṃśaṃ vinā sarve vajrakīṭā bhavaṃ tviti ||

<p. 89a>

anenaiva tu gaṇḍakyāḥ putratvaṃ bhavatāmapi |
bhaviṣyati tadaṃtaśca cihnaṃ taddevatodbhavaṃ ||

vijñāyayercaviṣyaṃti sā prītā tasya devatā |
na yaṃtrasya na mūrteśca na vṛkṣasyāpi pūjanāt ||

saṃtoṣo jāyate teṣāṃ gaṇḍakyasyārcarādyathā |
iti viṣṇu vacaḥ śrutvā brahmāvacanamavravīt ||

kīdṛk pūjyāśilā viṣṇoḥ kiṃ cihnākasya vallabhā |
kiṃ phalaṃ cādhikārīkaḥ kena mārgeṇa tadvada ||

iti brahmavacaḥ śrutvā viṣṇurvacanama vravīt |
svīyavarṇā śilāpūjyā brāhmaṇādyaiḥ sukhāptaye ||

snigdhāḥ śilāmaṃtra siddhiṃ rukṣāsiddhiṃ karoti ca |
pecakā kīrtitā dhautāṃgāravatsāyaśoharā ||

pāṇḍurāyā praśamanī malinā pāpadhīkarā |
pītā putraphalaṃ dadyādāravarṇāsutān haret ||

nīlāsaṃdiśate lakṣmīṃ dhūmābhāharate matiṃ |
rogapradā raktavarṇā siṃdūrābhā mahākaliṃ ||

dāridryakāriṇī cakrāsanā sarvārthasādhikā |
sthūlāni haṃti vai vāyuḥ sūkṣmā svalpamṛtiṃ haret ||

pūjāphalaṃ lāṃchitayā niṣphalaṃ lāṃchinaṃ vinā |
kapilācitta vaikalpaṃ netrarogaṃ ca karvurā ||

bhagnābhaṃgakarī jñeyā vahucakrā pramāṇitāṃ |
rakṣaṇāṃtarahīnāvedeka cakrāviyogatāṃ ||

vṛhanmukhī kalataghnīvṛhacakrā sutān haret |
saṃlagna cakrātva sukhaṃ vaddha vakrāmahāgadaṃ ||

bhagna cakrā tu dāridryaṃ sarvanāśaṃ tvadhomukhī |
kuṣṭādikaṃ vyālamukhī viṣamā vividhā padaṃ ||

vikṛtāvartanābhiśca vikārān kurute vahūn |
vaṃśachedo gṛhasthānāṃ nārasiṃhyāṃ prajāyate ||

rekhāvartā duḥkhadātrī yathā sūkṣmā tathā sukhaṃ |
yathā snigdhā tathā lakṣmīmadvibhedānataḥ śṛṇu ||

lakṣmī hariḥ sa vijñeyo yatra padmaṃ sa cakrakaṃ |
kevalā vanamālmavā gṛhasthānāmabhīṣṭadaḥ ||

vāsudevaḥ sa vijñeyo yadvāre cakra yugmakaṃ |
niraṃtaraṃ samaṃ vāpi sa śvetaḥ pāpanāśanaḥ ||

saṃkūrṣaṇaḥ sa vijñeyaḥ prākyaścāccakra yugmakaṃ |
saṃlagnaṃ pūrvabhāgasthaṃ mahadraktaḥ suśobhanaḥ ||

pradyumnaḥ sūkṣmacakraḥ syācchidraṃ dīrghaṃ vicitritaṃ |
sukhirāṃtarvahucchidraṃ vīta iṣṭapradāyakaṃ ||

agniruddhastunīlābhovartulaścāti śobhanaḥ |
rekhādvayaṃ tu tadvārapṛṣṭaṃ padmena lāṃchitaṃ ||

keśavaḥ sa tu vijñeya ekaṃ vā dvayameva vā |
prāgvāpaścāccakraṃ syāccatuḥkoṇa sa bhāgyakṛt ||

nārāyaṇaḥ śyāmavarṇā nābhau cakraṃ tathānnataṃ |
dīrgharekhā samāyuktaṃ daikṣiṇe sukhiraṃ pṛthu ||

<p. 89b>

harirūpā (**) (?) śilāsāsyādyasyā ūrddhvamukhaṃ bhavet |
harivandṛśyate dvāraṃ bhuktimukti pradātu sā ||

parameṣṭī sa vijñeyaḥ padmacakrānvitastrayaḥ |
vilvā kṛtiśca śuklābhaḥ pṛṣṭhe ca sukhirāṃ mahān ||

viṣṇustu kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ syāt sthūle cakra suśobhane |
dvāropari tathā rekhā dṛśyate madhyadeśataḥ ||

narasiṃhastu kapilaḥ pṛthucakro vṛhanmukhaḥ |
trayo vā paṃcavā tatra viṃdavo gṛhiṇāṃ na sat ||

kapilo narasiṃhastu guḍalākṣānibho bhavet |
sthūla cakradvayaṃ madhye dvāre rekhā suśobhanā ||

mahānṛsiṃho vijñeyaḥ pūrvoktairlalakṣaṇairyutaḥ |
rekhāśca keśarākārāmukhaṃ dīrghaṃ bhayānakaṃ ||

lakṣmī nṛsiṃho vijñeyaścatuścakra triviṃdukaḥ |
pūrvokta lakṣaṇairyukto vanamālā virājitaḥ ||

vārāhosau śaktiliṃge cakre ca viṣame tathā |
iṃdranīlanibhaḥ sthūla strirekhālāṃchito bhavet ||

pṛthivīvārāhanāmnī sāpāvarāhākṛtiḥ śilā |
ābhugnā caiva rekhaikāgatarājyapradāyikā ||

matsyākhyā sā śilā jñeyā viṃdutrayavibhūṣitā |
kāṃsyābhāvāsvarṇanibhā dīrghā sā bhuktimuktidā ||

kūrmākhyā tu śilā pṛṣṭhe vartulāyonnatā bhavet |
haritaṃ varṇamādhatte kaustubhena ca cihnitā ||

śilākūrmaḥ sa vijñeyaḥ kūrmākārastuyo bhavet |
cakrāṃkitā tathā vṛttā pūjitā sā padapradā ||

hayagrīvoṃ kuśākārā rekhācakra samīpagā |
vahuviṃdu samāyuktaṃ pṛṣṭhaṃ nīradanīlakaṃ ||

jñeyaḥ saumyahayagrīvāhayagrīvā samāśilā |
dīrghayā rekhayā yukto rekhā vā tādṛśī bhavet ||

hayaśīrṣaḥ sa vijñeyo mukhaṃ yasya hayākṛtiḥ |
padmākṛtirbhavedvāpi sākṣamālaṃ śirastathā ||

vaikuṇṭhastilavarṇābhaścakramekaṃ tathā dhvajaṃ |
hāroparitathā rekhā pūpākārā suśobhanā ||

śrīdharastu tathā devaścihnito varamālayā |
kadaṃva kusumākāro rekhā paṃcakabhūṣitaḥ ||

vāmanaḥ sa tu vijñeyo yoti hrasvaśca vartulaḥ |
aṭasīkusumaprakhyo viṃduno pariśobhitā ||

dadhivāmananāmātu ūrddhvādhaścakrasaṃyutaḥ |
mahādyutiratihrasvaḥ subhikṣakṣemadāyakaḥ ||

sudarśanastathā devaḥ śyāmavarṇo mahādyutiḥ |
vāmapārśve tathā cakraṃ rekhaikaiva tu dakṣiṇā ||

<p. 90a>

sahasrārjuna nāmāsau nānārekhāmayī bhavet |
cakrākāra yatra paṃktiḥ sa naṣṭadravyadāyakaḥ ||

sthūla dāmodaroyasya madhye cakraṃ pratiṣṭhitaṃ |
dūrvābhaṃ dvāri saṃkīrṇaḥ pītārekhā dhanapradaḥ ||

rādhā dāmodaro jñeya ūrddhvādhaścakramānvilaṃ |
nātidīrghāmukhaṃ madhye laṃvorekhā sa bhogadaḥ ||

dāmodaraḥ sa vijñeyoyaścakradvayalāṃchitaṃ |
sūkṣmaṃ bhavecca vivaraṃ pūjitaḥ sukhadaḥ sadā ||

anaṃto vahuvarṇaḥ syānnāga bhogena cihnitaḥ |
aneka cakra saṃbhinna sarvakāma phalapradaḥ ||

puruṣottama nāmāsau yasya dikṣu vidikṣu ca |
ūrddhvānyāsyānidṛśyaṃ te puruṣārtha phalapradaḥ ||

yogeśvaraḥ sa vijñeyo liṃgaṃ yasya śirogatam |
brahmahatyādi pāpānāṃ nāśako yogasiddhidaḥ ||

padmanābhastathāraktaḥ paṃkajaḥ chatrasaṃyutaḥ |
tulasyā pūjito nityaṃ daridrastvīśvaro bhavet ||

raśmijvālo hiraṇyāsyaścaṃdrābhaḥ sphaṭikopamaḥ |
athavā jāyate nānāsvarṇarekhābhiranvitaḥ ||

garuḍaḥ sa tu vijñeyo madhya pakṣadvayānvitā |
sudīrghā dṛśyate rekhā sa sarpyaviṣanāśakaḥ ||

janārdanaḥ sa vijñeyaḥ kevalāni sphuṭāni ca |
yasyodare tu catvāri cakrāṇi pitṛ tṛptikṛt ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇo jñeyo vanamālyaṃ kitodaraḥ |
sūkṣmadvāraścatuścakro bhuktimuktipradāyakaḥ ||

hṛṣīkeśaḥ sa vijñeyoyorddhacaṃdvākṛtirbhavet |
tamabhyarcyalabhet svarge viṣayāṃśca samīhitān ||

lakṣmīnaraharirjñeyaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇaḥ saviṃdukaṃ |
vāmapārśve same cakre gṛhasthābhīṣṭadāyakaḥ ||

trivikramastu vijñeyaḥ śyāmavarṇo mahādyutiḥ |
vāmapārśve cakra yugmamekārekhā tu dakṣiṇe ||

kṛṣṇo jñeyaḥ śilākṛṣṇo sa cakrāvāci cakrikā |
pradakṣiṇāvarttakṛta vanamālā vibhūṣitā ||

caturmukhaḥ sa vijñeyo dvecakre madhyadeśataḥ |
catasra pārśvamārekhā vedaśāstrāgamapradaḥ ||

viṣṇorbhedā ime proktā atraivā vā hareddhariṃ |
visarjayecca pūjāṃte pratiṣṭhāṃ nātra kārayet ||

śāligrāmāḥ samā pūjyāḥ sameṣudvitayaṃ na hi |
asamānaiva pūjyaṃte ekaḥ pūjyatamottamaḥ ||

<p. 90b>

śilādvādaśayonityaṃ bhaktyā saṃpūjayennaraḥ |
dine dine dharmavṛddhiḥ pāpanāśaḥ prajāyate ||

śālagrāmaśilāyastu bhaktyā saṃpūjayennaraḥ |
śataṃ dināni yastena kṛtakāmaḥ sa siddhyati ||

śāligrāmāmat svarūpāḥ śṛṇu teṣāṃ tu lakṣaṇaṃ |
yatsevanādbhavediṣṭamiha loke paratra ca ||

śivanābhaḥ sa vijñeyaḥ sa liṃgākāratāṃgataḥ |
svayaṃbhu liṃgākṛtimānmaṃtra siddhividhāyakaḥ ||

traiyaṃvakaḥ sa vijñeyo yo viṃdutraya bhūṣitaḥ |
śulākārā tathā rekhāgata puṃstvapradāyakaḥ ||

dhūrjaṭiḥ sa tu vijñeyo yatra rekhā jaṭāsamā |
tisro yatra pradṛśyaṃte sorcito jñānadāyakaḥ ||

śaktastu pāṇḍuro jñeyo viṃduḥ kṛṣṇastu mastake |
vilvapramāṇa tejasvī pūjita strīvaśaṃkaraḥ ||

īśvaraḥ sa tu vijñeyo raktaviṃdustu mastake |
ekacakro dvicakro vābhyaṃtaredhaścagāḥpahaṃ ||

mṛtyuṃjayaḥ savijñeyaḥ svalpamṛtyuvināśakaḥ |
adhaścakraṃ tadūrddhvaṃ ca śvetārekhā triśūlamān ||

caṃdraśeṣaranāmāsāvarddhacaṃdrākṛtistuke |
madhyacaṃdra dvayaṃ tasya sevanādroganāśanaṃ ||

rudraḥ sa eva vijñeyaḥ kapilo mūrddhni rukṣataḥ |
cakraṃ madhye bhavedveṣāmārayedripusaṃtatiṃ ||

śāligrāmānatho vakṣye śaktikīṭasamudbhavān |
yeṣāṃ pūjanato devī bhavānī suprasīdati ||

śrīvidyā sā tale cakre mūrddhnachatraṃ pradṛśyate |
vāhyaghaṭāṃkito mūrddhā snigdhā śyāmākhileṣṭadā ||

mahākālī tu sā jñeyā yoni cihna samanvitā |
rukṣā sthūlā cipiṣṭā ca vāmamārgeṇa pūjayet ||

vārāhī tu varāhasya cihnitāṃtaḥ samanvitā |
mrāpitā valiraktai sā yadarthaṃ bhakṣayeccataṃ ||

dvichidrādyāḥ sarvaśilā strikoṇe śāṃkitāścayāḥ |
yadā yudhākṛtiścorddhaṃtāṃ devīṃ tatra nirddiśet ||

devīśilā ca cakrāyā dakṣe mārgenatāṃ yajet |
sārvitā mārgeṇa lokadvaya sukhāvahāḥ ||

yā cakrarahitā devī śilāṃ tāṃ vāmatorcayet |
sparśaḥ kāryo na viprāṇāṃ na gavāṃ kṣobha kṛdbhavet ||

<p. 91a>

saurīśilādurllabhaiva prāyaḥ kaliyugesurāḥ |
sphaṭikābhā bhavet sātudyarme muktā vimuṃcati ||

tulasyorddha sthite vahniṃ sābhiṣiktā pravarṣaṇe|
kurute śapatho mithyā kṛtosyākṛṣṭakārakaḥ ||

gaṇeśaḥ sa tu vijñeyo yaḥ svaśuṇḍāṃkito bhavet |
śuṇḍākārāśilā vāpi gajānana samāpi vā ||

yasyā madhye mahaccakraṃ sūkṣmacakraṃ ca yaddiśi |
sā śilā tasyadikyasya sevyā taddiśi rājyadā ||

arddhacaṃdrākṛtiryatra dṛśyate śaṃkaradvayaṃ |
sā tu caṃdraśilā tryasrayuktā bhaumaśilāmatā ||

vāṇākāreṇa cihnena jñeyā vudhaśilā surāḥ |
dīrgheṇa caturasreṇa yuktā guruśilā matā ||

paṃcakoṇā tu śukrasya cāpākārāśanermatā |
sūryākārā tu rāhoḥ syāt ketostu dhvajarūpiṇī ||

prāpte kaliyuge ghore vāmācāre vimiśrite |
bhaktyā bhakṣya vivārādi rahitā mlecchasaṃkule ||

kāmakrodhādibhirvyāptejanestrībhirvinirjite |
kvaśiṣyaḥ kvagururmaṃtraḥ kvajapaḥ kva ca siddhayaḥ ||

ayutāvde kaleryāte tyajedviṣṇuśilāṃmahīṃ |
tadarddhā jāhnavī toyaṃ tadarddhvāddevatāśilāḥ ||

japa evaṃ kalau śreyān śāligrāmārcanaṃ tathā |
śāligrāme tathā yaṃtre sahasraiva prasīdati ||

śāligrāme tathā yaṃtre vidyamāne maheśvari |
devaḥ kutravaseddevisthāna dvitayakaṃ bhavet ||

śāligrāmā bhavedyaṃtraṃ śāligrāmo gṛhaṃ bhavet |
yaṃtraṃ tu gṛhamityuktaṃ gṛhasthā devatāmatā ||

pratimā vā prakartavyo yathoktā śubhalakṣaṇā |
divyacakre jīvacakre śāligrāme tathaiva ca ||

vāṇaliṃge maheśāni nāvāhana visarjane ||

athāvāhanādikaṃ ||

sūryārghadānasamaye dānaṃ vibhavataḥ paraṃ |
āvāhanādikaṃ kuryān mūrtyādau navadhā tu tat ||

ādāvā vāhanaṃ kāryaṃ trirjapte mūlamaṃtrakaṃ |
svalokāt sūkṣmarūpeṇa deva āgatya mūrtiṣu ||

sthita evaṃ bhāvayitvā suṣumṇāvartmanāsudhīḥ |
ānīya tejaḥ svasyānānnāsikāraṃdhunirgataṃ ||

kare puṣpāṃjalau sthāpyaṃ taddadyādevamūrddhani |
devasya tejastanmūrtau āvāhinyākhya mudrayā ||

<p. 91b>

sthāpayeduccaranmūlametadāvāhanaṃ mataṃ |
vibhorniveśanaṃ yaṃtre sthāpanaṃ kathitaṃ vudhaiḥ ||

tataḥ saṃsthāpanaṃ kuryādihatiṣṭhehatiṣṭa ca |
mūlāṃte devatānāma tasyāṃte ca paṭhediti ||

āsthāpanīyamudrāṃ ca darśayitvā vibhāvayet |
jātaḥ sthirodeva iti paścāt saṃprārthayediti ||

deveśa bhaktisulabha sarvāvaraṇa saṃyutaḥ |
yāvattvāṃ pūjayiṣyāmitāvattvaṃ susthirobhava ||

evaṃ saṃprārthyate deśaṃ sannidhāpanamācaret |
pūjāṃ prapūjyamānāṃ tu gṛhītvānu grahādikaṃ ||

kartuṃ sāmarthya tasyāstu tatsānnidhyaṃ pracakṣate |
mūlamaṃtraṃ samuccārya saṃbudhyaṃ tāṃ ca devatāṃ ||

ihatvaṃ sannidhehīti dviruktvā svasya sannidhau |
sthitaṃ devatoṣayecca sannidhāpana mudrayā ||

ākarmakāśuparyaṃtaṃ sānnidhyamehibho vadet |
sannirodha uddiṣṭo bhaktito maṃtravinnaraiḥ ||

sannirodhaṃ tataḥ kuryān mūlamuccārya devatāṃ |
saṃvudhyatāṃ samuccārya sanniruddho bhaveti ca ||

dviruccaret kṛpāpūrṇāṃ bhaktibhāva nirodhitāṃ |
pratimāyāṃ sthirījātāṃ devatāmiti ciṃtayet ||

saṃmukhīkaraṇaṃ kuryān mūlamuccārya devatāṃ |
saṃvudhyatāvadet paścāt saṃmukho bhava ityapi ||

dhyāyet svasaṃmukhaṃ devaṃ suprasannānanāṃvujāṃ |
saṃmukhīkaraṇīṃ mudrāṃ darśayediti tat smṛtaṃ ||

ānaṃdāyatanaṃ tatvaṃ saccidānaṃdalakṣaṇaṃ |
tadatra sakalevyāptaṃ dhyeyaṃ syādevaguṇṭhanaṃ ||

tato vaguṇṭhanaṃ kuryān mūlamuccārya devatāṃ |
saṃvuddhyatāmavaguṇṭhito bhavaṃti pradarśayet ||

avaguṇṭhana mudrāṃ ca darśayecciṃtayediti |
bhaktyā saṃmohitaṃ deva vismayotphullalocanaṃ ||

sakalīkaraṇaṃ caiva devasya hṛdayādiṣu |
ṣaḍaṃgamaṃtrānvinyasya mūlamuccārya devatāṃ ||

saṃ (************) 
(***) (?) |
(************) 
(?) raṇād bhavet ||

<p. 92a>

aṃgānāmaṃgināsārddhaṃ vidadhyādamṛtīkṛtiḥ |
amṛtīkaraṇaṃ vakṣye pīṭhe saṃsthāpya devatāṃ ||

vadhvā samyagdhenumudrāṃ devamūrdhni pravarṣaṇaṃ |
jāyate cāmṛtasyeti dhyāyantrarghyodakena ca ||

trisiṃcen mūlamaṃtreṇa dīpinī maṃtratastridhā |
akārādikṣakārāṃta mātṛkābhistridhā punaḥ ||

atra dīpinī maṃtro yathā ||

vāgbhavaṃ vadayugmaṃ ca vāgvādīni ca vāgbhavaṃ |
klīṁ klinnekledinīkledaya mahākṣobhamityapi ||

kuruyugmaṃ kāmavījaṃ saumokṣaṃ kuruyugmakaṃ |
prāsādaśca parāprāsādaḥ saptatriṃśadakṣaraḥ ||

dīpanāṃ manunākhyā tādeva tejobhivṛddhikṛt |
mūlaṃ saṃvodhanāṃ taṃ ca devanāmāmṛtīkṛtaḥ ||

bhave hi ca vadedittha mamṛtīkaraṇaṃ smṛtaṃ |
kṣamātasyāparādhānāṃ vijñeyā paramīkṛtiḥ ||

paramīkaraṇaṃ vakṣye mahāmudrāṃ ca vaṃdhayet |
uccārya mūlaṃ devaṃ ca pūrvavat paramāmṛtī ||

kṛtā bhaveti ca proktā dhyāyeddevasya mastakeḥ |
paramāmṛtavṛṣṭiṃ ca devasya hṛdayaṃ spṛśan ||

kuryāt prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ ca mamasthāne vadet tathā |
devatānāmaśeṣaṃ tu sarvaṃ prāgvadeva hi ||

atha krameṇāvāhanādi mudrālakṣaṇamāha |
hastābhyāṃ maṃjaliṃ vadhvā nāmikāmūlaparvaṇoḥ ||

aṃguṣṭāni kṣipet seyaṃ mudrātvā vāhinī matā |
adhomukhisviyaṃ vai syāt sthāpinīti nigadyate ||

ucchritāṃguṣṭa muṣṭyāstu yogāt saṃdhāpanīmatā |
aṃtaḥ praveśitāṃguṣṭā saiva saṃrodhanīmatā ||

uttānamuṣṭiyugalā saṃmukhīkaraṇīmatā |
savyahastakṛtāguṣṭidīrghādhomukhatarjanī ||

avaguṇṭhana mudreyamabhito bhrāmitāsatī |
devatāṃge ṣaḍaṃgānāṃ nyāsaḥ syāt sakalīkṛtīḥ ||

amṛtīkaraṇaṃ dhenumudrayā soktaiva ||

anyonyagrathitāṃguṣṭhā prasārita parāṃguliḥ |
mahāmudreyamuditā paramīkaraṇe priye ||

etāḥ prayojayenmudrā devatāhvāna karmaṇi |
tat taddaivatakalpoktāstato mudrāḥ pradarśayet ||

oṃ klīṃmiti tu vījābhyāṃ mudrayāvaṃdhanaṃ smṛtaṃ |
darśayenmūlamaṃtreṇa haṃsavījena saṃtyajet ||

<p. 92b>

mudaṃ svarūpatvābhābhyāṃ dehadvāreṇa cātmanaḥ |
yā arpayaṃtyo yatnena mudrāstāḥ śaktayonatā ||

modayaṃti grahādityaḥ pāpaughaṃ drāvayaṃti ca |
modayaṃ drāvaṇaṃ yasmādato mudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

yathā vālasyābhinayaṃ dṛṣṭvā hṛṣyaṃti mātaraḥ |
tathā bhakta kṛtāṃ mudrāṃ dṛṣṭvā hṛṣyaṃti devatāḥ ||

na jātu darśayen mudrāṃ mahājana samāgame |
kṣubhyaṃti devatāstasya kiṃ phalaṃ tu kṛtaṃ bhavet ||

tataḥ saṃpūjayeddevaṃ śaktyā labhyopacārakaiḥ |
āsanaṃ svāgataṃ cārghyaṃ pādyamācamanīyakaṃ ||

madhuparkothā ca manaṃ snānaṃ vastramalaṃkṛtiḥ |
gaṃdhaṃ puṣpāṇi dhūpaśca dīpanaivedyacaṃdanā ||

prayojayedarcanāyāmupacārāṃstu ṣoḍaśaḥ |
daśopacārā madhyā syāt sā gṛhasthairvidhīyate ||

arghyaṃ pādyaṃ tathā vāmo madhuparkastathācayaḥ |
gaṃdhādayo nivedyāṃtā upacārā daśasmṛtāḥ ||

gaṃdhādayo nivedyaṃtā pūjāpaṃcopacārikā |
agṛhasthairgṛhasthairvākartavyākārya tatparaiḥ ||

saparyā trividhā proktātāsāmekatamaṃsrayet |
upacāreṣu sarveṣu yat kiṃcidurlabhaṃ bhavet ||

tatsarvaṃ manasādhyātvā puṣpakṣepeṇa kalpayet |
tatra tatra jalaṃ dadyādupacārāṃtarāṃtarā ||

ādau kuryādvaidikastuvada maṃtreṇa pūjanaṃ |
tataśca tāṃtrikairmaṃtrairvāmīśūdraśca taṃtrataḥ ||

ahaṃ haṃ haṃ ihamidamidaṃ gṛhāṇa ṭhadvayaṃ |
yojyaḥ sarvopacāreṣu maṃtraḥ paṃcadaśākṣaraḥ ||

paṭhedvā vaidikasyāṃte taṃtramaṃtraṃ tu vaidikaḥ |
sarvatra vahnijāyāyāḥ sthāna śūdro namaḥ paṭhet ||

athāsanaṃ ||

devasya vāmabhāge tu dadyānmūlena cāsanaṃ |
pauṣpaṃ dārumayaṃ cāstraṃ cārmakauśaṃ ca tejasaṃ ||

pauṣpaṃ puṣpādi racitaṃ kuśasūtrādi saṃyutaṃ |
nānāvarṇaṃ sugaṃdhaṃ ca komalaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ ||

yasya yāni niṣiddhāni puṣpāṇyuktānitaiḥ kṛtaṃ |
kevalairāsanaṃ haṃti sādhakasya manorathān ||

athaiteṣāṃ bhedā ||

yajñadāru samudbhūtaṃ vailvaṃ vā caṃdanodbhavaṃ |
gaṃbhāryā vā viṣṭaro vā śrīparṇyā vepsitapradaṃ ||

<p. 93a>

sakaṃṭakaṃ kṣīrayutaṃ tālasāla vivarjitaṃ |
caitya śmaśāna saṃbhūtaṃ varjayecca vibhītakaṃ ||

romajaṃ valkalaṃ kośajātaṃ kāryā sa saṃbhavaṃ |
vāstraṃ caturvidhaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ turyaṃ pūrvamudāhṛtaṃ ||

siṃhavyāghratarakṣūṇāṃ chāgasya mahiṣasya ca |
gajānāṃ turagāṇāṃ ca kṛṣṇaśārasya carmaṇā ||

āsanaṃ nirmitaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ niṣiddhaṃ kharakukkuraṃ |
śṛgālasya vṛkasyāpi gośaśasya kapestathā ||

kuśaḥkāśaḥśarograṃthoya vā dūrvāśca valkayā |
gokeśattujaukaṃdaśca pūrvābhāveparaḥ paraḥ ||

yogapīṭhasya sadṛśametemāma saṃsmṛtaṃ |
pūrvaṃ pūrvaṃ śreṣṭhatamaṃ kauśaṃ daśavidhaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

svarṇatārā tāmrasadavaṃgānāṃ tu paraṃ paraṃ |
hīnaṃ niṣiddhaṃ lohaṃ ca kāṃsyaṃ sīsaṃ ca pittalaṃ ||

atha svāgataṃ ||

sāṃgasāvaraṇaṃ devaṃ pūjārthamihacāgataṃ |
iti dhyātvā tu mūlāṃte svāgataṃ parikīrtayet ||

athārghyadānaṃ ||

tatorghyaṃ mūrdhni dadyācca kālosya trividhomataḥ |
āgatāya tathārcāyāṃ snānumāsanagāya ca ||

pūjāṃte gaṃdukāmāyaddevāyārghyaṃ pradāpayet ||

atha pādyadānaṃ ||

arghya dravyadyutaistoyai rūpacāramanuṃpaṭhan |
āgate snānakāle ca naivedyopakramopi ca ||

trividhaḥ pādyakālaḥ syāt pādyaṃ syāt pādadhāvanaṃ |
sugaṃdhāmṛttikābhirvāgaṃdhapuṣṭātakairapi ||

samyakkṣālana pūrvaṃ tu śītairvoṣṇajalairbhavet ||

athācamanīyaṃ ||

pādye ca madhuparke ca snāne vastropavītayoḥ |
bhojanecācamaḥ śuddhetoyaiḥ ṣaṭva prakīrtitaḥ ||

atha madhuparkaḥ ||

kṣaudraṃ kṛtvā kāṃsyapātre dadyāddeva mukhāṃvuje |
divase dadhi saṃyukta mupacāramanuṃ paṭhan ||

atha punarācamanīyaṃ ||

jātīphalalavaṃgailā caṃdrakaṃ kolacūrṇayuk |
punarācamanīyārthaṃ toyaṃ devamukherpayet ||

atha snānīyaṃ ||

suvarṇa tailairabhyajyasugaṃdhamalakādibhiḥ |
uddhatanairvidhāyātha snāpayeduṣṇavāriṇā ||

gaṃdhodakaiśca mūlena yathā śaktābhiṣecayet |
kṣīradadhyājya madhubhiḥ khaṇḍena ca pṛthak pṛthak ||

<p. 93b>

nārikelodake nāpi tathā tālaphalāṃvunā |
gaṃdhadravyaiśca vahunistathāgaṃdhodakena ca ||

ekṣaveṇodakenāpi sa karpūrādi gaṃdhinā |
kadalīpaṇasāmrotharasenāpi sugaṃdhinā ||

śataṃ sahasramayutaṃ śaktyāṃ cāpyabhiṣecayet |
śaṃkhaṃ saṃpūryate naiva snāpayettemananyadhīḥ ||

sarveṣāṃ prītidaḥ śaṃkho na sūryāsya kadācana |
paṃcāmṛtaistīrthatoyairabhiṣiktaḥ śivostudaṃ ||

labhatenānya śaṃkhodaistataḥ śuddhodakena ca |
snānaṃ puruṣasūktena kāryemūlena vāmibhiḥ ||

atha vastraṃ ||

viṣṇave vagalāmukhyaiḥ pītakauśeyamaṃvaraṃ |
śivāya ca sarasvatyai pārśvanāthāya śubhrakaṃ ||

raktaṃ śaktyaka vighnānāṃ bhaumasaugatayorapi |
kṛṣṇaṃ bhairavakālyāderādhādernīlamaṃ varaṃ ||

achidraṃ malahīnaṃ ca sadaśaḥ ṣannadhāritaṃ |
kāryā sa jaṃvā kauśeyaṃ nārkavaṃ vā viśiṣyate ||

tailādidūṣitādrogaḥ sacchiddhābhyatā bhavet |
parakīyācca dāridryaṃ jīrṇādāyuḥ kṣayo bhavet ||

dagdhādvipadbhaveddāsyaṃdatte gātrāvalaṃvite |
śūcīcihnā sphoṭakādi malināt kāṃtihīnatā ||

uptakeśe putranāśaścādhautedīnatā bhavet |
mithyābhiśāpo bhavati śleṣmamūtrādidūṣite ||

tataḥ pūrvoditaṃ vastraṃ yathā vaibhava kalpitaṃ |
dadyāddevyāśvabhāvepi kevalaṃ kusumaṃ tathā ||

vastrārpaṇena tu vinā pūjā bhavati niṣphalā |
ato dadyāt puṣpamapi vastrābhāve sureśvari ||

atha yajñopavīta bhūṣaṇe ||

yajñopavītaṃ datvātha bhūṣaṇāni samarpayet |
ṅeṃtaṃ namoṃtaṃ tannāma pūjanādau prayojayet ||

tāni nānāvidhānāni syurmukuṭādikabhedataḥ |
strīṣu prabhedataścāpi vijñeyāni vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||

atha caṃdanaṃ ||

caṃdanaṃ malayotpanna manāghrātaṃ suśītalaṃ |
karpūrāgurukastūrīhimāṃvukṣoditaṃ śubhaṃ ||

cūrṇaghṛṣṭaṃ dhūmasāraḥ saṃmardaprāṇisaṃbhavaḥ |
gaṃdhaḥ paṃcavidho jñeyo mokṣadaḥ svargavāsināṃ ||

praśastaṃ gaṃdhayuktānāṃ yatra cūrṇāni yāni ca |
tāni gaṃdhāhvayāni syuścūrṇajaḥ prathamaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

<p. 94a>

ghṛṣṭomalayajogaṃdhaḥ saralo devadāru ca |
kṛṣṇāguruḥ kadaṃvaśca dvitīyoyaṃ prakīrtitaḥ ||

śatapatrīrasemagnāccaṃdanā gurukādikāt |
piṭharīyaṃtrataḥ kācakūpyāṃ siddhastṛtīyakaḥ ||

kṛṣṇāguruścaṃdanadevadāru kālīyakaṃ vālaka bhadramustaṃ |
śilārasaḥ kuṃdarakokilāścasenaṃtikāketuragāhalīnāḥ ||

mṛtkarpaṭaiḥ saṃyutakā ca kupyāṃ datvā mukhaṃ mudrayalohasūtraiḥ |
niṣkāsitodhūmarasastu tasyai saugaṃdhikaiḥ kā ca kaṭorakeyaḥ ||

mahāmodanāmāsurāmodakārī tathā bhūtapakṣoragātaṃkakārī |
jvarārocakachardiśaṃkāpahārī lalāṭesthidoṣāpahārī ||

yathā bhāgamanekāstu sugaṃdhāgaṃdhavāribhiḥ |
marditā sa caturthastu saṃmarda iti kīrtyate ||

kastūrikā caika bhāgādvaubhāgau mustakasya ca |
tadarddhailājaṭāmāṃsītvakuṣṭaṃ ca śilārasaḥ ||

caturbhāgaṃ vālakaṃ ca ghṛtabhṛṣṭā tathā nakhāṃ |
sugaṃdha kokilā lohavāṇo rājavacā tathā ||

aṣṭaubhāgāḥ keśarasya śūlāyāścātha ṣoḍaśaḥ |
kṛṣṇā guruścākasīraṃ kālīyamathaṣādhayaḥ ||

bhāgāḥ sevaṃtikā kasya caṃdanena vimardayet |
kāmodanāmāsaṃmarde devatārājatoṣayet ||

kastūrikāyau tu madaḥ prāṇijāta itīryataṃ |
paṃcamoyaṃ sugaṃdhaśca devadānava toṣayet ||

gaṃdhāṣṭakaṃ ca trividhaṃ śaktiviṣṇuśivātmakaṃ |
caṃdanā gurukarpūrayora kuṃkumarocanā ||

jaṭāmāṃsī kapiyutā śaktergaṃdhāṣṭakaṃ viduḥ |
caṃdanāgurūhrīverakuṣṭakuṃkumasevyakāḥ ||

jaṭāmāṃsī suramiti viṣṇorgaṃdhāṣṭakaṃ smṛtaṃ |
caṃdanā gurukarpūratamālajanakuṃkumaṃ ||

kuśītakuṣṭa saṃyuktaṃ śaivagaṃdhāṣṭakaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

atha puṣpavidhiḥ ||

atha puṣpasya māhātmyaṃ leśamātraṃ dadāmyahaṃ |
yaṃ jñātvā sādhakaḥ siddhiṃ labhennūnaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

puṇyasaṃvarddhanācāpi pāpaugha parihārakaḥ |
puṣpa ātmapradānācca puṣpamityabhidhīyate ||

puṣpairdevāḥ prasīdaṃti puṣpe devāśca saṃsthitāḥ |
kiṃ cāti vahunoktena puṣpasyāti mṛtallikā ||

<p. 94b>

paraṃ jyotiḥ puṣpayutaṃ puṣpeṇaiva prasīdati |
trivargasādhanaṃ puṣpaṃ puṣṭi śrīsvargamokṣakaṃ ||

puṣpamūle vasedbrahmā puṣpamadhye tu keśavaḥ |
puṣpāgre ca mahādevaḥ sarvedevāsthitādale ||

tasmāt puṣpairyajeddevaṃ nityaṃ bhaktiyuto naraḥ |
puṣpaṃ paṃcavidhaṃ proktaṃ paraṃ cā parameva ca ||

uttamaṃ madhyamaṃ hīnaṃ teṣāṃ vakṣyāmi lakṣaṇaṃ |
paraṃ suvarṇa puṣpaṃ syāt tatsadāyogyameva hi ||

abhyāgata pūrvakaṃ deyamarcanāhraṃ punarbhavet |
aparaṃ rājataṃ puṣpe tāmraṃ ca parikīrtitaṃ ||

sadāyogyaṃ cedamapi trivarṣaṃ caikavarṣakaṃ |
tulasī ketakī padmaṃ karavījaṃ ca mālatī ||

paṃcaitānnuttamānyāhurmadhyamāni tathā daśa |
mallikā kuṃdamaṃdāratagarārjuna kiṃ śukāḥ ||

pārijātamaśokaṃ ca vilvaṃ ca paṃkameva ca |
etadbhinnaṃ suvarṇaṃ ca sugaṃdhaṃ hīnamucyate ||

tattanmaṃtravidhāneṣu vihitāni samarpayet |
nānopahāravalibhirnnānāpuṣpairmanoramaiḥ ||

apāmārgadalairbhṛṃgaistulasī varjitaḥ śubhaiḥ |
pūjanīyā sadābhaktyā nṛṇāṃ śīghraphalāptaye ||

sugaṃdhaiḥ śvetalohityaiḥ kusumairarcayet skalaiḥ |
vilvairmaruvakādyaiśca tulasīvarjitaiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

droṇapuṣpairviśeṣeṇa vajrapuṣpeṇa miśritaiḥ |
puṣpāṇyapi tathā dadyādraktakṛṣṇāsitāni ca ||

śvetapuṣpaṃ javāpuṣpaṃ karavīraṃ tathāpriye |
tagaraṃ mālatī jātī sevaṃtī yūthikā tathā ||

dhustūrāśokavakula śvetākṛṣṇāparājitā |
vakapuṣpaṃ vilvapatraiścaṃpakaṃ nāgakeśaraṃ ||

mallikādgiṇṭhikā kāṃcīraktaṃ yatparikīrtitaṃ |
arkapuṣpaṃ kokanadaṃ varvaraṃ ca priyāṃvadā ||

āmrajīvūkadaṃvāni kumudāmrātakāni ca |
sarvadhānyodbhavaṃ puṣpaṃ raṃbhāniṃ ca samudbhavaṃ ||

aṣṭamyāṃ ca viśeṣeṇa tuṣṭā bhavati kālikā |
padmapuṣpeṇa raktena saṃtuṣṭā sarvadevatā ||

kṛṣṇā vā yadi vā śuklākālikā varadā bhavet |
śmaśānadhustūreṇaiva tuṣṭā dhūmāvatīya sa ||

vanyaiḥ puṣpaiśca vividhaistuṣṭā bhavati sarvadā |
āmalakyāstu patreṇa tuṣṭā bhavati pārvatī ||

aparājitā phalaṃ vaktuṃ mayādevi na śakyate |
aparājitā priyataraṃ priyaṃ devyā na vidyate ||

aparājitāyāṃ sāparṇāsthitā pūrveśaṃtaṃ samā |
yonirūpeṇa tatrāsau sthitvā nirgacchatāṃ śivā ||

<p. 95a>

karavīre liṃgarūpe śivovasati vai sadā |
śivaśaktyāśca saṃyogāt karavīrā parājitā ||

raktacaṃdana miśreṇa tayoryogena pūjayet |
tuṣyate parameśāni sā pūjā sa phalā smṛtāḥ ||

puṣpairaraṇya saṃbhūtaiḥ patrairvāgiri saṃbhavaiḥ |
svārāmodbhavapuṣpairvātrisaṃdhyā śvetalohitaiḥ ||

karavīraḥ paṃcavarṇaḥ kālītārā pragocaraḥ |
cūḍāmaṇiṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvapuṣpottamottamaṃ ||

cūḍāmaṇirdaśavidho navaratna prabhedataḥ |
daśamaṃ sarvavarṇādyaṃ puṣpeṃdraḥ saṃjñako bhavet ||

ketakī dvividhā proktā puṃstrī bhedakrameṇa ca |
puṃbhede vidvidhā proktā pītaśveta prabhedataḥ ||

strībhedepi dvidhā proktā pītaśveta prabhedataḥ |
puṃbhede kaṭhinaḥ proktaḥ strībhede komalāmatāḥ ||

mallikā vedadhā proktā tat kramaṃ śṛṇu pārvatī |
śvetādvipuṣpāṣaṭpuṣpāpuṣpagucchā tathā parā ||

navapuṣpo parāproktā raktapuṣpā parā bhavet |
pītapuṣpānyecakā ca dhūsarā paṃcavarṇajā ||

mālatī paṃcadhā proktā tadbhedān saṃśṛṇu priye |
gaṃdharājā sarvagaṃdhā tathā śrīkhaṇḍagaṃdhikā ||

kastūrī gaṃdhasaṃyuktā caturthā ketakī matā |
mālatī svarṇabhājāti śvetāraktaśilāparā ||

raktavarṇā parā jñeyā paṃcavarṇā tathā parā |
ete bhedā mayā proktā gopitā yāmalādike ||

ḍāmare gopitā devi tava snehādihoditā |
gopanīyā maheśāni saṃkṣepāde tadeva tu ||

yūthikā mālatī jātī mallikā navamallikā |
kastūrī gaṃdhikā devi tathaiva vā guru gaṃdhijā ||

nakhagaṃdhāśalākādyā mālatī vedagaṃdhikā |
svarge tu mālatī proktā raktā pātālagocarā ||

jātīyūthī tathā mallī mṛtyuloke prakīrtitā |
raktamallīpītamallī varṇapaṃcakarūpiṇī ||

triśaktiloke deveśi sarvadeva prapūjane |
etadrūpaṃ viciṃtyaivaṃ pūjayeccīnasuṃdarīṃ ||

etadrahasyaṃ saṃproktaṃ puṇyānāṃ nirṇayāmṛtaṃ |
jātā na tṛpti deveśa viśeṣavada satvaraṃ ||

sālatī rājamallī ca jātī yūthījayaṃtikā |
mālatī laghuyūthī ca mallīcetikramaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

śvetāśrīmālīgaditā jātī raktatalāmatā |
mālatī dalapatrā ca raktaśvetābhṛśārasā ||

rājamallī maheśāni vahunetrāṇi gaṃdhinī |
śatapatrā rājamallī kalāpatrā tu mallikā ||

<p. 95b>

paṃcapatrā bhavejjātī saptapatrā tu mālatī |
yūthī sūkṣmā tadvividhā rasagaṃdhāmanoharā ||

mālatī svarṇabhājātī śvetā raktaśilāmatā |
raktavarṇā paṃcavarṇā pītakṛṣṇā parā smṛtāḥ ||

kastūrī gaṃdhikā devi tathaivā gurugaṃdhikā |
aśvagaṃdhāmalākākhyā vedayuktā tu mālatī ||

sarvadevavidhau śastā pūjāsāṃgārtha hetave |
caṃpakaḥ puṣpadānena svarṇaṃ vahuvidhaṃ labhet ||

nāgakeśaradānena rūpavān śubhago bhavet |
punnāgasya ca puṣpeṇa jvaraśāṃtirbhavet sadā ||

keśarasya pradānena śatruṃ nāśayate dhruvaṃ |
pārijātaḥ pāribhadradānādāyuḥ pravarddhate ||

kuṃdapuṣpa pradānena kāmānāpnoti vai dhruvaṃ |
jātī mālati kubjena śīghraṃ tu puṣpaṃti mānataḥ ||

kokilākhya pradānena akālamaraṇaṃ haret |
odrapuṣpapradānena tuṣyate parameśvarī ||

yathā chāgāni valinā tathā tuṣyati niścitaṃ |
datte caiva javā puṣpe paṭṭavastra phalaṃ labhet ||

brahmāhatyādikaṃ pāpaṃ kṣaṇānnaśyati niścitaṃ |
karavīreṇa puṣpeṇa pūjayejjagadīśvarīṃ ||

pratipuṣpeṣu maṃtreṇa yojayitvā niśāsu vai |
labhate vāṃchitān kāmān ājñā siddhiśca labhyate ||

lohitaṃ vātha raktaṃ vā karavīrastu siddhidaṃ |
vaṃdhūkasya pradānena paṭṭavastraṃ ca labhyate ||

puṣpamālāṃ cāha ||

ekajātīyakaiḥ puṣpairbhinnajātīyakairapi |
mālā tathaika varṇaḥ syādbhinnavarṇāpi vā priye ||

sāpurastrividhā jñeyā pariṇāhavaśena tu |
pateddhṛdaya varjaṃtaṃ yāmalā nityamālinī ||

raikikā sā parijñeyā sarvāvaratayāsthitā |
adhovastaṃ vilīnābheḥ kausumīyāsragucyate ||

sādhāraṇī parijñeyā madhyamā pūrvatodhikā |
āgulphasragvinīyā tu pādapadmoparisthitā ||

vanamālati vikhyātā sarvābhyaḥ sragbhyaḥ uttamā |
kiṃcidviśeṣamatrāpitamapivyāharāmite ||

karavīrairjavāpuṣpairvakairdamanakairapi |
nīlotpalaiḥ sarasijairllavaṃgairnāgakeśaraiḥ ||

<p. 96a>

jātībhirmālatībhiśca mallikācampakādibhiḥ |
racitāyā bhaveyurhisrajaḥ paramaśobhanā ||

mālābhyo'nyāmya etāṃstu devyāḥ prīti pradāyakaḥ |
atonyeṣu prasūneṣuttiṣṭhaḥ su varavarṇinī ||

amībhiḥ kusumaistāsāṃgrathane yatnamācaret |
svadravyaiḥ pūjayed vidyāṃ javāyāvaka siṃdūraiḥ ||

caṃdanaṃ raktasaṃjñaṃ tu śāṇitaṃ samudāhṛtaṃ ||

atha rahasya puṣpaṃ ||

yonipuṣpaṃ maheśāni varjapuṣpaṃ nigadyate |
āṣoḍaśādanūḍhayā uttamaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ ||

valātkareṇa ūḍhāyāmadhyamaṃ bhogavarddhanaṃ |
rajoyogavaśādanyedadhamaṃ sukhadāyakaṃ ||

svayaṃbhūkusumaṃ devi trividhaṃ tu vijāyate |
savaiḥ puṣpaiḥ sadā pūjyā vihitā vihitairapi ||

kartavyā sarvadevānāṃ bhaktiyogotra kāraṇaṃ |
na svarṇairnavaratnaiśca na sparśamaṇibhiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

na hi tṛpyati deveśi kālikā bhaktavatsalā |
tasmādyonibhavaṃ puṣpaṃ pūjārthaṃ saṃgrahecchive ||

rahasyāti rahasyaṃ ca kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ |
avīrā paṃcadhā proktā śvetapītāruṇa kramāt ||

śvetapītā pītaraktā raktāśvetā parāmatā |
evaṃ bhedāṃtare saiva navadhā parikīrtitā ||

avīrā kusume naiva pūjayet sarvadevatā |
ratipuṣpaṃ kāmapuṣpaṃ devapuṣpakrameṇa ca ||

sevaṃtī vahudhākhyātā tadbhedān śṛṇu pārvatī |
śvetapītā tathā raktā tritayaṃ tritayaṃ triṣu ||

siṃdūrā divyavarṇā ca hāridrā ca parā bhavet |
ratipuṣpamidaṃ proktaṃ kāmapuṣpaṃ śṛṇu priye ||

pītaṃ gucchaḥ svarūpaṃ ca raktagucchaḥ svarūpakaṃ |
pītaṃraktaṃ raktapītaṃ sūkṣmamanyanmaheśvarī ||

ṣaṭbhedāḥ sūkṣmabhede tu atisūkṣmepi ṣaṭbhavet |
evamaṣṭādaśavidhaṃ kāmapuṣpaṃ maheśvarī ||

devapuṣpaṃ pravakṣyāmi yena devīmayorccanāt |
śvetaraktaṃ divyarūpaṃ siṃdūrasannibhaṃ tathā ||

aparaṃ śvetapītaṃ ca paṃcavarṇa mathāparaṃ |
ratipuṣpaṃ paṃcavarṇaṃ suṃdarīlokagocaraṃ ||

kāmapuṣpaṃ paṃcavarṇaṃ kālikānāmagocaraṃ |
devapuṣpaṃ naṃdavarṇaṃ tāriṇī lokagocaraṃ ||

<p. 96b>

anayoḥ graṇoyācāyamāha ||

sūtreṇa paṭṭavastreṇa vīravastreṇa pārvatī |
kāśmīravastre sūtreṇa paṭṭasūtreṇa pārvatī ||

kastūrī kuṃkumaṃ tatra caṃdanā gurukādikaṃ |
nānā sugaṃdhikaṃ datvā ekīkṛtvā tu sādhakaḥ ||

aṣṭagaṃdhena vā puṣpaiḥ saṃyuktaṃ puṣpamāharet |
etenākṣatayogena pūjayet parameśvarīṃ ||

āsanārthe ca pūjārthe homārthe ca kramādviduḥ |
svayaṃbhu saṃyutaṃ puṣpaṃ siddhapuṣpaṃ vidurvudhāḥ ||

ratimālyāni deveśī na ca paryuṣitāni ca |
siddhapuṣpāṇi khyātāni gaṃdharva prītidāyi ca ||

suddhāśuddhāni puṣpāṇi navīnāni dinedine |
etatsarvaṃ samādāya tārāṃ kālīṃ ca pūjayet ||

puṣpadāna phalāt koṭi guṇitaṃ phalamāpnuyāt ||

athāvihitaṃ ||

mārpayedbhūmi patitaṃkārakaṃ kṛmi bhakṣitaṃ |
aṃgalagnaṃ samāprātaṃ mlānaṃ paryuṣitaṃ tathā ||

ugragaṃdhamagaṃdhaṃ ca kṛmikeśādi dūṣitaṃ |
aśuddhapātraprāṇyaṃga vā somiḥ kutsitātmabhiḥ ||

ānītaṃ tanniṣiddhaṃ syānmadhyāhnasnānatastathā |
svayaṃvikāśitaiḥ puṣpaiḥ svayaṃ ca patitaṃ bhuvi ||

bhūgataṃ varjayet puṣpaṃ sephālivakulaṃvinā |
kalikābhistathātyājyāvināvaṃ pakapadmakaiḥ ||

vilvasya khadirasyaiva tathā dhātrī dalasya ca |
tamālasya ca patrasya chinnabhinnaṃ na duṣpati ||

viṣṇukrāṃti javā nāgakeśara pallavaṃ |
vaṃdhūka caiva maṃdārasavṛṃtena samarcayet ||

devīpūjā sadā kāryā jalajaisthalajairapi |
vihitā vihitairvāpi bhaktiyuktena cetasā ||

patraṃ vā yadi vā puṣpaṃ phalaṃ neṣṭamadhomukhaṃ |
duḥkhadaṃ tat samākhyātaṃ yathotpannaṃ tathārpaṇaṃ ||

citrapūjāsu sarvāsu na viruddhasya ca dūṣaṇaṃ |
adhomukhārpaṇaṃ neṣṭaṃ puṣpāṃjalividhau na tat ||

na paryuṣitadoṣosti tulasī vilvacaṃpake |
jalaje vakulāgastya mālākāra gṛheṣu ca ||

puṣpaiḥ paryuṣitairnnaṣṭaiḥ kṛmikīṭavidāritaiḥ |
na pūjayeddhomayecca devatāśāpamāpnuyāt ||

<p. 97a>

vilvapatraṃ ca tulasī svayaṃ bhūsvarṇapuṣpakaiḥ |
na paryuṣita rūpatvaṃ nirmālyatvaṃ maheśvarī ||

caturṇāṃ devadeveśi namayākīrtitaṃ bhuvi |
nṛsiṃhaṃ ca śivaṃ caiva na ketakyā samarcayet ||

śvetakṛṣṇa tulasyā ca kālikāṃ na spṛśet kvacit |
kamalaṃ daśarātraṃ ca jātī dinatrayaṃ tathā ||

caṃpakaḥ paṃcarātraṃ ca kiṃśuko dina saptakaṃ |
karavīroṣṭa divasaṃ ketakī daśapaṃca ca ||

kudo netradinaṃ devi munipuṣpaṃ ca dāḍimī |
japāpuṣpaṃ tato drākhyāṃ  divasa dvayagocarāṃ ||

śatapuṣpaṃ puṣparājo gaṃdharājastathaiva ca |
bhagapuṣpaṃ maheśāni vedarātraṃ na dūṣyati ||

nāradamate naiva kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ |
vilvāyāmārgadhātrī ca tulasī triṃśadāditaḥ ||

vaṣaṭ triṃśa maheśāni na ca paryuṣitāni ca |
ekena karavīreṇa sahasreṇa śatena ca ||

māṃ ca saṃpūjye deveśi mamarūpo naro bhavet |
ekena karavīreṇa māṃ ca saṃpūjayet priye ||

tena saṃpūjayeddevi jagatsthāvara jaṃgamaṃ |
karavīre śaktiviṃdau tatrahaṃ nivasāmyahaṃ ||

ketakī kuṭajeneśaṃ navarvaryākṣatairhariṃ |
na dūrvāyā yajeddurgāṃ vilvapatrairddivākaraṃ ||

laṃvodaraṃ tulasyā ca vṛṃta hīnaiḥ samarpayet |
pītākṛṣṇākarautyājyāḥ sūryaśaṃbhau viśeṣataḥ ||

vilvairmaruvakādyaiśca tulasī varjitaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
tulasīṃ mālatīṃ caiva kālītārā vidhau tyajet ||

vilvaṃ maruvakaṃ caiva vīrakarmaṇi varjite |
devīnāmarkamaṃdārāvāditye tagaraṃ tathā ||

gaṇeśāya ca sūryāya yastu pūjamati priyaṃ |
puṣpābhāve pravālairvā tadabhāve ca korakaiḥ ||

tadabhāve ca phalaiḥ patrai tadabhāve ca tṛṇāṃkuraiḥ |
kadalaṃ dāḍimaṃ kolaṃ jaṃvū ciṃcāmalāmrakaṃ ||

mātuluṃgaṃ ca jaṃvīraṃ paramaṃ śreṣṭhamucyate |
pūjayet parameśāni puṣpābhāve tu patrakaiḥ ||

patrāṇāmapyalābhe tu drumagulmodbhavādibhiḥ |
tadbhāvānāma lābhe tu tatphalena prapūjayet ||

<p. 97b>

akṣatairvājalairvāpi tadabhāve tu saśarṣapaiḥ |
sitaisteṣāmalābhe tu mānasaṃ pūjanaṃ caret ||

ataḥ paraṃ puṣpadāna mākarṇaya śucismite |
yat tatpuṣpasyanāmāpi nama ityakṣaradvayaṃ ||

uccārya dadyāt taddevyaiḥ sarvakāmārtha siddhaye |
aṃguṣṭha tarjanībhyāṃ ca cakre puṣpaṃ nivedayet ||

puṣpaṃ suśobhanaṃ devi saurabhyena samanvitaṃ |
mayā niveditaṃ bhaktyā supuṣpaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||

atha puṣpopacārāṃte kuryādāvaraṇārcanaṃ |
maṃtra saṃpuṭitairvarṇairmātṛkāyāḥ sa viṃdukaiḥ ||

krameṇa gaṃdhapuṣpādyairdevasyāṃge samarcayet |
layogatvena mātṛṇāṃ sthānāṃgeṣu tataḥ paraṃ ||

prathamāvaraṇyaṃ pūjyaṃ tadaṃte devatāṃ yajet |
punarāvaraṇaṃ ceṣṭvā devatāmarcayet tathā ||

evaṃ samarcya sarvāstā yathoktā vṛttidevatāḥ |
atha sarvajñatā tṛptiranya divodhasaṃjñīkā ||

svataṃtrātānyā nityāsyādaluptaḥ śaktireva ca |
ṣaḍaṃga devatāhyetā nāmataḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||

keśareṣvagni koṇādau hṛdayādīni pūjayet |
netramagre diśāsvastraṃ dhyātavyāścāṃgadevatāḥ ||

tuṣārasphaṭikaḥ śyāmanīlakṛṣṇāruṇārciṣaḥ |
varadābhayadhāriṇyaḥ pradhānatanavaḥ striyaḥ ||

agnīśāsuravāyavya madhyadikṣu kramāt sthitāḥ |
vāyavyādiśaṃparyaṃtaṃ gurupaṃktiṃ samarcayet ||

tasmāt sarvatra deveśa saṃkṣepān śṛṇutān gurūn |
ādau sarvatra deveśa maṃtradaḥ prathamoguruḥ ||

parāpara gurustvaṃ hi parameṣṭītvahaṃ tataḥ |
sarvamaṃtreṣu vidyā su svayaṃ prakṛtirūpiṇī ||

tataḥ puruṣarūpaṃ ca kathitā guru saṃtatiḥ |
yeṣu yeṣu ca maṃtreṣu ye ye gurugaṇāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

te te pūjyāḥ saparyādau saṃkṣepādgaditaṃ mayā |
devasya purataḥ prācī jñeyā varaṇapūjane ||

tadādi parivārāṇāṃ prādakṣiṇyena pūjanaṃ |
aṃgamaṃtrāstu pūjāyāmo namoṃtā hutau tathā ||

svāhāṃtā atha devasyābhi mukhaṃtāḥ samāsthitāḥ |
tato yajellokapālān svasvadikṣu vyavasthitān ||

āyudhāni tadagre ca teṣāṃ dhyānamathocyate |
indraḥ surādhipaḥ prītamairāvatagataṃ vibhuṃ ||

<p. 98a>

sahasranetraṃ dvibhujaṃ pītavajradharaṃ bhaje |
agni tejodhipaṃ raktaṃ śvetaśaktikaraṃ prabhuṃ ||

subhūṣaṇaṃ meṣavāhaṃ vaṃde raktāṃtalocanaṃ |
yamaṃ pretādhipaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ mahiṣo parisaṃsthitaṃ ||

kāladaṃḍadharaṃ krūraṃ vṛttaṃ dūtairbhayānakaiḥ |
rakṣodhi paṃcanair(-)ṛtyaṃ śavāsana samāsthitaṃ ||

dhūmābhaṃ khaḍgahastaṃ ca piṃgalaśmaśrukūrcakaṃ |
makare saṃsthitaṃ vidyunnibhapāśakarāṃvujaṃ ||

śubhrāṃgaṃtaṃḍilaṃ vaṃde varuṇaṃ yādasāṃpatiṃ |
vāyuṃ prāṇādhipaṃ dhūmraṃ raktāṃkuśakaraṃ paraṃ ||

vātapramīsamārūḍhaṃ dhāvaṃtaṃ vegato bhaje |
yakṣapatiṃ kuveraṃ ca śuklaṃ śūlagadādharaṃ ||

narasiṃhāsanārūḍhaṃ medalaṃviḥ triṇīyutaṃ |
vidyādhipaṃ nīlaśūladharaṃ vṛṣabhavāhanaṃ ||

trinetraṃ bhālacaṃdraṃ ca jaṭājūṭadharaṃ mitaṃ |
gauraṃ nāgādhipaṃ mūrddhniphalāmaṃḍalabhūṣitaṃ ||

pīnottuṃgaṃ cakradharamanaṃtaṃ viśvagaṃ bhaje |
lokādhipaṃ vidhātāraṃ raktaṃ padmakaraṃ śubhaṃ ||

haṃsārūḍhaṃ vedapāṭhakūrvaṃtaṃ tamahaṃ bhaje |
punarmūlaṃ samuccāryā sāṃgādyaiḥ sa pareti ca ||

vārāyaināmadevyāśca caturthyaṃta mudīrayet |
nama ityarcayedgaṃdha puṣpādyaiḥ sādhakastriyaḥ ||

atha dhūpadānaṃ ||

dhṛtāśeṣa mahādoṣa pūtigaṃdhaprabhāvataḥ |
paramānaṃda jananādhūpa ityabhidhīyate ||

dhūpapātraṃ tatostreṇa kṣālayet pūjayet tataḥ |
hṛdāṇunātha cāstreṇa ghaṇṭhāṃ saṃpūjya vādayet ||

itthaṃ dhūpaṃ prakurvīta tāmrakāsyādinirmite |
bhājane dvipade bhugnanāle padmākṛtau śubhe ||

sārāṅgāra viniḥkṣiptairgugulvaguruvṛkṣajaiḥ |
niryāsādyusthitairdhūpaiḥ kuṃdhudravyairathoditaiḥ ||

dhūpaṃ dadedgaṇeśasya priyaḥ proktastu guggulaḥ |
sarjaṃ devyā maheśasya niryāso devadārujaḥ ||

viṣṇoḥ kṛṣṇāguruḥ śītaṃ bhāskarasya priyaṃ mataṃ |
jaṭāmāṃsī gugguluṃ ca caṃdanā gurukaistathā ||

caṃdrairajani saṃyuktairmākṣikaissahakuṃkumaiḥ |
sarpiḥ saṃmiśritairdadyāddevyairdhūpaṃ maheśvari ||

sa guggulva gurūśīraṃsitājya madhucaṃdanaiḥ |
sārāṅgāra viniḥkṣiptairddhūpaṃ nīcaiḥ pradhūpayet ||

<p. 98b>

śakterdaśāṃgaṃ vakṣyāmi śaileyaṃ malayodbhavaim |
nakhaṃ kuṣṭaṃ sarjarasaṃ mekaikāṃśaṃ prakalpayet ||

śilārasā gurujaṭāmāṃsī bhāgadvayaṃmataṃ |
ṣaṭmākṣikaṃ sitā cāṣṭau dhūpoyaṃ śaktitohamaḥ ||

harītakīsarjarasamuramāṃsyaḥ kumbhāgikāḥ |
lākṣātribhā catvāro bhāgāḥ śailajamustayoḥ ||

paṃcabhāgaṃ nakhaṃ proktaṃ ṣaḍbhāgaṃ kuṣṭamucyate |
dvādaśāṃśo guḍokeśa vighna viṣṇuṃ daśāṃgakaḥ ||

madhumustāghṛtaṃgaṃdho guggulva guruśailajaṃ |
saralaṃ sihlasiddhārthau śeṣadeva daśāṃgakaḥ ||

gugguluṃ saralaṃ dāruḥputraṃ mayalasaṃbhavaṃ |
hīveramaguruṃ kuṣṭhaṃ guḍaṃ sarjarasaṃśanaṃ ||

harītakī nakhī lākṣā jaṭāmāṃsī ca śailajaṃ |
soḍaśāṃgaṃ vidrudhūpaṃ daivapaitre ca karmaṇi ||

athavā'gurukarpūraṃ caṃdanā sahaguggulaṃ |
madhusarpirjaṭāmāṃsī śailajaṃ kuṃkumaṃ tathā ||

ebhirvimiśritaḥ kāryo dhūpoyaṃ pārvatī priyaḥ |
lohavāṇau ṣoḍaśāṃgaḥ trividyāyāṃ prakīrtitau ||

kālīvidyāvidhau devi aguruśca daśāṃgakaḥ |
aṣṭāṃdaśāṃga śrīkhaṃḍaṃ tārāvidyā vidhau smṛtaṃ ||

chinnā vidyā vidhau devi paṃcāṃgaṃ guggulustathā |
kṛṣṇā guruṃ pītasāro brahmāstu manugocaraṃ ||

rālodya gurucaṃdanaṃ mātaṃgyāṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
kastūrī caiva karpūramaṣṭagaṃdhaṃ tathaiva ca ||

bhairavyāṃ kīrtitaṃ devī namricaiva śilārasaḥ |
bhuvaneśyā mayā proktāṃ śrīkhaṃḍaṃ kamalāmatau ||

lākṣāguḍohni dhūmrāyā siddhavidyā vidhau śive |
madhumustaṃ ghṛtaṃ gaṃdhaṃ gugguluṃ guḍaśailajaṃ ||

caṃdanaṃ sihnasiddhārtha daśāṃgā dhūpa iṣyate |
sitājya madhusaṃmiśraṃ guggulva gurucaṃdanaṃ ||

ṣaḍaṃgaṃ dhūpametattu sarvadeva priyaṃ sadā |
astreṇa dhūpadīpādīn saṃpūjya dāpayettataḥ ||

yathāgaṃdhastathā devi dhūpaṃ dadyādvicakṣaṇaḥ |
vanaspati rasotpannāgaṃdhādyo dhūpanuttamaḥ ||

āghreyaḥ sarvadevānāṃ dhūpoyaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ |
vāmataṃ tu tathā dhūpamagrecāna tu dakṣiṇe ||

na dhūpaṃ vitaredbhūmau nāsanena ghaṭe tathā |
yathā tathā dhāragataṃ kṛtvātaṃ vinivedayet ||

<p. 99a>

medomajjāyunāneṣṭā viṣṇavedārasaṃbhavaḥ |
tataḥ samarpayeddhūpaṃ ghaṃṭāvādanapūrvakaṃ ||

yasyāḥ śabdena vighnāstu yāti sarvediśodaśaḥ |
vyādhayordurgrahāḥ sarve tathāgrāśca vināyakāḥ ||

duḥsvapnārākṣasā duṣṭāvetālā bhairavāḥ śivā |
ḍākinyo bhūtasaṃghāśca sarpakarkoṭakādayaḥ ||

valikāmāṃ tu kāmāyā ratikāmān yathā pare |
ghaṇṭāni nādaśravaṇāddhatavīryabhavaṃti ca ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena pūjākāle sadāhanet ||

ghaṇṭāpūjanamaṃtro yathā ||

tāro jayadhvani padaṃ maṃtramātogni gehinī |
ekādaśākṣaromaṃtro ghaṃṭāyāḥ sarvasiddhidaḥ ||

pūjayitvā svamaṃtreṇa ghaṇṭāṃ tannāda pūrvakaṃ |
dīpaṃ dadyāttu vibhave nānāvādyapuraḥsaraṃ ||

āvāhanorgha dhūpe ca puṣpanaivedyadīpayoḥ |
ghaṇṭāṃnādaṃ prakurvīta viśeṣāddhūpadīpayoḥ ||

pūjākālaṃ vinānyatra kuryādasyāḥ pravādanaṃ |
nonayā ca vinā pūjāṃ kārayet siddhilālasāḥ ||

atha dīpavidhiḥ ||

dīrghājñāna mahādhvāṃtāhaṃkāra parivarjanāt |
paratatva prakāśācca dīpa ityabhidhīyate ||

ghṛtadīpaḥ prathamatastilataila samudbhavaḥ |
sārṣapaḥ phalaniryāsa jāto vā vārijodbhavaḥ ||

dadhijaścānnajaścaiva dīvāssapta prakīrtitāḥ |
padmasūtra bhavāvartirdarbhasūtrabhavāthavā ||

jālājāvādarī vāpi tūlakoṣodbhavāthavā |
vartikādīpa kṛtyeṣu sadāpaṃcavidhāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

vartiḥśvetā'thavāraktānapītānāsitāpi ca |
nirvījaṃ vātha kāryā saṃtajjātāstaṃtavotha vā ||

praśastā dīpavartiḥ syāt kadācinnūtanāṃvaraṃ |
śānaṃvādarajaṃ vāstraṃ jīrṇaṃ malinameva ca ||

upabhuktaṃ tu nādadyādvartikārthaṃ kadācana |
daśāṃ vivarjayet prājño yadyadvāhatavastrajāṃ ||

taijasaṃ rājasaṃ lauhamārtikyaṃ nārikerajaṃ |
tṛṇarājodbhavaṃ vāpi dīpapātraṃ praśasyate ||

evaṃ dīpaṃ prakurvīta netraraṃjanakāraṇaṃ |
dīpaṃ tu yāgaparyaṃta madhomukha prakalpayet ||

labhyate yasya tāyastu dīpasya caturaṃgulāt |
na sa dīpa ihākhyāta adyavṛdddhistu saṃmṛtaḥ ||

<p. 99b>

gosarpiṣā vā tailena vartyā caladyugarbhayā |
uccaiḥ pradarśayeddīpaṃ navamedādinā kvacit ||

na miśrīkṛtya dadyāttu dipasnehān ghṛtādikān |
kṛtvā miśrīkṛtaṃ snehaṃtā miśraṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

dīpasya dhūpavatpātraṃ padmākāra vinirmite |
pratipatre pradīpaṃ ca tyāgavya ghṛtāktayā ||

atha dhūpadīpapātrayorgrahaṇamāha ||

madhyamānāmikāmadhye aṃguṣṭhāgreṇa dāpayet |
uttoraṇaṃ tridhākāryaṃ dīpaṃ netrāṃtikaṃ priye ||

dhūmaṃ nāsāgraparyaṃtaṃ darśayet priyavādini |
pārāvata bhramākāraṃ dīpaṃ netrādi darśayet ||

dakṣiṇe sarpiṣā dīpaṃ tilatailena vāmataḥ |
sitāvartirdakṣiṇatoraktāvartistu vā mataḥ ||

vṛkṣeṣu dīpo dātavyo na tu bhūmau kadācana |
sarvaṃ sahāvasumatī sahatena tvidaṃ dvayaṃ ||

akārya pādatvānaṃ ca dīpatāpaṃ tathaiva ca |
kurvaṃtu pṛthivītāpaṃ yo dīpamutsṛjennaraḥ ||

sa tāpa pāpanarakaṃ prāpnotyevana na saṃśayaḥ |
naiva nirvāpayeddīpān lakṣmīnāśakarotyataḥ ||

naiva nirvāpayeddīpaṃ devārthamupakalpitaṃ |
dīpahartābhavedaṃdhakāṇo nirvāpako bhavet ||

aṃguṣṭhāgreṇa deveśi dhṛtvā dīpannivedayet |
uttoraṇaṃ tathā kuryādgātra tryāmūlayogataḥ ||

pārāvata bhramākāraṃ bhrāmayecca pradarśayet |
devasya sarvāvayavān ślokamekaṃ tataḥ paṭhet ||

sa prakāśo mahādipa sarvatra timirāpahaṃ |
sa vāhvābhyaṃtaraṃ jyotirdīpoyaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||

adha naivedyaṃ ||

dakṣiṇe vā purobhāge vāme vā maṇḍalaṃ likhet |
trikoṇaṃ vṛttabhūvimvamādhāraḥ śaktimarcitaṃ ||

nivedayet purobhāge gaṃdhaṃ puṣpaṃ ca bhūṣaṇaṃ |
dīpān dakṣiṇato dadyāt purato vāma vāmataḥ ||

vāmatastu tathā dhūpamagrato dānadakṣiṇaḥ |
naivedyaṃ dakṣiṇe vāme purato na tu pṛṣṭataḥ ||

madirāṃ pṛṣṭhato dadyāccāgrato na kadācana |
gaṃdhapuṣpaṃ tathā dhūpodīpo naivedyameva ca ||

yasyai yaddīyate vastramalaṃkārādikāṃcanaṃ |
teṣāṃ daivatamuccārya kṛtvā prokṣaṇapūjane ||

utsṛjya mūlamaṃtreṇa pratimāmnā nivedayet |
viśeṣārghyodakenaiva copacārān samutsṛjet ||

<p. 100a>

anyatoyairyadutsṛjyamarghapātrasthitetaraiḥ |
na gṛhnāti mahādevī dattaṃ vidhi śatairapi ||

pādyamācamanīyaṃ ca datvā naivedya samarpayet |
nidhāya svarṇaje pātre sādhāre tacca maṇḍale ||

saṃsthāpya caturasre ca saṃskuryācchāstramārgataḥ |
astramaṃtreṇa saṃprokṣyaṃ cakra mudrābhirakṣitaṃ ||

hastau tu saṃmukhau kṛtvā saṃlagnau saṃprasāritau |
kaniṣṭāṃguṣṭha saṃlagnau mudraiṣā cakrasaṃjñikā ||

sparśa dṛṣṭvādi doṣāṃśca vāyuvījena śoṣayet |
spṛśandakṣa karāgreṇa vahnivījena nirdahet ||

vaṃ vījenāmṛtī kṛtya mūlamaṃtreṇa tatpuraḥ |
spṛśet karābhyāṃ vidhivada sṛṣṭā cābhi maṃtrayet ||

dhenumudrāṃ pradarśyātha gaṃdhapuṣpaiḥ samarcayet |
devamabhyarcya kuryācca puṣpāṃjali mananyadhīḥ ||

hemapātrasthitaṃ divyaṃ paramānnaṃ susaṃskṛtaṃ |
paṃcadhā ṣaḍrasopetaṃ gṛhāṇa mama siddhaye ||

mūlamaṃtraṃ samuccārya svāhāṃtaṃ jalamarpayet |
karābhyāṃ saṃspṛśan pātraṃ naivedyaṃ te namo vadet ||

devasya dakṣiṇe haste jalaṃ datvā paṭhedidaṃ |
amṛtopastaraṇamasi svāheti bhavākṣaraḥ ||

darśayedvāmahastena vikalotpalasannibhāṃ |
darśayitvā grāsamudrāṃ paṃcaprāṇāhutīṃścaret ||

kaniṣṭānāmikāṃguṣṭhaḥ yogaḥ prāṇasya mudrikā |
tayāgrāsaṃ gṛhītvā prāṇāya svāheti saṃvadet ||

tarjanī madhyamāṃguṣṭhayogenāpānakaṃ vadet |
ṅentaṃ svāhāṃtamatha ca vyānāya ca tato vadet ||

svāhātha madhyamā nānāṃguṣṭhayogena nirvapet |
hitvāṃ kaniṣṭāṃ sarvābhirudānāyāgnigehinī ||

sarvābhistu samānāya svāhotkāgrāsanārpayet |
tataḥ svarṇādije pātre suto yaṃ dhenumudrayā ||

amṛtīkṛtya devāya deyaṃ maṃtramimaṃ paṭhan |
namaste devadeveśi sarvatṛptikaraṃ varaṃ ||

anyāṃ niveditaṃ śuddhaṃ prakṛtisthaṃ suśītalaṃ |
paramānaṃda saṃpūrṇaṃ gṛhāṇajalamuttamaṃ ||

uktaivaṃ devatā vāme jalapātraṃ niveśayet |
tribhirvarṇaiḥ pradātavyaṃ devārthaṃ pākabhojanaṃ ||

ghṛtapakvaṃ dugdhasiddhaṃ sādhitaṃ kevalāgniyā |
yuktaṃ vaikṣavayaṃ kena tacchūdrasya praśasyate ||

<p. 100b>

tataḥ puṣpāṃjali dadyādastramaṃtreṇa vaṃdhanaṃ |
diśāṃ kṛtvā javanikāṃ devasya parito nyaset ||

amṛtātmaka naivedyaṃ nama ityuccaret punaḥ |
dhenuṃmudrāṃ pradarśyātha bhujānāṃ devatāṃ smaret ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā mūlamaṃtraṃ dadejjalaṃ |
naivedyāṃte cā camanaṃ datvā homa vidhiṃ caret ||

atha ṣoḍaśopacārāṇāṃ krameṇa mudrāmāha |

āsane madmamudrasyāddhastadvayamadhomukhaṃ |
mudraiṣā kuśalapraśne tadaivorddha mukhaṃ punaḥ ||

mudrāsyāt svāgate cārghyamudrātvaṃjalirūpiṇī |
anāmāṃguṣṭayoryogātsaivāktāpādyamudrikā ||

uttānaṃ dakṣahastaṃ tu kṛtvā nitaraṃmudhīḥ |
kaṇiṣṭha hīnā saṃyuktā catasroṃgulya unnataḥ ||

mudraiṣā camane proktādho mukhī sātvatā mayā |
spṛṣṭāṃguṣṭhā bhavenmudrāṃ madhuparke varānane ||

adhomukhī dakṣahaste kṛtāmuṣṭiḥ kaniṣṭayā |
vimuktā snānamudraiṣāgaditā parameśvarī ||

uttānaṃdakṣiṇaṃhastaṃ kṛtvā tanmadhyamāpunaḥ |
aṃguṣṭhena spṛśe devāmudrā vastrasya kīrtitā ||

eṣaivānāmikā sparśān mudrābhūṣaṇa saṃjñakā |
kaniṣṭhā sparśato hyeṣā upavītasya mudrikā ||

jyeṣṭhāgreṇa kaniṣṭāgraṃ spṛśed gaṃdhasyamudrikā |
adhomukhaṃ karaṃ kṛtvā tarjanyāgreṇa yojayet ||

aṃguṣṭāgreṇa mudreyaṃ puṣpākhyā parameśvarī |
aṃguṣṭhāgreṇa tarjanyā spṛśedagraṃ maheśvarī ||

dhūpamudreyamākhyātā sarvadeva priyaṃkarī |
jyeṣṭhāgreṇa spṛśedagraṃ madhyamāyāsurārcite ||

dīpamudreyamuditā sarvadevāśrayā śubhā |
anāmāgraṃ spṛśeddevi jyeṣṭāgrena tu deśikaḥ ||

naivdeya mudrā kathitā tatvamudreti kīrtitā ||

atha nitya homavidhiḥ ||

nityahomavidhiṃ vakṣye sarvārthaṃ yena viṃdati |
saṃkalpa parameśāni nityahomavidhiṃ caret ||

vidhivad  vahnimāniya kravyādīśaṃ parityajet |
tataśca maṃtramuccārya kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile tathā ||

bhūmau vā saṃstaredvahniṃ vyāhṛti tritayena tu |
āhuti trayamutkṣipya ṣaḍaṃga havanaṃ tataḥ ||

<p. 101a>

tato devīṃ samāvāhya mūlenaiva ṣaḍādgatiṃ |
saṃpūjya mūlamanunā paṃcaviṃśatimāhutiṃ ||

hunedājyena haviṣā tilairvā pāyasaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
taṇḍulaistilasaṃmiśraiḥ kevalairvātha puṣpakaiḥ ||

aṃgāvaraṇa devānāmekaikāmāhutiṃ hunet |
udvāsya devaṃ vahniṃ ca pūjāsthānaṃ vrajet tataḥ ||

upaviśyāsane maṃtrī dadyād bhūtavaliṃ tataḥ |
vāminastūpacārāṃte kuryurmadyena tarpaṇe ||

teṣāmanityo homastu nityaṃ tarpaṇasevanaṃ |
kṭvāstutvā namaskṛtya visṛjerdvidumaṇḍale ||

atha bhūtavalidānaṃ ||

īśāne maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā sādhāraṃ tatra niḥkṣipet |
atra vyaṃjanatoyādyaṃ pātraṃ puṣpādipūritaṃ ||

tatra bhūtāni saṃtyajya tatastebhyo valiṃ haret |
ye raudrāraudra karmāṇo raudrasthāna nivāsinaḥ ||

yoginyopyugrarūpāśca gaṇānāmadhipāścaye |
bhūcarākhecarāścaiva ye tiṣṭhaṃtyaṃtarikṣagāḥ ||

sarvete prītimanaso bhūtā gṛhaṃtvimaṃ valiṃ |
vāmahastena tatpātre jaladhārāṃ samarpayet ||

puṣpāṃjaliṃ samādāya bhūtāni prārthayediti ||

bhūtāni yānīhavasaṃti bhūtale valiṃ gṛhītvā vivivat prayuktaṃ |
saṃtoṣamāsādya vrajaṃ tu sarvekṣamaṃ tu tānyatra namostutebhyaḥ ||

datvā puṣpāṃjaliṃ natvā viharaṃ tu yathā sukhaṃ |
bhūtādīni ca nārā ca mudrayā visṛjettataḥ ||

yathā hastagataṃ cāpaṃ tathā hastaṃ kuru priye |
vāṇamudrayamākhyātāripuvarga nikṛṃtanī ||

devaṃ tṛptimiti dhyātvā naivedyaṃ gata sārakaṃ |
saṃciṃtya rakṣodigbhāge pātraṃ tu sthāpayet tataḥ ||

gomayādbhistadastreṇa naivedya sthānaśodhanaṃ |
devocchiṣṭaṃ gṛhītvā tu nirmālya bhojine namaḥ ||

ityaiśānyāṃ viniḥkṣipyahastaṃ prakṣālayet tataḥ |
punarācamanaṃ dadyāt karodvartanameva ca ||

śuddhamācamanaṃ datvā sugaṃdhairgaṃdhayetkarau ||

atha tāmbūlaṃ ||

tato dadyāccatāṃvūlaṃ viṣṇave dvādaśāṃgakaṃ |
khadirailālavaṃgaiṃducūrṇaparṇatamālakaṃ ||

jātīkośadalatvagbhiḥ kastūrīkeśarairyutaṃ |
pūgīphalamatha proktaṃ daśāṃgaṃ bhāskarasya tu ||

<p. 101b>

mṛganābhita mālābhyāṃ hīnaṃ vighneśvarasya tu |
paṃcāṃgaṃ cūrṇakhadiraḥ parṇapūgī phalendukaṃ ||

śailaṃ devyā jātikośa yutaṃ tacca maheśituḥ |
tataśca mukuṭādīni dadyādbhūṣaṇakāni ca ||

darśayecca tathā darśaṃ kalpayecchatra cāmare |
śirasyāropya devasya dūrvākṣata pavitrakaṃ ||

ārātrikaṃ tataḥ kuryāddharmmakāmārtha siddhaye ||

athārātrikaṃ ||

sauvarṇe rājate kāṃsye lokanetra manohare |
kuṃkumena likhet padmamaṣṭapatraṃ suśobhanaṃ ||

daśadīpairviṃśatibhiḥ paṃcabhirnavabhistu vā |
aṣṭabhistatva saṃkhyābhiḥ kuryādārātrikaṃ vudhaḥ ||

trikoṇaṃ caiva ṣaṭkoṇa madhye viḍunipātayet |
tat tadvidyāmayaiḥ patrairviśeṣārghyamayena vā ||

ādau tu bhairavīyaṃtre cakramudrāṃ pradarśayet |
ārātrikaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ devatā prītihetave ||

maṃtreṇānena deveśi kuryādārātrikaṃ vudhaḥ |
māṣaistilaistaṇḍulairvāgodhūmairyavajairapi ||

odanotthāśarkarotthāhāridrāḥ keśarodbhavā |
aṣṭagaṃdhodbhāvā gauḍādīpā yatnena kārayet ||

dīpānāṃ raktapītānāṃvaśyastaṃbhābhidhaṃ phalaṃ |
mahādīpaṃ karṇikāyāṃ vasupatreṣṭadīpakān ||

yavagodhūmaracitān śarkarādugdha saṃyutān |
valayāṃcita śobhābhiḥ śobhitān ghṛta pūritān ||

abhimaṃtrya tato maṃtrī ratneśvaryā na cārṇataḥ |
śrīṁ hrīṁ glūṁ mlūṁ mayai prāgvannaśca śrīṁ hrīmiti kramāt ||

daleśvaryā samuddiṣṭāstato mūlenatāṃ yajet |
tatastatpātramuddhṛtyamastakāṃtaṃ punaḥ punaḥ ||

navavāraṃ bhrāmayecca cakramudrāṃ pradarśayet |
devaṃ praṇamya ca tataḥ prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ caret ||

mūlamaṃtreṇātha pūrvanyāsān sarvān samācaret |
aṣṭottara sahasraṃ tu tadarddhaṃ triśataṃ tu vā ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi japenmūlamataṃdritaḥ |
samāpte tu japenmālāṃ nidadhyānmastakopari ||

atha nitya japyarthekaramālāmāha ||

atha vāṃguli mālābhirjapaṃ kuryāt taducyate |
dvividhatvaṃ ca pratyekaṃ sṛṣṭi saṃhārabhedataḥ ||

anāmā madhyamārabhya anāmūlaparvaṇi |
triparvaṃ ca kaniṣṭhāyā anāmāgraṃ maheśvarī ||

<p. 102a>

madhyamāgrā ca tarjanyā mūlaparvātimaṃ śive |
śaktimālā tviyaṃ proktā saṃhārādvaiṣṇavī bhavet ||

madhyamā madhyamārabhya tadagrāt parameśvarī |
anāmā madhyakasyātha pradakṣiṇa manuvrajan ||

tarjanyagrāṃtakaṃ devī ca suparvācchivābhidhā |
saṃhāra bhairavīmālā tarjanyagrāṃtakaṃ yadi ||

sauramālā tu saṃproktā saṃhārādgāṇapī bhavet |
anāmāmadhyamārabhya madhyamā madhyataḥ śive ||

agakrameṇa deveśi tarjanyagrāṃtakaṃ śive |
gāyatrīmālikā proktā saṃhārādvadukābhidhā ||

anāmāmadhyamārabhya madhyamāmadhyamāgataḥ |
mūlabhāga krameṇaiva pradakṣiṇa manuṃ vrajet ||

cīnamālā tu saṃproktā saṃhārāt kṣetrapālajā |
madhyamāmadhyamārabhya tarjanīmadhyabhāgataḥ ||

agakrameṇa deveśi tarjanī mūlataḥ śive |
gāṃdharvamālikā proktā saṃhāradvaṭavāsinaḥ ||

tarjanī mūlamārabhya cāgrabhāga krameṇa ca |
pradakṣiṇa krameṇaiva madhyamāmūlaparvaṇi ||

maṃjughoṣe mālikā tu saṃhārāt khecarī vidhau |
kaniṣṭāgraṃ samārabhya mūlāgrāṃtaṃ krameṇa ca ||

tarjanī mūlaparyaṃtaṃ mālā proktā tu sāṃbhavī |
saṃhārādvāruṇī mālā dhanadasya prakīrtitā ||

kaniṣṭhā mūlamārabhya sarpadaṇḍa krameṇa ca |
tarjanyagrāṃtagaṃ devī yakṣiṇī mālikāmatā ||

saṃhārāt kinnarīmālāmahāgānakarī parā |
kaniṣṭhā mūlamārabhya paṃktimārga krameṇa ca ||

kaniṣṭhāyāṃtakaṃ devījainamālā prakīrtitā |
saṃhārājjainamālāsyādanāmā mūlataḥ śṛṇu ||

pradakṣiṇa krameṇaiva tarjanī madhyamāṃkakaṃ |
mālācāṃdrī tu saṃproktā saṃhārādvidhimālikā ||

nityaṃ japaṃkare kuryānna tu kāmyaṃ kadācana |
kāmyamapi kare kuryādyadi mālā na vidyate ||

arghapātrājjalaṃ haste gṛhītvedaṃ paṭhet punaḥ |
guhyātiguhyagoptātvaṃ gṛhāṇā smṛt kṛtaṃ japaṃ ||

siddhirbhavatume devatvatprasādājjagatpate |
devyāḥ vāmakaredeyaṃ sadājapaphalaṃ śive ||

devasya dakṣiṇe haste toyaṃ datvā samarpayet |
japaṃ ca japamālātha sthāpyā rahasiveṣṭhitā ||

tatastu vīrastutibhirghaṃṭhāvādanapurvakaṃ |
brāhmaṇo vedamaṃtrādyaiḥ kṣatriyaḥ sahitādibhiḥ ||

<p. 102b>

paurāṇikādyairvaiśyastu śūdrastu prākṛtādibhiḥ |
kaulikaiḥ śaktisahitaistaducchiṣṭaṃ ca sevayet ||

mohādvākāmataḥ śūdraḥ purāṇaṃ saṃhitāṃ smṛtāṃ |
paṭhannarakamāpnoti pitṛbhiḥ sahapāpakṛt ||

yaḥ śūdro vuddhipūrvaṃ tu śṛṇuyāchrāvayedvijaḥ |
vedaṃtaudvau duḥkhitāvasmin bhavet yatra nārakau ||

adhikāramadādyastu dhanasya madatopi vā |
śūdrastu śṛṇuyādvedaṃ sa nirvaśaśca nirddhanaṃ ||

ajñānāccecchruto vedaḥ śrāpito cādvijanmanā |
prājāpatyaṃ trayaṃ kṛtvā taudvau śraddhau bhaviṣyataḥ ||

tatorghya pātramādāya mūlamuccārya maṃtravit |
sādhu vā sādhu vā karmapadyadā caritaṃ mayā ||

tatsarvaṃ bhagavandeva gṛhāṇārādhanaṃ paraṃ |
ityarghodakasutsṛjya kiṃciddevasya dakṣiṇe ||

kare samarpyayedvidvān kṛtamārādhanaṃ tataḥ |
bhaktyā praṇamya deveśaṃ ślokairebhiḥ kṣamāpayet ||

yaddattaṃ bhaktimātreṇa patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ jalaṃ |
niveditaṃ ca naivedyaṃ tadgṛhāṇānukaṃpayā ||

āvāhanaṃ na jānāmi na jānāmi visarjanaṃ |
pūjāṃ caiva na jānāmi tvaṃ gatiḥ parameśvaraḥ ||

karmaṇā manasā vācā tvattonānyāgatirmama |
ataścāreṇa bhūtānāṃ iṣṭātvaṃ parameśvaraḥ ||

nātha yoni sahasreṣu yā suyāsu rvajāmyahaṃ |
tāsu tāsu sadābhaktiravyayāstu sadātvayi ||

devodātā ca bhoktā ca devaḥ sarvamidaṃ jagat |
devo jayati sarvatrayo devaḥ sohameva hi ||

atha praṇāma pradakṣiṇe ca ||

namanaṃ māna saṃproktaṃ kāyikaṃ vācikaṃ tathā |
trividhaṃ ca namaskāre kāyikaṃ cottamaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

paurāṇikairvedikairvā kriyate vācikaṃ punaḥ |
madhyamo sau namaskāro bhavedvācanikaṃ punaḥ ||

yatsvayaṃ gadyapadyābhyāṃ ghaṭitābhyāṃ namaskṛtiḥ |
kriyate bhaktiyukto hi vācikastu tataḥ smṛtaḥ ||

jānubhyāmavanīṃ gatvā śirasā spṛśyamedinīṃ |
kriyate yo namaskāra uttamaḥ kāyikaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

puṭīkṛtya karau śīrṣe dīyate pādayostathā |
spṛṣṭvā ca jānuśīrṣābhyāṃ bhavedanyā namaskṛtaḥ ||

padbhyāṃ karābhyāṃ jānubhyāmurasā śirasādṛśā |
vacasā manasā ceti praṇāmo'ṣṭāṃga īritaḥ ||

vāhubhyāṃ ca sa jānubhyāṃ śirasā vaca sādṛśā |
paṃcāṃgoyaṃ praṇāmaḥ syāt pūjāsu pravarāvimau ||

bhūmau niṣatpayaḥ kuryāt kṛṣṇe'ṣṭāṃgama tiṣṭadhīḥ |
sahasrajanmajaṃ pāpaṃ tyaktvā vaikuṇṭhamāpnuyāt ||

vedavidbhyodharāṃ datvā yatphalaṃ labhate naraḥ |
tatphalaṃ labhate bhaktyā kṛṣṇe kṛtvā pradakṣiṇaṃ ||

<p. 103a>

śaṃkha haste ca sarvatra dakṣiṇaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
ekaṃ caṇḍyāṃ ravau saptatrīṇi dadyādvināyake ||

catvāri keśave dadyāt śive cārddhaṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ |
trikoṇākāra sarvatra na tiḥśakteḥ samīritā ||

arddhacaṃdraṃ maheśasya pṛṣṭhataśca samīritā |
śivapradakṣiṇe maṃtrī arddhacaṃdra krameṇa ca ||

savyāsavya krameṇaiva somasūtraṃ na laṃghayet |
pradakṣiṇa trayaṃ kṛtvā namaskāraṃ tu paṃcakaṃ ||

punaḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ kuryāt punarjanma na vidyate |
vṛṣasya vṛṣaṇa spṛṣṭvā dakṣāṃgreṃguṣṭatarjanī ||

śṛṃgamadhye śivaṃ dṛṣṭvā punarjanma na vidyate |
vṛṣaṃ caṇḍaṃ vṛṣaṃ caiva somasūtraṃ punarvṛṣaṃ ||

khaṇḍaṃ ca somasūtraṃ ca punaḥ khaṃḍaṃ punarvṛṣaṃ |
padepadāṃtaraṃ gacchet kalau śarala varjitaḥ ||

vācāstotraṃ manodhyānaṃ caturaṃgaṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ |
somasūtradvayaṃ yatra yatra vā viṣṇumaṃdiraṃ ||

apasavyaṃ na kurvīta kṛtvā cāṃdrāyaṇaṃ caret |
prasārya dakṣiṇaṃ hastaṃ svayaṃ na muśirāpunaḥ ||

darśayed dakṣiṇaṃ pārśvaṃ manasāpi pradakṣiṇaṃ |
tridhā vaceṣṭayet samyak devatāyāḥ pradakṣiṇe ||

ekahasta pramāṇaṃ tu ekaṃ vāpi pradakṣiṇaṃ |
akāledarśanaṃ viṣṇorhaṃti puṇyaṃ purākṛtaṃ ||

pradakṣiṇādvāyavīṃ gatvā diśaṃ tasmācca sāṃbhavīṃ |
tataśca daikṣiṇāṃ datvā namaskāraṃ trikoṇavat ||

brahmārpaṇasya manunā kuryād brahmārpaṇaṃ tataḥ |
tārāditaḥ pūrvamiti prāṇavuddhīti saṃvadet ||

dehadharmādhikāreti jāgratsvapnasuṣuptya ca |
sthāsūtkā manasā vācā karmaṇābhyaṃtarastataḥ ||

yacchandoścādareṇeti śiṣṇāyacca smṛtaṃ ca yat |
uktayecca kṛtaṃ tecca sarvabrahmārpaṇaṃ bhava ||

tursvāheti ca maṃtroyaṃ ṣaṭṣaḍarṇaḥ sa samīritaḥ |
udvāsayet tato devaṃ parivāragaṇaiḥ saha ||

iti puṣpāṃjaliṃ datvā praṇamya paribhāvayet |
devasyāṃge vilīnaṃ tadraśmi vṛṃdamaśeṣataḥ ||

tejorūpaṃ śivaṃ dhyātvā kṣamasveti punaḥ punaḥ |
kṣamāpyāropayetsvīya hṛtaṃ bhoje tu devatāṃ ||

atha saṃhāramudrāmāha ||

spṛṣṭalagnau karau kṛtvā aṃgulyānyonya madhyataḥ |
parivartya tataḥ kuryāt tarjanyau saralākṛtī ||

<p. 103b>

visarjanenigaditāmudrāḥ saṃhārasaṃjñikā |
gaccha gaccha paraṃ sthānaṃ svasthānaṃ parameśvara ||

ete brahmādayo devā na viduḥ paramaṃ padaṃ |
viṣṛjyānena maṃtreṇa tataḥ pūrakavāyunā ||

dhyāyaṃśca maṃtreṇānena dhyātvātāṃ sthāpayeddhṛdi |
tiṣṭha tiṣṭha paresthāne svasthāne parameśvara ||

yatra brahmādayaḥ sarve surā tiṣṭhaṃti me hṛdi |
iti saṃsthāpya sṃpūjya svātmānaṃ tanmadyaṃ smaret ||

īśānyāṃ maṇḍalaṃ kuryādvāra padmavivarjitam |
nirmālya bhovjaḥ pūjārthaṃ paṃcāyatana pūjane ||

kartavyāṇi tu paṃcaiva īśādāmadhyamarcayet |
laṃbodaro gaṇeśasya tejaścaṃḍo vivasvataḥ ||

viśvakteno hareḥ proktaścaṇḍeśvarī maheśi tuḥ |
caṇḍeśvaro bhavānyāśca maṃtrohaṃ tādṛśaṃ caret ||

lehya coṣyāntapānādi nirmālyaṃ sragvilepanaṃ |
nirmālya bhojine tubhyaṃ daśamiśrī śivājñayā ||

iti naivedya śeṣaṃ tu datvā natvā visarjayet |
atha hrīṁ hrīṁ saḥ bījaistu sahite nāmunā punaḥ ||

maṃtreṇa bhāskarāyārcāmachidrārthaṃti vedayet |
namo vivasvate tubhyaṃ sāsvate viṣṇutejase ||

jagatsavitre śucaye savitre karmadāyine |
tataḥ kṛtyaṃjaliścitte sthirīkṛtya paṭhediti ||

yajñachidraṃ tapaḥ chidraṃ yacchidraṃ pūjane mama |
sarvaṃ tadachidramastu bhāskarasya prasādataḥ ||

arghyaṃto yena ca tato gaṃdhaṃ pūjāvaśeṣitaṃ |
āloḍya kiṃcinmūlena maṃtrayedaṣṭadhā punaḥ ||

prokṣayetena toyena svātmānaṃ mūlamaṃtrataḥ |
nirmālyaṃ mastake dhāryaṃ mūlamaṃtreṇa maṃtriṇā ||

prāśyapādodakaṃ paścānnaivedyaṃ vibhajet punaḥ |
tadbhaktebhyaḥ svayaṃbhuktvā tanmayo viharetsuya ||

śaivastu śivanirmālya prasādasyādhikāravān |
anyonirayamāyāti na doṣaḥ paṃcasaṃgame ||

svayaṃbhu liṃgatīrthaṃ vā prasādaṃ vāpi bhaktitaḥ |
aśaivā vātha vā śaivā mucyaṃte pāparāśitaḥ ||

śūdraḥ saṃsthāpitaṃ liṃgaṃ pūjayedvānameta vā |
tatsaṃvaṃdhi prasādādi gṛhnannirāyamāpnuyāpnuyāt ||

ayaṃ pūjāvidhirmukhyo yuṣmabhyaḥ saṃprakāśitaḥ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau sādhāraṇanityārcanāyāṃ 
taryajanādivisarjanāṃtanirṇayo nāma saptadaśaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 17 ||

<p. 104a>

atha kaulavāminornityārcanamāha ||

tatrādautanmārgotpatimāha |

dakṣayajñe yadā devi tvayā tyaktaṃ kalevaraṃ |
ahaṃ gṛhītvā tatskaṃdhe citāṃ praveṣṭu mudyataḥ ||

vaḍavāgnergaveṣārthaṃ yatra yatrā bhavet sa tu |
tatra tatra ca śakreṇa tūrṇaṃ nivrāpito jalaiḥ ||

evaṃ paryaṃṭato varṣaṃ prasvedo me mahāna bhūt |
tadviṃdu pātra nirdagdhā dharaṇīyaṃ bhaviṣyati ||

tadā saṃprārthito viṣṇurddharaṇī rakṣaṇāya ca |
tadāśu laghubhirvāṇaistvadaṃgāni samācchinat ||

caturāśīti khaṃḍāni kṛtvāsau pātayadbhuvi |
vā tena vījitāścāhaṃ prītohamakhilastadā ||

viṣṇuśca prakaṭī bhūyaḥ pādayoḥ parito mama |
utthāpya ca pariṣṭhaktastavaśokaśca vismṛtaḥ ||

tāvad brahmādikā devānāradādyāmaharṣayaḥ |
māṃtuṣṭuvustadā vākyaṃ viṣṇuḥ provāca pārvatī ||

jñānadosi maheśatvaṃ kathaṃ mohamupāgataḥ |
satyāḥ śarīreṇa sahapraveṣṭuṃ havyavāhanam ||

anugacchetpatiṃ nārī na pumānatāṃ ca gacchati |
iti śāstramanādṛtya kathaṃ deva vimohitaḥ ||

evaṃ vadati deveśa brahmaṇāmāṃ hariṃstathā |
śleṣālaṃkāra vāhyaiśca tuṣṭuvurvidhinā saha ||

āvābhyāṃ tu tadā proktā yā ca yadhvaṃvaraṃ dvijā |
tadātairbārhmaṇairuktaṃ jātoyaṃ dharmaviplavaḥ ||

dakṣayajñāśritaiḥ śaivā brāhmaṇyādbhraṃśitā dvijāṃ |
yajñāgatāśca sarvepi śaivaiḥ śaptādvijātayaḥ ||

viṣṇunākartatairaṃgaiḥ satyāścedaṃ dharātalaṃ |
sthale sthale śavaḥ sparśād brahmakarma vivarjitam ||

tasmāddharāyāḥ saṃśuddhiṃ viprāṇāṃ cāpi śuddhatāṃ |
brahmavākyasya satyatvaṃ yathā bhavati tatkuru ||

tato dhyātvā mayā proktaṃ sammatīkṛtya viṣṇunā |
yatra vedakriyādhvastā tatra taṃtra pravartyatāṃ ||

ye viprāḥ śāpanirdagdhā brahmakarma vivarjitāḥ |
teṣāṃ tu kauladharmoyaṃ bhuktimuktyestu sādhanaṃ ||

ye viprāḥ pīṭhasaṃjātāḥ śāpanirdagdhavipratāḥ |
teṣāṃ kuledhikāroyaṃ mārgasyāsya prajāyate ||

tatkule eva pūjyatvāt kauloyaṃ mārga ucyate |
vāmamārgastato nyūnasteṣāṃ kṣatriya vaiśyakau ||

<p. 104b> 

yajamānau tayosvatrādhikāraḥ samudāhṛtaḥ |
siddhāṃtīyustatonyūnastatrāśūdrādhikāritā ||

ye pāraṃparya yajñātvā kauladharme vitite |
niḥśvāsaṃtatihīnāścarogiṇo nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

kaulajñānehyasiddhoyasta drvayaṃ bhoktamicchati |
sa mahāpātakī devī sarvakarma vahiḥ kṛtaḥ ||

samayācārahīnasya svairvavṛtterdurātmanaḥ |
na siddhayaḥ kulabhraṃśestatsaṃsargaṃ na kārayet ||

yaḥ śāstravidhimutsṛjya vartate kāmacārataḥ |
sa siddhimihamāpnoti paratra ca parāṃ gatiṃ ||

kuladravyāṇi sevaṃta yena darśanamāṣritaḥ |
tadaṃgaro samaṃkhyātaṃ bhūtayoniṣu jāyate ||

madapraskhalitātmā ca na kiṃcidapi vetti cet |
na dhyānaṃ na tapaścarcā na dharmaṃ ca na satkriyāṃ ||

na devaṃ na gurunmatmavicāro yadi kaulike |
kevalaṃ viṣayāsaktaḥ patatyeva na saṃśayaḥ ||

śriguroḥ kulaśāstrebhyaḥ samyagvijñāya vāsamom |
paṃcamudrāṃ niṣeveta cānyathā patito bhavet ||

āvṛttiṃ gurupaṃktiṃ ca vaṭukādīnna pūjyayaḥ |
vīropyevaṃ vṛthāyāmāddevatā śāpamāpnuyāt ||

atha pūjā prakārastu kathyate kaulavāsinoḥ |
ātmadāna samudravya devaśuddhiṃ prakalpayet ||

snānasaṃdhyā bhūtaśuddhiḥ prāṇāyāmaḥ pratiṣṭhati |
prāṇānāṃ mātṛkānyāsādikaiḥ syādātmaśodhanaṃ ||

saṃmārjanānulepādyairdarpaṇodaravat kṛatṃ |
vitāna dhūpadīpādyaiḥsthāna śuddhiriyaṃmatā ||

grathitā mātṛkāvarṇai mūlamaṃtrākṣarāṇi ca |
kramotkramatrirāvṛttirmaṃtraśuddhiriyaṃmatā ||

pūjā dravyāṇi saṃprokṣya mūlāstreṇa vidhānavit |
darśayeddhenu mudrāṃ ca dravyaśuddhiriyaṃmatā ||

pīṭhe devaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya sakalīkṛtya prokṣayet |
arghyodakena mūlena trirdīpanīṃ pradarśayet ||

devaśuddhirvidhāyetthaṃ paścādyajanamārabhet |
sā pūjā saphalā jñeyātvanyathā niṣphalā bhavet ||

ādau jalamadhiṣṭāyapādaṃyorkṣālanaṃ tataḥ |
dvirācamya śikhāṃ vadhvā kuryādvāreśapūjanaṃ ||

<p. 105a>

viprānutsārayitvā ca tataḥ puṣpādi śodhanaṃ |
vīrāsane tathā viśya vijayā bhakṣayet tataḥ ||

śaktiṃ pārśve ca saṃsthāpya nyāsajālaṃ samācaret |
kuladravyaṃ ca saṃśodhya pātrāṇāṃ sthāpanaṃ tataḥ ||

atha vīrāsanāti ||

mṛdukomalamāsīnaṃ saṃgrāma patitaṃ ca yet |
jaṃtuvyāpāditaṃ vāpi mṛtaṃ vānaramāsanaṃ ||

garbhacyutaṃ ca tārīṇāmathavā yonijaṃ na vā |
tvaṃ ca vātaccharīraṃ vā śive kuryāt tatorcanaṃ ||

ṛturaktāktavastraṃ vā āsanāya praklpayet |
śmaśānakāṣṭhāghaṭitaṃ pīṭha vā yajñadārujaṃ ||

nā dikṣito viśejjātu kṛṣṇasārājine gṛhī |
ekahastaṃ dvihastaṃ vā caturaṃgulamucchritaṃ ||

viśuddhe āsane kuryāt sthāpanaṃ pūjanaṃ vidhiḥ ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi rahasyāti rahasyakaṃ |
muṇḍādi vīraparyaṃtaṃ saṃskāraṃ sādhanaṃ vada ||

śrīśiva uvāca ||

rahasyātirahasyaṃ ca na kutrāpi mayeritaṃ |
tava prītyā maheśāni kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ||

mṛdvāsano bhavedādau dvitīyaṃ syādacūḍakaṃ |
komalaṃ ca tṛtīyaṃ syān muṇḍaproktaṃ caturthakaṃ ||

mṛtāsanaṃ paṃcamaṃ ca ṣaṣṭhaṃ vīrāsanaṃ mataṃ |
mahāvīrāsanaṃ devī saptamaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||

saptānāṃ sādhayeddevī mālāpātra viśodhanaṃ |
yaṃtra saṃśodhanaṃ caiva sarvaṃ saṃkathitaṃ purā ||

idānīmāsanānāṃ ca sādhanāṃ śṛṇu pārvatī ||

atha lakṣaṇamāha ||

arvāk ṣaṇmāsatogarbhaḥ cyutamāhurmṛduṃvudhā |
cūḍopanayanairhīnaimṛtaṃ vā cūḍakaṃ viduḥ ||

nivṛtta cūḍako vālo hīnopanayanaḥ śive |
yo mṛtaḥ paṃcame varṣe tameva komalaṃ viduḥ ||

sāmānya maraṇaṃ prāptaṃ proktaṃ devi mṛtāsanaṃ |
vīrarūpeṇa saṃjātaṃ tacca vīrāsanaṃ viduḥ ||

āveśa śūlapāśādi mahāvīrāsanaṃ mataṃ |
akhaṃḍāṃgaṃśavaṃ devi sa khaṃḍaṃ mastake na yat ||

tanmuṇḍaṃ yatra mālādi pātrakarmaṇi kīrtitaṃ ||

athāsana saṃskāraḥ ||

śavamāniya deveśi garbhajaṃ yadi vāsavaṃ |
saptamāṣṭāmamāsīnaṃ cūḍakaṃ vāpi komalaṃ ||

sthānaṃ saṃśodhya yatnena vīcaveṣo mudānvitaḥ |
tataḥ saṃskāramācarya saṃsthāpya vimale sthale ||

<p. 105b>

gaṃdhāṣṭakaṃ samādāya prokṣayet prathamaṃ tataḥ |
paṃcāmṛtaiḥ paṃcamavyaiḥ kalāpaṃca sa maṃtritaiḥ ||

mūlena sthāpayet tatra pīṭhacakredharaṇyadhaḥ |
trikoṇaṃ viṃdumāyāṃ ca caturasre vikoṇakaṃ ||

trikoṇaṃ tasya vāhye tu padmamaṣṭadalaṃ likhet |
ṣoḍaśāraṃ ca tadvāhye trivṛttaṃ triguṇānvitaṃ ||

mūladevī ca tanmadhye mūlena paripūjayet |
vṛttaṃ ca triguṇaṃ caiva ādimādya na yojayet ||

vāṅmāyā kamalāstatra varṇādau sarvakarmasu |
vahnerdaśakalāstatrakoṇe cāṣṭadale tathā ||

ṣoḍaśāre trivṛtte ca kalā somasya pūjayet |
tatraiva sthāpayedvīraṃ mṛdvākhyaṃ vā prayatnataḥ ||

svayaṃtraṃ vilikhet tatra sādhāraśaktipūrvakaṃ |
sudhāsiṃdhuṃmaṇidvīpaṃ ciṃtāmaṇi gṛhaṃ tathā ||

śmaśānaṃ pārijātaṃ ca tanmūle śavavedikāṃ |
dharmajñānaṃ ca vairāgyamaiśvaryaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

adharmādi tato maṃtrāpāṇipāde ca yugmakaṃ |
akārādikṣakārāṃtaṃ mātṛkānyāsa rūpakaṃ ||

tat sthāne pūjayenmaṃtrī hṛdinyāsādi pūjayet |
karanyāsaṃ tato maṃtrī karābhyāṃ pūjayet tataḥ ||

adhomukhaṃ mṛtaṃ kṛtvā tanmukhe madhuraṃ vadet |
he vīra paramānaṃda devīparyaṃkaśaṃkaraṃ ||

aṣṭasiddhiṃ ca me dehi mamaśāṃtiḥ sadā kuru |
etad vrūhi ca vīrendra vasuvarṇaṃ mukhe kṣipet ||

elālavaṃgajātīṃ ca phalatāṃvūla saṃyutaṃ |
ṣaḍirādrakaṃ ca guḍaṃ karpūraṃ raktataṃtunā ||

mūlena bhāvayet tatrajūṭikāṃ dṛḍhamuṣṭikāṃ |
arkeṃduśita vāghālanirmitāṃ dīpavartikāṃ ||

nimaṃtrayet tataḥ śāktaḥ sapta (**) (?) nanu kramāt |
vaṃdanāgurupuṣpādyairmūrddhnidevīṃ prapūjayet ||

jīvanyāsaṃ tato maṃtrī prāṇamaṃtreṇa sādhayet |
gudeliṃge tathānābhau bhūdare guhyadeśake ||

ūrujānu tathā jaṃghā gulphapādatale tathā |
śire kaṃthe nāsikāyāṃ cakṣuṣoḥ karṇayorapi ||

śikhākavacagaṇḍeṣu ūrddhvādhoṣṭa (*) (?) ke tathā |
taṃtayoścaiva jihvāyāṃ śiraḥ pṛṣṭe ca pārśvayoḥ ||

<p. 106a>

hṛdādike ca vāhubhyāṃ pādābhyāṃ ca tathaiva ca |
sarvāṃge vinyase devapīṭhanyāsamanuttamaṃ ||

sūryasyamaṃḍalaṃ tatra tapinyādi kalātmakaṃ |
mṛtakāyaśavāyātra namaścāṃte padaṃ tataḥ ||

snāpayan mūlamaṃtreṇa pūjayenāṣṭavāriṇā |
sūryasomātmakaṃ pīṭhamagnirūpaṃ prakalpayet ||

merupṛṣṭa ṛṣiḥ chaṃdaḥ sutalaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ |
kūrmodeva tataḥ paścāddharmārtha sādhane tataḥ ||

mokṣe punarmanoścaiva siddhyarthe parikīrtitaṃ |
kūrmamudrāṃ darśayitvā astrāvaguṃṭhane tataḥ ||

śaktiyonirmatsyamudrāṃ dhenumudrāṃ tataḥ śive |
pradarśayecchoṭikāyāṃ caturasrāṃ pradarśayet ||

dhṛtvā vimarśayen mūlaṃ pṛthvītvamiti vai kramāt |
tato vajrodaketyādi manubhiḥ kāmasaṃkhyakaiḥ ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya sahasrāra pade tataḥ |
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā tadaṃte ca rakṣarakṣa tato vadet ||

mahāpratisare sarve vighnān chedaya yugvadet |
hūṃ phaḍaṃtaṃ samuddhṛtya vahnijāyāṃ samuccaret ||

dikpāla yajanaṃ kāryamiṃdrodi kramayogataḥ |
vīrārgalā ghoramaṃtraistathā pāśupatairapi ||

mahāmaṇḍala maṃtrairvādigvaṃdhaṃ tatra kārayet |
śivā valiṃ tatra dadyādgrahaṇādāvapi priye ||

ādau madhye tathā cāṃte trivāraṃ tu śivā valiḥ |
muṇḍagrahaṇakāle tu sarvathā tu śivā valiḥ ||

śivāṃ śaktiṃ ca vā pūjyadikpālān vali saṃyutān |
pūjayet parameśāni sāyudhādi yathākramaṃ ||

evaṃ krameṇa vīrendra sarveṣāṃ valimāharet |
vāṅmāyāṃ kamalāṃ procya devyāmuka eṣavaidyajuḥ ||

pravartate imaṃ bhāgavaliṃ gṛhnaṃ tu yugmakaṃ || 87 ||

tathā ||

atra tiṣṭha namaḥ procya astute hūṃphaṭ svāhā |
akārādi kṣakārāṃtaṃ viṃduyuk mātṛkākṣarān ||

śirādi pādaparyaṃtaṃ veṣṭayed dakṣiṇa kramāt |
sārddhatrivalayairyuktaṃ veṣṭayet sādhakottamaḥ ||

nānāsugaṃdha dravyeṇa raktacaṃdanacaṃdanaiḥ |
kāśmīrā gurukaṃ datvā pītasūtreṇa veṣṭayet ||

<p. 106b>

vaṃdhayedvividhairdravyaiḥ kṣārayukta haridrayā |
vadhnīyādraktasūtreṇa paṭṭasūtreṇa vāpi vā ||

athādhikāritāmāha ||

nirdvaṃdvo nirahaṃkāraḥ śuddhanāḍīgaṇāvṛtaḥ |
pākhaṃḍovuddhirahitaḥ sarvabhūta hiterataḥ ||

sarvāvayava saṃśuddhaḥ sarvaśāstra viśāradaḥ |
kṛtābhiṣekā vidyājño japapūjādi tatparaḥ ||

mṛdvāsane vaset sohitvanyathā narakaṃ vrajet |
ajñānānmohadaṃbhaiśca dṛṣṭvādṛṣṭaṃ karoti yaḥ ||

sayāti narakaṃ ghoraṃ piśācatva mavāpnuyāt |
prayāṃti te mahāmūḍhā vyādhiḥ tvaṃ svalpajīvitāṃ ||

viśedvīrastu śāstrajñaḥ samayācāra tatparaḥ |
maṃtrajñastaṃtradarśī ca yaṃtra maṃtra vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

nigrahānugrahe śaktaścaturvarga vinodakaḥ |
sasiddhaḥ siddhido lokeśāyānu grahanekṣamaḥ ||

aśaktaḥ kurute yastu mṛtyustasya na saṃśayaḥ |
mṛdvāsanamidaṃ proktaṃ kimanyachrotu micchasi ||

devyuvāca ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi acūḍaka viśodhanaṃ |
acūḍakāsane devī siddhayaḥ sakalāsthitāḥ ||

tamāsanaṃ samādāyamakāra paṃcakānvitaṃ |
bhaumāṣṭamyāṃ caturdaśyā mamāyāṃ dīpakotsave ||

kulaṛkṣepi deveśi acūḍakāsanaṃ bhavet |
digvaṃdha bhūtaśuddhādīn kṛtvā yatnena pārvatī ||

vajrodake samārabhya rakṣāṃtakaṃ śive |
maṃtrānvijñāya yatnena sādhayediṣṭasādhanaṃ ||

anyatsarvaṃ pūrvavat syāt komalepyeva meva tu |
suṇḍāsanaṃ pravakṣyehaṃ śṛṇu sā vahito bhava ||

bhaumāṣṭamyāṃ caturdaśyāṃ maṃgaleśa nivāsare |
dīpotsave ca phālguṇyāṃ sāṣṭarātridinepi ca ||

pūrvakṛtyaṃ samāvyāthayāma mātraṃ gate niśi |
vīraveṣo dayāyukto bhakta bhakto jiteṃdriyaḥ ||

mahāvalo mahābuddhirvijiteṃdriya śāstravit |
khaḍgahasto muktakeśaḥ siṃdūratilakānvitaḥ ||

validravyāṇi cādāya dṛḍhabhaktau mahāruciḥ |
vīrasādhanasāmagrī saṃvṛtaḥ sādhakottamaḥ ||

<p. 107a>

śivāvaliṃ pradatvā dautadaṃte muṇḍasādhanaṃ |
śivārūpā svayaṃ devī tatra vighnaharāddhruvaṃ ||

anyathā vighnakartāro devā daityāśca mānavāḥ |
sarvavighnaṃ vināśārthaṃ siddhyarthaṃ pheravīṃ yajet ||

śmaśāne gahvarenadyāṃ śunyagehepi sādhayet |
śmaśāne cenmaheśāni vidhistatra śmaśānavat ||

anyatra vīravat kāryaṃ sādhanaṃ sarvasādhanaṃ |
kādirān kīlakānaṣṭau nikhanenmaṃtramuccaret ||

mahāmaṃḍala maṃtraiśca sarvavighnānvighātayet |
muṃḍamānīya yatnena paṃcagavyaṃ vinā kṣipet ||

dugdhena snānamācarya tataḥ saṃvijjalena ca |
tadaṃte surayā snānaṃ kṛtvā yatnena pārvatī ||

tailaṃ lāpya ca tanmuṃḍe siṃdūrekajjalaṃ tathā |
gaṃdhapuṣpaiśca saṃpūjya khaneddhastārddhamānataḥ ||

tārāyāṃ kālikāyāṃ tu chinnāyāmapi pārvatī |
muṇḍakādi bhavetpīṭhamādhārādikameva vā ||

tatrāpi daśaśaktau tu tridhā bhinnā maheśvarī |
ṛṭumatyāṃ tathā śaktau yatkiṃcit pīṭhamarcayet ||

athāsanakālasyāvadhiryathā ||

ṛṭuvastrāsanaṃ devi sūtrāṃ taṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
muṇḍāsanaṃ tu majjītaṃ tathā śavāsane priye ||

kucāsane japāttaṃ ca suratāsanameva ca |
mṛdukomalacūḍādi cūrṇāṃtaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||

tathā vīrāsanaṃ devī samādāya prayatnataḥ |
hṛnmalaṃ dūratastyaktvā hṛdayaṃ śodhayet punaḥ ||

vastrācchannaṃ bhūmayaṃ vā kṛtvā sthitvā japaṃ caret |
(********) (?) 
naracarmāsanaṃ tathā ||

vastrāsanaṃ sa bhaṃgāṃtaṃ sa lomāṃtaṃ nṛkeśarī |
saṃvidrasaṃ sagājākhyaṃ tūrṇākhyaṃ troṭanāṃtakaṃ ||

yonitvagāsanaṃ devī sa lomāṃtaṃ maheśvarī |
yogyāsanaṃ sa jīvāṃtaṃ pātāṃtaṃ suratāsanaṃ ||

viparītāsanaṃ devī tatpātāṃtaṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
tadaṃte saṃtyajeddevī yadyanyaṃ cottarottaraṃ ||

viṣarāsanakaṃ devī chedanāṃ taṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
kramāt siddhiprade devī sarvakāryakaraṃ bhuvi ||

vyāghrāsanaṃ sa lomītaṃ kaḥ cidbhaṃgātamaṃvike |
iti saṃkṣepataḥ proktaṃ kālasaṃkhyāṃ śṛṇu priye ||

<p. 107b>

ṛtumatyāsane devī tridināttriguṇā kṛtiḥ |
ṛtuvastrāsanaṃ devi trisāsrātphaladāyakaṃ ||

muṇḍāsanaṃ tu ṣaṇmāsairdināṃ taṃ tu śavāsanaṃ |
naracarmāsanaṃ devīmāsāt satphalamucyate ||

kucāsane dvimāsena phalaṃ bhavati suṃdari |
ratāsane maheśāni pakṣāṃtaṃ tu phalaṃ bhavet ||

mṛdvāsane tu māsane komalaṃ tatvamāsikaṃ |
phalaṃ bhavaṃ tu deveśi ūrṇākhye daśavarṣataḥ ||

acūḍake viṣṇutatvairvīrepi maṃtra eva ca |
vastrāsane paṃcavarṣaiḥ siṃhāsanaṃ paṃcamāsakaiḥ ||

mṛgākhye ṣaḍvarṣaścaiva ūrṇākhye daśavarṣataḥ |
yonitvagāsane devi saptāhe na phalaṃ bhavet ||

yonyāsane sa pakṣāṃte suratākhye dināṣṭakaṃ |
viparīte ṣaṭdinaiścejjihvāsparśodvivedakaiḥ ||

saptacuṃvanake devī yojayet kālikānnaraḥ |
tāvatsannārakī jñeyo yāvadā huta saṃplavaṃ ||

atha mṛdvāsanādya bhāve anukalpamāha ||

mṛtābhāvekuśaṃ rūpaṃ viṣṭaraṃ parikalpayet |
pūjyaṃ pīṭhaṃ viṣṭharākhyaṃ pūjyātā saṃvikāparā ||

śrīdevyāviṣṭarodevidhārāstasyāsphaṭāsti ca |
viṣṭaraṃ sādhakasyātha kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ||

bhūtapatrāṇi yasmin vai sa kuśebhyo vidhīyate ||

haste pāde daśadaśasitādik yugaṃ hṛtsaroje viṃśat saṃkhyā sakalavarade 
mastake kīrtitāśca |
guhye jihvā vada naradane ghrāṇakarṇastaneṣu liṃge cāṃdre yugaparimitā 
yojanīyākuśāśca ||

ityeṣa viṣṭaraḥ khyātaḥ sarvasiddhi pradāyakaḥ |
kuśairvā vaṃdhanaṃ kāryaṃ nāḍyāṃ vā parameśvarī ||

raktamiśritasūtreṇa paṭṭasūtreṇa vā punaḥ |
viṣṭaraṃ parikalpyātha tasyopari japaṃ caret ||

vidhiviṣṭarapadmasya vidhiḥ prokto mayā tava |
śavarūpaṃ prakalpyātha kavirvāgmī bhavennaraḥ ||

svayaṃbhuvāktaṃ sūtraṃ svakartavyaṃ sarvasiddhaye |
śavābhāve viṣṭarastu śavarūpaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

sākṣāttu śivarūpo hi viṣṭaraḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
viṣṭaraḥ śivarūpaḥ syāt svasya śaktitvakalpanā ||

śivaśakti samāyogot kiṃ na siddhyati bhūtale |
śavavīrottamaṃ vastraṃ dvitīyo viṣṭaraḥ smṛtaḥ ||

<p. 108a>

tṛtīyaṃ śṛṇu deveśi sarvasiddhipradāyakaṃ |
viṣṭaraṃ śaṃbhurūpaḥ syāt sa śivāśivaviṣṭaraḥ ||

siṃhāsanaṃ ca paryaṃko viṣṭarastu tṛtīyakaḥ |
catuṣpāde mahādevi brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarāḥ |

īśvarastu caturthaḥ syāt tanmadhye tu sadāśivaḥ |
madhye tu āsanasthānaṃ mahāsamarasātmakaṃ ||

hastau pādau prakalpyātha mastakaṃ hṛdayaṃ tathā |
sāṃgaṃ sā ca vayaṃ devi śavaṃ vā parikalpya ca ||

sa pāde śatapātreṇa bhūtapatre kuśaiḥ kramāt |
asthiṃ vā tatra saṃsthāpya śavāṃśaṃ vāpi suṃdari ||

nārī rajonvitaṃ sūtraṃ tena vāgrathanaṃ caret |
paṭṭasūtreṇa sūtreṇa yathāyogena vā punaḥ ||

jīvanyāsaṃ tatra kṛtvā dhyātvā tārāṃ japaṃ caret |
anena krame yogena kinnasiddhyati bhūtale ||

sadāśiva pretarūpo viṣṭaraḥ kathito mayā ||

atha viṣṭarasya saṃskāramāha ||

gāyatryātroṭanaṃ  kāryaṃ mūlena grathanaṃ caret |
yatra noktā tu gāyatrī tat kramaṃ śṛṇu tārike ||

tannāmapada devyaṃ tāṃ gāyatrīśaṃ tu sā matā |
tannāma karma devyaṃtā gāyatrī tāriṇī mayā ||

kṛtasaṃkalpako maṃtrī komalaṃ vāmapāṇinā |
kūrcavījena saṃgṛhya astramaṃtreṇa prokṣaṇaṃ ||

praṇavaṃ tu vaneśīṃ ca samuccāryaṃ tu taṃ vadet |
śavarūpa mahāpreta cāṣṭasiddhiṃ prayacchame ||

iti stutvā tu taṃ samyak kuśamadhye nidhāpayet |
tasya gehe trikoṇaṃ tu raktacaṃdana vai ||

māyāṃ tanmadhyagāṃ likhya vahirmaṃḍalakaṃ caret |
praṇavaṃ āḥ sa rerave ca vajrarerave tataḥ ||

kūrca cāstraṃ vahni vadhūmayaṃ ca maṇḍale manūḥ |
oṃ āṃ kāraṃ ca tato māyāṃ krauṃkāraṃ haṃsa eva ca ||

vahnijāyāṃ samuccārya śavaḥ prāṇāḥ padaṃ vadet |
iha prāṇāḥ padaṃ proktā śavajīva ihasthitaḥ ||

śavasya sarveṃdriyāṇi punarvāṅmana cakṣu ca |
śrotraghrāṇa ihāgatya sukhaṃ ca virameva ca || 

tiṣṭhaṃ tu svāhayāyukto praṇavaṃ sthāpano manuḥ |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya ādhāraśakti padaṃ tataḥ ||

komalāsana padaṃ ṅeṃtaṃ namoṃtena tamarcayet |
praṇavaṃ kāmapīṭhāya namaḥ śabdānnamaskriyā || 

<p. 108b>

svarṇairmāsa trayai paṭṭe kāryā mūrtiḥ śavasya ca |
saṃsthāpya viṣṭaraḥ syāṃte sarvaṃ pūrvavadācaret || 

samayāśodhanaṃ kṛtvā śaktiśodhanamācaret |
śaktiḥ saṃśodhanaṃ kṛtvā surāśodhanamācaret ||

surāḥ saṃśodhanaṃ kṛtvā śuddhiśodhanamācaret |
śuddhiḥ saṃśodhanaṃ kṛtvā mudrāṃ maithunaśodhayet || 

atha dvijayāṃgīkāramāha ||

saṃvidā śavayormadhye saṃviddevīgarīyasī |
saṃvit prayogasteneha pūjādau sādhakottamaiḥ || 

kartavyā ca mahāpūjā karaṇīyā sumaṃtritaiḥ |
śuklapuṣpābhavedbrāhmī raktapuṣpā tu kṣatriyā ||

pītapuṣpā bhavedvaiśyā kṛṣṇapuṣpā tu śūdrajā |
ṛṣirasyā maheśāni ānaṃdabhairavā mataḥ ||

(**) (?) chaṃdo devatā ca samayā ca vāgvādinī |
vālāvīja trayeṇaiva vījaṃ śaktiśca kīlakaṃ ||

kramāt kāryaṃ maheśāni viniyogastu śodhane |
dvidhā tribhistutairvījaiḥ ṣaḍaṃgāni kramādviduḥ || 

atha dhyānaṃ ||

siddhāyāṃ śivavodhinīṃ karalasat pāśāṃkuśo bhairavīṃ bhaktābhīṣṭa 
varapradāna kuśalāṃ saṃsāravaṃdhachidāṃ |
pīyūṣāṃ vudhimaṃthanodbhavarasāṃ saṃsāravaṃdhachidāṃ 
vīrārādhitapādukāṃ suvijayāṃ dhyāyejjaganmohinīṃ ||

saptābhimaṃtritaṃ kṛtvā pūtaṃ sarvaṃ bhaveddhruvaṃ ||

saṃvide brahmasaṃbhūte brahmaputri sadānaghe |
bhairavānaṃda dattātvaṃ pavitrā bhavasarvadā ||

oṃ brāhmyai namaḥ svāhā ||

brāhmaṇīṃ śodhayediti ||

siddhimūla kriye devi hīnabodha pravodhinī |
rājā prajā vaśaṃkarī śatrukaṃṭhanisūdinī || 

aiṁ kṣatriyāyai namaḥ svāhā ||

śodhayet kṣatriyāṃ tataḥ ||

ajñāneṃdha na dīptāgnerjvālāgnerjñānarūpiṇī |
ānaṃdasyāgamaṃ prītiṃ samyag jñānaṃ prayacchame ||

hrīṁ vaiśyāyai namaḥ svāhā ||

śūdrāṃ ca śodhayet tataḥ ||

namasyāmi namasyāmi yogamārga pradarśinī |
trailokya vijaye mātaḥ samādhi phaladā bhava ||

klīṁ śūdrāyai namaḥ svāhā ||

kathyate maṃtramuttamaṃ ||

<p. 109a>

amṛte amṛtodbhave amṛtavarṣiṇi padaṃ tataḥ |
amṛtamākarṣayadvaṃdvaṃ siddhiṃ dehi padaṃ tataḥ ||

sarvametha tato vrūyādvaśamānaya tatparaṃ |
dviṭhāṃtoyaṃ manuḥ proktaścaturṇāmapi śodhane || 

mūlamaṃtraṃ saptavāraṃ tasyopari niyojayet |
āvāhanādi mudrāśca dhenuyoniṃ tataḥ paraṃ || 

digvaṃdhanaṃ choṭikābhistāratrayapurassaraṃ |
divyadṛṣṭyā tathā pārṣṇighātairvighnānvighātayet || 

saptadhā tarpayedbrahmaraṃdhre mūlaṃ samuccaran |
guruṃ padme sahasrāre tathā tatvākhyamudrayā || 

tridhaiva tarpayedbhaktyā sādhakaḥ siddhimānasaḥ |
aiṁ vadavadapadaṃ vrūyādvāgvādini padaṃ tataḥ || 

mama jihvāgre sthirībhava sarvaṃ padaṃ tataḥ |
sarva satvavaśaṃkarī svāhāṃte juhuyānmukhe || 

ānaṃdena yuto devī pūjā kāryā yathāvidhiḥ |
samayābhakṣitā yena samayāyoṣitā tathā || 

sa śivaḥ sa ca yogī ca sattapasvī satāṃvaraḥ |
sa bhavenmuktimārgasthaḥ samayā yena bhakṣitā || 

bhakṣayitvā ca samayāyaṃ yaṃ maṃtraṃ japennaraḥ |
samastaphalamāpnoti satyaṃ satyaṃ varāṇane || 

atha śaktiśodhanaṃ ||

sa śodhanaṃmanāścarya striṣumayeṣu sādhakaḥ |
kṛtepi siddhihāniḥ syāt kruddhā bhavati caṇḍikā || 

abhiṣekādbhavecchaktirmaṃtrasyoccāraṇāchrutau |
ratikāla maheśāni dīkṣākāle ca kanyakā || 

kalādvā yatnato vyarthādabhiṣekaṃ samācaret |
surayā retasā vāpi jalena manunā purā ||

ādau vālāṃ samuccārya tripurāyai samuccaret |
namaḥ śabdaṃ samuccārya imāṃ śaktiṃ tato vadet ||

pavitrī kuru śabdāṃte mama śaktiṃ kuru priye |
vahnijāyāṃ samuccārya śuddhimaṃtraḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

anena vidhinā devī abhisiktā striyaḥ sadā |
ramamāṇotra saṃnityaṃ sarvasiddhimavāpnuyāt ||

ihaloke sukhaṃ bhuktāpare muktimavāpnuyāt |
asyā karṇebhedavuddhyā māyāvījaṃ samuccaret ||

<p. 109b>

tena suddhā bhavennārī pūjā yogyā sadaiva hi ||

atha vāma kaulayorviśeṣanyāsānāha ||

kṣamārabhya akārāṃto nyāsaścetkriyate yadi |
saṃhāranyāsanāmā syāt viṃdunyā sa itīritaḥ ||

vāmamārge pravṛttānāṃ śaktisevanakāriṇāṃ |
aṃtarnyāsāt paraṃ viṃdunyāsaiḥ syācchukradhāraṇaṃ || 

yāvat klinnā bhavecchaktistāvadbhogo vidyīyate |
vāmenna dakṣiṇemārge devatā dhyānamucyate ||

akṣasrajaṃ hariṇapota mudagraṭaṃ.kaṃ vidyāṃkurairavirataṃ dadhatīṃ trinetrāṃ |
arddhendumaulimaruṇāsaraviṃdavasāṃ varṇeśvarīṃ 
praṇamatastanabhāranamrāṃ ||

śaktermanorathe pūrṇe visarganyā samācaret |
tato viṃdupatettasmādetau viṃdu visargakau ||

nyāsau proktau yadā śukraṃ vāminaḥ kaulikasya vā |
śaktaṃ stṛptiṃ vinā sarganyāsenāpi vinācyutaṃ || 

tadāsau nirayaṃ yāṃti yāvaccaṃdra divākarau |
ihalokepyavaṃśaḥsyādvihīno brahmatejasā || 

bhogamokṣadhiyā vāme patituṃ ye samudyatāḥ |
vinā maṃtraṃ sarpamaṇiṃ te gṛhītuṃ samudyatāḥ ||

visargamātṛkānyāsobhave kevala mātṛvat |
viśeṣastu visargāṃto varṇoccāro bhavediti ||

viṃdusargadyutān ḍādivyaṃ tān varṇānsthitau nyaset |
pūrvoktā eva mutpādyāḥ ṣaḍaṃga dhyānamucyate ||

siṃdūrakāṃti mamitābharaṇāṃ trinetrāṃ vidyākṣasūtra 
mṛgapottavarāndhānāṃ |
pārśvasthitāṃ bhagavatīmapi kāṃcanābhāṃ dhyāyet karābja 
ghṛtapustakavarṇamālāṃ ||

mātṛkānyāsa saṃsthāne vāme kaulika vartmani |
prapaṃcayoganāmānaṃ nyāsaṃ kuryāttaducyate || 

śrīprapaṃcedvīpamāye kamalājaladhī tathā |
giriviṣṇurvallabhe ca yattanaṃ padmadhāriṇī ||

samudratanayā pīṭhe kṣetrayuglokamātṛkā |
vanaṃ kamalavāsinyau iṃdirācāśramastathā ||

māgṛheturamānadyau padmācatvarakau tathā |
nārāyaṇapriyodbhijjausvedajāsiddhilakṣmikā ||

aṇḍajaśca mahālakṣmī jarāyurājalakṣmikā |
svarasthāne ṣoḍaśaiva yugmāni sparśajānyathā ||

āryālavautruṭirmā ca caṇḍikā ca kalānvitā |
kāṣṭhā durgenimevākhya śivaścāsauhyaparṇikā ||

<p. 110a>

aṃvikā ghaṭike caiva muhūrtaśca sanīyutaḥ |
īśvarī praharaścaiva śāṃbhavī divasānvitā ||

sarvamaṃgalayā yuktā stitinyasya tataḥ paraṃ |
dākṣāyiṇyo tathā vārāhaimavatyāyutaṃ nyaset || 

nakṣatraṃ ca mahāmāyā yuktaṃ yogenyasettataḥ |
māheśvaryā ca karaṇaṃ mṛḍānyā pakṣa eva ca || 

rudrāṇī māsasaṃyuktā sarvāṇi rāśi saṃyutā |
atha tu parameśvaryau kālī cānaya saṃyutā || 

kātyāyaṇāṃvatsarayuk gaurīyuga samanvitā |
bhavānī pralayau vāthayādi sthāneṣu vinyaset ||

paṃcabhūtayutā brāhmī paṃcatanmātrasaṃyutā |
vāgīśvarī tato vāṇī paṃcakarmendriyānvitā ||

saṃjñāneṃdriya sāvitrī sā nilāṃ ca sarasvatī |
gāyatrī guṇayuktā vāk prakaṭaḥ karaṇānvitā || 

avasthāyuk śāradā ca dhātuyuktā ca bhāratī |
doṣayuktā priyā ceti vyāpakaṃ vidyayā nyaset || 

tritāramūlavidyāṃte mātṛkākṣaṇataḥ paraṃ |
vadet prapaṃcarūpāyaiśriyai nama iti kramāt ||

prapaṃcādibhirāpohya varṇavyaktiṃ niyojayet |
mātṛkānyāsa saṃprokta sthāneṣu tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

tritālamūla sakala prapaṃcasya svarūpataḥ |
āryāvārāṃ vā devyai ca namoktyā vyāpakanyaset ||

prapaṃca nyāsa evaṃ syādbhuvanānyā sa ucyate |
vinā dravyādhivāsena na smarenna japet tathā || 

ye smaraṃti mahāmūḍhāstesāṃ duḥkhaṃ pade pade |
nāsavena vināmaṃtraṃ vināmaṃtreṇa nāsavaṃ ||

parasparavirodhitvāt kathaṃ pūjā vidhīyate |
tatsaṃśaya nivṛttiṃ ca jñātvā gurumukhādyajet ||

vīkṣaṇasparśana dhyānamaṃtra mudrāviśodhanaiḥ |
dravyaṃ tarpaṇayogyaṃ syāddevatā prītikārakaṃ || 

atha dravyāṃgīkāre adhikāri vivekamāha ||

dravyeṇa sātvike naiva brāhmaṇaḥ pūjayecchivāṃ |
brāhmaṇo madirāṃ datvā brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate || 

brāhmaṇastvanukalpaṃ ca kṛtvā cāṇḍālatāmiyāt |
evaṃ dadyātkṣitiṃyopi paiṣṭikīṃno kadācana ||

<p. 110b>

nārikelodakaṃ kāṃsyetāmregavyaṃ tathā madhu |
rājanyavaiśyayordānaṃ na dvijasya kadācana ||

evaṃ pradānamātreṇa hīnāyurbrāhmaṇo bhavet |
tāmregavyaṃ madhusamaṃdaivayaitrye na duṣyati ||

ata eva maheśāni home tāmre pragṛhyate |
brāhmaṇena tathā kāryaṃ brāhmaṇyaṃ na vinśyati ||

varṇānu kramabhedena dravyabhedā bhavaṃti ca |
kṣīreṇa brāhmaṇaistarpyaṃ ghṛtena nṛpavaṃśajaiḥ ||

mākṣikairvaiśyavaryastu āsavaiḥ śūdrajātibhiḥ |
yatrāvaśyaṃ vinirdiṣṭaṃ madirādānamuttamaṃ ||

brāhmaṇastāmrapātre tu gavyamadyaṃ prakalpayet |
satyakramāccaturvarṇaiḥ kṣīrājye madhupiṣṭajaiḥ ||

tretāyāṃ pujitā devī ghṛtena sarvajātibhiḥ |
madhubhiḥ sarvavarṇaiśca pūjitā dvāpareyuge ||

pūjanīyā kalau devī kevalairāsavairniśi |
brāhmaṇaiśca sadāpeyākṣatriyaiścaraṇāgame ||

vaiśyairddhana prayogaiśca śūdreṇaiva kadācana |
brāhmaṇasya mukhānmadya vāsanā prabhavedyadi ||

caṇḍālavadvahiḥ kāryo nāsau vā mīnakaulikaḥ |
brāhmaṇo na spṛśen madyaṃ vaidike vartmani sthitaḥ ||

paṃcalakṣaṇa saṃyukto brāhmaṇaḥ kāla eva sa |
ahaṃ brahmā tathā viṣṇustadājñāvaśavartinaḥ ||

sa ced vāmapathaṃ prāptaḥ punaḥ śvānobhijāyate |
caturlakṣaṇa saṃyukto vipro jñeyastu madhyamaḥ || 

tābhyāṃ datto bhāgyavaśāttāṃtrikaḥ kopi cenmanuḥ |
sadyaḥ phalati vāgyasya kriyayā vāpi tasya tu || 

lakṣaṇa trayayuktoyastasya vaidika tāṃtrike |
yathoktā caraṇādeva phaladastu na vāmakaḥ ||

lakṣaṇadvayasaṃyuktastasya vāmaśca dakṣiṇaḥ |
samatulya phalau syātāṃ na kadācana vaidikaḥ ||

ekalakṣaṇa saṃyukto samastaphalapradaḥ |
sautrāmiṇyāṃ kulācāre brāhmaṇaḥ prapivetsurāṃ ||

anyatra kāmataḥ pītvā prāyaścittī bhavennaraḥ |
brāhmaṇaiḥ kaulikaiḥ peyaṃ devatā tṛptihetave ||

vāmināṃ kaulikānāṃ ca mukhetiṣṭhaṃti devatāḥ |
nayaṃtiteṃ tu tadgaṃdhaṃ sa tu vaṃdyo harerapi ||

devatā yasya na mukhe sākṣāccāṇḍāla eva saḥ |
seveta madhumāṃsāni tṛṣṇayā cet sa pātakī || 

<p. 111a>

maṃtrapūtaṃ kuladravyaṃ gurudevārpitaṃ priye |
ye pivaṃti janāsteṣāṃ stanapānaṃ punarnava ||

vahunoktena kiṃ devi yathā śaktyā dadāti yaḥ |
kulācāryāya pūjārthaṃ kuladravyaṃ sa dharmavit ||

śaive tu vaiṣṇave śākte saure su gatadarśane |
vaudve pāśupate sāṃkhye maṃtre kālāmukhe tathā ||

sadakṣa vāmasiddhāṃte vaidikādiṣu pārvatī |
vinālipisitābhyāṃ tu pūjanaṃ niḥphalaṃ bhavet ||

śṛṇu devī pravakṣyāmi kaulikā caraṇaṃ yathā |
pāṇerbhrāṃti bhavedyasya ghṛṇāsyādraktaretasoḥ ||

śuddhau cāśuddhitā vudhiḥ pāpaśaṃkā ca maithune |
sa bhraṣṭaḥ pūjayedevīṃ caṇḍī maṃtraṃ kathaṃ japet ||

atha dravyāṇāmāvaśyakatāmāha ||

vinālivalidānābhyāṃ na prasīdati kālikā |
madhubhāṃḍa sahasraistumāṃsabhāraśatairapi ||

naiva tuṣṭā bhaveddevī bhagaliṃgāmṛtaṃ ṛte ||

atha kāmarāṇāṃ krameṇa phalamāha ||

yaḥ karoti surāpānaṃ jīvanmuktaḥ sa jāyate |
māṃsaṃ kādatiyomartyastasya mṛtyubhayaṃ kutaḥ ||

yo bhakṣayati matsyāṃśca sa śivo nātra saṃśayaḥ |
mudrāṃ bhakṣayatedyastu sa siddhīnāṃ patirbhavet || 

surataṃ yaḥ prakurute trailokya karaṇakṣamaḥ |
etasya cārtha tritayaṃ sātviko rājasastathā ||

tāmasaśceti tatrādyaurāmādibhyo nirūpataḥ |
taṃ mārgaṃ ye vijānaṃti te muktā nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

athāśavasyatraividhyamāha ||

madirātri vidhā proktā uttamāmadhyamādhamā |
uttamā svagṛhotyannāmadhyamācānyagehajā ||

adhamāhaṭṭasaṃkrītā evaṃ sā trividhāmatā ||

śiva uvāca ||

devāsuraiḥ purākalpemathyamāne mahodadhau |
tatra śyāmā samutpannā surākalaśadhāriṇī ||

gaurāṃgāruṇacailā ca bhāsvaddharitakaṃcukā |
śvetottarapadādevī trailokyasyāpi mohinī ||

dṛṣṭvātāṃ dānavāḥ sarve śukrācārya valātsurān |
jitvātāṃ jagṛhustasyāḥ kalaśāccapayuḥ surāṃ ||

devān palāyitān dṛṣṭvā śaktayastatra saṃsthitāḥ |
payustā apitāṃ puṇyāṃ surāṃ daivatamātaraḥ ||

varānapi vahūn dadyuḥ surāyāḥ suramātaraḥ |
abhayāsmāttarpayaṃti śeṣaṃ gṛhnaṃti ye narāḥ ||

te smadrūpā na saṃdeho bhuktiktyaikabhājanaṃ |
surāgaṃgā surāsiṃdhuḥ surādevī sarasvatī ||

<p. 111b>

surā godāvarī revāsuraiva paramaṃ padaṃ |
surāniṃdaṃti ye mūḍhā mūḍhāste janmajanmani ||

gaṃdharvaistūyamānāstā śaktayaste ca dānavā |
utpattiḥ kathitā devī pānaṃ ca kathayāmyahaṃ ||

jihvāmūlaṃ samārabhya hṛdayaṃ yā ca suṃdarī |
ṣoḍaśāṃgula vijñeyā sthānā svādomṛtaṃ padaṃ ||

ṣoḍaśaiva kalāyuktaṃ ṣoḍaśāṃgulamāyataṃ |
pivate daivatairdevi madyamamṛtarūpiṇaṃ ||

prathamaṃ pivate vahni dvitīyaṃ śaśinā pivet |
viṣṇunā ca tṛtīyaṃ tu caturthaṃ varuṇaḥ pivet ||

kumāraḥ paṃcamaṃ devī ṣaṣṭhaṃ tu vāsavaṃ pivet |
saptamaṃ ṛṣibhiḥ sarvaiḥ gaṇeśvaroṣṭamaṃ pivet ||

navamaṃ dharmarājena marutairdaśamaṃ pivet |
ekādaśamasaṃsthāne brahmaputrā pivet priye ||

kaumāra dvādaśaṃ yāti vaināyakyaḥ trayodaśaṃ ||

caturdaśyāṃ paśupatiṃ ||

ete pītvā daśaiḥ paṃcaṣoḍaśaṃ na prakāśayet |
na pītaṃ mānuṣairbhadre devaiḥ pītvā tu saṃbhavaiḥ ||

pītvā ca kathitairbhadre adhunā devatā śṛṇu |
yā rasā sā umādevī yo madyaḥ sa maheśvaraḥ ||

yo varṇaḥ sa svayaṃ brahmā yo gaṃdhaḥ sa janārdanaḥ |
yaḥ svādaḥ sa tu somoyaṃ yo vegaḥ pavanaḥ svayaṃ ||

jñānavijñāna saṃpannaṃ yo madyaṃ citsureśvarī |

atha pākaprakāramāha ||

aṃbhasāṃ dvādaśaprasthaṃ ca taṇḍulā |
prasthārddhaṃ taṇḍulaṃ proktaṃ tāvanmātrāstadaṃkurān ||

śītādirahite sthāne divasadvayamāsya tat |
paścāt bhānau samāropya jaṃvāla sadṛśaṃ pacet ||

pādaprasthaṃ daṃḍulāśca tanmātrānaṃ kurākṣipet |
punardinadvayaṃ sthāpya punarevaṃ prakalpayet ||

arddhaṃ tasya samādāya taṃḍuleṣu viniḥkṣipet |
kunarevaṃ tridhā kuryāttāṃḍulī sā surā smṛtā ||

ayameva bhavet somaḥ somayāga phalapradaḥ |
dūtīyāgo bhavedyogaḥ somapānaṃ tu tat smṛtaṃ ||

yāgatiḥ somayajñena kaulikānāmanena sā |
bhogaḥ svargaśca bhavati vinākaṣṭeṃ na vāmināṃ ||

evaṃ tu yavapiṣṭottho devaṃ soma iti smṛtaḥ |
yacca taṇḍula yogena śakti somo nigadyate ||

svinnaḥ kuṭṭita godhūmāḥ samakliṣṭe na saṃyutāḥ |
styāpito dvādaśāhaṃ ca vāruṇyāṃ paripācitāḥ ||

<p. 112a>

tanmadyaṃ sūryasaṃjñaṃ syādyoginī sadavarddhanaṃ |
pītaṃ tacca pūjāṃte vājapeya phalaṃ labhet ||

idameva tridhā yuktaṃ dalaṃ madyaṃ ca sādhikaṃ |
agnirbhavettasya pānādagnihotra phalaṃ labhet ||

agniryadā saptavāraṃ vāruṇīyaṃtragaḥ kṛtaḥ |
vaḍavānalamāno sau mahāpātakanāśanaḥ ||

daśaḥprasthaṃ guḍaproktastāvaddhūttūlajātva ca |
jaṃvutvagdhātakī puṣpaṃ tadarddhaṃ nārikeraja ||

kusumaṃ ca tadarddhaṃ syāt tadarddhaṃ ca harītakī |
tāvadvibhītakaṃ proktaṃ caturthāṃśaṃ kaṭutrayaṃ ||

tāvacca citrekaṃ tasmādguḍo dvādaśabhāgikaḥ |
kareṇa bhrāmaye samyak anuloma vilomataḥ ||

aṣṭottaraśatāvṛttyā trisaṃdhyaṃ prativāsaraṃ |
dvādaśāhena pākaḥ syādvāruṇī yaṃtragaṃ pacet ||

eṣāgauḍīti vikhyātā mahāmadakarī matāḥ |
śivena nirmitā pūrvaṃ svayaṃ pītā ca bhairavaiḥ ||

dviguṇaṃ makaraṃdākhyaṃ vāri saṃyojayedguḍe |
ṣoḍaśāhe na pākaḥ syāccheṣamanyatpuroktavat ||

sarvadevapriyāceyaṃ vaśīkaraṇīmadbhutaṃ |
devānāṃ śaktayovaśyāmānuṣīṇāṃ tu kādrathā ||

harītakī citrakaṃ ca marīcaṃ dhātakī tathā |
madhūkapuṣpaṃ kṣaudraṃ ca bhāgaikena vivarddhitaṃ ||

aśītiguḍasaṃmiśraṃ śeṣamanyatpuroktavat |
idaṃ manoharaṃ dravyaṃ yoginī pānamuttamaṃ ||

madyābhāve pravakṣyāmi viṃdumadyādhikaṃ surāḥ |
māhiṣaṃ dadhisaṃgrāhyaṃ caturdaśaguṇāṃ surāṃ ||

mocā phalasya pakvasya marditasya rasastathā |
grāhyaṃ dadhi caturthāṃśaṃ tatsaṃmargha ghaṭekṣipet ||

catvāriṃśaddinānyaṣṭau paṃke paṃkaja saṃkule |
nidhāyoddhṛtya kiraṇaiḥ sauraiḥ samyagviśoṣayet ||

yadā tat kaṭhinī bhāvastathā kuryādvaṃṭī śubhāṃ |
guṃjābhāṃ jalasaṃpūrṇetāṃ pātre praṇidhāpayet ||

idaṃ surātopyadhikaṃ brāhmaṇānāṃ praśasyate |
gauḍī sādhvī tathā paiṣṭī trividhā tu surā smṛtāḥ ||

śūdrāṇāmucitā ceyaṃ vaṃśā kṣatriya vaiśyayoḥ |
brahmānaṃda surāyaistu prītā vipraistu kaulikaiḥ ||

na conmādakarī teṣāṃ sureyaṃ vuddhivardhinī |
sarvasiddhikarī paiṣṭhī gauḍī bhogapradāyinī ||

mādhvī muktikarī jñeyā drākṣā rājyapradāmatā |
vidyāpradaikṣarīhālā khārjūrī ripunāśinī ||

tālajā staṃbhaneśastāpanasākhā śubhapradā |
nārikelādbhavā śrīdāniṃvajāroganāśinī ||

madhūkajā jñānakarī vaileyā pāpanāśinī |
yatsānaṃdaṃ rucikaraṃ sāmodaṃ ca manoharaṃ ||

<p. 112b>

madyaṃ taduttamaṃ devā devatā prītikārakaṃ |
brahmā syāt salile viṣṇurgaṃdhe rudraśca tadruvau ||

paramātmā tadānaṃde tasmāt sevyamidaṃ priye |
dṛṣṭvā praṇamya prathamaṃ tadrūpāṃ vāruṇī kalāṃ ||

varuṇenārcitā devī vāruṇī iti viśrutā |
suraistu pivate nityaṃ surānāma iti smṛtā ||

madanenārcitā nityaṃ madireyaṃ prakīrtitā |
paramārthe tu utpannā parāśaktiḥ prakīrtitā ||

yathāmṛtaṃ tathā madyaṃ proktaḥ kāle niṣevitaṃ |
amṛtena sahotpannaṃ sthāne madyaṃ sudhāyate ||

viṣeṇāpi sahotpannaṃ tena madyaṃ viṣāyate ||

atha niṣiddhamāha ||

naṣṭaiḥ paryuṣitocchiṣṭai durgaṃdhairgaṃdhavarjitaiḥ |
hetubhiḥ parapātrasthaistarpaṇaṃ niḥphalaṃ bhavet || 

svapātrasthaṃ ca hetuṃ ca na dadyāt bhairavāya ca |
datte ca siddhihāniḥ syādityājñā śaṃkaraiḥ kṛtā ||

svādiṣṭaiśca madotsiktairdravyairmṛtasannibhaiḥ |
manoharaiśca devīnāṃ tarpaṇaṃ saphalaṃ bhavet ||

māṃsaṃ tu trividhaṃ proktaṃ jala khecara bhūcaraṃ |
jalecarāsyuḥ kūrmādyā khecarāḥ kukkuṭādayaḥ || 

bhūcarā tu mṛgādyāsyuḥ teṣaṃ bhedāṣṭakaṃ bhavet |
gonarebhāśvamahiṣavarāhājamṛgodbhavaṃ ||

mahāmāṃsāṣṭakaṃ proktaṃ devatā prītikārakaṃ |
śaśakaṃ śataguṇaṃ proktaṃ godhāyāstaccaturguṇaṃ ||

mayūrapakṣiṇāṃ māṃsaṃ teṣāṃ caivādhikaṃ bhavet |
kūrmamāhiṣakhaḍgānāṃ puṇyaṃ taccāpyamutra ca ||

hāriṇaṃ tu tato deva puṇyaṃ meṣaṃ tadādhikaṃ |
meṣāccadviguṇaṃ chāgaṃ chāgādvari caturguṇaṃ ||

hareścāṣṭaguṇo'naḍvānaḍuhāna dviguṇo gajaḥ |
gajācca ṣaḍguṇācāśva aśvāccalaśunodhikaḥ ||

palāṃḍunārajastulyaṃ viśeṣeṇaiva vidyate |
matsyaṃ ca trividhaṃ proktamuttamādhamamadhyamaṃ ||

uttamaṃ trividhaṃ devi śālapāṭhī na rohitāḥ |
prācīśaṃ kaṇṭhakairhīnaṃ tailāktaṃ svādu saṃyutaṃ ||

devyāḥ prītikaraṃ caiva madhyamaṃ tadudāhṛtaṃ |
kṣudrāṇi tāni sarvāṇi adhamānyādguruttamāḥ ||

vraiheyaṃ maṇḍalākāraṃ caṃdraviṃvanibhaṃ śubhaṃ |
cāru pakva manohārī śarkarādyaiḥ prapūritaṃ ||

<p. 113a>

pūjākāle ca devīnāṃ mudraiyā parikīrtitā |
bhāgadvayaṃ taṇḍulānāṃ maithikāṃ hiṃgujīrakaṃ ||

lavaṇaṃ ca yathā yogyaṃ surayāmarditaṃ dṛḍhaṃ |
cakrī kṛtaṃ nāgavallī dalaiśca pariveṣṭitaṃ ||

jalayaṃtre vipakvaṃ tat śaktimudreya mucyate |
kālekhaṇḍaṃ varkarasya vādyayaṃtra vipācitaṃ ||

māṣāḍhakī masūrāṇāṃ vaṭakānāṃ samanvitaṃ |
samabhāgena cūrṇena tacca hiṃgvādibhiryutaṃ ||

vaṭakāḥ kaṭutailena pakvāḥ syānmudrikāparā |
sarvāsāmeva śudrāṇāṃ karaṇe tu jalasthale ||

surādeyātha vā madyamāsavaṃ vāmacetarat |
godhūmacūrṇaṃmāsaṃ ca pakvaṃ saṃmelaye dṛḍhaṃ ||

dinatrayaṃ jalesthāpyaṃ yāvadamla prajāyate |
sūkṣmāṇi matsyakhaṃḍāni pakvamaṃtra tu melayet ||

madhye tadroṭikāyāśca datvā paktvā ca roṭikāṃ |
iyaṃ tu paramāmudrāśaktīnāmati tṛptidā ||

ratimātre vāminātra kartavyā buddhirīdṛśī |
liṃgaṃ śivobhagaḥ śaktiṃrgāṃgaṃ vārijalaṃ mataṃ || 

iti bhāvanayā vāmīrataṃ kurvannimucyate |
anyathā strīgamaṃ kurvanniraye paripacyate ||

sadhayārati saṃhūtaṃ kuṇḍamuttamabhūtidaṃ |
vidhavārati saṃbhūtaṃ golaṃ siddhipradaṃ śuci ||

kuladravyairvinākuryājjapapūjāṃ tathā vrataṃ |
niṣphalaṃta bhave devi bhasmanā ca hutaṃ yathā ||

atha mukhyābhāve eteṣā manukalpamāha ||

nārikelodakaṃ kāṃsye tāmre vā visṛjen madhu |
gavyaṃ ca tāmrapātrasthaṃ surātulyaṃ ghṛtaṃ vinā ||

takraṃ kṣīraṃ guḍaṃ kṣaudraṃ dadhyājya tilaśarkarā |
tailaṃ mārjāravālaṃ ca dravyaṃ daśavidhaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

athavā ||

dravyābhāve tu vaṭakaṃ jale saṃloḍya tarpayet |
guḍamiśreṇa takreṇa tacca vā madhubhājanaṃ ||

sauvīreṇātha vā kuryāde tatkarma na lopayet ||

vaṭakaṃ yathā ||

madyaṃ māṃsaṃ ca vijayāmaṣṭagaṃdhaiḥ sumiśritāṃ |
saṃmarghavaṭakaṃ kuryāt tarpaṇārthaṃ ca saṃcayet ||

lavaṇārdrakapiṇyāka palāṃḍuṃ māṃsapaṃcakaṃ |
laśunaṃ ca mahādevi māṃsa pratinidhiḥ smṛtaḥ || 

<p. 113b>

matsyābhāve tu kramukaṃ tāṃvūla yadyadāmiṣaṃ |
mudrābhāve taṃḍulaṃ vā bharjitaṃ ca na kādikaṃ ||

vāmolau saṃlikhed raktacaṃdanena trikoṇakaṃ |
tanmadhye śaktivījaṃ hi vilekhet sādhakottamaḥ ||

tatra saṃpūjayet kāṃtāṃ maṃtreṇānena pārvatī |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi tadardhaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ ||

trikoṇe saṃjapen maṃtrī gāyatryā śakti saṃjñayā |
śaktau śaktyāṃ prakurvīta karmalopaṃ na kārayet ||

yadi vipro bhavet tatra kulapūjāparāyaṇaḥ |
tadānena vidhānena kuryāt kularasodbhavaṃ ||

aparāpuṣpagarbhe tu kulasthānaṃ manoharaṃ |
hayāri kusume devi svayamasti sadāśivaḥ ||

tanmadhyatau tu dhyātyaiva puṣpamadhye tu caṃdanaṃ |
raktaṃ vā kusumaṃ datvā dhyātvātmānaṃ kulātmakaṃ ||

yojayettaṃ śivaṃ śaktyāmaikyaṃ saṃbhāvayan dhiyā |
kṣaṇaṃ viciṃtya tatraiva saṃpūjya parameśvarīṃ ||

japtvā tadeva kuṇḍākhyaṃ dravyaṃ paramadurlabhaṃ |

athavā ||

kuṇḍe golodbhavaṃ dravyasyā bhāve śṛṇu suṃdari |
kathaṃ snānaṃ ca kuryāccadevatātoṣa hetave ||

yasya kasyataroḥ puṣpaṃ gṛhītvāśu prayatnataḥ |
teṣāṃ madhya dvayaṃ grāhyaṃ hastābhyāṃ manasā tadā ||

ubhayoḥ paṃcamaṃ tatra kurvīta vidhivannaraḥ |
raktacaṃdana ghṛṣṭena jale caiva kṣipet tadā ||

tajjalena prakurvīta devatā snānamuttamaṃ |
vāṃchitaṃ phalamāpnoti satyaṃ satyaṃ varānane ||

svayaṃbhū kusumābhāve raktacaṃdanakaṃ kṣipet |
makāra paṃcā bhāve tu paṃcamaṃkārayet priye ||

abhāve paṃcame devi manasā paṃcamaṃ caret ||

athāṃtarīyemakāramāha ||

āmūlādhāramābrahmaraṃdhragatvā punaḥ punaḥ |
ciccaṃdrakuṃḍalīśakti mudrayāsyānmukhodayaḥ ||

vyoma paṃkaja niḥsyaṃda sudhāpānarato bhavet |
madhupānamidaṃ proktamitare madyapāyinaḥ || 

puṇyāpuṇyavaruṃ hatvā jñāna khaḍgena yogavit |
pare layaṃ nayeccittaṃ palāśī sa nigadyate ||

manasā sveṃdriyagaṇaṃ niyamyātmaniyojayet |
matsyāśī sa janaḥ proktaḥ śeṣādhīvaravṛttayaḥ ||

<p. 114a>

aprabuddhāyaśoḥ śaktiḥ prabuddhā kaulikasya ca |
śaktiṃ tāṃ sevayedyastu sa bhavecchakti sevakaḥ ||

ityevaṃ paṃcamudrāṇāṃ guptaṃ tatvaṃ mayoditaṃ |
jñātvā gurumukhāt samyagyaḥ seveta samucyate ||

athaiteṣāṃ saṃskāravaśyakatāmāha ||

asaṃskṛtā sutā pītvā kalahavyādhi duḥkhadā |
āyuḥ śrīkīrti saubhāgya dharmavidyāvināśinī ||

tasmāt saṃskṛtya vidhivat kuladravyaistatorcayet |
susaṃskṛtā surā roga duḥkhāpatyayahāriṇī ||

āyuḥ śrīkīrti saubhāgya dharmavidyāvivarddhinī |
anyathā narakaṃ yāṃti dātā bhoktā na saṃśayaḥ ||

yathā surā vahni varṇā mahāpātakanāśinī |
tathā maṃtra viśuddhā sā divyagniḥ svargamokṣadā ||

dattātreyeṇa muninā śukreṇa ca mahātmanā |
dhīmatā balabhadreṇa surāḥ pītāstu maṃtritāḥ ||

saṃskāra saṃyute hetau datte tuṣyaṃti devatāḥ |
maṃtrāṇāṃ smaraṇādeva māhāpātakanāśanaṃ ||

āyuḥ śrīkāṃti saubhāgyaṃ jñānaṃ saṃskṛtayā tataḥ |
aṣṭaiśvaryaṃ khecaratvaṃ patanaṃ vidhivaryanāt ||

maṃtrairyutaṃ kuladravyaṃ gurudevārpitaṃ priye |
ye pivaṃti janāsteṣāṃ pāpaleśaṃ na vidyate ||

athaiṣāṃ krameṇa saṃskāramāha ||

tatrādau kulasaṃsthāpanaṃ yathā ||

vāmabhāge maheśāni maṇḍale caturasrake |
yāti dvayaṃ samālikhya tadaṃtarbrahmaraṃdhrakaṃ ||

vṛttenavettuyitvā tu caturasreṇa veṣṭayet |
arghyodakena saṃprokṣya tatra saṃsthāpya yaṃtrikāṃ ||

kalābhirdaśabhirvyāptaṃ yajet tatrāgni maṇḍalaṃ ||

atha kalaśasya vyutpatti lakṣaṇaṃ cāha ||

kalāṃ kalāṃ gṛhītvā ca devānāṃ viśvakarmaṇī |
nirmitoyaṃ surairya smāt kalaśastena ucyate ||

paṃcāśadaṃgula vyāsa ucchrāyo dvādaśāṃgulaḥ |
kalaśānāṃ pramāṇaṃ tu mukhamaṣṭāṃgulaṃ tathā ||

ādhāre sthāpayan maṃtrī sauvarṇaṃ cātha rājataṃ |
kāṃśyajaṃ mṛṇmayaṃ vāpi ghaṭaṃ nirvraṇaśālinaṃ ||

sauvarṇaṃ bhogadaṃ proktaṃ rājataṃ mokṣadaṃ smṛtaṃ |
kāṃśyaṃ śāṃtikaraṃ caiva mṛṇmayaṃ puṣṭidaṃ bhavet ||

ghaṭamūlesthito brahmā ghaṭamadhye ca keśava |
ghaṭakaṇṭhe nīlakaṇṭho ghaṭāgre śaktidevatā ||

ghaṭasya sthāpane naiva devatā karagā bhavet |
sarvoktaṃ sarvarūpaṃ ca sarvadevamayaṃ śivaṃ ||

ānaṃdabhairavaṃ paśyat ghaṭhamadhye niraṃtaraṃ |
tejaḥ svarūpī cākhyāto maṇiḥ kalpalatāmayaḥ ||

<p. 114b>

sudhārasamayī vrāṇī amṛtasyaṃdanirbharī ||

devatānāṃ nivedenaṃ ||

svayaṃ karoti deveśi svayaṃ nītvā samoghaṭaḥ |
tadgehe gamanādeva mūkovadati sāradā ||

sahasra śatadhārī ca sahāśruti dharoddhataḥ |
ghaṭasiddhiriyaṃ proktā sarvaśāstramayī bhavet ||

sāmānyārghya viśeṣārghyau dvauproktau yatra pārvatī |
cakṣuḥ prāṇādi rūpatvā ghaṭastvāvaśyakāmataḥ ||

yathā trikoṇaṃ deveśi viṃdunāvarjitaṃ bhavet |
tathā ghaṭaṃ vinā devi pūjā sarvatra varjitā ||

kṣālayedastramaṃtreṇa kuṃbhaṃ samyak sureśvarī |
sthāpayet kalaśādhāraṃ kuṃbhaṃ gaṃdhādhikasitaṃ ||

veṣṭitaṃ raktavastreṇa raktamālyena bhūṣitaṃ |
sthāpayet kalaśaṃ tatra sauvarṇādibhi bhūṣitaṃ ||

kalādvādaśasaṃyuktaṃ bhānuviṃvaṃ yajediha |
śuddhena hetunā maṃtrī mūlamaṃtreṇa pūrayet ||

kalāṣoḍaśasaṃvyāptamiṃduviṃvaṃ yajediha ||

atha kalānāṃ vījamuktamaṃnyatra ||

maṇḍale kalaśe devyā vahnyekaśaśimaṇḍalaṃ |
tārabhaṃgaistribhirmaṃtrīviṃva tritayamarcayet ||

rakṣayedastramaṃtreṇa tanutreṇāvaguṇṭhayet |
vīkṣayenmūlamaṃtreṇa tenaivābhyukṣa sādhakaḥ ||

gaṃdhādinā samabhyarcya bhāvayed devatātmakaṃ |
anyacca śṛṇu deveśi yathā kulādikarmaṇi ||

hānirna jāyate devi tān vai maṃtrān śrṇu priye |
ekameva paraṃ brahmasthūla sūkṣmamayaṃ dhruvaṃ ||

kacodbhavāṃ brahmahatyāṃ tena tenāśayāmyahaṃ |
sūryamaṇḍalasaṃbūte varuṇālayasaṃbhave ||

amāvījamayedevī śukreśāpādvimucyatāṃ |
vedānāṃ praṇavo vījaṃ brahmānaṃdamayaṃ yadi ||

tena satyena te devi brahmahatyāṃ vyapohatu |
evaṃ maṃtra trayeṇaiva cābhi maṃtryakulaṃ śubhaṃ ||

pradadyāt kālikāyai ca naivedya mudareharet |
vedādi varuṇāṃtāṃ ca ṣaḍdīrghasvarabheditaṃ ||

śukraśāpavimācitāyai sudhādevyai namostute |
dvādaśadhā japenmaṃtraṃ śukraśāpa vimuktaye ||

māyayā ramayā vālā saṃvudhyaṃtā trivarṇakā |
śukraśāpaṃ vimocāya punastadvarṇakāṃtikā ||

<p. 115a>

yasyā upāsanā tasyā vījena puṭito manuḥ |
ṣoḍaśārṇastayākhyāto maṃtritāṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ ||
 
niḥśāpaṃ kurute sādhyaṃ bhuktimuktyaika bhājanaṃ |
vedādi vāruṇaṃ vījaṃ ṣaḍdīrghasvarabheditaṃ ||

brahmaśāpavimocitāyai sudhādevyai namostu ca |
daśakṛtyaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ brahmaśāpa vimuktaye ||

māyāśriyāṃkuśaṃ caiva ṣaḍdīrghaḥ svarabheditaṃ |
surākṛṣṇa svarūpāṃ te pāpaṃ mocaya tatparaṃ ||

amṛtaṃ śrāvayadvaṃdvaṃ vahnijāyā tataḥ paraṃ |
anena manunā maṃtrī kṛṣṇaśāpaṃ vimocayet ||

pavamānaḥ parānaṃdaḥ pavamānaḥ parorasaḥ |
pavamānaṃ paraṃ jñānaṃ tena te plāvayāmyahaṃ ||

ślokānetānpaṭhetpaścāddīpi mṛtaśīmanūn |
akhaṇḍaika rasānaṃda kalevara sudhātmani ||

svacchaṃdaḥ sphuraṇākāranidhejya mṛtarūpiṇī |
akulasthāmṛtākāre śuddhijñānakare pare ||

amṛtatvaṃ nidhehya smin vastūniṃ klinnarūpiṇī |
tadrūpiṇikarasyarśaṃ kṛtvāhyetatsvarūpiṇī ||

bhūtvā mṛtāparākāremapi visphuraṇaṃ kuru |
athavā mūlamuccārya suṣumṇā mūlavartmanā ||

pāpayitvāṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ dravyaśuddhiriyaṃ punaḥ |
anenaiva vidhānena vīraśuddhiṃ samācaret ||

dravyamadhye bhairavabhairavyorddhyānaṃ ||

sūryakoṭi pratīkāśaṃ caṃdrakoṭi suśītalaṃ |
aṣṭādaśabhujaṃ devaṃ paṃcavaktraṃ trilocanaṃ ||

amṛtārṇavamadhyasthaṃ brahmapadmo paristhitaṃ |
vṛṣārūḍhaṃ nīlakaṃṭhaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaṃ ||

kapālakhaṭvāṃgadharaṃ ghaṇṭhāḍamaruvādinaṃ |
pāśāṃkuśadharaṃ devaṃ gadā muśaladhāriṇaṃ ||

khaḍgakheṭakapaṭṭīśamudgaraṃ śūlakuṃtakaṃ |
vicitrakheṭakaṃ muṇḍaṃ varadā bhayapāṇinaṃ ||

lohitaṃ devadeveśaṃ bhāvayet sādhakottamaṃ |
evaṃ dhyātvā svamaṃtreṇa puṣpāṃjali trayaṃ kṣipet ||

tato ānaṃdabhairavīṃ dhyāyet ||

<p. 115b>

tasyotsaṃge surāṃ devīṃ caṃdrakoṭi yutaprabhāṃ |
himakundendudhavalāṃ paṃcavaktrāṃ trilocanāṃ ||

aṣṭādaśabhujairyuktāṃ sarvānaṃdavarodyatāṃ |
prahasaṃtīṃ viśālākṣīṃ devadevasya saṃmukhīṃ ||

athavā devadeveśamarddhanārīśvaraṃ smaret |
evaṃ dhyātvā svamaṃtreṇa pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ ||

śivacaṃdrau mātṛkāṃtaṃ tathā kṣamalavahnayaḥ |
vāyuśca vāmakarṇena bhūṣito viṃdunā tataḥ ||

vījame tat samuccārya tathā vā naṃdabhairavaṃ |
ṅentaṃ śikhāmastrayutaṃ pūrvavījaṃ tu saṃlikhet ||

caṃdrahitvādimaṃ kuryāt karṇe vāmākṣi yojayet |
surādevyai tato vauṣaḍiyamānaṃdabhairavī ||

anena manuyugmena dhyānapūrvaṃ yajeccatau |
māṁṣayācādi saṃyuktaṃ vahnimāyedu saṃyutaṃ ||

paramasvāmini prāṃte paramākāśa śunya ca |
vāhinī caṃdrapādāṃte sūryāgni bhakṣiṇīti ca ||

pātraṃ viśaviśa svāhā daśadhā prajapenmanuṃ |
vāṅmāyā kamalā prāṃte ānaṃdeśvari vidmahe ||

surādevyaidhīmahīti tannorddhanārīśvarīti |
pracodayāditi japedgāyatrī daśadhā sudhīḥ ||

tataśca bhāvayeddravyaṃ amṛtaṃ raktabhaṃ priye |
akathādi tripaṃktyā tu harakṣatrayamaṇḍitaṃ ||

pūrvokta yonimudrāyāṃ śivaśaktyostu saṃgame |
amṛtaṃ ciṃtayeddravyamaṣṭadhā amṛtāṃ japet ||

amṛtāmaṃtraḥ ||

aiṁ klīṁ hrauṁ ju sa ityuktvā amṛte amṛtodbhave |
amṛteśvarī amṛtavarṣaṇīti padaṃ vadet ||

amṛtaṃ prāvaya yugaṃ svāhāto dravyaśuddhaye |
amṛteśī manaḥ proktaḥ paṃcatriṃśadbhirakṣaraiḥ ||

dīpinī maṃtro yathā ||

vāgbhavaṃ vījayugmaṃ ca vāgvādinī vāgbhavaṃ |
klīṁ klinnekledinīkledaya mahākṣobhayamityapi ||

kuruyugmaṃ kāmavījaṃ sau mokṣaṃ kuru yugmakaṃ |
prāsādaḥ parāprāsādaḥ saptatriṃśadaśākṣaraḥ ||

dīpinī manurākhyātaḥ dravyaśuddhirvidhīyate ||

atha prakārāṃtaraśodhanaṃ ||

ghaṭaṃ hetuśca dravyeṇa pūrayedityanuvṛattau |
tatra yaṃtraṃ vilikhyādau yadyat kulasamudbhavaṃ ||

dhyātveṣṭa devatāṃ tatra japedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
dhenuyonī viciṃtyātha prasṛtaṃ tadviciṃtayet ||

dṛṣṭvā mṛtamupāttaṃ vai nṛtyaṃti yoginīgaṇāḥ |
nṛtyaṃti bhairavāḥ sarve nṛtyaṃti bhairavīgaṇāḥ ||

yadyatkula samudbhūtaṃ tattadyaṃtreṣu pūjayet |
evaṃ dhyātvā japedvidyā dvayaṃ ca sādhakottamaḥ ||

māyālakṣmī dvayasyāṃte namo bhagavatīti ca |
maheśvarī svarūpāṃte sarve paśujaneti ca ||

<p. 116a>

manaścakṣu tiraskāraṃ kuru dvaṃdvaṃ ca ṭhadvayaṃ |
tathānya tiraskariṇī lajjāṃ kāmeśvarīṃ tataḥ ||

vāṇīglau tiraskaraṇaṃ sakalajaneti vai tataḥ |
vāgvādinīti sakala paśu vratajaneti ca ||

manaścakṣu śotra jihvāghrāṇokṣi tiraskaraṇaṃ |
kuru dvayaṃ ṭhadvayañca sa visargaṃ śiro manuḥ ||

tasyopari svamūlaṃ ca varuṇaṃ saptadhā japet |
ityanena vidhānena dravyaśuddhiṃ samācaret ||

atha māṃsaśuddhiḥ ||

pretaviṣṇuriti maṃtraṃ sāṃ sa śuddhau niyojayet |
tryamvakasya tu maṃtreṇa matsya śuddhiṃ samācaret ||

tadviṣṇoriti maṃtreṇa tadviprāso munā tathā |
mudrāṃ tu śodhayenmaṃtrī devatā prītikārakaṃ || 

viṣṇuryoni manuṃmaṃtraṃ garbhaṃ dhehīti vai tathā |
kuṇḍagolotthayoḥ śuddhau sādhako viniyojayet ||

māṃsaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryāt tena siddhimupālabhet ||

oṃ pratadviṣṇustavatevīryeṇa mṛgo na bhīmaḥ kucarogavighnāḥ ||
yasyoruṣu triṣu vikramaṇe śuddhi bhavaṃti bhuvanāni viśvā ||

anena manunāmaṃtrī tridhā māṃsaṃ viśodhayet ||

atha matsyaśuddhiḥ ||

oṃ tryaṃvakaṃ yajāmahe sugaṃdhiṃ puṣṭivarddhanaṃ 
ūrvārukamivavaṃdhanānmṛtyormukṣīyamāmṛtāt ||

matsyaśuddhi manenaiva trivāraṃ sādhakaścaret |

atha mdrāśuddhiḥ ||

oṃ tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃ padaṃ sadāpaśyaṃti sūrayaḥ
divīvacakṣurātataṃ tadviprāso vipannavo jāgṛvāṃsaḥ samiṃdhate ||

viṣṇoryatparamaṃ padaṃ ||

mudrāṇāṃ śodhanaṃ kāryā trivāraṃ manunāmunā ||

atha kuladravyaśodhanam ||

svayaṃbhu kusumādīnāṃ śodhane manu ucyate ||

oṃ viṣṇuryoniṃ kalpayaṃtaḥ tvaṣṭrā rūpāṇipiṃśa tu ||

āsiṃca tu prajāpatirddhātā garbhaṃ dadhātu te |
grabhaṃdhehisinīvāli garbhaṃdhehi sarasvatī ||

garbhaṃ dhehyaśvinaudevāvādhattāṃ puṣkarasrajau |
tāraṃ kūrcāstramuddhṛtya śivādi trayaviṃduyuk ||

vahnijāyā ramāmāyā śrīvījaṃ suratapriye |
tāramāyāramāstraṃ ca vahnijāyāṃ catuṃdiraṃ ||

tato mṛtodbhavāye amṛtavarṣiṇī tatparaṃ |
priye devi padaṃ yuktaṃ śāpamocaya yugmakaṃ ||

amṛtaṃ ca śrāvayadvaṃdvamamṛtaṃ kuru yugmakaṃ |
vahnijāyāṃta maṃtreṇa śukraśuddhiṃ samācaret ||

<p. 116b>

glūṁ mlūṁ plūṁ nlūṁ klūṁ svāhā |

amṛte amṛtodbhave ||

amṛtavarṣiṇi amṛtaṃ śrāvaya śrāvaya svāhā ||

trivṛtyā puṣpaśuddhiṃ ca kārayet sādhakothavā ||

iti vajra puṣpaśodhanaṃ ||

saveṣāṃ śodhane mūlaṃ saptavāraṃ japenmanuṃ |
anenaiva vidhānena kuryāt paṃcamaśodhanaṃ ||

asādhyaṃ sādhayet sarvaṃ saṃpūjya paradevatām ||

atha pātrāsādanaṃ ||

śrīpātraghaṭayormadhye sarvapātrāṇi sthāpayet |
ghaṭāte śrīguroḥ pātraṃ bhogapātraṃtadaṃtike ||

tadaṃte śaktipātraṃ ca yogināṃ tadaṃtike |
tadaṃte vīrapātraṃ ca valeḥ pātraṃ tadaṃtike ||

pādyamācamanīyaṃ ca argheṇa navamaṃ viduḥ |
uttamaṃ navapātrāṇi saptapātrāṇi madhyamaṃ ||

kecidvadaṃti maṃtrajñā paṃcapātrāṇi madhyaṃ |
adhamaṃtrīṇi pātrāṇi pātrayugmaṃ tathaiva ca ||

ekapātraṃ na kurvīta yadi sākṣāt kuleśvaraḥ |
matrāḥ parāṅmukhāyāṃti kruddhā bhavati suṃdarī ||

ihaloke ca dāridryaṃ mṛte ca narakaṃ vrajet |
śrīgurorbhogapātrāṇi triṣu pātreṣvayaṃvidhiḥ ||

pūjāpātraṃ valeḥ pātraṃ paṃcapātreṣvayaṃvidhiḥ |
śaktipātraṃ vīrapātraṃ saptapātreṣvayaṃvidhiḥ ||

pādyamānīyaṃ ca navapātreṣṭhayaṃ vidhiḥ |
pūjāpātraṃ ca vijñeyaṃ yoginīnāṃ ca pūjayet ||

pādyamācamanīyaṃ ca valipātrāt pradāpayet |
pādyādīni ca sarvāṇi bhogapātrāt pradāpayet ||

pātradvaye maheśāni nirṇayaṃ yatnataḥ śṛṇu |
bhogapātraṃ śaktipātraṃ vīrapātraṃ ca yoginīṃ ||

valipātraṃ guroḥpātraṃ śrīpātreṇa prakalpayet |
sāmānyārghyaṃ ca śrīpātramekamavyanmaheśvarī ||

sāmānyārghyeṇa deveśi dravyāṇāṃ prokṣaṇaṃ bhavet |
śrīpātrena ca pūjā syāt sarvavijñāpitaṃ śivaṃ ||

sāmānyārghye ca dvārārghye viśeṣe tu viśeṣatā |
sāmānyārghyaṃ tu sāmānyāṃ śrīpātramekameva vā ||

tathāpi devadeveśi ghaṭapātrepyavaśyake |
kapālaṃ yadi deveśi tadaikapātraṃ mācaret ||

anyatraikaikapātratvaṃ kapāle sarvapātratā |
kapālapālapātre deveśi kāpālī siddhirasti ca ||

<p. 117a>

yadyadvāṃchati kāmāni guṭikāṃjana siddhayaḥ |
siddhadravyaṃ kāmagatiṃ manorathamayīkalāṃ ||

vāṃchā bhogānnavyamṛṣṭikaraṇaṃ caiva dṛśyatā |
ciṃtāmaṇiṃ kālamatāṃ yatpātre sarvameva ca ||

kāpālini turyasiddhiḥ kapālasiddhigocarā |
ekapātraṃ samānīya khaṃḍatritayabhedataḥ ||

atha mānamāhā ||

caturaṃgulamucchrāya māyāme dvādaśāṃgulaṃ |
aṣṭāṃgulaṃ sa viṣtāridroṇagrāhi jalaṃ yathā ||

tathā pātraṃ pūrṇadīkṣā sūryārghyādau prakīrtitaṃ |
viśeṣārghyaṃ maheśāni mānasasya parkīrtitaṃ ||

ṣaḍaṃgulaṃ ca vistīrṇaṃ muttānena samākṛti |
atha vā devadeveśi pātraṃ ca vartulī kṛtaṃ ||

aśvattha patrākāraṃ vā kutayākārameva vā |
trikoṇākārapātraṃ ca tristriyoni samanvitaṃ ||

madhye viṃduyutaṃ pātraṃ dhvajacihna samanvitaṃ |
atha vā tu bhagākāraṃ dhvajaviṃduḥ sa keśaraṃ ||

evaṃ pātraṃ samānīya mahācīneśvarīṃ yajet ||

atha pātramāha ||

nārikela svarṇatāmrakā ca śaktiḥ śilodbhavaṃ |
śaṃkhasaddārukurmotthaṃ kapālājāṃ ca mṛṇmayaṃ ||

uttamaṃ madhyamaṃ hīnaṃ viprādīnāṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
nāti sthūlaṃ nāti sūkṣmaṃ chinnaṃ vivarjayet ||

tāmrakāṃśyādibhirlohaiḥ pātraṃ naiva tu kārayet |
sarvasiddhiḥ savarṇesyādudyamastālapātrataḥ ||

śāṃtiḥ śilāyāṃ staṃbhastu mṛṇmayaṃ nārikelaje |
vaśyādyaṃ kūrmaje jñānaṃ bhuktimukti pradāyinī ||

puṇyavṛkṣajapātraṃ tu pāpaghnaṃ mṛtyunāśakṛt |
kapāle vīrasaṃsiddhiralāvau yogasiddhayaḥ ||

kāṃsyasyāpyatha rūpyasya śaive śaṃkhacarī harau |
mahāśaṃkho vāmamārge sphāṭikaṃ grahanāyake ||

viśvāmitre kapālaṃ tu sarvapātrottamottamaṃ |
brahmahatyādi pāpāni tathā viśvāsaghātakaṃ ||

dṛṣṭvāpātraṃ nārikelaṃ sarvameva praṇaśyati |
kanyākoṭi pradānāni tathā hema śatāni ca ||

yo dadāti maheśāni rāhudyaste divākare |
tat phalaṃ koṭiguṇitaṃ nārikelārghyapātrataḥ ||

alābhe tasya pātrasya anyapātreṇa pūjayet ||

idamapi mahāśaṃkhetaraparaṃ ||

tathā ca ||

mahāśaṃkhamayaṃ pātraṃ jñeyaṃ sarvottamottamaṃ |
nārikelābhidhaṃ devi jñeyaṃ cottama madhyamaṃ ||

raktapātraṃ tu suśroṇi jñeyaṃ cottamakalpakaṃ ||

atha mahāpātrādānamāha ||

<p. 117b>

ādau muṇḍavidhānaṃ ca proktaṃ tat kathyate śṛṇu |
sarvamuṇḍe vidhirayaṃ śūlā protādike śṛṇuṃ ||

taruṇaṃ suṃdaraṃ śūraṃ saṃmukhe raṇavartitaṃ |
parāyaṇa viśūnyaṃ ca kakārāṣṭakavarjitaṃ ||

yaṣṭi prabhṛtyastra viddhaṃ yadāśūlena pātitaṃ |
cāṇḍālādyabhibhūtaṃ ca śīghraṃ siddhipradāyakaṃ ||

śanibhaumādine vāpi śarīre mṛtasaṃbhave |
kālarātryāṃ vīrarātryāṃ moharātryāmathāṃvike ||

mahārātryāṃ caturdaśyāmaṣṭamyāṃ pakṣayugmake |
dīpotsava caturdaśyāṃ grahaṇe saṃkramepi vā ||

vīraveṣaṃ samāsādyaṃ muktakeśo digaṃvaraḥ |
siṃdūra kūrcatilako surāsaṃvitpradāyakaḥ ||

gatvā śūlasthale devi sarvadravya samanvitaḥ |
tāṃvūlaṃ vijayā khaḍgaṃ siṃdūraṃ vijayāṃ tathā ||

pāṣāṇamāṃsamadyādi kāraṇādīdhi pārvatī |
sāmagrīṃ sa kalāṃ kṛtvā sthale gehe viśodhya ca ||

kṛtvā yatnena deveśi śivā pūjāpurassaraṃ |
śivāmabhyarcya yatnena tato śūraṃ prapūjayet ||

śūlaṃ saṃpūjayeddevi samādānaṃ tataścaret |
śūlarāja mahākrūra sarvabhūtapriyaṃkaraḥ ||

siddhiṃ saṃkalpitāṃ devi vajraśūla namostute |
kṛtvā vai jāgṛyādvīraṃ tadaṃte khaḍgapūjanaṃ ||

tacchūlasthaṃ śavaṃ pūjyaṃ dhūpadīpopacārakaiḥ |
tāṃvūlailālavaṃgādi karpūrāgurusaṃyutaiḥ ||

dravyaiḥ saṃpūjya deveśi khaḍgaṃ pūjya prayatnataḥ |
kālī khaḍga samudbhūta sarvasiddhi pradāyakaḥ ||

kaviciṃtāmaṇitvaṃ ca khaḍgamuṇḍanamostute |
vīravīra mahāvīraḥ ṣaṣṭhisiddhiḥ pradarśakaḥ ||

kavikalpalatātvaṃ ca prasanno bhavasatvaraṃ |
anena mūlamaṃtreṇa prārthyakartanamācaret ||

svayaṃ ca kartayedvīyaṃ brahmāṇḍa valimarpayet |
paṃcagavyena militaṃ muṇḍamācchādya vā haret ||

gṛhevānīya deveśi hastārddhamānatasthale |
sarvāḥ sāmagrī kṛtvādau muṇḍaprāṇān pratiṣṭhayet ||

khādirādīn kīlakāṃstaddaśadikṣu nikhātayet |
tatra sthitvā valiṃ datvā japapūjāparāyaṇaḥ || 

<p. 118a>

staddarśanādghoramaṃtrau yathā pāśupatādi ca |
jayadurgā maheśāni vīrārdanamanaṃtaraṃ ||

etairanyaistrayodaśabhiḥsthāna sādhanapūrvakaṃ |
bhūmau saṃsthāpya deveśi yatra nyāsaḥ samāni ca ||

sthāpya sthitvā japaṃ kṛtvā tatra pūjya maheśvarī |
divārātri krameṇaiva japellakṣadvayaṃ śive ||

homatarpaṇakaṃ devimārjanaṃ dvijabhojanaṃ |
kṛtvā saṃsādhitaṃ muṇḍaṃ siddhamuṇḍaṃ bhavecchive ||

evaṃ sādhita muṇḍasya phalaṃ siddhyaṣṭakaṃkare |
saṃsādhikena muṇḍena mālāpātrādikaṃ caret ||

anyathā kurute yastu tasya siddhirna jāyate |
mālāyaṃtraṃ tathā pātraṃ tadaṃte siddhimuṇḍataḥ ||

kārayed yat tato devi samayācāra tatparaḥ |
samiddhaḥ siddhidoloke kalikalpadrumo bhavet ||

sarvaśāstrārtha cettāsyānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
sadyaḥ kṛtaṃ trirātraṃsyaṃ saptarātrasthagaṃ tathā ||

trisaptarātra madhyasya tatravādi kramāchṛṇu |
uttamaṃ madhyamaṃ caiva hyadhamaṃtvadhamādhamaṃ ||

sadyaḥ kṛtyaṃ trayanmuṇḍamuttamaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
ṣaḍrātrottaragaṃ muṇḍamadhyamaṃ parikīrtitaṃ || 

trisaptarātramadhyasthaṃ kīrtitaṃ hyadhamādhamaṃ |
sadyaḥ kṛttaṃ tu yanmuṇḍaṃ sarvakārye prakīrtitaṃ ||

trirātramadhyamaṃ muṇḍamālā yaṃtraḥ prakīrtitaṃ |
ṣaḍrātrottaragaṃ muṇḍaṃ pātre kāryavinirdiśet ||

atha māhāpātralakṣaṇaṃ ||

māhāpātrasya deveśi lakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ |
gomukhaṃ gajapṛṣṭaṃ ca gajakuṃbhaṃ tathaiva ca ||

kūrmapṛṣṭo kaṭiścaiva śaktipātraṃ tathaiva ca |
khaṇḍapadmasamākhyātaṃ lakṣaṇānihyataḥ śṛṇu ||

dīrghākāraṃ tathā pṛṣṭhaṃ agre tīkṣṇaṃ prajāyate |
gomukhaṃ kathitaṃ devi kapālaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

dīrghaṃ samunnataṃ madhye pārśve naiva susaṃsthitaṃ |
vistīrṇaṃ ca tathā pṛṣṭhe gajāpṛṣṭhā kṛtiṃ tava ||

madhye samunnataṃ yastu kapāla parimaṇḍalaṃ |
kūrmapṛṣṭa samākāraṃ kūrmapṛṣṭhaṃ taducyate ||

lalāṭāccaulakaṃ yāvadrekhāsaṃdhyuḥ prajāyate |
ṣaṭkhaṇḍastu bhavedyastu śaktipātraṃ tu tadviduḥ ||

<p. 118b>

samapṛṣṭeṣu yacchṛgaṃ vimnaṃ vāpi tathocchritaṃ |
madhye caiva samākhyātaṃ padmapātraṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

śṛṣiraṃtargate yastu śikhāyāṃ varavarṇinī |
ekadvitrīṇi catvāri jātayaḥ syurdvijāditaḥ ||

ekachidraṃ bhavedviprodvikṣidraṃ kṣatriyaḥ smṛtaḥ |
trichidraṃ vaiśyamityuktaścatuśchidraṃ tu śūdrakaṃ ||

chidrāstu cānyajātiśca kapālāni bhavaṃti hi |
achidraṃ tu tyajeccaiva kapālaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||

caturvarṇaṃ tu yatpātraṃ tadgrāhyaṃ lakṣaṇānvitaṃ |
anyajātīni pātrāṇi sādhakaiḥ parivarjayet ||

śyāmavarṇa mahāvyādhiḥ kṛṣṇe ca maraṇaṃ bhavet |
saṃtāpaṃ raktavarṇena miśravarṇena kiṃcana ||

raktavarṇaṃ tu cāgneyaṃ sphaṭikaṃ sarvato bhavet |
tadgrāhya sādhakaṃ deśabhuktimukti phalapradaṃ ||

go navanīta saṃkāśaṃ snigdhaḥ chāyā tu muktidaṃ |
śuklavarṇaṃ hi yadukṣyaṃ mumukṣūṇāṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

vartulaṃ strīkapālaṃ syāt dvipuṭaṃ mokṣadāyakaṃ |
ekapuṭāni śastāni durlabhāni bhavaṃtyapi ||

dvipuṭāni tu grāhyāṇi lakṣaṇaistu yutāni vai |
ekakhaṇḍaṃ kapālendraṃ durlabhaṃ tridaśairapi ||

tena hastasthite naiva vidyādhara padaṃ labhet |
dvikhaṇḍaṃ ca trikhaṃḍaṃ ca bhuktimukti prakīrtitaṃ ||

catuḥkhaṃḍaṃ ca yatpātraṃ caturvargapradaṃ tu tat |
paṃcakhaṃḍaṃ ca ṣaṭkhaṃḍaṃ saptakhaṃḍa manukramāt ||

śatakhaṃḍāṃtakaṃ devi bhāgye naiva tu labhyate ||

atha strīpātrasy sthāpanamāha ||

sādhyasādhakayormadhye ṣaṭtriṃśadaṃgulaṃ bhavet |
dvādaśāṃgulamūrddhaṃ ca adhobhāge tathāṃgulaṃ ||

dvādaśāṃgulamadhyasthaṃ tatra saṃsthāpayedvudhaḥ |
svārthaṃ ca dvādaśāṃtyaktvā devārthaṃ dvādaśaṃ tyajet ||

dvādaśāṃgula madhyasthaṃ tatracārghyaṃ nidhāpayet ||

atha maṇḍalānāmāvaśyaka pūrvaka lakṣaṇamāha ||

maṇḍalena vinā pūjā viphalāṃ parikīrtitā |
tasmāt maṇḍalamālikhya vidhivat tatra pūjayet ||

<p. 119a>

akhaṃḍa maṃḍalākāraṃ viśvavyāpya vyavasthitam |
trailokyaṃ maṇḍitaṃ yena maṇḍalaṃ tat sadāśivaṃ ||

udyānaṃ caturasraṃ syāt kāmarūpaṃ tu vartulaṃ |
jālaṃdharaṃ cārddhacaṃdraṃ pūrṇaṃ pūrṇagirirmataḥ ||

abhyarcyamaṃḍalaṃ paścādādhāraṃ sthāpayet kramāt ||

atha arghyaṃ dravyamāha ||

surayārghya pradānena yoginīnāṃ bhavet priyaḥ |
mahāyogī bhaveddevī pīṭhaṃ prakṣyālyatairjalaiḥ ||

atha māhāpātraśodhanaṃ ||

pātrāṇāṃ śodhanaṃ devi śṛṇu yatnena sāṃprataṃ |
iṃdro tadāditaḥ seṃdurmaṃtreṇānena mārjayet ||

dhruvaṃ maṇḍalamaṃtreṇa bhūgṛhaṃ vṛtta vahniyuk |
kuryāt tatrādhāraśaktiḥ kūrmītaṃ tān prapūjayet || 

vyomāgni śaktisahita sastume taddhruvādikaṃ |
anena manunādhāraṃ sthāpayet tatra maṃtravit ||

vahnimaṇḍalametasmin pūjayet tadanaṃtaraṃ |
krodhavījāstra vījābhyāmādhārekṣālitaṃ śubhaṃ ||

mahāśaṃkhaṃ mahāmaṃtrī sthāpayet strīṃ paṭhanaṃ tat |
śikhāṃ dīrghatrayopetāṃ kālī brahmāramāgnyutāṃ ||

dīrghaḥ śacīpatircāyu hṛdayaṃ manmathāṃtikaṃ |
dīrghatraya samopetaṃ tāriṇī pūrvavat punaḥ ||

śivaṃ dīrghatrayopetaṃ nīlāśabdāttu pūrvavat |
māyāṃśarāṃtimaṃ śaṃbhu vāmakarṇeṃdu saṃyutaṃ ||

sarvakāmaḥ kālarātrirdīrghākāya padāt tataḥ |
sarvādhārāya sarvāya sarvodbhavāya śabdataḥ ||

sarvaśuddhimayā yātha sarvāsurapadāt tataḥ |
rudhirāruṇāya padāchubhrāya surabhājanaṃ ||

āyadevī kapālāya hṛdayāṃto manurmataḥ |
ebhiścaturbhirmanubhirmahāśaṃkhaṃ prapūjayet ||

tatrāsāralayaṃ maṃtrī maṇḍalaṃ tigmaroviṣaṃ |
mūlena pūrayettoyaṃ sudhā vudhyā vidhānavat ||

gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatān kṣiptvā trikhaṃḍāṃ darśayet tataḥ |
pīyūṣa rocito devi maṇḍalaṃ tatra pūjayet ||

vācaśaktirameśakti manusvarasamanvitaṃ |
mūletattīya bhairavyāṃ krodhavījaṃ samjjvalaṃ ||

<p. 119b>

anena manunāmaṃtrī bhāvayedaṣṭamoṣṭataṃ |
śaktyā sudhāṃ viniḥkṣipyaśaṃkhaṃ yoniṃ pradarśayet ||

viśeṣārghyokta vidhinā sarvameva puroktavat |
evaṃ yathoktavidhinā kapālaṃ pātramuttamaṃ ||

anena pātravaryeṇa sādhayediṣṭa sādhanaṃ |
vāṃchā siddhiṃ khecarīṃ ca parakāya praveśanaṃ ||

manoratho divyadṛṣṭi vetālagutike tathā |
rasaṃ rasāyanaṃ caiva sādhayediṣṭa sādhanaṃ ||

vāparṇa vījasaṃdi pādukā yakṣiṇīgaṇaṃ |
khaḍgasiddhiḥ kuṃtasiddhiṃ pāśaṃ vā janameva ca ||

sṛṣṭisiddhirbhairavāṣṭa mahākapālinī śive |
kapālārghyeṇa deveśi sarvāḥ siddhyaṃti niścitaṃ ||

athārghya sthāpanaṃ ||

tatorghyaṃ sthāpayenmaṃtrī svavāme surasuṃdarī |
kalaśāddakṣiṇe bhāge trikoṇaṃ vṛttasaṃyutaṃ ||

ṣaṭkoṇaṃ caturasraṃ ca kṛtvā tanmadhyabhāgataḥ |
vilasaccaṃdra sakalaṃ gaṃdharvaṃ ca samālikhet ||

ojāpūpādikaṃ pīṭhaṃ taccaturdikṣu pūjayet |
aṃgamaṃtraiśca ṣaṭkoṇe śaktau mūla tribhedataḥ ||

ādhāraśaktiṃ saṃpūjya pūrvavadyaṃ trikāmapi |
mahāśaṃkhaṃ nārikelaṃ sauvarṇaṃ rājaṃtaṃ tathā ||

tāmraṃ śaktyudbhavaṃ vāpi pātraṃ tatra nidhāpayet |
samarcya pūrvayanmaṃtrī kuṃbhadravyeṇa pūrayet ||

ādhāraṃ trividhaṃ prāhuḥ ṣaṭpadaṃ vā catuṣpadaṃ |
atha vā vartulākāraṃ kuryāddevi manoharaṃ ||

padmābhaṃ vā trikoṇaṃ vā yonyābhaṃ dhātujaṃtutaḥ |
ādhāreṇa vinābhraṃśo na hi tuṣyaṃti devatāḥ ||

tasmādvidhivadādhāraṃ kalpayet kulanāyike |
dikṣu cāstraṃ samabhyarcya śaṃkhādhāraṃ pravinyaset |

mūlena kṣālitaṃ śaṃkhādhāraṃ saṃsthāpyayāmi ca |
kālaṃ sa viṃḍukaṃ tadvadbhujaṃ śeśaṃ samuddharet ||

vahnyaṃte maṇḍalāyeti tathā dharmapradeti ca |
daśakalātmane coktvā namo gaṃdhādibhiryajet || 

śastreṇakṣālitaṃ śaṃkhaṃ tatrasaṃsthāpya pūjayet |
arghamānaṃ tu prādeśaṃ caturaṃgulamucchritaṃ ||

<p. 120a>

arghapātramiti proktaṃ sthāpayāmīti maṃtrataḥ |
amarkamaṇḍalāyeti vadedvādaśa ityatha ||

kalātmane padaścoktvā arghapātraya hṛnmanuḥ |
anena śaṃkhamabhyarcyakalāḥ sūryasya pūjayet ||

samarcya pūrvavanmaṃtrī śaṃkhaṃ dravyeṇa pūrayet |
saṃspṛṣṭvārcanapātraṃ tu pūjayeddhetu mudrayā || 

brahmāṇḍakhaṇḍasaṃbhūtamaśeṣa rasamaṃmitaṃ |
āpūritaṃ mahāpātraṃ pīyūṣarasamāvahet ||

japan vilomato varṇān mūlamaṃtraḥ samujjvalān |
saṃpūjya pūrvavat tatra vṛttaṃ ṣaṭkoṇamālikhet ||

akathādi trirekhāṃtaṃ trikoṇaṃ vṛttamadhyataḥ |
mūlakhaṇḍatrayeṇātha trikoṇaṃ paripūjayet ||

ṣaṭkoṇe ca ṣaḍaṃgāni tatastīrthamayaṃ smaret |
ānaṃdabhairavaṃ dhyātvā samabhyarcya vidhānataḥ ||

pūjayet paṃcaratnāni kuladravyāṇi niḥkṣipet |
tatra māṣa pramāṇaṃ tu māṃsamatsyādi niḥkṣipet ||

kulāmṛtaṃ samādāya tatrārghe niḥkṣipedbudhaḥ |
tataḥ somakalāḥ pūjyā sādhakairnirmalāśayaiḥ ||

racayet pūrvavaccheṣamayamarghavidhiḥ smṛtaḥ |
kulāmṛtā tadānaṃ tu dutaṃ yajane vakṣyāmaḥ ||

bhauvaneśīramarāmā kāmā yoginyanaṃtaraṃ |
śākinī ca kramāt saptavījāni sthairyabhāṃji hi ||

aṣṭamaṃ tu parijñeyaṃ vījaṃ tribhuvaneśvarī |
tattallokādimo varṇohyavatṣu pariviṣṭitaḥ ||

gamanaṃ svargamartyau ca pātālaṃ nāga eva ca |
vigṛhyarala śabdena ṅeṃtena kila hṛtkṣuṣā ||

dhūmrārciruṣmājvalinī jvālinī visphuliṃginī |
saḥ śrīḥsarūpā kapilāhavyakavya vahetyapi ||

āgneyyāyādi varṇādyā daśadharma pradāḥ kalāḥ |
tapinī tāpinī dhūmrāmarīci jvālinī ruciḥ ||

suṣumṇā bhogadā viśvāvodhinī dhāriṇī kṣamāḥ |
kalādyāḥ vasudāḥ saudāḥ phaḍaṃtā dvādaśeritā ||

amṛtāmānadā pūṣā tuṣṭipuṣṭiratirddhṛtiḥ |
śaśinī caṃdrikā kāṃti jyotsnā śrīḥprītiraṃgadā ||

<p. 120b>

pūrṇā pūrṇāmṛtā ceti kathitāḥ kulavāpike |
saumyāḥ kāmapradāyinyaḥ ṣoḍaśasvarajāḥ kalāḥ ||

prāgvattīrthaṃ samāvāhya tīrthamaṃtreṇa tatra ca |
saṃyojya netramaṃtreṇa puṣpanyasya śikhāmunā ||

pradarśyagālinī mudrāṃ mudrayā dhenu saṃjñayā |
amṛtīkṛtya vidhivat sudhāvīje ca sādhakaḥ ||

dhyātveṣṭa devatāṃ tatra sakalī kṛtya sādhakaḥ |
aṃganyāsasya cāstreṇa kalayecca diśodaśaṃ ||

netramaṃtreṇa saṃvīkṣya mudrayā śaṃkha saṃjñayā |
gaṃdhapuṣpāṃdibhistatra pūjayediṣṭadevatāṃ ||

ṣaḍaṃgāni ca saṃpūjya maṃtrayen mūlamaṃtrataḥ |
abhicāreṣu kāryeṣu vilomena japediti ||

aṣṭakṛtva tathā cārghyaṃ chādayen matsyarūpiṇī |
kaniṣṭhāṃguṣṭhakau yuktaṃ karayoritaretaraṃ ||

tarjanīmadhyamābhyāṃ ca saṃhatābhugnavarjitāḥ |
mudraiṣāgālinī proktā śaṃkhasyo paricālitā ||

kalaśokta vidhānena sthāpayet pātrasaṃtatiṃ |
puṣpādinā samuddhṛtya viṃduṃśaṃkhāmṛtasya ca ||

niḥkṣipet sarvapātreṣu sarvaṃ divyaviciṃtayet |
ekaṃ pātrāṇi saṃsthāpya te naiva tarpaṇaṃ caret ||

atrādau śarīrasthaṃ devatarpaṇaṃ ||

śuddhe dravyeṇa tenāpi gaṃdhapuṣpākṣaṃtairapi |
nyāsokta sarvamaṃtraiśca svātmānaṃ plāvayet tathā ||

mūrddhni śrīgurupaktiṃ ca mūlādhāre tu pādukāṃ |
divyaughaṃ tarpayedādau ādināthaḥ sadāśivaḥ ||

īśvaro rudraviṣṇuśca brahmāpatnīyutāstime |
bhavaṃti dvādaśa ca te siddhau ghaṇṭhān pratarpayet ||

sanakādyāśca catvāraḥ su jātaścārubhūṣitaḥ |
sanatkumāro vyāsaśca vāmadevaḥ sakastathā ||

dattātreyo raivatako dvādaśaitetha mānavān |
tarpayet ṣaṭ nṛsiṃhaṃ ca maheśaṃ bhāskaraṃ tathā ||

maheṃdraṃ mādhavaṃ viṣṇuṃ nāmāṃte tu prayojayet |
mahāśivaṃ ca siddhaughe mānavaughe sadāśivaṃ ||

śivaṃ tu paramaṃ divyaṃ pīṭhapūjāṃ tataścaret ||

ete kaula vāmayoḥ sāmānya guravaḥ ||

brahmaraṃdhre svakemaṃtrī mudrayā tatvasaṃjñayā |
tarpayed gurupātrīya dravyeṇaugha trayaṃ sudhīḥ ||

<p. 121a>

svagurūnapi saṃtarpya trissakṛdvā viśeṣataḥ |
ātmano hṛdayāṃbhoje parigaṇāvṛtāṃ ||

devī pātrāmṛtenāpi tarpayet kulanāyikāṃ |
śuddhidravyaṃ samādāya tarpaṇaṃ tatvamudrayā ||

aṃguṣṭha tarjanīmadhye śuddhiṃ saṃgṛhya vāmataḥ |
vāmena dakṣiṇe vāpi devīṃ saṃtarpayet sudhīḥ ||

atha tatvaśuddhiṃ kuryāt ||

oṃ prāṇāyānavyānodāna samānāse śuddhyaṃtāṃ jyotirahaṃ virajāmi vipāpmā 
bhūyā saṃsvāhā ||

oṃ pṛthivyaptejā vāyvākāśāni me śuddhyaṃtāṃ jyoti ||

oṃ prakṛtya haṃkāra vuddhimanaḥ śrotrāṇi me śuddhyaṃtāṃ ||

oṃ tvak cakṣuḥ śrotrajihvāghrāṇavacāṃsi me śuddhyaṃtāṃ ||

oṃ pāṇipādapādyūpastha śabdā me śuddhyaṃtāṃ ||

oṃ sparśarūparasagaṃdhākāśāni me śuddhyaṃtāṃ ||

oṃ vāyustejaḥ salilabhūmyātmāno me śuddhyaṃtāṃ ||

saptamaṃ trān parāmṛṣya hastābhyāṃ saptadhā punaḥ ||
sarvāṃgaṃ saṃspṛśenmaṃtrī tatvaśuddhiriyaṃ matā ||

atha vaṭukādi validānaṃ ||

avaśyamādau vāmādau kuryād vaṭukapūjanaṃ |
mārgesmin vaṭuko mukhyaḥ surādyaṃtenarmitā ||

vinā taṃtu na gṛhnaṃti devāstasmāttadarcanaṃ |
apūjya vaṭukaṃ yaṃ tu mohāddevaṃ prapūjayet ||

tasya pūjāphalaṃ nāsti vaṭukaśca kupyati |
sa gaṇaṃ pūjayet tasmādgaṃdhapuṣpā savāmiṣaiḥ ||

tat tanmaṃtrairvidhānena devatā prītimāpnuyāt |
īśāna vahni nair(-)ṛtya vāyukoṇeṣu pūrvavat ||

maṇḍalāni vidhāyātha pūrvavat pūjayet priye |
pūrvavad validānaśca dadyāt sarvasamṛddhaye ||

vaṭukāya maheśāni yoginībhyaśca vallabhe |
gaṇeśakṣetrapālābhyāṃ pūrvavadvalimutsṛjet ||

dakṣiṇe vaṭuke dadyāduttare yoginī valiṃ |
sarvabhūta valiṃ dadyāt kṣetrapālāya paścime ||

aṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ tu vaṭukāya valirmataḥ |
kaniṣṭhāṃguṣṭha yogena yoginī valimāharet ||

<p. 121b>

aṃguṣṭhā tarjanībhyāṃ ca kṣetrapāla valiṃ haret |
tāratrayaṃ tato devī putroktvā vaṭuketi ca ||

nātheti kapilajaṭābhārabhāsvarapiṃgala |
trinetrāgnirjvālāmukha imāṃ pūjāṃ valiṃ vadet ||

gṛhna gṛhna hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

ṣaṭ catvāriṃśaddarśakaḥ ||

maṃtramevaṃ samuccārya tataḥ ślokapaṭhedidaṃ |
validānena saṃtuṣṭo vaṭukaḥ sarvasiddhidaḥ ||

śāṃtiṃ karotu me nityaṃ bhūtavetālasevitaḥ |
tāratrayaṃ sarvapūrvettyaḥ saṃtāni vadet kramāt ||

yoginī būtabhūtādhipatītha ca ḍākinī ||

śākinī trailokyavāsinī imāṃ pūjāṃ valiṃ gṛhna gṛhna hūṁ phaṭ tathā 
svāhā |
ekapaṃcāśadakṣaraḥ yākācidyoginī raudrā saumyā ghoratarāparā ||

khecarī bhūcarī vyomacārī prītistu me sadā ||

ūrddhvaṃ brahmāṇḍatoyādi gaganatale bhūtale niṣkale pātāle vā'nale vā 
salilapavanayoryatra tatra sthito vā |
kṣetre pīṭhopapīṭhādiṣu ca kṛtapadāḥ puṣpadhūpādike na prītā devyassadānaḥ 
śubhavali vidhināyāṃ tu deveṃdratulyāḥ ||

etadaṃte maheśāni yāṃ vījaṃ yoginī tataḥ |
bhyaḥ svāhā sarvavarṇāṃte yogināṃ padamālikhet ||

kavacaṃ cāstramālikhya vahnijāyāṃ punarlikhet |
anunamanunādevī yoginī valimāharet ||

tālatrayaṃ tathaihye hi devīputra vaṭūkanā |
thocchiṣṭahāriṇe hūṁ hūṁ phaṃ hūṁ vāṃ radvayaṃ vadet ||

kṣetrapāleti sarveti vighnānnāśaya yugmakaṃ |
sarvopacāraḥ sahitāmimāṃ pūjāvaliṃ dadet ||

gṛhnagṛhna hūṃ phaṭ svāhā catuḥṣaṣṭhyakṣaro manuḥ |
kṣetrapālasya saṃproktaḥ sarvasiddhipradāyakaḥ ||

yasmin kṣatranivāsī ca kṣatrapālasya kiṃkaraḥ |
prītoyaṃ validānena sarvarakṣāṃ karotu me ||

anena manunā devī kṣetrapāla valiṃ haret ||

gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ trayamālikhya ṅentaṃ gaṇapatiṃ vadet |
varāṃte varadāṃte ca sarvāṃte janamālikhet ||

<p. 122a>

mevaśaṃ cānayet yuktvā valiṃ gṛhna dvidhāpadaṃ |
vahnijāyānvito maṃtrogaṇapasya valiṃ haret ||

vāmabhāge kṛtasyātha maṇḍalasyo parikṣipet |
ādhāraṃ pūjayet tatra pātraṃ cānnodakānvitaṃ ||

svakāraṇaṃ maṃtrayitvā sarvabhūta valiṃ haret |
ṣoḍaśārṇena manunā trivāraṃ vīravaṃdite ||

tāraṃ ca bhuvaneśāni sarvavighna padaṃ tataḥ |
kṛdbhyaśca sarvabhūtebhyo hūṃkāraṃ vahnivallabhāṃ ||

samuccaran valiṃ dadyān mudrayā tatva saṃjñayā |
tātratrayaṃ vadet sarvabhūtebhyaḥ sarva eva ca ||

paṃcādbhūtapatibhyo hṛduḥ saptadaśākṣaraḥ |
bhūtā ye vividhākārā divyabhaumāṃtarīkṣagāḥ ||

pātātala saṃsthāśca śivayogena bhāṣitāḥ |
dhruvādyāḥ satyasaṃdhāśu iṃdrādyāśca vyavasthitāḥ ||

tṛpyaṃtu pretamānaso bhūtā gṛhnaṃ tvimaṃ valiṃ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau kaulavāmayoḥ sāmānyanityārcanāyāṃ 
tanmārgotpattipūrvaka śrīpātrādisthāpanāṃtanirṇayo nāmāṣṭādaśaḥ 
prakāśaḥ] || 18 ||
atha pūjāmāha ||

paśuvīradivyabhedāt pūjāsthānaṃ tridhā mataṃ |
gauṇaṃ mukhyaṃ cottamaṃ ca tadidānīṃ nigadyate ||

paśūnāṃ kalpite yaṃtre pūjāgauṇī prakīrtitāṃ |
vīrāṇāṃ likhite yaṃtre viṃdau śakteśca sthāpanaṃ ||

sveṣṭarūpāṃvatāṃ dhyātvā pūjanāt mukhyatāṃ gatā |
divyānāṃ divyacakre tu pūjanaṃ cottamaṃ mataṃ ||

jīva cakre maheśāni prasannāsti niraṃtaraṃ |
jīvacakrasya vijñānī kalau durlabha eva ca ||

vālukāyā bhavettailaṃ vaṃdhyāputraṃ prasūyate |
khepuṣpamapi jāyaṃte ayonirmanujo pivā ||

jīvackrasya vijñānī kalau kvāpi na bhairavet |
agrasthānaṃ parityajya bhikṣāmaṭatidurmatiḥ ||

tathā jīvaṃ parityajya paridhāvati dhāvati |
aho jīvasya vijñānī śivatulyo naro bhavet ||

kalpite vā mahādevī sāṃgāṃ sāvaraṇāṃ yajet |
saṃpūjya pīṭhapūjāṃtaṃ tasmin siṃhāsanetha vā ||

abhedavudhyā deveśi akṣatāṃ sthāpya pūjayet |
pīṭhapūjā samācārya paṃcopacāratorcayet ||

<p. 122b>

pūjya siṃhāsane sthāpya sudhāsiṃdhau samarcayet |
tatpīṭhaṃ tu bhavedekaṃ sarvāsāṃ pīṭhamuttamaṃ ||

mukhyaṃ tu devadeveśi yaṃtre pīṭhaṃ samarcayet |
tadyaṃtraṃ siṃhapīṭhe tu sa pīṭhāṃ sthāpayecchive ||

sā pīṭhā tatra deveśi bhavedā vṛttidevatā |
pīṭhā vṛttiśca vā kāryā sarveṣāmatamīritaṃ ||

tatra pīṭhe mahāyaṃtraṃ sveṣṭa devātmakaṃ mahat |
jīvacakretha vā yaṃtraṃ bhāvyaṃ likhyaṃ maheśvarī ||

eteṣāmabhāve pūjāsthānamāha ||

liṃgesthaṃtrilavahyostu phalake mūrddhni maṇḍale |
mūrtau kuḍye ca hṛdaye pūjā daśa su kīrtitā ||

arūpaṃ rūpiṇaṃ kṛtvā karmakāṃḍaratājanāḥ |
gavāṃ sarvāṃ gajaṃ kṣīraṃ prasavet stanmukhādyathā ||

tathā sarvamato devaḥ pratimādau virājite |
ābhimukhyārci viṃvasya pūjāyāśca viśeṣataḥ ||

sādhakasya ca viśvāsāt sānnidhyaṃ devatā labhet |
gavāṃ sarveśarīrasthaṃ na karotyātmayoṣaṇaṃ ||

sukarma racitaṃ dattaṃ punastāneva poṣayet |
evaṃ sarvaśarīrasthaḥ sarpicet parameśvaraḥ ||

upāsanā vinā devi na dadāti phalaṃ nṛṇāṃ ||

atha pīṭhapūjā ||

pīṭhapūjā vidhānena pīṭhaṃ saṃpūjayedbudhaḥ ||

tata āvāhayeddevīṃ maṃtrābhyāṃ pūjayet tathā |
mahāpadmavanāṃtasthe kāraṇānaṃta vigrahe ||

sarvabhūtahite mātarehye hi parameśvarī |
deveśi bhakti sulabhe sarvāvaraṇa saṃyute ||

yāvattvāṃ pūjayāmīha tāvattvaṃ susthirā bhava |
dhyātvā mudrāṃ pradarśyātha gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ ||

cinmayasyā prameyasya nirguṇasyā śarīriṇāḥ |
sādhakānāṃ hitārthāya brahmaṇorūpakalpanā ||

sakalīkṛtya tatprāṇāṃtadīyānīṃdriyāṇi ca |
pratiṣṭhāpyārcayeddevānanyathā niḥphalaṃ mataṃ ||

maṃtrahīnaṃ kriyāhīnaṃ taṃtrahīnaṃ ca yadbhavet |
yadyat sādhayate sarvaṃ hīnamaṃgaṃ yathā tathā ||

devasya maṃtrarūpasya yaṃtravyāpti sa jānatāṃ |
kṛtārcanādikaṃ sarvaṃ vyathāṃ bhavati śāṃbhavi ||

ṣoḍaśairupacāraistu sāṃgāṃ sāvaraṇāṃ yajet |
praṇavādi namoṃ tena tattannāmnāṃ samarcayet ||

atha krameṇa ṣoḍaśopacāramaṃtrāḥ ||

idaṃ tu āsanaṃ dattaṃ mayā suravarārccite |
bhavaitasminniṣaṇātvaṃ yāvat pūjāṃ karomyahaṃ ||

<p. 123a>

pādyagṛhna mahādevi sarvaduḥkhāpahārakaṃ |
trāyasva varade devi ghorādasmādbhavārṇavāt ||

snāne vastre ca naivedya dadyādā camanīyakaṃ |
tacca svadhāyadairdadyān madhuparkaṃ tathā priye ||

arghyaṃ svāhā padenaiva sarvamanyantamaḥ yadā |
dūrvākṣata samāyukte vilvapatra samanvitaṃ ||

śobhanaṃ śaṃkhapātrasthaṃ gṛhāṇārghyaṃ harapriye |
caṃdrajātī lavaṃgailā kakkola sahitaṃ jalaṃ ||

gṛhāṇā camanīyaṃ tvaṃ mayābhaktyā niveditaṃ |
madhuparkaṃ maheśāni brahmaṇā parikalpitaṃ ||

mayā niveditaṃ tubhyaṃ gṛhāṇa jagadīśvarī |
madhuparka pradānāṃte punarācamanīyakaṃ ||

dātavyaṃ prāśanāṃtesya yataducchiṣṭatā bhavet |
vārīdaṃ himamāmodi prāsastyaṃ madhyameva ca ||

mayā niveditaṃ bhaktyā snāhyanena sureśvarī |
nānāvarṇa samāyuktaṃ paṭṭasūtrādi nirmitaṃ ||

vāsaḥ śuklaṃ tathā raktaṃ gṛhāṇa tridaśeśvarī |
dehaśobhākaraṃ pūtaṃ raṃjitaṃ rāgavastubhiḥ ||

paridhatsvajaddhātrī vāso bhaktyā niveditaṃ |
vāsasaḥ paridhānāṃte punarācamanīyakaṃ ||

dātavyaṃ bhaktibhāvena smṛtyuktatvān manuṣyavat |
divyaratna samāyuktaṃ vahnibhānu samaprabhaṃ ||

alaṃkārātsvadaṃgāni śobhayaṃ tu sureśvarī |
alikādhika śobhāyāḥ kārakaṃ nāgasaṃbhavaṃ ||

atirāgi samutyiṃjaṃ siṃdūraṃ parigṛhyatāṃ |
snigdhamullaṃ hṛdyatamaṃ dṛśāṃ śobhākaraṃ tava ||

gṛhītvā kajjalaṃ sadyo netrāṇyaṃ jayapārvatī |
tvatpādāṃ bhojana kharadyutikāri manoramaṃ ||

araktakamidaṃ devi mayādattaṃ pragṛhyatāṃ |
anulepena me tatte mahāsurabhiśītalaṃ ||

mayā niveditaṃ devi gṛhītvā lepayāṃgakaṃ |
idaṃ kusumamāmodi grāmāraṇya samudbhavaṃ ||

ghrāṇa saṃtarpaṇaṃ hṛdyaṃ mayādattaṃ pragṛhyatāṃ |
karpūrāgurusaṃmiśrovanaspati rasodbhava ||

mayā nivedito dhūpo devadevi pragṛhyatāṃ |
tvaṃ sūryaścaṃdrajyotīṣi vidyudagdhnostathaiva ca ||

tvameva jagatāṃ jyotirdīpoyaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ |
nānāvidhāni ramyāṇi svādūni rasavaṃti ca ||

mayādattāni gṛhyaṃtaṃ nivedyādi surārcite |
phalamūlāni sarvāṇi grāmakānajāni hi ||

nānākāra sugaṃdhīni gṛhāṇatvaṃ haripriye |
caturvidhamidaṃ bhakṣyaṃ devi ṣaḍbhirasaṃyutaṃ ||

sadātṛptakaraṃ ramyaṃmidamannaṃ pragṛhyatāṃ |
gavyaṃ sarpiḥ payoyuktaṃ nānāmadhuramiśritaṃ ||

<p. 123b>

niveditaṃ vedi mayā paramānnaṃ pragṛhyatāṃ |
amṛtai racitaṃ divyaṃ ghṛtakhaṇḍavinirmitaṃ ||

piṣṭakaṃ vividhaṃ svādu gṛhāṇa haravallabhe |
modakaṃ svādu ruciraṃ karpūrādibhiranvitaṃ ||

miśraṃ nānāvidhairdravyaiḥ pratigṛhyā śubhujyatāṃ |
tāmrapātre sthitaṃ sīdhuṃpayogavyamathātra vā ||

nārike rodakaṃ kāṃsye gṛhyaṇa śaṃkara priye |
pānīyaṃ śītalaṃ svacchaṃ prasannaṃ ghanasārayuk ||

bhojane tṛptikṛddevī kṛpayā parigṛhyatāṃ |
bhojanāṃte pradātavyaṃ punarācamanīyakaṃ ||

pūrvokte naiva maṃtreṇa sarvatraiva śucismite |
phalapatraka saṃyuktaṃ karpūrādi suvāsitaṃ ||

mukhakāṃtikaraṃ hṛdyaṃ tāmvūlaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||

athāgamoktamārgeṇa tarpayedali viṃdubhiḥ |
aṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ tu nakhairniḥśabdamutkṣipan ||

tryapātrasyaṃdamuṣṭau ca tarpayeddevatā mukhe |
sakṛttarpaṇamutsṛjya japtvā mūlaṃ ca pādukāṃ ||

aṃtaḥśakti manusmṛtya tarpayeddeha devatāṃ |
aṃguṣṭho bhairavasthānaṃ caṇḍikāyāstvanāmikā ||

tasmāttābhyāṃ tarpaṇīyaṃ yatra etat tayoḥ priyaṃ |
aṃguṣṭha madhyamābhyāṃ ca vaśyakarmaṇi tarpayet ||

tarjanyaṃguṣṭhayogena tarpayedābhicārake |
kaniṣṭāṃguṣṭhayogena staṃbhakarmaṇi tarpayet ||

evaṃ saṃtarpya devāgre gurupaṃkti prapūjayet ||

karābhyāṃ cinmudrāṃ samudhva nṛkapālaṃ ca dadhatīṃśrita 
svarṇaprakhyātaruṇakusumālepavasanāṃ |
kṛpāpūrṇāpāṃgī maruṇanayanāvarvarakacāmupetāṃ siddhādyairyajati 
gurupaṃktiḥ kṛtamatiḥ ||

evaṃ svaṃpūjya dhūpaṃ ca dīpaṃ naivedyameva ca |
āsavaṃ piśitopenaṃ bhakṣyāni vividhāni ca ||

kadalpāni phalānyevaṃ tāṃvūlaṃ ca samarpayet |
vaṭukādīn samucyaivaṃ kuladīpān pradarśayet ||

īṣat pakvaḥ supiṣṭena kuryādvedāṃgulonnataṃ |
dīpāṃ ḍamarukākārān trikoṇānati śobhanān ||

karṣāhyagrahiṇaḥ kuryānnavasaptātha paṃca vā |
aṃtastejo vahisteja ekīkṛtvāmitaḥ prabhān ||

tridhā devyuparibhrāmya kuladīpaṃ nivedayet |
samastacakra cakreśi yute devi tavāṃtike ||

ārātrikamidaṃ devi gṛhāṇa mamasiddhaye |
kuladīpān pradarśyātha śaktipūjāṃ samācaret ||

athāśyāvaśyakatāmāha ||

<p. 124a>

kaulikāvāpya kaulāvāye caitanmatavartinaḥ |
teṣā nityā śaktipūjā prāhaivaṃ māṃpuradviṣaḥ ||

kṛtāyāṃ śaktiṃ pūjāyāṃ saphalaṃ nityapūjanaṃ |
akṛtāyāṃ manuṣyāṃ tu niṣphalaṃ nityapūjanaṃ ||

tasmād yatyena saṃpūjya śaktirnityārcanādanu |
devīdhiyaiva saṃpūjyā na sāmānya vadhūdhiyā ||

abhyarcya devatā vuddhyā bhogapātraṃ nivedayet |
tadaṃte kaṇyakāścāpi pramadāśca manoharāḥ ||

saṃpūjya devatā vuddhyā dadyāt pātraṃ pṛthak pṛthak |
anivedya tu yaḥ śaktyai kuladravyaṃ niṣevate ||

pūjanaṃ niḥphalaṃ tasya devatā na prasīdati |
maṃtramaṃtra samāyuktā samayācārapālikā ||

kumārī vā vratasthā vā yogamudrādharāpi vā |
pūjākāle svataḥ prāptā sā pūjyā sahasā vudhaiḥ ||

tatorcanādikaṃ sarvaṃ maṃtrodakapuraḥsaraṃ |
itaḥ pūrvādi manunāmaṃtrī devyai samarpayet ||

śeṣaṃ dakṣiṇavat kuryāt taducchiṣṭādikaṃ tathā |
śaktihīnā vṛthā pūjā śivahīnaṃ vṛthārcanaṃ ||

śivaśaktiḥ samāpūjā sā pūjā sarvakāmadā |
bhaktyābhāve dravyalābhe manaḥ śaktiṃ prapūjayet ||

śeṣikā maṃtrito deyaṃ śeṣikāyai sa kathyate |
aiṃ hṛducchiṣṭa cāṃḍālini mātaṃgi padaṃ vadet ||

sarvevaśaṃkarī svāhā caika viṃśati varṇakaḥ |
maṃtreṇānena nirmālyaṃ śeṣikāyai samarpayet ||

devīmucchiṣṭa mātaṃgī dhyāyellokaikamohinīṃ ||

vīṇāvādya vinodgīta niratāṃ nīlāṃśukollāsinīṃ viṃvoṣṭīṃ 
navayāvakārdracaraṇāmākarṇakeśāṃśukāṃ |
hṛdyāṃgīsitaśaṃkhakuṃdadhavalāṃ māṇikya bhūṣojjvalāṃ mātaṃgīṃ 
praṇatosmisusmitamukhīṃ devīṃ śukaśyāmalāṃ ||

kaulikaiḥ śaktisahitaistaducchiṣṭaṃ ca sevayet |
svaśaktiṃ vīraśaktiṃ vā dīkṣitāṃ gururūpiṇīṃ ||

pāpayitvā pivenmadhyamiti śāstrasya niścayaḥ |
tataḥ śrīgururūpāya sākṣāt paraśivātmane ||

karābhyāṃ pātramuddhṛtya sa dvitīyaṃ nivedayet |
gurorabhāve tatpātraṃ jalamadhye ca niḥkṣipet ||

pūjyaśaktiṃ śaktipātraṃ vīrebhyo vīrapātrakaṃ |
anyebhyo yoginī pātraṃ svārthe syādbhogapātrakaṃ ||

<p. 124b>

kuṇḍalī tarpaṇārthaṃ ca bhogapātraṃ samācaret |
aṃtaḥśakti manusmṛtya tarpayeddeha devatāṃ ||

atha yena prakāreṇa svīkuryuḥ pātramuttamaṃ |
tattehaṃ vyāhariṣyāmi yathā rudreṇa bhāṣitaṃ ||

prāṇāyāma vidhāyānu tat tanmaṃtra ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
kurvīta bhaktibhāvena śaktyā vṛkṣādikaṃ tathā ||

tatoghrāya tat tatpātraṃ dakṣahaste niveśayet |
vāmahastānāmikāyāṃguṣṭhaṃ samabhiyojayet ||

idaṃ hi tarpaṇī mudrā śudrūpā parikīrtitā |
etayā mudrayā devi saṃhāraḥ kramato khilāt ||

pātrā tu dravyamādāya tarpayeduditakraimaiḥ |
aṃguṣṭhasyānāmikāyā nakhau yāvat pralimyataḥ ||

vātanniveśanīyā hi mudrā vai kaulikādravaiḥ |
nimīlya cakṣuṣī dhyāyede tadrūpeṇa kālikā ||

mamāṃtarhṛdayāṃbhojaṃ praviṣṭā siddhidāyinī |
mūlamaṃtraṃ paṭhan kuryāllalāṭe viṃducitrakaṃ ||

paṃcaprāṇāhutī dadyāt karṣanmāṃsalavaṃ vade |
ādau tāraḥ śiraḥ śeṣe madhye turyavibhaktigān ||

prāṇāpāna samāno dānavyā nānekarūpiṇaḥ |
maṃtraṃ paṭhan vakṣyamāṇaṃ niḥśabdaṃ tat piveddravaṃ ||

svātmamūla trikoṇodyat sūryakoṭi samaprabhe |
kuṇḍalyā kṛti cidrūpe hunedravyaṃ samaṃtrakaṃ ||

anaṃtapātrabharitamidaṃ tat paramāmṛtaṃ |
parāhaṃtā maye vahnau homasvīkāralakṣaṇaṃ ||

idaṃ pavitramamṛtaṃ pivāmi bhavabheṣajaṃ |
paśupāśa samucchedakāraṇaṃ bhairavoditaṃ ||

anyaṃ maṃtraṃ paṭhintpatra maule yā jagadīśvarī |
dharmādharma havirdīptamātmāganu manasā śruvā ||

suṣumṇā vartmanā nityamakṣavṛttiṃ juhomyahaṃ |
kāpālikānāṃ maṃtronyastamapivyāharāmite ||

hṛdaṃ bhojagatāṃ devīṃ snāpayāmi sudhā rasaiḥ |
tenāyaṃ bhavavaṃdho me vināśamupagacchatu ||

evaṃ maṃtra trayaṃ proktaṃ pātrasvīkārakarmaṇi |
nirmaṃtraṃ na piveddravyaṃ prāyaścittaṃ vidhīyate ||

na kadācit pivenmadyaṃ nirmaṃtraṃ na pivet tathā |
vinā maṃtraṃ pivenmadyaṃ samurāpo nigadyate ||

pūrṇapātrakare dhṛtvā juhomi sādhakaḥ paṭhet |
tato vīragaṇāḥ sarvejuṣasveti manuṃ vadet ||

anyonyaṃ caṃdanaṃ kṛtvā pivet tat tadanujñayā |
yathāvidhi dvitīyena gṛhnīyān maṃtramuccaran ||

piśitaṃ māṣamātraṃ tu madyaṃ culukasaṃmitaṃ |
svīkāryamādau guruṇā śiṣyebhyaḥ śeṣado bhavet ||

<p. 125a>

nissaṃkonirmalo dhīro nirlajjāni kutūhalaḥ |
nirṇīta vedaśāstrārtho varaṃdā vāruṇīṃ pivet ||

devān pitṝn samabhyarcya vedīśāstroktavartmanā |
guruṃ smaraṃ pivanmadyaṃ ṣādanmāṃsaṃ na doṣabhāk ||

gurudaivatamaṃtrāṇāṃmaikyaṃ saṃbhāvayandhiyā |
āgalāṃtaṃ piveddravyaṃ tataśca carvaṇaṃ caret ||

māṃsaṃ matsyaṃ ca mudrāṃ ca maithunaṃ vai kramārcayet |
svasaṃpradāya saṃyuktairvīraiśca sahapūjayet ||

cittaḥ svātaṃtryasāratvāt tasmānaṃdamayetvataḥ |
tanmayet vācca bhāvanāṃ bhāvaścāṃtarhite rase ||

svasvātaṃtryavikāśāya surāsastena pīyate |
tasmādiṣṭā surādevīṃ pūrṇāhaṃtā juhomyahaṃ ||

maṃtreṇānena deveśi mūlamaṃtreṇa maṃtravit |
anākulamanāḥ kuryān madhupānaṃ śaniḥ śnaiḥ ||

yāvadullā sa paryaṃtamupadaṃśaiḥ pivanmadhuḥ |
tataḥ pātragataṃ hālāviṃdu bhūmau prapātayet ||

ucchiṣṭaṃ bhairavāyeha dadyān maṃtramanuṃ paṭhan |
maidhamāyāramāvīje ehyesyucchiṣṭa bhairava ||

visaṃdhi ca valiṃ gṛhya yugaṃ svāhā ca paścime |
nighṛṣya tadbhūmitale pūrvavaccitrakaṃ caret ||

yenyepi pātraṃ svīkuryusteṣāmapyeṣa hi kramaḥ |
pānabhedaphalollāsaḥ pramāṇasthiti lakṣaṇaṃ ||

avijñāya caredyastu ma bhavedā padāṃ padaṃ |
pānapaṃcavidhaṃ proktaṃ mahādivyādi bhedataḥ ||

mahādivyaṃ tathā divyaṃ vīraścaiva mahāpaśuḥ |
paśuvaṃdyaḥ śuciśceti paṃcadhā parikīrtitaḥ ||

prāṇāpānau samāhārau pratyāhāramanaḥ sthiraṃ |
bhānumaṇḍalakaṃ bhītvā iṃdumaṇḍalamadhyagaṃ ||

suṣumṇā vartmanā nityaṃ surādhārā prakarṣaṇī |
mahādivyamidaṃ proktaṃ śṛṇu divyaṃ maheśvarī ||

divyaṃ devyagrataḥ pānaṃ vīramṛdvāsanottamaṃ |
tyaktaḥ sarvapāśa mūle vāmanāmala saṃcaye ||

kaulikācāra yogena paṃcatatvena tarpayet |
ṣaṭcakra kramabhedena huneddravyaṃ sa maṃtrakaṃ ||

dhyānārcana parāvasthāṃ vīrapānamanuttamaṃ |
udvāsanottaraṃ devi vīrapānaṃ taducyate ||

vīrapānaṃ dvidhā prokta paśupānaṃ śṛṇu priye |
vīrapāne pūrvadhīro parastu paśurityapi ||

āsakta lolupādaṃbho maṃtrārthe vā prasaṃgakaḥ |
kārmukaḥ kāryanirdeśe paśupānaṃ taducyate ||

sarvaiḥ kulīnaiḥ sthitvā tu vinā pūjāṃ sa garvitaiḥ |
yatpānaṃ krīyate devi paśupānaṃ taducyate ||

atopi śṛṇu deveśi paśupāne kramaḥ śive |
ekākī madyapāpīya ekākī śaktibhukpriye ||

<p. 125b>

maheśvarasya saṃsargaṃ na kadāpi karoti cet |
paśupānamidaṃ proktaṃ mahādāridryadāyakaṃ ||

vinā maṃtraṃ vinā dīkṣāṃ vinā guru mukhātpriye |
yatpānaṃ kriyate mūrkhaiḥ paśupānaṃ vidurvudhāḥ ||

mahāpaśuriti proktaḥ kaulavāmo śṛṇu priye |
vāme rāmā manohārī colipātraṃ tu dakṣiṇe ||

pānapātrān maheśāni vāmahastena tarpakaḥ |
mahākaulo maheśāni bhūmausthāpya pratarpayet ||

hastadvayena ceddevi kaula ityabhidhīyate |
vāmadakṣavyatpayena vīrakaula prakīrtitaḥ ||

alipātraṃ vāmapāṇau dakṣahastena tarpayet |
kāmagauḍastu saṃproktaḥ caitanyākhyaḥ sa eva tu ||

bhūmau sthāpya maheśāni hastayugmena tarpayet |
ānaṃdākhyastu saṃproktaḥ vāma ityavidhīyate ||

phalaṃ tu ||

maṃtra saṃskāra saṃśuddho'mṛtapānena pārvatī |
jāyate devatā bhāvo bhavavaṃdha vimocakaḥ ||

ānaṃda brahmaṇo rūpaṃ tacca mokṣa vyavasthitaṃ |
tasyābhivyaṃjakaṃ dravyaṃ yogibhistena pīyate ||

divyapānarato vīro devī sāyujya māpnuyāt |
deśiko vīrapānena devīlokaṃ hi gacchati ||

sādhakaḥ paśupānena rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet |
āraṃbhastaruṇaścaiva yauvanaḥ prauḍha eva ca ||

tadaṃtaśconmanāsthānāṃvasthāścaiva saptamaḥ || 

athaiṣāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ ||

pātratrayaṃ syādāraṃbhaḥ kathitaḥ kulanāyike |
tadaṃte taruṇaścaiva taruṇaṃ sukhadaṃ priye ||

yauvanaṃ manasaḥ samyagullāsaḥ kathitaḥ priye |
skhalanaṃ dṛṅmano vācāṃ prauḍhamitvabhidhīyate ||

svābhīṣṭaveṣṭāvaraṇaṃ prauḍhāṃtaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
ūmanāḥ patanotthāna mūrchanācca muhurmuhuḥ ||

deheṃdriyānāmavaśaścā navasthāni gadyate |
bhojanāṃte viṣaṃ madyaṃ madyāṃte bhojanaṃ viṣaṃ ||

amṛtaṃ tadvijānīyādyadantaṃ surayāsaha |
carvaṇena yutaṃ madyamamṛtaṃ kathitaṃ sadā ||

carvaṇena vināpānaṃ kevalaṃ viṣabhakṣaṇaṃ |
tatastutvā namaskṛtya kuryāt saṃbhogamelanaṃ ||

devatāgre tu saṃbhoge devatā prīṇanaṃ bhavet |
etāsukāṃ vidānīya tataśca yonimaṇḍale || 

pūjayitvā mahādevī tato maithunamācaret |
dharmādharmahavirdīpte ātmāgnau manasā śruvā ||

<p. 126a>

suṣumṇāvartmanā nityamakṣavṛttirjuhomyahaṃ |
svāhāṃtoyaṃ mahāmaṃtra āraṃbhe parikīrtitaḥ ||

tato japet priyaṃ gacchan devī tribhuvaneśvarīṃ |
prakāśākāśahastābhyāmavalaṃ vyomanī śruvā ||

dharmādharmakalā snehapūrṇamagnau juhomyahaṃ |
svāhāṃtoyaṃ mahāmaṃtra śuklatyāge prakīrtitaḥ ||

pramādādyadi lupyeta devatā sā prakupyati |
vinā bhuktvā vinā pītvā vinā kṛtvā tu paṃcamaṃ ||

sa pāpiṣṭhaḥ kathaṃ vrūte kālīmaṃtraṃ japāmyahaṃ |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena sādhayet paṃcamaṃ priye ||

yadi cetkriyate naiva tasya duḥkhaṃ pade pade |
yadi yocinta saṃgastyāttadānu kalpayogataḥ ||

kartavyaṃ karmasāṃgārthaṃ nocedviphalamīritaṃ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau kaulavāmayoḥ sāmānyanityārcanāyāṃ 
pīṭhapūjādikuladravyaniṣevano nāmaikonaviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 19 ||
nirgatya pūjāṃ gṛhato viharet svecchayā tataḥ |
śṛṇu bhojana kālīyaṃ kartavya madhunā priye ||

bhuṃjīta prācyabhimukhaścirakāji jīviṣu |
yāmyadigvadano devī yaśaḥ kāmaṃ samaśrute ||

paścimābhi mukho bhuṃkte īhamānodhikāṃ śriyaṃ |
siddhimuktimabhilasadbhakṣayeduttarāmukhaḥ ||

evaṃ sthite dharmapathe viśeṣācchaktyupāsakaḥ |
sadottarāśābhimukhe'nnamadyāt saṃdhyayordvayoḥ ||

validānaṃ tatra hetu nityāha bhagavācchivaḥ |
yena kenādhyāsanena yasmin kasmin stathāsane ||

upaviśyānnamaśnīyāttatu bhūmau kadācana |
ādāvāca manaṃ kṛtvā dakṣe saṃsthā codakaṃ ||

vāca ācamanīya matramaṃtranidadhīta vai |
rātraupuraḥ pradīpaṃ ca divāgniṃ yaḥ sureśvarī ||

tenāsya jāṭharo vahnirnitya siddho bhavedahe |
bhūtapreta piśācānāṃ sānnidhyaṃ na ca jāyate ||

rakṣāṃsinovalupyaṃti tadannaṃ taddhavistathā |
nair(-)ṛtyāgrāṃ mārutāṃtā rekhāmudakadhārayā ||

rodhaṃrāvāstramuccārya kuryād dakṣiṇapāṇinā |
vāyavyagrāṃ tatheśānāṃ vasanāṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

<p. 126b>

aiśānakoṇādārabhyāgne yāṃtāṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ |
āgneyāgrāṃ nir(-)ṛtyaṃ tāṃ sarvaśeṣe vibhāvayet ||

maṇḍalaṃ madhyaviṃdvārgharakṣaḥ koṇe vahirlikhet |
vajraṃ vāyavyakoṇe ca caṃdrarekhāṃ sa viṃdukāṃ ||

īśānakoṇe vilikhedaṃ kuśaṃ vahnikoṇagaṃ |
arvācyodīcyagāṃ rekhāṃ madhye kuryāt tataḥ paraṃ ||

pratīcī prācyanugatāṃ punastaduparinyaset |
rekhāgraṃ caṃdrarekhābhiḥ sa viṃdubhirupa spṛśet ||

nirmite maṃḍale vāri dhārayaivaṃ varānane |
svayaṃ vānyotha vā tatranyasedbhojanabhājanaṃ ||

tadupaskaravastūni cāvaṃtiracitāni hi |
pṛthak pṛthaktayā tatra vinyasedbhājanāgrataḥ ||

tato dakṣiṇahastena tadannaṃ vāriṇokṣitaṃ |
śirasyaṃ jalimādhāya praṇavediṣṭa rūpiṇaṃ ||

haviraktaṃ vidhāyādau te manāloḍitaṃ tataḥ |
gṛhītvā dakṣahastena kiṃcidannaṃ jalānvitaṃ ||

ghanavījaṃ samuccārya paryanyaṃ cabhyasaṃtimaṃ |
namastasyānu nair(-)ṛtya koṇe pūrvādike nyaset ||

tārāt prajāpatibhyonu hṛduccāryāni lāhvaye |
dadyāṃ dannaṃtoya yutaṃ tatra aiśānamaṃḍale ||

kṣudbhyo namastasya vījaṃ pūra uktvā valiṃ nyaset |
tadvahṛdbhyonamaḥ procya tadvījādyaṃ surārcīte ||

dadyāt sṛṇu pariṣṭānnu sattoyānnaṃ ca dādhakaḥ |
tataḥ svadakṣe pūrvasyāṃ kuryādvartula maṇḍalaṃ ||

ārabhya pūrvarahito yāvatsyurvidigeśvarāḥ |
tāvadvādyātsatoyānnaṃ paṭhenmaṃtraṃ pṛthak pṛthak ||

caitanyaṃ praṇavo māyāpāśaḥ kāmaśca śākinī |
yoginī kamalā ceti vījānyaṣṭau pṛthak pṛthak ||

puṣṭiḥ kāṃtirvalaṃ buddhivīryaṃ jñānaṃ tathaiva ca |
buddhiḥ siddhiritihyaṣṭau bhinnabhinnapadāni hi ||

dāyai namaśca sarvebhyaḥ krameṇa parikīrtayet |
ekāstu kālikā devyāḥ śaktirūpāstu mūrtayaḥ ||

parivāratayākhyātā annādhiṣṭādya īritāḥ |
etāstattat pradāyinyaḥ syurannena prapūjitāḥ ||

tato bhojanapātrāgrecitastimita īritaḥ |
ṣaṇmaṇḍalāni kurvīta vāriṇākṣallakāni hi ||

<p. 127a>

teṣāmadhastāt kramato viṃdustāvat samācaret |
yāvaddhastenotpatati piṃḍī kartuṃ ca śakyate ||

tāvat tatra puro datvā vāriṇā tat samutsṛjet |
adhogatistaduparitadaṣṭamanavastataḥ ||

ataḥ paraṃ krameṇaiva maṃtrān dvādaśa tāṃtrikān |
vakṣyamāṇānmayā devi sāvadhānā niśāmaya ||

tāro māyā carāvaśca kūrcakuṃḍe sa karṇike |
surasaścāpi phetkārī ghaṭī ceti na caiva hi ||

vījāni purato datvā haṃsārādi trikūṭakaṃ |
ehyehi saṃbhāṣya tato bhagavatyapi kīrtayet ||

guhyakāli tataḥ procya sarvākhyāya na kāriṇi |
idamannaṃ visaṃhyutkā gṛhnakhādi yugaṃ yugaṃ ||

balaṃ buddhirmeṃdriyāṇi tato naṃtaramīrayet |
mayidhehi dvayaṃ cāpi sarvāṃtaryāminīti ca ||

tataḥ sarvamidaṃte ca svedatāṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ |
prasīda dvitayasyānuroṣāstre śira eva ca ||

maṃtreṇānena devyai tu valyannaṃ vinivedayet |
annapiṇḍaṃ punaścānyatsaṃparisthāpya maṃḍale ||

udīryamāṇamanunā samutsṛjya nivedayet |
sārasvataramā kāmaprāsādāṃkuśakālikā ||

ḍākinī preta bhairavyaḥ puro vījāni vai nava |
kūṭatrayaṃ ca tadanu paiśācaḥ khecarīkulaṃ ||

yoginī ḍākinībhyonunumamannavaliṃ vadet |
nivedayāmi ca tataḥ saumyā bhuktvā bhavaṃ tu ca ||

siddhiṃ dadatvanu mayi kṛpāṃ dadatu kīrtayet |
prabhaṃjanādi vījāliṃ tataḥ saptasamullikhet ||

aḍākinī mahārātriṃ roṣamastra trayaṃ śiraḥ |
idānīma vadhe hitvaṃ vināyaka valiṃ śubhaṃ ||

pūrvavanmaṃḍale datvā valyannaṃte manairyutaṃ |
jalpiṣyamāṇa maṃtreṇa gaṇā'dhipatayepayet ||

vedādi pāśa garuḍayoginī caṃdradakṣiṇāḥ |
valiḥ padmeśca taṃdrā ca kūṭā siddho prabhānavāḥ ||

mahāgaṇādhipataye vighnarājāya cetyapi |
imaṃ sopasthala valiṃ daded gṛhnayugaṃ tataḥ ||

bhakṣaya dvitayaṃ cāpi sarvān vighnān tataḥ paraṃ |
vināśa yadvayaṃ cārumamāriṣṭaṃ dahadvayaṃ ||

vījamāpsarasa caiva māścarya vaiśvadevakaṃ |
ṛṣabhaṃ ca prayojaṃ ca paṃcaitānī nayet kramāt ||

<p. 127b>

astra trayānu svāhā ca tārtīyomaturīritaḥ |
turyaṃ vaṭukanāthasya maṃtramākarṇaya priye ||

puroktavat piṇḍitānnaṃ maṇḍale vinidhāya vai |
samuccarantimaṃ maṃtraṃ vaṭukāya samarpayet ||

tāracaitanya pāśahnī bhāruṇḍā kūrcakākinī |
kālādityai na vaitāni vījāni coccaret punaḥ ||

raudrā naṃdā calākhyātān kūṭāṃ strīṃ stadanaṃtaraṃ |
ehyehi tadanuprocya mahāvaṭukanātha ca ||

imaṃ vali gṛhīṇānu sarvasiddhi dada dvayaṃ |
mamaśatruṃ nāśaya dvirdehadvirmāraya dvayaṃ ||

sarvaiśvaryadehi yugmaṃ dāpaya dvitayaṃ tathā |
sa sauraṃgaṃ carpaṭādi catuṣkaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

rauṣāstrayostristriruktvā sarvaśeṣe śiro vadet |
adhunā kṣetrapālasya śṛṇvaṃ tu valimuttamaṃ ||

puro vatsadalaṃ datvā maṃtramenaṃ samuccaret |
caitanya māyākamalājaṃbha sāhasamekhalau ||

tāṭaṃ kamaṃdasvārṇā ca vījāni purato na ca |
kūṭatrayaṃ tato brūyān māyāmaṃdāragahvaraṃ ||

hetukādipadaṃ procya bhīṣaṇāṃtebhya ityapi |
sarvebhyaḥ kṣetrapālebhyaḥ imaṃ valiṃ mitīrayet ||

dade saumyā bhavenmuktvā mamasiddhiṃ samullikhet |
prayacchaṃ tu tataḥ śatrunnāśayaṃ tu ca kīrtayet ||

hūṃ phaṭ svāhā bhaveccheṣa ityuktvā vāriṇot sṛjet ||

atha ṣaṣṭhavale maṃtraṃ kathayāmi śucismite |
dīyate parivārebhyoyamuccārya phalārthibhiḥ ||

caitanya tārakamalā pāśaroṣa vadhusmarā |
tataḥ trāsāda śākinyo purovījāni vai navaḥ ||

bhagamāli kalāmāli vedavatyastataḥ paraṃ |
ratnakuṃbhaḥ puṣpamālā cūḍākūṭaṃ tataḥ paraṃ ||

ekāvalī tato vajrakavacaṃ brahmakarparaṃ |
jagadā vṛtitvījaṃ ca daśamaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||

mahākalpasthāyi nāma jñeya mekādaśaiva hi |
pārijātāhvayaṃ kūṭaṃ tadvādaśatamaṃ bhavet ||

ekaviṃśatirevasyāt saṃkhyā vai vījakūṭayoḥ |
guhyakālī sahacaraṃ yāvadeka padādanu ||

parivārapadaṃ cāpi dvayamevetyasaṃmitaṃ |
tataḥ saṃdhānasahitamimamannavaliṃ vadet ||

<p. 128a>

gṛhna dvayaṃ makṣayadviḥkhāhi dvitayameva ca |
uktvā kṛtyābhicārāṃśca dahadvirnāśayadvayaṃ ||

sarvasaṃpadamābhāṣya dada dehi dvayaṃ dvayaṃ |
śatrūn dviḥsaṃhārayoccārya śeṣe kūrcāstrakāni ca ||

valimaṃtrā ṣaḍevaṃte kathitā jagadīśvarī |
ūrddhvastha maṃḍaleṣvetairutsṛjet sādhakocalīn ||

eṣāmadhastādye proktāḥ viṃdavaḥ ṣaṭpuro mayā |
taddevāṃstasya maṃtrāṃśca kathayāmyadhunā tava ||

jātavedācāduvaścaśanyagastyau tataḥ paraṃ |
kālāgni rudrastadanu paṃcamaḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||

kalpāṃtakālī ṣaṣṭhī tu vijñeyā tadanaṃtaraṃ |
turyerkeṣaḍimeśabdāḥ kartavyaḥ suravaṃdite ||

nidheyā kramaśaḥ kiṃtu vedādi hṛdayāṃtaraṃ |
etairma (*) (?) bhirutsṛjya tat taddevebhya odanaṃ ||

mūladevyaiḥ sarvamantamutsṛjet tadanaṃtaraṃ |
uktamaṃtra dvayaṃ tatra vaidikaṃ tāṃtrikaṃ tathā ||

dadyādu bhayamuccārya krama eṣa śivoditaḥ |
tatrādau vaidikaṃ vacmi vakṣye tadanu tāṃtrikaṃ ||

idamanna prāṇa dhanurddhāraṇā kāraṇaṃ sadā |
yathā vibhava saṃbhārasaṃbhārita surī kuru ||

tvamevānnaṃ tvamevātrītvaṃ dātrī tvaṃ grahītryapi |
tvaṃ bhoktrī ca vidhātrī ca saṃhatryaṃpija nitryapi ||

kalpāṃta kālanartaktvai mahāsaṃhāra mūrtaye |
trilokī grāsakāriṇyai kimannaṃ te pradīyate ||

tathāpi bhaktibhāvena yatta devi niveditaṃ |
tadannaṃmayi vātsalyāt sādarādbhuṃkṣvakālike ||

nivedyānena maṃtreṇa tāṃtrikaṃ samudīrayet |
tāromaidhaṃ ca māyā ca prāsādo me ca yoginī ||

pretaḥ paroḍākinī ca phetkārī hārakarṇike |
saṃhārādi trayaṃ bhokakūṭādyaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

padaṃ siddhi karālīti siddhito vikarāli ca |
bhagavatpatha saṃkīrtya guhyakālī tato vadet ||

idamannaṃ visaṃdhyuktvā bhuṃjakhāhi yugaṃ yugaṃ |
bhakṣaya dvitayaṃ cāpi māṃrakṣayugalaṃ tataḥ ||

lajjā mahācaṃḍayogeśvarīti tadanaṃtaraṃ |
vajrakāpāli tatra khecarī cakranāyike ||

hasadvayaṃ valgayugaṃ peṣṭiḍiṃḍimadāruṇaḥ |
roṣasyāstrasya ce tristri svāhāśeṣe vyavasthitaṃ ||

paṭhitvemaṃ manuṃ sarvaṃ kṣipedatvannamūrddhani |
nimīlya nayane tiṣṭhet kṣaṇaṃ tadanu pārvatī ||

āpośānaṃ tataḥ kuryādimaṃ maṃtramudīrayet |
imamannaṃ havyaśeṣaṃ devyucchiṣṭhaṃ rasānvitaṃ ||

<p. 128b>

asvāmi svargakaṃ valyadharmakāmārtha siddhaye |
ityuccārya manuṃ namaḥ śiro vāma kaniṣṭhayā ||

gaṇḍūṣaṃ brahmatīrthena spṛśan sthālī caredvudhaḥ |
tato dakṣakarāṃguṣṭhānāmike yojite caran ||

haviraktaṃ stokamannaṃ gṛhītvā vadane nyaset |
prāṇāhutībhirjuhuyādanyābhirapi pārvati ||

nānāmatīyāṃtadrīkathayāmyavadhāraya |
tārāgni jāyayormadhye vibhaktyā turyayānvitā ||

krameṇa vāyavaḥ paṃca teṣāṃ nāmāni vai śṛṇu |
prāṇāpāna samāno dānavyānāḥ parameśvarī ||

rāṃtyānayābhāṇḍikerojudvatyanyānapi priye |
nāgaḥ kūrmaśca kṛkaro devadatto dhanaṃjayaḥ ||

etasmādadhikaṃ kiṃcit kuryuḥ kāpālikā kramaṃ |
yuktiyuktaṃ tamapite kathayāmi varānane ||

tayorevāṃtareśabdau dvau dvau syādaṃtimau sadā |
kṛtvā vigrahitau pūrvoktarītyā juhuyācchanaiḥ ||

kṣaṭ tṛpau ca śramālasya nidrātaṃdre tathaiva ca |
kāmakrodhau lobhamohau madamānau tataḥ paraṃ ||

rogaśokau janmamṛtyurddharmādharmau kṛtā kṛte |
puṇyapāpe divārātrau jñānajñāne śubhā'śubhe ||

jāgrat svapnau khaluḥ suṣupti turīyaṃ ca tatonu ca |
bhāvābhāvau svargamartyau tataḥ satyānṛte priye ||

tasmāt prakṛti puruṣau tanmātreṃdriya ityapi |
jīvātmā paramātmānau vaṃdhamokṣau tathaiva ca ||

caturviṃśatimau viṃśat prativiṃvau varānane |
sarvaśeṣe parijñeyaḥ śivaśaktiśca sādhakaiḥ ||

paṃcaviṃśati saṃkhyākametat tatvamudīritaṃ |
tebhyastvāhuti saṃproktā yāmalādhipaśastutā ||

anityatvena vedādhvapāpināṃ saṃmatātviyaṃ |
kaulācāravatāṃ kiṃtu nityatvena prakīrtitā ||

paṃcatriṃśāhutiḥ śreṣṭhā daśamadhyādhamātataḥ |
evaṃ tiṣṭhati siddhāṃte prāṇāhutyāmatāṃtare ||

yāvadyasya bhavecchakyaṃ tāvat tena vidhīyate |
yāvat prāṇāhutīḥ kuryāt tāvadbhojanabhojane ||

kaniṣṭhā tiṣṭhati tathā maunaṃ cāpi vidhīyate |
tatastadannaṃ bhuṃjīta yaddevyai viniveditaṃ ||

<p. 129a>

na hasan grāsamaśnīyānnāti riktaṃ na vāmanaṃ |
na sa śabdaṃ pivettoyaṃ nādhikaṃ bhojanāṃtarā ||

nyūnādhike rasānāṃ hi na viṃdyāt kiṃ ca pūjayet |
naivedya saṃbhṛtau devyai yadyaddravyaṃ niveditaṃ ||

mahāprasādabhūtaṃ tatsarvaṃ bhuṃjīta tatkṣaṇe |
naikākyadyāt sādhakastu kaulān vālāṃśca vāṃdhavān ||

sahopaveśayet tatra yatra bhuṃkte svayaṃ rahaḥ |
eṣā mahāvaikaulikyo bhaveyuḥ sthāpitā api ||

bhāgatrayaṃ pūrayīta jaṭharasyā śanaiḥ śanaiḥ |
eko bhāgovaśoṣyaḥ syāt saṃcāro yonilāṃvunā ||

tiktādyamamlamadhyaṃ hi madhurāṃtaṃ ca bhojanaṃ |
āyurvedādiṣu prokta mātreyādi maharṣibhiḥ ||

evaṃ nirvātya sakalaṃ bhojanaṃ sādhakaḥ svayaṃ |
utkṣipya bhājano maṃtramanyatra sthāpayacchanaiḥ ||

avaśiṣṭaṃ kiṃcidannamavaśya bhājane nyaset |
tadannaṃ piṇḍitaṃ kṛtvā sa jalaṃ dakṣapāṇinā ||

sthālyadho valimādadhyādu bhayatra varānane |
ucchiṣṭa bhairavāyādau paścimāyāṃdiśi nyaset ||

tathaivocchiṣṭa cāṃḍālyai pūrvasyāmapi ca kramāt |
etayormaṃtra yugalamidānīmavadhārayet ||

maidhaṃ māyāyoginī carāvarāmāsmarāśaruṭ |
kulyāyoṭomuṃtālā ca vījānyetāni vai daśa ||

ucchiṣṭa bhairavā yoktvā tathocchiṣṭa valiṃ vadet |
gṛhna dvayaṃ bhuṃjayugmaṃ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ca paścime ||

athāparaṃ śṛṇu manuṃ pūrvasyāṃ yena dīyate |
maidhaṃ pāśaḥ smarorāvaḥ kūrcaḥ kṣetrapatākinī ||

pūtanāśakti liṃgaṃ ca rāvī ceti daśoddharet |
ehyehyucchiṣṭa cāṃḍālinyanughaṃsadhi varjitaṃ ||

virūpaveśa uddhṛtya mumukṣūktvā piśācini |
iyamucchiṣṭa saṃbhāṣya valiṃ gṛhna yugaṃ tataḥ ||

khādadvitayamasyānu mudrāṃ khecaryanaṃtaraṃ |
yugaṃ prakaṭayaḥ procyaḥ saṃdhyūnamabhicāriṇī ||

sāmarthyaṃ devi yugmaṃ ca piśācinyāstrayaṃ tataḥ |
atrāpi caramejñeyā pūrvavaccaturakṣarī ||

evaṃ manubhyāmetābhyāṃ datvā valiyugaṃ priye |
tatraivā ca manaṃ kuryāt saḍaṃgaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

<p. 129b>

prasāda yat tāṃvūlaṃ cāsya vāsanaṃ |
tāṃvūlaṃ carvayan martyaḥ pavitraṃ śrīkaraṃ paraṃ ||

śubhadaṃ sarvavarṇānāṃ mukhaśuddhiṃ karaṃ paraṃ |
tāṃvūlaṃ dīpanaṃ rucyaṃ sarvavātaka bhāpadaṃ ||

tyājyaṃ piktva bhrame raktenetroktvaṃ pekṣayepi ca |
parṇāgraṃ parṇapṛṣṭaṃ ca cūrṇaparṇaṃ vivarjayet ||

parṇamūle bhavedvyādhi parṇāgre pāpavuddhayaḥ |
cūrṇaparṇaṃ haratyāyuḥ śirāvuddhi vināśinī ||

tarjanyā cūrṇamādāya tāṃvūlaṃ na tu bhakṣayet |
yadi khedati muḍhātmā rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

pūgo brahmādalaṃ viṣṇuścūrṇa devo maheśvaraḥ |
kāṣṭhāyaṃ tu bhaveddevī tāṃvūlamatidurlabhaṃ ||

eteṣāṃ saṃpradānena varddhate bhāgyasaṃpadaḥ |
tāṃvūla samayaṃ devī tatra śṛṇu yathā kramaṃ ||

śataparṇāni deveśi cakravartitarāya ca |
gurubhyaḥ saṃpradātavyā dvātriṃśatparṇavīṭikā ||

aṣṭāviṃśati bhūpebhyo vāṃdhavebhyo daśāṣṭakaṃ |
jāmātre pakvaparṇāni vasudvādaśa vā priye ||

paṃcaviṃśati śaktibhyaḥ putrebhyastatva saṃkhyakān |
ṣaṭparṇāni ca śatrubhyasturīyaṃ dānamuttamaṃ ||

parṇatrayaṃ śatrupakṣe daśaparṇāni vaśyayoḥ |
vīrebhyaḥ ṣoḍaśa śive divyaughe vasu pīṭhayuk ||

tadarddhaṃ caiva siddhaughe mānavaughe tadarddhakaṃ |
mānyebhyaḥ saptaparṇāni kanyāyai paṃcaviṃśatiḥ ||

caṃdrayuktaṃ maheśāni pautrebhyo daśapaṃca ca |
stuṣāyai triṃśati śivedāsye caiva caturdaśaḥ ||

anyebhyaḥ parameśāni viṃśat parṇāni dāpayet |
paripūtrī tathā dāsī dāsaścaiva caturthakaḥ ||

parivettā pārivettā ṣaṭtāṃvūladāyakāḥ |
agradānaṃ ca śatrubhyo cakradānaṃ sumitrake ||

tiryagdānaṃ sevakādau yathā yogena yojayet ||

mlecchahastā chatruhastācchaṃki tasya tathaiva ca |
atha vaidagdha hastasya tāṃvūlaṃ hi niṣidhyati ||

ādyapīkobhiyoktavyo dvitīyalpajyatāṃ sataṃ |
tṛtīyo gṛhyatāṃvūlāt tṛtayaṃ tṛtayaṃ kramāt ||

patraṃ phalaṃ kādiraṃ ca cūrṇaṃ caiva caturthakaṃ |
paṃcamaṃ tu sukhaṃ proktaṃ rāgaḥ ṣaṣṭha udāhṛtaḥ ||

ṣaḍaṃgamiti saṃproktaṃ ṣaḍaiśvaryayutāyakaṃ |
(******) (?) vasestatralakṣmī niraṃtaraṃ 
||

<p. 130a>

tadgṛhītvā varārohe svecchayā viharet tataḥ |
atha vā sāyaṃtana bhavaṃ kṛtyaṃ samavadhāraya ||

saṃdhyāhnakālavat saṃdhyāṃ vaidikīṃ samupāsya hi |
tāṃtrikīmācareddevī trivarṇasthāna cetaraḥ ||

turyastu tāṃtrikīmevano bhāvapyavalājaghanaḥ |
astaṃgamanavelāyāṃ mārtaṇḍasya niśā su vā ||

atha nitya śivāvalidānaṃ ||

vilvamūle prāṃtare vā śmaśāne vāpi sādhakaḥ |
sthāpino jayino nityaṃ kāmye caiva kulākule ||

māṃsa pradhāna naivedyaṃ saṃdhyākāle nivedayet |
kālikālīti vaktavye tadā sā śivarūpiṇī ||

paśurūpadharāyāti parivāragaṇaiḥ saha |
bhuktvā rauti yadaiśānyāṃ mukhamuttolyasusvaraṃ ||

tadaiva maṃgalaṃ tasya anyathā kuladūṣaṇaṃ |
avaśyaṃ cānnadānena niyataṃ toṣayecchivāṃ ||

nityaśrāddhaṃ yathā saṃdhyā caṃdanaṃ pitṛtarpaṇaṃ |
tathaiva kulasevyānāṃ nityatā kulapūjanṃ ||

paśurūpadharāṃ devīṃ yo nārcayati nirjane |
śivārāveṇa tasyāśu sarvaṃ naśyati niścitaṃ ||

japapūjāvidhānāni yatkiṃcit sukṛtāni ca |
gṛhītvā śāpamādatte śivārodati nirjane ||

ekayā bhujyate yatra śivayā kulabhairavi |
tatraiva sarvaśaktīnī prītiḥ paramadurlabhā ||

paśuśaktiḥ pakṣiśaktirnaraśaktiryathā kramāt |
pūjanād dviguṇaṃ karma saguṇaṃ sādhako yataḥ ||

tena sarvaprayatnena kartavyaṃ pūjanaṃ mahat |
rājādi bhayamāpanne deśāṃtara bhayādike ||

śubhāśubhāni karmāṇi viciṃtya valimāharet |
gṛhna devi mahābhāge śive kālāgnirūpiṇī ||

śubhāśubhaphalaṃ vyaktaṃ vrūhi gṛhna valiṃ tava |
evamuccāryadātavyo valiḥ kulajanai priye ||

tadi no bhujyate devi tadā naiva śubhaṃ bhavet |
śubhaṃ yadi bhavet tatra bhujyate tadaśeṣataḥ ||

evaṃ jñātvā mahādevi śāṃtiṃ svastyayanaṃ caret ||

iti śivāvalidānam ||

<p. 130b>

kṛta śaucastathā cāṃtaḥ punaḥ pūjālayaṃ viśet |
puṣpasragdhūpanaivedya validīpādi saṃbhṛtiṃ ||

pūjākālī navat kuryāt sādhayaṃtaṃ samarcane |
ārātrikaṃ vibhavato dīpavṛkṣānapi priye ||

kṣaṇaṃ nimīlya nayane dhyānaṃ pūrvoktavaccaret |
tato vaddhāṃjaliḥ padmayugalaṃ samudīrayet ||

yoginyo mātaraḥ siddhāḥ kṣetrapālān vināyakāḥ |
tathā vaṭukanāthaśca cāmuṇḍā bhairavīgaṇāḥ ||

vetālabhūtakuṃbhāṇḍāye cānye kālikānumāḥ |
iha kurvaṃtu sānnidhyaṃ kurvehaṃ naiśikārcanaṃ ||

paṭhitvetthaṃ tataḥ kuryādṛṣyādidviṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
vaktranyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryādāvaśyakatayāpriye ||

anyānapi svecchayaivayāvacchakyān samācaret |
vaktranyāsasya nityatvamitereṣāṃ ca kāmyataḥ ||

itthaṃ nyāsādikaṃ kṛtvā svecchayā suravaṃdite |
vaddhāṃjaliḥ punarapi ślokanekaṃ samuccaret ||

he guhyakālī jagadīśvarī viśvamātaścaitanyarūpiṇī sadāśiva jīvatulye |
dainaṃdina pracitayā pacayāpahatyaisāyaṃtanaṃ smaraṇamamvakaromitehaṃ ||

paṭhitvemaṃ tataḥ puṣpaṃ gṛhītvāṃ jalinā priye |
trikhaṇḍā mudrayā vāpi dhyānonmīlita dṛk caret ||

atha trikhaṇḍāmudrā yathā ||

parivartyakarau spṛṣṭāvaṃguṣṭhau kārayet samau |
anāmāṃtargate kṛtvā tarjanyau kuṭilākṛtī ||

kaniṣṭhike niyuṃjīte nijasthāna maheśvarī |
trikhaṇḍeyaṃ samākhyātā tripurāhvāna karmaṇi ||

pūrvastotrokta padyobhyāṃ na tu dhyāyediti kramaiḥ |
yāvatvarkakaletekaṃ brahmeṃdreti dvitīyakaṃ ||

śaktau pūrvoktavat kuryādā vāhanapuraḥsarān |
upacārān ṣoḍaśabhirmaṃtraireva puroditaiḥ ||

aśaktau kusumaiḥ sragbhirddhūpadīpaidirātrikaiḥ |
naivedyairvalibhistotraiḥ pāṭhairapi japairapi ||

daṇḍavat praṇameccāpi kuryāccāpi pradakṣiṇaṃ |
kākūktibhiḥ prārthapītaḥ svasyābhīṣṭāni sādhakaḥ ||

yadi vedvidyate devi pratimā yaṃtrameva ca |
kalpayitvā tadākalpaṃ mṛdvāstaraṇa saṃvṛtaṃ ||

<p. 131a>

sthāpayitvopadhānaṃ ca sā japet tatrakālikāṃ |
naiśārcanopayuktāni syurvaidyāni ca yāni hi ||

avaśyaṃ tāni bhuṃjīta śaktibhiḥ sādhakaiḥ saha |
gītavādyādi nṛtyaṃtaṃ yathāśaktiṃ tataścaret ||

sāyaṃtanīna sa śanaṃ kuryāt pūrvoktavat tataḥ |
svayaṃ śayīta tadanusahasvābhiṣṭayāstriyā ||

pracchirā vā dakṣaśirā modak paścimamastakaḥ |
prāk śireśayane vidyā āyurvittaṃ ca dakṣiṇe ||

paścime pravalā ciṃtāhāni mṛtyustathottare |
kṛta śaucaḥ karapadairācāṃtaḥ su samāhitaḥ ||

dīpe jvalati nadhvāṃtenā kṛtā pavanāśanaḥ |
na ca stimitavatpāṇirnanagno nāpi kaṃcukī ||

paṭhendusvapnanāśāya vakṣyamāṇānmarutpriye |
jaganmātarmahāmāyekālike kālanāśini ||

duḥsvapnaṃ hararudrāṇitvadbhaktaṃ pāhimāṃ sadā |
bhūtapretapiśācādyāye bhīmādeva mānavaḥ ||

rakṣo dānavadaityāśca ye nidrābhaṃgakārakā |
duḥsvapnajāścaye doṣā mamahiṃsā karāścaye ||

tetvatsmaraṇadaṃbholi nihitāyāṃ tu saṃkṣayaṃ |
ye daṃdaśūkā vihagāvṛścikāḥ śūkayonayaḥ ||

yeṣāṃ viṣaṃ vādhateṅgaṃ ye ca śṛṃgaviṣāstathā |
viṣairvapuryutā kīṭāye codvegapradāyinaḥ ||

śrutvā te kālikānāma vidravaṃ tu diśodaśaḥ |
kālīkarālī cāmuṇḍā chinnamastā ca bhairavī ||

harasiddhāsiddhilakṣmīrdvāmarī vābhravī tathā |
mahāmārī tāmasī ca mātaṃgīśavareśvarī ||

carcikā śivadūtī ca mahāmahiṣamardinī |
ugracaṃḍākubjikā ca phetkārī guhyakālyapi ||

etāste mūrtayo ghorāyāśca saumyāsureśvarī |
mātaḥ śayānaṃ rakṣaṃ tu duḥsvapnaṃ nāśayaṃ tu ca ||

cakrapāśāsi śūlarṣṭi gadā parighatomarāḥ |
vajramudgarakuṃteṣu bhuśuṃḍī pāśapaṭṭiśaḥ ||

yānyanyāpi ca deveśi karayorvidhṛtāni te |
astrāṇi tāni rakṣaṃ tu svayaṃtaṃ māṃ maheśvarī ||

tvadājñayā nārasiṃhī pūrvasyāṃdiśi pātumāṃ |
vārāhī paścimāyāṃ ca dakṣiṇasyāṃ ca kālikā ||

<p. 131b>

uttarasyāṃ ca cāmuṇḍā mahāghoratarāvatu |
urddhaṃ tathādho digvidiśostvaṃ sarvatraiva pāhimāṃ ||

śaktayoyāścate devi parivāragaṇāścaye |
sarvatra sarvadā pāṃtu māṃ tvaccaraṇasevakaṃ ||

tvadājñayaiva deveśi nānārūpadharāvubhau |
devau māmavatāṃ viṣṇurudrau sarvasureśvarau ||

varāho nārasiṃhaśca vāmanonaṃta eva ca |
trivikramo hayagrīvaḥ ṣaḍaite pāṃtumāṃ sadā ||

mṛtyuṃjayo nīlakaṇṭho dakṣayajña vighātakaḥ |
tripurapnohariśmaśruḥ pinākī nīlalohitaḥ ||

pramatheśaḥ kīrtivāsā virupākṣo maheśvaraḥ |
ekādaśaitemāṃ pātu rudrāraudraḥ tanūdharāḥ ||

sadā māmakṛtaṃ bhītiṃ kurustvaṃ guhya kālike |
evamaṣṭādaśa ślokairakṣāṃ kṛtvān manaḥ priye ||

śayitaściṃtayan kālīṃ nirviśaṃ kena ceta sā |
sarvā niśāmayogajñogamayatyaiva nidrayā ||

uttiṣṭeccoṣasi punaḥ prātaḥkṛtya cikīrṣayā |
āhnikaṃ pūrvavat kāryaṃ svasvakalpokta vartmanā ||

atha madhyamānāṃ nityārcanavidhiḥ ||

athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmiyaṃ vināduḥkhamāpnuyāt |
prātarutthāya gurvādi smṛtvā śaucaṃ samācaret ||

snānasaṃdhyāṃ tarpaṇaṃ ca vaidikaṃ tāṃtrikaṃ tathā |
āgatya ca gṛhe paścāt prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ caret ||

kuryācca mātṛkānyāsaṃ tathā chaṃdapi devatam |
tanmaṃtrasya karāṃgākhya nyāsaṃ śaṃkhārgha saṃsthitiḥ ||

maṃtrasnānaṃ devatāyāḥ pūjāpaṃcorikā |
caṃdanāṃ te tvāvṛtīnāṃ puṣpaireva prapūjanaṃ ||

vaiśva devottaraṃ tatra dadannāhuti paṃcakaṃ |
mūlena homayet tat prāgjapaścāṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ ||

vaidikākāśavalyaṃte pūjā cocchiṣṭa bhojitaṃ |
tataḥ saṃprārthayeddevaṃ sāyaṃ saṃdhyā samācaret ||

devāgāraṃ dīpadānaṃ proktaṃ saṃkṣepamāhnikaṃ ||

atha pravāsa kārāgṛhādya śubhasthānāhnikaṃ ||

athāparāhnikaṃ vakṣye tatsthāna daśake bhavet |
mārge pravāse durge ca nāntaḥ prāptau manobhaye ||

kārāgṛhe śubhesthāne sarpavyāghrādije bhaye |
paracakrāgame kuryācchau cādyaṃ tu yathā tathā ||

maṃtrasnānādikaṃ ciṃtya kṛtvā mānasapūjanaṃ |
manasā hṛdayasyāṃtardhyātvā yogākhya pīṭhakaṃ ||

<p. 132a>

tatraiva pṛthivīmadhye pūjāṃ devasya cācaret |
yathā puṣpādibhiḥ pūjā vahirdeśe vidhīyate ||

tathā hṛdyapi kartavyāḥ sarvāstāḥ pratipattaye |
manasā jaṭhare home etadvipadi cāhnike ||

atha rogiṇāmāhnikaṃ ||

athāturāhnikaṃ vakṣye nityaṃ svāsthyādhikasya tat |
yadi laṃghanaparyaṃto vyādhirātmani dṛśyate ||

tadā pūjā na kartavyāsthaṇḍilaṃ pratimāsu ca |
na snānaṃ daṃtakāṣṭhaṃ vā kuryāddho na mathāpi vā ||

ravimaṃḍalamālokya pratimāmatha vā punaḥ |
mūlamaṃtraṃ sakṛjjaptvā puṣpaṃ sākṣatamutsṛjet ||

śrāṃto vyādhibhiratyugrairjarayā ceṃdriyai śataḥ |
nijasāmayakairvāpi svakartavyaṃ samāpayet ||

agnivṛttastataḥ kṛtvā pūjayitvāgni devatāḥ |
guruvidyāṃstadagre ca vākyaṃ ca tadudīrayet ||

etāvat kālavicchinnā pūjāyuṣmat prasādataḥ |
na doṣostviti saṃprāpya punaḥ pūrvavadācaret ||

yastu rogavaśāddoṣo jātastat kṣālanaṃ caret |
japena vātha dānena homane dhanatopi vā ||

athāṇau vāhnikaṃ ||

atha sūtakināṃ nityaṃ vaidikaṃ smṛtīritaṃ |
jātasūtakamādau ca tadaṃte mṛtasūtakaṃ ||

dvijasya sūtake devi na devoccāṭamācaret |
saṃdhyāṃ ca mānasīṃ kuryāt dhyātvaiva parameśvarī ||

śālagrāmaṃ ca pratimāṃ na spṛśet karhicit priye |
sparśātpāpī naro bhūyānnā prakāryā vicāraṇāt ||

kṛtvā tāṃtrikapūjādi manasaiva samācaret |
kāmanārthaṃ prayogaścet tadā pūrvavadācaret ||

mṛtagehaṃ parityajya vāmācāreṇā sūtrakaṃ |
spṛhāṃ hitvā jñāna pūrvaṃ kulatodharmamāgataṃ ||

yayālabhedvāmadharmaṃ devatāyāṃ sajāyate |
gurūpadiṣṭaṃ yatkarma bhaktyā vāme karoti yaḥ ||

śāstratatvaṃ devatatvaṃ no vahiḥ sa tu guhyakaḥ |
jñātvā tamevaṃ bhajate sukhārthā tatra jāyate ||

kṣuṭ tṛṣṇā mohitaḥ pretastasyāddharmaṃ vicārayet |
saṃtastena na cellasyāvyarghya yātrādi sādhanaṃ ||

<p. 132b>

pūjodakena kartvyā toya yannaiva vidyate |
tadā saṃpūjayeddevaṃ bhāvanā kusumādibhiḥ ||

bhaktiśraddhābhāvanā ca pūjānāṃ jīva ucyate ||

atha jaḍāhnikaṃ ||

jaḍānāmāhnikaṃ vakṣye tathā saṃkṣepa karmaṇi |
ratnamaṃḍapa dharmādi catuṣkamuragoṃ vrajaṃ ||

mūlamūrtiḥ ṣaḍaṃgāni teṣāṃ pūjā vidhīyate ||

sarveṣāmapi vastūnāma lābhe bhāvanaiva hi |
nirmalenodake naiva pūjayet sthiramānasaḥ ||

sāmānyatastridhā pūjā cottamā madhyadhamā |
adhikārī nimittābhyāṃ bhidyate śatadhā punaḥ ||

yā sopakaraṇaiḥ kṛtsnaiḥ krīyamāṇottamāmatāḥ |
yathā labdhairviniṣpādyairdravyaiḥ pūjā tu madhyamā ||

yatra puṣpāṃvu niṣpādyā pūjā cādhamasaṃjñakāḥ |
vihitākhila vedāktairbrahmarṣibhirakalmaṣaiḥ ||

kriyamāṇā tu yā pūjā sātvikī sā vimuktidā |
rājarṣibhistayoniṣṭairbhagavattatvavedibhiḥ ||

yā pūjā krīyate samyagrājasī sā sukhapradā |
strīvāla vṛddhamūrkhādyairbhaktairakṣudramānasaiḥ ||

yā pūjā krīyate nityaṃ tāmasī sā prakīrtitā ||

araṇye svalpa kāmānāṃ siddhyarthaṃ pūjanaṃ hitaṃ |
niṣkāmānāṃ gṛhasthānāṃ hitaṃ gehe tu pūjanaṃ ||

kadācidapi ratyājo vedamārgo dvijaiḥ sadā |
vedacyutānāṃ vipratvaṃ devatvaṃ cāpi durlabhaṃ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau bhojanādipūjāyāḥ sātvikādibhedāṃtanirṇayo nāma 
viṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 20 ||
sarvasādhāraṇaṃdhīrā uktamevā puro mayā |
kalpāni daśavidyāyā krameṇa kathayāmi tu ||

atha śyāmā yā viśeṣa kramamāha ||

snānaṃ saṃdhyādikaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavat samupasya ca |
avahirmāna sā yogī yāgabhūmiṃ tathā viśet ||

atha sthānamāha ||

ekaliṃge śmaśāne ca śūnyāgāre catuḥpathe |
tatrasthaḥ sādhayedyogī vidyāṃ tribhavamocinīṃ ||

eteṣāṃ lakṣaṇamāha ||

paṃcakrośāṃtare yatra na liṃgāṃtaramiṣyate |
tadā kaligamākhyātaṃ tatra siddhiranuttamā ||

<p. 133a>

(***) (?) vyasano yatra sa ca kīlakasaṃkule |
gṛdhragomāyukākādyairmāṃsalubdhairyadāvṛtaṃ ||

tachmaśānamitikhyātaṃ piśāca gaṇasevitaṃ |
kākādi gṛdhra saṃyuktaṃ kṛmichatrādi saṃyutaṃ ||

nāgarairdūranirmuktaṃ sādhvasodvetakāraṇaṃ |
saudhasaṃrūḍhadyāsāḍhyaṃ śūnyāgāraṃ taducyate ||

caturṇāṃ patho yatra saṃyogo yugapad bhavet |
taccatuṣpathamityuktaṃ rajanyāmiṣṭadāyakaṃ ||

pūrvapūrvakamiśastaṃ jaghanyaṃ cottarottaraṃ |
urjaṭe parvate vāpi nirjane vā catuṣpathe ||

devāgāre devaśūnye vilvamūle nadītaṭe |
svagṛhe nirjanā rāme tathā cāśvattha sannidhau ||

tadabhāve divyagehe siṃdūrādibhiraṃkite |
khaḍgaśūlagadākartrī cāmaravyajanādibhiḥ ||

vitāna dhūpasaṃkīrṇe kṛṣṇā guru suvāsite |
yuvatīnāṃ surāpīnāṃ veśyānāṃlāsya śobhite ||

śaṃkhaghaṃṭhāravākīrṇe dīpāvali virājate |
evaṃ putragṛhe pūjā kālikāyāḥ suśobhanā ||

atha kālamāha ||

sarva eva śubhaḥ kālo nā śubhaṃ vidyate kvacit |
na viśeṣo divārātrau saṃdhyāyāmatha vā niśi ||

na viśeṣo divārātrau saṃdhyāyāmatha vā niśi |
vali pūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ rātrau tu kriyate yadi ||

tattadakṣayatāṃ yāti kālikāyāḥ prasādataḥ |
gate tu prathameyāme tṛtīya praharāvadhi ||

kulapūjāṃ prakartavyā kulaśāstra viśāradaiḥ |
jalaśaṃkhaṃ kare kṛtvā gatvā dvāri maheśvarī ||

kṣālayeddhastapādau ca vakṣyamāṇena vartmanā ||

oṃ vajrodake hūṃ phaṭ svāhā maṃtreṇa maṃtravit |
jalamānīya savyena āsanaṃ śodhayet tataḥ ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya jajjāvījaṃ tathaiva ca |
tato viśuddhāṃte sarve pāpāni śamayaṃ ca ||

aśeṣāṃte viklpaṃ syāda panayeti tataḥ paraṃ |
tato ācamanaṃ kṛtvā sāmānyārghyaṃ prakalpayet ||

trikoṇavṛttabhūvivaṃ trikoṇa racayet tataḥ |
ādhāraśaktiṃ saṃpūjya tatrādhāraṃ viniḥkṣipet ||

<p. 133b>

astramaṃtreṇa saṃśodhya hṛnmaṃtreṇa prapūrayet |
niḥkṣipet tīrthamāvāhya gaṃdhādyaṃ praṇavena tu ||

darśayeddhanu mudrā vai sāmānyārghamidaṃ smṛtaṃ |
sāmānyārgheṇa deveśi pūjayedvārapārśvagān ||

gaṇeśaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ ca vaṭukaṃ yoginīṃ tathā |
gaṃgāṃ ca yamunāṃ caiva lakṣmīṃ vāṇīṃ tato viśet ||

gāṃ vījādyaṃ gaṇeśānaṃ vā mādyaṃ vaṭukaṃ tathā |
kṣāmādyaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ ca yāmādyaṃ yoginīṃ tataḥ ||

ūrddhve vāme dakṣiṇe ca adhaścaivaṃ prakīrtitāḥ ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya sarvavighnāntataḥ paraṃ |
utsāraya tato hūṃ phaṭ svāhā ca tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

anenaiva ca maṃtreṇa vighnānutsārayetsudhīḥ ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya rakṣarakṣa tadaṃtaraṃ |
hūṃ phaṭ svāheti maṃtreṇa pūjā bhūmiṃ ca śodhayet ||

tataḥ pravṛtta vajrādau praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddharet |
carmayaṃ ca tataścaiva phaṭ svāhā tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

anenaiva ca maṃtreṇa kuryād bhūmyabhimaṃtraṇaṃ ||

adhiṣṭānepi ca puṣyasya praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddharet |
ṭhātābhiṣeketi padaṃ ṭhātābhīti tataḥ padaṃ ||

ṣeketi ca padaṃ proktaṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā tataḥ paraṃ |
anena manunā devyāḥ puṣpādhiṣṭhānameva ca ||

praṇavaṃ puṣpaketuśca tathā rājārhate tathā |
ṭhātāyasasyagityuktvā saṃvuddhāya tataḥ paraṃ ||

puṣpe puṣpe mahāpuṣpe supuṣpe puṣpasaṃbhave |
puṣpe ca yāvakīrṇe hūṃ phaṭ svāhā ca tataḥ paraṃ ||

viśuddhaṃ puṣpame tena jalaṃ pūrvavadā haret ||

mṛdumacūḍamāsīnaścānyeṣu komaleṣu vā |
viṣṭareṣu samāsīraḥ sādhayet siddhamuttamā ||

mṛtāsanaṃ vinā devi yojapet kālikāṃ naraḥ |
tāvat kālaṃ nārakī syāt yāvadā dūta saṃplavam ||

ṛṣicchaṃdaṃ vidhāyātha kuśāṃ tatraiva dāpayet |
māyāvījaṃ samuccārya ādhāraśakti pūrvakaṃ ||

kamalāsanamālikhya ṅeṃtamoṃtaḥ prapūjayet |
ākārāṃtaṃ surekhe ca vajrarekhe tataḥ paraṃ ||

hūṃ phaṭ svāheti kūryād vai maṇḍalaṃ tu śavāsane |
vīrāsanenopaviśyet saṃpūjyāsanameva ca ||

<p. 134a>

atha vīrāsanaṃ yathā ||

ekapādamathai kasmin vinyasyoruṇi saṃsthitaḥ |
itarasminnatho cāruṃ vīrāsana mudāhṛtaṃ ||

atha maṃtrācamanamāha ||

upaviśyāsane maṃtrā camanaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
kālibhistribhiḥ pītvā kālyādibhirūpaspṛśet ||

dvābhyāmoṣṭhau dvirunmṛjya caikena kṣālayet karaṃ |
āsyaghrāṇe kṣaṇa śrotranābhyuraskaṃ bhujo spṛśet ||

ācamyaivaṃ bhavedyastu vatsarāttāṃ prapaśyati |
tataḥ ṣoḍaśavarṣīyānnārīmānīya yatnataḥ ||

yuvatīṃ vāmadonmattāṃ suveṣāṃ cāruhāsinīṃ |
sadā rase sābhilāṣīṃ siṃdūrāṃkitabhālikāṃ ||

sādhake premaśīlāṃtāṃ vāme saṃsthāpayedvudhaḥ ||

vinā hetu kamākhādya kṣobhayukto maheśvarī |
na pūjānnajapaṃ kuryānnadhyānaṃ nāpi ciṃtanaṃ ||

tasmādbhuktvā ca pītvā ca pūjayet parameśvarīṃ |
kūrcaṃ viyadviṃduyutaṃ śaktyastrāya phaḍityapi ||

anena manunā kuryād digvaṃdhaṃ choṭikādibhiḥ |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya tadanaṃtarameva ca ||

hūṃ phaṭ svāhā manuḥ proktaḥ kāyavāhacittaśodhane |
rakṣarakṣa hūṁ phaṭ svāhā maṃtrasyādātmarakṣaṇe ||

tataḥ kṛtāṃjali puṭo vāmadakṣiṇapāśvayoḥ |
guruṃ gaṇapatiṃ matvā purataḥ sveṣṭa devatāṃ ||

sugaṃdhapuṣpāṇyādāya caṃdanāktāni maṃtravit |
hyauṁ maṃtreṇa karayorastra maṃtreṇa mardayet ||

tat puṣpaṃ vāma hastena samādāya ca mastakaṃ |
bhrāmayet paritastāraṃ japannāghrāya tatpunaḥ ||

hauṁ oṃ pūrvapaṭhe chlokamimaṃ sa ca nigadyate |
te sarve vilayaṃ yātuṃ yemāṃ hiṃsaṃti hiṃsakāḥ ||

mṛtyuroga bhayakleśāḥpataṃtu ripumastake |
astramaṃtreṇa nārā ca mudrayeśa diśi tyajet ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryādātmānaṃ kuṇḍalīyutaṃ |
jīvaṃ haṃsena saṃyojya śive ca madhyamādyayā ||

pāpaṃ kukṣisthitaṃ krūraṃ vāyvagnimanilākṣaraiḥ |
śoṣayedāhayedaṃtaḥ prakṣālya recayedvahiḥ ||

sohamaṃtreṇatāmeva yathā sthānaṃ samānayet |
tataḥ śuddhaśarīro sau jīvanyāsaṃ samācaret ||

athāsyāḥ maṃtrabhūta śuddhimāha ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryāt svamaṃtrākṣarayogataḥ |
yathā kālī tathā tārā yathā tārā tathonmukhī ||

<p. 134b>

bhūtaśudhyādikaṃ sarvaṃ tāriṇīvat samācaret ||

prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kuryādvighatayā tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

bhairavosyā ṛṣiḥ prokta uṣṇik chaṃda udāhṛtaḥ |
devatā kālikā proktā lajjāvījaṃ tu vījakaṃ ||

śaktistu kūrcavījaṃ syāt kīlakaṃ codyavījakaṃ |
viniyogo maheśāni caturvargasya siddhaye ||

aṃganyā sa karanyāsau yathāvadabhidhīyate |
ṣaḍdīrghabhājā vījena praṇavādyena kalpayet ||

praṇavaṃ cādyavījaṃ ca ṣaḍdīrghasvarabheditaṃ |
kuryāt ṣaḍaṃgavinyāsaṃ mūlakhaṃḍatrayeṇa ca ||

varṇanyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryād divyabhāva phalapradaṃ |
hṛdvāhu pādayugmeṣu sa viṃdūn mātṛkākṣarān ||

paṃktiśo vinyaset paścādvyāpakanyāsamācaret |
dorbhyāṃ ca vyāpakaṃ kuryān mūlavidyāṃ samuccaran ||

pādādi ca śiro aṃtaṃ śira ādi padāṃtakaṃ |
sakṛdevaṃ pravinyasya sādhakastanmayo bhavet ||

atha varṇanyāsaḥ ||

hṛdayevinyasedvāpi akārādi daśākṣaraṃ |
ekārādi daśaccaiva paraṃ tu dakṣiṇe bhuje ||

bhuje vāme pravinyasya ṅakārādi daśākṣaraṃ |
paraṃ tu dakṣiṇe jaṃgheṇakārādi daśanyaset ||

makārādi kṣakārāṃtaṃ vāmajaṃghe pravinyaset ||

iti varṇanyāsaḥ ||

atha ṣoḍhānyāsaḥ ||

vakṣye ṣoḍhātmakaṃ nyāsaṃ durlabhaṃ bhuvanatraye |
yaṃ kṛtvā sādhaka śreṣṭho bhavedbhairava sannibhaḥ ||

vinyasen mātṛkāṃ pūrvaṃ nyāsoyaṃ prathamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
śriyā saṃpuṭitaṃ varṇaṃ varṇa saṃpuṭitāṃ śriyaṃ ||

evaṃ krameṇa vinyasya dvitīyaśca samīritaḥ |
kāmasaṃpuṭitaṃ lakṣmīṃ lakṣmī saṃpuṭitaṃ ca taṃ ||

vinyasen mātṛkāsthāne tṛtīyoyaṃ samīritaḥ |
lajjayā saṃpuṭī lakṣmīṃ śriyā saṃpuṭitāṃ hriyaṃ ||

pūrvavad vinyasen maṃtrīnyāsastūrya udāhṛtaḥ |
mukhavṛtta samārūḍha lajjā dvaṃdvanamodvayaṃ ||

śaśāṃkaśakalārūḍhaṃ kāmaśakrapade sthitaṃ |
mūlasaṃpuṭitaṃ kṛtvā tatpuṭaṃ ca manuṃ tathā ||

vinyaseduktamārgeṇanyāsoyaṃ paṃcamo bhavet |
anulomavilomenelipi sthāneṣu kevalaṃ ||

<p. 135a>

mūlaṃ vinyasya medhāvī mūlamaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
saṃjapya vyāpayeddehenyāsaḥ ṣaṣṭhoyamīritaḥ ||

kālikāmaṃtrarājasya ṣoḍhānyāsoyamīritaḥ |
evaṃ nyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryāt sa maṃtrī bhairavopamaḥ ||

viṣopa mṛtyuharaṇaṃ graharogavināśanaṃ |
duṣṭāḥ sarvevinaśyaṃti śatravoyāṃti mitratāṃ ||

kavitālaharītasya drākṣārasa paraṃparā |
aṇimādyaṣṭasiddhistu tasya haste vyavasthitā ||

kāyikaṃ vācikaṃ vāpi mānasaṃ yaccaduṣkṛtaṃ |
sarvaṃ tasya vināśatvaṃ yāti nyāsasya ciṃtanāt ||

brahmahatyā kṣayaṃ yāṃti yatkiṃcidupapātkaṃ |
yadrūpaṃ dṛśyate yaistu sa tadrūpaṃ ca gacchati ||

yaṃ namaṃti mahādevi ṣoḍhā puṭitavigrahāḥ |
alpāyuḥ sa bhavet sadyo devatā kaṃpatebhiyā ||

sa haraḥ sa hariḥ sākṣāt sa devī nātra saṃśayaḥ |
tārāyāśca tathonmukhyā idaṃ nyāsaṃ samācaret ||

aṇimādyaṣṭa siddhināmīśvaraśca bhavennaraḥ ||

atha guhya ṣoḍhānyāsaḥ ||

īśvara uvāca ||

śṛṇu devī pravakṣyāmi guhya ṣoḍhāmimāṃ priye |
na prakāśyamidaṃ kvāpi yadīchedātmano hitaṃ ||

karpūraṃ mātṛkāvarṇaiḥ puṭitaṃ mātṛkā sthale |
tenaiva puṭitaṃ varṇaṃ nyasedatraiva pārvati ||

kūrcavījayugaṃ devi vinyastavyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
śaktivījaṃ tathā devī vinyasen mūlamāditaḥ ||

dakṣiṇe kālikebhyāṃ tu pūrvavījatrayaṃ nyaset |
kūrca vījatrayaṃ devī lajjāvīja dvayaṃ ||

vinyastavyaṃ tathā devimīlitaṃ vahnijā yayā |
tatastatsakalanyasya vyāpakatvena devate ||

dvāviṃśatpakṣaremaṃtre ṣoḍhānyāsa ihoditaḥ |
ayaṃ tu siddhido loke tathā devāsureṣu ca ||

avaśyaṃ pratyahaṃ kāryaṃ na pūjā na japastathā |
kṛtepi sādhakaḥ śreṣṭho mahādeva samo bhavet ||

iti te kathitaṃ kiṃcid rahasyaṃ ghoradakṣiṇe |
na prakāśyaṃ kadācittu deveṣu ca tathā nari ||

atha tatvanyāsaḥ ||

ātmavidyā śivaistatvaistatvaṃ nyāsaṃ samācaret ||

<p. 135b>

atha vījanyāsaḥ ||

atha brahmabhruvormadhye lalāṭe nābhideśake |
guhye vaktre tu sarvāṃge saptavījāni vinyaset ||

atha maṃtravarṇa nyāsaḥ ||

śirasi nayane bhāle bhrūyugme karṇagaṇḍayoḥ |
vadane radane jihvāskaṃdhadeśe galeṣu ca ||

bhuja hṛdaya sa pārśve pṛṣṭanābhau ca rudre kaṭi udarakapāde sarvato maṃtra 
varṇān ||

mūlena vyāpakaṃ nyāsaṃ navadhā kārayet priye |
paṃcadhā navadhā vāpi mūlena saptadhā tathā ||

tataḥ strīveṣadhārī syāt siṃdūrāṃkitabhālakaḥ |
śṛṃgāro jvalaveśādya tāṃvūlapūritānanaḥ ||

evaṃ veśādikaṃ sarvaṃ vanitāmapi kārayet |
pīṭhanyāsastataḥ paścādādhāraśakti pūrvakaṃ ||

prakṛtiṃ kajaṭhaṃ caiva śeṣaṃ pṛthvīṃ tathaiva ca |
sudhāṃvudhiṃ maṇidvīpaṃ ciṃtāmaṇi gṛhaṃ tathā ||

śmaśānaṃ pārijātaṃ ca tanmūle ratnavedikāṃ |
tasyoparimaṇeḥ pīṭhaṃ nyaset sādhakapuṃgavaḥ ||

caturdikṣu munīn devān śavāṃśca śavamuṇḍakān |
dharmāṃdīścāpi dharmādīn pādagātra catuṣṭaye ||

hṛdipadme tathā padmaṃ sūryasomau maheśvari |
vaiśvānaraṃ tathā satvaṃ rajaścaivatamastathā ||

ātmānaṃ caiva vinyasya śakti hṛtpadmake nyaset |
icchājñāna kriyā caiva kāminī kāmadāyinī ||

ratīratipriyānaṃdā karṇikāyā manonmanī |
vāgbhavaṃ prathamaṃ coktvā parāyai tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

yai hyauṁ vācyamataḥ paraṃ ||

sadāśiva mahāpreta ṅeṃtaṃ padmāsanaṃ tataḥ |
nama ityeva maṃtroyaṃ pīṭha nyāsa udāhṛtaḥ ||

pīṭhapūjāṃ tataḥ kuryāt pradhānaṃ tu svaśaktibhiḥ |
ugrogra caṇḍā cāmuṇḍā pracaṇḍā vikaṭotkaṭā ||

saṃkaṭā caiva caṇḍogrā tathā maṃgala caṇḍikā ||

atrāṃtaryajanaṃ ||

evaṃ dehamayepīṭhe ciṃtayediṣṭa devatāṃ ||

atha vahiryāyaḥ ||

evaṃ vinyastadehaḥ san yaṃtrarājaṃ samuddharet |
tāmrapātre kapāle vā śmaśāna kāṣṭhanirmite ||

<p. 136a>

śanibhaumadine cāpi śarīre mṛta saṃbhave |
svarṇe rupye tathā lohe cakramarcyaṃ vidhānataḥ ||

āsurekhe vajrarekhe hūṁ phaṭ vahnivallabhā |
maṃtreṇānena vilikhedyaṃtrarājaṃ manoharaṃ ||

svayaṃbhū kusumaṃ kudagolotthaṃ rocanā guruḥ |
kaśmīra mṛganābhī ca padmaṃ ca malayodbhavaṃ ||

esa gaṃdhaḥ samākhyātaḥ sarvadā caṇḍike priye |
etena gaṃdhayogena yonicakraṃ samālikhet ||

maṃtrabhedena śrīkālyāḥ yaṃtrāṇi saṃśṛṇu priye |
ādau śaktiṃ samutpādya śaktīnāṃ tu catuṣṭayaṃ ||

vāhyāvāhya krameṇaiva madhye viṃduṃ likhecchive |
idaṃ vilikhya deveśi bhūpuraikena saṃyutaṃ ||

kvacid bhūpuraśabdena caturasraṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
atra bhūpuraśabdena caturdvārātmakaṃ bhavet ||

trikoṇa trayamālikhya ṣaṭkoṇaṃ ca tatopari |
vṛttāṣṭadalavṛttaṃ ca bhūpureṇa samanvitaṃ ||

viṃdumadhye tu śrīmāyākālī yaṃtraṃ susiddhidaṃ ||

maṃtramanya chṛṇu prājñe yonicakraṃ likhet sudhīḥ |
yonidvayaṃ tatolikhya ṣaṭkoṇaṃ ca tato bhavet ||

tataścāṣṭadalaṃ padmabhūgṛheṇa samanvitaṃ |
yaṃtrametan maheśāni mahāsāmrājyadāyakaṃ ||

ādau yoniṃ samālikhya yoniṃ ca tadvahirlikhet |
yonitrayaṃ tadvahistu tato vṛttaṃ samālikhet ||

tataścāṣṭadalaṃ padmavṛttaṃ caiva tatopari |
dharaṇī gṛhamālikhya yaṃtrametanmayeritaṃ ||

śaktimādyāṃ samutpādya tataḥ śaktidvayaṃ likhet |
vahni śaktiṃ samutpādya vāhyaśaktiṃ vibhedayet ||

graṃthibheda krameṇaiva vahniṃ prastārayedadhaḥ |
agnibheda krameṇaiva śaktyūrddhaṃ cāpi bhedayet ||

ūrddhvaṃ vahni vibhedena adhogniṃ ca vibhedayet |
trayaṃ yone dvayaṃ vahneḥ kālīyaṃtraṃ susiddhidaṃ ||

ṣaṭkoṇa vṛttāṣṭadalaṃ ṣaḍasraṃ vajralāṃchitaṃ |
tadvahirbhūpuraṃ yaṃtramāvṛtti trayasaṃyutaṃ ||

śaktyāgnibhyāṃ ca ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tatra yoni trayaṃ bhavet |
vṛttamaṣṭadalaṃ padmaṃ bhū caturdvārabhūṣitaṃ ||

yaṃtraṃ śrīdakṣiṇākālyāḥ madhye māyā vibhūṣitaṃ |
maṃtrabhedena vījānāṃ nirṇayaḥ kathyate śṛṇu ||

nādaviṃḍu yutaṃ cetsyāccicchaktiḥ parikīrtitā |
virādvījaṃ krameṇaiva vījayaṃtre vibhāvayet ||

<p. 136b>

pīṭhapūjāṃ tataḥ kuryādādhāraśaktipūrvakāṃ |
tato hṛdaya padmāṃta sphuraṃtī vidyudā kṛtiṃ ||

deveśītyādi maṃtreṇa viṃdvā vā vāhayet sudhīḥ |
tataḥ kāmakalādhyānādā vāhyakālikāṃ śivāṃ ||

kūrmākhya mudrayā puṣpaiścakramadhye nidhāpayet ||

kāmakalā dhyānaṃ ||

mukhaṃ viṃduvadākāraṃ tadadhaḥ kucayugmakaṃ |
sarvavidyāmṛtāpurṇaṃ sarvarogo bhavapradaṃ ||

sarvārthasādhakaṃ sarvajana raṃjanakārakaṃ |
tadadhaḥ sa parārddhaṃ ca supariskṛtamaṇḍalaṃ ||

sarvadevādi bhūtaṃ ca sarvadeva namaskṛtaṃ |
sarvāhrādana saṃpūrṇaṃ sarvaraṃjanakārakaṃ ||

sarvārthasādhakaṃ sarvaṃ devavaśya pravartakaṃ |
etat kāmakalāṃ dhyānaṃ sugopyaṃ sādhakottamaiḥ ||

kūrmamudrā yathā ||

vāmahastātha tarjanyā dakṣiṇasya kaniṣṭhayā |
tathā dakṣitarjanyā vāmāṃguṣṭhaṃ niyojayet ||

unnataṃ dakṣiṇāṃguṣṭhaṃ vāmasya madhyamādikāḥ |
aṃgulī yojayet pṛṣṭha dakṣiṇasya karasya ca ||

vāmasya pitṛtīrthena madhyamānāmikā tathā |
adhomukhe ca te kuryād dakṣiṇasya vahastataḥ ||

evaṃ vidhaḥ sarvasiddhiṃ dadāti karakacchapaḥ |
kuryā tu hṛdayāsannaṃ nimīlya nayanadvayaṃ ||

samaṃkāya śirogrīvaṃ kṛtvā sthiratarovudhaḥ |
dhyānaṃ samārabhen maṃtrī sarvapāpa pranāśanaṃ ||

atha dhyānaṃ ||

devyā dhyānamatho vakṣye sarvadevopaśobhitaṃ |
aṃjanādinibhāṃ devīṃ karālavadanāṃ śivāṃ ||

muṇḍamālā valīkīrṇāṃ muktakeśīṃ smitānanāṃ |
mahākāla hṛdaṃbhoja sthitāṃ pīnapayodharāṃ ||

viparītaratā saktā ghoradaṃṣṭrāṃ śivena vai |
nāgayajñopavītaṃ ca caṃdrārddhakṛtaśekharāṃ ||

sarvālaṃkārayuktāṃ ca muktāmaṇi vibhūṣitāṃ |
mṛtahasta sahasraistu vaddhakāṃcī digaṃvarāṃ ||

śivākoṭi sahasraistu yoginībhirvirājitāṃ |
raktapūrṇamukhāṃbhojāṃ madyapāna pramattikāṃ ||

vahnyarka śaśinetrāṃ ca raktavisphuritānanāṃ |
vigatāsu kiśorābhyāṃ kṛtavarṇāvataṃsinīṃ ||

karālavadanāṃ ghorāṃ muktakeśīṃ caturbhujāṃ |
kālikāṃ dakṣiṇāṃ divyāṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣiṇāṃ ||

<p. 137a>

sadyaśchinnaḥ śiraḥ khaḍgavāmorddhādhaḥ karāṃvujāṃ |
abhayaṃ varadaṃ caiva dakṣiṇādhorddhapāṇikāṃ ||

mahāmeghaprabhāṃ śyāmāṃ tathaiva ca digaṃvarāṃ |
kaṇṭhāvasamuṇḍālīgaladrudhiracarcitāṃ ||

karṇāvataṃ satāṃ nīta śavayugma bhayānakāṃ |
ghoradaṣṭrāṃ karālāsyāṃ pīnonnata payodharāṃ ||

śavānāṃ karasaṃvyātaiḥ kṛtakāṃcī hasatmukhīṃ |
sṛkkadvayagaladraktadhārā visphulitānanāṃ ||

ghorarūpāṃ mahāraudrīṃ śmaśānālayavāsinīṃ |
daṃturāṃ dakṣiṇāṃ divyāṃ muktalaṃvakacoccayāṃ ||

śavarūpa mahādeva hṛdayo parisaṃsthitāṃ |
śivābhirghoranādādiścaturdikṣu samanvitāṃ ||

mahākālena ca samamupariṣṭaratāturāṃ |
mukhaprasannanayanāṃ smerānana saroruhāṃ ||

evaṃ saṃciṃtya kālīṃ tu śmaśānālayavāsinīṃ ||

dhyātvā devī samāvāhya yonimudrāṃ ca darśayet |
khaḍgamuṃḍavarābhīti mahāyoniṃ tu darśayet ||

atha krameṇa khaḍgādi mudrāmāha ||

kaniṣṭhānāmike vaddhvāsyāṃguṣṭhe naiva dakṣataḥ |
śeṣāṃgulī tu prasṛte saṃspṛṣṭhe khaḍgamudrikāṃ ||

aṃtarāṃguṣṭhamuṣṭhiṃ ca kṛtvā vāmakarasya ca |
madhyamābhyāṃ dakṣiṇasya tathā laṃvya prayatnataḥ ||

madhyame nātha tarjanyāmaṃguṣṭhāgrāgrimohya tu |
dakṣiṇaṃ yojayet pāṇiṃ vāmamuṣṭau tu sādhakaḥ ||

darśayed dakṣiṇebhāge muṇḍamudreyamucyate |
adhaḥ sthito dakṣahastaḥ prasṛto varamudrikā ||

ūrddhvaḥ kṛto vāmahastaḥ prasṛto'bhayamudrikā |
tarjanyanāmikā madhye kaniṣṭhe cakramādapi ||

karayoryojayeccaiva kaniṣṭhā mūlabhedataḥ |
aṃguṣṭhāgraṃ tu niḥkṣipya mahāyoniḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

atha viśvasyo bhayātmakatvā chaktiṃ vinā śivasya śivaṃ 
vināśakteścopāsanāyāṃ phalābhāvādubhayoreka daivayajanamāha ||

tathā ca ||

prakṛtyā tu vinā devi na saṃsāraḥ kvacidbhavat |
puruṣaṃ ca vinā devi na vidyā siddhidāyinī ||

kālikāyāṃ mahākālaḥ suṃdaryāṃ laliteśvaraḥ |
tārāyāṃ ca tathā kṣobhyaśchinnāyāṃ vikarālakaḥ ||

<p. 137b>

bhuvanāyāṃ mahādevo dhūmrāyāṃ kālabhairavaḥ |
nārāyaṇo mahālakṣmyāṃ bhairavyāṃ vaṭukaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

mātaṃgyāṃ tu mataṃgaḥ syādathavā syāt sadāśivaḥ |
mṛtyuṃjayastu vagalā vidyāyāṃ parikīrtitaḥ ||

tasmāt kāraṇato devī dvitīyaṃ pūjayecchive |
mahākālaṃ yajet pūrvaṃ paścāddevīṃ prapūjayet ||

mahākālaṃ yajeddevyā dakṣiṇe dhūmravarṇakaṃ |
vibhrataṃ daṇḍaṣaṭkāṅga daṃṣṭrā bhīmamukhaṃ śiśuṃ ||

vyāghracarmāvṛta kaṭiṃ tuṃdilaṃ raktavāsasaṃ |
trinetra mūrddhakeśaṃ ca muṇḍamālā vibhūṣitaṃ ||

jaṭābhāslasaccandra khaḍgamugraṃ jvalanniva |
iti dhyātvā mahākāla maṃtreṇaiva ca prapūjayet ||

kavacaṃ sphauṁ samuddhṛtya yālārāvāṃ cakrauṃ mataḥ |
mahākāla bhairaveti sarvavighnāśayeti ca ||

nāśayati punaḥ procya māyāṃ lakṣmīṃ samuddharet |
phaṭ svāhayā samāyukto maṃtraḥ sarvārthasādhakaḥ ||

tato deviṃ punarddhyātvā sarvopacārataḥ sudhī |
pūjayet mūlamuccārya dakṣiṇāṃ kālikāṃvudhaḥ ||

tāṃvūlāṃ te trisaṃtarpya natvā yoniṃ pradarśayet |
devī vāmorddhādho haste khaḍgaṃ muṃḍaṃ ca pūjayet ||

devyā dakṣahastorddhādhaḥ pūjayeda bhayaṃ varaṃ ||

vijñāpya ca tato devyāḥ parivārāṃstathārcayet |
tataḥ ṣaḍaṃga pūjāṃte gurupaktiṃ prapūjayet ||

pādyādinā tathā paścāt pūjayedaṃgadevatā |
sarvamaṃtreṣu purataḥ sarvatra siddhidāyakāḥ ||

divyaughā guravodeva siddhaughā guravastathā |
mānavaughāḥ samāsena kathayāmita vāgrataḥ ||

tatrāsau kālikādevī tasyāḥ śṛṇu gurukramaṃ |
mahādevī mahādeva stripurācaiva bhairavaḥ ||

divyaughā guravaḥ proktāḥ siddhaughān kathayāmite |
brahmānaṃdaśca pūrṇaśca calacittaścalācalaḥ ||

kumāraḥ krodhanaścaiva varadaḥ smaradīpanaḥ |
māyā māyāvatī caiva mānavaughān śṛṇu priye ||

vimalaḥ kulaścaiva bhīmasenaḥ sudhākaraḥ |
mīnā gorakṣanāthaśca bhojadevaḥ prajāpatiḥ ||

mūladevoraṃtidevo vighneśo vai hutāśanaḥ |
samayānaṃda saṃtoṣau kālikā guravaḥ smṛtāḥ ||

<p. 138a>

divyā devītike nityaṃ siddhābhūmāvihāyi ca |
mānavaughā mānaveṣu mamarūpadharāḥ sadā ||

ānaṃdanātha śabdāṃtā guravaḥ sarvasiddhidā |
striyopi gururūpāścedatvāṃtāḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||

mānavaughāṃtike devī svaguruṃ paripūjayet |
nijaṃ guruṃ purā dhyātvā tato guru catuṣṭayaṃ ||

pūjayitvā yajeddevaṃ navasaṃkocamācaret |
guruṃ paramaguruṃ caiva parāpara guruṃ tathā ||

parameṣṭhī guruṃ caiva kathitā guravastava ||

atha guruṇāṃ sthānamāha ||

vidyā pṛṣṭhe maheśāni guravaḥ saṃti sarvadā |
kalpā tripaṃktimārgeṇa devīpṛṣṭha krameṇa ca ||

divyādi kramayogena tadadhaḥ svagurutrayaṃ |
dakṣodīcyaḥ pratīcyāṃ ca rekhā tritayakaṃ caret ||

divyaughā devatā pṛṣṭhe tadanyau tu sthale hṛdye |
vidyāyāḥ bhedabhāge tu svaguruṃ pūjayecchive ||

sarvatvayi maheśāni gurusthānaṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

atha etasyāvaśyakatāmāha ||

gurupūjāṃ vinā vatsadyadi pūjāṃ samārabhet |
taddoṣaśamane vatsaśaktiṃ pūjāṃ samārabhet ||

viguṇaṃ yatra yadvāsyāt saguṇaṃ kulapūjanāt |
kulāvalokane caiva syātkva ca proktamārjanaṃ ||

kva snānaṃ kva ca vākśuddhiḥ kva ca māsaviśodhanaṃ |
dīkṣā prabhuḥ kulīnāścet kulaṃ vā vaṭukeśvaraḥ ||

taddehe gurumānīya kularūpaṃ guruṃ smaret |
kulaṃ yathā gurustatra na tathā kulasādhakaḥ ||

gurukramaṃ ca kathitaṃ gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
yagoragrena caivaiṣāṃ nāmagrāhyaṃ kathaṃcana ||

athāvaraṇa devatāḥ paṃcadaśakoṇeṣu ||

tathā ca ||

tataśca sarvakoṇeṣu devīmāvāhya pūjayet ||

tataḥ pūrvādi koṇeṣu vāmāvartena pūjayet ||

kālī kapālinīṃ hullāṃ prathame tu trikoṇake |
nīlāṃghanāṃ valākāṃ ca dvitīye tu trikoṇake ||

kurukullā virodhinyau vipravittāṃ tṛtīyake |
ugrāmugraprabhāṃ dīptāṃ caturthe tu trikoṇake ||

mātrāṃ mudrāṃmitāṃ caiva trikoṇe paṃcamaṃ yajet |
sarvāḥ śyāmā asikarāmuṇḍamālā vibhūṣaṇā ||

<p. 138b>

tarjanī vāmahastena dhārayaṃtyaścasaṃmitāḥ |
tristriḥ pūjāprakartavyā sarvāsāmapi sādhakaiḥ ||

athāṣṭadale ||

brahmādyāḥ pūjayet patre patrāgre bhairavān yajet |
lokapālāṃ stato vāhye tadastrāṇi ca tadvahiḥ ||

vahirmaṇḍalataścāpi brāhmī nārāyaṇī tathā |
māheśvarī ca cāmuṇḍā kaumārī cāparājitā ||

vārāhī ca tathā pūjyā nārasiṃhī tathaiva ca |
tāraṃ pāśāṃ tathā śrī ca brāhmī śrīpādukāṃ tataḥ ||

pūjayāmita taścaiva dhyāyettāṃ brahmaṇapriyāṃ |
brahmāṇī haṃsamārūḍhāṃ svarṇavarṇāṃ caturbhujāṃ ||

caturvaktrāṃ trinetrāṃ ca kūrcaṃ ca paṃkajaṃ tathā |
daṇḍaṃ padmākṣa sūtraṃ ca dadhatīṃ cāruhāsinī ||

jaṭājūṭadharāṃ devīṃ bhāvayet sādhakottamaḥ |
evaṃ dhyātvā brahmapatnīṃ yathāśaktyāya yatpriye ||

oṃ ismṛtvā nārāyaṇī śrīpādukāṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
pujayāmīti coddhṛtya dhyāyettāṃ vaiṣṇavī priye ||

nārāyaṇī mahādīptāṃ śyāmāṃ garuḍavāhinīṃ |
nānālaṃkāra saṃyuktaṃ cārukeśīṃ caturbhujāṃ ||

ghaṇṭhāṃ śaṃkhaṃ kapālaṃ ca cakraṃ saṃdadhatīṃ parāṃ |
madhumattamadollola dṛṣṭiṃ sarvāṅgasuṃdarīṃ ||

iti dyātvā maheśāni yatnato bhāvayettataḥ |
pūjayitvā mahādevīṃ māheśvarīṃ yajet punaḥ ||

saviṃduṃ uṃ samuccārya māheśvarīṃ tataḥ priye |
śrīpādukāṃ tataścoktvā pūjayāmi tataḥ śiraḥ ||

dhyānamasyāvarārohe vravīmite niśāmaya |
māheśvarīṃ vṛṣārūḍhāṃ śuklāṃ trinayanānvitāṃ ||

kapālaṃ ḍamaruṃ caiva varadā bhayaśūlakaṃ |
ṭaṃkaṃ ca dadhatīṃ devīṃ nānābharaṇabhuṣitāṃ ||

pūjayecca yathā śaktyā dhyānaṃ kṛtvā maheśvarīṃ ||

ṛṃ vījaṃ cāmuṇḍā muktvā śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi |
pūjayitvā mahādevīṃ tato dhyānaṃ samācaret ||

cāmuṇḍo caṇḍahāsāṃ prakaṭita vadanāṃ bhīmavaktrāṃ trinetrāṃ 
nīlāṃbhojaprabhābhāṃ pramudita vapuṣaṃ nāramuṇḍāli mālāṃ |
khaḍgaṃ śūlaṃ kapālaṃ naraśiraghaṭitaṃ kheṭakaṃ dhārayaṃtī pretārūḍhāṃ 
pramattāṃ madhumadamuditāṃ bhāvayeccaṃḍarūpāṃ ||

<p. 139a>

evaṃ dhyātvā yajeddevīṃ cāmuṇḍāṃ jagadīśvarīṃ |
ṛṃkāreṇa ca kaumārīṃ saṃpūjya dhyānamācaret ||

kaumārīṃ kuṃkumā bhābhāṃ trinetrāṃ śikhi saṃsthitāṃ |
caturbhujāṃ śaktipāśāṃmaṃkuśā bhayadāyinīṃ ||

nānālaṃkāra saṃyuktāṃ pramattāṃ prariciṃtayet |
dhyānaṃ kṛtvā kaumārīṃ ca yathā śaktyā prapūjayet ||

vāgbhavena mahādevīṃ pūjayeda parājitāṃ |
sarvaṃ pūrveṇa vidhinā tato dhyānaṃ samācaret ||

aparājitāṃ ca pītāhāmakṣamudrā varapradāṃ |
kamalaṃ mātuliṃgaṃ ca dadhatīṃ pariciṃtayet ||

evaṃ saṃpūjya vidhivat sādhako bhaktito yajet |
aukāreṇa sureśāni vārāhīṃ pūjayet tadā ||

dhyānamasyānivodhatvaṃ vārāhyāḥ parameśvarī |
vārāhī dhūmravarṇābhāṃ varāhavadanāṃ śubhāṃ ||

phalakaṃ khaḍgamuśale phalaṃ vedabhujairvṛtāṃ |
vidhinā pūjayedenāṃ vārāhīṃ parameśvarīṃ ||

visargeṇa nārasiṃhīmarcayet sādhakāgraṇīḥ |
nārasiṃhī nṛsiṃhasya vibhratī sadṛśaṃ vapuḥ ||

dhyānamasyāḥ pravakṣyāmi devi te tanniśāmaya ||

kopādālolajihvā vivṛta nijamukhāṃ somasūryāgni netrāṃ pādānāṃ 
vābhiraktāmupari hṛditāṃ bhinnadaityeṃdragātrīṃ |
cakraṃ śaṃkhaṃ ca pāśāṃkuśakuliśagadāvāraṇānuddhṛhaṃtī bhīmāṃ 
tīkṣṇāgradaṃṣṭrāṃ maṇimayamukuṭāṃ nityamīḍe nṛsiṃhīṃ ||

evaṃ dhyātvā pūjayettu yathā śaktyā maheśvarī ||

athāṣṭadalāgre bhairavān bhairavaśca ||

asitāṃ goruruścaṇḍaḥ krodha unmatta bhairavaḥ |
kapālī bhīṣaṇaścaiva saṃhāraścāṣṭamaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

athaiṣādhyānaṃ ||

dathatāṃ janapuṃjanīlavarṇān varavetāla kapālaśūladaṇḍān |
laghuduṃdubhi saṃyuktāṃ strinetrān karadaṃḍaiḥkari hastadaṇḍa caṇḍaiḥ ||

gajakṛtti nivarttito turīyān bhrakuṭī saṃghaṭitairlalāṭapaṭṭaiḥ |
lalitālikulābhakuṃtalāgrān muditāṃtaḥ karaṇān ca yauvanādyān ||

eteṣāṃ maṃtro yathā ||

hrasvārṇā viṃdusaṃyuktāṃ vāṅmāyā pūrvabhūṣitā ||

<p. 139b>

atha bhairavāṇāṃ sthāne bhairavyaśca pūjyāḥ ||

bhairavī ca mahāsiṃha dhūmrabhīmādikāṃ catāṃ |
unmattabhairavīṃ paścād vaśīkaraṇa bhairavīṃ ||

patrāgreṣu yajenmaṃtrī mohanākhyāṃ ca bhairavīṃ |
tridhā tridhā yajedetā raktamālānu lepanaiḥ ||

atha dhyānamāsāṃ ||

udyadbhānu sahasrakāṃti maruṇakṣaumāṃ śiromālikāṃ raktālipta payodharāṃ 
japavaṭīṃ vidyāmabhītiṃvaraṃ |
hastābjairdhatīṃ trinetra vilasadvaktrā raviṃdaśriyaṃ deviṃ vaddhahimāṃśu 
ratnamukuṭāṃ vaṃde samaṃdasmitāṃ ||

atha bhūpurasyorddhe lokapālān pūjayet ||

pūrvārabhya īśānāṃtaṃ dikpālān pūjayet sudhīḥ |
indravījaṃ samuccārya iṃdrāya tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

surādhipataye coktvā sāṃgāya tadanaṃtaraṃ |
saparivārāya ca tataḥ sāyudhā yata topyanu ||

sa vāhanāya ca tato namaste na prapūjayet ||

laṁ raṁ yaṁ kṣaṁ vaṁ yaṁ śaṁ haṁ aṁ kaṁ evaṃ svasva vījādīnāṃ 
dikpālān pūjayet ||

dhyānaṃ tu ||

indraṃ surādhipaṃ pītamairāvatagataṃ vibhuṃ |
sahasranetraṃ dvibhujaṃ pītaṃ vajradharaṃ bhaje ||

agniṃ tejodhipaṃ raktaṃ śvetaśaktikaraṃ prabhuṃ |
subhūṣaṇaṃ meṣavāhaṃ vaṃde raktāṃtalocanaṃ ||

yamaṃ pretādhipaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ mahiṣo parisaṃsthitaṃ |
kāladaṇḍadharaṃ krūraṃ vṛttaṃ dūtairbhayānakaiḥ ||

rakṣodhipaṃ ca nir(-)ṛtaṃ śavāsanamāsthitaṃ |
dhūmābhaṃ khaḍgahastaṃ ca piṃgaśmaśruḥ sukūrcakaṃ ||

makare saṃsthitaṃ vidyunnibhapāśakarāṃvujaṃ |
śubhrāṃgatuṃ dilaṃ vaṃde varuṇaṃ yādasāṃpatiṃ ||

vāyuprāṇādhipaṃ dhūmraṃ raktāṃ kuśakaraṃ paraṃ |
vātapramī samārūḍhaṃ dhyāvaṃte vegato bhaje ||

yakṣapatiṃ kuveraṃ ca śuklaṃ śūlagadādharaṃ |
narasiṃhāsanārūḍhaṃ medalaṃ citriṇī yutaṃ ||

vidyādhipaṃ nīlaśūladharaṃ vṛṣabhavāhanaṃ |
trinetraṃ bhālacaṃdraṃ ca jaṭājūṭadharaṃsitaṃ ||

gauraṃ nāgādhipaṃ mūrddhni phaṇāmaṃḍalabhūṣitaṃ |
pīnottuṃgaṃ cakradharamanaṃtaṃ visagaṃ bhaje ||

lokādhipaṃ vidhātāraṃ raktaṃ padmakaraṃ śubhaṃ |
haṃsārūḍhaṃ vedapāṭhaṃ kurvaṃtaṃtamahaṃbhaje ||

tathā ||

<p. 140a>

indrokta vidhinā sarvaṃ pūjayet parameśvarī |
rakṣo varuṇayormadhye śeṣanāgaṃ prapūjayet ||

īśāna śakrayormadhye brahmāṇaṃ pūjayet tataḥ ||

atha lokapālānāṃ mudrā yathā ||

pāṇimūlesu saṃlagne śākhāḥ sarvāḥ prasāritāḥ |
lokeśānāmiyaṃ mudrā teṣāmarcā sudarśayet ||

atha bhūpurasya vahirdikpālāstrāṇi ||

tadvahirarcaye devi vajraṃ śaktiṃ ca daṇḍakaṃ |
khaḍgaṃ pāśamaṃkuśaṃ ca gadāṃ triśūlameva ca ||

kuvaro varuṇayormadhye cakraṃ pūjyaṃ tathaiva ca |
īśānaśakrayormadhye padmaṃ saṃpūjayet tataḥ ||

atha viśeṣābhāve sādhāraṇa maṃtramāha parivārāṇāṃ ||

nāmādya varṇavījāśca ṅeṃtāstāstu namoṃtikāḥ |
śrīpadaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya pādukā padamuddharet ||

pūjayāmi namaḥ paścāt pūjayedṅgadevatāḥ |
tataḥ pūrvokta rūpāṃ tu dhāyaiccaiva hi dakṣiṇāṃ ||

yoginī cakrasahitāṃ mahākāla samanvitāṃ ||

devyāstu dakṣiṇebhāge mahākālaṃ punaryajet |
pādyābhirmūladevīṃ saṃpūjya tarpayet tataḥ ||

tato devyairdhūpadīpaudadyānnai vedyakaṃ tathā |
puṣpāṃjali trayaṃ bhaktyā viśeṣārghyodakākṣataiḥ ||

devī vāmorddhādhohaste khaḍgaṃ muṇḍaṃ ca pūjayet |
devyādakṣahastorddhādhaḥ pūjayeda bhayaṃ varaṃ ||

punarmūlaṃ samuccārya sāṃgāyai sa pareti ca |
vārāyai nāmadevyāśca caturthyaṃtamudīrayet ||

atha validānaṃ ||

pūjāṃte bhojanādau ca valiṃdadyān maheśvari ||

tatrādau mahākāla validānaṃ tasya maṃtro yathā ||

humaṃte ca mahākālāchmaśānādhipa ityapi |
imamaṃte sāmiṣānnaṃ valiṃ gṛhnayugaṃ tataḥ ||

gṛhnāpaya padadvaṃdvaṃ vighnanivāraṇaṃ tataḥ |
kuru siddhiṃ ca me caiva prayaccha svāhayāyutaḥ ||

mahākālāya devāya praṇavādyena dāpayet ||

atha devyā validānaṃ maṃtropi ||

ehyehi jagatāṃ mātarjagatāṃ jananī tathā |
gṛhna gṛhna imaṃ nityaṃ validāna mataḥ paraṃ ||

siddhiṃ dehi padadvaṃdva tataḥ śatrukṣayaṃ kuru |
vāyuśabdaṃ samuccārya kūrcayugmaṃ punaḥ punaḥ ||

hṛllekhā dvitayaṃ pūrvamaṃte ca ṭhadvayaṃ punaḥ |
tadā maṃtra samuddhṛtya phaḍaṃte vahni suṃdarī ||

<p. 140b>

validānamidaṃ citraṃ sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ |
sarvāsu kālī vidyā su yathā nāmnā kṣipedvaliṃ ||

valibhiḥ sādhyate muktirvalibhiḥ sādhyate divaṃ |
validānena sa tataṃ japecchattra nṛpānnṛpaḥ ||

evaṃ pūjāṃ purā kṛtvā mūle naiva yathā vidhiḥ |
naivedyādi yathāśaktyā dadyāddaivyai punaḥ punaḥ ||

tato nīrājanaṃ kuryāddaśavāraṃ pradīpakaiḥ |
tataḥ samāhitaṃ maṃtrī guruṃ natvā śiraḥ sthitaṃ ||

mahākāla mahāmaṃtraṃ japedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ ||

śrī(-)īśvara uvāca ||

kullukāṃ mūrddhni saṃciṃtya hṛdi setuṃ viciṃtayet |
mahāsetuṃ viśuddhau ca sahasrāre samuddharet ||

maṇipūre tu nirvāṇaṃ mahākuṇḍalinīmataḥ |
svādhiṣṭhāne kamarājaṃ kākinī mūrddhni saṃsthitāṃ ||

viciṃtya vidhivaddevī mūlādhārāṃtikācchire |
viśuddhāṃtaṃ smareddevī visataṃtu tanīyasīṃ ||

vedasthānādvijihvāṃtaṃ mūlamaṃtrā vṛtāṃ vibhuḥ ||

atha dīpanī vidyā ||

kāṃtāṃ taṃ jīvanīvījaṃ tripado paribhūṣitaṃ |
kalāmanusvaropetaṃ vījatrayamudāhṛtaṃ ||

tuṃvuruṃ ca tato dadyāt saṃhāraṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ |
vidyādau yojayeddevī viṃdutraya kalānvitaṃ ||

eṣā tu dīpanī vidyā sarvāmnāyai namaskṛtā |
tatprabhāpaṭahairjihvāṃ pradīptāṃ ca vibhāvayet ||

ajñātvā dīpanīṃ vidyāṃ yojayet kālikāṃ parāṃ |
socirānmṛtyumāpnoti mṛte ca narakaṃ vrajet ||

atha maṃtra dhyānam ||

maṃtra dhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi japāt sārvajñadāyakaṃ |
maṃtradhyānānmaheśāni siddhyate brahmayataḥ ||

mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ sarvāṃ vidyāṃ vibhāvayet |
sūryakoṭi pratīkāśāṃ yogibhirdṛṣṭa pūrvikāṃ ||

devatā gurumaṃtrāṇāmaikyaṃ saṃbhāvayan dhiyā |
sa vāsanāṃ japenmaṃtraṃ saṃtuṣṭaḥ sthiramānasaḥ ||

daṃtākṣamālayā caiva rājadaṃte nameruṇā |
mūlamaṃtreṇātha pūrvanyāsān sarvān samācaret ||

aṣṭottara sahasraṃ tu tadarddhaṃ tridaśaṃ tu vā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi japennitya mananyadhīḥ ||

tejomayaṃ japaphalaṃ devyā haste samarpayet |
stuvanpradakṣiṇīkṛtya daṇḍavat praṇamedbhuvi ||

<p. 141a>

śrījagalanmaṃgalaṃnāma kavacaṃ prapaṭhestataḥ ||

atha dakṣiṇaṃ ||

tato vai śirasi puṣpaṃ datvāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇamya ca |
prasāryaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ hastaṃ svayaṃ namrānanaṃ punaḥ ||

darśayed dakṣiṇaṃ pārśvaṃ manasāpi pradakṣiṇaṃ |
tridhā ca veṣṭayet samyak kālikāyāḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ ||

sa ca pradakṣiṇo jñeyaḥ sarvadevaugha tuṣṭidaḥ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ yastu kālikāyāḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ ||

sarvān kāmānavāpnoti paścān mokṣamavāpnuyāt |
tathaiva manasā proktaṃ vācikaṃ kāyikaṃ tathā ||

sakalaṃ pūrvavat kāryaṃ vāmadakṣiṇabhedataḥ |
ayaṃ viśeṣaḥ kathitaḥ sāmānyaṃ pūrvamīritaṃ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau śrīdakṣiṇakālikāyāḥ nityārcananirṇayo 
nāmaikaviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 21 ||
atha karpūrastavamāha ||

karpūraṃ madhyamāṃtāḥ svarapararahitaṃ seṃduvāmākṣiyuktaṃ vījaṃ te 
vāmātaretattripuraharavadhūtriḥ kṛtaṃ ye japaṃti |
teṣāṃ gadyāni padyānijamukhakuharādullasaṃtyeva vācaḥ svacchaṃdaṃ 
dhvāṃtadhārādhararucirucire sarvasiddhiṃgatānāṃ ||

īśānaḥ seṃduvāmaśravaṇa parigato vījamanmanmaheśi dvandvāṃte maṃdacetā 
yadi japati janovāramekaṃ kadācit |
jitvā vācāmadhīśaṃ dhanadamapi ciraṃ mohayannamvujākṣī vṛndaṃ 
caṃdrārddhacūḍe prabhavati samamahāghorarāvāvataṃse ||

īśo vaiśvānarasthaḥ śaśadharavilasadvāmanetreṇayukto vījaṃte 
dvaṃdvamanyadvigalita cikure kālike ye japaṃti |
dveṣṭāraṃdhraṃtite ca tribhuvanamapitevaśyabhāvaṃ nayaṃti sṛkkadvaṃdvā 
pradhārādvayadharavadane dakṣiṇe tryakṣare ca ||

ūrddhvaṃ vāme kṛpāṇe karakamalatale chinnamuṇḍaṃ tatodhaḥ savyebhītiṃ 
varaṃ ca trijagadyaphaledakṣiṇe kālike ca |
japtvaitaṃ vāmaye vā tava manu vibhavaṃ bhāvayattastadarthaṃ 
teṣāmaṣṭaukarasthāḥ prakaṭitaradane siddhayastryamvakasya ||

vargādyaṃ vahniyuktaṃ vidhurati lalitaṃ taṃtrayaṃ kūrcayugmaṃ lajjādvaṃdvaṃ 
ca paścāt smitamukhaṃ tadadhaṣṭhadvayaṃ yojayitvā |
mātaryeye japaṃti smaraharamakhile bhāvayaṃtaḥ svarūpaṃte lakṣmīlākṣya 
līlākamaladaladṛśaḥ kāmarūpā bhavaṃti ||

<p. 141b>

pratyekaṃ vā dvayaṃ vā trayamapi ca paraṃ vījamatyaṃtaguptaṃ tvannāmnā 
yojayitvā sakalamapi sadābhāvayaṃtojapaṃti |
teṣāṃ netrā raviṃ devi rahati kamalāvaktra śubhrāṃ śuvimva vāgdevī 
devimuṇḍasragatiśayalasat kaṃṭhapīnastanāḍhye ||

gatāsūnāṃ vāhu prakarakṛta kāṃcī parilasannitaṃ vāṃ digvastrāṃ tribhuvana 
vidhātriṃ trinayanāṃ |
śmaśānasthetalyeseva hṛdi mahākālasurataḥ prasaktāṃ tvāṃ dhyāyet janani 
jaḍacetā api kaviḥ ||

śivābhirghorābhiḥ śavanivahamuṇḍāsthinivahaiḥ paraṃ saṃkīrṇāyāṃ prakaṭita 
citāyāṃ haravadhuṃ |
praviṣṭāṃ saṃtuṣṭāmuparisuratenāti yuvatīṃ sadātvāṃ dhyāyaṃtī kvacidapi na 
teṣāṃ paribhavaḥ ||

vadāmaḥ kiṃvātvāṃ jananivayamuccairjaḍadhiyona dhātānāpīśona harirapite 
vetti paramaṃ |
tathāpi tvadbhaktirmukharayati cāsmākamasi te tadetatkṣaṃtavyaṃ na khalu 
paśuṃrosaḥ samucitaḥ ||

samaṃtādāpīnastanajaghanadhṛk yauvanavatīratāsakto naktaṃ yadi japati 
bhaktastava manuṃ |
picāsāstvāṃ dhyāyan galitacikurastasya vaśagāḥ samastāḥ siddhaughā 
bhuvicirataraṃ jīvati kaviḥ ||

samāḥ svasthī bhūtāṃ japati viparītāṃ yadi sadā viciṃtyatvāṃ dhyāyannatiśaya 
mahākālasuratāṃ |
tadā tasya kṣoṇīṃtala virahamāṇasya viduṣaḥ karāṃbhoje vaśyā haravadhū 
mahāsiddhinivahāḥ ||

prasūteḥ saṃsāraṃ janani bhavatī pālayati yatsamastaṃ kṣityādi pralayasamaye 
saṃharati ca |
atastvāṃdhātāpi tribhuvanapatiḥ śrīpatiraho maheśopi prāyaḥ sakalamapi 
saṃstauti bhavatīṃ ||

anekāḥ sevaṃte bhavadadhika gīrvāṇani vahān vimūḍhāste mātaḥ kimapi na hi 
jānaṃti paramaṃ ||

samārādhyāmādyāṃ hariharaviriṃcyādi vivudhaiḥ |
prapannosmi svairaṃratirasa mahānaṃdaniratāṃ ||

dharitrī kīlālaṃ śucirapi samīropi gagaṇaṃ tvamekā kalyāṇī giriśaramaṇīkāli 
sakalaṃ |
stutiḥ kātemātastavacaraṇayormāmagatikaṃ prasannāstvaṃ 
bhūyādbhavamanurabhūyānmamajanuḥ ||

<p. 142a>

śmaśānasthaḥ susthogalita cikurodik paṭadharaḥ sahasraṃ tvarkāṇāṃ 
nijagalitavīryeṇa kusumaṃ |
japan tvat pratyekaṃ manumapi vidhvāna nirato mahāsālikhairaṃ sa bhavati dharitrī 
paridṛkaḥ || 

gṛhe saṃmārjanyā parigalita vīrya hi cikuraṃ samūlaṃ madhyāhne 
vitaranicitāyāṃkuja dine |
samuccāra prekṣṇāyanumapi sakṛt kāli sa tataṃ gajāruḍho yāti kṣiti parivṛtaḥ 
satkavivaraḥ ||

svapuṣpairākīrṇaṃ kusumadhanuṣo maṃdiramahāpurodhyāyan yadi japati 
bhaktastava manuṃ |
sa gaṃdharvaḥ śreṇaīpatiriva kavitvā mṛtanadī nadīnaḥ paryaṃtaṃ 
paramapadalīnaḥ prabhavati ||

tripaṃcāre pīṭhe śavaśivahṛdismesvadanāṃ mahākālenoccairmadana 
rasalāvaṇyaniratāṃ |
samāyukto naktaṃ svayamapiratānaṃdaniratājanoyodhyāyetvāṃ jananikilasasyāt 
smaraharaḥ ||

sa lomāsthisvairaṃ palalamapi mārjāramapi vā paraṃ mauṣaṃ meṣaṃ 
naramahiṣayośchāgamapi vā |
valiṃ te pūjāyāṃ mayi viralavaktre vitaraṃtāṃ na kiṃ siddhiḥ sarvāprati 
padamapūrvā prabhavati ||

vaśīlakṣaṃ maṃtraṃ japati haviṣyāśanarato divāmātaryuṣmaccaraṇa 
kamaladhyānanirataḥ |
paraṃ nakto nagno nidhuvana vinodena ca manuṃjanorlakṣaṃ samyak parahara 
samānaḥ kṣititale ||

idaṃ stotraṃ mātastava manusamuddhāraṇa japasvarūpākhyaṃ pādāṃvuja yugala 
pūjāvidhiyutaṃ |
niśārddhaṃ vā pūjāsamayamadhivāyastu paṭhati pralāpastasyāpi prasarati 
kavisvāmṛtarasaḥ ||

kuraṃgākṣī vṛṃdaṃta manusarati premataralaṃ vaśastasya kṣoṇīpatirapi kuvera 
pratinidhiḥ |
ripuḥ kārāgāraṃ kalayati ca tatkeli kalayā ciraṃjīvanmuktaṃ prabhavati subhaktaḥ 
pratijaniḥ ||

iti śrīmahākālakṛtaṃ karpūrastotraṃ samāptaṃ ||

athāsyapuraścaraṇam ||

kapūrākhyamidaṃ stotraṃ yaduktaṃ bhavatā purā |
ṣaṭkarmasādhanaṃ tasya prayogaṃ vada śaṃkara ||

śrīśiva uvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi karpūrastavasādhanaṃ |
sakṛt kṛtepi deveśi kālī tuṣṭā bhavet sadā ||

<p. 142b>

śanibhaumadine devi snātvā prayatamānasaḥ |
saṃpūjya kālikāṃ devīṃ saṃkalpaṃ samyagā caret ||

kṛtvā ṣoḍhādikaṃ devi paṭhet stotra manuttamaṃ |
ayutaika pramāṇena taddaśāṃśaṃ hunet sudhīḥ ||

tarpaṇaṃ cābhiṣekaṃ ca brāhmaṇān bhojayet tataḥ |
paścāt svakārya siddhyarthaṃ prayogānā care tadā ||

prayogamātre deveśi aṣṭottara sahasrakaṃ |
yojayet sarvakāryārthaṃ kāmanābhedabhāvitaḥ ||

ākarṣaṇe vaśīkāre māraṇoccāṭane tathā |
rājño bhaye samutpanne durbhikṣe śatrusaṃkaṭe ||

trāsotpanne maheśāni rogaśoka bhaye tathā |
paṭhet stotraṃ mahākālyāḥ sarvaśāṃtiṃ prayacchati ||

kumārī pūjanaṃ cāṃte kartavyaṃ susamāhitaḥ |
evaṃ kṛte maheśāni samyak siddhirbhavaddhruvam ||

atha jaganmaṃgalakavacaṃ ||

bhairavyuvāca ||

kālīpūjā śrutānātha vidyāśca vividhāḥ prabho |
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi kavacaṃ pūrvasūcitaṃ ||

tvameva śaraṇaṃ nātha trāhimāṃ duḥkhasaṃkaṭāt ||

śrībhairava uvāca |

rahasyaṃ śṛṇu vakṣyāmi bhairava prāṇavallabhe |
śrījaganmaṃgalaṃ nāmakavacaṃ maṃtravigrahaṃ ||

paṭhitvā dhārayitvā ca trailokyaṃ mohayet kṣaṇāt |
nārāyaṇopiya kṛtvā nārī bhūtvā maheśvaraṃ ||

yogaḥ saṃkṣobhamanayadyaddhṛtvā ca raghūdvahaḥ |
varadṛptān jaghāneva rāvaṇādīn niśācarān ||

yasya prasādādīśopi trailokyavijayī vibhuḥ |
dhanādhipaḥ kuveropi sureśo bhucchavīpatiḥ ||

evaṃ hi sa kalā devāḥ sarvasiddhīśvarāḥ priye |
śrījaganmaṃgalasyāsya kavacasya ṛṣiḥ śivaḥ ||

chaṃdonuṣṭup devatā ca kālikā dakṣiṇeritāḥ |
jagatāṃ mohaneṃ duṣṭavijaye bhuktimuktiṣu ||

yoṣidākarṣaṇe caiva viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
śiro me kālikāpātu krīṃkāraikākṣarīparā ||

krīṁ krīṁ krīṁ me lalāṭaṃ ca kālikā khaḍgadhāriṇī |
hūṁ hūṁ pātu netrayugmaṃ hrīṁ hrīṁ pātu śrutī mama ||

<p. 143a>

dakṣiṇe kālike pātu ghrāṇayugmaṃ maheśvaraī |
krīṁ krīṁ krīṁ rasanāṃ pātu hūṁ hūṁ pātu kapālakaṃ ||

vadanaṃ sakalaṃ pātu hrīṁ hrīṁ svāhā svarūpiṇī |
dvāviṃśatyakṣarīskaṃdhau mahāvidyā śubhapradā ||

khaḍgamuṇḍadharākālī varadā'bhayakāriṇī |
vidyābhiḥ sakalābhiśca sarvāṅgamebhito'vatu ||

krīṁ hūṁ krīṁ tryakṣarī pātu cāmuṇḍā hṛdayaṃ mama |
aiṁ hūṁ oṃ aiṁ stanadvaṃdvaṃ hrīṁ phaṭ svāhā kakusthalaṃ ||

aṣṭākṣarī mahāvidyā bhujau pātu sakartṛkā |
krīṁ krīṁ hūṁ hūṁ hrīṁ hrīṁ karau pātu ṣaḍakṣarī mama ||

krīṁ nābhi madhyadeśaṃ ca dakṣiṇe kālike ca tu |
krīṁ svāhā pātu pṛṣṭhaṃ tu kālikā sā daśākṣarī ||

hūṁ hrīṁ dakṣiṇe kālike krīṁ hūṁ pātu kaṭidvayaṃ |
kālikā dvādaśakṣarī svāhā mamoru yugmakaṃ ||

oṃ hrīṁ krīṁ me svāhā pātu kālikā jānunāṃ sadā |
kālī hṛnnāma vidyeyaṃ caturvarga phalapradā ||

krīṁ hūṁ hrīṁ pātu me gulphaṃ dakṣiṇe kālikepi ca |
krīṁ hūṁ hrīṁ svāhā pātu caturdaśākṣarī mama ||

khaḍgamuṇḍadharā kālī varadā'bhayadhāriṇī |
vidyābhiḥ sa kalābhiḥ sā sarvāṃgamabhito'vatu ||

kālī kapālinī kullā kuru kullā virodhinī |
vipracittā tathā grogra prabhādīptāghanatviṣaḥ ||

nīlāghanavalākā ca mātrāmudrāmitā ca māṃ |
etāḥ sarvāḥ khaḍgakarā muṇḍamālā vibhūṣaṇā ||

rakṣaṃ tu māṃ digvidikṣu brāhmī nārāyaṇī tathā |
māheśvarī ca cāmuṇḍā kaumārī cāparājitā ||

vārīhī nārasiṃhī ca sarvāścāmitabhūṣaṇā |
rakṣaṃ tu sāyudhairdikṣu vidikṣumāṃ yathā tathā ||

iti te kathitaṃ divyaṃ kavacaṃ paramādbhutaṃ |
śrījaganmaṃgalaṃ nāmakavacaṃ maṃtravigrahaṃ ||

trailokyākarṣakaṃ brahmakavacaṃ manmukhoditaṃ |
gurupūjāṃ vidhāyātha vidhivat prapaṭhet tataḥ ||

kavacaṃ triḥsakṛdvāpi yāvajjīvaṃ ca vā punaḥ |
etacchatārddhamāvartya trailokyavijayī bhavet ||

trailokyaṃ kṣobhayatyeva kavacasya prasādataḥ |
mahākavi bhavenmāsāt sarvasiddhīśvaro bhavet ||

puṣpāṃjalīn kālikāyai mūle naiva paṭhet sakṛt |
śatavarṣa sahasrāṇāṃ pūjāyāḥ phalamāpnuyāt ||

bhūrje vilikhitaṃ caitatsvarṇasthaṃ dhārayedyadi |
śikhāyāṃ dakṣiṇe vāhau kaṇṭhe vā dhārayadvudhaḥ |

trailokyaṃ mohaye krodhāt trailokye cūrṇayekṣaṇāt |
putravān dhanavān śrīmān nānāvidyā nidhirbhavet ||

<p. 143b>

brahmāstrādīni śastrāṇi tadgātra sparśanāt tataḥ |
nāśamāyāṃti deveśi nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

kākavaṃdhyā ca yā nārī vaṃdhyā cāmṛta putriṇī |
kaṇṭhe vā nāmahaste vā kavacasya vadhāraṇā ||

vahupatyā jīvavat sādbhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ |
na deyaṃ paraśiṣyebhyo abhaktebhyo viśeṣataḥ ||

śiṣyebhyo bhaktiyuktebhyaścānyathā mṛtyumāpnuyāt |
sparddhātuddhūya kamalā vāgdevī mukhamaṃdire ||

pautrāṃ tasthairyamāsthāya nivasatyeva niścitaṃ |
idaṃ kavacama jñātvā yo bhajet kālidakṣiṇā ||

śatalakṣa prajaptāpi tasya vidyā na siddhyatiḥ |
sa śastraghātamāpnoti so'cirānmṛtyumāpnuyāt ||

iti śrībhairavataṃtre bhairavabhairavīsaṃvāde śyāmākavacaṃ samāptam |

atha śatanāma ||

bhairava uvāca ||

mahākāla pravakṣyāmi devyā aṣṭottaraṃ śubhaṃ |
yadguhyaṃ paramaṃ puṇyaṃ sarvatra bhayanāśanaṃ ||

mahatī cetanāṃ māyāṃ mahādevīṃ maheśvarīṃ |
mahābuddhirmahācaṇḍāṃ mahākālīṃ mahākalāṃ ||

mahāmudrāṃ mahāvuddhāṃ mahānidrāṃ mahodbhavāṃ |
mahāśurbhrā mahālakṣmīṃrmahābhāgāṃ mahodayāṃ ||

mahāmohāṃ mohadṛṣṭirmahāpuṣṭirmahājayāṃ |
mahādhṛtirmahāghorāṃ mahādaṃṣṭrāṃ mahādyutiḥ ||

mahākāṃtirmahāpadmāṃ mahāsiddhāṃ mahātapāṃ |
mahāsvadhāṃ mahotsyahāṃ mahāvodhāṃ mahāsudhāṃ ||

mahāvaṃdhana saṃhartrīṃ mahābhayavināśinīṃ |
mahānetrāṃ mahāvaktrāṃ mahājihvāṃ mahābhujāṃ ||

mahāmahīruhāpāṇirmahājovāṃ mahānakāṃ |
mahākāṃtirmahākṣāṃtirmahāprītirmahāmatiḥ ||

mahāśvāsāṃ mahāsujñāṃ mahāparvatavāsinīṃ |
mahābrahmamayīṃ mātā mahākāyā mahāravāṃ ||

mahāsvarā śrīrmahatī pārvatī caṇḍikā śivāṃ |
mahākulāṃ mahālolāṃ mahāmatāṃ mahādhanāṃ ||

mahānīlāṃ mahāśailāṃ mahāvāhāṃ mahāvalāṃ |
mahāciṃtāṃ mahācittāṃ mahāheturyaśasvinī ||

mahāvidyāṃ mahāsādhyā mahāmedhāṃ mahāmatīṃ |
mahāśūlīṃ mahādaryāṃ mahāduḥsvapnanāśinī ||

<p. 144a>

mahāmokṣapradāṃ mokṣāṃ mahādakṣāsahāyanīṃ |
mahādakṣāṃ mahāvārṇī mahāśvekavināśinīṃ ||

mahākālā mahādhārā mahāmāyā ca khecarī |
mahākṣemaṃkarīkhyasyā mahaiśvarya pradāyinīṃ ||

mahāviṣaghnāṃ viṣahāṃ mahādurga praṇāśinīṃ |
mahādurgā mahāmatatvāṃ mahākailāsavāsinīṃ ||

mahāsutatvīsubhagā mahejyā ca mahāsatīṃ |
mahāpratyaṃgiro nityā mahāpreta karālinī ||

mahāśāṃtirmahāmuktirmahāmaṃgalakāriṇīṃ |
ya idaṃ kīrtayed bhaktyā viṣamastho bhavedyadi ||

lohapaṃjara madhyastha tasya naśyati vaṃdhanaṃ |
rājānodāsatāṃ cāṃti bhavet sarvajanapriyaḥ ||

acalā śriyamāpnoti tasya naśyaṃtyupadravāḥ |
saṃgrāme vijaye chatrūn khagavantagāni ca ||

na viṣaṃ kramate dehena mṛtyuḥ pāvake jale |
nā kāle maraṇaṃ tasya kadācit saṃbhaviṣyati ||

yaṃ yaṃ kāmayate kāmaṃ taṃ taṃ prāpnoti nityaśaḥ |
vahunā kimihoktena sarvasiddhipradaṃ nṛṇāṃ ||

iti śrīrudrayāmale bhairavasaṃvāde śyāmāṣṭottaraśatanāmastotraṃ saṃpūrṇam 
||

atha kakārādi sahasranāma ||

kailāśaśikhareramye nānādevagaṇāvṛte |
nānāvṛkṣa latākīrṇe nānāpakṣiravairyute ||

caturmaṇḍala saṃyukte śṛṃgāra maṇḍapasthite |
samādhau saṃsthitaṃ śāṃtaṃ krīḍaṃtaṃ yoginī priyaṃ ||

tatra maunadharaṃ dṛṣṭvā devī pṛcchati śaṃkaraṃ ||

devyuvāca ||

kiṃ tvayā japyate nātha kiṃ tvayā smaryate sadā |
sṛṣṭiḥ kutravilīnāsti punaḥ kutra prājāpate ||

brahmāṇḍa kāraṇaṃ kiṃtet kimādyaṃ kāraṇaṃ mahat |
manorathamayī siddhirvāṃchā siddhistathā śiva ||

tṛtīyā kalpanāsiddhiḥ koṭi siddhīśvaratvakaṃ |
śaktipātāṣṭa daśakaṃ carācara pūrīgatiḥ ||

mahendrajālamiṃdrādi jālānāṃ racanā tathā |
animā khecaratvaṃ ca parakāya praveśanaṃ ||

navīna sṛṣṭikaraṇaṃ samudraśoṣaṇaṃ tathā |
amāyā caṃdrasaṃdṛśyodi vā caṃdraprakāśanaṃ ||

caṃrāṣṭakaṃ cāṣṭadikṣu tathā caṃdrāṣṭakaṃ śiva |
jalejalamayatvaṃ ca vahnau vahninayatvakaṃ ||

brahmaviṣṇvādi nirmāṇamiṃdrāṇāṃ karaṇaṃ paraṃ |
pādukā guṭikā pakṣivetāla paṃcakaṃ tathā ||

<p. 144b>

rasāyanaṃ tathā guptistathaiva ca vilāṃ janaṃ |
mahāmadhumatī siddhistathā padmāvatī śiva ||

tathā bhogavatī siddhiryāvatyaḥ saṃti siddhayaḥ |
kena maṃtreṇa tapasā kalau pāpa samākule ||

āyuṣya puṇyarahite kathaṃ bhavati tadvada ||

śiva uvāca ||

vinā maṃtraṃ vinā stotraṃ vinaiva tapasā priye |
vinā valim vinābhyāsaṃ bhūtaśuddhiṃ vinā priye ||

siddhirāśubhavedyeva tadeva kathyate mahaḥ |
anye brahmāṇḍagole tu paṃcāśacchubha madhyage ||

paṃcaśūnye sthitāttārā sarvāṃte kālikā sthitā |
anaṃtakoṭi brahmāṇḍaṃ rājadaṃtāgrake śive ||

sthāpya śūnyālayaṃ kṛtvā kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ vidhāya ca |
mahānirguṇa rūpā tu vācā tītā parā kalā ||

krīḍayā śūnyarūpaṃ tu bhartāraṃ tu prakalpayet |
sṛṣṭerāraṃbha kāryārthaṃ chāyā dṛṣṭā tadā tayā ||

icchāśaktistu sā jātā tayā kālo vinirmitaḥ |
prativiṃvaṃ tatra dṛṣṭaṃ jātā jñānābhi dhātu sā ||

idame tat kiṃ viśiṣṭaṃ jñānavijñānakaṃ yadā |
tadā kriyā dvidhā jātā tadicchāte maheśvari ||

brahmāṇḍagolaṃ deveśi rājadaṃtta sthitaṃ tu yat |
sā kriyā sthāpayāmāsasvasvasthāna krameṇa ca ||

tatraiva svecchayā devī sāmarasya parāyaṇā |
yadicchā kathyate devi yathā vadavadhāraya ||

yugādi samaye devi śivaṃ paraguṇottaraṃ |
tadicchānirguṇaṃ śāṃtaṃ saccidānaṃda vigrahaṃ ||

sāsvataṃ suṃdaraṃ śuddhaṃ sarvadeva yutaṃ paraṃ |
ādināthaṃ guṇātītaṃ kālyasaṃyutamīśvaraṃ ||

viparītarataṃ devaṃ sāmarasya parāyaṇaṃ |
pūjārthamāgatān devagaṃdharvāpsarasāṃgaṇān ||

yakṣiṇī kinnarīmartyā sarvāsyādyā tilottamā |
vīkṣya tanmāyayā prāha suṃdari prāṇavallabhe ||

trailokyasuṃdari prāṇasvāmini prāṇaraṃjani |
kimāgataṃ bhavatpādya mamabhāgyārṇavo mahān ||

uktvā maunadharaṃ śaṃbhūṃ pūjayat yapsarogaṇāḥ ||

gaṃdharvā ūcuḥ ||

saṃhārāttāritaṃ devatvayā viśvajanapriya |
sṛṣṭerāraṃbha kāryārtha madyuktosi mahāprabho ||

<p. 145a>

vaśyā kṛtyamidaṃ devamaṃgalārtha pragāyaṇaṃ |
prayāṇotsuva kāle tu samāraṃbhe pragāyaṇaṃ ||

yugādyāraṃbha kālā hi vartate mṛḍaśaṃkara |
iṃdrāṇī koṭayaḥ saṃti tasyā praśragvaviṃdutaḥ ||

brahmāṇī vaiṣṇavīṇāṃ ca māheśī koṭikoṭayaḥ |
tavasāmarasānaṃdaṃ darśanārthaṃ samudbhavāḥ ||

saṃjātāścāgatā devacātmākaṃ saukhasāgara |
ratiṃ hitvā kāminīnāṃ nānya saukhyaṃ maheśvara ||

sāratirdṛśyate smābhirmahat saukhyārthakārikā |
evameva tu cāsyābhiḥ kartavyaṃ bhartṛṇā saha ||

evaṃ śrutvā mahādevo dhyānāvasthitamānasaḥ |
dhyānaṃ hitvā māyayā tu provāca kālikāṃ prati ||

kālikāli ruṇḍamāle priye bhairavanādinī |
śivārūpadhare krūre ghoradaṃṣṭrā bhayānake ||

trailokyā bhakṣaṇakari suṃdaryāḥ saṃtitegrataḥ |
suṃdarī vīkṣyaṇaṃ karma kāryakāla priye śive ||

dhyānaṃ muṃca mahādevī nā gacchaṃti gṛhaṃ prati |
tava rūpaṃ mahākāli mamakāla priyaṃ karaṃ ||

etāsāṃ suṃdaraṃ rūpaṃ trailokya priyakārakaṃ |
evaṃ māyā bhramāviṣṭo mahākālo vadanniti ||

īdṛkkālavacaḥ śrutvā kālaṃ prāha ca kālikā |
māyayācchādya cātmānaṃ nijastrīrūpadhāriṇī ||

itaḥ prabhṛti strīmātraṃ bhaviṣyati yuge yuge |
kalpādyauṣadhayo devi divāvallī svarūpatāṃ ||

rātrau strīrūpamāsādya krīḍaṃtī ca parasparaṃ |
ajñāna caiva sarveṣāṃ bhaviṣyati yuge yuge ||

evaṃ śāpa pradatvā tu punaḥ provāca kālikā |
viparītarataṃ kṛtvā ciṃtayaṃti bhajaṃti ye ||

teṣāṃ varaṃ pradāsyāmi tatra nityaṃ vaśāmyahaṃ |
ityuktvā kālikā vidyā tatraivāṃtaradhīrayata ||

triṃśannikharve ṣaḍvṛṃdanavatyarvudakoṭayaḥ |
darśanārthaṃ tapastepe sā vai kutragatā priye ||

mama prāṇapriyā devi mahāprāṇapriyā mama |
kiṃ karomika gacchāmi ityevaṃ bhramasaṃkulaḥ ||

tadā kālyāḥ kṛpā jātā mamaciṃtā paraḥ śivaḥ |
yaṃtra prastāra vuddhistu kālī dadāti satvaraṃ ||

<p. 145b>

yaṃtraṃ kṣātaṃ tadārabhya pūrvaṃ siddha na gocarā |
śrīcakrarāja prastāra racanābhyāsa tatparaḥ ||

itastato bhrāmyamāṇastrailokyaṃ cakramadhyagaṃ |
cakrapāraṃ darśanārthaṃ kodyarvudayugaṃ gataṃ ||

bhakta prāṇa priyā devī mahāśrīcakranāyikā |
tatra viṃdau paraṃ rūpaṃ suṃdaraṃ sumanoharaṃ ||

rūpaṃ jātaṃ maheśāni jāgrattripurasuṃdarī |
rūpaṃ dṛṣṭvā mahādevo rājarājeśvarohya bhūt ||

tasyāḥ kaṭākṣa mātreṇa tasyā rūpadharaḥ śivaḥ |
vinā śṛṃgāra saṃyuktāṃ tadā jātā maheśvarī ||

vinā kālyaṃ śato devī jagatsthāvarajaṃgamaṃ |
na śṛṃgāro na śaktitvaṃ kvāpi nāsti maheśvarī ||

suṃdaryā prārthitā kālī tuṣṭā provāca kālikā |
sarveṣāṃ netrakeśeṣumamāṃ śrotra bhaviṣyati ||

pūrvāvasthāsu deveśi mamāṃśastiṣṭhati priye |
sāvatasthoruṇākhyātu tadaṃ te naiva tiṣṭati ||

madbhaktānāṃ maheśāni sadā tiṣṭati niścitaṃ |
śaktistu kuṃṭhitā jātā tathā rūpaṃ na suṃdari ||

ciṃtāviṣṭāti malinā jātā tatra tu suṃdarī |
kṣaṇaṃ sthitvā dhyāna parākālaṃ ciṃtana tatparā ||

tadā kālī prasannā bhūt tatkṣaṇā deva niścitaṃ |
varaṃ vrūhivaraṃ vrūhivaraṃ vrūhītisādaraṃ ||

suṃdaryuvāca ||

mama śaktiṃ parāṃ dehi varoyaṃ prārthito mayā |
tādṛgupāyaṃ kathaya yena śaktirbhaviṣyati ||

kālyuvāca ||

mamanāma sahasraṃ ca mayāpūrvaṃ vinirmitaṃ |
matsvarūpaṃ kakārākhyaṃ mahāsāmrājyanāyakaṃ ||

varadānābhidhaṃ nāma kṣaṇārddhādvaradāyakaṃ |
tatpaṭhasvamahāmāye tava bhaktirbhaviṣyati ||

tataḥ prabhṛti śrīrvidyā tannāma pāṭha tatparā |
tadeva nāma sāhasraṃ suṃdarī śaktidāyakaṃ ||

kathyate parayā bhaktyā sādhayaḥ svamaheśvarī |
madyairmāsaistathā śukraiḥ sarvairaktaistathā priye ||

tarpayet pūjayet kālīṃ viparītaratiṃ caret |
viparītarate devi kālī tiṣṭhati nityaśaḥ ||

mādhvīka śukrapuṣpā tu maithunānu virāginī |
vaiṣṇavī vyāpakā vidyā śmaśānevāsinī parā ||

vīrasādhana saṃtuṣṭā vīrāsphālani nādinī |
śivāvali prahṛṣṭātmā śivārūpādi caṇḍikā ||

<p. 146a>

kāmānaṃdā parāstotra priyā matyugramānasā |
brahmānaṃda parāsāṃdra maithunānaṃdatoṣiṇī ||

yogīṃdra hṛdayāgārā divā niśi viparyayā |
viparītā divā niśi viparītaratā surā ||

kṣaṇāttuṣṭā ca pratyakṣā daṃtāmālā japapriyā |
khaḍgahastau muktakeśo digamvara vibhūṣitaḥ ||

śayyāstho cumvanā naṃdī veśyāsaṃga parāyaṇaḥ |
paṭhet sahasranāmākhyaṃ medhā sāmrājyanāmakaṃ ||

yathā divyāmṛtairdivyā prasannā kṣaṇamātrataḥ |
tathānena samākālī prasannā pāṭhamātrataḥ ||

kathyate nāma sāhasraṃ sāvadhāna manā śṛṇu |
sarvasāmrājya medhākhyanāma sāhasrakasya ca ||

mahākālo ṛṣiḥ prokta uṣṇik chaṃdaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
devatā dakṣiṇākālī māyāvījaṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

hūṁ śaktiḥ kālikaṃ vījaṃ kīlakaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
kālikā varadānābhiḥ sveṣṭārthe viniyogatāḥ ||

karpūreṇa ṣaḍaṃgāni ṣaḍdīrghādyena kārayet |
dhyānaṃ ca pūrvavat kṛtvā sādhayet sveṣṭasādhanaṃ ||

oṃ krīṃ kālī krūṁ karālī ca kalyāṇī kamalākalā |
kalāvatī kalākhyā ca kalā pūjyā kalātmikā ||

kalā hṛṣṭā kalā puṣṭā kalā kaṣṭā kalākarā |
kalākoṭi samāsābhā kalākeli prapūjitā ||

kalāmayī kalādhārā kalāpārā kalāgamā |
kalādhārā kamalinī kakārā karuṇākarī ||

kakāravarṇa sarvāṃgī kalākoṭi vibhūṣitā |
kakārakoṭi guṇitā kakārakoṭi bhūṣaṇā ||

kakāravarṇa hṛdayā kakāra manumaṇḍitā |
kakāravarṇa mukuṭā kakāravarṇabhūṣitā ||

ka ka ka ka varṇarūpā ka ka śabdaparāyaṇā |
ka ka vīrāsphālaratā kamalākarapūjitā ||

kamalākaranāthā ca kamalākara rūpadhṛk |
kamalākara siddhisthā kamalākarapāradā ||

kamalākara madhyasthā kamalākaratoṣitā |
kathaṃkāraparālāpā kathaṃkāra parāyaṇā ||

kathaṃkāra padāṃtasthā kathaṃkāra padādyabhūḥ |
kamalākṣī kamalajā kamalākṣa prapūjitā ||

kamalākṣa varodyuktā kakārā karvurākṣarā |
karatārā karacchinnā karaśyāmā kalārṇavā ||

karapūjyā kararatā karadā karapūjitā |
karatoyā karāmarśā karmanāśā kanapriyā ||

karaprāṇā karakajā karakākarakāṃtarā |
karakāvalarūpā ca karakāvalaśobhinī ||

<p. 146b>

kakāracalaputrī ca karakā ca toṣiṇī |
karakā cala gehasthā karakācala rakṣaṇī ||

karakācala sanmānyā karakācalakāriṇī |
karakācala vaṣāḍhyā karakācala raṃjitā ||

karakācala kāṃtārā karakācalamālinī |
karakācala śobhāḍhyā karākamalarūpiṇī ||

karāmalaka saṃsthā ca karāmalaka siddhidā |
karāmakele saṃpūjyā karāmalakatāriṇī ||

karāmala kakārī ca karāmalaka locanī |
karāmalakamātā ca karāmakala sevinī ||

karāmalakavaddhye yā karāmalakadāyinī |
kaṃjanetrā kaṃjagatiḥ kaṃjasthākaṃjadhāriṇī ||

kaṃjamālā priyakarī kaṃjarūpā ca kaṃjajā |
kaṃjajātiḥ kaṃjagatiḥ kaṃjahomaparāyaṇā ||

kaṃjamaṃḍala madhyasthā kaṃjābharaṇabhūṣitā |
kaṃjasammānaniratā kaṃjotpattiḥ parāyaṇā ||

kaṃjarāśi samākārā kaṃjāraṇya nivāsinī |
karaṃja vṛkṣamadhyasthākaraṃja vṛkṣavāsinī ||

karaṃjaphalabhūṣāḍhyā karaṃjāraṇyavāsinī |
karaṃjamālābharaṇākavaṃdha śaśimadhyagāḥ ||

kavaṃdha kūṭasaṃsthānākavaṃdhānatabhūṣaṇā |
kavaṃdhanāda saṃtuṣṭā kavaṃdhāsanakāriṇī ||

kavaṃdha gṛhamadhyasthāka vaṃdhacaravāsinī |
kavaṃdhakāṃcikariṇī kavaṃdha śaśibhūṣaṇā ||

kavaṃdha mālā jayadā kavaṃdha dehavāsinī |
kavaṃdhāsanamālyā ca rūpālamāladhāriṇī ||

kapālamālāmadhyasthā kapālavratatoṣitā |
kapāladīpasaṃtuṣṭā kapāladīparūpiṇī ||

kapāladīpavaradā kapālakajjalasthitā |
kapālamāla jayadā kapālajapatoṣiṇī ||

kapālasiddhi saṃtuṣṭā kapālabhojanodyatā |
kapālavratasaṃsthānā kapālakamalālayā ||

kavitvā mṛtasārā ca kavitvā mṛtasāgarā |
kavitva siddhi saṃhṛṣṭā kavitvadānakāriṇī ||

kavipūjyā kavigatiḥ kavirūpā kavipriyā |
kavi brahmāṇḍarūpā ca kavitva vratatoṣitā ||

kavimānasasaṃsthānā kavivāṃchā prapūraṇī |
kavikaṃṭhasthitākaṃ hrīṃ kaṃ kaṃ kaṃ kavipūrtidā ||

<p. 147a>

kajjalākajjalā dānamānasā kajjalapriyā |
kapālakajjala samākajjaleśa prapūjitā ||

kajjalārṇava madhyasthā kajjalānaṃdarūpiṇī |
kajjalapriyasaṃtuṣṭā kajjalapriyatoṣiṇī ||

kapālamālābharaṇā kapālakarabhūṣaṇā |
kapālakarabhūṣāḍhyā kapāla cakramaṇḍitā ||

kapālakoṭi nilayā kapāladurgakāriṇī |
kapālagirisaṃsthānā kapālācalavāsinī ||

kapālapātra saṃtuṣṭā kapālārghya parāyaṇā |
kapālārghya priya prāṇā kapālārghya varodyatā ||

kapāla cakrarūpā ca kapālarūpamātragā |
kadalī kadalīrūpā kadalī vanavāsinī ||

kadalī puṣpasaṃprītā kadalīphalamānasā |
kadalī homasaṃtuṣṭā kadalīdalanodyatā ||

kadalī garbhamadhyasthā kadalīvanasuṃdarī |
kadaṃvapuṣpanilayā kadaṃva vanamadhyagā ||

kadaṃva kusumāmodā kadaṃvavanatoṣiṇī |
kadaṃva puṣpasaṃpūjyā kadaṃva puṣpahomadā ||

kadaṃva puṣpamadhyasthā kadaṃva phalabhojinī |
kadaṃva kānanāṃtasthā kadaṃvā calavāsinī ||

kacchapākacchapārādhyā kacchapāsanasaṃsthitā |
karṇapūrā karṇanāśā kārṇāṭī kālabhairavī ||

karaprītā kalahadā kalahā kalahātarā |
karṇayakṣī karṇavārtā kathanī karṇasuṃdarī ||

karṇapiśācinī karṇamaṃjarī kapikacchudā |
kapikacchupi rūpāḍhyā kapikacchu svarūpiṇī ||

kastūrī mṛgasaṃsthānā kastūrī mṛgarūpiṇī |
kastūrī mṛgasaṃtoṣā kastūrīmṛgamadhyagā ||

kastūrī rasanīlāṃgī kastūrīgaṃdhatoṣitā |
kastūrī pūjaka prāṇā kastūrī pūjaka priyā ||

kastūrī premasaṃtuṣṭā kastūrī premadhāriṇī |
kastūrī pūjakānaṃdā kastūrīgaṃdharūpiṇī ||

kastūrīmālikārūpā kastūrīpūjanapriyā |
kastūrī tilakānaṃdā kastūrī tilakapriyā ||

kastūrī homasaṃtuṣṭā kastūrī tarpaṇodyatā |
kastūrīmārjanodyuktā kastūrī cakrapūjitā ||

<p. 147b>

kastūrī puṣpasaṃpūjyā kastūrī carvaṇodyatā |
kastūrīgarbhamadhyasthā kastūrīvastradhāriṇī ||

kastūrikāmodaratā kastūrīvanavāsinī |
kastūrī vanasaṃrakṣā kastūrīpremadhāriṇī ||

kastūrī śaktinilayā kastūrī kuṇḍamadhyagā |
kastūrī kuṇḍasaṃsnātā kastūrī cumvamajjanā ||

kastūryarghyeṇa saṃtuṣṭā kastūrī jīvadhāriṇī |
kasturī paramāmodā kastūrī jīvanakṣamā ||

kastūrī jātibhāvasthā kastūrīgaṃdhacumbanā |
kastūrīgaṃdhasaṃśobhirvirājita kapālabhūḥ ||

kastūrīdamanāṃtasthā kastūrīmadaharṣadā |
kastūrikāvitānādyā kastūrī gṛhamadhyagā ||

kastūrī sparśaka prāṇā kastūrī niṃdakāṃtakā |
kastūryāmodarasikā kastūrī krīḍanodyatā ||

kastūrīdānaniratā kastūrīvaradāyinī |
kastūrīsthāpanāśaktā kastūrīsthānaraṃjanī ||

kastūrī kuśalapraśnakastūrīstutivaṃditā |
kastūrīvaṃdakādhārā kastūrīsthānavāsinī ||

kaharūpā kahāḍhyā ca kahānaṃdā kahātmabhūḥ |
kahapūjyā kahetyākhyā kahaheṣā kahātmikā ||

kahamālā kaṇṭhabhūṣā kahamaṃtra japodyatā |
kahanāma smṛti parākahanāmaparāyaṇā ||

kahapārāyaṇaratā kahadevī kaheśvarī |
kaha hetuḥ kahānaṃdā kahanāda parāyaṇā ||

kahamātā kahāṃtasthā kahamaṃtrā kaheśvarā |
kahagotrā kahārāḍhyā kahadhyānaparāyaṇā ||

kahataṃtrāṁ kahahākahacarcāparāyaṇā |
kahācāraḥ kahagatiḥ kahatāṇḍavakāriṇī ||

kahāraṇyā kahagatiḥ kahaśaktiḥ parāyaṇā |
kaharājyaratākarma sākṣikarma suṃdarī ||

karmavidyā karmagatiḥ karmataṃtraparāyaṇā |
karmamātrā karmagātrā karmamarmaparāyaṇā ||

karmarekhānāśakartrī karmarekhā vinodinī |
karmarekhā mohakarī karmarekhā vinodinī ||

karmarekhā mohakarī karmakīrtiparāyaṇā |
karmavidyā karmasārā karmadhārā ca karmabhūḥ ||

karmakārī karmakarī karmakautuka suṃdarī |
karmakolī karmatārā karmachinnā ca karmadā ||

<p. 148a>

karmacāṇḍālinī karmavedamātā ca karmabhūḥ |
karmakāṇḍaratānaṃtā karmakāṇḍānumānitā ||

karmakāṇḍaparīṇāhā kamaṭhīkamaṭhā kṛtiḥ |
kamaṭhārādhya hṛdanyā kamaṭhākaṇṭhasuṃdarī ||

kamaṭhāsana saṃsevyā kamaṭhīkarma tatparāḥ |
karuṇākarakāṃtā ca karuṇākaravaṃditā ||

kaṭhorā karamālā ca kaṭhorakucadhāriṇī |
kapardinī kapaṭinī kaṭhinī kaṃkabhūṣaṇā ||

karabhoruḥ kaṭhinadākarabhākaramālayā |
kalabhāṣāmayī kalpākalpanā kalpadāyinī ||

kamalasyā kalāmālā kamalāsyā kaṇaprabhā |
kakudminī kaṣṭavatī kacchākacchārcitākajā ||

kacārcitā karatanuḥ kacasuṃdaradhāriṇī |
kaṭhera kuca saṃlagnā kaṭi sūtravirājitā ||

kaṇabhakṣapriyā kaṃdā tathā kaṃdagatiḥ kaliḥ |
kalighnī kalidūtī ca kavināyakapūjitā ||

kaśākakṣāṇi yaṃtrā ca kaścit kavivarārcitā |
kartrī ca kartrikā bhūṣā karaṇī karṇaśatrupā ||

karaṇeśī karaṇadā kalanāṃjanabhūṣitā |
karaṇeśī karaṇadākarṇāṃ vā kalānidhiḥ ||

kaladā calanādhārā karikākarakākarā |
kalage vā karkarāśiḥ karkarāśi prapūjitā ||

kanyārāśiḥ kanyakā ca kanyakā priyabhāṣiṇī |
kanyādānakarānaṃdā kanyādāna śṛheṣṭadā ||

kanyakādāna saṃtuṣṭā kanyādāna pratoṣiṇī |
karṣaṇākakṣa dahanākamitākamitāsanā ||

karamālā naṃdakartrī karamālā pratoṣitā |
karamālāśavānaṃdā karamālā samāgamā ||

karamālā siddhidātrī karamālā karapriyā |
karapriyā karalatā karadānaparāyaṇā ||

karanaṃdā kaligatiḥ kalipūjyā kaliprasū |
kalanādaninādasthā kalanāda varapradā ||

karanāda samājasthā kaholā ca kaholadā |
kahoragehasaṃsthā ca kahoravaradāyinī ||

kahorakavitādhārā kahola ṛṣimānaṃtā |
kaholamānasārādhyā kahola vākyakāriṇī ||

kaholagehamadhyasthā kaholavarakāriṇī |
kartṛstayā kartṛmayī kartṛmātā ca kartarī ||

kanīyā kanakārādhyā kanīnakamayīkathā |
kanīyānaṃda nilayā kanakānaṃdatoṣitā ||

<p. 148b>

kanīna kakarākaṣṭā kathārṇava karīkariḥ |
karigamyā karigatiḥ kari dhvajaparāyaṇā ||

kalināthapriyā kaṃṭhā kathānaka pratoṣitā |
kamanīyā kamanakā kamanīya vibhūṣaṇā ||

kamanīya samājasyā kamanīya vratapriyā |
kamanīya guṇārādhyā kapilā kapileśvarī ||

kapilārādhya hṛdayā kapilāvaradāyinī ||

ka e ī la hrīṃ svarūpā ca ka e ī la hrī varapradā ||

ka e ī la hrīṃ siddhidātrī kalaha hrīṃ svarūpiṇī |
kahalahrīṃ maṃtravarṇā ca kalaha hrīṃ prasūkalā ||

kavargā ca kapāṭasthā kapāṭodghāṭana kṣamā |
kaṃkālī ca kapālā ca kaṃkāla priyabhāṣiṇī ||

kaṃkāla bhairavārādhyā kaṃkālamānasasthitā |
kaṃkālamohanirato kaṃkālamohadāyinī ||

kaluṣoghnī kaluṣahākaluṣārti vināśinī |
kalipūjyā kalādānākaśipuḥ kaśyapārcitā ||

kaśyapākaśyapārādhyā kaliṃ pūrṇakalevarā |
kalevarā karikacā kaṭavargā karālikā ||

karālabhairavārādhyā karālabhairaveśvarī |
karālākaraṇādhārākapardīśa varapradā ||

kapardīśa premaratā kapardī mālikāyutā |
kapardī japamālāḍhyā karavīra prasūnadā ||

karavīra priyaprāṇā karavīra prapūjitā |
karṇikāra samākārā karṇikāra prapūjitā ||

karīṣāgni sthitā karṣākarṣamātra suvarṇadā |
kalaśākalaśārādhyā kaṣāyā karigānaṃdā ||

kapilā kalakaṇṭhī ca kalikalpalatā matā |
kalpalatā kapamātā kalpakārī ca kalpabhūḥ ||

karpūrāmodarucirā karpūrāmodadhāriṇī |
karpūramālā bharaṇā karpūra vā sa pūrtidā ||

karpūramālā japadā karpūrārṇavamadhyagā |
karpūratarpaṇaratā karpūravaradhāriṇī ||

kapaṭeśvara saṃpūjyā kapaṭeśvara rūpiṇī |
kaduḥkapidhvajārādhyākalāpa puṣparūpiṇī ||

kalāpa puṣparucirā kalāpa puṣpapūjitā |
krakavāca kacārādhyā kathaṃ drūmā karālatā ||

kathaṃ kālavinirmuktā kālīkālapriyā ka tu |
kāminī kāminī pūjyā kāminī puṣpadhāriṇī ||

<p. 149a>

kāminī puṣpapūjārhā kāminī puṣpabhūṣaṇā |
kāminī puṣpatilakā kāminī kuṃḍacuṃvanā ||

kāminīyoga saṃtuṣṭā kāminī yogadāyinī |
kāminīkuṃda saṃmagnā kāminīkuṃḍa madhyagā ||

kāminī mānasārādhyā kāminīmānatoṣitā |
kāminīmānasaṃcārā kālikālikā kālakālikā ||

kāmā ca kāmadevī ca kāmeśī kāmasaṃbhavā |
kāmabhāvā kāmaratā kāmārtā kāmamaṃjarī ||

kāmamaṃjīraraṇitā kāmadeva priyāṃtarā |
kāmakālī kāmakalākālī kāmakalābhidhā ||

kāli kāmakalākāli kālānala samaprabhā |
kalyāṃtadahanākāṃtā kāṃtārapriyabhāṣiṇī ||

kālapūjyā kālaratā kālamālā ca kālinī |
kāravīrā kālaghorā kālasiddhā ca kāladā ||

kālāṃjana samākārā kāliṃjananivāsinī |
kālaṛddhiḥ kālavṛddhiḥ kārāgṛha vimocinī ||

kādividyā kādimātā kādisthā kādi suṃdari |
kāśīkāṃcī ca kāṃcīśākāśīśa varadāyinī ||

krāṃ vījā caiva kāṃvījā krāṃ hṛdayāya namasmṛtā |
kāmyākāmyagatiḥ kāmyasiddhidātrīkasiddhibhūḥ ||

kāmākṣā kāmarūpā ca kāmacāpa vimocinī |
kāmadeva kalārāmā kāmadeva kalālayā ||

kālarātrī kāmadātrī kāṃtārācalavāsinī |
kālarūpā kālagatiḥ kāmayoga parāyaṇā ||

kāmasaṃmardanaratā kāmageha vikāśinī |
kālabhairava bhāryā ca kālabhairavakāminī ||

kālabhairava yogasthā kālabhairava bhogadā |
kāmadhenuḥ kāmadogdhrī kāmamātā ca kāṃtadā ||

kāmukā kāmukārādhyā kāmukānaṃdavarddhinī |
kārtavījā kārtikeyā kārtikeyaḥ prapūjitā ||

kāryā kāraṇadā kāryākāriṇī kāraṇāṃtarā |
kāṃtigamyā kāṃtimayī kāṃtyā kātyāyanīvakā ||

kāmasārā ca kāsmīrā kāsmīrācāra tatparā |
kāmarūpācāraratā kāmarūpa priyaṃvadā ||

<p. 149b>

kāmarūpā kāmasiddhā kāmarūpa manomayī |
kārtikī kārtikārādhyā kāṃcanāraprasūnabhūḥ ||

kāṃcanāraprasūnābhā kāṃcanāla prapūjitā |
kācarūpā kācabhūmiḥ kāṃśyapātraprabhojinī ||

kāṃśyadhvanimayī kāmasuṃdarī kāmacuṃvanā |
kāśapuṣpapratīkāśā kāmadruma samāgatā ||

kāmapuṣpā kāmabhūmi kāmapūjyā ca kāmadā |
kāmadehā kāmagehā kāmarāga parāyaṇā ||

kāmadhvaja samārūḍhā kāmadhvaja samāsthitā |
kāśyapīkāśyapārādhyā kāśyapānaṃdadāyinī ||

kāliṃdījalasaṃkāśā kāliṃdī jalapūjitā |
kādevapūjāniratā kodeva paramārthadā ||

karmaṇā kārmaṇākārā kāmakārmaṇakāriṇī |
kārmaṇa troṭanakarī kākinī kāraṇāhvayā ||

kāvyāmṛtā ca kāliṃgāṃ kāliṃgamadanodyatā |
kālāguru vibhūṣāḍhyā kālāguru vibhūtidā ||

kālāguru sugaṃdhā ca kālāgurupratarpaṇā |
kāverī nīlasaṃprītā kāverī tīravāsinī ||

kālacakra bhramākārā kālacakra nivāsinī |
kānanākānanādhārākāruḥ karuṇikāmayī ||

kāṃpilyavāsinīkāsthā kāmapatnī ca kāmabhūḥ |
kādaṃvarī pānaratā tathā kādaṃvarītalā ||

kāmavaṃdyā ca kāmeśī kāmarāja prapūjitā |
kāmarājeśvarī vidyā kāmakautuka kaumudī ||

kāṃvojajākāṃkṣi tadākāśyā kāṃcanakāriṇī |
kāṃcanādri samākārā kāṃcanādri sa pradāradā ||

kāmakīrtiḥ kāmakeśī kālikā kāṃtaraśrayā |
kāmabhedī ca kāmārtināśinī kāmabhūmikā ||

kālarirnāśinī kāvyavanitā kāmarūpiṇī |
kāmasthā kāṣṭha saṃdīptiḥ kāvyadā kāmasuṃdarī ||

kāṣṭheśī kāraṇavarākāmāri pūjanodyatā |
kāṃcīnūpurabhūṣāḍhyā kuṃkumābharaṇānvitā ||

kālacakrā kālagatiḥ kālacakra manobhavā |
kuṃjamadhyā kuṃjapuṣpā kuṃjapuṣpa priyākuśā ||

kuṃjamātā kujārādhyā kuṭhāra varadhāriṇī |
kuṃjarasthā kuśaratā kuśeśaya vilocanā ||

<p. 150a>

kunaṭhī kurarī kruddhā kuraṃgī kuṭajāhvayā |
kuṃbhī nadya vibhūṣā ca kuṃbhī namavadhodyatā ||

kuṃbhakarṇa manollāsā kulacūḍāmaṇiḥ kulā |
kulāla gṛhakanyā ca kulacūḍāmaṇi priyā ||

kulapūjā kulārādhyā kulapūjāparāyaṇā |
kuca bhūṣā tathā kukṣiḥ kuravīgaṇasevinī ||

kulapuṣpā kularatā kulapuṣpa parāyaṇā |
kulavastrā kulārādhyā kuṇḍaḥ kulasamaprabhā ||

kulakuṇḍa samullāsā kuṇḍapuṣpa parāyaṇā |
kuṇḍapuṣpa prasehenā kuṇḍagolodbhavātmikā ||

kuṇḍagolodbhavādhārā kulagolamayī kuhuḥ |
kuṇḍagola priyaprāṇā kuṇḍagola prapūjitā ||

kuṇḍagola manollāsā kuṇḍagola varapradā |
kuladevaratā kruddhā kulasiddhikarī paraṃ ||

kulakuṇḍa samākārā kulakuṇḍa samānabhūḥ |
kuṇḍasiddhiḥ kuṇḍaṛddhiḥ kumārī pūjanodyatāḥ ||

kumārī pūjakaprāṇā kumārīkujakālayā |
kumārīkālasaṃtuṣṭā kumārī pūjakātmikā ||

kumārīvratasaṃtuṣṭā kumārīrūpadhāriṇī |
kumārībhojanā prītākumārī ca kumāradā ||

kumāramātā kuladākulayoni kuleśvarī |
kulaliṃgā kulānaṃdā kularamyā kutarkadṛk ||

kuṃtī ca kulakāṃtā ca kulamārgaparāyaṇā |
kullā ca kuru kullā ca kullukā kulakāmadā ||

kuliśāṃgī kubjikā ca kubjikā nandavarddhinī |
kulīnā kuṃjaragatiḥ kuṃjareśvaragāminī ||

kulapālī kulavatī tathaiva kuladīpikā |
kulayogīśvarī kuṇḍā kuṃkumāruṇa vigrahā ||

kuṃkumānaṃda saṃtoṣā kuṃkumārṇavavāsinī |
kuṃkumā kusumaprītā kulabhūḥ kulasuṃdarī || 

kuṃdadaṃtī kumudinī kuśalākulaṭālayā |
kulayogīśvarī kuṇḍā kulaṭā kulatoṣitā ||

kulaṭā cumvanodyuktā kuśāvartā kulārṇavā |
kulārṇavā cāraratā kuṇḍalī kuṇḍalākṛtiḥ ||

kumatiśca kulaśreṣṭhā kulacakra parāyaṇā |
kuṭasthāṃ krūradṛṣṭiśca kuṃtalākuṃtalākṛtiḥ ||

kuśalākṛti rūpā ca kūrcavījadharā kucaḥ |
kukuḥ kukuḥ śabdaratā krūṁ krūṁ krūṁ krūṁ parāyaṇā ||

<p. 150b>

ku ku kuṃ śabda nilayā kukkurālayavāsinī |
kukkurāsaṃga saṃyuktā kukkurānaṃda vigrahā ||

kūrcaraṃbhā kūrcavījā kūrcajāpa parāyaṇā |
kulinī kulasaṃsthānā kūrcakuṇḍa parāgatiḥ ||

kūrcavījā bhāladaśā kūrcamastakabhuṣitā |
kulavṛkṣagatā kūrmākūrmācala nivāsinī ||

kulaviṃduḥ kulaśivā kulaśākta parāyaṇā |
kulaviṃdumaṇi prakhyā kuṃkumadrumavāsinī ||

kucamardana saṃtuṣṭā kuca jāpa parāyaṇā |
kuca sparśana saṃtuṣṭā kucāliṃganaḥ tatparā ||

kugatighnī kucerārcyā kucabhūḥ kulanāyikā |
kugāyanā kucadharā kugītā kuṃdadaṃtikā ||

kugeyā kuharābhāsā kuśoṣā kughnadārikā |
kīrtiḥ kirātinī klinnā kiraṇā kinnarīpriyā ||

krīṃtārī krīṃjapāsaktā krīṁ hūṁ strī maṃtrarūpiṇī |
kimmīrita dṛśāpāṃgī kiśorārcā kirīṭinī ||

kīṭabhāṣā kīṭayoniḥ kīṭamātā ca kīśadā |
kiṃśukā kīṭabhāṣā ca kriyāsārā kriyāvatī ||

kī kī śabdaparā krāṁ krīṁ krūṁ kraiṁ krauṁ maṃtrarūpiṇī |
kāṁ kīṁ kūṁ kaiṁ svarūpācaka phaṭ maṃtra svarūpiṇī ||

ketakībhūṣaṇānaṃdā ketakī bharaṇānvitā |
kekarākeśinī keśī keśī sūdana tatparā ||

keśarūpā keśamuktā kaikeyī keśikī tathā |
kairavā kairavā hlādā keśarā keturūpiṇī ||

keśavārādhya hṛdayā keśavāsaktamānasā |
klaivya nirnāśinī klaiva klaivīja japatoṣitā ||

kośalā komalākṣī ca kośā ca komalā tathā |
kolāpura nivāsī ca kolāsura vināśinī ||

koṭarūpā koṭaratā krodhinī kākarūpiṇī |
kekācakokilā koṭiḥ koṭimaṃtraparāyaṇā ||

koṭyanaṃtamaṃtrayutākarūpā keralāśrayā |
kairalācāra nipuṇā keraleṃdra gṛhasthitā ||

kedārāśramasaṃsthā ca kedāreśvara pūjitā |
krodharūpā krośapādā krodhamātā ca kauśikī ||

<p. 151a>

kodaṇḍadhāriṇī krauṁcā kauśalyā komalāṃgaṇā |
kaulinī kaulikādhārā kaulikānatavāsinī ||

kautukī kaumudī kaulākaumārī kauravārcitā |
kauṇḍinyā kauśilī krodhā jvālā bhāsvararūpiṇī ||

koṭikālānalajvālā koṭimārtaṇḍa vigrahā |
kṛrttikā kṛṣṇavarṇā ca kṛṣṇā kṛtyā kriyāturā ||

kṛśāṃgī kṛta kṛtyā cakraḥ phaṭ svāhā svarūpiṇī |
kroṁ kroṁ hūṁ phaṭ maṃtravarṇā krīṁ krīṁ hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svadhā ||

krīṁ krīṁ hrīṁ hrīṁ tathā hūṁ phaṭ svāhā maṃtra svarūpiṇī ||

iti śrīsarvasāmrājyamedhānāma sahasrakaṃ ||

suṃdarī śaktidānākhyaṃ svarūpābhidhameva ca |
kathitaṃ dakṣiṇā kālyā suṃdaryai prītiyogataḥ ||

varadāna prasaṃgena rahasyamapi darśitaṃ |
gopanīyaṃ sadā bhaktyā paṭhanīyaṃ parātparaṃ ||

prātarmadhyāhnakāle ca saṃdhyārddha rātrayorapi |
pūjākāle japāṃte ca paṭhanīyaṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

yaḥ paṭhet sādhakādhīśaḥ kālīrūpo hi varṣataḥ |
paṭhitvā pāṭhayedvāpi śṛṇoti śrāvayedapi ||

vācakaṃ toṣayedvāpi sa bhavet kālikā tanuḥ |
sahelamvā salīlaṃ vāyaḥ kaścin mānavaḥ paṭhet ||

sarvadukha vinirmuktaṃ strailokyavijayī kaviḥ |
mṛtavaṃdhyā kākavaṃdhyā kanyāvaṃdhyā ca vaṃdhyakā ||

puṣpavaṃdhyā śūlavaṃdhyā śṛṇuyāt stotramuttamaṃ |
sarvasiddhi pradātāraṃ sat kaviṃ virajīvinaṃ ||

paṇḍitendraṃ kīrtiyutaṃ labhate nātrasaṃśayaḥ |
yadyat kāmamupaskṛtya kālīṃ dhyātvā japet stavaṃ ||

taṃ taṃ kāmakare kṛtvā matrāṃ bhavati nānyathā |
yoni puṣpairliṃgapuṣpaiḥ kuṇḍagolodbhavairapi ||

saṃyogāmṛtapuṣpaiśca vastudevī prapūrakaiḥ |
kālīpuṣpaiḥ pīṭhatoyairyonikṣālana viṃdubhiḥ ||

kastūrī kuṃkumairdevī nakhakālā guru kramāt |
aṣṭagaṃdhairddhupadīpairjavāyāvaka saṃyutaiḥ ||

raktacaṃdana siṃdūrairmatsyamāṃsādi mūṣakaiḥ |
madhubhiḥ pāyasaiḥ kṣīraiḥ śodhitaiḥ śoṇitairapi ||

<p. 151b>

mahopacārairaktaiśca naivedyaiḥ ṣaḍusānvitaiḥ |
pūjayitvā mahākālīṃ mahākālena lālitāṃ ||

vidyārājñīṃ kullukāṃ ca japtvā stotraṃ paṭhecchive |
kālībhaktastveka cittaḥ siṃdūra tilakānvitaḥ ||

tāmvūlapūritamukho muktakeśo digaṃvaraḥ |
śavayonisthito vīraḥ śmaśāna suratānvitaḥ ||

śūnyālaye viṃdupīṭhe puṣpākīrṇe śivāvane |
prayānetha prabhūṃ jānaḥ kālīdarśana māpnuyāt ||

tatra yadyat kṛtaṃ karma tadanaṃta phalaṃ bhavet |
aiśvarye kamalā sākṣāt siddhau śrīkālikānvikā ||

kavitvetāriṇī tulyaḥ sauṃdaryasuṃdarī samaḥ |
vasorddhārā samaḥ kāvya śrutau śruti dharo yathā ||

brahmāstra iva durddharvsastrailokya vijayāstravat |
śatruhartā kāryakartā bhavecchiva samaḥ kalau ||

digvidikcaṃdrakartā ca divā rātri viparyayāṃ |
mahādeva samoyogī trailokya staṃbhakaḥ kṣaṇāt ||

gāṇe catuṃvuruḥ sākṣādvāne karṇa samo bhavet |
gajāśvaratha pattīnāṃ matrāṇāmadhipaḥ kṛtī ||

āpuṣpe tu bhuśuṇḍī ca jalāpalita nāśakaḥ |
varṣa ṣoḍaśavān bhūyāt sarvakālaṃ maheśvarī ||

brahmāṇḍa goladeveśi na tasya durlabhaṃ kvacit |
sarvaṃ hastagataṃ bhūyānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

kulapuṣpayutaṃ dṛṣṭvā tatra kālīṃ viciṃtya ca |
vidyārājñīṃ ca saṃpūjya paṭhennāma sahasrakaṃ ||

manorathamayī siddhistasya haste sadā bhavet |
paradārāṃ samāliṃgya saṃcuṃvya parameśvarī ||

hastāhastikayoryogaṃ kṛtvā japtvā stavaṃ paṭhet |
yoniṃ vṛkṣa japet stotraṃ kuverādadhiko bhavet ||

kuṇḍagolodbhavaṃ gṛhya parṇāktaṃ homayenniśi |
pitṛbhūmau maheśāni vidhirekhā vimārjayet ||

taruṇīṃ caṃcalā ramyāṃ suṃdarīṃ kāmagarvitāṃ |
samānīya prayatnena saṃśodhyanyāsa yogataḥ ||

prasūnamaṃce saṃsthāpya pṛthvīṃ vikasitāṃ caret |
mūlacakraṃ tu saṃbhāvya devyāvaraṇa saṃyutaṃ ||

saṃpūjya parameśāni sa valyaṃtaṃ maheśvarī |
japtvā stutvā maheśāni drāviṇīṃ saṃsmarecchive ||

<p. 152a>

aṣṭottaraśatairyoniṃ sa maṃtrya cuṃvya yatnataḥ |
sa yogī bhūya japtavyaṃ sarvavidyādhiyo bhavet ||

śūnyāgāre śivāraṇye śivadevālaye tathā |
śūnyadeśe taḍāge ca gaṃgāgarbhe catuḥpathe ||

śmaśāne parvate prāṃte ekaliṃge śave mukhe |
muṇḍe yonau ṛtusnātā gehe veśyāgṛhe tathā ||

kuṭṭinī gṛhamadhye vā kadalī maṇḍape sadā |
paṭhet sahasranāmākhyaṃ stotraṃ sarvārthasiddhaye ||

araṇye śūnyadurgeṣu raṇe śakti samāgame |
kālīṃ saṃciṃtya prajapet paṭhennāma sahasrakaṃ ||

sarvasiddhīśvaro bhūyādvāṃchā siddhiṃ sa viṃdati |
mṛḍu cūḍakayoryoniṃ tvavivā komalepi ca ||

viṣṭareśa ca vastre vā puṣpavastrāsanepi vā |
kālīṃ saṃciṃtya prajapet tato nāma sahasrakaṃ ||

paṃcānaṃdamayo bhūtvā paṭhitvā kālikā svayaṃ |
muktakeśo diśā vāsaḥ maithunī śayanasthitaḥ ||

japtvā kālīṃ paṭhet stotraṃ khecarī siddhibhāgbhavet |
cikuraṃ yogamāsādya śukrot sāraṇameva ca ||

japtvā śrīdakṣiṇā kālīṃ śaktipātaśataṃ labhet |
latāṃ spṛśan japitvāpi kālikāṃ ciṃtayannapi ||

ālokayandiśā vāsāṃ paraśaktiṃ viśeṣataḥ |
stutvā śrīdakṣiṇākālīṃ yoniṃ svakaragāṃ caret ||

paṭhennāma sahasraṃ yaḥ śivādapyadhiko bhavet |
latārateṣu japtavyaṃ stutvā kālīṃ nirākulaḥ ||

daśāvadhāno bhavati māsamātreṇa sādhakaḥ |
kālarātryāṃ mahārātryāṃ vīrarātryāṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

caturdaśyā mathāṣṭamyāṃ saṃkramepi maheśvarī |
kuhuḥ pūrṇendu śukreṣu bhaumaravyāṃ niśāmukhe ||

navamyāṃ maṃgaladine tathā kulatithau śive |
kulaṛkṣe tu yatnena paṭhennāma sahasrakaṃ ||

sodarśano bhavedāśu kinnarī siddhibhāk bhavet |
paścimābhimukhaṃ liṃgaṃ vṛṣaśūnyaṃ purātanaṃ ||

tatra sthitvā japet stotraṃ sarvakāmāptaye śive |
bhaumavāre niśīthe ca amāvāsyāṃ dine śubhe ||

māṣa bhakta valiṃ chāgaṃ kṛśarānnaṃ ca pāyasam |
dagdhamīnaṃ śoṇitaṃ ca dadhi dugdhaṃ guḍārdrakaṃ ||

<p. 152b>

valiṃ datvā japet tatra tvaṣṭottara sahasrakaṃ |
devagaṃdharva siddhaughaissevitaḥ purasuṃdarīṃ ||

labheddeveśi māsena tasya vāsana saṃhatiḥ |
hastatrayaṃ bhavedūrdhānātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

helayā līlayā bhaktyā kālīṃ stauti narasruyaḥ |
brahmādīn staṃbhayeddevī māheśī mohayet kṣaṇāt ||

dhruvamuccāṭaye nūnaṃ sṛṣṭiṃ ca nūtanī caret |
meṣamāhiṣamārjārachāgaḥ kharatarādikaiḥ ||

khaḍgaśūkarakāpotaiṣṭiṭṭibhaiḥ śaśakaiḥ palaiḥ |
śoṇitaiḥ sāsthimāṃsaiśca kāraṇairdugdhapāyasaiḥ ||

kādaṃvarī siṃdhumadyaiḥ sarāriṣṭaiśca sā savaiḥ |
yonikṣālana tīraiśca yonirliṃgāmṛtena ca ||

svajāta kusumaiḥ pūjya japāṃte tarpayecchivaṃ |
sarvāḥ sāmrājya nāmnātu stutvā natvā svaśaktitaḥ ||

śaktyālāpe paṭhet stotraṃ kālīrūpo dinatrayāt |
dakṣiṇā kālikā tasya gehe tiṣṭhati nānyathā ||

veśyā latāgṛhe gatvā tasyāścumvana tatparaḥ |
tasyā yonyai mukhaṃ datvā tadrasaṃvilihan japen ||

tadaṃ te nāma sāhasraṃ paṭhed bhaktiparāyaṇaḥ |
kālikādarśanaṃ tasya bhavatyeva triyāmataḥ ||

nṛtyapātra gṛhe gatvā makāra paṃcamānitaḥ |
prasūcamaṃ ca saṃsthāpya śaktinyasa parāyaṇaḥ ||

pātrāṇāṃ sādanaṃ kṛtvā digvastrāṃ tāṃ samācaret |
cakra tanmūla saṃbhāvya tatra sāvaraṇaṃ yajet ||

śataṃbhāleśataṃ keśeśataṃ siṃdūramaṇḍale |
śatadvayaṃ kucadvaṃdveśataṃ nābhau maheśvarī ||

śataṃ yonau maheśāni utthāya ca śatatrayaṃ |
japet tatra maheśāni tadaṃte prapaṭhet stutiṃ ||

śatāvadhānā bhavati māsamātreṇa sādhakaḥ |
mātaṃginīṃ samānīya kiṃ vā kāpālikīṃ śive ||

daṃtamālā jape kāryā galedhāryā tṛmuṇḍajā |
netrapadmeyoni cakraṃ śaktiṃ cakraṃ svavaktrake ||

kṛtvā japen maheśāni muṇḍayaṃtraṃ prapūjayet |
muṇḍāsanasthito vīromakāra paṃcakānvitaḥ ||

anyāmāliṃgya prajapedanyāsaṃ cuṃvyavaiḥ paṭhet |
anyāṃ saṃpūjayet tatratvanyāsaṃmardayan paṭhet ||

<p. 153a>

anyayonau śivaṃ datvā punaḥ pūrvavadācaret |
avadhāna sahasreṣu śaktipātaśateṣu ca ||

rājā bhavati deveśi māsapaṃcaka yogataḥ |
yuvatī śaktimānīya gāṇaśaktiparāyaṇaḥ ||

kulācāra krameṇaiva tasyā yoniṃ vikāśayet |
tatra jihvāṃ pradatvā ca japennāma sahasrakaṃ ||

nṛkapāle tatra dīpaṃ lāpyayatnena vai paṭhet |
mahākavi varo bhūyānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

kālārtāṃ śaktimānīya yonau tu mūlacakrakaṃ |
vilikhya parameśāni tatra maṃtraṃ likhecchive ||

tallihan prajapeddevi sarvaśāstrārtha tatvavit |
aśrutānyapi śāstrāṇi vedādīn pāṭhayeddhruvaṃ ||

vinābhyāsairvināyāsairvināpāṭhādibhiḥ priye |
caturvedādhiyo bhūtvā triḥkālajña strivarṣataḥ ||

caturvidhaṃ ca pāṇḍityaṃ tasya hastagataṃ kṣaṇāt |
śivāvaliḥ pradātavyaḥ sarvadā śunyamaṇḍale ||

kālīdhyānaṃ maṃtrarcitānīla sādhanameva ca |
sahasranāma pāṭhaśca kālīnāma prakīrtitaṃ ||

bhaktasya kṛtyametāvadanya datyadayaṃ viduḥ |
vīrasādhanakaṃ karma śivāpūjyā valistathā ||

siṃdūratilako devi veśyālāpo niraṃtaraṃ |
veśyāgehe niśācāro rātrau paryaṭanaṃ tathā ||

śaktipūjā yonidṛṣṭiḥ khaḍgahasto digaṃvaraḥ |
muktakeśo vīraveṣī tāṃvūla pūritānanaḥ ||

kālībhaktā bhaveddevī nānyathā kṣobhamāpnuyāt |
dugdhasvādī yoni lehī saṃvidā savaghūrṇitaḥ ||

veśyālatā samāyogān māsāsāt kalpalatā svayaṃ |
veśyā cakra samāyogāt kālī cakra samaḥ svayaṃ ||

veśyādeha samāyogāt kālīdehamayaḥ svayaṃ |
veśyā madhyagataṃ vīraṃ kadā paśyāmi sādhakam ||

evaṃ vadati sā kālī tasmād veśyā varāṃgaṇā |
veśyā kanyā tathā pīṭha jātibheda kula kramāt ||

akulakramabhedena jñātvā caiva kumārikāṃ |
kumārī pūjayed bhaktyā japāṃte devavat priye ||

<p. 153b>
 
paṭhennāma sahasraṃ yaḥ kālīdarśana bhāgbhavet |
bhaktyā pūjyā kumārīṃ tu veśyā kulasamudbhavāṃ ||

vastrahemādibhistoṣya japtvā stotraṃ paṭhecchive |
trailokyavijayī bhūyādamā caṃdrapradarśakaḥ ||

yadyaddattaṃ kūmāryai tu tadanaṃta phalaṃ bhavet |
kumārī pūjanaphalaṃ mayā vaktuṃ na śakyate ||

cāṃcalyādgaditaṃ kiṃcit kṣamyatāṃ na yamaṃjaliḥ |
ekācet pūjitā vālā dvitayaṃ pūjitaṃ bhavet ||

kumāryaśca śaktayaśca sarvametaccarācaraṃ |
śaktimānīya tadgātrenyāsajālaṃ pravinyaset ||

svavāmabhāge saṃsthāpya paṭhennāma sahasrakaṃ |
sarvasiddhīśvaro bhūyānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

śmaśānastho bhavet susthogalitaṃ cikuraṃ caret |
digaṃvaraḥ sahasraṃ ca sūryapuṣpaṃ samānayet ||

svavīryeṇa yutaṃ kṛtvā pratyekaṃ prajapen hunet |
pūjya dhyātvā mahābhaktyā kṣamāpālonaraḥ paṭhen ||

nakhaṃ keśaṃ svavīryaṃ ca yadyat saṃmārjanī gataṃ |
muktakeśo diśāvāso mūlamaṃtra puraḥsaraṃ ||

kujavāre madhyarātrau homaṃ kṛtvā śmaśānake |
paṭhennāma sahasraṃ yaḥ pṛthvīśākarṣaṇaṃ caret ||

puṣpayukte bhage devi saṃyogonaṃda tatparaḥ |
punaścikuramāsādya mūlamaṃtraṃ japecchive ||

citā vahnau madhyarātre vīryamutsārya yatnataḥ |
kālikāṃ pūjayet tatra paṭhennāma sahasrakaṃ ||

pṛthvīśākarṣaṇaṃ kuryānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
kadalīvanamāsādya lakṣamātraṃ japennaraḥ ||

madhumatyāḥ svayaṃ devyā sevyamānaḥ smaropamaḥ |
śrīmadhumatī tyuktvā tathā sthāvarajaṃgamā ||

karṣaṇīti samuccāryaṭhaṭha svāhāṃ samuccaret |
trailokyākarṣaṇī vidyā tasya haste sapta bhavet ||

nadīṃ purī ca ratnāni he maṃtrī śailabhūruhān |
ākarṣayatyaṃvunidhessumeroścadigaṃ tataḥ ||

alabhyāni ca vastūni dūrābhūmitalādapi |
vṛttāṃ taṃ ca purasthānāṃ rahasyaṃ vidviṣāmapi ||

<p. 154a>

rājñāṃ ca kathayat yeṣā satyaṃ satvaramāviśet |
dvitīyavarṣapāṭhena bhavet padmāvatīpatiḥ ||

oṃ hrīṁ padmāvati padaṃ tatra strailokya nāma ca |
vārtā ca kathaya dvaṃdva svāhāṃto maṃtra īritaḥ ||

brahmaviṣṇvādikānāṃ ca trailokye yādṛśī bhavet |
sarvaṃ vadati deveśi trikālajñaḥ kaviḥ śubhaḥ ||

trivargapāṭhato devi labhedbhogavaṭīṃ kalāṃ |
mahākālena dṛṣṭopi vinā dhūmagatopi ca ||

tasya darśanamātreṇa ciraṃjīvī naro bhavet |
vaṃ mṛtasaṃjīvanī suktvā mṛtayutthāya dvayaṃ ||

svāhāṃto manurākhyātaḥ svapnasiddhā bhavet tataḥ |
oṃ hrīṃ svapna vārāhī kālī svapne kathayacoddharet ||

amukasyāmukaṃdehi krīṃ svāhāṃto manurmataḥ |
svapnasiddhā caturvarṣāt tasya svapnet yadā sthitā ||

caturvarṣasya pāṭhena caturvedādhiyo naraḥ |
tadvaktra jalasaṃyogādvṛkṣaḥ kāvyaṃ karoti ca ||

tasya vākyaḥ vayānmūrtirvadati bhāratīṃ |
prastare tu karaṃ datvā vadavāṇīmiti bruvan ||

sādhako vāṃchayā kurvan tat tathaiva bhaviṣyati |
brahmāṇḍagolake yācayākācijjagatītale ||

samastā siddhayo devī kalāmūlaka vadbhavet |
sādhakaḥ smṛtimātreṇa yāvaṃtyaḥmita siddhayaḥ ||

svayamāyāṃti purato japādīnāṃ tu kākathā |
nideśavartino bhūtvā vartaṃte ceṭakā iva ||

amāyāṃ caṃdradarśaśca caṃdragrahaṇameva ca |
aṣṭamyāṃ pūrṇacaṃdratvaṃ caṃdrasūryāṣṭakaṃ tathā ||

aṣṭadikṣu tathā cāṣṭau karotyeva maheśvarī |
animā khecaratvaṃ ca carācara pūrīgatiḥ ||

pādukā khaḍgavetāla yakṣiṇī guhyakādayaḥ |
tilako guptatā dṛśya carācara kathānakaṃ ||

mṛtasaṃjīvanī siddhirguṭikā ca rasāyaṇaṃ |
uḍḍāda siddhirdeveśi ṣaṣṭhisiddhīśvaratvakaṃ ||

<p. 154b>

tasya haste bhaveddevi nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
ketau vā duṃdubhau vastrevitāneveṣṭane gṛhe ||

bhittau ca phalake pīṭhe lekhyaṃ pūjyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
madhya cakraṃ daśyaṃgāktaṃ parito nāmalekhanaṃ || 

tadvāraṇā maheśāni trailokya vijayī bhavet |
eko hi śatasāhasrāṃ nirjite caraṇājire ||

punarāyāti ca sukhaṃ svagṛhaṃ pratipārvatī |
eko hi śatasaṃdarśī lokānāṃ bhavati dhruvaṃ ||

kalaśaṃ sthāpya yatnena nāmasāhasrakaṃ paṭhet |
eṣaḥ kāryo maheśāni sarvāpattirnivāraṇaṃ ||

bhūtapreta grahādīnāṃ rākṣasāṃ brahmarākṣasāṃ |
vetālānāṃ bhairavāṇāṃ skaṃda vai nāyikādikān ||

nāśayet kṣaṇamātreṇa nātrakāryā vicāraṇā |
bhasmābhimaṃtritaṃ kṛtvā grahagrastaṃ vilepayet ||

bhasma saṃlāpanāddevi sarvagraha nivāraṇaṃ |
navanītaṃ cābhi maṃtrya strīṇāṃ dadyān maheśvarī ||

vaṃdhyātvā putravatī devi nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
kaṃṭhe vā vāmavāhau vā yonau vā dhāraṇācchive ||

vahuputravatī nārī śubhagā jāyate dhruvaṃ |
puruṣo dakṣiṇāṃge ca dhārayet sarvasiddhaye ||

kaṇṭhe vāhau ca śirasi hṛdayenābhigocare |
kaṭisthāne śikhāyāṃ ca dhārayet sarvasiddhaye ||

balavān kīrtimān dhanyo dhārmikaḥ sādhakaḥ kṛtī |
vahuputrī rathānāṃ ca gajānāmadhipaḥ sukhī ||

kāminīkarṣaṇodyuktaḥ krīṃ ca dakṣiṇakālike |
krīṃ svāhā prajapen maṃtramayutaṃ nāmapāṭhakaḥ ||

ākarṣaṇaṃ careddevī jalakhecara bhūgatā |
vaśīkaraṇa kāmo hi hūṁ hūṁ hrīṁ hrīṁ ca dakṣiṇe ||

kālike kūrcavījāni pūrvavat prajapen paṭhan |
urvaśīmapi vaśayennātrakāryā vicāraṇā ||

krīṁ dakṣiṇe kālike ceti svāhā yutaṃ japennaraḥ |
paṭhennāma sahasraṃ ca trailokyaṃ mārayeddhruvaṃ ||

<p. 155a>

satputrāya pradātavyaṃ vidyārājñīṃ pravedine |
suvinītāya śāṃtāyadāṃtāyāti guṇāya ca ||

bhaktāya jyeṣṭhaputrāya gurubhakti parāya ca |
bhaktabhaktāya yogyāya śakti bhaktāparāya ca ||

deyaṃ sahasranāmākhyaṃ svayaṃ kālyā prakāśite |
vaiṣṇavāya viśuddhāya śivā valiratāya ca ||

veśyā pūjana yuktāya kumārī pūjakāya ca |
durgābhaktāya śaivāya mahākāla prajāpine ||

advaitabhāvayuktāya kālībhaktaparāya ca |
gurudaivata maṃtrāṇāṃ maheśasyāpi pārvatī ||

abhedena smaren maṃtraṃ sa śivo nātra saṃśayaḥ |
yo maṃtraṃ bhāvayen maṃtrī sa śivaḥ sa ca gānayaḥ ||

sa śākto vaiṣṇavaḥ sotra sa eva pūrṇadīkṣitaḥ |
ayogyāya na dātavyaṃ siddhirodhaḥ  prajāyate ||

veśyā strī niṃdakāyāthāmurāsaṃvit praniṃdake |
surāmukhīṃ manuṃ smṛtvā surācāvatariṣyati ||

vāgvṛttāghore āḥ saḥ paramaghore ca hūṁ vadet |
ghorarūpehaśca ghoramukhī bhīma padaṃ vadet ||

bhīṣaṇyamukaṣaṣṭhyaṃtaṃ hetuṃ ca mayutaṃ pivā |
śivaṃ vahni yugāstraṃ ca hūṁ haḥ phaṭ ca manurbhavet ||

etasyāḥ smaraṇādeva duṣṭānāṃ ca mukhe surā |
avatīrṇā bhaveddevi nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

khalāya parataṃtrāya paraniṃdā parāya ca |
bhraṣṭāya duṣṭasatvāya parivādaparāya ca ||

śivā bhaktāya duṣṭāya paradāraratāya ca |
na stotraṃ darśayeddevi śivahatyā karo bhavet ||

kalikānaṃda hṛdayaḥ kālikāsakta mānasaḥ |
kālībhakto bhavet so hi dhanyarūpaḥ sa eva tu ||

kalau kālīkalau kālīkalau kālī tu kevalā |
kalau kālī kalau kālī kalau kālī varapradā ||

vilvapatra sahasrāṇi karavīrāṇi vai tathā |
pratināmnā pūjayeddhitena kālī varapradā ||

<p. 155b>

kamalānāṃ sahasraṃ ca pratināmnā samarpayet |
cakraṃ saṃpūjya deveśi kālikā varamāpnuyāt ||

maṃtrakṣobhayute devikalaśastha jalena ca |
nāmnāprase ca yeddevi sarvakṣobha vināśakṛt ||

tathā damanakaṃ devi sahasramāharedvratī |
sahasranāmā saṃpūjya kālikā varamāpnuyāt ||

cakraṃ vilikhya dehasthaṃ dhārayet kālikā tanuṃ |
kālyai niveditaṃ yadyattaccheṣaṃ bhakṣayecchive ||

divyadehadharo bhūtvā kālī dehasthitā bhavet |
naivedya niṃdakān duṣṭān dṛṣṭā nṛtyaṃti bhairavāḥ ||

yoginyaśca mahāvīrāḥ raktapānodyatāḥ sadā |
māṃsāsthi carvaṇodyuktā bhakṣayaṃti na saṃśayaḥ ||

tasmānna niṃden manasā karmaṇā vacasā kimu |
anyathā kurute yastu tasya pāto bhaviṣyati ||

kramāddīkṣā vihīnānāṃ siddhirbhavati nānyathā |
maṃtrakṣobhaśca vā bhūyāt kṣīṇāyurvā bhaveddhruvaṃ ||

putrahārī ca strīhārī rājyahārī bhaveddhruvaṃ |
kramadīkṣāyuto devi kramādrājyamavāpnuyāt ||

ekavāraṃ paṭheddevi sarvapāpa vināśanaṃ |
dvivāraṃ prapaṭhedyo hi vāṃchāṃ viṃdati nityaśaḥ ||

trivāraṃ prapaṭhedyastu vāgīśaḥ samatāṃ vrajet |
caturvāraṃ paṭheddevi cāturvarṇyādhipo bhavet ||

paṃcavāraṃ paṭheddevi paṃcakāmādhipo bhavet |
ṣaḍvāraṃ prapaṭheddevi ṣaḍaiśvaryamayo bhavet ||

saptavāraṃ paṭheddevi kāmānāṃ ciṃtitaṃ labhet |
vasuvāraṃ paṭheddevi digīśo bhavati dhruvaṃ ||

navavāraṃ paṭheddevī navanātha samo bhavet |
daśavāraṃ kīrtayedyodāśārhakhacareśvaraḥ ||

viṃśadvāraṃ kīrtayedyaḥ sarvaiśvarya mayo bhavet |
paṃcaviṃśati vāraistu sarvaciṃtā vināśakaḥ ||

paṃcāśadvāramāvṛtya paṃcabhūteśvaro bhavet |
śatavāraṃ kīrtayedyaḥ śatānaṃda samānadhīḥ ||

śatapaṃcakamāvṛtya rājarājeśvaraḥ kalau |
sahasrāvartanāddevi lakṣmī māvṛṇute svayaṃ ||

trisahasraṃ samāvṛtya trinetra sadṛśadyutiḥ |
paṃcasahasrāvartanāttu kāmakoṭi vimohanaḥ ||

<p. 156a>

daśasahasrāvartanāttu bhaveddaśamukheśvaraḥ |
paṃcaviṃśat sahasreṇa caturviṃśati siddhibhuk ||

lakṣāvartana mātreṇa lakṣmīpati samo bhavet |
lakṣatrayāvartanāttu mahādevaṃ vijeṣpati ||

lakṣapaṃcakamāvṛtya kalāpaṃcaka saṃyutaḥ |
dakṣalakṣāvartanāttu daśavidyāptiruttamā ||

paṃcaviṃśati lakṣaistu daśavidyeśvaro bhavet |
paṃcāśallakṣamāvṛtya mahākāla samo bhavet ||

koṭimāvṛttayedyohi kālīṃ paśyati cakṣuṣā |
varadānodyuktaparāṃ mahākāla samanvitāṃ ||

pratyakṣaṃ paśyati śive tasya dehe vaseddhruvaṃ |
śrīvidyākālikātārā triśaktiviṣaye paṭhet ||

triśakti viṣayeddevi kramadīkṣā prakīrtitā |
kramadīkṣāyuto devīrājā bhavati niścitaṃ ||

vidherlipiṃ tu saṃmārjya kiṃ karatvaṃ visṛjya ca |
mahārājya mavāpnoti nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

kramadīkṣā vihīnasya phalaṃ pūrṇamayeritaṃ |
kramadīkṣāyutoddevi śiva eva na vā paraḥ ||

kramadīkṣā samāyuktaḥ kalpoktasiddhibhāgbhavet |
kramadīkṣā vihīnasya siddhihāniḥ pade pade ||

ahodhanyavartā madhye dhanyaḥ kramayutaḥ kalau |
tatrāpi dhanyo deveśināma sāhasra pāṭhakaḥ ||

daśakālīvidhau devī stotra me tat sadā paṭhet |
siddhiṃ viṃdati deveśi nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

kalaukālī mahāvidyā kalaukālī tu siddhidā |
kalaukālī susiddhā ca kalaukālī varapradā ||

kalaukālī sādhakasya darśanārthaṃ samudyatā |
kalaukālī kevalāsyānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

nānyavidyā nānyavidyā nānyavidyā kalau bhavet |
kalaukālīṃ vihāyātha yaḥ kaścit siddhikāmukaḥ ||

sa tu śaktiṃ vinā devi ratiṃ saṃbhogamicchati |
kalaukālīṃ vinā devī yaḥ kaścit kāryamicchati ||

sa nīla sādhanaṃ tyuktvā paribhramati sarvataḥ |
kalaukālīṃ vihāyātha yaḥ kaścinmokṣamicchati ||

<p. 156b>

gurudhyānaṃ parityajya siddhimicchati sādhakaḥ |
kalaukālīṃ vihāyāthayaḥ kaścidrājyamicchati ||

sabhojanaṃ parityajya kṣunnivṛttimabhīpsyati |
sa dhanyaḥ sa ca vijñānī sa eva surapūjitaḥ ||

sa dīkṣitaḥ sukhī sādhuḥ satyavādī jiteṃdriyaḥ |
sa vedavaktā svādhyāyī sarvānaṃda parāyaṇā ||

svasmin kālīṃ tu saṃbhāvya pūjayejjagadaṃvikāṃ |
trailokyavijayī bhūyānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

gururūpaṃ śivaṃ dhyātvā śivarūpaṃ guruṃ smaret |
sadāśivaḥ sa evasyānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
rahasyātirahasyaṃ rahasyātirahasyakaṃ ||

ślokārddha pādamātraṃ vā pādārddhaṃ ca tadarddhakaṃ |
nāmārddhaṃ vā paṭheddevi na vaṃdhyaṃ divasaṃ caret ||

pustakaṃ pūjayed bhaktyātvā vṛtti phalasiddhaye |
navanārī bhayaṃ tatra navāgni vātasaṃbhavaṃ ||

na bhūtādi bhayaṃ tatra sarvatra sukhamedhatte |
kuṃkumāraktake naiva rocanā guruyogataḥ ||

bhūrjapatre likhetyustaṃ sarvakāmārthasiddhaye |
iti gaditamaśeṣaṃ kālikāvarṇarūpaṃ ||

prapaṭhati yadi bhaktyā sarvasiddhīśvaraḥ syāt |
abhinava sukhakāmaṃ sarvavidyābhirāmaṃ ||

bhavati sakalasiddhiḥ sarvavīrā samṛddhiḥ |
iti saṃkṣepataḥ proktaṃ kimanyaṃ chrotumicchasi ||

iti śrīmadādināthaviracitāyāṃ mahākālasaṃhitāyāṃ kālīkālasaṃvāde 
suṃdarīvaradānākhyaṃ kakārādi sahasraṃnāmastotraṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau śrīdakṣiṇakālikāyā nityārcanāyāṃ 
stavakavacādinirṇayo nāma dvāviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 22 ||

atha śrīdakṣiṇakāṃgatvena mahākālādi nityānāṃ pratyekopāsanāmāha ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

mahākālādinityānāṃnirṇayadvitayaṃ vada ||

śrīśiva uvāca ||

mahākāla samārabhya nityānāṃ nirṇayaṃ śṛṇu |
mahākālo mahābhīmaḥ pralayānalasannibhaḥ ||

<p. 157a>

kālīmāyāsamudbhūtaḥ kālīmānasikaḥ śiva |
mahākāla paraṃ śaṃbhuḥ paratīta guṇākaraḥ ||

tasya maṃtraṃ pravakṣyāmi yena rakṣe jagattrayaṃ |
kūrcayugmaṃ mahākālaṃ prasīdeti padadvayaṃ ||

lajjāyugmaṃ vahnijāyā saṃyukta ṣoḍaśārṇakaḥ |
ṣoḍaśārṇā yathā mukhyā sarvaśrīcakramaṇḍale ||

tathāyaṃ sarvakālīṣu mahākālaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
kālikāsya ṛṣiḥ proktaḥ virāṭ chaṃda prakīrtitaḥ ||

devatā tu mahākālaḥ sarvarūpī niraṃjanaḥ |
kūrcavījaṃ tathā māyāśaktiratra prakīrtitaḥ ||

svāhā kīlakamuddiṣṭaṃ kālyarthe viniyogatā |
māyayā tu ṣaḍaṃgā ni dhyānaṃ śṛṇu varānane ||

koṭikālāna lābhāsaṃ caturbhujaṃ trilocanaṃ |
śmaśānāṣṭaka madhyasthaṃ muṇḍāṣṭaka vibhūṣitaṃ ||

paṃcapreta sthitaṃ devaṃ triśūlaṃ ḍamaruṃ tathā |
khaḍgaṃ ca kharparaṃ caiva vāma dakṣiṇayogataḥ ||

vibhrataṃ suṃdaraṃ dehaṃ śmaśānabhasmabhūṣitaṃ |
nānāśavaiḥ krīḍamānaṃ kālikā hṛdayasthitaṃ ||

lālayaṃtaṃ ratāsaktaṃ ghoracuṃvana tatparaṃ |
gṛddhragomāyusaṃyuktaṃ pheravīgaṇa saṃyutaṃ ||

jaṭāpaṭala śobhāḍhyaṃ sarvaśūtpālayesthitaṃ |
sarvaśūnyaṃ muṇḍabhūṣaṃ prasannavadanaṃ śivaṃ ||

bhāvayet parameśāni ratiyaṃtraṃ tu yaṃtrakaṃ |
trikoṇa saṃjñā yoniḥ syāt taccakraṃ kālacakrakaṃ ||

yonau vā hṛdaye bhāle kāminyāstana maṇḍale |
mahākālaṃ yajeddevaṃ paṃcāvaraṇa saṃyutaṃ ||

trikoṇe pūjayeddevi trikoṇe kālikādikaṃ |
ṣaṭdale tu ṣaḍaṃgāni nābhaudik śaktayomatāḥ ||

hṛdayo dvādaśādityaṃ kaṇṭhe ṣoḍaśa nityakāḥ |
dvipatre parameśāni kālakālī prapūjayet ||

viparītaratau devī ratau devīṃ prapūjayet |
śaktiṃ svābhimukhīṃ kṛtvā pūjayet kālikāṃ parāṃ ||

mūlādhārā dvipatrāṃtaṃ tathā cakrāṇi kārayet |
pūjayet parameśāni gurupūjā puraḥsaraṃ ||

pātrāsādanakaṃ kṛtvā kālīvat paripūjayet |
evaṃ pūjāṃvidhāyātha lakṣasaṃkhyaṃ japecchive ||

taddṛśāṃśena havanaṃ karavīra prasūnakaiḥ |
svayaṃbhuvāktairvījāktaiḥ kāraṇāktaiśca vāhunet ||

<p. 157b>

nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kāmyaṃ kālīvat sarvamācaret ||

ajñānāṃtakarī kālī vidyāyā vidhirucyate |
mūrtidhyānoditāṃ kṛtvā sarvāvayavaśobhitāṃ ||

mūledhāre gaṇapatiṃ liṃge gaṇapati vallabhāṃ |
nābhau vaṭukanāthaṃ ca hṛdi vaṭukavallabhāṃ ||

kaṃṭhe udyānapīṭhaṃ ca bhrūvi pradīptamaṃgalaṃ |
lalāṭe karavīraṃ ca alake kṣetrapālakaṃ ||

mūrddhni vai kālikā caiva caturthyaṃtāṃ prapūjayet |
mūrddhni vyomaiśvaryavāṃ ca lalāṭe khecarī tathā ||

bhrūmadhye dikcarīṃ caiva hṛdaye gocarīṃ tathā |
nābhau ca bhūcarīṃ caiva liṃge ca khagamūrtikāṃ ||

mūlapatre vicitraṃ ca pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ |
tathā lalāṭe sūryaṃ ca dakṣanetre kalādhipaṃ ||

vaiśvānaraṃ vāmanetraṃ kaṃṭhe ca kālikāṃ tathā |
hṛdaye dāsayoniṃ ca nābhau ca tāsasiddhakai ||

brāhmī māheśvarīṃ ca kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā |
vārāhyaindrai ca cāmuṇḍā mahālakṣmī parāmatā ||

maṃthāna bhairavaścaiva ṣaṭcakra bhairavastathā |
ṣaṭkālabhairavaścaiva ravibhakṣaka bhairava ||

vīreśa bhairavaścaiva śrīmaṃtreśvara bhairavaḥ |
hemagarbha bhairavaśca caṇḍikeśvara bhairavaḥ ||

mūrddhni lalāṭe kaṃṭhe ca hṛdaye nābhimaṃḍale |
liṃge ca mūlādhāre ca sarvāṃge pūjayet sudhīḥ ||

yathāśakti japedvidvān valiṃ dadyād yathāvidhiḥ |
oṃ kṣauca kṣetrapālā ca imaṃ valipadaṃ vadet ||

gṛhna gṛhna dvayaṃ yuktaḥ kṣetrapāla valirmataḥ |
iti pūjāvidhirdevi śrīkālīkālayormatāḥ ||

aṃtardhyāna vidhānena viparīta ratirmatā |
mahākāla prasaṃgena rahasyamapi darśita ||

gopanīyaṃ tvayā bhadre rahasyāti rahasyakaṃ |
gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ svayoniraparairyathā ||

kālīnityā ca tanmaṃtraḥ kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ |
viṣavījaṃ tato māyāṃ kālīti yugalaṃ vadet ||

mahākālī padaṃ procya kaumārīti padaṃ vadet |
bhagaṃ dehi padaṃ dehi ṭhaṭhayukto manurmataḥ ||

<p. 158a>

uraviṃśākṣarī vidyā kālī nityā prakīrtitāḥ ||

paraśurāmo ṛṣiḥ proktaśchaṃdonuṣṭup prakīrtitaḥ |
devatā kālikā proktā māyāvījaṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

kālikā ca bhavecchaktiḥ ṭhayugmaṃ kīlakaṃ bhavet |
kālikā prīṇatādyarthe viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

ṣaḍaṃgamācareddevī jātiyuktena māyayā |
tato dhyāyen maheśāni citānirvāṇamaṇḍale ||

śyāmavarṇo mahābhīmā ghorarāvā karālinī |
muṇḍamālā vibhūṣāḍhyā dakṣe khaḍgaṃ pravibhratī ||

tarjanī dhārayen vāme nṛtyaṃtī pretabhūmiṣu |
evaṃ dhyātvā maheśāni tadyaṃtraṃ śṛṇu pārvatī ||

trikoṇa yugmaṃ deveśi vṛttāṣṭadalabhūpuraṃ |
viṃdau kālīṃ samārādhya trikoṇa yugmake punaḥ ||

guṇatrayaṃ tatpurasthāstacchaktayaḥ kramānmatāḥ |
brāhmyādimātaraścāṣṭau lokapālāḥ saśastrakāḥ ||

bhūpure pūjayeddevi dhūpadīpopacārakaiḥ |
naivedyaṃ vividhaṃ khādyaṃ paṃcakhādyaṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

nivedayet kālikāyai tatastuṣṭā bhaviṣyati |
nīrājanītaṃ kṛtvātha prajapet lakṣamātrakaṃ ||

daśāṃśaṃ pāyasenaiva homaṃ kuryādvidhānataḥ |
athavā karavīreṇa homayet sarvasiddhaye ||

sarvasiddhīśvaro devi bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ ||

maṃtrabhedān pravakṣyāmi yathāvadavadhāraya |
nāmamātraṃ maheśāni pratyekaṃ praṇavakramāt ||

maṃtra trayaṃ maheśāni vījatraya niyojayet |
vidyā trayaṃ punardevī dhruvamāyā niyojanāt ||

vidyā trayaṃ maheśāni pratyekaṃ navadhā manuḥ |
durbhagānāṃ ca dīnānāṃ krūrāṇāṃ pāpakarmiṇāṃ ||

maṃtramenaṃ prakathayet sarvaiśvarya mayo bhavet |
lakṣmīvān kīrtivān dhanyo bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ ||

sunārīṃ kāminīṃ dṛṣṭvā tasyāścaiva bhagaṃ vadet |
bhagaśabde tadbhagaṃ ca sā dāsī maṃtrajāpataḥ ||

vyākulā saṃbhavatyeva svecchayā bhogamicchati |
lalāṭe hṛdaye vidyāṃ yonimadhye yathākramaṃ ||

yasyāḥ saṃciṃtayedvidyāṃtaṃnāma smṛti pūrvakaṃ |
tāmākarṣayati prājñaḥ kimanyairvahujalpitaiḥ ||

<p. 158b> 

sākṣāt sa kālīputraḥ syānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
deveśi kathyate gopyaṃ yatna kutrāpi kīrtitaṃ ||

kapālinī mahāvidyā dvitīyā tanmanuṃ śṛṇu ||

ādau samakalaṃ procya kāmaṃ vahni padesthitaṃ |
iṃdirāṃ viṃdubhūṣāḍhyaṃ vījaṃ kālī svarūpakaṃ ||

kapālinī mahākapālapriya mānase vadet |
kapāla siddhiṃ me dehi hūṁ phaṭ svāhāya ko manuḥ ||

triṃśadvarṇārdvavarṇādyomaṃtrarājā mahottamaḥ |
bhairavasya ṛṣiḥ prokto triṣṭup chaṃda udāhṛtaṃ ||

kapālinī devatānukālikā vījamīritaṃ |
svāhā śaktiḥ samākhyātā hūṁ phaṭ kīlakamīritaṃ ||

kapālinī siddhayetra viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
ṣaṭdīrghabhājā vījena kūrcādaṃgāni ṣaṭ kramāt ||

dhyāyedaṃjana pūjābhāṃmāpīnastana yugmakāṃ |
caṃdravaktrā ca viṃcoṣṭa muktakeśīṃ digaṃvarāṃ ||

caturmuṃḍāparigatāṃ śaṃkhakaṃkaṇabhuṣitāṃ |
khaḍgatriśūlavaradābhayān hasta catuṣṭayaṃ ||

kramāt saṃvibhratīṃ devīṃ gītahāsya parāyaṇāṃ |
evaṃ saṃcitayeddevī mahākāpālinīṃ parāṃ ||

trikoṇa tritayaṃ vṛttaṃ dalāṣṭaka vibhūṣitaṃ |
bhūpureṇa samākīrṇaṃ caturvāropaśobhitaṃ ||

yaṃtraṃ kāpālinī devyāḥ sarvasāmrājyadāyakaṃ |
mahākālīṃ mahālakṣmīṃ mahāsarasvatīṃ tathā ||

ratiṃ prītiṃ tathā kāṃtiṃ dvitīyettha tṛtīyake |
icchāṃ jñānāṃ kriyāṃ caiva trikoṇe tu tṛtīyake ||

madhye kapālinīṃ pūjyadaleṣṭau mātṛkārcanaṃ |
tatoṣṭau bhairavāścaiva digīśān śāstrakāṃ yajet ||

paṃcopacāraiḥ saṃpūjya kulācāraparāyaṇaḥ |
sādhakaḥ prajapellakṣaṃ hayāri kusumairhunet ||

māsena madhunāṃ vāpi juhuyādiṣṭa sādhaye |
tadā kāpālinī devī siddhirbhavati niścitaṃ ||

puraścaryāṃ vinā devī kathaṃ siddhiḥ kapālinī |
muṇḍāsane naraḥ sthitvā sadā tadgatamānasaḥ ||

<p. 159a>

mahāmālā mahāpātraṃ mahāsaṃtrāsanādikaṃ |
kṛtvā tu vidhivaddevī tadā bhavati sādhakaḥ ||

athānyadapi vakṣyāmi kāpālinyāḥ parākramaṃ |
raṇavīrākapālāni kujavāre niśāmukhe ||

samāhṛtya maheśāni paṃcapaṃca samanvitaḥ |
digvaṃdha bhūtaśuddhyādi dikpālādyupahārakaiḥ ||

sādhakaḥ sahito bhūtvā siṃdūratilakāṃkitaḥ |
khaḍgahasto diśāvāso muktakeśo mudānvitaḥ ||

īdṛśaḥ sādhakaḥ sohaṃ kṛtibhāvaḥ samanvitaṃ |
sudūresādhansthāpya puṣpavartyā ghṛtāktayā ||

dīpaṃ saṃlāpayeddevī japet tatra kapālinīṃ |
bhāgyāt kapālinī siddhiḥ kadācit prabhaviṣyati ||

tathāpi kālikā bhakte bhaviṣyati bhaviṣyati |
kapālaṃ bhāgyayogena kadācid yadi labhyate ||

tadā kapālinīṃ siddhiḥ kajjalaṃ taddhisaṃgrahaṃ |
tat kajjalaṃ kapāle tu kajjalaṃ sthāpya vai japet ||

saṃmohanāṃjanaṃ nāmamahadaṃ janamīritaṃ |
tat kapāle maheśāni kiṃtadyannakare sthitaṃ ||

eṣā kapālinī nityā dvitīyā kālikā ca vat |
iti saṃkṣepataḥ proktaṃ kullāṃ śṛṇu tṛtīyakaṃ ||

kālikā kullukā kullā tridhā nāmnā tu yā matā |
tasmāt kulleti nāmnā ca kulapūjyatvaṃ tāṃ gatā ||

vidyānāṃ kulapūjyatvā kullukā parikīrtitā |
kullukā kulapūjyatvāt kulanāmnā kuleśvarī ||

tasyā maṃtraṃ pravakṣyāmi yathāvadavadhāraya ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya kālikā vījamuddharet |
kullāyai hṛnmanurdevī proktaḥ saptākṣaro manuḥ ||

bhairavosya ṛṣiḥ prokto gāyatrī chaṃdamīritaṃ |
kullākālī devatātra kālikāvījamīritaṃ ||

kullāśaktiritikhyātā namaḥ kālakamīritaṃ |
sarvārthasādhane caiva viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

kālikokte yajetpīṭhe kumārī yaṃtrameva hi |
kumāryāṃ pūjayeddevī kullā siddhā bhaveddhruvaṃ ||

<p. 159b>

lakṣadvayaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ haviṣyāsī divā śuciḥ |
aśuciśca tathā rātrau śrīkullādarśanotsukaḥ ||

kadācidabhra sadṛśāṃ kadācijjyoti sannibhāṃ |
caturbhutāṃ trinayanāṃ mukuṭāṭopamaṇḍitāṃ ||

śavāsanagatāṃ kullāṃ daśamuṇḍoparisthitāḥ |
varābhayakare vāme pustasrak dakṣiṇekare ||

nānāvilāsa kuśalāṃ kullāṃ vā pariciṃtayet |
evaṃ ciṃtayastasya daśavidyāmayī kalā ||

bhavatyeva maheśāni kullāṃ vāyāḥ prabhāvataḥ |
karavīrairjavāpuṣpairhunaijapadaśāṃśataḥ ||

taddaśāṃśaṃ gaṃdhatoyaistarpayenmārjayedapi |
brāhmaṇān bhojayeddevī tadaṃte tu kumārikāṃ ||

pūjayet parameśāni kullā vidyā prasiddhyati |
kullā vidyā maheśāni sarvavidyā prakāśinī ||

yaṃtramasyāsti deveśi vai mityekāmya karmaṇi |
trikoṇa dvayamuddhṛtya vṛttāṣṭadalabhūṣitāṃ ||

caturddhāra samāyuktaṃ bhūpuraikena saṃyutaṃ |
madhye vījanyaset kālyāḥ vījayuktaṃ mahottamaṃ ||

dhṛtiṃ puṣṭiṃ tathā medhāṃ prajñāṃ caiva tathā japāṃ |
trikoṇa dvitaye pūjyadaleṣṭa mātṛbhairavau ||

lokapālān śāstrayuktān kullukāvaraṇe yajet |
athavā devadeveśi kālikāvat samastakaṃ ||

navarātra dvaye caiva grahaṇasya dvaye tathā |
saṃkrame cottama tithau pūjayedyaṃtramadbhutaṃ ||

yadaiva kāryamutpannaṃ dataiva kullukārcanaṃ |
na vidyā siddhimāpnoti kullukārcanamaṃtarā ||

ādimāṃ samāyuktaḥ sa vidyā siddhimāpnuyāt |
ādimāṃtyaṃ na jānāti yo guruḥ sa tu śiṣyahā ||

ādimāṃtyaḥ kriyā yukto nityā maṃtro hi siddhyati |
ādimāṃtya vihīnasya tasyāddevasyadarśanaṃ ||

prītibhayaṃ dvayamiti dvābhyāṃ saṃdhyāpitaṃ jagat |
ayaṃ prayogo goptavyā na kutrāpi mayeritaḥ ||

kullā devyādi nityāsu japo hi dvitayāvadhi |
dvitayābhyāṃ na siddho sau sa maṃtro na japakṣamaḥ ||

kullā nityā mayā proktā yasyā me tat pratiṣṭhitaṃ |
samaste jagatīsāraṃ kullā saṃkṣepapūjanaṃ ||

śrṇu devi pravakṣyāmi rahasyātirahasyakaṃ |
vidyānāṃ kulapūjyatvāt kuru kullā kulādhikān ||

<p. 160a>

kullāyā api pūjyatvāt kuru kullā mahodayā |
tasyā maṃtro maheśāni sarvamaṃtrottamottamaḥ ||

kālīṃ dhruvaṃ samuddhṛtya kuru kulle padaṃ vadet |
kālīṃ māyā mama padaṃ sarvajanapadaṃ tataḥ ||

vaśamāna coccārya kālī ca kuru kulluke |
padamuddhṛtya deveśi māyā svāhāṃta go manuḥ ||

saptaviṃśatparṇa saṃkhyā maṃtrosyāḥ surapādapaḥ |
etasya hṛnmanurdevi kuru kullānavākṣarī ||

śrīvidyāviṣayebhinnā kuru kullā maheśvarī |
kālyaṃga vidyā deveśi śrīvidyā kurukullukāṃ ||

iyaṃ vidyā mahābhinnā kālī nityā caturthikā |
vinā tu hṛnmanuṃ devi kurukullā na siddhyati ||

hṛnmanuṃ kurukullāyā jñātvā yatnena pārvatī |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya kurukulle padaṃ vadet ||

hrīṁ svāhāṃto manurdevi kurukullā kumārikāṃ |
hṛnmanutvena kathitaḥ sarvamaṃtro tamottamaḥ ||

kālabhairava ṛṣiścāsya vṛhatī chaṃda īritaṃ |
devatā kurukullā ca sarvavidyāmayī parā ||

krīṁ vījaṃ hīṁ tathā śaktiḥ svāhā kīlakamīritaṃ |
kurukullā kumāryastu bhairavo viparītataḥ ||

virāṭ chaṃdo nigaditaṃ kūrcavījaṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
svāhā śaktiṃ samuddiṣṭā viniyogo yathecchayā ||

kurukullāṃ mitrakullāṃ kurukullāṃ hṛdaṃgamāṃ |
kālī dhruvaśca kurukulle krīṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ mama sarvataḥ ||

janavaśaṃ krīṁ kuru yuk kurukulle triviṣṭayā |
svāhāṃtoyaṃ manurdiṣṭā bhairavo hi virāṭ tataḥ ||

hrīṁ vījaṃ ca tathā svāhā śaktiḥ klīṃ kīlakaṃ mataṃ |
sarvārtha viniyogaḥ syāt pūrvavat kvāpi kīrtitaṃ ||

viniyogaḥ pūrvavatsyācchṛṇudhvaṃgādi kalpanā |
ṣaṭdīrgha kālīvījena ṣaḍaṃgāni kramāccaret ||

tato dhyāyen mahāvidyāṃ kurukullāṃ maheśvarīṃ |
śavopari samāsīnāṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ ||

kapālakartṛkāṃ hastāṃ khaḍgakheṭakadhāriṇīṃ |
aṃjanādri nibhāṃ divyāṃ muktakeśīṃ caturbhujāṃ ||

<p. 160b>

pīnonnata kucadvaṃdvāṃ pīnavakṣo nitaṃvinīṃ |
bhaktānaṃdakarodyuktāṃ sādhakābhīṣṭadāyinīṃ ||

āsavāpūrṇanayanāṃ kāminī janamohinīṃ |
evaṃ saṃciṃtayeddevīṃ kurukullāṃ mahodayāṃ ||

evaṃ dhyātvā japellakṣa saṃkhyaṃ trimadhurānvitaḥ |
homayed vilvapatraiśca vilvapuṣpairapi priye ||

daśāṃśaṃ tarpaṇaṃ kuryāddaśāṃśena tu mārjanaṃ |
daśaṃ vipra bhojyaṃ ca tena siddho manurbhavet ||

pūjayet kālikāpīṭhe trikoṇa trayasojjvale |
vṛttāṣṭadalabhūṣāḍhye bhūpuradvayaśobhite ||

viṃdau vījaṃ likhet kālyāstriśakti trayamarcayet |
kālīṃ tārāṃ chinnamastāṃ vālāṃ vā vagalāṃ rasāṃ ||

ugra prabhā mugravīryāṃ tṛtīyāṃ tu tṛtīyakāṃ |
trikoṇa tritaye pūjā krameṇa parikīrtitāṃ ||

brāhmyādyaṣṭau bhairavā ca pūjayeddvidalāṣṭake |
lokapālāntadastrātāḥ pūjayet parameśvarī ||

śavaśmaśāno vipine araṇya bhūtasaṃkule |
pūjayet kurukullāṃ vā sarvasiddhiṃ sa viṃdati ||

yadyat prārthayate citte tat tadāpnoti sādhakaḥ |
samastānpūjayeddevī brāhmaṇāṃśca suvāsināṃ ||

viprārādhana mātreṇa kiṃ tadyantakare sthitaṃ |
taṃḍulena jayāvāptirgodhūmena dhanāgamaḥ ||

māṣaiḥ śatrumṛtiṃ yāti mudgairmokṣakalāṃ labhet |
tilataṃḍulahomena mahāprītiṃ sa viṃdati ||

rājī lavaṇahomena kāminīṃ karṣayeddhruvaṃ |
sarṣapairlavaṇairdevikāmini manabhaṃjanaṃ ||

sarpirlavaṇahomena kāminīmanaraṃjanaṃ |
haridrayā daridrāṇi naśyaṃtyeva na saṃśayaḥ ||

rahasyādati gopyā hi nityā proktā virodhinī |
paṃcamī saṃjñikāṃ nityā yathāvadavadhāraya ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya kāli praṇavamuddharet |
māyā kāmastataḥ kūrcaḥ prokto virodhinī padaṃ ||

śatrunuccāṭayaṃ padaṃ virodha yadvayaṃ vadet |
śatru kṣayakarī procya hūṁ phaṭ svāhānvito manuḥ ||

dvātriṃśadvarṇa saṃyukto maṃtrarājo mahottamaḥ |
mahāmaṃtro yamākhyāto ṛṣirbhairava īritaḥ ||

<p. 161a>

gāyatrī chaṃda ādiṣṭaṃ devatā tu virodhinī |
kālīvījaṃ vījamasyāḥ māyāśaktiḥ prakīrtitā ||

kāmavījaṃ kīlakaṃ syāt viniyogo yathecchayā |
kālī ṣaṭdīrghavījena ṣaḍaṃgayugmamācaret ||

dhyāyedaṃ janagirinibhāṃ dviraṣṭavarṣadeśinī |
pīnonnata kucadvaṃdvāṃ sarpācchimālikāṃ yutāṃ ||

caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ śavapadmoparisthitāṃ |
triśikhaṃ nāgapāśaṃ ca ghaṇṭāṃ ca ḍamaruṃ tathā ||

sa vibhratīṃ mahādevīṃ kramādbhuja catuṣṭaye |
dhūmrāṃvarāṃ pītagātrīmīṣat prahasitānanāṃ ||

mābhairvīra varaṃ vrūhi sarvatatvaṃ dadāmyahaṃ |
upasthitaṃ te yat kāryaṃ tat tatkāryaṃ karomyahaṃ ||

evaṃ saṃvadatīṃ devīṃ cāruhāsāṃ manoharāṃ |
virodhakaraṇodyuktāṃ śatrūṇāṃ nāśakāriṇīṃ ||

kālikokte yajetpīṭhe trikoṇa traya śobhite |
vṛttāṣṭadala bhūṣāḍhye bhūpuraikeśobhite ||

caturdvāra vibhūṣāḍhye śrīvījojjvalakarṇike |
virodhinī karṇikāyāṃ trikoṇe tritaya kramāt ||

dhūmāṃ ca pūṣṇāṃ jvalinīṃ jvālinīṃ visphuliṃginīṃ |
suśrīṃ surūpāṃ kapilī tato havyavahāṃ yajet ||

virodhinīṃ mastake tu tato hi daśamīṃ yajet |
dalāṣṭake bhairavāṣṭau bhairaveṇa samanvitāṃ ||

bhūpure lokapālāṃśca tadastrāṇi ca tadvahiḥ |
tano nīrājanaṃ kṛtvā lakṣasaṃkhyaṃ japenmanuṃ ||

daśāṃśaṃ juhuyād vahnau niṃva vahnau yathāvidhi |
ariṣṭamālāṃ kṛtvā ca mahāmuṇḍāsanīnaraḥ ||

juhuyādarināśāya ariṣṭaphalamādarāt |
vibhītakena juhuyāt sarvaśatru nivarhaṇaṃ ||

dhuttūrakusumairddhīmān śatru vidveṣayennaraḥ |
kākolūkasya māṃsena śatrūnmārayati kṣaṇāt ||

rājasuvṛkṣa prasūnaiśca tatkāṣṭāgnau hunetsudhīḥ |
virodhinī bhavetsiddhā dhūmāvatyādi saṃyutā ||

arkakāṣṭhādi saṃyuktā śatruvidveṣakāriṇī |
vāyavyābhimukho bhūtvā vadujīrakajaṃjalaṃ ||

koṣṇaṃ pivenmaheśāni śatrurjvarayuto bhavet |
parābhicāranāśārthaṃ svarakṣārthaṃ yathāvidhiḥ ||

<p. 161b>

ekāṃte mātṛgehe vā mṛtahaṭṭe śivālaye |
virodhinīṃ japedvidyāṃdyayutaṃ coktamārgataḥ ||

vibītakasya samidhā hunecchatru nivāraṇaṃ |
nābhimātrodake gatvā marī ca jalayogataḥ ||

tarpayeddevatā nīraistrailokya dveṣaṇaṃ caret |
athākarṣaṇamanvicchanvalmīkamṛt samānayet ||

śmaśāne mṛtsamādāya godhūmahiṃgujīrakaiḥ |
puttarīṃ sādhyarūpāṃ ca kārayet parameśvarīṃ ||

nāsāyāṃḍorakaṃ datvā prāṇasthāpanapūrvakaṃ |
virodhinīṃ japet tatra karavīraissamarcayet ||

dugdhena puttaliṃ kṛtvā tāpayet vadirānale |
anena kramayogenadināni ca caturdaśa ||

yaḥ karoti naraḥ śreṣṭhaḥ sarvākarṣaṇakārakaḥ |
vanittāṃmadanarbhāḍhyāṃ samākarṣati yogataḥ ||

vicāryākarṣaṇaṃ kāryaṃ bhavedvāna bhaviṣyati |
dhyātvā mādhyagale pāśaṃ mastake tvaritāṃkuśaṃ ||

evaṃ saṃciṃtya deveśi trailokyākarṣako bhavet |
rahasyamapi te devi tava prītyā nigadyate ||

vipracittādi duṣṭānāṃ vadhārthaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtā |
vipracitteti vikhyātā vai pravitta vināśinī ||

ṣaṣṭhī nityā mahāvidyātanmaṃtraṃ śṛṇu pārvatī |
praṇavaṃ kamalākāmaṃ cāmuṇḍārāvamuccaret ||

vipracittepadaṃ procya duṣṭaghātini coccaret |
śatrūnnāśayacoccārya etaddināvadhi priye ||

siddhiṃ me dehi coccārya hūṁ phaṭ svāhāṃta go manuḥ |
catustriṃśadvarṇayuto vipracittāmanurmahān ||

īśvarosya ṛṣirdevī jagatī chaṃda īritaḥ |
vipracittā devatā hi cāmuṇḍā vījamīritaṃ ||

kamalāśaktirākhyātā kāmavījaṃ tu kīlakaṃ |
ṣaṭdīrghādyena kāmena ṣaḍaṃganyā samācaret ||

siṃhopari samārūḍhāṃ śavapaṃjaramadhyagaṃ |
caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ pīnonnatapayodharāṃ ||

digaṃvarāṃ muktakeśīṃ lalajihvāṃ bhayānakāṃ |
bhīmadaṃṣṭrāṃ karālāsyāṃ sṛkkiṇīṃ raktavāhinīṃ ||

khaḍgamuṇḍakapāla triśūlahastāṃ mahodarīṃ |
nīlotpalanibhāṃ śyāmāṃ bhaktānu grahakāriṇīṃ ||

daitya saṃhāraṇodyuktāṃ sādhakānāmabhītidāṃ |
evaṃ saṃciṃtya deveśīṃ vipracittāṃ śivapriyāṃ ||

<p. 162a>

lakṣamāṃtraṃ japenmaṃtraṃ daśāṃśaṃ kumudairhunet |
athāṣṭagaṃdhanīreṇa taddaśāṃśaṃ pratarpayet ||

mārjanaṃ taddaśāṃśena daśāṃśenābhiṣecanaṃ |
taddaśāṃśaṃ viṣabhojyaṃ vipracittāsu siddhaye ||

trikoṇavṛtta ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vṛttāṣṭadala bhūṣitaṃ |
vṛttabhūpurasaṃyuktaṃ viṃduvīja vibhūṣitaṃ ||

viṃdau yajedvipracittāṃ trikoṇe triguṇāṃ yajet |
ṣaṭkoṇe tu ṣaḍaṃgāni taddale mātṛbhairavau ||

bhūpure lokapālāṃśca tadastrāṇi ca tadvahiḥ |
tato nīrājanaṃ kṛtvā japaṃ devyai samarpayet ||

puraścaryā samāyuktaḥ prayogārho na cānyathā |
sākalyairjuhuyāddevi śāṃtikarmaṇī sādhakaḥ ||

mālatyā juhuyādvaśye ketakyā vāk vibhūtaye |
karavīrairvaśīkāraḥ kiṃśukaistaṃbhanaṃ bhavet ||

mohanaṃ coḍru puṣpeṇa dhuttūrairmāraṇaṃ diśet |
vṛhatpātu ripūccāṭogiri karśyāṃ dhanāgamaḥ ||

kāśapuṣpairipūccāṭo vidveṣe karṇikārajaiḥ |
nīvārairjuhuyāddevīdhānya siddhyarthameva hi ||

kalāpapuṣpairjuhuyāttulasyā sarvasaṃpadaḥ |
kausuṃbha kusumairdevī kāminī vāṃchitāṃ labhet ||

madhupuṣpaiśca juhuyādabhīṣṭasiddhaye dhruvaṃ |
dhotakyā juhuyāddevī dhanairdhana patirbhavet ||

yadrogebheṣajaṃ yacca tena tadroganāśanaṃ |
rahasyātirahasyaṃ ca tathāpi kathyate śṛṇu ||

praṇavaṃ ca vadhūvījaṃ hūṁ vījaṃ bhuvanāṃ tataḥ |
punaḥ pūrvaṃ tato hūṁ phaṭ ugrā saptākṣaro manuḥ ||

bhairavosya ṛṣiḥ prokto vṛhatī chaṃda īritam |
ugrā tu saptamī nityā devatā parikīrtitā ||

kūrcavījaṃ ca phaṭ śaktirvadhūlīlakamīritaṃ |
sarvābhīṣṭādi siddhyarthe viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

ṣaṭdīrghādyena vījena māyākhyena ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
tato dhyāyet parā mugrāṃ pratyālīḍha padasthitāṃ ||

caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ muṇḍamālā vibhūṣitāṃ |
digaṃvarāṃ karālāsyāṃ ghoradaṃṣṭrā bhayānakāṃ ||

<p. 162b>

śavotsaṃge krīḍamānāṃ śmaśānālayavāsinīṃ |
śyāmavarṇāṃ muktakeśīṃ khaḍgeṃdīvaradhāriṇīṃ ||

kapālakartṛkāṃ hastāṃ varadāna parāyaṇaṃ |
ugrāṃ dhyāyen mahāvidyāṃ lakṣayugmaṃ japaṃ caret ||

taddaśāṃśena juhuyāt kamalairghṛta saṃyutaiḥ |
taddaśāṃśaṃ tarpaṇaṃ ca taddaśāṃśena mārjanaṃ ||

viprabhojyaṃ daśāṃśena tenogrāsiddhidā dhruvaṃ |
parvate prāṃtareghore vipine taṭinī taṭe ||

ekaliṃge śmaśāne vā puraścaraṇavān bhavet |
athāsyāḥ pūjā yaṃtraṃ ca yathāvat kathyate śrṇu ||

trikoṇavṛttāṣṭadalaṃ vṛttaṃ bhūpurabhūṣitaṃ |
dalāṣṭaka vibhūṣāḍhyaṃ kiṃ vā vajravibhūṣitaṃ ||

trikoṇavṛtte vilikhet kūrcavījaṃ mahottamaṃ |
tārāṃ nīlāmekajaṭāṃ tattrikoṇaṃ prapūjayet ||

tato dalāṣṭake devi ugrā ghorāṣṭakaṃ yajet |
vairocanāṣṭakaṃ pūjya tathā padmāṃtakānyajet ||

lokapālān tadastrāṇi yathāvad vidhinā yajet |
tato nīrājanaṃ kṛtvā japaṃ devyai samarpya ca ||

śavāsane surapate sthitvā ca sarvadā japet |
siṃdūratilako nityaṃ saṃvidāsavacūrṇitaḥ ||

muktakeśo diśāvāso bhaktiyukto jiteṃdriyaḥ |
mahācīna drumalatāṃ saṃpādya parameśvarī ||

trikoṇaṃ caiva saṃvīkṣya sadā tadgatamānasaḥ |
lakṣamātraṃ japenmaṃtra mugrāsiddhyati niścitaṃ ||

anyat sarvatu tārāvat kīrtitaṃ jagadīśvarī |
nyāsa pūjādikaṃ dhyānaṃ puraścaryā vidhānakaṃ ||

mahogratārāvadjñeyaṃ kiṃ bhūyaḥ śrotumicchasi |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya śivavījaṃ samuddharet ||

vahnyārūḍhaṃ nādaviṃdu ṣaṣṭhaḥ svaravibhūṣitaṃ |
vījadvayaṃ samuccārya ugraprabhe svarūpakaṃ ||

devī kālī mahādevī svarūpaṃ darśayeti ca |
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā samāyuktaṃ prokta mugraprabhā manuḥ ||

paṃcaviṃśati tatvādyaḥ proktaścogra prabhā manuḥ |
mahākālo ṛṣiḥ prokta striṣṭupchaṃdaḥ prakīrtitaṃ ||

ugra prabhā mahākālī devatā parikīrtitā |
raṃ vījaṃ oṃ tathā śaktiḥ phaṭ kīlakaṃ udāhṛtaṃ ||

<p. 163a>

kālikā darśanādyarthe viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
ugra prabhākhyā vījena ṣaḍdīrgheṇa ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ ||

dhyāyed ugraprabhāṃ divyāṃ divyanīlotpalaprabhāṃ |
caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ śavapadmo paristhitāṃ ||

digaṃvarāṃ muktakeśīṃ pītonna tapayodharāṃ |
suprasannamukhāṃ bhojāśavomāṃsa prabhojanīṃ ||

śavānāṃkara saṃghātaiḥ kṛtakāṃcī hasanmukhīṃ |
khaḍgamuṇḍadharāṃ vāme dakṣe kharparakartṛke ||

vibhratī paramānaṃda jananīṃ kālavaṃcinīṃ |
evaṃ dhyātvā mahāvidyāṃ lakṣayugmaṃ japecchive ||

kālikokte yajetpīṭhe trikoṇadvayakojvale |
vṛttāṣṭadalabhūṣāḍhye bhūpuredvayabhūṣite ||

ugraprabhā viṃdumadhye kālītārāṃ ca rocanīṃ |
prathame prayajeddevī dvitīyetāriṇīgaṇaḥ ||

tārāmekajaṭhāṃ nīlāṃ tu dvitīye trikoṇake |
dalāṣṭake mātṛkāṣṭhau dalāgre bhairavāṣṭakaṃ ||

būpure lokapālāṃśca tadastrāṇi ca tadvahiḥ |
tristriḥ pūjā prakartavyā sarveṣāmapi deśikaiḥ ||

evamugra prabhāmiṣṭvā lakṣayugmaṃ japaṃ caret |
daśāṃśaṃ vajrapuṣpāṇi maireyāktāni homayet ||

tarpayet taddaśāṃśena dugdhena madhunātha vā |
dadhnācekṣu rasenāpi pīṭhato yena vā punaḥ ||

taddaśāṃśaṃ mārjanaṃ ca daśāṃśaṃ viprabhojanaṃ |
kumārīṃ pūjayet paścāchaktiṃ cāpi prapūjayet ||

ugra prabhāṃ patākāyāṃ mūrti kṛtvā vidhārayet |
raṇe devān surāṃ jitvā trailokya vijayī bhavet ||

duṃdubhau phalake khaḍge japtvā cogra prabhāṃ śivāṃ |
sarvasiddhiṃ samāsādya kālīrupo naro bhavet ||

mālinīmaṇḍalaṃ dṛṣṭvā japedugra prabhā manuṃ |
kālikā siddhidā bhūyānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

yoni svareta sā liptvā japedugra prabhāṃ parāṃ |
tatra saṃciṃtya deveśi sādhakaḥ kiṃnna sādhayet ||

<p. 163b>

ugra prabhābhyāṃ kālīṃ tu kṛtvā māsaṃ japecchive |
māsamātra prayogena kālikā varadā bhavet ||

sarvataṃtreṣu saṃguptā dīptā nityā mahodayā |
navamī saṃkhyakā nityā nityā sārā mahodayā ||

tasyā maṃtraṃ pravakṣyāmi yathāvadavadhāraya |
praṇavaṃ kālikā vījaṃ kaulinī meva ca ||

kūrcavījaṃ samuddhṛtya dīptāyai tadanaṃtaraṃ |
sarvamaṃtraphalaṃ cocyadāyai śabdaṃ samuccaret ||

hūṁ phaṭ svāhāṃtako maṃtrastūna viṃśākṣaraḥ paraḥ |
arddhasaṃkhyā vihīnena vīti saṃkhyaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

mahādevo ṛṣiścāsya uṣṇik chaṃdaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
dīptākhyā navamī nityā devatāḥ parikīrtitā ||

kālīvījaṃ vījamasyāḥ kaulinī śaktireva hi |
svāhā kīlakamityuktaṃ kālyarthe viniyogatā ||

kālyāḥ ṣaṭdīrghayuktena ṣaḍaṃganyā samācaret |
dhyāyeddīptāṃ mahānīla maṇiprakhyāṃ mahodarīṃ ||

caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ |
digaṃvarāṃ muktakeśīṃ ghoradaṃṣṭrāṃ karālikāṃ ||

śavapadme samāsīnāṃ pīnonnata payodharāṃ |
śavāsthi kṛta keyūraśaṃkhakaṃkaṇa bhūṣitāṃ ||

lelihānāṃ śavaṃ kvāpi prahasaṃtīṃ madāturāṃ |
bhaktānāṃ varadā nityāṃ kālikā dhyānakāriṇīṃ ||

na rātraṃ yogapaṭṭena bhūṣitāṃ yogamārgaṇāṃ |
khaḍgamuṇḍadharāṃ vāme savye'bhaya varapradāṃ ||

su daṃturāṃ mahāraudrī śmaśāna layavāsinīṃ |
evaṃ saṃciṃtya dīptābhāṃ lakṣamekaṃ japecchive ||

daśāṃśaṃ nārikereṇa havanaṃ samupācaret |
kadalyā havanaṃ kāryaṃ sarvadīpti prasiddhaye ||

daśāṃśaṃ pīṭhato yena havanaṃ samupācaret |
taddaśāṃśaṃ mārjanaṃ ca gaṃdhāṣṭaka jalena vai ||

taddaśāṃśaṃ viprabhojyaṃ bhojayeddhi kumārikāṃ |
tataḥ siddhamanurmaṃtrī prayogārhona cānyathā ||

<p. 164a>

brāhme muhūrte cotthāya gurusmaraṇa pūrvakaṃ |
guruṃ dhyātvā sahasrāre pūrvokta dhyānayogataḥ ||

mulādhārāt svajihvātāṃ mūlavidyāṃ parāṃ smaret |
sarasvatīṃ dīparūpāṃ mūlavījasvarūpiṇīṃ ||

saṃpūrṇā mātṛkāṃ procya mūlavidyāṃ samuccarat |
punarvai mātṛkāṃ procya punarvidyāṃ samuccaret ||

tridhābhi maṃtrato yastu krameṇānena suṃdari |
mūlavidyāṃ tato dhyātvā jihvāyā dīparūpiṇī ||

tejorūpī sāyudhāṃ vai tajjalaṃ pivecchive |
yogenānena deveśi trikālajñā naro bhavet ||

vināyāsairvinābhyāsairvinā pāṭhādinā priye |
caturvidhaṃ tu pāṇḍitya tasya haste vyavasthitāṃ ||

jātī puṣpeṇa deveśi kavitā vaśavartinī |
kaṃdapuṣpeṇa deveśi sarvaśāstravaśī kṛtiḥ ||

durvayā śāṃtike homeḥ guḍūcyā mṛtyuvāraṇe |
surayā mohanaṃ proktaṃ raṃbhāstaṃbhanamīritaṃ ||

āmreṇa vaśyasiddhiḥ syāddhuttūreṇa mahodayaḥ |
uccāṭana karavīreṇa vidveṣaḥ karkaṭī phalaiḥ ||

smaraṇaṃ nīlapuṣpeṇa marīcena tu karṣaṇaṃ |
evamādi kriyāḥ sarvāsiddhamaṃtrī samācaret ||

aṃjanaṃ guṭhikāṃ khaḍgadhātuvādaṃ rasāyanaṃ |
carukaṃ tilakaṃ vā sā duṃdubhiśca kapākalaṃ ||

evamāddhi kriyā siddhidīptā maṃtreṇa vai bhavet |
maṃtroddhāraṃ śṛṇu prājñe yena siddhiṃ sa viṃdati ||

kūrcayugmaṃ mahādevi kālī vījadvayaṃ tathā |
māyā dvayaṃ samuddhṛtya hasakalarī svarūpakaṃ ||

atha nīlapatāke ca hūṁ phaḍaṃtā maheśvarī |
nīlānīlapatāke ca sarvasiddhīkarī parā ||

ugracaṃḍāla lajjidvāyā sā siddhakarālikā |
paṃcadhā kathitā nīlā mahānīlapatākikā ||

bhairavosya ṛṣiḥ prokto vṛhatī chaṃda īritaṃ |
kūrcavīja svarūpaṃ hi śaktirityabhidhīyate ||

<p. 164b>

hūṁ phaṭ ca kīlakaṃ bhadre kālyārthe viniyogatā |
kālī ṣaṭdīrghavījena ṣaḍaṃganyā samācaret ||

atha dhyāyen mahānīlāṃ nīlāṃjanagiri prabhāṃ |
caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ muṃḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ ||

śavopari samāsīnāṃ medirāghūrṇalocanāṃ |
mṛgaṇāvaka netrāṃ ca prasannavadanāṃvujāṃ ||

karakāṃcī śobhanānāṃ śavakarṇāvataṃsinīṃ |
lalajihvāṃ karālāsyāṃ ghoradaṃṣṭrāṃ bhayānakāṃ ||

pāpināṃ sarvadā nīlā krūrā puṇyavatāṃvarāṃ |
duṣṭasaṃharaṇodyuktāṃ sādhakasya varapradāṃ ||

pheruvargairgṛdhra gaṇaiścaturdikṣunināditāṃ |
īdṛśīmādi rūpāṃ tāṃ nīlāṃbhoja varapradāṃ ||

japellayaṃ devi haviṣyāśī jiteṃdriyaḥ |
kulācāra krameṇaiva yathokta kramayogataḥ ||

karavīrairjavā vilvairmallikādyairghṛtānvitaiḥ |
trikoṇakuṇḍe juhuyāt supariskṛta bhūtale ||

daśāṃśaṃ tarpaṇī kāryaṃ dugdhena surayāpi ca |
mārjayedraktanīraiśca brāhmaṇān bhojayet tataḥ ||

suvāsinīṃ kumārīṃ ca śaktiṃ vā tritayāṃ śubhāṃ |
puraścaraṇa saṃpanno maṃtraḥ sarvārthadāyakaḥ ||

yathādravyaṃ nṛpādīnīṃ puraścaryā tu maṃtriṇāṃ |
puraścaraṇa saṃpannaḥ prayogārho navānyathā ||

yaṃtramasyāḥ pravakṣyāmi yena siddhīśvaro bhavet |
viṃdumadhye likhet kūrcaṃ trikoṇaṃ ca tatopari ||

vṛttaṃ ṣaṭkoṇa vṛttāṣṭadalavṛttaṃ ca bhūpuraṃ |
caturdvāropa śobhāḍhyaṃ yaṃtraṃ nīlāmanoḥ śubhaṃ ||

vaṭukādyāścaturdvāri pareṣu dvāradevatāḥ |
tadastrāṇi ca tadvāhye daleṣṭo bhairavān priye ||

keśare mātṛkāṣṭau ca vṛtteṣṭha siddhayaḥ kramāt |
ṣaṭkoṇe tu ṣaḍaṃgāni trikoṇadevatā trayaṃ ||

kālarātrirmahārātrirmoharātriḥ kramāttrike |
madhye nīlāṃ samārādhya tato naivedya tarpayet ||

nīrājanaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā stutvā natvā visṛjya ca |
nīlāṃ saṃsādhya yatnena ṣaṭtriṃṣadyakṣaṇīgaṇaṃ ||

yadyadā jñāpayet sādhyaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśadyakṣiṇī gaṇaṃ |
kālīkūrca vadhūmāyā amuka yakṣiṇī madhyataḥ ||

<p. 165a>

aṃte imāni vījāni hūṁ phaṭ svāhānvitāṃgaṇaḥ |
ṣaṭtriṃśaccaiva yakṣiṇyaḥ krameṇa coddhṛtāḥ priye ||

tathaiva valino yakṣa spheṁ krīṁ hūṁ hrīṁ puṭena ca |
sarvayakṣā hūṁ phaḍaṃtā caturāśiti kīrtitāḥ ||

yakṣiṇī siddhimāsādya sādhakaḥ sukhamāpnuyāt |
rājā bhavati lokesmin vonārājyena pārvatī ||

alpajñamapi vidvāṃsaṃ mūrkhaṃ ca paṇḍitaṃ tathā |
yaḥ karotyevamādīnidīvārāṇāṃ śatānyapi ||

yo vai dadāti sādhyāya yakṣiṇī nātra saṃśayaḥ |
devayonirmānavī ca dvidhā yoniḥ prakīrtitā ||

tat tadrūpaṃ samāsādya tatsiddhimadhigacchati |
phalaṃ tu yakṣiṇī siddheryakṣa siddheśca kiṃ phalaṃ ||

tanme vadayā pāraparāpara namostute |
dīnāraṃguṭikāṃ khaḍgaṃ vetālaṃ pādukāṃjane ||

rasaṃ rasāyanaṃ guptistilako'dṛśyatā tathā |
kapālaṃ ca paṭhaḥ śaṃkhastriśūlaṃḍamaruṃ tathā ||

ākarṣaṇaṃ vaśyatā ca mohanoccāṭanaṃ tathā |
māhendra jālamiṃdrādi jālānāṃ racanā tathā ||

ūrddhvot kramaṇakarmādi khecaryādyā hi siddhayaḥ |
gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ kimanyacchrotumicchati ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi ghanā nityā kramārcanaṃ |
udyadghanaghanākārāghanā nityā mahodayā ||

ghanālayā ghoṣavatī ghaṭikodaya rūpiṇī |
tasyā maṃtrārcanaṃ nityaṃ ca datvaṃ karuṇānidhe ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya kālikādvyakṣaraṃ tathā |
ghanālaye ghanāghane hrīṁ hūṁ manurmataḥ ||

bhuvanākṣaroghanāyāstu maṃtroyaṃ surapādapaḥ |
aghorabhairava ṛṣirvirāṭ chaṃdaḥ prakīrtitam ||

kālīṃ vījaṃ tathā māyā śaktiṃ hūṁ phaṭ ca kīlakaṃ |
kālikā prītaye devī viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

ṣaṭdīrghabhājā vījena karpūreṇa ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
ghanāṃ nityāṃ mahāvidyāṃ nīlajīmūta sannibhāṃ ||

mattakokila netrābhāṃ pakva jaṃvu phalaprabhāṃ |
sudīrgha prapadālaṃ vimukta laṃvakacoccayāṃ ||

caturbhujāṃ trinayanīṃ digaṃvara vinodinīṃ |
karālāsyāṃ ghoradaṃṣṭrāṃ pīnonnata payodharāṃ ||

oṣṭhaprāṃtadvāladraktadhārā visphuritānanāṃ |
vīrāṇāṃ karakāṃcyāṃ tu bhūṣitāṃ bhīmavigrahāṃ ||

<p. 165b>

khaḍgakheṭakapaṭṭīśamudgarān vibhratīṃ kramāt |
dhyātavyā sa tataṃ vīrairmahāvīraghanālayāṃ ||

lakṣamātraṃ japenmaṃtraṃ yathoktaiḥ kamalairhunet |
taddaśāṃśaṃ tarpaṇaṃ tu gaṃdhādugdhādibhiḥ priye ||

taddaśāṃśaṃ mārjanaṃ tu śītalena jalena ca |
taddaśāṃśaṃ brāhmaṇānāṃ bhojanaṃ samupācaret ||

evaṃ kriyā samāyukto maṃtra siddhiṃ sa viṃdati |
ghanā yaṃtraṃ pravakṣyāmi pūjanaṃ yādṛśaṃ bhavet ||

ṣaṭkoṇa vṛttāṣṭadalaṃ bhūpureṇopaśobhitaṃ |
ṣaṭkoṇe tu ṣaḍaṃgāni (**) (?) tu devatā api ||

dalāṣṭake mātṛkāṣṭau tato bhairava pūjanaṃ |
lokapālā bhūpureṣu tadastrāṇi ca tadvahiḥ ||

yathāśakti japitvā tu tato nīrājayedamuṃ |
nīrājanāṃtaṃ deveśi stutvā natvā visṛjya ca ||

deveśi śṛṇu vakṣyāmi valākāpūjanaṃ kramaṃ |
valākā dvādaśā nityā sarvanityā vaśaṃkarī ||

yajñānān sa kalā vidyāḥ svasvasthāna padaṃ gatā |
tasyā maṃtro maheśāni kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ||

praṇavaṃ kālikā vījaṃ kūrcamāye samuddharet |
valākā kāliśabdāṃte atyadbhuta parākrame ||

abhīṣṭasiddhiṃ me dehi hūṁ phaṭ svāhā manurmataḥ |
kālikāsyā bhavedvījaṃ kūrcaṃ śaktiḥ prakīrtitā ||

māyākīlakamuddiṣṭaṃ kīlakena ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
ṣaḍaṃganyāsamāsādya dhyānaṃ kuryān maheśvarī ||

aṃjanānaṃta sadṛśīṃ koṭi kālānala prabhāṃ |
caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ muṇḍa durganivāsinīṃ ||

digaṃvarīṃ karālāsyāṃ pīnonnata payodharāṃ |
śavānāṃ karasaṃhatyā kṛtakāṃcī śavāsanāṃ ||

muktakeśīṃ mahāghūrṇāṃ prasannamukha paṃkajāṃ |
sūryakoṭi samābhāsāṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ ||

khaḍgamuṇḍadharāṃ vāme savye karparatarjanīṃ |
saṃvibhratīṃ mahākālīṃ valākārūpadhāriṇī ||

śmaśānanirayāṃ bhīmāṃ bhūtapreta samanvitāṃ |
śivābhirghorarāvābhirveṣṭitā ghoranādinīṃ ||

<p. 166a>

mābhairvīravaraṃ vrūhi hṛdgataṃte karomyahaṃ |
evaṃ dhyātvā japellakṣaṃ maṃtrasiddho bhaveddhruvaṃ ||

daśāṃśaṃ vilvapatraiśca ghṛtāktairjuhuyātsudhīḥ |
tarpaṇaṃ taddaśāṃśena taddaśāṃśena mārjayet ||

taddaśāṃśaṃ brāhmaṇānāṃ bhojanaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
viprārādhanamātreṇa sarvāṃgaṃ pūrṇatāmiyāt ||

yadyadaṃgavihīnaṃ ca tatsāṃge dvijabhojanaṃ |
anyat sarvaṃ maheśāni kālikāvat samācaret ||

mātrā nityā tu yā proktā sarvanityottamottamā |
tasyā maṃtraṃ maheśāni yathā vadavadhāraya ||

praṇavaṃ kālikāvījaṃ māyā kūrcaṃ ca mātṛkā |
sa viṃduṃ mātṛkāvarṇaṃ caturvījāni vai punaḥ ||

punaśca mātṛkāvarṇaṃ caturvījaṃ punaśca tat |
evaṃ kṣāṃtāṃ maheśāni mahāmātrā prakīrtitā ||

caturvījaṃ tathā mātre siddhiṃ me dehi satvaraṃ |
hūṁ phaṭ svāheti deveśi mātrāmaṃtro paromataḥ ||

praṇavaṃ kālikāvījaṃ kūrcamāye tataḥ śiva |
madhye nityānāma dadyāt saṃvuddhyaṃtā ca kevalā ||

nityā maṃtrāśca jāyaṃte bhinnarūpāśca pārvatī |
punarvījāni hūṁ phaṭ ca svāhāṃtāḥ parikīrtitā ||

ādyāyogāt saṃpuṭādvā hūṁ phaḍaṃtaḥ prayogataḥ |
evaṃ navati nityānāṃ maṃtrabhedā bhavaṃti hi ||

bhairavosya ṛṣiḥ prokto uṣṇik chaṃdaḥ prakīrtitam |
mātrā devīti vikhyātā devatā parikīrtitā ||

krīṁ vījaṃ hūṁ tathā śaktiḥ hrīṁ kīlakamudāhṛtaṃ |
viniyogo maheṣṭārthe kālikārthe prakīrtitaḥ ||

māyā ṣaṭdīrgha yuktena ṣaḍaṃganyā samācaret |
tathā dhyāyen mahāvidyāṃ nīlāṃjanagiri prabhāṃ ||

caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ muṇḍapadmoparisthitāṃ |
kapālakartṛkāṃ hastāṃ khaḍgamuṇḍadharāṃ parāṃ ||

daṃturāṃ ca mahāraudrīṃ caṇḍanādāti bhīṣaṇāṃ |
śavavakṣaḥ samārūḍhāṃ lelihānāṃ śavāsanāṃ ||

evaṃ vidhātāṃ śrīmātrāṃ mahāghora ninādinīṃ |
iti saṃciṃtya deveśi lakṣamātraṃ japaṃ caret ||

daśāṃśaṃ juhuyād vilvairatha vā kadalīphalaiḥ |
drākṣābhirpāyasairvāpi daśāṃśaṃ havanaṃ caret ||

tarpaṇaṃ mārjanaṃ vipra bhojyaṃ yatnena kārayet |
yadyadaṃga vihīteta tat saṃkhyā dviguṇo japaḥ ||

<p. 166b>

japa pūjā prayogādi kālīvallipi mātṛvat |
rahasyamapi te devi kathyate śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ||

mudrā nityā vidhānaṃ ca sarvaṃ sārottamottamaṃ |
mudriṇīnāmakā nityā śrīvidyāyāṃ tu mudriṇī ||

mudriṇī daṃḍinī nāmnī devī maudārya vigrahāṃ |
mahāvidyādikādīnāṃ manormudreṇa kāriṇī ||

teneyaṃ mudrā nityākhyā sarvasiddhiḥ parāṃvikā |
praṇavaṃ kālikāvījaṃ mayā kūrcakrameṇa ca ||

proktaṃ vījayugaṃ procya mudrāṃ vā padamuddharet |
mudrāṃ siddhiṃ me dehi bhojapaṃ mudrā svarūpiṇī ||

hūṁ phaṭ svāhā samāyukto vīti vaśomanuḥ śubhaḥ |
mahādevo ṛṣiścāsya gāyatrī chaṃda īritaḥ ||

mudrā nityā mahādevī devatā parikīrtitā |
kālīvījaṃ vījanasyā māyāśaktiḥ prakīrtitā ||

kūrcaṃ kīlakamityuktaṃ kālyāḥ ṣaḍdīrghayuktayā |
ṣaḍaṃganyā samācarya mātrāṃ dhyāyen maheśvarī ||

aṃjanādri nibhāṃ mudrāṃ muṇḍamālā vibhūṣitāṃ |
digaṃvarāṃ ghoradaṃṣṭrāṃ caṇḍanādāti bhīṣaṇāṃ ||

dakṣiṇāṃ muktakeśālīṃ digaṃvara vinodinīṃ |
piṃgākṣīṃ prajvala jihvāṃ ghoradaṃṣṭrāṃ bhayānakāṃ ||

śavānāṃ karasaṃghātaiḥ kṛtakāṃci hasanmukhīṃ |
sṛkkadvayagaladraktā dhārā visphuritānanāṃ ||

kapāla kartṛkāṃ hastāṃ khaḍgakheṭakadhāriṇīṃ |
mahākālena ca samaṃ rattāsaktāṃ kṣudhāturā ||

varaṃ vrūhi varaṃ vrūhi varaṃ vrūhīti vā pradan |
evaṃ saṃciṃtya deveśi pūjayed yaṃtra mādarāt ||

trikoṇavṛtta ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vṛttāṣṭadalabhūpuraṃ |
caturdvāropaśobhāḍhyāṃ tadvāri gaṇapastathā ||

yoginī kṣetrapālaśca vaṭuko hi caturthakaḥ |
lokapālāstra lokeśo bhūpure kramaṇo yajet ||

daleṣṭa mātṛkāṃ pūjya keśare bhairavāṣṭakaṃ |
dalāṣṭāgretvaṣṭasiddhiḥ ṣaṭkoṇeṣu ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ ||

rājyadāṃ bhogadāṃ mokṣajayadāṃ bhayadā tathā |
ṣaṣṭhī tu siddhidāṃ proktvā ṣaṭkoṇeṣu kramād yajet ||

icchāṃ jñānāṃ kriyāṃ caiva trikoṇe paripūjayet |
madhye mudrāṃ ca saṃpūjya sarvapaṃcopahārakaiḥ ||

iti pūjāṃ samāsādya tato nīrājanaṃ caret |
nīrājanāṃte deveśi prāṇāyāma puraḥsaraṃ ||

<p. 167a> 

rakṣa dvayaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ suśvetaiḥ karavīrajaiḥ |
daśāṃśaṃ havanaṃ kṛtvā taddaśāṃśaṃ ca tarpaṇaṃ ||

mārjanaṃ brāhmaṇānāṃ ca bhojanaṃ samupācaret |
evaṃ siddhirmanurmaṃtrī prayogārhona cānyathā ||

yadyaddhṛdi samādhatte tat tat kṛtyaṃ karoti hi |
sarvaṃ tu kālivat proktaṃ viśeṣaḥ kathitā mayā ||

iti saṃkṣepataḥ proktaṃ kimanyacchrotumicchasi ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

deveśi śrotumicchāmimitā nityā vidhikramaṃ |
sarvavidyā varārohe mitāṃ me vrūhi sādaraṃ ||

śrīśiva uvāca ||

śṛṇu vaṣyāmi deveśi rahasyātirahasyakaṃ |
sarvavidyā mahārājñīmitā nāmnī mahodayā ||

tasyā maṃtraṃ pravakṣyāmi kālī sarvāṃgamadbhutaṃ |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya kālikāvīja muddharet ||

kūrcavījaṃ tathā māyāṃ vāgbhavaṃ vījamuddharet |
mite padaṃ samuccārya tathā parimite padaṃ ||

parākramāya ca padaṃ punarvījāni coddharet |
sohaṃ hūṁ phaṭ tathā svāhā saptaviṃśati varṇakān ||

maṃtroyaṃ kathito devi ṛṣi chaṃdādikaṃ śṛṇu |
mahākālo ṛṣiścāsya triṣṭupchaṃdaḥ prakīrtitaṃ ||

mitānityā devatā ca kālikā vījamīritaṃ |
kūrcaṃ śaktiṃ maheśāni māyākīlakamīritaṃ ||

kīlakena ṣaḍaṃgāni ṣaṭdīrghādyena kārayet |
dhyāyen nīlādri saṃkāśānnīlajīmūta sannibhāṃ ||

raktāvastrāṃ śavāsīnāṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ |
pīnonna tapayodvaṃdvāṃ pīnavakṣa nitaṃvinīṃ ||

dakṣiṇāṃ muktakeśānīṃ digaṃvara vinodinīṃ |
mahādeva hṛdaṃ bhojamadhyasthāṃ śaṃkhakaṃkaṇāṃ ||

koṭikālānala prakhyāṃ śmaśānālayavāsinīṃ |
khaḍgamuṇḍadharāṃ vāme savye bhayavarapradāṃ ||

sādhakākāṃkṣa hṛdayāṃ sādhakasya varapradāṃ |
mukhasāṃdra sthitā modamodinīmada vihvalāṃ ||

ārakta mukhasāṃdrābhirnetrādibhirvirājitāṃ |
dakṣiṇāṃ saṃmitāṃ divyāṃ dīnanāthāṃ vibhāvayet ||

evaṃ dhyātvāmitāṃ devi lakṣatrayaṃ japaṃ caret |
kiṃśukairhavanaṃ kāryaṃ jyotiṣmatyāthavā priye ||

jyotiṣmatī prasūnena phalaṃ kiṃśukavanmataṃ |
ārakta karavīreṇa juhuyān maṃtrasiddhaye ||

<p. 167b>

trikoṇa kuṇḍe juhuyāt saṃskṛte khādi vā nale |
tāṃvūlapatra homena kālikā vaśamānayet ||

puṣpāktanāgavalyāṃ ca nāginī siddhimāpnuyāt |
vajrapuṣpeṇa juhuyāt ḍākinyā vā maheśvarī ||

dhumūreṇārinidhanaṃ kuṃdaiśca kavitāṃ layet |
jātipuṣpairjayāvāptistilapuṣpairvalonnatiḥ ||

punnāgaiḥ puruṣārthāya ketakyā kāminī labhet |
āsūryāripunāśaśca caṃdanena jayī sadā ||

tathaivā guruṇā devi rājarājapadaṃ lahbet |
raktacaṃdana homena sarvamohanamācaret ||

girikarnyākanyakāptiḥ sevaṃtyā śivarūpatāḥ |
puḍūcyā ripunāśaśca marīcinā kṛṣṭiruttamā ||

pūgīphalairmahābhāgyaṃ tathā jātīphalairdhenaṃ |
staṃbhanaṃ caṃpakenaiva jaṃghājanmārtināśanaṃ ||

evaṃ nānāvidhānena kāmamuddiśya sādhakaḥ |
tato homaṃ daśāṃśena tarpaṇaṃ pīṭharīrataḥ ||

aṣṭagaṃdhodakenāpi tathā keśaranīrataḥ |
tarpaṇaṃ taddaśāṃśena mārjanaṃ samupācaret ||

taddaśāṃśaṃ viprabhojyaṃ śaktayaśca kumārikā |
pūjayedbhojayeddevi sarvasiddhiṃ sa viṃdati ||

atha pūjāvidhānena yaṃtraṃ saṃ kathyate śṛṇu |
trikoṇa tritayaṃ likhya vṛttaḥ ṣaṭkoṇa saṃyutaṃ ||

vṛttāṣṭadala bhūṣāḍhyaṃ bhūpureṇa samanvitaṃ |
caturdvāropa śobhāḍhyaṃ madhye viṃdu vibhūṣitaṃ ||

kālīṃ karālāṃ śrīghorāṃ prathame tu trikoṇake |
dvitīye tu trikoṇe tu vāme jyeṣṭhāṃ ca raudrikāṃ ||

tṛtīye tu trikoṇe tu icchā jñānāṃ kriyā tathā |
atha vṛtte yajeddeviṃ vārtālīṃ prathamaṃ yajet ||

dvitīyabhāge deveśi laghuvārāhikāṃ yajet |
tṛtīyabhāge deveśi svapnā vārāhikāṃ yajet ||

tiraskārāṇikāṃ pūjya caturthabhāgake śive |
ṣaṭkoṇe vṛttadeveśi caturdvāraṃ prapūjayet ||

ṣaṭkoṇe tu ṣaḍaṃgāni vṛtte siddhyaṣṭakaṃ tathā |
daleṣṭau mātṛkāḥ pūjyāstadaṃteṣṭau ca bhairavāḥ ||

bhūpure lokapālāṃśca tadastrāṇi ca tadvahiḥ |
evamiṣṭvāmitāṃ nityāṃ vidyāmitrāṃ niraṃjanīṃ ||

evamārādharo yukto maṃtrasiddhi labhennaraḥ ||

<p. 168a>

athavānya prakāreṇa dhyānanityā krame śṛṇu |
aṃjanādrinibhāḥ sarvāmuṇḍamālā vibhūṣaṇā ||

dakṣahaste devi khaḍgaṃ vāmahaste ca tarjanīṃ |
dhārayaṃtya śubhaḥ kālyovarābhayalasatkarā ||

etat sāmānyato dhyānaṃ nāmamaṃtravidhau smṛtaṃ |
rahasyamaṃtrakathitaṃ siddhayorvividhākara ||

aṃjanaṃ guṭikāṃ khaḍgaṃ vetālaṃ yakṣiṇīgaṇaṃ |
carukaṃ tilakaṃ vāsaḥ kapālaṃ pādukāṃ tathā ||

laguḍaḥ kinnarī siddhījāmiryādi mahākalā |
carācaragatiścaiva aṇutvaṃ laghimādikaṃ ||

parakāya praveśaśca sarvaṃ rasarasāyanaṃ |
sparśa ciṃtāpahāraśca bhūtasaṃcaraṇaṃ tathā ||

mṛtakotthāpanaṃ divyaḥ siddhayastatkare sthitā |
mahāpīṭhaṃ samuddhṛtya nityāsthāpyā yathā kramaṃ ||

athavā mūlamaṃtreṇa japanmadhye svadevatāḥ |
yathokta maṃtrasiddhyarthaṃ dhyāyecca kulavastubhiḥ ||

yajet saṃtarpayecchaktirbhojanācchādanādibhiḥ |
dhūpayed daśagaṃdhena devatāvatarettadā ||

raktākṣīstaccanetrāṃgī prasannamukhapaṃkajā |
kācidekā bhavecchaktiritarāstanmukhasthitāḥ ||

tasmin kṣaṇe tu prakṛtiṃ kṛtvā māṣamayīṃ śubhāṃ |
ghṛtapakvā māṃsamayīmupayogān prakalpayet ||

grāse grāse surāṃ dadyān matsya kṣudhā kanakāni ca |
ādyaṃ vījaṃ samuccārya nitye krūramukhe tathā ||

krūradaṃṣṭre lalajihve mukhasteyaṃ prakalpitaṃ |
āhāro bhakṣayayugaṃ svāhāṃtaṃ ṭhadvayaṃ punaḥ ||

ādyaṃ vījaṃ samuccārya mṛtaṃ dhyāyed ripuṃ tathā |
tat kālameva harate mitāprāṇān sureśvari ||

śrūyate saumṛta iti tāvat saṃbhojayetmitāṃ |
paścāt paṃcāṃga dhūpena dhūpayettāṃ varapradāṃ ||

hāsaṃ kṛtvā varaṃ datvā vrajet sā śaktidehataḥ |
śmaśāne vātha saṃpūjyā vaḍavāgni samaprabhā ||

sa sainyarājño nāśāya nṛmāṃsaiḥ kulavastubhiḥ |
udyāneṣu vaśīkartu muccāṭe tu nadī taṭe ||

nātaḥ paratarā vidyā sadyaḥ pratyayakāriṇī |
vikhyātā nūtanāmnāye śatadhā pūjitāmayā ||

gopyādgopyatarāpyeṣāṃ mayā tubhyaṃ prakāśitā ||

<p. 168b>

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau mahākālādimitānityāṃtakarmanirṇayo nāma 
trayoviṃśatitama prakāśaḥ] || 23 ||

athogratāraikajaṭānīlasarasvatīnāmekatamakramamāha ||

ādau jalamadhiṣṭhāya pādayoḥ kṣālanaṃ mataṃ |
dvirācamya śikhāṃ vaddhā brahmagraṃthiṃ prakalpayet ||

arghyaṃ dvāri pariskṛtya dvāramabhyukṣyatajjalaiḥ |
gaṇeśaṃ vaṭukaṃ kṣetraṃ pālaṃ ca yoginīṃ tathā ||

pūjayitvā gṛhe gatvā brahmāṇa vāstvīśaṃ yajet |
praṇavādya namoṃtena nair(-)ṛtyāṃ sādhakottamaḥ ||

viśodhya vācaṃ cittaṃ ca bhūmiṃ samyak viśodhayet |
vighnānutsārayitvātu kuryādbhūmyabhi maṃtraṇaṃ ||

āsane maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā tatsamarcyāruhetsudhīḥ |
yaṃtraṃ likhitvādhiṣṭhāya puṣpaśodhanamācaret ||

mṛdvāsanaṃ samāsādya māyāṃ pūrvadale lihket ||

athaiṣāṃ krameṇa maṃtrāmāha ||

praṇavo vahnijāyāṃto manuraṃbha parigrahe ||

tāro vajrodake hūṁ phaṭ svāhā jalamadhiṣṭhitaṃ |
tāraṃ lajjā viśuddhāṃte sarve pāpāni caiva hi ||

samayāṃte aśeṣāṃte vikalpa padamuddharet |
apanayāṃte varma phaṭ svāhā pāda viśuddhayet ||

oṃ māyā vahnijāyā ca smṛta ācamane manuḥ |
praṇavaṃ maṇidharaṇīni vajriṇī sarvaśabdataḥ ||

vaśaṃkarīti hūṁ phaṭ svāheti vaṃdhayecchikhāṃ |
tāraṃ munipadaṃ caiva dharaṇyaṃte ca vajriṇī ||

mahāpratisare rakṣadvaṃdvāṃte māṃ tataśca hūṁ |
phaṭ svāhā manunānena rakṣāṃ graṃthiṃ ca kārayet ||

phaḍābhyukṣya hṛdāpūjyā tāreṇa daśamaṃtrayet |
phaṭkāraiḥ prokṣayeddhāraṃ gaṃdhapuṣpaiḥ prapūjayet ||

dvārorddhagāṃ gaṇeśaṃ ca vāme vāṃ vaṭukaṃ tathā |
daśamekṣāṃ kṣetrapālamadhoyāṃ yoginīṃ yajet ||

athaiṣāṃ maṃtre viśeṣaśca sarvāte dhruvadīrghāḍhyā ||

śaktivījapuraḥsaraḥ caturthyaṃtā namoṃtāścanāmādya vījasaṃyutāḥ ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ na vārṇena tataḥ kūrvīta sādhakaḥ ||

oṃ rakṣarakṣa hūṁ cāstraṃ svāhā maṃtro navākṣaraḥ |
trayodaśārṇa maṃtreṇa vighnānutsārayet tataḥ ||

oṃ dāraya dāraya hūṁ phaṭ svāhā vighnadāraṇaṃ ||

oṃ sarvavighnānutsāraya hūṁ phaṭ vahni gehinī |
trayodaśārṇakomaṃtraḥ pārṣṇighātena vighnahā ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya āḥkāraṃ tadanaṃtaram |
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā manuḥ proktaḥ kāyavāk cittaśodhane ||

tatastu devyāḥ pūjārthaṃ maṃtrayet kāśyapīṃ dhruvaṃ |
pavitra vajra me hūṁ svāhā maṃtro bhavākṣaraḥ ||

bhūmau trikoṇamālikhyādhāraśaktiḥ prapūjanaṃ |
māyāvījaṃ samuccārya ādhāraśaktaye tataḥ ||

<p. 169a>

kamalāsanamālikhya ṅenamoṃtaśca pūjayet |
āḥkārāṃte surekhe ca vajrarekhe tataḥ paraṃ ||

hūṁ phaṭ svāheti kuryāsu maṇḍalaṃ vai śavāsane |
tatra mṛdvāsanaṃ devi pīṭhamaṃtreṇa pūjayet ||

oṃ aiṃ klīṃ kāmapīṭhāya hṛdayāṃ toyamīritaṃ |
tatra vadhvāsanaṃ vīra ātmānaṃ śodhayet tataḥ ||

caturdaśārṇa manunā kusumāni suśodhayet |
yathā gatābhiṣeketi samāśrime padaṃ vadet ||

tārādi hūṁ phaṭ svāhāṃto manukto manuvarṇakaḥ |
śyāmāvada paraṃ jñeyaṃ puṣpaśodhanakaṃ vudhaḥ ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi bhūtaśuddhiṃ viśeṣataḥ |
hrīṁ vījaṃ tu javāpuṣpaṃ nibhaṃ nābhau viciṃtayet ||

tadutthenāgninā dehaṃ dahetsārddhaṃ svayāpmanā |
strīṃ vījaṃ tu suvarṇābhaṃ ciṃtayeddhṛdi maṃtravit ||

pavanena tadutthena pāpabhasma kṣipedbhuvi |
hūṁ vījamiṃdukaṃdābhaṃ bhāle dhyāyecca bhāvataḥ ||

taduttha sudhayā dehaṃ vacayeddevatānibhaṃ |
anayā bhūtaśuddhyā tu devī sādṛśyamāpnuyāt ||

athāsyā dhyānaṃ ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ vidhāyetthaṃ śūnyaṃ viśvaṃ viciṃtayet |
nirlepaṃ nirmalaṃ sūkṣmamātmānaṃ devatāmayaṃ ||

aṃtarīkṣe tato dhyāyedāḥkārād raktapaṃkajaṃ |
bhūyastasyopari dhyāyeddāṃ kārācchuklapaṃkajaṃ ||

tasyopari tato dhyāyet hūṁkāraṃ nīlasaṃnilaṃ |
tasyopari tato dhyāyet kartṛkāṃ vījabhūṣitāṃ ||

tasyopari mahādevīṃ kharvāṃnīla ghanaprabhāṃ |
laṃvodarīṃ vyāghracarma samāvṛta nitaṃvinīṃ ||

pīnonnata payobhārāṃ raktavartula locanaṃ |
piṃgākṣaika jaṭāṃ nīlanāga yajño vibhūṣitāṃ ||

kalotpalalasanmaulīvaddhajūṭāṃ bhayaṃkarīṃ |
śvetāsthipaṭṭikāyukta kapālaṃ paṃcaśobhitāṃ ||

lalāṭe raktanāgena kṛta karṇāvataṃsinīṃ |
atiśubhramahānāga kṛtahāra mahojjvalaṃ ||

dūrvādalaśyāmanāgakṛta yajñopavītinīṃ |
caturbhujāṃ raktamāṃsa khaṃḍamuṇitamuṣṭinā ||

jaṭājūṭena sūtreṇa śobhitāṃ tīkṣṇadhārayā |
khaḍgena dakṣiṇasyorddhaṃ śobhitāṃ vīranādinīṃ ||

tadadhastādvījarūpa kartṛkālaṃ kṛtāṃ parāṃ |
vāmārddhe raktanālenavika svaramanoharaṃ ||

<p. 169b>

dadhatīṃ nīlapadmaṃ ca tadadhastvāt kapālajaṃ |
jagatāṃ jāḍyasaṃyuktaṃ dadhatīṃ kuṇḍasannibhāṃ ||

dhūmrābha nāgasaṃdohakṛta keyūra sadbhujāṃ |
suvarṇa varṇanāgaṃ ca kaṃkaṇo jvalapāṇikāṃ ||

śubhravarṇa mahādeva śavahṛdi samāsanāṃ |
niryaṃtreṇābhiyā tadvat saṃkoca prapadāṃcalāṃ ||

śavapādahṛyārūḍha vāmapādāṃ hasanmukhīṃ |
kuṃdābhanāgasaṃśobhi kaṭisūtrāṃ trilocanāṃ ||

īṣadraktena nāgena kṛta nūpura pallavāṃ |
sadyaśchinnagaladrakta nṛmuṇḍairātmabhūṣaṇaiḥ ||

anyonya keśa grathitaiḥ pādapadma pralaṃvitaiḥ |
paṃcāśadbhirmahāmālā śobhitāṃ parameśvarīṃ ||

jvalaccitāṃ madhyagatāṃ dvīpi carmottarāṃśukāṃ |
lākṣābhanāgasaṃvaddha jaṭājūṭāṃ varapradāṃ ||

sāvaiśasmeravadanāṃ lalajihvāṃ varapradāṃ |
eva dhyātvā paṇḍitohaṃ bhāvayecca mahākaviḥ ||

atha dhyāna rahasyamāha ||

vaśyārthe nīlavarṇā bhāmā kṛṣṭau pītarūpiṇīṃ |
māraṇoccāṭane dhūmrī kṛṣṇā tu tadapekṣayā ||

ciṃtayet parameśānīṃ dhyātvā preta kṛtāsanāṃ ||

atha maṃtrā ca manamāhā ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ purā kṛtvā divyamācamanaṃ caret |
tārābhedaistribhiḥ pītvā māyayā kṣālayetkaraṃ ||

strīṁ hūṁ oṣṭaudvirunmṛjya phaṭkāraiḥ kṣālayet karaṃ |
āsyanāthe kṣaṇaśrotra nābhivakṣaḥ śiro bhujān ||

vairocanādibhiḥ spṛṣṭvā sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate |
ācamya bhairavo bhūtvāvatsarāttāṃ prapaśyati ||

atha bhūtaśuddheranaṃtaraṃ kramamāha ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ vidhāyetthamarghyādi sthāpanaṃ caret |
prāṇāyāmaṃ tataḥ kuryādṛṣyādinyā samācaret ||

nyāsaiḥ karāṃgayoḥ kuryādātmānaṃ tāriṇīṃ smaret ||

atha āsāmānyārghya sthāpanamāha ||

tataścā camanaṃ kṛtvā sāmānyārghyaṃ prakalpayet |
trikoṇavṛtta bhūviṃva maṇḍalaṃ racayet tataḥ ||

sādhāraśaktiṃ saṃpūjya tatrādhāraṃ viniḥkṣipet |
astreṇa pātraṃ saṃśodhya hṛnmaṃtreṇa prapūrayet ||

<p. 170a>

niḥkṣipettīrthamāvāhya gaṃdhādīn praṇavena ca |
darśayeddhenumudrāṃ vai sāmānyārghya vidhirmataḥ ||

nyāsaṃ pravartate devī ṣoḍhānyāsa puraḥsaraṃ ||

athāsyā mahāṣoḍhāmāha ||

tārā ṣoḍhāṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ |
sarvavighnopaśamanīṃ sarvapāpa vināśinīṃ ||

mahādāridryaśamanīṃ sarvasampratpradāyinīṃ |
sarvakāmapradāṃ nityāṃ sarvasāmrājyadāyinīṃ ||

śiṣyāya bhaktiyuktāya vinītāya mahātmane |
vadānyāya kulīnāya śuddhācāraratāya ca ||

evaṃ vidhāya deveśi sādhakāya praveśayet |
anyathā siddhihāniḥ syādātmājñā śaṃbhunā kṛtā ||

tathā ca ||

nyāsaṃ ṣaṭkaṃ tataḥ kuryāttārāyāḥ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
tatrādau prathamonyāsaḥ śrīkaṃṭhādiḥpuroditaḥ ||

mātṛkākṣaramuccārya hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ pūrvakaṃ vadet |
śrīkaṃṭhādi sapatnīkaṃ namoṃtaṃ mātṛkāsthale ||

vinyasecca caturthyaṃtaṃ nyāsoyaṃ prathamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
asminnyāse krīyamāṇe devīmevaṃ vidhāṃ smaret ||

śavapīṭhe samāsīnāṃ nīlakāṃtiṃ trilocanāṃ |
arddheṃdu śekharāṃ nānābhūṣaṇāḍhyāṃ caturbhujāṃ ||

dvitīyaṃ grahanyāsaṃ kuryāttāṃ sa manusmaret |
trivījapūrvakaścāyaṃ grahanyāsaḥ samīritaḥ ||

svarādikaṃ raviṃ raktaṃ hṛdiyavargapūrvakaṃ |
somaṃ śvetaṃ bhuvonyasyakavargādyaṃ ca maṃgalaṃ ||

raktaṃ netratrayanyasya ca vargādyaṃ ca vakṣyasi |
vudhaṃ śyāmaṃ nyaset pītaṃ ṭa vargādyaṃgale guruṃ ||

ta vargādyaṃ śvetavarṇaṃ ghaṭikāyāṃ tu bhārgavaṃ |
nīlavarṇaṃ pa vargādyaṃ nābhideśeśanaiśvaraṃ ||

śa vargādyaṃ dhūmravarṇaṃ dhyātvā rāhunyasenmukhe |
lakṣmyādyaṃ dhūmravarṇābhaṃkatuṃ nābhau punarnyaset ||

nyāsaṃ tṛtīyaṃ vakṣyāmi vīja tritayapūrvakaṃ |
samānavarṇānuccārya prāgiṃdrāya namostute ||

na sisaṃdhyakṣarāṇyuktvācāgneyyāmagnaye namaḥ |
dakṣiṇeyamāya namaḥ ka vargādyaṃ lalāṭake ||

ca vargādyaṃ ca nair(-)ṛtyāṃ nair(-)ṛtyāya namo mukhe |
ṭa vargādyaṃgale paścādvaruṇāya namastviti |

<p. 170b>

nyaseddhṛdi ta vargādyaṃ vāyavyāṃ vāyave namaḥ |
pa vargādyaṃ kuverāya namoṃtaṃ dakṣiṇe kare ||

vāmahaste ya vargādīśāṇa rudrāya hṛdbhavet |
śavargādyurddhakāmāya namo nābhau tu vinyaset ||

hūṁ rakṣādya pṛthivyai hṛdyādayoriti vinyaset |
śivaśaktyabhidhānyāsaścaturtha kathyatedhunā ||

hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ pūrvakaḥ kārya iṃdriyādya haraḥ paraṃ |
brahmāṇaṃ ḍākinīyuktaṃ vādisyaṃ tārṇapūrvakaṃ ||

mūlādhāra pravinyasyeccaturdala samanvitaṃ |
śrīviṣṇuṃśākinī yuktaṃ vādilāṃ tārṇapūrvakaṃ ||

svādhiṣṭānābhidhe vakre liṃgasthe ṣaṭdale nyaset |
rudraṃ tu lākinī yuktaṃ ḍādiphāṃtārṇapūrvakaṃ ||

cakre daśadalaṃ nyasyennābhisthe maṇipūrake |
īśvaraṃkādivātārṇa pūrvakaṃ kākinīyutaṃ ||

vinyased dvādaśadale hṛdayasthetvanāhate |
sadāśivaṃ śākinīṃ ca ṣoḍaśasvarapūrvakaṃ ||

kaṃṭhasthe ṣoḍaśadale viśuddhākhye pravinyaset |
ājñācakre paraśivaṃ hākinī saṃyutaṃ nyaset ||

hakṣārṇaṃ bhrūmadhye saṃsthiteti manoharaṃ |
vakṣyastha paṃcamanyāsaṃ samastāriṣṭanāśanaṃ ||

aṁ āṁ kavarga hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ tārāyai nama uccaret |
vinyased brahmaraṃdhretha iṁ īṁ cāpi ca vargakaṃ ||

hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ nama ugrāyai lalāṭe cāpi vinyaset |
uṁ ūṁ ca varga strīṁ hrīṁ hūṁ mahogrāyai namo vadet ||

vinnyasecca bhruvormadhye kaṇṭha ṛṁ ṝṁ ṭa vargakaṃ |
hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ cāpi vajrāyai namoṃtaṃ sa kaleṣvapi ||

ḷṁ ḹṁ ta varga hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ namaḥ kālyai hṛdinyaset |
eṁ aiṁ pa varga hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ sarasvatyai ca nābhigāṃ ||

oṃ auṃ śa varga hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ vāmuścarya ca liṃgake |
aṁ aḥ rakṣau ca hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ cāmuṇḍāyai namonyaset ||

mūlādhārenyasetyaścā sveṣṭenyāsaṃ samācaret |
ādhāre kāmarūpākṣaṃ vīja hrasvā na pūrvakaṃ ||

hṛdi jālaṃdharaṃ pīṭhaṃ dīrghapūrvaṃ tu vinyaset |
lalāṭe pūrṇagiryākhyaṃ ka vargādyaṃ nyaset sudhīḥ ||

uḍḍīyānaṃ ca vargādyaṃ keśasaṃdhyaiḥ pravinyaset |
bhuvorvārāṇasīṃ pīṭhaṃ ṭa vargādyaṃ samāhitaṃ ||

<p. 171a>

ta varga pūrvakānyasyedavaṃti nayanadvaye |
pa varga pūrvakaṃ māyāpūripīṭhaṃ mukhanyaset ||

kaṃṭhe tu mathurāpīṭhaṃ ya vargādyaṃ pravinyaset |
nābhāvayodhyāpīṭhaṃ tu śa vargādyaṃ pravinyaset ||

kaṭaukāṃcīpurīpīṭhaṃ daśamaṃ tu pravinyaset |
ṣoḍhānyāsastutārāyāḥ proktobhīṣṭapradāyakaḥ ||

atha maṃtraṣoḍhāḥ ||

maṃtreṇāṃtaritāṃ kṛtvā ṣaḍvārāṃ mātṛkāṃ nyaset |
kramot kramādvarārohe tārā ṣoḍhāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

kṛtesmin nyāsaparye tu sarvapāpaṃ vinaśyati |
yoginīnāṃ bhavet pūjyaḥ sa devo na tu mānuṣaḥ ||

yaṃ namaṃti maheśāni ṣoḍhāḥ pūtita vigrahāḥ |
alpāyuḥ sa bhavet sadyo devatā kaṃpate bhayāt ||

na tasya pūrvyolokesmin pitṛmātṛ tu yojanaḥ ||

atha guhya ṣoḍhāmāha ||

na prakāśyamidaṃ kvāpi maṃtriṇaḥ kāyarakṣaṇe |
praṇavaṃ mātṛkāvarṇaṃ pūtitaṃ mātṛkāsthale ||

tenaiva pūṭitaṃ varṇaṃ nyaset tatraiva pārvati |
māyāvījaṃ tathā devī vinyastavyaṃ prayatnataḥ ||

vadhūvījaṃ tathā devī vinyasettu samāhitaṃ |
kūrcavījaṃ tathānyasanīyaṃ maśeṣataḥ ||

astreṃ caiva mathānyastvā sa karaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ |
guhya ṣoḍhāhyayaṃ devī na prakāśyā kadācana ||

avaśyaṃ pratyahaṃ kāryaṃ na pūjā na japastathā ||

athāsyāḥ sāmānyaṣoḍhā tu śyāmā prakaraṇepyuktā ||

tārāvidyāvidhau devī kāryaṣoḍhā catuṣṭayī ||

atha nakṣatrakānyāsaḥ ||

akārādi kramatonyasya rohiṇyādi krameṇa tu |
vyutkrameṇa ca catvāriśeṣaṃ śeṣaṃ na yojayet ||

rohiṇyādi mahānyāsaṃ kṛtvā naravaratsudhīḥ |
rohiṇī sutavat pṛthvyāmāśocyo bhavati dhruvaṃ ||

akṛtvā tārakānyāsaṃ tāriṇīṃ prayajedyadi |
śatarakṣa prajaptopi na maṃtraḥ siddhidāyakaḥ ||

atha ṛṣyādinyāsaḥ ||

akṣobhya ṛṣire tasyā vṛhatī chaṃda īritaṃ |
nīrasarasvatī devī triṣu lokeṣu gopitā ||

hūṁ vījamatraṃ śaktiḥ syānmāyā strīṃ kīlakaṃ smṛtaṃ |
vināyogo bhaveddevī caturvarga phalāptaye ||

atha karāṅganyāsaḥ ||

tatrādau sārddha paṃcākṣarai vidyāyā ||

ṣaṭdīrgha māyāvījena ṣaḍaṃga vidhirīritaḥ ||

<p. 171b>

atha ṣaḍakṣarī tryavidyayoḥ ||

akhilavāgrūpiṇīṃ procya hṛdayāya namo vadet |
akhaṇḍa vāgrūpiṇīṃ ca śirase vahnivallabhā ||

brahmavāgrūpiṇīṃ muktvā kavacāya hūṃ muccaret |
rudravāgrūpiṇī netratrayāya vauṣaḍityapi ||

sarvavāgrūpiṇī muktvā astrāya phaḍiti smaret |
ṣaḍdīrgha māyayā vījaṃ vījāṃtetā niyojayet ||

atha sārddhavedākṣarī vidyāyāḥ ||

vījāṃte ekajaṭāyai hṛdayaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
tāriṇyau śirase tadvadvajrodake śikhā tathā ||

ugra jaṭai ca kavacaṃ mahāparisane tathā |
piṃgāgraika jaṭe tadvannetrāstre parikīrtite ||

atha vyāpakanyāsaḥ ||

mūlena vyāpakaṃ nyāsaṃ navadhā kārayet priye |
saptadhā paṃcadhā cāpi tattonūnaṃ ca kārayat ||

atrokta mācaredatra nānyaṃ saṃcārayedbudhaḥ ||

atha yaṃtralikhanamāhā ||

tataḥ kuṃkuma siṃdūraiḥ kāryaṃ yaṃtraṃ tu yoginā |
sauvarṇe rājate tāmre sphāṭike vaidrume tathā ||

cakre yathokta vidhinā pūjyā devī narottamaiḥ |
viṃdu trikoṇāṣṭadala bhūpuraṃ vajracihnitaṃ ||

yaṃtra me tanmaheśāni rahasyātirahasyakaṃ |
viṃdu ṣaṭkoṇa vṛttaṃ ca padmabhūgṛhabhūṣitaṃ ||

yaṃtraṃ proktaṃ mahāprājña bhūpura dvayayugmakaṃ |
viṃdu trikoṇa ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vṛtta trayamanaṃtaraṃ ||

caturasraṃ tato vṛttaṃ dalāṣṭakaṃ tatopari |
vṛttatrayaṃ samālikhya bhūpuratrayakaṃ tataḥ ||

triśūlatāṃkitaṃ yaṃtraṃ śrīmahātāriṇī manoḥ ||

viṃdu trikoṇa ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vṛttāṣṭadalabhūṣitaṃ |
ṣoḍaśāraṃ daṃtapadmaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭāṃdalaṃ tathā ||

bhūpuratraya saṃyuktaṃ yaṃtraṃ śrītāriṇī manoḥ ||

atha sa vījayaṃtramāha ||

tataḥ kularase naiva pīṭhaṃ nirmāya yatnataḥ |
oṃ āḥ surekhe vajrarekhe hūṁ phaṭ ca vahnivallabhā ||

matreṇānena vilikhettārā yaṃtraṃ manoharaṃ |
ṣaṭkoṇāṃtargataṃ padmaṃ bhūviṃ vadvitayaṃ punaḥ ||

tanmadhye vilikhenmaṃtrī tārā praṇavameva hi ||

athavā ||

ṣaṭkoṇāṃtargataṃ padmaṃ bhūvimvadyutayaṃ punaḥ |
māyāpūrvadale caiva dvitayaṃ dakṣiṇe likhet ||

athottare paścime ca hūṁ phaṭ tāraṃ ca madhyataḥ |
sa yoniṃ gomayenāṣṭa patramabjaṃ suśobhanaṃ ||

<p. 172a>

bhūpuraṃ ca su vajrāḍhyaṃ yaṃtrameka jaṭātmakaṃ |
māyāṃ pūrvadalenyasya yāmye vījaṃ dvitīyakaṃ ||

tathottere paścime ca phaṭkāre vilikhet tataḥ |
madhyavījaṃ likhitvā tu bhūtaśuddhiṃ samācaret ||

astrāstravījaniṣanemaptabhedosti ||

kuleśvaramataḥ proktaṃ phottare paścimetuta |
phaṭ paścimeṭottare ca vikarālamate smṛtaṃ ||

vyomeṃdau rasanārṇa karṇikamacāṃ dvaṃdvaiḥ sphurat keśavaṃ vargollāsiva 
succhadaṃva sumatī gehena saṃveṣṭhitaṃ ||

tārādhīśvara vārivarṇa vilasaddikkoṇa saṃśobhitaṃ |
yaṃtraṃ nīratanoḥ paraṃ nigaditaṃ sarvārthasiddhipradaṃ ||

śaśūnyaṃ kusumaiḥ kuryācchūnye vighne vinirdiśet |
hrasvaḥ sākṣī bhayaṃ śveto bhagavānmadanovakaḥ ||

tābhiṣekaṃ tathā coktvā bhṛguḥ kālīmarutpriye |
kūrcāstraṃ vahnibhāryeti yaṃtre puṣpāṃjaliṃ kṣipet ||

atha pīṭhapūjāmāha ||

mahīgṛhaścaturdikṣu gaṇeśaṃ vaṭukaṃ tathā |
kṣetrapālaṃ yoginīṃ ca dhyātvā samyak prapūjayet ||

pāśāṃkuśo triśūlaṃ ca kapālaṃ dadhataṃ karaiḥ |
kṛṣṇaṃ digaṃvaraṃ krūraṃ kṣetrapaṃ paścime jayet ||

kapālaśūlahastābhyāṃ dadhataṃ sarpabhūṣaṇaṃ |
svayūthaveṣṭitaṃ ramyaṃ vaṭukaṃ dakṣiṇe ca yet ||

ḍamarvaśi triśūlāṃśca kapālaṃ dadhatī karaiḥ |
raktamālyāṃ raktavastrāṃ yoginīmuttare yajet ||

śmaśānaṃ tatra saṃciṃtya tat tatkāledrumaṃ smaret |
tanmūle maṇipīṭhaṃ ca nānāmaṇi vibhūṣitāṃ ||

nānāraṃkārabhūṣāḍhyaṃ munidevaiśca bhuṣitaṃ |
śivābhirvahumāṃsāsthi moḍamānābhiraṃtaraṃ ||

caturdikṣu śavān muṇḍān vitāṃgārāsthi bhūṣitān |
pīṭhaśaktirathābhyarcyā keśareṣu samaṃ tataḥ ||

varadā dhārīṇyāḥ pīṭhaṃ pīṭhāmunāyajet ||

tāyathā ||

lakṣmī sarasvatī caiva ratiḥ prītistathaiva ca |
kīrtiḥ śāṃtiśca puṣṭiścatuṣṭirityaṣṭa śaktayaḥ ||

tanmadhye pūjayeddevyā vāhanaṃ śavameva ca ||

atha pīṭhamaṃtramāha ||

viyadbhṛśaṃ samuccārya manu viṃdu kalānvitaṃ |
mahāpretapadaṃ paścāddhṛdayāṃta mayaṃ manuḥ ||

<p. 172b>

athārghya sthāpanaṃ ||

bhūmiṃ pūrvokta maṃtreṇa maṇḍalasya tu maṇḍalaṃ |
kuryāt tatrādhāraśaktiṃ kūrmaśeṣaṃ ca saṃjapet ||

ādhāraṃ sthāpayet tatra oṃ hrīṁ phaḍiti maṃtrataḥ |
ādhāraṃ pūjayet tatrayaṃ vahnimaṇḍalāya ca ||

namoṃte namavārṇena tato narakapālakaṃ |
hūṁ phaṭ maṃtreṇa saṃkṣālya strīṁ vījena niveśayet ||

tatorcayennṛkapālaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ catuṣṭayaṃ ||

kālīkapālāya namo hrīṁ hrīṁ hūṁ purvakaṃ vadet |
ekādaśākṣaro maṃtro'nena pūjādimāmatā ||

strīṁ strīṁ strūṁ tāriṇītyuktvā kapāloya namoṃtikaḥ |
dvādarśonena bhavet kapālārcā dvitīyakai ||

hāṁ hīṁ hūṁ procya nīlā kapālāye nama ityayaṃ |
ekādaśārṇonenoktā kapālārcā tṛtīyakā ||

māyā strīṁ hūṁ svargakapālāya sarvāpadaṃ vadet |
tato dhārāya sarvāya tathā sarvodbhavāya ca ||

sarvaśuddhimayāyeti sarvāsurarudhīti ca |
devī kapālāya namaścaturtho maṃtra īritaḥ ||

ṣaṭpaṃcāśat kavarṇoyaṃ kapālasya tu pūjane |
tatastasmin kapāle tu pūjayedarkamaṇḍalaṃ ||

oṃ sūryamaṇḍalāyeti namāṃtoyaṃ navākṣaraṃ |
sūryamaṇḍalapūjāyāṃ nṛkapāle manurmataḥ ||

mūlamaṃtraṃ paṭhaṃ tasmin sudhāvudhyā sulāṃ kṣipet |
gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatāḥ kṣiptvā trikhaṇḍākhyāṃ pradarśayet ||

mudrāṃ sā tu kalau vyastāvaṃguṣṭau kārayatsamau |
anāmāṃtargate kṛtvā tarjanyau kuṭilā kṛtī ||

kaniṣṭhike nijasthāne trikhaṃḍāhvāna karmaṇi |
tatastasyāṃ surāyāṃ tu pūjayeccaṃdramaṇḍalaṃ ||

ekādaśārṇena tataḥ śaṃkhatoyaṃ tu maṃtrayet ||

hrīṁ śrīṁ hrauṁ oṃ samuccārya hrīṁ strīṁ hūṁ phaṭ samuccaret |
hyoṁ humiti vāgvījādi maṃtra ekādaśākṣaraḥ ||

hrīṁ vījena tato madyaṃ kiṃciccheṣāṃvu niḥkṣipet |
śaṃkhamudrāṃ yonimudrāṃ śaṃkhatoyāya darśayet ||

tatra vṛttyaṣṭa ṣaṭkoṇaṃ dhyātvā deviṃ viciṃtayet |
pūrvoktāṃ pūjayitvaināṃ mūle nātha pratarpayet ||

tarjanī madhyamānāmā kaniṣṭhābhi maheśvaraṃ |
sāṃguṣṭhābhiścaturvāraṃ mahāśaṃkhasthite jale ||

paṃcākṣaroṇunāpaścāttarpya ānaṃdabhairavaḥ |
tāro hrauṁ hyauṁ nama iti paṃcārṇo bhairavo manuḥ ||

<p. 173a>

tataste nārghyato yena prokṣet pūjanasādhanaṃ |
yonimudrāṃ pradarśyātha praṇamedbhavatāriṇīṃ ||

atha pūjāmāha ||

āvāhasthāpayitvā tu dhyātvā mudrāṃ pradarśayet |
mudrā pradarśya vidhivadupacāraiḥ prapūjayet ||

atha dhyānaṃ ||

pratyālīḍhapadāṃ ghorāṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ |
kharvāṃ lamvodarīṃ bhīmāṃ vyāghracarmāvṛtāṃkaṭau ||

navayauvana sampannāṃ paṃcamudrāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ |
caturbhujāṃ lalajihvāṃ mahābhīmāṃ varapradāṃ ||

khaḍgakartṛdharāṃ savye vāme muṇḍotpalānvitāṃ |
piṃgāgraikaṃ jaṭāṃ dhyāyenmaulā vakṣobhya bhūṣitāṃ ||

vālārkamaṇḍalākāralocana trayabhūṣitāṃ |
prajvalat pitṛbhūmadhye gatā daṃṣṭrāṃ karālinīṃ ||

sā vai sasmeravadanāṃ sarpālaṃkārabhuṣitāṃ |
viśvavyāpakatoyāṃtaḥ śvetapadmoparisthitāṃ ||

atha mudrāmāha ||

tārārcane viśeṣeṇa darśayet paṃcamudrikāṃ |
yoniśca bhūtinī caiva vījākhyādaityadhūminī ||

lelihā ceti saṃguptāḥ paṃcamudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
yonirmāyādharādhyenurvadhūḥ kūrcaṃ kramādviduḥ ||

vījānyāsāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ tu krameṇa kathayāmyahaṃ |
tarjanya nāmike madhye kaniṣṭhe cakramādapi ||

karayoryojayeccaiva kaniṣṭhā mūlabhedataḥ |
aṃguṣṭhāgraṃ tu niḥkṣipya mahāyoniḥ prakīrtitā ||

adhomukhīmimāṃ mudrāṃ darśayedvījapūrvikāṃ |
vaddhvā tu yonimudrāṃ vai madhyame kuṭile kuru ||

aṃguṣṭhe tu tadagre tu mudreyaṃ dhūtinī matā |
parivartyakarau spṛṣṭvāvaṃguṣṭha tarjanī yugaṃ ||

arddhacaṃdrākṛtirnyāyaṃ yugapat kārayet samaṃ |
adhaḥ kaniṣṭhāmākṛṣya madhyame vīniyojayet ||

mudraiṣā kathitā devī vījākhyā jñānarūpiṇī |
parivartyakarau kṛtvā kaniṣṭhā kaṣṭamadhyamāṃ ||

anāmayoryugaṃ cādhastarjanīyugalaṃ pṛthak |
anyonyaṃ niviḍaṃ vadhvā aṃguṣṭhāgre anāmike ||

daityānāṃ dhūmakatvākhyā mudraiṣā kathitā priye |
cakraṃ visphāritaṃ kṛtvāpyadho jihvāṃ ca cālayet ||

pārśvestha muṣṭiyugalaṃ lelihāneti kartitā ||

athāsyāḥ pūjāmāha ||

śrīmadekajaṭetyuktvā vajra puṣpaṃ pratīcchava |
tārādi vahnijāyāṃtamudīrya yajanaṃ caret ||

saṃtarpya paṃcamudrābhirnamaskuryādalakṣitaḥ ||

paṃcamudrā yathā ||

<p. 173b>

saṃmukhaṃ caturasraṃ ca vṛttaṃ gomukhameva ca |
yoni mudreti kathitā mudrāyaṃ ca namaskṛtau ||

athāsāṃ rakṣaṇamāha ||

aṃjaliṃ bhūmau saṃsthāpya tatra datvā śiraḥ punaḥ |
eṣāmudrā maheśāni khyātā saṃmukhasaṃjñakāḥ ||

uttānaṃ ca vāmakaraṃ bhūmau kṛtvā maheśvarī |
dakṣaṃ karatalaṃ tatra saṃyojya sādhakottamaḥ ||

karayoraṃgulībhiśca pṛṣṭadeśaṃ parasparaṃ |
spṛṣṭvā tatra śiroyogānmudrāsyāccatusrikā ||

nidhāya bhūmāvuttānāṃguṣṭha muṣṭidvayaṃ śive |
mūrddhni yogamaheśāni khyāterya vṛttamudrikā ||

bhūmau karayugaṃ devī saṃpuṭaṃ vistṛtāṃguliṃ |
kṛtvā tatra śiroyogānmudrā gomukhasaṃjñakā ||

pūrvoktā yonimudrāyā sā bhūmau śirasaṃyutā |
yoni mudreti kathitā tārā devyā namaskṛtau ||

athāsyāḥ mūrddhni bhairavaṃ yajet ||

tathā ca ||

tataḥ saṃpūjayeddevyā mastake'kṣobhya saṃjñitaṃ |
munidvādaśavarṇena manunā sa nigadyate ||

akṣobhya vajrapuṣpaṃ ca pratīcchānalavallabhā ||

asyopāsya maṃtradhyānādikamagrevācyaṃ ||

atha saṃpūjayet koṇaṃ ṣaṭke devyāḥ ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ ||

atha divyaughādyā guravaḥ ||

atha tārā gurūn vakṣye dṛṣṭādṛṣṭa phalapradān |
ūrddhvakeśo vyomakeśo nīlakaṇṭho vṛṣadhvajaḥ ||

divyaughān kathitān vatsa siddhaughān pūjayet tataḥ |
vaśiṣṭhaḥ kūrmanāthaśca mīnanātho maheśvaraḥ ||

harināthaśca mānaughān śṛṇu vakṣyāmi sadgurūn |
tārāvatī bhāsvamatī jayā vidyā mahodarī ||

sukhānaṃdaḥ parānaṃdaḥ pārijātaḥ kuleśvaraḥ |
virūpākṣaḥ pheravī ca kathitaṃ tāriṇī kulaṃ ||

trikoṇa madhye devyagre svaguruṃ pūjayedbudhaḥ |
kāmeśvaryādikāḥ pūjyā strikoṇe vahnimaṇḍale ||

kāmeśvarī dikkaravāsinī ca caṇḍalāyikā ||

athādho mukhatrikoṇe ||

iṃdrakoṇe lasaddaṇḍakuṇḍikākṣagunābhayāṃ |
gāyatrīṃ pūjayenmastrīṃ brahmāṇamapi tādṛśaṃ ||

iti ṣaṭkoṇapakṣe trikoṇapakṣetūpaniṣadiviśeṣaḥ ||

<p. 174a>

krameṇa koṇatraye vījatrayeṇa brāhmī vaiṣṇavīṃ māheśvarīṃ pūjayediti ||

athāsyāvaraṇārcā vāmāvartenaiva ||

tathā ca ||

vāmāvarte krameṇaiva pūjayedaṃga devatā ||

atha pūrvādyaṣṭadale mūla mahākālpādyāḥ pūjyā |
tatoṣṭau yoginī vāhye saṃpūjyā dalamūlataḥ ||

mahākālyatha mudrāṇī ugrā bhīmā tathaiva ca |
ghorā ca bhrāmarī caiva mahārātrīśca saptamī ||

bhairavī cāṣṭamī proktā yoginīstāḥ prapūjayet ||

atha pūrvādi dala catuṣṭaye vai rocanādīn pūjayet ||

vairocanaṃ tathā śaṃkhapāṇḍaraṃ padmanābhakaṃ |
asitābhaṃ yajenmaṃtrī aindrītaśca caturdale ||

athāgnyādi dala catuṣṭaye nāmakādyāḥ iṣṭyāḥ ||

vidikṣu pūjayet paścādagni koṇāditaḥ kramāt |
nāmakāṃ nāmakāṃ caiva pāṇḍarāṃtārikāṃ tathā ||

atha vairocanādīnāṃ dhyānamāha ||

vairocanaṃ dvihastaṃ ca yaṣṭi ṭomaradhāriṇaṃ |
pītaṃ vṛṣāsanagataṃ trinetraṃ raktavatsalaṃ ||

śaṃkhaṃ triśirasaṃ devamasitābhaṃ hiraṇmayaṃ |
pustakābhīti varadaṃ vimalaṃ śaśavāhanaṃ ||

padmanābhaṃ daṃti vaktuṃ pustakaṃ varadā bhayaṃ |
pāśaṃ ca vidhṛtaṃ devaṃ trinetraṃ varadaṃ śubhaṃ ||

śvetāṃ trinetravaradāṃ pustakābhayadhāriṇīṃ |
māmakāṃ valadevena saṃyuktena vibhāvitāṃ ||

kṛṣṇāṃ karālavadanāṃ tāmakā navayauvanaṃ |
godhikāyāṃ samārūḍhāṃ śikhirūḍhāṃ ca tālakāṃ ||

pāṃḍurāṃ śvetavījena caturvāhuḥ samanvitāṃ |
raktāṃ lamvodarīṃ dhyāyet paṃcapretāsanasthitāṃ ||

atha vairocanādi narakāṃtakāṃ tāyāṃ pūjāyāṃ maṃtra viśeṣamāha ||

ādau praṇavamuccārya nāmādya vījamuccaret |
saṃvuddhyaṃtaṃvatannāma vajra puṣpaṃ pratīccha ca ||

svāhāṃto manurākhyāto dvādaśānāmayaṃ kramaḥ ||

atha pūrvādyaṣṭa dalāgreṣu brāhmādyaṣṭa mātaraḥ pūjanīyā ||

dalāgre ca maheśāni brāhmādi paripūjayet ||

<p. 174b>

atha pūrvādi dvāre catuṣṭaye padmāṃtakādīn jayet ||

dvāre pūrvāditaḥ paścāt padmāntakayarmāttakau |
vighnāṃtakaṃ samabhyarcya pūjaye narakāṃtakaṃ ||

atha bhūpurasya daśadikṣu digpālān saṃpūjya tadvahyaṣṭadalāni samabhyarcya 
bhūpura pūrvadiśi bhūpurayaṃ kalayoraṃtarāle sūryaṃ saṃpūjya devyottarabhāge 
gurupaṃktyaṃtare vaurddha jayet ||

bhūpure caiva tadvāhye daśadikṣu yathā kramaṃ |
śakrādīṃścāpi vajrādīn pūjayetadanaṃtaraṃ ||

bhūviṃvābhyaṃtare sūryaṃ gurupaṃktyuttare tataḥ |
uttare pūjayedvauddhaṃ punardevī prapūjayet ||

puṣpāṃjali trayaṃ dadyādyathā saṃkhyaṃ japedbudhaḥ ||

atha sarvāvaraṇa sādhāraṇa yajanamastramāha ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya nāma saṃvodhanānvitaṃ |
vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīccheti hūṁ phaṭ svāheti maṃtritaḥ ||

etanmaṃtreṇyāsamātraṃ bhinnameva na saṃśayaḥ |
anena manunā sarvān parivārān samarcayet ||

vairocanādiṣu punarnāmādyakṣarapūrvakaṃ ||

atha balidānaṃ ||

tatośca nityā pūjāṃte'nvahaṃ devyai valiṃ haret |
vāmabhāge trikoṇe ca vṛttaṃ bhūpurameva ca ||

vidhāya rakatamālyādau arcayitvā yathāvidhiḥ ||

śrīmadeka jaṭenīla sarasvatī mahogra ca |
tārādevī khakhetyuktvā sarvabhūtapiśācarā ||

kṣasān grasagra samamajāḍyaṃ chedaya chedaya ||

śrīṁ hrīṁ phaṭ vahni jāyāṃtastāra māyādi ko manuḥ |
bhaved dvipaṃcaśadaśaḥ pūjaivaṃ pūrṇatāmiyāt ||

atha japamāha ||

tatrādau bhairavasya tataḥ kullukāyāḥ tataḥ sveṣṭadevatāyāśca ||

akṣobhyasya manuṃ tyaktvā devīṃ tārāṃ japedyadi |
siddhihānirbhavettasya rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

akṣobhyasya manuṃ vipra kavacaṃ sāramuttamaṃ |
atiguhyaṃ mahādhyānaṃ sarvadhyāneṣu cottamaṃ ||

agre manuṃ pravakṣyāmi dhyānaṃ caiva tataḥ paraṃ |
kavacaṃ ca tataḥ paścāt kathayāmi krameṇa tu ||

<p. 175a>

anuttaraṃ samuddhṛtya prapaṃcama vibhūṣitaṃ |
akṣobhyeti ca svāhetiramādyaṃtaṃ mahāmanuḥ ||

svayaṃ ṛṣiśca saṃprokto virāṭ chaṃda udīritaḥ |
akṣobhyo devatā proktastrimūrtirnāgarūpadhṛk ||

viniyogastu niyataṃ puruṣārtha catuṣṭaye ||

atha dhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvasaubhāgyadāyakaṃ |
sahasrāditya saṃkāśaṃ nāgarūpadharaṃ śubhaṃ ||

vidyuṭi samaṃ vaktraṃ vahnibhāsvaralocanaṃ |
sārddha trivalayopetaṃ jaṭākodyagra saṃsthitaṃ ||

mahārāvaṇya saṃyuktaṃ surāsura namaskṛtaṃ |
sūrya vidyut samaṃ bhāsvanmahāmaṇi śiropari ||

etadyūyaṃ mahākāyaṃ devīrapi supūjitaṃ ||

śrīśiva uvāca ||

akṣobhya kavacasyāsya brahmaviṣṇuśca rudrakāḥ |
ṛṣayaśca samākhyātā virāṭ chaṃda udāhṛtaṃ ||

akṣobhya devatā caiva śrīvījaṃ vījameva ca |
svāhā śaktirviniyogaḥ puruṣārtha catuṣṭaye ||

śrīvījaṃ śirase avyādādi vijiaṃ ca bhārake |
akāraḥ skaṃdhame avyāt kṣakāro hṛdi rakṣa tu ||

bhakāro nābhi me avyādekāro guhyadeśake |
maṃtraśaktiśca sarvāṃgaṃ vījaṃ netratraye'vatu ||

sarvabhāvaiśca akṣobhyo vāhu dvaurakṣayet sadā |
brahmārakṣa tu pādau dvauviṣṇurakṣa tu jānunī ||

mūlādhāraṃ śivomevyāt svādhiṣṭānaṃ vṛṣo'vatu |
maṇipūre sadā avyāt śivasya gṛhiṇī ca me ||

anāhatāmvujaṃ me'vyādiṃdrādi daśadevatāḥ |
viśuddhacakreṣṭa tataṃ rakṣāṃ karo me raviḥ ||

maheśvaraḥ sadā rakṣedājñā cakraṃ suśobhanaṃ |
brahmaśukraṃ ca me rakṣennābhiṃ rakṣa tu bhairavī ||

divyādau gurupaṃktau ca sarvatrākṣobhya ucyate |
evaṃ kramavidhānena kavacaṃ ca japecchuviḥ ||

trisaṃdhyaṃ yaḥ paṭhennityaṃ śradhābhaktiḥ samanvitaḥ |
siddhyahānirbhavet tasya nātrakāryā vicāraṇā ||

atha kullukāyāḥ āvaśyakatāmāha ||

ajaptvā kullukāmaṃtrama smṛtvā śrīpatiṃ hariṃ |
yojayet tāriṇī maṃtra narakeśariṇīyate ||

japitvā kullukāmaṃtramaṣṭottaraśataṃ sudhīḥ |
prajapettāriṇīṃ paścānnānyathā siddhimāpnuyāt ||

<p. 175b>

dhṛtvā tu kullukā haste mahādevīṃ samarcayet |
athavā mūrddhnī vinyasya pūjayet prajapedapi ||

anitya japasaṃkhyāmāha ||

aṣṭottara sahasraṃ vā aṣṭottara śataṃ ca vā |
rahasya mālayā maṃtrī japennitya mananyadhīḥ ||

tathā ca ||

sahasraṃ śataṃ viṃśati vā japeṃdrasya mārayeti śrutau |
rahasya mālayātatā tāriṇī siddhidā bhavet ||

atastayā prajaptavyā mārayā siddhimicchatā |
mahāśaṃkhamayīmālā paṃcāśanmaṇinirmitā ||

rahasyamālā saṃproktā gopanīyā prayatnataḥ |
calamālāsthi khaṇḍe naracitā japamālikā ||

mahāśaṃkhamayī jñeyā tadabhāve sphāṭikīmatā ||

atha maṃtradhyānaṃ ||

maṃtradhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi japā sarvārthasādhakaṃ |
maṃtradhyānāṃ maheśāni śuddhyate brahmahāyataḥ ||

mūlacakre ca hṛllekhāṃ sūryakoṭiṃ samaprabhāṃ |
svādhiṣṭāne pītavarṇaṃ dvitīyaṃ ca vibhāvayet ||

sūryakoṭi pratīkāśaṃ kūrcavījaṃ mahāprabhaṃ |
aṣṭamaṃtraṃ hṛdi dhyāyet kālāgni sadṛśa prabhaṃ ||

mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ sarvāṃ vidyāṃ vibhāvayet |
sūryakoṭi pratīkāśāṃ yogibhirdṛṣṭa pūrvikāṃ ||

jihvāyānyasanādeva mūkopi su kavirbhavet |
itthaṃ japaṃ samarpyātha ghaṃṭhāvādanapūrvikāṃ ||

stutvā tā stutibhiḥ samyak sādhakobhakti saṃyutaḥ ||

atha stotraṃ yathā ||

svayaṃ līlayāyā paraṃ viṣṇumūrtirvabhau cenna caivaṃ kathaṃ caṃdracūḍaḥ |
tadaṃghri padmodgatāṃvu pravāhī jagannitya vījaṃ bhajetāṃ trinetrāṃ ||

parāyā na cet kṛṣṇa āsīt kathaṃ sa svavaktrā raviṃdadyuternetrabhaṃgyā |
smarānervahuvrīhitā kṛchunāmni jagannitya vījaṃ bhajetāṃ trinetrāṃ ||

lasatyā dehastānanākteṣu yasyā madhūnicchurāṃśona paṃcāsyako bhūt |
atastena labdhvā sadānaṃda saṃjñāṃ jagannitya vījaṃ bhajetāṃ trinetrāṃ ||

yadīyaṃ rasaṃ sannipīyaścareṇa smarīye mukhe cāmṛte caṃdanādau |
ghṛṇāṃ kiṃ vṛtatyāśita kālakūṭo jagannitya vījaṃ bhajetāṃ trinetrāṃ ||

<p. 176a>

vidhātā yadā yā na cāste svayaṃ saḥ svayaṃbhūḥ kathaṃ syāt tadā toti tūrṇaṃ |
nutārābhidheyo na jātaḥ dyulauleḥ jagannitya vījaṃ bhajetāṃ trinetrāṃ ||

tadaṃśaṃ samāyaṃ dvivījaṃ tataḥ syāt tripādeti vedāṃtinoyāṃ vadaṃti |
videkāṃkṣaraṃ brahmavījaṃ kūrcaṃ jagannityavījaṃ bhajetāṃ trinetrāṃ ||

tatostraṃ yadā sārddha paṃcākṣarāṃ sā jagattāraṇādugratārā prasiddhā |
vinā tārakaṃ sā paraikā jaṭāsyājjagannityavījaṃ bhajetāṃ trinetrāṃ ||

vināstraṃ paṃcākṣaraiḥ kullukeyaṃ svayaṃ nīravāṇī paraṃ citsvarūpā |
smṛtāpyekavālaṃraṃ sadāmukti hetuṃ jagannitya vījaṃ bhajetāṃ trinetrāṃ ||

idaṃ ye janāstotrarājaṃ vivaṃti prasiddhāścate gadyapadya prasaṃge |
jagadrūpa pāpādi mukto hi tūrṇaṃ śarīrāṃtare yāṃti tārā samīpaṃ ||

vipattau niśārddhe japāṃte prabhāte paṭhedyastu bhaktyā tadarthaṃ viciṃtya |
bhavennīlavānyādvirephāṃghripadme sajīvastu haṃsaḥ sajīvo na jīvaḥ ||

iti śrīadvaitanirūpaṇemaṃtrārthavivaraṇātmakatātmakastotrarājanāmastotraṃ 
saṃpūrṇaṃ |

atha kavacamāha ||

purā kailāśaśikhare tārāṃ papraccha śaṃkaraḥ |
guptabhāvena deveśi kathayasva tu sādaraṃ ||

kenopāyena sahasā śarīraṃ sudṛḍhaṃ bhavet |
kathaṃ vā siddhiratulā tavarmatra vidāṃ priye ||

śrītārovāca ||

asti guhyataraṃ hyetanniḥ sṛtaṃ mukhapaṃkajān |
idaṃ rahasyaṃ paramaṃ kathayāmitvayi priye ||

śrūyatāṃ sāvadhānena kavacaṃ tanmukhātsṛtaṃ |
madhukaiṭabhayoryuddhe kathitaṃ padmajanmanā ||

tatprabhāvottu deveśanāśaṃ viṣṇurnagacchati |
bhavat su kathitaṃ pūrvaṃ tannasmarasi māyayā ||

uddhṛtaṃ sārabhūtānāṃ kavacaṃ yogināṃ sate |
na kasmaicit pravaktavyaṃ na prakāśyaṃ kathaṃcana ||

śapathaṃ kuru deveśa yadi snehosti sāṃpratī |
śrūyatāṃ sāvadhānena kavacaṃ sārasaṃgrahaṃ ||

satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ punaḥ |
kavacena vinā devayonāmarcayati kṣaṇāt ||

tamaśnāmi mahogrāhaṃ yoginībhiḥ suniścitaṃ ||

brahmaviṣṇumaheśānāṃ vījaṃ rakṣa tu mūlakaṃ |
tadūrddha śaktivījaṃ tu liṃgaṃ rakṣa tu yatnataḥ ||

maṇipūraṃ sadā pātu vadhū vījaṃ viśeṣataḥ |
anāhataṃ varmavījaṃ pātu me sarvasarvataḥ ||

astrāṇi sarvadā pātu viṣuddhaṃ kaṇṭhabhūṣitaṃ |
śeṣastu pātu me nityamājñāsthānaṃ dvipatrakaṃ ||

<p. 176b>

śīrṣaṃ pātu tathā tārā jaṭāpātu sadānanaṃ |
nīlasarasvatī pātu hṛdayaṃ me sadāpunaḥ ||

akṣobhyaḥ pātu sarvāgaṃ vṛhatī pātu bhālakaṃ |
ugratārādevatā me gahvaraṃ pātu sarvadā ||

caraṇai me sadā pātu māyāvījamaśeṣataḥ |
urūme sarvadā pātu vadhūvījaṃ sadaiva hi ||

stanadvayaṃ sadāpātu kūrcaṃ vighnavighātakaṃ |
rasanāmasanāpātu lakṣmī devī ca sāsvatī ||

rasāgraṃ sadā pātu sarasvatī prayatnataḥ |
ratiḥ pātu sadāvījaṃ prītirme vadanaṃ sadā ||

kīrtiḥ kīrtiḥ sadā pātu śāṃtiḥ śāṃtiṃ sadāvatu |
puṣṭirmeyā tu puṣṭiṃ ca puṣṭituṣṭiḥ sadāvat ||

vairocanaṃ pātu śaṃkhaṃ śaṃkha pūrvastathaiva ca |
pāṇḍaro me sadāgaṇḍaṃ pātu nityaṃ ca sarvaśaḥ ||

padmanābhaḥ sadā pātu nābhirmedaśapatrakaṃ |
asitābhaḥ pātu liṃgaṃ nāmakaḥ pātu cakṣuṣi ||

māmakoma tathā hastau grīvāṃ me pātu pāṃḍaraḥ |
tārakaḥ pātu hṛdayaṃ draṣṭiṃ padmāṃtako mama ||

pārśvadvaṃdvaṃ sadā pātu yamāṃtaka narāṃtakau |
caraṇau me pātu nityaṃ vighnāṃtaka samāhvayaḥ ||

tārā me pātu satatamaṣṭāṃgaṃ parameśvarī |
idaṃ tu kavacaṃ deva kathitaṃ tanmukhāt sṛtaṃ ||

pramādādyadi deveśa yatra kutra prakāśyate |
yoginībhistadāhaṃ tu svayaṃ ca vadhakāriṇī ||

yadi bhāgyavaśāllabdhaṃ kenacit sādhakīlavai |
tadā tasya mahāsiddhirvapuṣā jāyate dhruvaṃ ||

niṣiddhebhyo na dātavyaṃ na prakāśyaṃ kathaṃcana |
yadi dadyānniṣiddhebhyastadāhaṃ vadhakāriṇī ||

dadyācchāṃtāya śiṣyāya taṃtra maṃtra yutācya ca |
gurupaṃktipuṭā caiva tadā siddhiranuttamā ||

rahasyaṃ kathitaṃ sarvamanaṃta phaladāyakaṃ |
gopitavyaṃ tadā deva na prakāśyaṃ kadācana ||

iti śrīyoginītaṃtroktaikajaṭākavacaṃ samāptaṃ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau tārābhedatritayasādhāraṇanityārcananirṇayo nāma 
caturviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 24 ||
(25th prakāśaḥ not available)

atha śrīvairocanīvidyāyāḥ kramollikhyate ||

jalapātraṃ kare kṛtvā pūjāsthānaṃ tato vrajet |
prakṣālya pādau hastau ca vāsasī paridhāya ca ||

ācamya vidhivaddevī deśikeṃdra sukhāsane |
prāgāsya mukhagāsyaṃ vā dakṣiṇāsyaṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

svagehādvāmato ramyaṃ devīveśma samācaret |
praṇavaiścaiva lajjāṃ ca sakāraśca visargavān ||

asurakṣayāya rakṣamāye phaṭ ca dviṭhāṃtikaḥ |
anenāṃghrī ca prakṣālya jalamīśānatastyajet ||

atha maṃtrācamanaṃ ||

maṃtrairācamanaṃ kuryāddevīṃ dhyāyan hṛdaṃvuje |
lakṣmīmāyā kūrcavījaistribhiḥ pītvāṃvu sādhakaḥ ||

<p. 177a>

lakṣmīmāyā kūrcavījaistribhiḥ pītvāṃvu sādhakaḥ |
vāgbhavenāṣṭa saṃpūjya māyābhyāṃ vadvirunmṛjet ||

kūrcena kṣālayet pāṇimebhirmaṃtraiśca vinyaset |
śrīmāyā kūrcavāk kāma tripuṭā bhagavarṇakaiḥ ||

kāmakalāṃ kuśābhyāṃ ca vaktranāsākṣi karṇayoḥ |
nābhi hṛnmastakaṃ cāṣṭau kṛtvāśasturbhavetkṣaṇāt ||

ācamyaivaṃ chinnamastāṃ vatsarātāṃ prapaśyati |
puṇyāhaṃ vācayeddhīmānsāmānyārghyaṃ tato diśet ||

dvāramabhyukṣyate naiva dvāradevān prapūjayet |
dhātāraṃ ca vidhātāraṃ kṣetrapālaṃ tataḥ paraṃ ||

vighnarājaṃ maheśāni gaṃgā ca yamunāṃ tataḥ |
vasudhārāṃ śaṃkhanidhiṃ padmanidhiṃ vasumatīṃ ||

dvāraśriyaṃ namaskṛtya pūjayaṃ kramataḥ sudhīḥ ||

oṃkārādi namoṃtena pūjayeddeśikottamaḥ |
kiṃcit saṃkucya vāmāṃge vāmapāda puraḥsaraṃ ||

pūjāsthānaṃ viśeddhīmān astrāya phaṭ samuccaran ||

adyapātraṃ vidhāyātha kṣetrapālaṃ namatsudhīḥ |
ūrddhvaṃ brahmā adhonaṃtaḥ ādhāraḥ śaktiṃ tataḥ paraṃ ||

kūrmamanaṃtaṃ pṛthivīṃ kalpavṛkṣaṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
maṇidevīṃ svarṇa siṃhamaṣṭa śaktistataḥ paraṃ ||

ānaṃdakaṃdaṃ praṇamet saṃvinnālaṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
tataḥ prakṛti patrāṇi vikāramaya keśaraṃ ||

kamalaṃ sarvatatvaika guṇāḥ satvaṃ rajastamaḥ |
sūryavimvaṃ caṃdraviṃvaṃhniviṃvaṃ tataḥ paraṃ ||

paṃcāśadvījasaṃyuktāṃ karṇikāṃ praṇametsudhīḥ |
ātmānaṃ paramātmānamaṃtarātmānameva ca ||

vikāraṃ keśaraṃ dhīmān praṇameddaṇḍavadbhuvi |
divyadṛṣṭyādivyavighnān dūrayet na pūrvakaṃ ||

astrāya (*) (?) ca maṃtreṇa hūṁ maṃtreṇāpi suṃdarī |
ātmānaṃ rakṣayeddhīmān vahniprākārayogataḥ ||

śavaṃ vā gajacarmāṇi naracarma maheśvarī |
vyāghrājinaṃ kuce laṃvābhūtikāṃgāra saṃbhava ||

śavacailaṃ maheśāni āsane kalpayetsudhīḥ |
ātmānaṃ nīlacolena nīlayadyatnapūrvakaḥ ||

viśeṣeṇa maheśāni pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ |
kūrmacakre viśeddhīmān mukhe sarvasamṛddhaye ||

pūjayitvā vidhānena viśeddhīmān tadā śuciḥ |
uparicāsaneddhīmān śodhayitvā viśeṣataḥ ||

pūjayitvāsanaṃ dhīmānnādhāraḥ śaktiyogataḥ |
śvetasarṣapamādāya vighnānniḥ sārayetsudhīḥ ||

svargamartya ca pātāle vighnāvighnavināyakāḥ |
naśyaṃ tu mama kūrmesmin te sarve ca śivājñayā ||

<p. 177b>

tāratrayaṃ tato dadyādastrāya phaḍiti smaraṃ |
vinyasta hastayugalaṃ mūrddhorddha kramayogataḥ ||

dhyātvā guruṃ sahasrāre praṇamyanatimādiśet |
guruvāmena meddhīmān tatraiva gurupādukāṃ ||

gaṇeśaṃ dakṣiṇe dhyātvā praṇame vighnaśāṃtaye |
saṃmukhe praṇameddevīṃ chinnamastāṃ vasuṃdharāṃ ||

ratikāmoparisthātāṃ prāṇāyāma tathā caret |
bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryāddhaṃ sa maṃtreṇa sādhakaṃ ||

oṃkāreṇa purojīva mūrddhamut kṣipya yatnataḥ |
nirjīvaṃ dehamākārairvahnivījena dāhayet ||

tenaiva vāyuvījena tadbhasmāyagamaṃ bhavet |
tenaiva megharūpeṇa tatra viṣṭiṃ viciṃtayet ||

tenaivāmṛta vṛṣṭiṃ ca dhyātvā dehanavīkṛtaṃ |
pūrvokta devatārūpaṃ sarvakalmaṣa varjitaṃ ||

karakacchapikā puṣpaṃ haste mūlena dhārayet |
itīyaṃ bhūtaśuddhistu lokānāṃ hitakāriṇī ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ samāsādya mātṛkānya samācaret |
ṣoḍaśārṇena mūlena prāṇāyāmaṃ samācaret ||

caṃdrāvedāgni saṃkhyābhirmāyayā vā samācaret |
vikāra vidyā daśanairvidyāsu sakalāṣvapi ||

maṃtranyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryādṛṣyādīn pūrvasūcitām |
āsāṃ ṛṣirbhairavohaṃ nāmnā tu krodhabhūpatiḥ ||

samrāṭ chaṃdo devatā ca chinnamastāḥ prakīrtitā |
māyāvījaṃ svāhā śaktiḥ kathitā padmayoginā ||

dharmārtha kāmamokṣeṣu viniyogaḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
uccaret praṇavaṃ pūrvaṃ ākāraṃ viṃdu saṃyutaṃ ||

khaḍgātha hṛdayāyeti svāhā yuktaṃ kanīyasi |
ikāraṃ praṇavāddevī caṃdraviṃdu samanvitaṃ ||

sukhadgāyatato vācyaṃ śirase tadanaṃtaraṃ |
svāhā yuktaṃ tato vācyaṃ pavitrāṃguli saṃyutaṃ ||

ūkāraṃ praṇavāddevī viṃdulāchitamastakaṃ |
śrīvajrāya samāyuktaṃ śikhāyai ca tataḥ paraṃ ||

svāhāṃtaṃ vinyaseddevī madhyamāyāṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
mātrāṃ dvādaśikāmuktvāpāsāya tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

kavacāya tato vācyaṃ svāhā ca tadanaṃtaraṃ |
tarjanyāṃ vinyaseddevī saṃbhuvitsu samāhitaṃ ||

<p. 178a>

aukāraṃ praṇavāddevī aṃkuśāya tataḥ paraṃ |
netratrayāya saṃyuktaṃ svāhā ca tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

aṃguṣṭhe vinyaseddevī praṇavādyaṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
tryaḥkāraṃ ca visargoktaṃ surakṣayāya suṃyutaṃ ||

asurakṣayāya saṃyuktaṃ vinyase karayordvayoḥ |
hṛdi mūrddhni śikhāyāṃ ca kavace netrayordvayoḥ ||

nyasedastrākhya paryaṃtaṃ digvidikṣu yathākramaṃ ||

atha ṣoḍhānyāsaḥ ||

maṃtraṣoḍhāṃ tataḥ kuryāt trailokyavaśakāriṇīṃ |
śrīvārātripuṭoyoniḥ prāsādaṃ praṇavastathā ||

kāridhvaṃkuśaiḥ kāmakalā kūrcāstrakaiḥ kramāt |
ṣoḍaśī maṃtravarṇaiśca pṛthagaṣṭā daśākṣaraiḥ ||

ebhirvījairmātṛkārṇānsveṣusthāneṣu vinyaset |
eṣā brahmasvarūpā hi vījaṣoḍhāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

anyāścanyasanāt sarvavajradehā bhavaṃti hi |
sarvaiśvaryayutāste hi jīvanmuktā daśābdataḥ ||

athāsyāḥ yaṃtramāha ||

athāsyāḥ maṇḍalaṃ vakṣye yathā vadavadhārayet |
dīkṣā karaṃ mahādeviṃ sarvakarma prayojakam ||

sitaṃ kuryāddalaṃ pūrvamāgneyaṃ raktavarṇakaṃ |
yāmye kṛṣṇaṃ tataḥ pītaṃ śuklaṃ caiva tato'sitaṃ ||

tataḥ pītaṃ prakurvīta karṇikā tasya madhyagā |
tatra madhye prakurvīta maṇḍalaṃ caṇḍarociṣaṃ ||

rajaḥ satvatamorekhārakta śuklasitāṃ kramāt |
māyāyugaṃ ca tanmadhye phaḍakṣara samanvitaṃ ||

vāhyāṃtaraṃ ca cakrasya kuryāt tridvāra saṃyutaṃ |
pūrvaṃ raktaṃ tataḥ pītaṃ śuklaṃ raktaṃ yathā kramaṃ ||

caturdvāra samāyuktaṃ kṣetrapālairadhiṣṭhitaṃ ||

athocyate yaṃtrarājo vairocanyā maheśvarī |
ṣaṭkoṇa prathamaṃ sakhyamadhyadeśe trikoṇakaṃ ||

sūryavimvaṃ tato dadyāccaturasraṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
bhūgolaṃ ca tato dadyāccaturasraṃ tataḥ paraṃ ||

aṣṭapatraṃ tato dadyādyathā sthānena deśikaḥ |
caṃdraviṃvaṃ tato dadyād vahniviṃvaṃ tataḥ paraṃ ||

bhūgolaṃ ca tato dadyād bhūpura tritayaṃ tataḥ |
vajraśūlaṃ samāyuktaṃ koṇetaṃkaṇ niyojayet ||

kiṃjalkaṃ keśare dadyān maṃtravarṇāt trikoṇake |
dūtiḥ kāmopari dhyāyeddevīṃ vairocanīṃ śubhāṃ ||

<p. 178b>

bhairavoktaṃ mahaṃ vakṣye yaṃtraṃ samṛddhitaṃ |
trikoṇaṃ prathamaṃ lekhyaṃ ṣaṭkoṇairvaṣṭayeccataṃ ||

trivimvaṃ ca tato dadyād guṇānāṃ pariṇāmakaṃ |
bhūpura tritayaṃ kuryād vajraśūlasamanvitaṃ ||

koṇadeśe tato dadyāt ṭaṃkāstraṃ sumanoharaṃ |
yathāsthāne likheddhīmān kartṛkharparakaṃ śubhaṃ ||

ratiḥ kamopari dhyāyeddevīṃ vairocanīṃ śubhāṃ ||

athāsyāḥ yaṃtralikhanāṃnaṃtaramarghyādi sthāpanaṃ kāryaṃ ||

tathā ca ||

arghyapātrādikaṃ kuryān maṇḍalaṃ purataścaret ||

atha pīṭhapūjāmāha ||

ādhāraśaktimārānya paratatvāṃta pūjite |
pīṭhe jayākhyā vijayājitā cāpi parājitā ||

nityā vilāsinī ṣaṣṭīdogdhī ghorā ca maṃgalā |
dikṣu madhye ca saṃpūjyā pīṭhavasyena śaktayaḥ ||

atha svanābhimaṇḍalaṃ devīṃ dhyātvā mānasairupacāraiḥ saṃpūjya yathokta 
parityā yonimudrāṃtastha puṣpākṣate samānīya punardhyātvā yaṃtra madhye 
cāvāhya yajet ||

atha dhyānaṃ ||

svanābhau nīrajaṃ dhyāyachuddhaṃ vikaśitaṃśitaṃ |
tasya keśara madhye tu maṇḍalaṃ caṃḍarociṣaṃ ||

japākusuma saṃkāśaṃ raktavaṃdhūka saṃnnibhaṃ |
rajaḥ satva tamo rekhā yonimaṇḍalamaṇḍitaṃ ||

viparīta ratiḥsthau ca dhyāyedrati manobhavau |
ratiḥ kāmopavisthau ca dhyāyeddevīṃ manoharāṃ ||

madhyetāṃ ca mahādevīṃ sūryakoṭiḥ samaprabhāṃ |
chinnamastāṃkare vāme dhārayaṃtiṃ svamastakaṃ ||

prasārita mukhī bhīmāṃ lelihānogra jihvikāṃ |
pivaṃtiṃ raktadhārāṃ ca nijakaṇṭha samudbhavāṃ ||

vikīrṇa keśapāśāṃ tāṃ nānāpuṣpa samanvitāṃ |
dakṣiṇe ca kare kartṛṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ ||

digaṃvarīṃ mahāghorāṃ pratyālīḍha padasthitāṃ |
asthimālāṃ dharāṃ devī nāgayajñopavītinīṃ ||

sadā ṣoḍaśavarṣīyāṃ pīnonna tapayodharāṃ |
ḍākinī varṇinī yuktāṃ vāmadakṣiṇayogataḥ ||

dakṣiṇevarṇinīṃ dhyāyed vāmapārśve tu ḍākinīṃ |
varṇinīṃ lohitāṃ saumyāṃ muktakeśīṃ digaṃvarāṃ ||

<p. 179a>

kapālakartṛkāṃ hastāṃ vāmadakṣiṇa yogataḥ |
devīgalocchaladraktadhārāpānaṃ prakurvatāṃ ||

asthimālāṃ dharāṃ devīṃ nāgayajñopavītinīṃ |
ḍākinī vāmapārśve tu kalpāṃta jvalanopamāṃ ||

vidyucchaṭābhanayanāṃ daṃtapaṃktivalākinīṃ |
daṃṣṭrā karālavadanāṃ pīnonna tapayodharāṃ ||

mahāghorāṃ mahādevīṃ muktakeśīṃ digaṃvarāṃ |
laṃvodarīṃ kālarātrīṃ nāgayajñopavītinīṃ ||

lelihāna mahājihvāṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ |
kapālakartṛkāṃ hastāṃ vāma dakṣiṇayogataḥ ||

devīgalocchaladraktadhārāpānaṃ prakurvatīṃ |
karasthita kapālena bhīṣaṇenātibhīṣaṇāṃ ||

ābhyāṃ niṣecyamānāṃ tu dhyāyeddevīṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ |
evaṃ dhyātvā yajeddevī vāmanā bhakti yogataḥ ||

vāhyārcāṃ tu tataḥ kuryāt puṣpaṃ naivedya dhūpakaiḥ ||

atha dhyānāṃtaramāha ||

bhairavoktamahaṃ vakṣye dhyānaṃ sarvasamṛddhidaṃ |
svanābhau nīrajaṃ dhyāyet samyak vikaśitaṃ sitaṃ ||

pūrvavat saṃkaraṃ dhyātvā ratikaṃ darpasaṃyutaṃ |
ratikāmoparisthāṃ tu dhyāyeddevīṃ manoharāṃ ||

tanmadhyetāṃ mahādevīṃ makārajaladopamāṃ |
chinnamastāṃ kare vāme dhārayaṃtiṃ svamastakaṃ ||

prasārita mukhīṃ devīṃ lelihāṃnogra jihvikāṃ |
pivaṃtīṃ raktadhārāṃ ca nijakaṇṭha samudbhavāṃ ||

vikīrṇa keśapāśāṃtāṃ nānāpuṣpa vibhūṣitāṃ |
dakṣiṇe ca kare kartṛṃ muṇḍamālāṃ vibhūṣitāṃ ||

śatārddhena nṛmuṇḍena mālāsrak parikalpitāṃ |
anyonya keśapāśena grathitāṃ sumanoharāṃ ||

digaṃvarāṃ mahārūpāṃ pratyālīḍha padāsthitāṃ |
asthimālāṃ dharāṃ devīṃ nāgayajñopavītinīṃ ||

sadā ṣoḍaśavarṣīyāṃ pīnonnatapayodharāṃ |
nānāṃgadā nāgakāṃcīnāganūpurasaṃgatāṃ ||

nāgakuṃḍala saṃyuktāṃ aṣṭanāga samanvitāṃ |
anaṃto vāsukiścaiva takṣakarkoṭapadmakau ||

mahāpadma tathā śaṃkhaḥ kulikoṣṭau prakīrtitā |
anaṃtakulikau citrau karṇamūle niyojitau ||

vāsukī śaṃkhapālaśca kṣatriyau pītavarṇakau |
pratyekaṃ tu phalāsaptaśanasaṃkhyā virājitau ||

<p. 179b>

nāgahārāṃ nāgakīṃcī yathāsthāna niyojitāṃ |
takṣakaśca mahāpadmo vaiśyāvetau udāhṛtau ||

nīlavarṇau phaṇā paṃcaśata yuktau tu sāṃgakau |
aṃgadaṃ kathitaṃ devyāstābhyāṃ yuktaṃ manoharāṃ ||

padmakarkoṭakau śūdrau raktavarṇāmudāhṛtau |
phaṇātriṃśatasaṃyuktau nūpurau sumanoharau ||

tābhyāṃ dhṛtāṃ chinnamastāṃ dhyāyedhyāna samādhinā |
ḍākinīvaṇinīyuktāṃ vāmadakṣiṇa pārśvataḥ ||

dakṣiṇe varṇinīṃ dhyātvā yetṛvāmapārśve tu ḍākinī |
varṇinī śyāmalāṃ dhyāyet muktakeśīṃ digamvarāṃ ||

kapālakartṛkā hastāṃ vāmadakṣiṇayogataḥ |
devyā dakṣiṇa nāmāstudhāyapānaṃ prakurvatī ||

muṇḍamālādharāṃ devīṃ nāgayajñopavitinīṃ |
devyāḥ saṃdṛśa rūpeṇa bhūṣaṇena ca bhūṣitāṃ ||

ḍākinīṃ vāmapārśve tu kalpāṃtajvalanopamāṃ |
vidyudagni samudbhūtāṃ trinetrāṃ sunoharāṃ ||

dāḍimī vījasadṛśa daṃtapaṃkti virājitāṃ |
draṣṭrā karālavadanāṃ pīnonna tapayodharāṃ ||

mahādevīṃ muktakeśīṃ mahāghorāṃ digaṃvarāṃ |
lamvodarīṃ kālarātriṃ nāgayajñopavītinīṃ ||

lelihānāgurasanīṃ muṇḍamālā vibhūṣaṇāṃ |
kapālakartṛkāhastāṃ vāmadakṣiṇayogataḥ ||

vāmanāḍyoguladraktadhārāpānaṃ prakurvatīṃ |
karasthita kapālena bhīṣaṇenāti bhīṣaṇāṃ ||

ābhyāṃ niṣevyamānāṃ tu dhyāyeddhyāna samādhinā |
evaṃ dhyātvā yajeddevīṃ manasā bhaktiyogataḥ ||

vāhyārcāṃ tu tataḥ kuryānnaivedyapuṣpadhūpakaiḥ |
bhairavoktaṃmidaṃ dhyānaṃ kuryād yatnena deśikaḥ ||

sarvasiddhipradaṃ sākṣyānmahāpātakanāśanaṃ ||

yaḥ smaret prātarutthāya devyāḥ pūjanakepi vā tasya siddhirbhaveddevī 
vāṃchitārtha pradāyinī dhanaṃdhānyaṃ sutaṃ jāyāṃ dvayaṃ hasti na meva ca ||

vasuvaṃdharāṃ mahāvidyāṃmaṣṭasiddhilabhettu saḥ ||

<p. 180a>

atha vījaviśeṣādi maṃtrapakṣemāvarṇaviśeṣeṇadhyeyā ||

tathā ca ||

yenaṃ vījena cādyaina yadya dhyānaṃ taducyate |
kāmādau niśadā dhyāyellajādau lohitāṃ tathā ||

māyādau ca bhavet kṛṣṇāvāgādau vaidyuta prabhā ||

atha yoni mudrāṃ vaddhvā tanmadhye raktacaṃdanākṣatajavāpuṣpaṃnidhāya tatra 
punardhyāyet ||

yonimudrāṃ gataṃ kṛtvā sākṣataṃ raktapuṣpakaṃ |
dhyāyedevīṃ mahāmāyāṃ sarvakalyāṇakāriṇīṃ ||

sudhāsāgara dvīpe ca smaredudyānamadbhutaṃ |
tasminnavasarastīreśobhanaṃ raktamaṃḍapaṃ ||

caturdvāra samopetaṃ staṃbharājivirājitaṃ |
gavākṣamārge daśakavāyuyukta sa kesaraṃ ||

sudhāsaṃvisat tataṃ kalpavṛkṣa catuṣṭayaṃ |
niviṣṭi ratnastaṃbhe ca saṃsmarennija devatāṃ ||

śavāsanagatāṃ dhyoyet chinnamaṣṭāṃ mahodarīṃ |
caturbhujāṃ śavārūḍhā raktavastrāṃ trilocanāṃ ||

mukuṭāṭopa saṃpannāṃ dakṣiṇe khaḍgadhāriṇīṃ |
sotpalāvā mahastena dorbhyāṃ pustakadhāriṇīṃ ||

nikṛtya svaśiraḥ khaḍgaiḥ pivaṃti rudhiraṃ vahu |
upaddinakarābhāṃ ca caṃdrārddhakṛtaśekharāṃ ||

yogibhiḥ sevyāmaniśaṃ nāgayajñopavītinīṃ ||

athāvāhanamaṃtrastu ||

tatra cāvāhanaṃ kuryānān maṃtreṇānena sādhakaḥ |
sarvasiddhiprade pūrvamuccaret sādhakottamaḥ ||

varṇanīye tato vācya sarvasiddhiprade tataḥ |
ḍākinīya tato vācyaṃ devīnāma tataḥ paraṃ ||

ehyehīti tato vācya maheti tadanaṃtaraṃ |
tiṣṭatiṣṭeti vācyaṃ ca māyāyugmaṃ tataḥ paraṃ ||

phaḍakṣara samāyuktaṃ svāheti tadanaṃtaraṃ |
ityāvāhanamuddiṣṭa sthāpanena samanvitaṃ ||

athāsanadāne maṃtraviśeṣamāha ||

athāvāhyāsanaṃ dadyāt maṃtrenānena sādhakaḥ |
praṇavaṃ prathamaṃ kṛtvā sarvasiddhiprade tataḥ ||

<p. 180b>

varṇanīye tato vācyaṃ praṇavaṃ ca tato vadet |
ḍākinīya tato vācya praṇavaṃ ca tato vadet ||

ihaśabdāstiṣṭatiṣṭamāye phaṭ svāhayāyutaṃ |
tato dhyātvā yajeddevīṃ yuvatīṃ caṃdrarūpiṇī ||

atha pūjāmāha ||

mūlamaṃtreṇa saṃpūjya maṃḍalaṃsyāmaheśvarī |
upacāraiḥ prapūjyātha prasūnai raṃjanaistataḥ ||

tadanujāṃ gṛhītvā ca aṃgadevāṃ prapūjayet |
tato dakṣiṇadeśasthāṃ varṇinīṃ pūjayet tathā ||

praṇavāt sarasvatīvījaṃ prakṛtyai nāmanāmataḥ |
tataśca vāmapārśvasthāṃ ḍākinīṃ pūjayennaraḥ ||

pūrvavat praṇavādistu ḍākinyai nama ityapi ||

trikoṇe pūjayedādau phaḍanta kavacena tu |
kālikāṃ bhuvaneśīṃ ca mātaṃgīmīśa deśataḥ ||

uttarādi tataḥ paścāt puṭeṣu ca yathākramaṃ |
kāmākhyāṃ caiva bheruḍāṃ tathā nīlasarasvatīṃ ||

māyāvījena prayajet mahāvibhava vistaraiḥ |
bhairavaṃ pūjayeddevaṃ saṃmukhe vidhinā munā ||

samrāṭ chaṃdo dakṣiṇe ca maṃtravarṇān tathauttare |
vījaśaktī rakṣodiśi pūjayet kramataḥ sudhīḥ ||

mātaraḥ padmamadhye ca brāhmyādyāḥ sarvasiddhidā |
indrādi lokapālāntāḥ pūjyā astra samanvitāḥ ||

bhūpure pūjayettāṃśca pūrvādi kramayogataḥ |
pīṭhopari yajedrudraṃ paritaśca manoharaṃ ||

pūrvādiṣu caturdvāre pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ |
dvāropari mahālakṣmī brahmāṇaṃ cāgrato yajet ||

k.etrapālaṃ karālaṃ ca vikarālaṃ tathā punaḥ |
praṇavādi namāntena caturthyaṃ tapadena ca ||

pūrvoktamastvanulomenoktaḥ punarasthāpi lomekamāntaramāha ||

<p. 181a>

bāhyāvaraṇamārabhya pūjayen pratilomataḥ |
bhūpurādvāhyabhāgeṣu vajrādīni prapūjayet ||

tadantara surarājādīndvāreṣu dvārayānyajet |
karāle vikarālaṃ cāti kālaṃ mahākālakaṃ ||

ekaliṃgāṃ yoginīṃ ca ḍākinīṃ bhairavajendrākṣīhyasitāṃgīṃ saṃhāriṇīṃ ||

ṣaḍkoṇeṣu ṣaḍaṃgāni trikoṇe chinnamastakā |
ḍākinīṃ varṇinīṃ tārāvāgbhyātatpārśvayoryajet ||

evaṃ pūjāprakartavyā validānaṃ tataścaret ||

athādau bhūpurasya vāhye vajrādīni urddhve caṃdrādīn saṃpūjya pūrvādi 
krameṇa dvārapālān pūjayet ||

pūrvadvāre karālaṃ ca vikarālaṃ ca dakṣiṇe |
paścime cāti kālaṃ ca mahākālaṃ tathottare ||

praṇavādi namontena pūjāmeṣāṃ samācaret ||

athaiteṣāṃ dhyānamāha ||

karālaṃ raktavarṇaṃ ca dvibhujaṃ dvīpasaṃsthitaṃ |
paścime vikarālaṃ ca nīlanīraja saṃnibhaṃ ||

aṃkuśaṃ puṣṭakaṃ vāme javāpuṣpa chaviṃ smaret |
garuḍasthaṃ mahākāyaṃ trinetraṃ candraśekharaṃ ||

mahākālaṃ tathā caiva dvibhujaṃ pītavāsasaṃ ||

atha pūrvādi krameṇāṣṭadale caika liṃgādyā bhairavyaḥ pūjyā ||

ekaliṃgāṃ mahādevī ḍhākinī yoginīṃ tathā |
bhairavīṃ ca mahāpūrvāṃ bhairavīmatha suvrate ||

iṃdrāṣī masitāṃgī ca tataḥ saṃhāriṇī kramāt |
pūrvādike dale pūjyāḥ śaktayaḥ kramayogataḥ ||

praṇavādi namontena lajjā vījayutena ca ||

athāmākrameṇa dhyānamāha ||

raktāṃ gaurīṃ tathā kṛṣṇā tathā raktāṃ ca piṃgalaṃ |
pītāṃ muktāṃ ca dhūmrābhāṃ kathayāmi punaḥ kramaṃ ||

<p. 181b>

triśūlavaradāmādyāṃ vyāghracarma samanvitāṃ |
trilocanāṃ ca tanvaṃgī nāgayajñopavītinī ||

dvitīyāṃ suṃdarālokāṃ daṃḍaśaṃkhadharāṃ kare |
raktavastraparīdhātāṃ raktanāgopavītinīṃ ||

asthimālādharāṃ devīṃ vaddhapadmāsanasthitāṃ |
tṛtīyāṃ bhīṣaṇākārāṃ lalajihvāṃ mahodarīṃ ||

kapālakartṛkāhastāṃ kṛṣṇanāgopavītinīṃ |
ghoradaṃṣṭrāṃ mahāghorāmattimatto sudāruṇāṃ ||

caturthī pāvakābhāsāṃ muṇḍamālā vibhūṣitāṃ |
kapālakartṛkāhastāṃ khaḍgaśūlasamanvitaṃ ||

āpiṃgakeśanicayoṃ pracaṃḍāṭṭāṭṭahāsinī |
paṃcamīṃ vālasūryābhāṃ ṣaḍbhujāṃ dvipadā tathā ||

trimukhiṃ ca mahogrāṃcca raktapītāsiptānanāṃ |
kapālakartṛkāhastāṃ khaḍgaśūla samanvitāṃ ||

jaṭājūṭārddha caṃdrāṃ ca prativaktraṃ trilocanāṃ |
śavoparisthitāṃ devīmānīyasthānamāśritāṃ ||

dvīpi carmaparīdhānāṃ vīraghaṃṭhā samanvitāṃ ||

ṣaṣṭīsuvarṇavarṇābhāṃ sahasranayanojvalāṃ |
śaṃkha cakra gadā padma vyagrahastāṃ manoharaṃ ||

padmopari samāsīnāṃ kṛta padmāsanasthitā |
pītavastra parīdhānāṃ snigdhanetrāṃ sudāruṇāṃ ||

aṣṭhamī ca pravakṣyāmi kālajīmūta sannibhāṃ |
trinetrāṃ ḍākinī devīṃ saṃhārakāriṇīṃ ||

svābhiyuktāṃ sadā dhyāyeddevīṃ trailokyamātaraṃ |
pūrvādīśānaparyaṃtaṃ pūjayedvidhivatkramāt ||

atha validānaṃ ||

evaṃ pūjāṃ vidhāyātha validānaṃ prakalpayet |
dadyād valiṃ pāyasaṃ ca kṛśaraṃ madhusaṃyutaṃ ||

sa koṣaṃ madhusaṃyuktaṃ raṃbhā puṣpaṃ tathaiva ca |
aṃtarāntarato devi paśudānaṃ vidhīyate ||

<p. 182a>

samabhyarcya valiṃ pūrvegaṃdha puṣpāṃdinvandanai |
dhenumudrāṃ pradarśyātha vāmāguṣṭena saṃspṛśet ||

yaṃ mantreśodhanaṃ kṛtvāraṃ maṃtre dāruyettataḥ |
ṭhaṃ maṃtreṇāmṛtaṃ bhāvyaṃ vaṃ maṃtre plāvayeccata ||

tryaṣṭadhā prajapenmaṃtraṃ mūlaṃ ṅentaṃ nivedayet |
pradarśya saṃmukhe taṃtu punarācamanaṃ tataḥ ||

atha validānamaṃtra ||

saṃvuddhyaṃta padaṃ vrūyāddehi ehi padaṃ tataḥ |
gṛhna gṛhna imaṃ vrūyādvali śabdastataḥ paraṃ ||

mamaśabdaṃ samābhāṣya siddhiṃ dehi padadvayaṃ |
kavaca dvitayaṃ coktvā karālike padaṃ tataḥ ||

phaṭ svāhānto mahāmaṃtro validānaṃ vidhau smṛtaḥ ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ cāpi sahasraṃ vā maheśvari |
japaṃ samācarenmaṃtrī kullukādyaṃ yathāvidhi ||

japāṃte ca stutiṃ kuryānmālikāṃ śirasi kṣipet |
japapūjāṃ samāpyaivaṃ stutvā ca kavacaṃ paṭhet ||

tatrādau krodhabhairavasya maṃtro japtavyaḥ ||

stathā ca ||

ādau japtvā bhairavasya krodhasyāsya manuṃ japet |
asthimālāṃ samādāya vajra vairocanī manu ||

atha krodhabhairavasya maṃtramāha ||

atha krodha manuṃ vakṣye asādhyaṃ yena siddhyati |
vījaṃ hālāhalaṃ gṛhya krodha vījamataḥ paraṃ ||

bhayaṃkarārṇamābhāṣyāśitāṃgakṣatajasthitaṃ |
pralayāgnirmahājvālāmābhāṣya manumuddharet ||

evamuccāritaḥ krodhaḥ svayameva prasiddhyati ||

atha ṣaḍaṅganyāsaḥ ||

tatastu krodha maṃtreṇa ṣaḍaṅganyā samācaret |
viṣaṃ vajrayutaṃ vodhi mahākālaṃ nyased hṛdi ||

<p. 182b>

viṣaṃhanayugaṃ vajra kūrcādyaṃ vinyasedvahi |
hālāhale dehayutaṃ vajrakālanyasecchikhāṃ ||

viṣamaṃtrayutaṃ vajramāyudhaṃ kavacanyaset |
tāravījayutaṃ vajramāyudhaṃ kavacanyaset ||

tāravījayutaṃ vajramahākālāya netrayo |
viṣaṃ hanayutaṃ gṛhya daha gṛhya padānvitaṃ ||

krodhaṃ vajrayugaṃ tadvat sarvaduṣṭānathāparaṃ |
talomāraya varmāstraṃ digvaṃdhāntaṃ ṣaḍagakaṃ ||

atha dhyānamāha ||

tatra madhyenyasedbhīmaṃ taptajvālā samākulaṃ |
sāṭṭahāsaṃ mahāraudraṃ bhinnāṃjana ca yopamaṃ ||

pratyālīḍhaṃ caturvāhuṃ dakṣiṇe cakradhāriṇa |
tarjanaṃ vāmahastena tīkṣṇadaṃṣṭrākarālinaṃ ||

kapālaratnamukuṭaṃ trailokyasya vināyakaṃ |
ādityakoṭisaṃkāśa aṣṭhanāga vibhūṣitaṃ ||

aparājita padākrāṃta mudrā vālalaviṣṭitaṃ |
anāmikā dvayaṃ vadhvā ākuṃcya tarjanīdvayaṃ ||

kaniṣṭhāṃ madhyamā caiva jyeṣṭāṃguṣṭhena ca kramāt |
eṣa mudrādharaḥ śrīmān trailokyā sādhyasādhakaḥ ||

atha stuti ||

iti pūjārvidhīṃ kṛtvā ca yathā valaṃ ||

vāṃchitārtha prasiddhyarthabhimaṃstavamudīrayet ||

nābhau śuddhasarojamadhyavilasadvandhūka punyāruṇaṃ |
bhāsvadbhāskaramaṃḍalaṃ tadudaraṃ yadyonicakraṃ mahat ||

tanmadhya viparita maithuna parapradyumna tatkāminī |
pṛṣṭhasthāṃ taruṇārkakoṭi vilasattejasvarūpāṃ śivāṃ ||

vāme chinnadharāṃ śirottare pāṇau vṛhatkartṛkāṃ |
pratyālīḍha padāṃ digantavasanomāyuktakeśamrajāṃ ||

<p. 183a>

chinnātmīya śiraḥ samucchaladasṛgdhārāṃ pivaṃtīṃ parāvālāditya 
samaprakāśavilasannetra trayodbhāsinīṃ ||

vāmādanyatra nāḍī vahuvahalagaladraktadhārābhiruccaiḥ 
pāyantīmasthibhūṣāṃkarakamalalasat kartṛkāmugrarūpāṃ |
raktāmāraktakeśīmapagatavasanāṃvarṇinīmātmaśaktiṃ pratyālīḍhogra 
pādāmaruṇitamayanāṃ yoginīṃ yogamudrāṃ ||

digvastrāṃsrastakeśīṃ pralayaghanaghaṭā ghorarūpāṃ pracaṇḍāṃ |
daṃṣṭrāduḥprekṣyavaktrodaravivaralasallolajihvograbhāsāṃ ||

vidyullola jihvograbhāsāṃ || 

vidyullolākṣigugmāṃ hṛdayataṭalasadbhogibhīmāṃ svamūrtiṃ |
sadya chinnātmakaṃṭhapragalita rudhirairḍākinīṃ varddhayaṃtīṃ ||

brahmeśānācyutādyaiḥ śirasi vinihitā mandapādāravindāḥ |
mātmājñeryogimukhyaiḥ patidinamaviśaṃ ciṃtināṃ cityarūpāṃ ||

saṃsāre sārabhūtāṃ tribhuvanajananīṃ chinnamastāṃ praśastā | 
viṣṭāṃtāmiṣṭadātrīṃ kalikaluṣaharāṃ cetasā ciṃtayāmi ||

utpattisthiti saṃhṛtīrghaṭayatuṃ dhatte trirūṣāṃ tanuṃ |
traiguṇyājjagato yadīya vikṛtirbrahmācyutaṃ bhūlabhṛt ||

mātādyāṃ prakṛtiṃ smarāmi sa tataṃ sarvārtha saṃsiddhaye |
yasyā smarepadāravindayugalaṃsaṃto bhajente sadā ||

alipiśitapurandhrī yogapūjāparohaṃ vahuvidha kulabhārārambha saṃbhāvitohaṃ ||

paśujanaviratoha bhairavī saṃsthitohaṃ |
gurucaraṇa parohaṃ bhairavohaṃ śivohaṃ ||

imaṃ stavaṃ mahāpuṇyaṃ brahmaṇābhāṣitaṃ purā |
yaḥ paṭhet prātarutthāya devyāḥ sannihitopi vā ||

tasya siddhirbhaveddevī vāṃchitārtha pradāyinī |
dhanadhānyaṃ sutaṃ jāyā hayaṃ hasti nameva vā ||

<p. 183b>

vasundharāṃ mahāvidyāmaṣṭau siddhirllabheddhruvaṃ ||

iti bhairava prokto devyāḥ stavaḥ samāptaḥ ||

atha kavacaṃ ||

bhairavyuvāca ||

kathitā chinnamastāyādyāyā vidyā sugopitā |
tvayā nāthena jīvena śrutā ca gaditā mayā ||

idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi kavacaṃ pūrvasūcitaṃ |
trailokyavijayaṃ nāma kṛpayā kathyatāṃ vibhau ||

bhairava uvāca ||

śṛṇu vakṣyāmi deveśi sarvadeva namaskṛte |
trailokya vijayaṃ nāma kavacaṃ sarvamohanaṃ ||

sarvavidyāmayaṃ sākṣāt surāsura jayapradaṃ |
dhāraṇāt paṭhanādīśastrailokyavijayīvituḥ ||

brahmānārāyaṇā rudro dhāraṇāt paṭhanādyataḥ |
kartā pātā ca saṃhartā bhuvanāṃnāṃ sureśvari ||

na deyaṃ paraśiṣyebhyo abhaktebhyo viśeṣataḥ |
deyaṃ śiṣyāya bhaktāya prāṇebhyopyadhikāya ca ||

devyāśca chinnamastāyāḥ kavacasya ca bhairavaḥ |
ṛṣiḥ samrāṭ virāṭ chando devatā chinnamastakā ||

trailokya vijaya muktau viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
hūṁkāro me śiraḥ pātu chinnamastānatvaprabhā ||

hrīṁ hūṁ aiṁ tryakṣarī pātu bhālaṃ raktādigamvarī |
śrīṁ hrīṁ hūṁ aiṁ dṛśo pātu muṃḍakartṛdharāpimā ||

sā vidyā praṇavādyaṃtā śruti yugmaṃ sadāvatu |
vajra vairocanī ye hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā dhruvādikaḥ ||

ghrāṇaṃ pātu chinnamastā svamuṃḍakartṛdhāriṇī |
śrīmāyā kūrca vāgvīje vajra vairocanīya hūṁ ||

hūṁ phaṭ svāhā mahāvidyā ṣoḍaśī brahmarūpiṇī |
svayādyā dvāramabhyukṣya dakṣiṇa vāma pārśvayoḥ ||

<p. 184a>

uparyadhastritārānte svanāmādyarṇa vījataḥ |
gaṇeśaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ ca tathā dvāraśriyaṃ puna ||

dehalī ca samabhyarcya praviśedyāgamandiraṃ ||

āgneyādiṣu madhye dikṣu yathā kramaṃ |
tritāranā sa vījānne pūjayedgaṇapādikān ||

gaṇeśa durgā vaṭuka kṣetrapāla catuṣṭayaṃ |
ratnamaṇḍapamabhyarcya kāmavaṃratiyutaṃ ||

vasaṃtaprīti sahitaṃ tannodevi sarasvatīṃ |
śriyaṃ paścāt samabhyarca vikiret kusumāṃjali ||

athavā daśadikṣu daśaśakti samabhyarcya madhye vāgīśvarīṃ puṣpāṃjali mā 
dīpanāthaṃ yajet ||

sarasvatīṃ śriyaṃ māyāṃ durgāṃ ca tadanantaraṃ |
bhadrakāliṃ tathā svastīṃ svāhā caiva śubhaṃkarīṃ ||

gaurīṃ ca lokadhātrīṃ ca tathā vāgīśvarīmapi |
rakta dvādaśa śaktidbhiḥ sahitaṃ dīpanāthakaṃ ||

tritārayogaḥ sarvatra vijñeyaḥ sādhakottamaiḥ |
sāmānya kramavatkāryamaparaṃ sādhakottamaiḥ ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ vidhāyetthaṃ mātṛkānyā samācaret |
prāṇāyāma trayaṃ kṛtvānyāsānanyān samācaret ||

atha vakṣye maheśāni śrīvidyānyāsamuttamaṃ ||

athādau ṛṣyādinyāsa ||

ṛṣirasya maheśāni dakṣiṇāmūrtiravyayaḥ |
paṃktiḥ chandaḥ samākhyāto devī tripurasundarī ||

vāgbhavaṃ vījamityuktaṃ śaktistu śaktikūṭakaṃ |
kāmarājaḥ kīlakaṃ syādriṣyādinyāsa īritaḥ ||

atha karāṅganyāsaḥ ||

aṁ āṁ sauṁ ritiproktaṃ vījaṃ vividhamuttamaṃ |
etadvījaṃ dvirāvṛtya madhyamāṃdyaṃgulīṣu ca ||

śuddhiṃ karasya kurvītatalayoḥ pṛṣṭhayorapi |
caturthīnati saṃyuktānāma maṃtraiḥ pṛthak pṛathak ||

<p. 184b>

madhyamānāmikā caiva kanyaṣṭhāṃguṣṭha tarjanī |
krameṇa nāmavyākhyātamaṃgulīnāṃ maheśvarī ||

athātmarakṣāṃ digvaṃdhanaṃvāha ||

vālīvījaṃ trayaḥ pūrvaṃ tathā tripurasuṃdari |
ātmānaṃ rakṣarakṣeti kuryādrakṣāṃ hṛdi spṛśan ||

tathaivāstreṇa mudrāyāḥ kuryādigvaṃdhanaṃ tataḥ ||

athāsananyāsaḥ ||

amṛtārṇava śabdapūrva āsanāya tato manuḥ |
pādayorvinyaset paścādvālāṃta tripureśvarī ||

potāṃvujāsanāyāṃte namojānūvininyaset ||

aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ tripuret yuktvā suṃdarīti padaṃ tataḥ |
ṅentaṃ devyāsane cāṃtena madduru dvayaṃ nyaset ||

haiṁ hvrīṁ hsauṁḥ teṁ tripuravāsinīti ca ||

cakrāsanā ityamunā sphigadvaya pravinyaset ||

hyaiṁ hstrīṁ hstrauṁ (*********) 
(*) (?) ||

sarvamaṃtrāsanāyāṃte namoguhya pravinyaset |
hrīṁ klīṁ tripuramālinyaṃte tataḥ sādhya padaṃ vadet ||

tatasmiddhāsanaṃ ṅeṃtaṃ nābhideśe pravinyaset |
hsraiṁ hśrīṁ hsrauṁ maṃtre tripurāmvā padaṃ tataḥ ||

paryaṃka śaktipīṭhāsanāya namo vakṣasi vinyaset |
trīkūṭavidyā vījāṃte mahātripurabhairavī ||

sadāśiva mahāpreta yadā padmāsanāya ca |
nama ityamunā brahmaraṃdhrasthāne pravinyaset ||

atha ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ ||

sarvajñatā nitya su tṛptitā ca anādi bodhaśca svataṃtratā ca |
aluptatā śaktimanaṃtatā ca ṣaḍādgaraṃgāni śivayoḥ śivādyāḥ ||

vījāṃte nāma saṃyojya jātiyuktaṃ ṣaḍaṃkaṃ ||

saṃpūrṇāṃ ciṃtayedvidyāṃ brahmaraṃdhreruṇa prabhāṃ |
sravatsudhāṃ ṣoḍaśārṇāṃ mahāsaubhāgyadāṃ smaret ||

vāmāṃgadeśe saubhāgyadaṇḍinī bhrāmayet tataḥ |
viśvajihvāgrahammudrāṃ pādānmūlenyaset priye ||

trailokyasyatvahaṃ kartā dhyātvaivaṃ kīlakanyaset |
saṃpūrṇāmeva vadane veṣṭanatvena vinyaset ||

punaḥ saṃpūrṇaṃ vadane galārddhaṃ vinyasettayā |
punaḥ saṃpūrṇajā dehe vyāpakatvena vinyaset ||

vyāpakāṃte yonimudrāṃ mukhe kṣiptvābhinaṃdya ca |
śrīvidyāpūrṇarūpoyaṃ nyāsaḥ saubhāgyavarddhanaḥ ||

<p. 185a>

trailokyaṃ kṣobhavetyā śunyāsaṃ sannaddhavigrahaḥ ||

atha daṇḍinīmudrā ||

muṣṭiṃ dhṛtvā caranmaṃtrī tarjanī daṇḍavat tadā |
saubhāgyadaṇḍinīnāma ripūn daṇḍayate kṣaṇāt ||

atha ripu jihvāgrahāḥ ||

aṃguṣṭaṃ muṣṭigaṃ kuryād ripujihvāgrahā bhavet ||

atha yonimudrā yathā ||

saṃyojya hastau deveśi tarjanyāḥ nāmikāṃ yajet |
tadvadvāmena saṃsṛjyayonyākāreṇa yojayet ||

paribhrāmyā nāmikāstu murddhānaṃ paritaḥ priye ||

atha saṃmohana nyāsaḥ ||

brahmaraṃdhre jayeddevī maṇivaṃdhe nyaset tataḥ |
lalāṭe mālikāṃ kuryāt ṣoḍaśārṇāḥ smaredbudhaḥ ||

trailokyamaruṇaṃ dhyāyan śrīvidyāṃ manasi smaret |
saṃmohanākhyā deveśi nyāsoyaṃ kṣobhakārakaḥ ||

atha saṃhāranyāsaḥ ||

pādayorjaṃghayorjānvoḥ kadyolaṃ dhūnipṛṣṭake |
nābhau pārśvadvayoścaiva stanayoraṃśayostathā ||

karṇayorbrahmaraṃdhre ca vadane'ndhūni pārvatī |
tataḥ karmapradeśe tu naraveṣṭanataḥ kramāt ||

saṃhāroyaṃ mahānyāso bījaiḥ ṣoḍaśabhiḥ kramāt |
śrīvidyāyāḥ ṣoḍaśārṇairnyāsairviśveśvaro bhavet ||

sṛṣṭyarthaṃ vinyaseddevī mātṛkāṃ pūrvavat priye ||

atha vasinyādinyāsaḥ ||

mātṛkārṇaḥ svarūpāṃ ca varṇāṣṭaka samanvitāṃ |
veśinīṃ mātṛkān yasya bījāṣṭaka samanvitāṃ ||

avargāṃte likhedvījaṃ vahni phāṃte samanvitaṃ |
vāmakarṇe viśobhāḍhyaṃ viṃdunādāṃkitaṃ priye ||

veśinī pūjayed vācāṃ devatāṃ devasuvrate |
kavarāṃte maheśāni kāmeśī vījamuttamaṃ ||

merubhṛtaṃ samuccārya vāgdevīṃ pūjayet tataḥ |
ca vargāṃte dhvāṃtarāṃ takṣamāturya svarānvitaṃ ||

mādinīṃ pūjayed vācāṃ devatāṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ |
ṭa vargāṃte vāyuvījaṃ bhūmisaṃsthaṃ maheśvarī ||

vāmakarṇeṃdu viṃdvādyaṃ vimalāṃ vāgadhīśvarīṃ |
ta vargāṃte yamakṣmādyaṃ vāmanetraṃ vibhūṣitaṃ ||

biṃdunādāṃkitaṃ vījaṃ vāgdevī manunā yajet |
pa vargāṃte vyomacaṃdrakṣyātājānila saṃyutaṃ ||

<p. 185b>

ūkārasvara saṃyuktaṃ viṃdunāda kalātmakaṃ |
jayaṃtīṃ pūjayed vācāṃ devatāṃ suravaṃdite ||

ya vargāṃte yāṃtakālarepha vāyusamanvitaṃ |
vāmakarṇeṃdu viṃdvāḍhyaṃ sarveśīṃ paripūjayet ||

kṣamā vahnigataṃ sūryaṃ vījena pariveṣṭitaṃ |
viṃdunādakalākrāṃtaṃ kaulinīṃ vācamarcayet ||

śa vargāṃte mahādevīṃ nyaset sarvārthasiddhaye |
śiro lalāṭe bhrūmadhye karṇahṛnnābhi maṇḍale ||

ādhāradehakaṃ yāvannyaseddevīṃ parā priye ||

atha ṣoḍhānyāsaḥ ||

ṣoḍhānyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryādyena brahmāṇḍarūpa dhṛk |
virāṭ svarūpa varṇātmā śivaḥ sākṣānna saṃśayaḥ ||

gaṇeśaḥ prathamonyāsaḥ sarvavighnavināśakaḥ |
taruṇāditya saṃkāśān gajavaktrāṃ trilocanāṃ ||

pāśāṃkuśa varābhīti karālśakti samanvitān |
etāstu vinyaseddevī mātṛkānyāsavatpriye ||

vighneśvara śriyāmukto vighnanāthaḥ hriyānvitaḥ |
vināyakastathā tuṣṭiḥ śāṃtiyuktaḥ śivottamaḥ ||

vighnahṛt puṣṭiyuktā ca vighnakartā sarasvatī |
vighnarāṭ ratiyuktāśca medhā ca gaṇanāyakaḥ ||

ekadaṃtaścakāṃtiśca dvidaṃtaḥkāminīpatiḥ |
gajavaktro mohanī ca niraṃjana jaṭā tathā ||

kaparddabhṛt tathā tīvrā dīrghavaktra tataḥ priye |
jvālinī sahitaḥ paścānnaṃdā saṃkarṣaṇastathā ||

vṛṣadhvajaśca surasā gaṇanāthena saṃyutā |
kāmarūpānikāṃ paścādgajeṃdraśca guhā yutaḥ ||

śūpakarṇastu japinī trinetraḥ satyayā yutaḥ |
lambodaraśca vighneśi mahānāda svarūpiṇī ||

caturmūrtiḥ kāmadā ca sadāśivayutā tataḥ |
madavihvalā mahānāda āmodo vijayā tathā ||

durmukhaśca tathā ghūrṇā sumukhā bhūmidā tathā |
pramodaśca tathā bhūmireka pādastathā satī ||

dvijihvaśca ramāyuktaḥ śūlaśca dhvajinīyutaḥ |
vīraśca karṇayuktaṃ ca śailāśca makaradhvajā ||

ṣaṇmukhaśca vikarṇaṃ hi varado bhrukuṭī tathā |
vāmadevastathā lajjā vakratuṇḍastataḥ paraṃ ||

dīrghaghoṇānvitaḥ paścāt dviraṇḍaka dhanurddharau |
senānīyāminīyukto grāmiṇīrātri saṃyutaḥ ||

<p. 186a>

tamaśca caṃdrikāyukto vimaleśca śaśīyutaḥ |
mattavāhana lolā ca jaṭī ca capalākṣiṇī ||

muṇḍi ṛddhiyutaḥ paścāt khaḍgī ca śubhagāyutaḥ |
vareṇyaścaiva garbhā ca vṛṣake tu stathā śivā ||

bhaktapriyaḥ satvadā ca meghanādaścakāriṇī |
gajeśaḥ kālakubjā ca gaṇeśo vighnahāriṇī ||

mātṛkārṇairnyaseddevī grahanyāsastato bhavet |
raktaṃ śvetaṃ tathā raktaṃ śyāmaṃ pītaṃ tu pāṇḍuraṃ ||

dhūmraṃ kṛṣṇaṃ tathā dhūmraṃ raktadhūmraṃ viciṃtayet |
ravimukhyān kāmarūpān sarvābharaṇabhūṣitān ||

svarairarkaṃ hṛdīnyasyedyavageṇaśaśītataḥ |
bhūmadhye ca kavargeṇa bhaumaṃ netraṃ trayanyaset ||

ca vargeṇa budhaḥ kukṣīṭa vargeṇa vṛhaspatiṃ |
hṛdayoparivinyasyattavargeṇa gale bhṛguṃ ||

pa vargeṇa śaniṃ nābhau rāhuvaktreśavargataḥ |
lakṣābhyāṃ tu guḍeketuṃ nyasede varānane ||

atha nakṣatra vṛṃdānāṃ nyāsaṃ kuryāt sukhapradaṃ |
jvalat kālāgnisaṃkāśāḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ ||

matipāṇyāśvinī mukhyā varadā bhayapāṇayaḥ |
yugmaṃ yugmaṃ tathā yugmaṃ yugmaṃ yugmena rohiṇī ||

ekamevaṃ tathā dvaṃdvameka puṣpābhamucyate |
lalāṭe rocane paścād vāmadakṣiṇakarṇayoḥ ||

nāsyādvaye ca deveśi tathā kaṃṭhe nyaset kramāt |
puṣpābhaṃ tu pravinyasya khagābhyāṃ śleṣmanāmakaṃ ||

dakṣaṃ skaṃdhe ghaḍābhyāṃ tu maghāskaṃdhe dvitīyake |
cā pūrvaphālguṇī dakṣe kūrparecchaja saṃsthitā ||

uttarā phālguṇīṃ vāme kūrpare vinyaset priye |
ū ñavarṇasthito hasto maṇivaṃdhe ca dakṣiṇe ||

citrāṭaḍha parātmā ca maṇivaṃdhe nyaset priye |
ḍa varṇāṃte tathā svātī viśāṣāḍha sa varṇagāḥ ||

vinyaset kramato devī dakṣa vāme stanadvaye |
tathadasthānurādhāḥ ca nābhau nyaset tu pārvatī ||

dhakāreṇa yutāṃ jyeṣṭāṃ nyased dakṣakaṭau priye |
na paphadyāṃ tathā mūlāṃ nyased vāmakaṭau priye ||

purvāṣāḍhāṃ vakāreṇa dakṣorau vinyaset tataḥ |
bhakāreṇottarāṣāḍhāṃ vāmorau tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

makārayuktāṃ śravaṇāṃ dakṣajānuni vinyaset |
parasthitāṃ dhaniṣṭhāṃ tu vāmajānūni vinyaset ||

lakāreṇa mahādevīnyasecchatabhiṣāṃ priye |
dakṣajaṃghā gatāṃ paścāt pūrvabhādrapadāṃ tataḥ ||

vaśavarṇaḥ sthitāṃ nyasedvāma jaṃghāgataḥ kramāt |
ṣasahottara bhādrapadāṃ tathā dakṣiṇapādake ||

<p. 186b>

rakṣābhyāṃ viṃdusargābhyāṃ revatīṃ ca tathā priye |
kṣakāreṇa tato viṃdu visargābhyāṃ ca revatīṃ ||

vāmapāde pravinyasya yoginīnyā samācaret |
sitāsitāruṇāṃ ca bhruścitrāpītāśca ciṃtayet ||

caturbhujāḥ samairvaktraiḥ sarvābharaṇa bhūṣitāḥ |
ḍāṃḍīṃ vījadvayaṃ coktvā ḍamaravarayetpriye ||

vāmakarṇeṃdu nādāḍhyo ḍākinīṃ nama ityapi |
svanāṃte tu pravaktavyaṃ cāṃte rakṣapada dvayaṃ ||

tvagatmane kaṇṭhadeśe viśuddhau vinyaset priye |
kakārādyairākinīṃ tu rakārādyaikṣaraiḥ kramāt ||

pūrvavadvījasaṃyuktairasṛgātmāṃ ca saṃnyaset |
anāhataṃ nyaset paścāddakārādi phakāragaiḥ ||

rākinī ca tathā devī sāṃsānmāmaṇipūrake |
varavarṇaiḥ kākinīṃ tu svādhisthāne tathābhidhāṃ ||

madaḥ svarūpāṃ vinyaset ṣasavarṇaiśca kiṃkinīṃ |
mūlādhāresthi rūpāṃ tu vinyased vīravaṃdite ||

hakṣavarṇaiḥ sitāṃ caiva majjā hākinīkāṃ yajet |
brahmaraṃdhre maheśāni nyāsoyaṃ yoginī kramāt ||

rāśinyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryāt sarvarakṣākaraṃ sadā |
raktāśveta haridvarṇaḥ pāṇḍuścitrāsitānyaset ||

piśaṃgaṃ piṃgalau vabhruvarvurāśita dhūmatāṃ |
akārādi catuḥkena vinyaset suravaṃdite ||

meṣa dakṣiṇa gulphe tu tato dvaṃdvena vai vṛṣaṃ |
nyasejjānū nivedastu mithunaṃ vṛṣaṇe tataḥ ||

dvābhyāṃ karkaṭa saṃkukṣau dvābhyāṃ skaṃdhe tu siṃhakau |
anusvāra visargābhyāṃśa vargeṇa ca kanyakāṃ ||

dakṣiṇe tu śorobhāge vinyased vīravaṃdite |
tathā vāmaśirobhāge kavargeṇa tulānyaset ||

ca vargeṇa tathā skaṃdhe vṛścikaṃ vinyaset priye |
ṭa vargeṇa tathā saṃdhau dhanvinaṃ vinyaset priye ||

makaraṃ tu ta vargeṇa vṛṣaṇe vinyaset priyet |
pa vargeṇa tathā kuṃbhe vāmajānūni vinyaset ||

ya vargeṇa kṣakāreṇa mīnaṃ gulphe tulātmake ||

atha pīṭhānividhināvinyaset suravaṃdite |
sitāsitā'ruṇaḥ śyāmaharityāṃtānyavu kramāt ||

punaḥ punaḥ kramāddevī paṃcāśat pīṭhapaṃktayaḥ |
pīṭhāni saṃsmarevidvān sarvakāmārthasiddhaye || 

<p. 187a>

kāmarūpaṃ mahāpīṭhaṃ vārāṇasīṃ tataḥ |
nepālaṃ ca tathā pīṭhaṃ tathā vai pauṃḍuvarddhanaṃ ||

puraḥ sthitaṃ tathāpīṭhaṃ carasthitaṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
pūrṇaśailaṃ mahāpīṭhaṃ narvudaṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ ||

āmrāṭakeśvaraṃ pīṭhamekāmaṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ |
tisrotaṃ pīṭhamanaghaṃ kāmakoṭi mataḥ paraṃ ||

kailāśaṃ bhṛgupīṭhaṃ ca kedāraṃ caṃdrapūrakaṃ |
śrīpīṭhaṃ ca tathoṅkāraṃ jālaṃdhara mataḥ paraṃ ||

mālavaṃ ca tathā pīṭhaṃ kulāṃtaṃ devakoṭakaṃ |
gokarṇaṃ ca mahāpīṭhaṃ māruteśvarameva ca ||

aṭṭahāsaṃ ca virajaṃ pīṭhaṃ rājagṛhaṃ tathā |
mahāpīṭhaṃ kollagiri melāpuramataḥ paraṃ ||

koleśvaraṃ mahāpīṭhaṃ mahāpīṭhaṃ jayaṃtikāṃ |
pīṭhamarjayinī caiva vicitraṃ kṣīrikābhidhaṃ ||

hastināpūrapīṭhaṃ ca uḍḍīśaṃ ca prayāgakaṃ |
ṣaṣṭhīśaṃ ca tathā pīṭhaṃ māyuḥpuraṃ jaleśvaraṃ ||

malayaṃ ca mahāpīṭhaṃ śrīśailaṃ merukaṅgiriṃ |
mahendraṃ vāmanaṃ caiva hiraṇyapurameva ca ||

mahālakṣmīmayaṃ pīṭhaṃ oḍḍīyānamataḥ paraṃ |
chāyāchatraparaṃ pīṭhaṃ tathaiva parameśvarī ||

pañcāśat pīṭhavinyāsaṃ mātṛkāṃ vinyaset priye ||

gaṇeśaiḥ prathamonyāsaḥ dvitīyastu grahaiḥ smṛtaḥ |
nakṣatraistu tṛtīyaḥ syādyoginībhiścaturthakaḥ ||

rāśibhiḥ paṃcamo jñeyaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ pīṭhairnigadyate |
evaṃ tripurasuṃdaryāḥ ṣoḍhānyāsaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

ṣoḍhānyāsaṃ mahādevīnyaset sākṣāt sadāśivaḥ ||

atha tripurānyāsaḥ ||

tripurākhyaṃ tato nyāsaṃ kuryāt kāmārtha siddhaye |
trivījapūrvā mātṛkādyā ṅenamontā maheśvarī ||

tripurākhyānnyaseddevī mātṛkāyāḥ sthale kramāt |
asyāstunyāsa mātreṇa jīvanmukto bhavennaraḥ ||

atha kāmaratinyāsaḥ ||

atha kāmānnyaseddevī dāḍimī kusuma prabhān |
vāmāṅgaśakti sahitān puṣpavāṇekṣukārmukān ||

śaktistu kuṃkumanibhāḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ |
nīlotpalakarādhyeyā trailokyākarṣaṇakṣamāḥ ||

nyaset kāmaṃ ratīṃ paścāt kāmaprītipareśvarī |
kānteśaḥ kāminī yukto bhrāṃto vai mohinī yutaḥ ||

kāmukaḥ kamalāyuktaḥ kāmacāro vilāsinī |
karṇakalpalate tadvat komalasyāmale tataḥ ||

kāmavarddhana saṃyuktā vijayā caṃḍavismṛtā |
tārāstu vidyayā yukto viśālākṣī yuto namaḥ ||

<p. 187b>

vimalo lalitāyukto rātrinātha digaṃvare |
ratipriyaśca rāmāśca ratināthaśca kubjikā ||

malaśca kāṃtayā yukto ramaṇaḥ satyayāyutaḥ |
niśākaraśca kalyāṇī maṇḍano bhoginī tathā ||

naṃdīśaḥ kāmadāyukto madanaśca sulocana |
sulāvaṇyāyuto devī tathā naṃdāyitābhidhaḥ ||

niśācaraścamedinyā rahitāṅga tataḥ paraṃ |
kalahapriyayāyuktaḥ puṣpadhanvācakāṃkṣiṇī ||

mahādhanuśca sumukhī grāmiṇī nalinī yutaḥ |
bhīmaśca jaṭinī yukto bhrāmaṇe yāminī yutaḥ ||

bhramaṇaḥ śikhinī yuktaḥ śyāmamugdhe tataḥ paraṃ |
bhrāmaṇī ramayā yukto bhṛgurbhūmī tataḥ paraṃ ||

bhrāṃtabhrāmaralolā ca bhrāmāvahasuyaṃcare |
mohano dīrghajihvā ca sevakaśca tathā satī ||

tathā ca mugdhalolākṣī mohavarṇa na bhṛṅginī |
mohanaśca ca peṭā ca manmatho nāthayāsaha ||

mataṅgo māriṇī yukto bhṛṃganā paṃka haṃsinī |
gāyakena samāyukto tathā vai viśvato mukhī ||

gaja nandikayāyukto gītī ca madanaṃtaraṃ |
nartakaḥ saharaṃjinyā lekhaḥ kāṃtiḥ samanvitaḥ ||

unmatta karakaṇṭhī ca mattaścaiva vṛkodarī |
meghaḥ śyāmānvito devī vilaṃvinī kramāt priye ||

akārādyairmātṛkāyā sthāneṣu vinyaset priye |
anena nyāsa yogena trailokya kṣobhako bhavet ||

atha navayo vinyāsaḥ ||

navayonyātmakanyāsaṃvārāvījaistribhiḥ kramāt |
triṣu triṣu ca sthāneṣu vakṣyamāṇa krameṇa ca ||

karṇayościvuke bhūyo maṇḍapo vedane tathā |
netrayornāsi vinyasyedaṃśayorjaṭhare punaḥ ||

tataḥ kūrparayoḥ kukṣau jānūnorliṅgamūrddhani |
pādayorguhyadeśe ca pārśvayorhṛdayāṃbuje ||

stamadvaye kaṇṭhadeśe bījaṃ pratyekakaṃ nyaset |
navayonyātmakaṃ nyāsaḥ proktoyaṃ parameśvariḥ ||

atha krameṇa pīṭhatatva śrīcakranyāsaḥ ||

punarvālāṃ samuccārya caturasraṃ tu ciṃtayet ||

punarvālāṃ samuccārya golakatvena ciṃtayet |
golakanyāsa yogena śrīcakraṃ pariciṃtayet yet ||

ṣaṭcakreṣu lalāṭeṣu sīmaṃte ca śirovile |
navasthāneṣu saṃkalpānyaseddevi tataḥ paraṃ ||

<p. 188a>

atha śrīvidyāgurunyāsāśca ||

śiro lalāṭa bhruvaktra jihvāyat saṃdhikoṭiṣu |
ṣoḍaśārṇānyasedvaktre svarasthāneṣu ca kramāt ||

lalāṭagalahṛnnābhi mūlādhāre ca paṃcakaṃ |
brahmaraṃdhre mukhe svāṃte vījatrayamatho nyaset ||

ādhāra hṛdaye brahmaraṃdhre vījatrayaṃ tataḥ |
karapādeṣu hṛdayaṃ paṃcavījāni vinyaset ||

vyāpakaṃ pālakaṃ kuryān mahāsaubhāgyahetave |
śrīvidyāṃ hṛdaye devī saṃpūrṇāṃ vinyasetsudhīḥ ||

śrīvidyāyāṃ brahmaraṃdhreṣu pṛṣṭhato guravaḥ kramāt ||

atha tithi nityānyāsaḥ ||

tithi nityā tato devī mātṛkā svarasaṃyutā |
mātṛkāvinyasedvaktre sarvasaubhāgyadāyikā ||

atha ṣoḍaśī nityānyāsaḥ ||

prathamā suṃdarī vidyā mahātripurasuṃdarī |
kāmeśvarī samākhyātā tathaiva bhagamālinī ||

nitya klinnā ca bheruṇḍā tathaiva vahnivāsinī |
vajreśvarī ca dūtī ca tvaritā kulasuṃdarī ||

nityā nīlapatākā ca vijayā sarvamaṃgalā |
jvālāmālinī ciṃtrāṃtā paṃcadaśaḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

athaitāsāṃ krameṇa maṃtrānāha ||

śṛṇu devī pravakṣyāmi nityāmaṇḍalamuttamaṃ |
kāmeśvarī mahāvidyā sarvalokavaśaṃkarī ||

vālāvāgbhava hṛccāṃte kāmeśvarī padaṃ likhet |
icchāmaphalaprāptāṃte prade sarvapradaṃ likhet ||

tataḥ satvavaśaṃ vrūyāt kali sarvajagatpradaṃ |
kṣobhanāṃte karaṃ brūyāt hūṁkāra tritayaṃ likhet ||

paṃcavāṇān samālikhya vilomena kumārikāṃ |
eṣā kāmeśvarī vidyā prasaṃgā kathitā priye ||

vāgbhavaṃ bhagaśabdāṃte bhagebhagini cālikhet |
bhagodarī bhagāṃte ca bhagamāre bhagāvahe  ||

bhagaguhya bhagaprānte yoniprāṃte bhagāṅkite |
nipātīni ca sarvāṃte tato bhagavaśaṃkarī ||

bhagarūpe tato likhya nīrajāyatalocane |
nityaklinna bhagaprāṃte svarūpe sarva cālikhet ||

<p. 188b>

bhagānimehyānayeti varadetha samālikhet |
rate surate subhage klinne klinna drave tataḥ ||

kledaye drāvayedve ca sarvasatvān bhageśvarī |
amoghe bhagavicce cakṣu bhayakṣobha sarva ca ||

satvān bhageśvarī vrūyād vāgbhavaṃ plūṁ janmādikaṃ |
bheṁ plūṁ bhoṁ vlūṁ heṁ vlūṁ haiṁ vlūṁ klinne caiva tataḥ punaḥ ||

sarvāṇi ce bhagānyaṃte mevaśaṃ cānayeti ca |
strīvījaṃ cāharaprāṃte balamātmakamakṣaraṃ ||

bhuvaneśīṃ samālikhya vidyeyaṃ bhagamālinī |
prasaṃgāt kathitā vidyā sarvalokavaśīkarī ||

parāvījaṃ samuccārya nityaklinne madadrave |
vahnijāyānvitormaṃtro nityaklinneyamīritā ||

sarvasaubhāgyadā nityaṃ sarvaiśvarya pradāyinī ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya tathāṃkuśayutaṃ likhet |
tanmadhye vilikheddevī bhavoyānmakamakṣaraṃ ||

ca vargamaṃtyahīnaṃ tu vilikhed vahnisaṃsthitaṃ |
caturddaśa svaropetaṃ viṃdunādātmakaṃ pṛthak ||

vahniṃ jāyānvito maṃtro bheruṇḍāyāḥ phalapradaḥ |
bhuvaneśīṃ samuccārya ṅentā ca vahnivāsinī ||

hṛdatoya manurdevi vidyeyaṃ vahnivāsinī ||

praṇavaṃ bhuvane śāṃtīṃ phalamānmakamakṣaraṃ |
sa visarga śaśīpaścānnityaklinne madadrave ||

vahnijāyānvitā vidyā sarvaiśvaryapradāyinī |
mahāvajreśvarī vidyā prasaṃgā ca mayeritā ||

parāvījaṃ samuccārya śivadūtī ca ṅeyutāṃ |
hṛdaṃte ca manuṃ devī dūtīgrā sarvakāmada ||

oṃkāravījamuccārya parāṃte vahumālikhet |
khecachekhaṃ samālikhya strīvījaṃ ca samālikhet ||

hūṁkāraṃ kṣeparācāstraṃ vidyeyaṃ ṣoḍaśākṣarī ||

athavā ||

kheṁ ca strīṁ caiṁ chaṁ hūṁ caiṁ ca kṣeṁ visarga samolikhet |
hūṁkāraṃ ca parādevīṃ vidyeyaṃ dvādaśākṣarī ||

tvaritānāma vidyeyaṃ triṣu lokeṣu durlabhā |
sarvasiṃhāsanamayī vālaiva kulasuṃdarī ||

vālayāpuṭitāṃ kuryāt tathā caitanya bhairavīṃ |
paṃcavāṇāśca deveśi nityā śakrākṣarī bhavet ||

trailokya vimalā vidyā nityā syāt parameśvarī |
paṃcākṣaraṃ vāṇavījaṃ nityayena parāpriye ||

<p. 189a>

praṇavaṃ bhuvaneśānīṃ phalamātmakamakṣaraṃ |
sumātrakaṃ dvitīyaśca bhuvaneśyaṃ kuśaṃ tataḥ ||

nityaśabdaṃ samuddhṛtya saṃbuddhyā tu madadrave |
kavacaṃ cāṃkuśaṃ devī vidyā nīlapatākinī ||

vāṃtaṃ samāyuktaṃ tataḥ śakrasvarānvitaṃ |
vijayāyai namodevī nityāyaṃ vijayāpriye ||

athavā ||

vāṃte kālāgni vāyuśca tataḥ śakravibhūṣitaḥ |
nādaviṃdu kalāyuktā vidyeyaṃ vijayā bhavet ||

caṃdraṃ vāruṇasaṃyuktaṃ tāravījaṃ samālikhet |
tārahṛdbhagavatyaṃte jvālāmālini devi ca ||

dviruccārya ca sarvāṃte bhūtasaṃhārakālike |
jātavedasi saṃlikhya jvalaṃtī padayugmakaṃ ||

jvāleti prajvala dvaṃdvaṃ hūṁkāra dvitayaṃ likhet |
caturthyāṃ tu tato devī likhecca sarvamaṃgalāṃ ||

hṛdayaṃto manurdevī nityeyaṃ sarvamaṃgalā ||

athavā ||

caṃdraṃ vāruṇa saṃyuktaṃ tāravījaṃ samālikhet |
caturthyaṃtāṃ tato devī vilikhet sarvamaṃgalāṃ ||

hṛdayaṃto manurdevi nityeyaṃ sarvamaṃgalā |
vahnivījatrayaṃ hūṁ ca astraṃ svāhānvito manuḥ ||

iyaṃ nityā mahādevī jvālāmālinikāparā |
kavargāṃtaṃ svarāṃtaṃ ca śarasvara vibhūṣitaṃ ||

viṃdunādakalākrāṃtaṃ vicitrā parameśvarī |
akārādiṣu sarvāsu svareṣu kramato yajet ||

(*******) (?) ni śrīnityā 
viśvamātṛkā ||

svaravadvinyasennityāṃ nīrajāyata locane ||

atha prakaṭayoginīnyāsaḥ ||

ādhārādiṣunādeva nādāṃte brahmarandhreke |
prakaṭādyānyaset paścānnyāsaḥ prakaṭayoginī ||

atha rahasyayoginīnyāsaḥ ||

śirolalāṭe bhrūmadhye kaṇṭha hṛnnābhiśekhare |
ādhāravyāpakaṃ yāvadrahasya yoginīṃ nyaset ||

atha sthitinyāsaḥ ||

sthitiṃ nyāsaṃ tataḥ paścācchrī vidyā ṣoḍaśākṣaraiḥ |
paṃcākṣalīṣu karayorbrahmaraṃdhre mukhe hṛdi ||

evaṃ vinyasyanātyādi pādāṃte caiva madrije |
galādi nābhiparyaṃtamaparaṃ hi tataḥ paraṃ ||

brahmaraṃdhrādi kaṇṭhāṃte mekaṃ vinyasya pādayoḥ |
aṃgulīṣu ca vinyasya nyāso'yaṃ sthirakārakaḥ ||

<p. 189b>

atha sṛṣṭinyāsaḥ ||

sṛṣṭinyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryāt sarvasiddhipradāyakaṃ |
brahmaraṃdhrāṃtike bhāle ghrāṇe netre śrutauṣṭake ||

daṃtāṃtorddhvaradhodevi jihvāyāṃgala kūcake |
pṛṣṭhe sarvāṅga hṛdayestana kukṣiṣu liṃgake ||

śrīvidyārṇenyaseddevī maṃtrī sarvasamṛddhaye ||

atha svadehe avyā abhedavudhyā yathokta kāmakalāṃ dhyātvā āyudhanyāsaḥ 
kāryastathā ca ||

evaṃ kāmakalārūpaṃ devatāmayamātmanaḥ |
vapurviciṃtya śivayoḥ'rāyudhānyā samācaret ||

drāṁ drīṁ klīṁ plūṁ saḥ ityete kāmavāṇāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
yāṁ rāṁ lāṁ vāṁ māṁ idaṃ kāmeśvaryāśca vāṇapaṃcakaṃ ||

drādipaṃcayādi paṃcayaṃ saṃmohanasaptamaḥ |
ṅeṃtāt kāmeśvaradhanuḥ ṅenamoṃtaṃ samuddharet ||

anena ca śarānādho haste saṃdhārayeddhanuḥ |
vāmadevyāstathā maṃtrī dhārayedaikṣa vaṃdhanuḥ ||

drādiyādijaṃ jaṃ haṃ netyaṃ kāmeśvari padāṃtike |
vāṇebhyo nama ityetāṃ dakṣiṇādhaḥ kare nije ||

devyāḥ pravinyasedvāṇānyauṣyātyaṃva ca sādhakaḥ |
drādiyādīni bhūyopi mukha ātaṃ sa viṃdukaṃ ||

syād vaśīkaraṇāyaṃti kāmeśvaripradaṃ tataḥ |
pāśāya nama ityaṃtaṃ vāmorddha vinyaset kare ||

yādi drāvīni gagaṇaṃ vahnivāmākṣi viṃdumat |
syād vaśīkaraṇāyeti tataḥ kāmeśvarīti ca ||

pāśāya nama ityevaṃ vāmorddhva vinyaset kare |
drādiyādīnikrāṃ sarvastaṃbhanāya padaṃ tataḥ ||

kāmeśvarī padaṃ paścādaṃkuśāya namo likhet |
dakṣiṇorddhe kare devyā vinyasedaṃ kuśaṃ tataḥ ||

drādiyādīnikroṃ sarvastaṃbhanāya padaṃ tataḥ |
kāmeśvari padādūrddhvamaṃkuśāya namo likhet ||

dakṣiṇorddhe kare devyā vinyasedaṃkuśaṃ tataḥ |
mūlena vyāpakaṃ kṛtvā na ca mudrāḥ pradarśayet ||

atha vyāpakanyāsaḥ ||

sarvāṃge vinyased vidyāṃ vyāpakatena suṃdarī ||

atha nyāsa samayamāha ||

prātaḥkāle'thavā pūjāsamaye homakarmaṇi |
japakālepi vā teṣāṃ viniyogaḥ pṛthak pṛthak ||

<p. 190a>

pūjākāle samastaṃ vā kuryāt sādhakasattamaḥ ||

atha navamudrā pradarśayet ||

tathā ca ||

evaṃ vinyastadehaḥ san mudrā saṃdhārayet kramāt |
anāmābhyāṃ kaniṣṭhābhyāṃ madhyamābhyāṃ kareṇa tu ||

aṃguṣṭāvanujāgnau ca daṃḍavat tarjanī dvayaṃ |
kṣobhiṇīyaṃ mahāmudrā drāviṇī tu nigadyate ||

etasyā eva vidyāyā madhyame tarjanīyute |
sarvavidrāviṇīnāma dvitīyā parikīrtitā ||

etasyā eva vidyāyā tarjanī madhyamāyugaṃ |
aṃkuśākārarūpeṇa yojayet parameśvarī ||

trailokyākarṣaṇī vidyā tṛtīyā parikīrtitā |
puṭākāraukarau kuryāt tarjanyau cāṃkuśākṛtī ||

paripṛṣṭa krameṇātha madhyame tadadho gate |
krameṇa tena manuci kaniṣṭhānāmikādvayaṃ ||

saṃyojyagharṣayet sarvāmaṃguṣṭhā cāgradeśagau |
sarvāvaśakarī mudrā caturthī parameśvarī ||

saṃmukhau tu karau yojyau madhyamāgarbhagenuge |
tarjanībhyāṃ vahiryukta anāme sarale kuru ||

madhyamānakha deśe tu tatoṃguṣṭhau ca daṃḍavat |
unmādinīnāma mudrā paṃcamī parikīrtitā ||

krameṇa paṃcavāṇānāṃ manavaḥ parikīrtitā |
etasyā eva vidyāyāstarjanyau madhyamāvuje ||

kuryānmahāṃkuśākārau mudreyaṃ tu mahāṃkuśā |
aṃkuśākhyaṃ mahābījaṃ manurasyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

vāmadakṣiṇavāhuṃ tu dakṣiṇaṃ savyahastagaṃ |
vāhuṃ kuryāt tato devī hastau saṃgharṣayet kramāt ||

kaniṣṭhānāmikā dvaṃdvaṃ madhyamā pṛṣṭagaṃ tataḥ |
tarjanī madhyamaṃ kuryādubhayatra maheśvarī ||

aṃguṣṭau sakalau kṛtvā pārthive yojayedimāṃ |
khecarīyaṃ mahāmudrā trailokya kṣobhakāriṇī ||

vijayādyaṃ mahāvījaṃ manurasyāḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
eṣā samaya mudre ca sarveṣāṃ parikīrtitā ||

parispṛṣṭau karau devitvarddha caṃdrākṛtī tataḥ |
tarjanyaṃguṣṭhayugalaṃ yugapat yojayet tathā ||

tryadhaḥ kaniṣṭāvaṣṭaṣve madhyamena tu yojayet |
anāmike ca kuṭile sarvādhastānni yojayet ||

vījamudreya vikhyātā manurasyā hasaumiti |
pūrvoktā yonimudrā tu navamī parikīrtitā ||

śakti vṛṃde sphuraṃtīyaṃ tasmāt sādhāraṇī bhavet |
vāgbhavaṃ manuretasyā yato viśvasya mātṛkā ||

evaṃ vinyasta dehaḥ sanmudrāsannaddha vigrahaḥ |
aṃtaryāgavidhiṃ kuryād yena sākṣāt svayaṃ vibhuḥ ||

<p. 190b>

aṃtaryāgavidhiṃ kṭvā vahiryajanamācaret |
arghyādi sthāpanaṃ kṛtvā śrīcakraṃ vai samuddharet ||

atha śrīcakramāha ||

viṃdutrikoṇa vasukoṇa daśārayugmamanvaśra nāgadala saṃyuta ṣoḍaśāraṃ |
vṛttatrayaṃ ca dharaṇī sadanatrayaṃ ca śrīyaṃtrarājamuditaṃ paradevatāyāḥ ||

etadyaṃtraṃ trivṛtta rahitamiti kecit tathā ca |
caturvahniṃ samutpādya paṃcaśaktiṃ tataḥ śive ||

prāk pratyat kramamārgeṇa marmasaṃdhyādikaṃ bhavet |
aṣṭādaśaṃ tu marmāṇi caturviṃśati saṃdhayaḥ ||

caturbhiścaiva śrīkarṇaiḥ paṃcakaiḥ śivaśaktibhiḥ |
cakra krameṇa yuktābhiḥ saṃvaddhābhiḥ parasparaṃ ||

navacakrasvarūpeṇa śaṃbhostu bhava śaktibhiḥ |
catvāriṃśa trayaḥ koṇāḥ vṛttaṃ cāṣṭadalaṃ tathā ||

punarvṛttaṃ kalā patraṃ trivṛttaṃ bhūpuratrayaṃ |
caturddaśītamārabhya bhūpurāṃtaṃ maheśvarī ||

catvāri śiva cakrāṇi śakti cakrāṇi vai śṛṇu |
caturddaśāramārabhya trikoṇāṃtaṃ maheśvarīṃ ||

paṃca vai śakti cakrāṇi dakṣiṇāmūrti saṃmate ||

athavā ||

ānaṃdabhairavamate cakrāṇi śṛṇu yatnataḥ |
caturdaśāramārabhya bhūpurāṃtaṃ maheśvarī ||

catvāri śivacakrāṇi śāktāni śṛṇu yatnataḥ |
vahirdaśāramārabhya viṃdvaṃtaṃ parameśvarī ||

paṃca vai śakti cakrāṇi trivṛttarahitaṃ priye ||

atha likhanaprakāramāha ||

tatrādaumānaṃ yathā ||

racayet sthaṃḍile yaṃtraṃ hastamātraṃ tathā bhuvi |
ratnādiṣu vinirmāṇe mānamicchāvaśād bhavet ||

bhedaḥ saṃkathito devi racanāṃ śṛṇu yatnataḥ |
tatra prāṅmukha āsīnaścakrarājaṃ samālikhet ||

bhūpradeśe sameramye siṃdūrarajasātha vā |
kuṃkumādya rajobhiśca bhūmau cakraṃ samālikhet ||

ṛjurekhaṃ netraramyaṃ saṃdhiṃ bheda samaṃ kuru |
atha vāhena raupyābhyāṃ tāmre vā vahudhātubhiḥ ||

paṭṭaṃ viracya śrīkhaṇḍaraktacaṃdana nirmite |
paṭṭe saṃsthāpya vilikhellekhanyā hemayā priye ||

rocanā kuṃkumābhyāṃ tu kastūrīcaṃdanādibhiḥ ||

<p. 191a>

īśānādagniparyaṃtamṛjurekhāṃ samālikhet |
īśānādagnestadagrābhyāṃ rekhe cākṛṣya deśikaḥ ||

ekīkṛtya ca cāruṇyāṃ śaktirekhā parāpriye |
trikoṇākāra rūpāstu tasyā upari saṃlikhet ||

trikoṇākārarūpāṃ tu śaktidvaya mudāhṛtaṃ |
pūrvaśaktyagrabhāgeṣṭa mānayaṣṭi vadā caret ||

rekhāṃ tu parameśāni vāyurākṣasa koṇagāṃ |
saṃdhibheda krameṇaiva tayoḥ śaktyoḥ tataḥ paraṃ ||

rekhe cākṛṣya koṇābhyāṃ tadagrāt pūrvage kuru |
vahnimaṇḍalametaṃ tu pūrvāgāṃ vīravaṃdite ||

cakradvayama bhūdaṃte tataḥ śṛṇu varānane |
pūrvaśaktiḥ sa vahnibhyāṃ koṇābhyāṃ suravaṃdite ||

pūrvarekhāstu vistārya tathā paścimavahnitaḥ |
vāyurākṣasa koṇābhyāṃ rekhāṃ paścimagāṃ tathā ||

vistārya yojayeddevī saṃdhibheda krameṇa tu |
yonyagrahāṃ pūrvadeśe dakṣiṇottarataḥ kramāt ||

tathā rekhe yonisaṃsthaṃ paścimasyā diśi kramāt |
koṇābhyāṃ yojayitvā tu daśakoṇaṃ tadā bhavet ||

tathaiva devadeveśi dvitīyaṃ daśakoṇakaṃ |
īśāna vahnige rekhe pūrvayonyāgrayoḥ kramāt ||

vāyurākṣasa koṇāgre rekhe vistārya suṃdari |
paścimāgre tato devī yojayedindra digpate ||

ekatra pūrvakoṇāgre cuṃvinīṃ tu manoharīṃ |
yojayed devadeveśi yathā paṃktyamukaṃ bhavet ||

daśakoṇasya deveśi tyaktvā koṇa catuṣṭayaṃ |
daśakoṇāṃtare devi madhye rekhāṃ pravāsayet ||

tadvaddakṣiṇabhāte tu tathā cottabhāgake |
ṣaṭkoṇasya tato devī saṃdhibhedaḥ krameṇa tu ||

yoniṃ vahniṃ ca saṃyojya śakrāraṃ jāyate yathā |
kakṣā madhye gatāṃ rekhāṃ ṛjurūpāṃ tu yojayet ||

ṛjvā kṛtiryathā devi jāyateti manoharaṃ |
saṃmukhaṃ paṃcaśaktyagraṃ prāṅmukhaṃ caturagnikaṃ ||

viṃduṃ trikoṇamadhyāṃśa cakrametadvarānane |
madhye cakraṃ tu jānī hi daśārayugaraṃ tathā ||

śakrakoṇāṃkitaṃ devi vāhyamadhyāṃtakaṃ bhavet |
etaccakraṃ maheśāni sarvasaubhāgyavarddhanaṃ ||

sarvasāmrājyavaṃ devī sarvopadravanāśanaṃ |
aneka hayamāṇikya suvarṇa paripūrakaṃ ||

mahāmokṣapadaṃ devi vāgvilāsakalaṃ mahat |
etadvāhya maheśāni vṛttaṃ pūrṇeṃdu sannibhaṃ ||

<p. 191b>

tadyutaṃ kurumīnākṣi vasupatraṃ manoharaṃ |
tataḥ ṣoḍaśapatraṃ tu vilikhya suravaṃdite ||

caturasraṃ caturdvārasahitaṃ parameśvari |
catuḥṣaṣṭiryataḥ koṭyo yoginīnāṃ mahāmate ||

cakresmin sa viśeṣāstu sādhakaṃ mānayaṃti hi ||

athāsyāvayavabhedena saṃjñāvarṇā phalānyāha ||

caturasraṃ mātṛkārṇairmaṇḍitaṃ siddhihetave |
muktāmāṇikya ghaṭitaṃ samastaravirājitae ||

trailokyamohanaṃ nāma kalpadruma phalaṃpradaṃ |
ṣoḍaśāraṃ caṃdraviṃvarūpaṃ tu sakalālayaṃ ||

sarvāśāpūrakaṃ bhadre sravet pīyūṣavarddhitaṃ |
aṣṭapatraṃ maheśāni javākusumasannibhaṃ ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇaṃ nāma sarvakāma prapūrakaṃ |
etaddvayaṃ varārohe sṛṣṭicakraṃ śubhapradaṃ ||

sarvāmnāyādi devyāstu maṇḍitaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
caturdaśāraṃ deveśi dāḍimī kusumaprabhaṃ ||

anaṃtaphaladaṃ bhadre sarvasaubhāgyadaṃ sadā |
daśāraṃ taptahemābhaṃ siṃdūraṃ sadṛśaṃ priye ||

sarvārthasādhakaṃ cakraṃ ciṃtitaṃ manasā sadā |
dvitīyamapi paṃktyagraṃ javā kusumasannibhaṃ ||

sarvarakṣākaraṃ cakraṃ na (*****) (?) śive |
etat trayaṃ maheśānisthiti cakraṃ sukhapradaṃ ||

dakṣiṇāmnāya pūjāṃ ca yathepsita phalapradaṃ |
aṣṭakoṇaṃ varārohe vālārka kiraṇāruṣaṃ ||

padmarāga samaprakhyaṃ sarvarogaharaṃ sadā |
udyat sūrya sahasrābhaṃ vaṃdhūka kusumaprabhaṃ ||

sarvasiddhipradaṃ cakraṃ sa kalālayamīśvarī |
trikoṇaṃ sarvasaṃbhūtaṃ kāraṇaṃ bhūtidaṃ sadā ||

viṃducakraṃ varārohe sarvānaṃdaṃ mayaṃ priye |
sadāśivamayaṃ cakranāyakaṃ parameśvarī ||

etaccakraṃ tu saṃhārarūpaṃ brahmamayaṃ sadā |
paścimāmnāya saṃsevyaṃ trayamatra prapūjitaṃ ||

śrīkaivalyapradānācca (********) 
(?) |
caturvarga pradānācca śrīcakramiti kathyate ||

athāsya merurūpamaṃtrātmakatvamāha ||

śrīcakramapi deveśi (**) (?) rūpaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
lakāraḥ pṛthivī vījaṃ tena bhūviṃvamucyate ||

<p. 192a>

sakāraścaṃdramā bhadre kalāḥ ṣoḍaśa rūpadhṛk |
tasmāt ṣoḍaśapatraṃ tu hakāraḥ śiva ucyate ||

aṣṭamūrtiḥ sadābhadre tasmādaṣṭadalaṃ bhavet |
ikārastu samādāmāyā bhuvanāni caturdaśaḥ ||

pālayaṃti parātasmācchakrakoṇaṃ bhavet priye |
śaktirekhā daśasthāne sthitvā sūtre jagattrayaṃ ||

viśvajyotiritikhyātā sā viṣṇurdaśarūpiṇī |
rakārāt parameśāni cakraṃ vyāpya vijṛṃbhate ||

daśakoṇakarī tasmāt prakāro jyotiravyayaṃ |
kalādaśānvito vahni daśakoṇa pravartakaḥ ||

kakārānmādanaṃ devī śivaṃ cāṣṭa svarūpakaṃ |
yoniramya tadā cakraṃ vasuyonyaṃkitaṃ bhavet ||

arddhamātrāguṇān bhūtānāgarūpādyataḥ sthitā |
trikoṇarūpā yonistu viṃdunā vaiṃdavaṃ bhavet ||

kāmeśvara svarūpaṃ ca viśvādhāra svarūpakaṃ ||

atha darśanaphalaṃ ||

samyak kratuśataṃ kṛtvā yatphalaṃ samavāpnuyāt |
tatphalaṃ labhate bhaktyā kṛtvā śrīcakradarśanaṃ ||

mahāṣoḍaśadānāni kṛtvāyallabhate phalaṃ |
tatphalaṃ samavāpnoti kṛtvā śrīcakramuttamaṃ ||

sārddhatrikoṭi tīrtheṣu snātvā yat phalamaśnute |
tatphalaṃ labhate baktyā kṛtvā śrīcakradarśanaṃ ||

atha pūjāphalaṃ ||

koṭiliṃga pratisthāyāṃ yatphalaṃ samudāhṛtaṃ |
tatphalaṃ labhate nūnaṃ śrīcakrasya ca pūjanāt ||

atha dānaphalaṃ ||

śrīcakraṃ kārayitvā tu yo dadyāt sādhakāya ca |
bhūcakraṃ tena dattaṃ hi sa śailavana sāgaraṃ ||

atha śrīcakrapādodakaphalaṃ ||

gaṃgāpuṣkaranarmadā ca yamunā godāvarī gomatī gaṃgādvāra gayā prayāga 
vadarī vārāṇasī siddhiṣu |
revāsetu sarasvatī prabhṛtiṣu brahmāṇḍa bhāṇḍodare tīrthasnāna sahasrakoṭi 
phaladaṃ śrīcakrapādodakaṃ ||

atha sāmānyapīṭhe punarasyāḥ yo viśeṣastamāha ||

mahācakrasya saṃsthānaṃ bāvayet sthiramānasaḥ |
udyaccaṃdrodayākṣudhva raktapīyūṣavāridheḥ ||

madhye haimamayīṃ bhūmiṃ smarenmāṇikyamaṇḍitāṃ |
navaratnamayaṃ dvīpaṃ svaprabhā paṭalairdiśāṃ ||

<p. 192b>

mukhāni śoṇiyaṃtraṃ ca lelihānaṃ nabhasthalaṃ |
iti sāhasrasaṃkhyābhiryojanānāṃ suvistaraṃ ||

tanmadhye naṃdanodyānaṃ madanonmādanaṃ mahat |
karuṇātoya parikhaṃ svarṇaprākāraveṣṭitaṃ ||

nityābhyudita pūrṇendu jyotsnāmālā virājitaṃ |
sadā sahavasaṃtena kāmadevena rakṣitaṃ ||

prāṃtevakula punnāga nāgakeśarapaṃcakaiḥ |
pārijātāṃ munāraṃganāgaraṃgāti muktikaiḥ ||

elālavaṃga kakkolamālatī mallikādibhiḥ |
jamvīra madhujamvīra dāḍimī mātu liṅgakaiḥ ||

sephālikā nārikelaiḥ kadalī pūgapādapaiḥ |
nāgavallīmuralatā cakravallī latādibhiḥ ||

kālāguru mahendrendu kapittha paṇasādibhiḥ |
kharjūrītāla śrītālīhiṃtālī devadārubhiḥ ||

pāṭalī yūthikājātī sallatī latikādibhiḥ |
sa tomara ca niṣpaṃdī kadaṃbaṃ ca uḍuṃvaraiḥ ||

vṛttaṃ madhukamṛdvīkaśāmakuṃddhā dalairapi |
atisphuranmahodāra divyakalpadrumādibhiḥ ||

sarvadā phalasaṃpannaiḥ sarvatra kusumojjvalaiḥ |
hrīṃkāramukharairbhṛṃgairmāyadbhiḥ kokilairvṛtaṃ ||

mādyat kokilasallāpavācāli tadigaṃtaraṃ |
unmattaśukasaṃvādhakatva kūjitajṛṃbhitaṃ ||

sārikāmadhurālāpa saṃpūrita namoṃtaraṃ |
cakora cakrakāraṃdusārasālī virājitaṃ ||

makaraṃdurasonmattamarāla mithunojvala |
jātīpunnāgasaṃmiśra parāgapaṭalotkaraiḥ ||

marudbhirmaddha saṃcārairāceṣṭita jagattrayaṃ |
nānāpuṣpalatākalpa sevitaṃ vṛkṣa khaṃḍakaiḥ ||

paryaṃka dīrghakot phullakamalotpalasaṃbhavaiḥ |
rajobhirdhūsaraiḥ samyaksevitaṃ malayānilaiḥ ||

dhyātvaivaṃ naṃdanodyānaṃtadaṃtaḥ praṇavaṃ smaret |
śuddhakāṃcana karpūravālukābhiralaṃkṛtaṃ ||

sevārthamutsukoneka surasiddha niṣevitaṃ |
tanmadhye maṃḍapaṃ dhyāyed vyāptaṃ brahmāṇḍa maṇḍalaṃ ||

taruṇāditya saṃkāśaṃ caturasraṃ suśobhanaṃ |
ratnatejaḥ prabhāpuṃjaḥ piṃjarīkṛta diṅmukhaṃ ||

madhyestaṃbha vinirmuktaṃ koṇastaṃbha virājitaṃ |
mahāmāṇikya vaiḍūrya ratnakāṃcana nirmitaṃ ||

<p. 193a>

muktādāmavitānāḍhyaṃ ratnasopāna maṇḍitaṃ |
samaṃ vāyusamākrāṃtaṃ gaṃdhadhūpataraṃgitaṃ ||

jātīcaṃpaka punnāgaketakī mallikādibhiḥ |
gaṃdhotpalasitāṃbhojamādhavī himavedibhiḥ ||

ratnakāṃcana vaiḍūrya muktā nirmitapakṣakaiḥ |
ratnacāmaraghaṃṭādi vimānairūpaśobhitaṃ ||

vaddhvābhiścitra mālābhiḥ saṃsṛtābhiralaṃkṛtaṃ |
ratnaputtalikā koṭibhūṣitaṃ paramādbhutaṃ ||

nānāratnādibhirdivyaiścitritaiṃ viśvakarmaṇā |
tanmadhye vedikāṃ dhyāyet vipulāṃ śatabhojanāṃ ||

sahasrādi saṃkāśāmeka māṇikyanirmitāṃ |
caturdvāra samopetāṃ maṇikyadvāratoraṇāṃ ||

pradīpaiḥ pūrṇakuṃbhaiśca sarvataḥ samalaṃkṛtāṃ |
dhyātvaivaṃ vedikā madhye pīṭhaḥ caṃdrakalāmayaṃ ||

caṃdrakāṃta śilākḷptaścatuścaraṇaśobhitaṃ |
nānāmāṇikya ratnādi citra yatra manoharaṃ ||

japāruṇa lasadvastra samākīrṇa mahāmṛdu |
talpaṃ mahopadhānena maṃḍitaṃ pāṭalāvaraṃ ||

ev'm śrīcakrasaṃsthānaṃ dhyātvā pūjāṃ samārabhet ||

paścimādi tu madhyāṃtaṃ vilomena maheśvarī |
navaratnamayaṃ dvīpaṃ navakhaṇḍa virājitaṃ ||

mātṛkādyana tannāmnā namoṃ tena samarcayet ||

athoktarītyā pīṭhamabhyarcya kāmakalā pūrvikāṃ devīṃ dhyātvā śrīyaṃtra 
viṃdā vā cāhayet anyāsā tripuraviṃdu trayaṃ nāstyaiva śāstrataḥ ||

viṃdu trayorddha mātrābhiḥ kevalaṃ viśvamātṛkā |
tattasmāt kāraṇāddevī tripurāśaktirucyate ||

viṃdutraya samāyogāṃ triviṃdau tripurāsthitā ||

viṃduṃ saṃkalpayedvaktraṃ tadadhasthāṃ kucadvayaṃ |
tadadhastva parārddhaṃ ca ciṃtayet tadadho mukhaṃ ||

evaṃ kāmakalārūpā sākṣādakṣararūpiṇī |
tatrasthe vaindave pīṭhe tatra nityakalāṃvuje ||

tatra kāmeśvare pīṭhe niṣṇāṃ tat sadharmiṇī |
ājñāloka trayeśānīṃ brahmaviklīśa śāsanī ||

akārādi kṣakārāṃtā varṇāvayava suṃdarī |
mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ viśataṃ tu svarūpiṇīṃ ||

udyadbhāsvat samābhāsāṃ javā kusumasannibhāṃ |
sadyaḥ satapta hemābhāṃ dāḍimī kusumojvalāṃ ||

<p. 193b>

sugaṃdhodvāmakusuma pūrvadhammillarājitāṃ |
tanuketakasaṃrājannīlaṃ bhramarakuṃtalāṃ ||

bhṛṃgarekhā sphuranmukto māṇikya tilakojvalāṃ |
sphuradratnāvalīramyā mukuṭojvalakiṃkiṇīṃ ||

āraktaka sphuraccaṃdravadanāṃ vidrumādhamāṃ |
rājaccaṃdrakalā sphūrti tilakāṃ ca samujvalāṃ ||

karṇaṃyuṃ visphurannīlalokṣikṣepasuṃdarīṃ |
hāramuktāvalī rājatsvarṇatāṭaṃkarājitāṃ ||

karṇabhūṣaṇa tejobhiḥ kapolasthalamaṃjirāṃ |
mukhacaṃdrojvalachukrākaramauktikanāsikāṃ ||

smitamādhūryavijita brahmavidyā rasapradāṃ |
rājadvidrumavallībha vāhuvallī virājitāṃ ||

raktotpaladalākāra sukumāra karāṃbujāṃ |
karāṃvuja nakhajyotsnā virājita nabhasthalāṃ ||

suvṛtta niviḍottuṅga kucabhārālasāṃ śivāṃ |
navamuktā mahāhārapatanonnata vakṣasaṃ ||

śātodarī nimnacābhiṃkṣābha madhyama suṃdarīṃ |
anarghya ratnaghaṭita mekhalā lagnakiṃkiṇīṃ ||

nitaṃvaviṃva subhagāṃ romarāji virājitāṃ |
raktāṃśuka sphurattejo vyāpta trailokyamaṇḍalīṃ ||

divyakaṃcukasaṃrājadratna citravicitritāṃ |
kadalī lalitastaṃbha sukumārorujājitāṃ ||

navaratna sphurattejo maṃjīravyāpta devatāṃ |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśāni sphuranmauli padāṃvujāṃ ||

karpūra sakalonmiśra tāṃbūla pūgitānanāṃ |
pravālavallīghaṭitavāṃśaṃkṣauma guṇānvitāṃ ||

dvitīyā caṃdrarekhāṃkaśṛṇīmākarṣaṇakṣamaṃ |
saddīptyā bhrāmarī bhūtaguṇamikṣu śarāsanaṃ ||

kamalākārasaṃrājatpaṃcavāṇāśca vibhratīṃ |
mahanmṛgamadodāma kuṃkumāruṇa vigrahāṃ ||

sarvābharaṇa śobhāḍhya sarvālaṃkārarājitāṃ |
srvadevamayī devīṃ sarvācāraḥ svarūpiṇīṃ ||

sarvasaubhāgyajananīṃ sarvasaubhāgyasuṃdarīṃ |
evaṃ dhyāyan mahādevī kadamvavana madhyagāṃ ||

athavā pādādārabhya śiroṃtaṃ dhyāyet ||

udyat sūrya sahasrābhāṃ vaṃdhūka kusumaprabhāṃ |
javākusumasaṃkāśāṃ padmarāga samaprabhāṃ ||

taḍitpuṃjanibhāṃ taptāṃ kāṃcanābhāṃ pareśvarīṃ |
raktotpaladalākāra pādapallavarājitāṃ ||

<p. 194a>

anarghya ratnaracita maṃjīra caraṇadvayāṃ |
pādāṃgulīyakakṣipta ratnatejo virājitāṃ ||

kadalī lalitastaṃbha sukumāra urudvayāṃ |
nitaṃva viṃva vilasadraktavastra pariskṛtāṃ ||

mekhalāvaddhamāṇikya kiṃkiṇī nādavibhramāṃ |
arakṣamadhyamā nimnanābhīcchātodarīṃ parīṃ ||

rāmarājīlato bhūtamahāphala ivānvitāṃ |
saṃvṛtta niviḍottuṃga kucamaṇḍala rājitāṃ ||

anarghya mauktika sphārahārābhārādharārjitāṃ |
navaratnamayodīptagraiveya varabhūṣaṇāṃ ||

śrutibhūṣā manohārī kapolasthala maṃjarī |
udyadādityasaṃkāśātāṭaṃka sumukhaprabhāṃ ||

pūrṇacaṃdramukha prakṣavadanāṃbhojalohitāṃ |
sphuranmadanakodaṇḍa subhravāṃ padmalocanāṃ ||

lalāṭe paṭṭasaṃrājasadratna latikāṃkitāṃ |
muktāmāṇikya ghaṭita mukuṭasthala kiṃkiṇīṃ ||

sphuraccaṃdrakalārājanmukuṭāṃ locanatrayāṃ |
pravālavallī vilasadvāhuvallī catuṣṭayaṃ ||

ikṣuko daṇḍa puṣpeṣu pāśāṃkuśa catuṣṭayāṃ |
sarvadevamayīmamvāṃ sarvasaubhāgyasuṃdarīṃ ||

sarvatīrthamayīṃ devīṃ sarvadevasvarūpiṇīṃ |
sarvaśāstramayīṃ nityā sarvāmara namaskṛtāṃ ||

sarvāmnāyamayīṃ devīṃ sarvāya tanasevitāṃ |
sarvānaṃdamayīṃ jñānamātṛkāṃ siddhidāṃ parāṃ ||

athāvāhanamaṃtra trikhaṃḍā mudrevāha ||

mahāpadmavanāṃtasthe kāraṇānaṃda vigrahe |
sarvabhūtahite mātarehyehi parameśvarī ||

pūrvokta yonimudrāyā pṛthak khaṇḍatrayaṃ kuru |
aṃguṣṭābhyāṃ kaniṣṭābhyāṃ madhyamābhyāṃ kareṇa tu ||

trikhaṇḍanāma mudreyaṃ tripurāhvānakarmaṇi |
vahannāḍīpuṭadvāre nāgatāṃ ciṃtayet tataḥ ||

kāmeśvara śivasyāṃke sthāpayet kulasuṃdari |
vidyāyāhvānarūpiṇyā mudrayā ca trikhaṃḍayā ||

saṃsthitāṃ ciṃtayet tatra śrīpīṭhāṃ tannivāsinīṃ |
mudrāḥ saṃdarśayeddevī tarpaṇaistu tridhā yajet ||

sāṃgaṃ saṃkalpayeddeha devyāstu parameśvarī |
gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādīni devyaiḥ samyak nivedayet ||

upacāraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhiḥ saṃpūjya paradevatāṃ |
rarpaṇāni punardadyāt trivāraṃ mūlavidyayā ||

<p. 194b>

etasmin samaye devī tithi nityāḥ samarcayet ||

kāmeśvaryādikā nityā vicitrāṃtā maheśvarī |
pratipatyaurṇamāsyāṃtaṃ tithirūpāḥ prapūjayet ||

vibhāvya ca mahānnyāsamagradakṣottaraṃ kramāt |
rekhā suvilikhet tatra paṃcapaṃca krameṇa tu ||

akārādikṣakārāṃtaṃ dakṣiṇāsyāṃ viciṃtayet |
tataḥ svapūrvarekhāyāṃ dīrghakarṇā vipaṃcakaṃ ||

vilikhyottara rekhāyāṃ śaktyādi vilikhet tataḥ |
anusvārāṃta mātrāstu visargā ṣoḍaśīṃ yajet ||

vāmāvartena deveśi nityā ṣoḍaśa kīrtitāḥ |
pratipattithimārabhya paurṇamāsyaṃ tamadrije ||

ekaikāṃ pūjayennityāṃ mahāsaubhāgyamāpnuyāt |
kṛṣṇapakṣe maheśāni pūjayet tithimaṃḍale ||

vicitrādyā varārohe yāvat kāmeśvarī bhavet |
pūjanīyā vilomena krameṇāpi maheśvarī ||

kalā ṣoḍaśa deveśi yāvaccaṃdrakalāḥ kramāt |
sa saubhāgyaṃ mahādevī prāpnoti guruṇā sanāt ||

kāmeśvaryādikā nityā pūjayitvā tataḥ kramāt |
tithi nityā tridhā devī pūjayedbhāgya hetave ||

punaḥ śrītripurānityāṃ yajet saubhāgya hetave ||

etasmin samaye devi gurūn saṃpūjayedvudhaḥ |
puṣpasaṃkoca yogena kathayāmitavānaghe ||

raśmi vṛṃda (****) (?) guruṇāṃ ca 
śatādhikaṃ |
jñātvā saṃkocayet puṣpaṃ mamihāsiddhihānidā ||

puṣpasaṃkocayennācenaṣṭaṃ dvādaśa saṃtatiṃ |
saṃtatyā naṣṭarūpā ca na bhaveddevatā priye ||

ata eva mahāpuṣpaḥ samyak saṃkucitaṃ priye |
kāmarājākhya vidyāyā guruvastu samṛddhitā ||

madhye prāk tryasra madhyepi gurupaṃktiṃ tridhā yajet |
parākhyā nyūjayedādau parāpara vibhaktikān ||

tataḥ parāndevadevi gurut saṃpūjayet priye |
divyaughāstu parā siddhiḥ saptasaṃkhyā varānane ||

ānandanātha śabdāṃtā vijñeyo vīravaṃdite |
paraprakāśo deveśi tataḥ paraśivomataḥ ||

parāśaktistathā devī kauleśvara iti priye |
śuklā devī kuleśāna kāmeśvaryādikāḥ kramāt ||

<p. 195a>

munisaṃkhyāstu guravaḥ parākhyā divyarūpiṇaḥ |
bhogāḥ kiṃ nastu samayoḥ vedākhyā sahajāstathā ||

parāparākhyāḥ siddhaughaṃ mānavaughaṃ śṛṇu priye |
gagaṇo viśvakamalau madanābhuvanastathā ||

līlasvātmamaye paścānnāga saṃkhyā tu mānavaḥ |
aparā parameśāni akṣarāṇi yatā ime ||

etat trayaṃ tu niyataṃ deśikānyaṃ hitāya ca |
mayoddhataṃ maheśāni puṣpa saṃkucitaṃ priye ||

mānavaughāṃtikaṃ paścāt svagurutritayaṃ yajet |
parameṣṭhī guruḥ paścādguruḥ paramasaṃjñakaṃ ||

svaguruśca maheśāni pūjayecca gurutrayaṃ |
athavā mānavaughāṃte ekaṃ svagurumarcayet ||

ayaṃ prakāraḥ kathitaḥ prakārāṃtaramucyate ||

aṃtyaṃ sarvaprakārāṇāṃ mānavaughāstakaṃ tathā |
guravo navasaṃkhyātā eva saṃkhyā bhavaṃti hi ||

navacakreśvarī yasmāt tāvat puṣpaṃ prakāśayet |
mānavaughe tadā devī daśasapta bhavaṃti hi ||

paścāt saṃkocayet puṣpaṃ navamaṃ śrīguruṃ yajet ||

ājñātta guruśiṣyāṇāṃ kathayāmitavānaghe |
gurubhyo nama uccārya pādukābhyāṃ namo likhet ||

guruṃ tu paramāṃte ca parameṣṭhyāṃtake tathā |
eteṣāṃ pādukāṃstadvadācāryebhyo namo bhavet ||

gurupaṃkti prapūjyātha svayaṃ śrītripurā bhavet |
gurupaṃkti vihīnastu puruṣaḥ paṃktivarjitaḥ ||

puṣpasaṃkocamārgeṇa mayā siddhiḥ kṛtā priye |
kṛpayā parameśāni sādhakānāṃ hitāya ca ||

gurukramaṃ prapūjyātha yajedāmnāya devatā |
trailokyamohane cakre sarvāśā paripūrake ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhake cakre pūrvāmnāyaṃ prapūjayet |
sarvasaubhagyake cakre tathā sarvārthasādhake ||

sarvarakṣākare cakre dakṣiṇāmnāyamarcayet |
navacakreṣu deveśi kuveromnāyamarcayet ||

vaiṃdavaḥ parameśāni madhye siṃhāsanaṃ yajet |
anenaiva prakāreṇa pūjayecca parāṃvikāṃ ||

śrīvidyā ca tathā lakṣmīrmahālakṣmīstathaiva ca |
triśaktitvaritā caiva lakṣmīḥ paṃcaprakīrtitāṃ ||

<p. 195b>

śrīvidyā ca paraṃ jyotirparānihvalaśāṃbhavī |
ajapā mātṛkā ceti paṃcakoṣāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

śrīvidyāpārijāteśī paṃcavāṇeśvarī tathā |
trikūṭā paṃcavāṇeśī paṃcakalpalatāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

śrīvidyā mūlapīṭheśī sudhā śrīramṛteśvarī |
siddhi lakṣmīti vikhyātā paṃcakāmadughāsmṛtāḥ ||

śrīvidyā annapūrṇā ca mātaṃgī bhuvaneśvarī |
vārāhīṃ ca mahādevī paṃcaratnāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

śrīvidyāpūjanasthāne cakrarājo maheśvarī |
mahālakṣmīśvarī vṛṃdamaṇḍitāsanasaṃsthitā ||

sarvasaubhāgyajananī śrīvidyā pūjayāmi ca |
ityuccārya paraṃ jyotiḥ koṇāśca pūjayet sudhīḥ ||

anenaiva prakāreṇa pūjayet paṃcapaścikāṃ ||

atha krameṇāsāṃ maṃtrānāha ||

mūlavidyā maheśāni śrīvidyāḥ parikīrtitā ||

vāruṇāṃtaṃ vahnisaṃsthaṃ viṃdunāda samanvitāṃ |
lakṣmī devyai padaṃ proktā lakṣmī vījamudāhṛtaṃ ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya hrīmātmaka samarcayet |
śrīpuṭaṃ cānu kamalekamalāya prasīda tu ||

lāya madhye gatāṃ bhūmiṃ rudrasthāne niyojayet |
prasīda yugalaṃ dadyācchrīvījaṃ bhuvaneśvarīṃ ||

śriyo vījāṃ tato dadyānmahālakṣmī vahṛnmanaḥ |
saptaviṃśati varṇānnā mahālakṣmī manurmataḥ ||

śrīvījaṃ ca parāvījaṃ kāmavījaṃ samālikhet |
iyaṃ triśaktirdeveśi triṣu lokeṣu durlabhā ||

caṃdreṇa sādaraṃ lakṣmī devī dīrghākṣi maṇḍitāṃ |
viṣṇukūleśvarī vidyā prasaṃgāt kathitāpriye ||

trivījaṃ ca parāvījaṃ sakāmi tripuṭoditā |
paṃcakāmeśvarī vidyāvāṇābhyāse samīritā ||

vāgbhavaṃ vāmanetraṃ ca dhruvāṃtaṃ viṃdusaṃyutaṃ |
mūlapīṭheśvarī vidyā suguptā kathitā mayā ||

parāvījaṃ tu śrīvījaṃ valemānmakamakṣaraṃ |
rājyaderājyalakṣmīti caṃdraḥ sargavibhūṣitaḥ ||

vilomanādyavījāni sudhāḥ śrīsampramāśitā |
vāgbhavaṃ bhuvaneśānīṃ śrīvījaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

<p. 196a>

vipattadādi khaphare nityavastu samālikhet |
viyattadādikāṃtaṃ ca phromityeva manurmataḥ ||

cavarga tṛtīyaturyaṃ māyārephendu saṃyutaṃ |
mahāmakhaṃ samuddhṛtya saṃkarṣaṇi padaṃ likhet ||

kāli mahādiruktvā ca vipadiṃduḥ samanvitāṃ |
māyāvījaṃ ca kathitaṃ siddhilakṣmyāḥ mahāmanuṃ ||

annapūrṇā ca deveśi uttarāmnīya kīrtitā |
mātaṅginyai dviṭhāṃtaṃ ca vāṅmāyāḥ śrīpuṭāṃ likhet ||

iyamātaṅginīṃ vidyā dvādaśārṇā samīritā |
viyadagni samāyuktaṃ vāmanetreṃdu bhūṣitāṃ ||

bhuvaneśī maheśāntidurlabhā bhuvanatrayaṃ ||

vāṅmāyāṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya saṃvuddhyā bhagavatyapi |
vārtāli deśavārāhi yugmavārāhi mukhyati ||

aṃdheaṃdhini naśyaṃti ruṃdherudhini tatparaṃ |
jaṃbhejaṃbhini nahyaṃtaṃ mohemohini na hṛtaṃ ||

staṃbhestaṃbhini hṛdyuktaṃ mamukaṃ staṃbhayedvayaṃ |
sarvaduṣṭa praduṣṭānāṃ sarveṣāṃ sarvamuddharet ||

jihvāstaṃbhaṃ kurudvaṃdvaṃ śīghravaśyaṃ kuru dvayaṃ |
vāgluṇṭha trayaviṃduṃ ca maṃtraṃ pāvakavallabhā ||

mahāvidyā mahākhyātā sarvataṃtreṣugopitā ||

śrīvidyāpūjane sthāne cakrarāje maheśvarī |
mahākāmeśvarī vṛṃdamaṇḍitāsanaṃ saṃsthitāṃ ||

sarvasaubhāgyajananī pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ca |
ityuccārya paraṃ jyotiḥ koṣāṃtaṃ pūjayet sudhīḥ ||

anenaiva prakāreṇa pūjayet paṃcapaṃcikāṃ ||

śaivaṃ tu darśanaṃ devīvaiṃdaveṣu prapūjayet |
parito darśanaṃ śāktaṃ cakrasya parameśvarī ||

śauraṃ tu darśanaṃ devi bhūviṃve prathame priye |
śivasya vāmato devī vaiṣṇavaṃ darśanaṃ yajet ||

sṛṣṭicakre bhavet sūryadarśanaṃ kamalekṣaṇe |
sthiti cakre ca saṃpūjyavauddha darśanamuttamaṃ ||

evaṃ saṃpūjya sakalaṃ śrīvidyāṃ parito yajet |
tarpaṇāniṣu narddadyāt trivāraṃ tatvamudrayā ||

sarvopacārairārādhya mudrāḥ saṃdarśayet kramāt ||

athāṃgāvaraṇaṃ kuryācchī vidyāmanu saṃbhavaṃ |
agnīśāsuravāyavyā madhye dikṣāṅga pūjanaṃ ||

māyālakṣmīmayaṃ vījaṃ yugmāt pūrvakrameṇa tu |
kathitaṃ yojayeddevī trayaṃ vā parameśvarī ||

saṃpuṭa kramayogena cātha vā vīravaṃdite |
saṃyojya pūjayet sarvāḥ kramādevaṃ varānane ||

trailokyamohane cakre prakaṭāṃ yoginīṃ yajet ||

sadyaḥ saṃtapta hemābhāḥ siddhayedaśasuṃdarī |
sadyaḥ saṃtapta hemābhāḥ pāśāṃkuśadharā priye ||

<p. 196b>

mahābhāṇḍīraratnānisuḥ suvarṇāṃkitā nidhiṃ |
prayacchatyaḥ sādhakebhyaḥ padmahastāstu pūjayet ||

siddhinīdhyānaṃ ||

citrāṃvarā bhayakarāṃ caṃdrabhāsāṃ trilocanāṃ |
aṇimādi mahāsiddhi manuṇāṃ ciṃtayecchive ||

caturasre caturdvāre yoginyaḥ siddhidāyikāṃ |
aṇimāṃ paścimedvāre dakṣakoṇe prapūjayet ||

laghimāmuttaredevi paścime pūjayet tataḥ |
pūrvadvāre tu mahimāmuttare pūjayecchive ||

īśitvaṃ siddhiṃ deveśi dakṣiṇadvāri pūjayet |
vaśitvaṃ siddhiṃ vāyavye tenaiva kramato jayet ||

bhukti siddhiṃ tathāgneya tenaiva kramabhāvataḥ |
icchāsiddhiṃ pūrvabhāge nair(-)ṛtye ca prapūjayet ||

prāptiḥ siddhiḥ sarvakāmā siddhidā parameśvarī |
adhorddhva kramayogena jñātavyā suravaṃdite ||

brāhmī māheśvarī caiva tatheṃdrāṇī tṛtīyake |
kaumārī vaiṣṇavī caiva ṣaṣṭī vārāhikā bhavet ||

cāmuṇḍā ca mahālakṣmīrapareṇa ca bhāgataḥ ||

brahmāṇyādyāstu tatraiva yaṣṭavyāḥ kramaśaḥ priye |
brahmāṇī pītavarṇā ca caturbhiḥ śobhitāmukhaiḥ ||

varadābhayahastā ca pustakākṣara satkarā |
māheśī śvetavarṇā ca trinetrā sūtradhāriṇī ||

kapālamālāṃ paraśuṃ dadhānāpāṇibhiḥ priye |
kaumārī raktavarṇā ca śaktitomaradhāriṇī ||

varadābhayahastā ca dhyātavyā parameśvarī |
vaiṣṇavī śyāmavarṇā ca śaṃkhacakragadābjakān ||

hastapadmaiśca vibhrāṇā divyabhūṣaṇabhūṣitā |
vārāhī śyāmalachāyā kolavaktra samujvalā ||

halaṃ ca muśalaṃ khaḍgaṃ phetakaṃ dadhatīṃ karaiḥ |
aindrī tu śyāmavarṇā ca raktotpalalasatkarā ||

cāmuṇḍā kṛṣṇavarṇā ca śūlaṃ ḍamarukaṃ tathā |
khaḍgaṃ vetālakaṃ caiva dadhānā dakṣiṇairbhujaiḥ ||

mahālakṣmī tu pītābhā padmadarpaṇameva ca |
mātuluṃga phalaṃ caiva dadhāṃ parameva ca ||

paścimādi krameṇaiva prakaṭāścaturasrake ||

<p. 197a>

kṣobhaṇā drāvaṇākarṣa vaśyonmāda mahāṃkuśā |
khecarī vīrayonyaśca trikhaṃḍā cakramād yajet ||

vāmāvarteṇa saṃpūjya vāyavyādiṣu pūrvavat |
etāṃ saṃpūjyadeveśīṃ tripurāṃ pūjayet parāṃ ||

aṇimāsiddhipurataḥ sarvakāmārthasādhakīṃ |
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīṃ mudrāṃ darśayet kamalālaye ||

sarvāsāpūrakaṃ cakraṃ guhya yoninyadhisthitāṃ |
ṣoḍaśāraṃ tato devī pūjayet kāryasiddhaye ||

kābhākarṣaṇikā devī vuddhyākarṣaṇa rūpiṇī |
ahaṃkārākarṣaṇī ca śabdākarṣaṇarūpiṇī ||

sparśākarṣaṇa rūpā ca rūpākarṣaṇarūpiṇī |
rasākarṣaṇa rūpā ca gaṃdhākarṣaṇarūpiṇī ||

ciṃtākarṣaṇarūpā ca dhairyākarṣaṇarūpiṇī |
smṛtvākarṣaṇarūpā ca nāmākarṣaṇarūpiṇī ||

paścimādi krameṇaiva ṣoḍaśāre svarānvitā |
etā nityā kalādevi caṃdramaṇḍalamadhyagāḥ ||

svaralagnāḥ smarennityāṃ smare pīyūṣavarṣiṇī |
pāśāṃkuśa sudhāpūrṇa kāśmīraghaṭadānadā ||

cakreśvarīṃ yajeddevīṃ tripureśīṃ samṛddhidāṃ |
kāmākarṣaṇarūpāyāpurataḥ pūrayet priye ||

sarvavidrāviṇī mudrāṃ darśayitvā nivedayet ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhave cakre yajedguptatarāṃ vudheḥ |
anaṃga kusumāṃ prācyāṃ ka vargeṇa prapūjayet ||

dakṣiṇe ca cavargeṇa tathā cānaṃga mekhalāṃ |
anaṃgamadanāṃ paścāt ṭavargeṇa ca paścime ||

tavargeṇottare paścādanaṃgamadanāturāṃ |
vahnikoṇeṅga rekhāṃ ca pavargeṇa prapūjayet ||

rākṣasenaṅgavegāṃ ca yavargeṇa prapūjayet |
vāyavye tu śavargeṇa tathānaṃgāṃkuśāṃ yajet ||

aiśānyāṃ lakṣavargeṇa saṃpūjyānaṃgamālinī |
deviguptatarā etā vaṃdhūka kusumaprabhā ||

pāśāṃkuśanālanīlotpalakarāṃ smaret ||

cakreśvarī tato devī yajet tripurasuṃdarīṃ |
anaṃgakusumādye tu sarvasāmrājyadāyinīṃ ||

sarvākarṣaṇa mudrāṃ ca darśayet muravaṃdite ||

cakrapūjyāṃ prapūjyātha caturthaṃ cakramarcayet |
mahāsaubhāgyade cakre kaṭavarṇavirājite ||

<p. 197b>

saṃpradāyākhyayoninyaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitā |
pāśāṃkuśaudarpaṇaṃ ca pānapātraṃ sudhāmayaṃ ||

vitraṃtyaḥ sarvasubhagāḥ paścimādi vilohitaḥ |
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī śaktiḥ sarvavidrāviṇī tathā ||

sarvākarṣaṇa śaktiśca sarvāhladanakāriṇī |
sarvasaṃmohanī śaktiḥ sarvastaṃbhanarūpiṇī ||

sarvajaṃbhana śaktiśca sarvato vaśakāriṇī |
sarvaraṃjana śaktiśca sarvātmā vaśakāriṇī ||

sarvārthasādhakī śaktiḥ sarvasaṃpattirūpiṇī |
sarvamaṃtramayī śaktiḥ sarvaduḥkha kṣayaṃkarī ||

cakreśvarīṃ siddhidātrīṃ parāṃ traipuravāsinīṃ |
yoginīṃ pūjayet tatra saṃpradāyamidāṃ parāṃ ||

vaśyamudrāṃ pradarśyātha nivedya tadanaṃtaraṃ |
sarvārthasādhake cakreṇa bhavarṇaviśobhite ||

javākusumasaṃkāśa sphuranmaṇi vibhūṣitāḥ |
mahāsaubhāgya gaṃbhīrāpīna vṛttaghanastanī ||

ratnapeṭī viniḥkṣipta sādhake sitamānasaḥ |
nānāratnamayāṃ divyā ca dadhatīrhasitānanāḥ ||

pāśāṃkuśau ca dadhatīḥ saṃsmaret tatra yoginīḥ ||

paścimādi vilomena pūjayet sarvasiddhidā |
sarvasiddhipradā devī sarvasaṃpatpradā tathā ||

sarvapriyakarī caiva sarvamaṃgalakāriṇī |
sarvakāmapradā devī sarvaduḥkha vimocanī ||

sarvamṛtyu praśamanī sarvavighna vināśinī |
sarvāṃgasuṃdarī devī sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī ||

paścimādi vilomena daśāre pūjayedimāḥ |
sarvasiddhipradā devī purataḥ kramanāyikāṃ ||

sarvasiddhipradāṃ devīṃ pūjayet tripurāṃ priye |
sarvānmādini mudrāṃ ca darśayitvā nivedya ca ||

sarvarak.ākare cakre makṣavarṇa virājite |
paścimādi vilomena nigarbhayoginīṃ yajet ||

udyadbhāsvat sahasrābhā muktālaṃkārabhūṣitāḥ |
pāśaṭaṃkāyudha jñānamuktāvaradasatkarāḥ ||

devyaḥ prapūjayedetā pathepsita phalapradā |
sarvajñā sarvaśaktiśca sarvaiśvaryapradā tathā ||

sarvajñānamayī devī sarvavyādhi vināśinī |
sarvādhāra svarūpā ca sarvapāpaharā tathā ||
 
<p. 198a>

sarvānaṃdamayī devi sarvarakṣā svarūpiṇī |
sarvepsitapradā devyaḥ guhyā sarvārthasiddhidā ||

paścimādi krameṇaiva pūjayet paktiyonike |
sarvajñāpurato devī cakreśīṃ mālinīṃ yajet ||

mahāṃkuśāṃ mahāmudrāṃ darśayitvā nivedya ca ||

madhye cakre maheśāni yoginīṃ pūjayet priye |
sarvarogahare cakre vasukoṇe sureśvarī ||

sarvarogahare cakre vargāṣṭaka vijṛṃbhate |
paścimādi vilomena rahasyā yoginīṃ yajet ||

śrīkaṇṭhaparitodhastāddāḍimī kusumaprabhā |
raktavastraparīdhānā raktagaṃdhānulepanā ||

raktapuṣpākṣataiḥ samyak pūjayet sarvasiddhidā |
nānābharaṇa gaṃbhīrāḥ paṃcavāṇa dhanurddharāḥ ||

pustakaṃ varadānaṃ ca dadhatī varga saṃsthitā |
vargāṣṭaka mahāvarṇā viṃdunādāṅkitāṃ likhet ||

avargāṃte phalaṃ vakṣyā vāmakarṇeṃdu viṃdumān |
devī vā devatā pūjyāveśinīnāma suṃdarī ||

kavargāṃte kalayutāṃ parāṃ kāmeśvarīṃ likhet |
ca vargāṃ tena vakṣyāḍhyaṃ vāmanetra śaśīśamaṃ ||

anenamādinī pūjyā ṭhavargāṃte tataḥ paraṃ |
vāyukṣmā vāmakarṇe tu viṃdumadvikalāṃ yajet ||

tavargāṃtejakālakṣyā vāmākṣīṃdu kalātmakaṃ |
aruṇāṃ pūjayeddevī pavargāṃtetha kathyate ||

vyomavīja mahīnīra vāyucaṃdreśa bhūṣitaṃ |
anena jayanī pujyāyavargāṃtetha likhyate ||

sa rephakāra pavanapraṇavāṃ kena pūjayet |
sarveśvarīṃ lavargāṃte kṣamavahnīśa viṃdumat ||

anena kaulinīṃ devīṃ pūjayedaṣṭamīṃ vudhaḥ |
aṣṭakāṃte maheśāni etāḥ vāgdevatā yajet ||

paṃcavāṇān samuccārya kāmakāmeśvarīmayān |
bhaṃjanākhyā maheśāni pūjayeccāpa devatāḥ ||

dharmārthakaṃ kāmavīṇaṃ dvitīyaṃ tvathamātmakaṃ |
kāmeśvaryā mohanākhyāṃ pūjayeccāpadevatāṃ ||

dvitīyaṃ bhuvaneśāni pāśayugmaṃ vaśaṃkaraṃ |
kāmeśasya ca kāmasyāstrailokyakarṣaṇaṃ priye ||

aṃkuśaṃ ca samuccārya staṃbhanāya samuccaret |
kāmeśvarasya kāmesyāścāṃkuśaṃ pūjayet kramāt ||

<p. 198b>

ṣaḍaṃgāvaraṇādvāhye āyudhāṣṭakamarcayet |
koṇatrayeṣu saṃpūjyāstrisraḥ kūṭātrayānvitāḥ ||

paścimādi krameṇaiva caturdikṣu prapūjayet |
kāmeśvarī rudraśaktimādyaḥ kūṭena cārcayet ||

dvitīyena ca kūṭena rudrākhyāṃ śaktivaiṣṇavīṃ |
dakṣakoṇe samabhyarcya tṛtīye naiva pūjayet ||

bhagamālāṃ brahmaśaktimuttare viśvamātṛkāṃ |
cakreśvarīmaṃ vikākhyāṃ kāmeśīṃ purato yajet ||

vījamudrāṃ pradarśyātha cakrapūjāṃ nivedayet |
kāmeśvarī śuklavarṇā śuklamālyānulepanā ||

muktāsphurasphurabhūṣā nānābharaṇabhūṣitā |
pustakaṃ cākṣa sūtraṃ ca vadanaṃ cābhaya kramāt ||

dadhatī cāgrataḥ pūjyāḥ rudraśaktiḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

vajreśvarī kuṃkumā sphuradratnavibhūṣitā |
vālārkavasanā nīlakarṇacuṃvitalocanā ||

ikṣuko daṇḍapuṣpeṣu varadābhayaśobhitā |
vajreśvarī dakṣabhāge viṣṇuśakti maheśvarī ||

uttare bhagamālāṃ vā sadyaḥ saṃtapta hemabhā |
anarghya ratnakhacitā bhūṣaṇā bhuvaneśvarī ||

pāśāṃkuśa jñānamudrā varadā nadakalāṃvujā |
brahmaśakti maheśāni tāpatraya nikṛṃtanī ||

sarvānaṃdamaye cakre rājavaiṃdava saṃjñake |
brahmarūpaṃ viṣṇurūpe sāṃbhavaṃ śṛṇusuṃdari ||

parāpara rahasyākhyāṃ yoginīṃ tripurāṃ yajet |
kūṭatrayaṃ samuccārya sarvavidyā svarūpakaṃ ||

samasta devatā rūpaṃ vastuvastumayaṃ yajet |
cakre samarpitāmeva mahātripurasuṃdarīṃ ||

saṃpūjya pūjayet tatra parāpara rahasyagāṃ |
upacāraiḥ samabhyarcya gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ ||

yoginīṃ siddhidāṃ nityāṃ bhogakāmārthasiddhaye |
śrīvidyā ṣoḍaśārṇaṃ tu bhuktimukti phalapradāṃ ||

samastacakra cakreśīṃ sarvāmnāya namaskṛtāṃ |
sarvāmnāyeśvarī vidyālaṃkṛtā brahmarūpiṇīṃ ||

upacāraiḥ samabhyarcya gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ |
tarpaṇāni punardadyāt trivāraṃ mūlavidyayā ||

yonimudrāṃ pradarśyātha mudrāḥ saṃdarśayet kramāt |
tripurā sphaṭikābhāsāmuktā ratnavibhūṣitā ||

<p. 199a>

pustakaṃ cākṣamālāṃ ca kalaśaṃ padmamuttamaṃ |
dadhatīṃ ciṃtayennityaṃ mahāpātakanāśinīṃ ||

tripureśīṃ sarvarūpā suṃdarī kuṃkumaprabhā |
sarvālaṃkāra saṃpannāṃ pustakaṃ cākṣamālikāṃ ||

varadābhayau ca dadhatīṃ sāmarthyaṃ hasitānanā |
anayā sadṛśī devī dhyeyā tripuravāsinī ||

āraktalocanāṃ prāṃte mahāmadavighūrṇitāṃ |
tripurā śrīmaheśāni pīnavṛttaghanastanīṃ ||

udyadbhāsvat sahasrābhāṃ divyālaṃkāramaṇḍitāṃ |
pustakaṃ japamālāṃ ca varadā cā bhayaṃkaraiḥ ||

dadhatī sakalānaṃdāmālinīṃ kathyatedhunā |
iṃdragopaprabhādevī pāśāṃkuśa kapālinī ||

mahābhītiharā samyak sādhakānāṃ kṣaṇādiyaṃ |
siddhāṃ vā parameśānīṃ dhyāyed bhayavināśinīṃ ||

saṃpatpradā bhairavīvat mahāsiddhapradāyinīṃ |
cakreṇa siddhisahitā prati cakrādhi devatā ||

atigahvaramevedaṃ jñātvā cakraṃ samarcayet |
pādukāṃ pūjayāmīti namaskārotha vā bhavet ||

svāhā home tarpaṇe tu tarpayāmīti saṣmaret ||

athavā raśmayaḥ sarvādevīrūpeṇa ciṃtayet |
śrīcakre parameśāni svataṃtre svasvasannibhā ||

gopitavyaṃ tvayā bhadre svayoniriva pārvatī |
naivedyaṃ ṣaḍrasopetaṃ kāmadhenuḥ pavitrikaṃ ||

datvā karpūrasahitaṃ tāṃbūlaṃ paraśaktaye |
nitya homaṃ prakurvaṃti pūrvokta vidhinā priye ||

pūrvavad validānaṃ ca dadyāt sarvasamṛddhaye |
vaṭukāya maheśāni yoginībhyaśca vallabho ||

gaṇeśaḥ kṣetrapālābhyāṃ pūrvavad valimutsṛjet |
vāmabhāge tu tasyātha maṇḍalasyo parikṣipet ||

ādhāraṃ pūjayet tatra valimannodakānvitaṃ |
sakāraṇaṃ maṃtrayitvā sarvabhūta valiṃ haret ||

ṣoḍaśārṇena manunā trivāraṃ vīravaṃdite |
tāraṃ ca bhuvaneśāni sarvavighnapadaṃ tataḥ ||

kṛtyaḥ sarva ca bhūtebhyo hūṁkāraṃ vahnivallabhāṃ |
samuccārya valiṃ dadyānmudrayā tatva saṃjñayā ||

valipaṃcakamākhyātaṃ sadārakṣākaraṃ paraṃ |
yathāśakti japaṃ kuryāt stutiṃ ca parameśvarī ||

<p. 199b>

atha makaraṃda stotraṃ ||

śrīvīje nādaviṃdu dvitayaśaśikalā kālarūpasvarūpemātarmedehi vṛddhiṃ 
jahijahi jaḍatāṃtrā himāṃdīnanāthe |
ajñānadhvāṃtanāśakṣamavirucirasatprollasatpādapadmabrahmeśādyaiḥ 
sureṃdraiḥ suragaṇavivute śaṃbhukāṃte namāmi ||

lajjāvījasvarūpā trijagati varade krīḍayā saṃsthitāyātāṃ nityaṃ śaṃbhu śaktiṃ 
tribhuvanajananīṃ pālayaṃtīṃ jagacca |
saṃsārādyāṃ nidānāṃ sakalaguṇamayīṃ saccidānaṃdarūpāṃ tejorūpāṃ 
trinetrāṃ tribhuvana timirājñānahaṃtrīṃ namāmi ||

klīṃ vīje kāmarājyaṃ dhṛta kusuṃmadhanurvāṇa pāśāṃkuśāḍhyāṃ vaṃde 
bhāsvat svarūpe ravinibhavapuṣo mohayaṃtīṃ trilokān |
kīcīmaṃjīrahārāṃgadamukuṭalasatsvarṇamāṇikyabhūṣairbhāsvaṃtīmiṃdu##(-)

vāṇīvījasvarūpe tribhuvana jaḍatādhvāṃta vidhvaṃsinī tvaṃ tvaṃ śabda 
brahmarūpā śrutirapi ca sadāgīyamānā tvameva |
mātarbhedehi vuddhiṃ mama sadasi mahādvaṃdva saṃkṣobhakartrīdātrī 
vācaspaterapyatirvividhapadaṃ tvatpadāṃbhojamīḍe || 

sauḥ śaktiḥ kāryajātau ghaṭapata vikṛtauddṛṣṭa hetau sahāyāmāyā 
kecinmahatvaprabhṛti pariṇatau mūlabhūtā tvameva |

kiṃcidvākya prapaṃca bhramamati nivṛttau hetu bhūtāsividyā |
vidyāvibhrāṃta vṛṃdakṣayagati jagatāṃ me nire śuddhabhāvaṃ ||

oṃ mātaste namostu śrutimathita gurutryakṣara brahmarūpe mithyājñānāṃdha 
kūpe patitamanudinaṃ pāhimāmakṣahīnaṃ |
mohakrodha pralobha prathamagaticayaḥ śatrubhiḥ pīḍyamānaṃ 
patnīputrādibhṛtyairnata vividhajanaiḥ śṛṃkhalābhirnivaddhaṃ ||

hrīṁkārākhyaḥ svarūpe mama daha duritaṃ vyādhi dāridrya vījaṃ 
mātastvatpādapadme hṛdayaparisare prārthaye bhaktirūpāṃ |
tvaṃ vā nityaṃ ca lakṣmīstvamasi girisutā brahmaviṣṇvādirūpā ciṃtannityaṃ 
śaraṇye kṛtamiha jananītvat kaṭākṣaika vṛṃdaiḥ ||

<p. 200a>

śrīkāre śrīsvarūpe vitaramayi kṛpāṃ dhyānayuksatyarūpe svarṇaṃ māṇikya 
ratnādikadhanamakhilaṃ tvatpadārcā suyogyaṃ |
vidyāṃ tvaṃ dehi mokṣaṃ bhavabhava dahanairdevi daṃdahyamānaṃ yogīṃdraiḥ 
sevyamānairamṛtarucivayairmokṣayatvaṃ ca dīnaṃ ||

kāmoyoniścaturthaḥ svaradaśapatiterbhauvaneśiṃ ca vījaṃ tāvadvarṇāvalitvaṃ 
na taja na varadetvatpade baktimīḍe |
tvatpādāṃbhojayugmaṃ hṛdayasarasije sannidhāyaika ciṃtādhyāyaṃtaḥ 
karmavaṃdhāṃ dvigatakalimalāmuktavaṃto munīṃdrāḥ ||

brahmeṃduḥ kāmadevo viyadamaragururbhauvaneśākhyavījaṃ tāvadvarṇaḥ 
svarūpairghaṭita tanulatāṃtvaṃ prapannosmimātaḥ |
viṣṇurbrahmekṣamūrddhni maṇimukuṭaruciḥ 
prollasatyādapadmeyogīṃdrairdhairyamānaṃ prapadana khacayadyotavidyotamāne ||

induḥ kāmaḥ sureśau vipadanalayutaṃ vāmanetrārddha caṃdrairyuktaṃ 
yadvījametattadapi tava vapuḥ saccidānaṃdarūpaṃ |
vālātvaṃ bhairavītvaṃ tribhuvana jananītāriṇī nīlavāṇītvaṃ gaurītvaṃ ca kālī 
sakalaguṇamayītvaṃ mahāmokṣadātrī ||

sauṃkāre vīrarāje tribhuvanajñanite śaktirādyā tvamevatvaṃ yuktaḥ 
śaṃbhureṣaḥ prabhavati calituṃ tvāṃ vinājāḍyavānsaḥ |
brahmāviṣṇuḥ kapardī jananī tava kṛpāleśa mātrācchaśīrān gṛhnaṃtaḥ 
sṛṣṭirakṣā pralayamavirataṃ cakriretvatpadasthā ||

aiṃ vījaṃ vāgbhavākhyaṃ tvamiha jaḍamati dhvāṃta caṃdraprakāśaṃ mātaḥ 
kāruṇya dhārāmṛtakaliṃ tadṛśā rakṣamāṃ nāthahīnaṃ |
mohyaṃte mohitāste tava janani mahāmāyayāvaddhacittā |
kāruṇyaṃ prārthayaṃtastavapadayugalajñānavaṃto munīndrāḥ ||

klīṁkāraṃ vījarūpaṃ tava sudati manuśreṣṭha madhyepradeśe 
sākṣādbrahmasvarūpī madanatanuriyaṃ brahmaṇo mohakartrī |
ājñāṃtaḥ smeravaktrāmvuja kuharalasatsākṣa pīyūṣadhārāvedāḥ 
sāṃgādiyaṃte tu hinagirisuteprāpta māhendrarūpe ||

hrīṁkāre kālarūpetvamihaśaśimukhīṃ hrīḥ svarūpātvameva |
tvaṃ kṣāṃtistvaṃ ca kāṃtirharihara kamalo bhūtarūpā tvameva ||

<p. 200b>

tvaṃ siddhistvaṃ ca ṛddhiḥ smararipu mahiṣītvaṃ ca saṃmohayaṃtī vidyātvaṃ 
muktiheturbhava jaladhigatāṃ duḥkhahaṃtrī tvameva |
śrīvīje śrīkalāḍhye madhuripumanasā 
madhyamadhyādyabhedyāmātastvadṛṣṭileśādamarapatirasau prāptavānsvaḥ 
patitvaṃ ||

ityevaṃ ṣoḍaśārṇaḥ prathitamanuvaraḥ svargamokṣaiḥka hetuḥ |
siddheraṣṭau labhaṃteya iva manuvaraṃ sarvadā ced bhajaṃte ||

pūjayitvā vidhānena mahātripurasuṃdarīṃ |
idaṃ stotraṃ paṭhitvā tu devī sāyujya māpnuyāt ||

iti śrīrudrayāmalemahātaṃtre umāmaheśvarasaṃvāde śivavaktrāṃvujavinirgata 
śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī makaraṃdākhyastavaḥ samāptaḥ || 

atha mahātripurasuṃdarī kavacamāha ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

bhagavan devadeveśa lokānugrahakārakaḥ |
tvat prasādān mahādeva śrutā maṃtrāstvanekadhā ||

sādhanaṃ vividhaṃ devakīlakoddhāraṇaṃ tathā |
śāpādidūṣaṇoddhāra śrutastvatto mayā prabho ||

rājarājeśvarī devyāḥ kavacaṃ sūcitaṃmapi |
śrotumicchāmi tvattastat kathayasvamapi prabho ||

śrī īśvarovāca ||

lakṣavāra sahasrāṇi vāritāsi punaḥ punaḥ |
strīsvabhāvān mahādevi pṛcchasitvaṃ mayi priye ||

atyaṃtaguptakavacaṃ sarvakāma varapradaṃ |
prītaye tava deveśi kathayāmi śṛṇuṣva tat ||

asya śrīṣoḍaśīvidyā kavacasya ṛṣismṛtaḥ |
mahādevasya prastāraḥ paṃchiśchaṃda udāhṛtaṃ ||

rājarājeśvarī devī devatā parikīrtitāḥ |
sarvārthasādhane devi viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

pūrvemāṃ bhairavīpātu vālā māṃ pātu dakṣiṇe |
nālinī paścime pātu trāsinī tu uttareva tu ||

ūrddhvaṃ pātu mahādevī mahātripurasuṃdarī |
adhastātpāttu deveśi pātālatalavāsinī ||

ādhāre vāgbhavaḥ pātu kāmarājastathā hṛdi |
bhrāmaraḥ pātu sāṃ nityaṃ mastake sarvakāmadaḥ ||

brahmaraṃdhre sarvagātre chidrasthāne ca sarvadā |
mahāvidyā bhagavatī pātu māṃ parameśvarī ||

<p. 201a>

aiṁ klīṁ lalāṭe māṃ pātu pāyāt ||

hrīṁ klīṁ vlūṁ saśvanetrayoḥ nāsāyāṃ karṇayoścaiva drāṁ dreṁ drīṁ civuke 
tathā ||

sauṁḥ pātu gale hṛdaye mama saḥ hrīṁ nābhideśake |
kala hrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ guhyadeśe sa hrīṁ pātu pādayoḥ ||

sa hrīṁ māṃ pātu sarvatra sa klīṁ pātu me saṃdhiṣu |
jalesthale tathākāśe dikṣu rājagṛhe tathā ||

hūṁ khemāṃ tvaritā pātu sa hrīṁ sa klīṁ namo bhavaṃ |
haṃsaśca pāyāṃ mahādevi paraṃ niṣkala devatāḥ ||

vijayā maṃgalādūtī kalyāṇī bhagamālinī |
jñānā ca mālinī vidyā sarvadā pātu māṃ śivā ||

ityevaṃ kavacaṃ devi devānāmapi durlabhaṃ |
tava prītyā mayākhyātaṃ gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ ||

idaṃ rahasyaṃ paramaṃ guhyādguhyataraṃ priye |
dhanyaṃ yaśasya māyuṣyaṃ bhogamokṣapradaṃ śubhaṃ ||

duḥsvapnanāśanaṃ puṃsāṃ naranārīvaśaṃkaraṃ |
ākarṣaṇakaraṃ devistaṃbhoccāṭakaraṃ śive ||

idaṃ kavacama jñātvā rājarājeśvarīṃ śivāṃ |
yo'rcayedyoginī vṛṃdaiḥ sa bhakṣo nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

na tasya maṃtrasiddhiḥ syāt kadācidapi śāṃkari |
ihaloke ca dāridryaṃ rogaduḥkhabhayāni ca ||

paratra narake gatvā paśuyoni mavāpnuyāt |
tasmādeta sadābhyāsādadhikārī bhavet tataḥ ||

madvaktranirgatamidaṃ kavacaṃ supuṇyaṃ pūjāvidheśca purato vidhinā 
paṭhedyaḥ |
saubhāgyabhoga lalitāni śubhāni bhuktvā devyāḥ padaṃ bhajati tatpunaraṃtakāle ||

iti kulāṃta saṃhitāyāṃ śrīmahātripurasuṃdarī ṣoḍaśīkavacaṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ ||

atha tripurabhairavasya maṃtramāha ||

māyālakṣmīstathā haṃsaḥ prāsāda vīja eva ca |
vahnijāyāṃtako maṃtro bhavet tripurabhairavaḥ ||

ṣaḍaṃgaṃ mūlamaṃtreṇa vali pūjādike tathā ||

atha dhyānaṃ ||

ekavaktraṃ trinayanaṃ caturvāhuḥ samanvitaṃ |
dakṣiṇecāṃkuśaṃ khaḍgaṃ vāmakheṭakapāśakau ||

dhārayaṃtaṃ raktavarṇaṃ vṛṣāsanagataṃ vibhuṃ |
ūrddhvakeśaṃ hāduhāraṃ kapālamālayānvitaṃ ||

<p. 201b>

evaṃ vidhaṃ sarādevidhyāya tripurabhairavaṃ ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau śrīvidyānityārcananirṇayanāmāṣaḍviṃśatitamaḥ 
prakāśaḥ] || 26 ||

atha tripurabhairavyākramo likhyate ||

atha pūjāvidhiṃ vakṣye sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ |
devyāstripurabhairavyā viśeṣyayannirūpitaṃ ||

pīṭhaṃ nyāsāṃtaṃ vidhāyansavyādinyāsaṃ kuryāt |
ṛṣirasya maheśāni dakṣiṇāmūrtiravyayaḥ ||

nyasecchirasi pūjyatvāt paṃktiḥ chaṃdomukhe priye |
devatā hṛdaye vālātripurā parameśvarī ||

vījaṃ vāgbhavamityuktaṃ śaktistārtīya mūhayet |
nābherācaraṇaṃ nyasya galādānābhi cāparaṃ ||

mūrdhādi galaparyataṃ tryakṣaraṃ vinyaset kramāt ||

atha vidyānyāsaḥ ||

vidyānyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryātribhirvījaiḥ kramācchive |
karayorvinyasedādau maṇivaṃdhe talegrake ||

dakṣavāme ca vinyasya kukṣu kūrparapāṇiṣu |
punardakṣe tu vāme tu pādayośca tathā nyaset ||

nādāṃte hṛdayaliṃge nyaseddevi tataḥ paraṃ |
eteṣvaṃgeṣu deveśi saṃhārakramato nyaset ||

vidyāsṛṣṭhi krameṇaiva jānīhi parameśvari |
navayonyātmakanyāsa kuryād vījaistribhistataḥ ||

śrīvidyāyāḥ krameṇaiva pūrvameva samīritaṃ ||

atha rabhyādinyāsaḥ ||

mūleratiṃ hṛdi prītiṃ bhruvormadhya manobhavāṃ |
vālāvījaistribhirnyasyet sthāneṣveṣu vilomataḥ ||

amṛteśiṃcayogeśīṃ viśvayoniṃ kramādimāḥ |
vilomavījairvinyasya mūrtinyāsamathācaret ||

pravinyaset pathā pūrvaṃ bhṛguvāmāgni saṃyutaṃ |
sadyādi paṃcahasvādyaṃ vījanyāse prakīrtitaṃ ||

atha vāṇanyāsaḥ ||

paṃcavāṇāṃ krameṇaiva karāṃguliṣu vinyaset |
aṃguṣṭādi kaniṣṭāṃtaṃ krameṇa parameśvari ||

tatasteṣu ca sthāneṣu nyaset kāmānyathā kramaṃ ||

atha karāṅganyāsaḥ ||

ṣaḍdīrghayuktenādyenaṃ vījenāṅga kriyā matā |
mūrddhni pāde tathā vaktre guhye hṛdaya paṃkaje ||

thānta dvayaṃ samālikhya vahnisaṃsthe krameṇa hi |
mukhavṛttena netreṇa vāmena parimaṇḍitaṃ ||

<p. 202a>

vāṇadvayamidaṃ proktaṃ mādanaṃ bhūmisaṃsthitaṃ |
caturthasvaraviṃdvādyanādarūpaṃ varānane ||

kāṃtaṃ śakrasamārūḍhaṃ vāmakarṇa vibhūṣita |
vindunāda samāyuktaṃ sargavān caṃdramā priye ||

paṃcavāṇa maheśāni nāmāni śṛṇu pārvati |
drāvaṇo kṣobhano devi vaśyākarṣaṇa saṃjñakau ||

tathānmādaḥ krameṇaiva nāmāni parameśvari |
drāmādyāṃ drāviṇīṃ mūrddhni drīmādyāṃ kṣobhinīṃ pade ||

klīṁ vaśīkaraṇīṃ vaktre guhye hūṁ vījapūrvikāṃ |
ākarṣaṇīhyadi punaḥ sargānta bhṛgu saṃsthitāṃ ||

saṃmohinīṃ kramādevaṃ vāṇanyāsoyamīritaḥ |
parāvījaṃ madhyavāṇaṃ vāgbhavaṃ parameśvari ||

hūṁ vījaṃ kramāt priye ||

paṃcakāmā ime devināmāni śṛṇu vallabhe |
kāmamanmatha kandarpya makaraṃ dhvajasaṃjñakāḥ ||

mīnaketu maheśāni paṃcamaḥ parikalpitāḥ ||

atha subhagādinyāsaḥ ||

bhālabhrūmadhya vadane laṃvikā kaṃṭhahṛtsuna |
nābhyadhiṣṭānayoḥ paṃcatārādyā subhagādikāḥ ||

vākkāmavījaṃ vrūṁ strīṁ sastārāḥ paṃcoditāstvamī ||

atha bhūṣaṇaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

nyasecchirasi bhālabhrukarṇākṣi yugavonapi |
gaḍayorāṣṭaryo daṃtapaṃktyorāsyenyasetsvarān ||

civuke ca gale kaṃṭhe pārśvayostana yugmake |
dormūlayoḥ kūrparayoḥ pāropāstatpṛṣṭa deśayoḥ ||

nābhau guhye punarścovojanvorvaijaṃghayostataḥ |
sphicoḥ mattalayoḥ paśrāt caraṇāṃguṣṭha pṛṣṭayoḥ ||

kādirāṃ nānyasettvarṇān sthaleṣveṣu samāhitaḥ |
kāṃcyāgraiveyake paścāt kaṭake hṛdigūhyake ||

karṇayorgaṃḍayomolaulavaśakṣalaṣānhasau |
aṣṭāviṃmān pravinyasyedevaṃ deśika saptamaḥ ||

atha dhyānaṃ ||

oṃ udyadbhānu sahasrakāṃtimaruṇakṣaumāṃ śirāmālikāṃ 
raktāliptapayodharāṃ japavaṃṭī vidyāmabhītivaram ||

hastākṣairdadhaṃtī trinetravilasadvaktrāravidaśriyaṃ |
devīvahna himāṃśu ratnamakuṭāṃ vande samaṃ dakṣiṇāṃ ||

yonyākhyā hṛdivikhyātā trailokyarakṣaṇā bhavet |
trailokyadrāvaṇaṃnāma mukhasthāparameśvarī ||

bhrūmadhyasthā maheśāni trailokyākarṣaṇī bhavet |
lalāṭasthā maheśāni trailokyavaśakāriṇī ||

<p. 202b>

brahmaraṃdhrasthitā saiva sarvāhlādakarīparā |
paṃcamudrāmayī devī yonimudrā pradarśayet ||

atha pātrādi saṃsthāpanavidhāya yaṃtra vilikhet |
tatontaryajanaṃ kṛtvā vāhyapūjāṃ samācaret ||

tatra prāṅmukha āsīno yaṃtroddhāraṃ prakalpayet |
īśānādagni paryaṃtaṃ ṛjurekhāṃ samālikhet ||

īśādagnestadagrābhyāṃ rekhe ākṛṣya deśikaḥ |
ekīkṛtya ca vāruṇyāṃ śaktirekhā parā śive ||

trikoṇākārarūpaṃ tu śaktidvayamidaṃ śive |
pūrvaśaktyāgra bhāve tu maṇiyaṣṭivadā likhet ||

rekhāṃ tu parameśāni vāyurākṣasa koṇagām |
saṃdhibheda krameṇaiva tayoḥ śaktyostataḥ parāṃ ||

rekhe ākṛṣya koṇābhyāṃ udagrān pūrvagāṃ kuru |
vahnimaṃḍala me tat syāt pūrvāgraṃ suravaṃdite ||

navadyoni viśobhāḍhyaṃ cakrarājamidaṃ bhavet |
etad vāhe tu saṃlekhyaṃ vṛttaṃ pūrṇendu saṃnibhaṃ ||

tallagnamaṣṭapatraṃ tu rasraṃ likhecchive |
caturdvāra viśobhāḍhyaṃ sarvānandakaraṃ sadā ||

vilikhya pūjayed yaṃtra hemarūpyādi paṭṭake |
bhūmau caṃdanapīṭheṣu kuṃkumā gurucaṃdanaiḥ ||

siṃdūrarajasā vāpi kastūrī pusṛṇādibhiḥ |
suvarṇaratna lekhanyā kalpitaṃ mṛṇmaye yathā ||

vilikhya yaṃtraṃ deveśi pūjā dravyāṇi sādhayet ||

atha ādhvāra śaktyādi hrīṁ jñānātmane namaḥ ||

ityaṃtaṃ saṃpūjya pūrvādi keśareṣu madhye ca icchādi navaśaktiṃ yajet ||

icchājñānā kriyā ceti kāminī kāmadāyinī |
ratīpriyā tathā naṃtā madanonmādinīti ca ||

etā tripurabhairavyā pīṭhaśaktiḥ prakīrtitā |
vāgbhavaṃ lauhitaṃrāyai śrīkaṃṭhalohitonalaḥ ||

dīrgharāva ai parāpaścādayarāyai hrauṁ puna |
sadāśiva mahāpretaṃ ṅentaṃ padmāmanaṃ namaḥ ||

anena majunādadyādāsanaṃ śrīgurukrama |
pūrvamadhyama yoneścāntarāle pūjayet tataḥ ||

paṃcabhiḥ praṇavairmūrtirtasyāmāvāhya devatāṃ |
tato vākśakti kamalā hasakha phaṁsasau punaḥ ||

atha mūlamaṃtrāṃte vindumadhye devyāmūrti saṃkalpa ||

<p. 203a>

trikhaṇḍā mudrayā pūrvavaddevīṃ dhyātvā cā vāhya yathā śaktarītyā 
sarvaupacārairārādhyāvaraṇārcanamācaret ||

tathā ca ||

abhīśāsura vāyavya madhyādiṣvaṃga pūjanaṃ |
uttarasyāṃ dvayeṃ devī dakṣiṇasyāṃ dvayaṃ tathā ||

agre caiva krameṇaikaṃ paṃcavāṇān tato yajet |
paṃcakāmāṃstathādevi vāṇadyat paripūjayet ||

madhye yoni trikoṇeṣu tenaiva kramayogataṃ |
vālāvīja krameṇaiva ratiḥ prītirmanobhavā ||

tatoṣṭayoniṣu pūrvādi krameṇa svamaṃtra pūrvikā śubhagādyaṣṭa śaktayaḥ ||

svamaṃtrāṃte maheśāni pūjanīyāṣṭa yoniṣu |
śubhagā ca bhagā ceti tathā ca bhagasarpiṇī ||

bhagamālinyanaṃgā ca anaṃgakusumā tathā |
anaṃgarekhā cānaṃgamadanā parikīrtitāḥ ||

tatoṣṭapatreṣu pūrvādi krameṇa asitāṃgādibhiḥ sahabrāhmyādyaṣṭamātaraḥ ||

mātaro bhairarvākasthāmada vibhrama vihvalāḥ |
aṣṭapatreṣu saṃpūjyā yathāvat kusumādibhiḥ ||

tadvahiḥ caturasreṣu indrādīṃstadvahiḥ punaḥ |
teṣā maṃtrāṇi saṃpūjya yathā śaktyā japaṃ caret ||

atha bhairavi stotraṃ ||

raktatpānayā śrītripurestoṣyaṃtīṣṭa phalāptaye |
yayā vrataṃtitāṃ lakṣmīṃ manujāḥ surapūjitāṃ ||

brahmādayastuti śatairapi sūkṣmarūpāṃ jānaṃti naiva jagadādimanādimūrti |
tasmāt dvayaṃ kuca natāṃtara kuṃkumābhāṃ stūlāṃstubhaḥ 
sakalavāṅmayamātṛbhūtāṃ ||

sadyaḥ samudyata sahasra divākarābhāṃ vidyākṣasūtravaradābhaya cihnahastāṃ |
netrotpalaistribhiralaṃkṛta cakra padmāṃtvāṃtārahārarucirātriṃpurebhajāmi ||

siṃdūrapūraruciraṃ kucabhāra namūṃ janmāṃtare sukṛta puṇyaphalaikagamya |
anyonyabhedakalahākulamānasāste jānaṃti kiṃ jaḍadhiyastavarūpamamva ||

sthūlāṃ vadaṃti munayaḥ śrutayogṛṇaṃti sūkṣmāṃ vadaṃti vacasāmadhi vā 
samanye |
tvāṃ mūlamāhura pare jagatāṃ bhavānimatyāmahevayamapārakṛpāṃvurāśiṃ 
||

caṃdrāvataṃ śakalatāṃ śaravindu śubhrāṃ paṃcādaśākṣaramayīṃ 
hṛdibhāvayāmi |
tvāṃ pustakaṃ japavaṭīmamṛtāḍhya kuṃbhaṃ vyākhyāṃ ca 
hastakamalairdadhatī trinetrāṃ ||

<p. 203b>

śaṃbhustvamadritanayā kalitārddhaṃ bhāgo viṣṇustvameva 
kamalāparivaddhadehaḥ |
padmodbhavastvamasi vāgadhivāsa bhūmisteṣāṃ triyā ca jagati tripuretvameva ||

āśritya vāgbhavabhavāṃścaturaḥ parādīn bhārān padeṣva vihitān samudīrayantī |
kaṃṭhādibhiśca karaṇaiḥ paradevatāṃ tvāṃ mamvimayīṃ hṛdi kadāpi na 
vismarāmi ||

ākuṃcya vāyumavajitya ca vairiṣaṭkaḥ mālokyaniścaladhiyānijanāsikāgraṃ |
dhyāyaṃti mūrddhni kalitendu 
karāvataṃśaṃtvadrūmamamvakṛtinastaruṇārkamitraṃ ||

tvaṃ prāpyamanmatha riporvapurarddhabhāgaṃ sṛṣṭiṃ karoṣi jagatāmiti 
vedavādaḥ |
satyaṃ tadadritanayejagadekamātarnyacedaśeṣajagatāṃsthitireva na syāt ||

pūjāṃvidhāya kusumaiḥ surapādapānāṃ pīṭhetavāmva kanakāvalagahvareṣu |
gāyaṃti siddhavanitāḥ sahakinnarībhirāsvāditā samaraṇāruṇa netrapadmāḥ ||

dvidyudvilāsa vapuṣaḥściyamudvahaṃtīḥ yāṃtī suvāsa bhavanācchiva 
rājadhānīṃ |
śaṃbhośca vaktra kamalāni vikāśayaṃtī devīṃ bhaje hṛdiparāmṛtasikta 
gāyatrīṃ ||

ānaṃtyajanmabhavasaṃbhava saṃśrutīnāṃ caitanya mātra vapuryaṃta 
vacāśrayāmi |
brahmendra viṣṇubhirupāsita pādapadmāṃ saubhāgya janmavasatīṃ tripure 
yathāvat ||

śabdārthabhāvita vanaṃsṛjatīṃdrurūpāyātadvibharti punararka tanuḥ svaśaktyā 
|
vahnyātmikā harati tatsakalaṃ yugāntetāṃ śāradāṃ manasi jātu na vismarāmi ||

nārāyaṇīti narakārṇavatāriṇīti gaurīti khedaśamanīti sarasvatīti |
jñānapradeti nayanatrayabhūṣitetitvāmadrirājatanayeti vudhāvadaṃti ||

yestuvaṃti jaganmātaḥ ślokairdvādaśabhiḥ kramāt ||

tvāmanuprāpyayuste parāṃgatiṃ ||

iti bhairavīstavarājaḥ samāptaḥ ||

atha tripurabhairavīkavacaṃ ||

namaḥ tripurabhairavyai ||

śrīpārvatyuvāca ||

devadeva mahādeva sarvaśāstra viśārada |
kṛpāṃ kuru jagaṃnātha dharmajñosi mahāmate ||

suṃdarīyā purāproktā vidyā tripurapūrvikā |
tasyāṃ tu kavacaṃ divyaṃ mahyaṃ kathaya tatvataḥ ||

<p. 204a>

tasyāṃstadvacanaṃ śrutvā jagāda jagadīśvaraḥ |
adbhutaṃ kavacaṃ devyāḥ sundaryādi viruipivai ||

śrī(-)īśvara uvāca ||

kathayāmi mahāvidyā kavacaṃ sarvadurlabhaṃ |
śṛṇuṣvatvaṃ ca vidhinā śrutvā gopyaṃtva pāpi tat ||

yasyāḥ prasādāt sakalaṃ vibharmi bhuvanatrayaṃ |
nyasyā sarvaṃ samutpannaṃ yasyā madyāpi tiṣṭati ||

mātāpitā janmānyā jagadrakṣā svarūpiṇī |
siddhidātrī ca siddhāsyāda siddhā duṣṭajaṃtuṣu ||

(********) (?) sarvabhūta 
svarūpiṇī |
kakāraḥ pātumāṃ devī kāminī kāmadāyinī ||

aiṁkārī pātumāṃ devī mūlādhāra svarūpiṇī |
īkārī pātumāṃ devī ravisarvastu svaḥpradā ||

lakārī pātumāṃ devī indrāṇī varavallabhā |
hrīṁkārī pātumāṃ devī sarvatra śaṃbhusuṃdarī ||

etairvarṇermahāmāyāṇaṃbhavīpātu mastakaṃ |
kakāre pātumāṃ devī sarvāṇī haragehinī ||

makāre pātumāṃ devi sarvapāpa praṇāśinīṃ |
kakāre pātumāṃ devī kāmarūpadharā sadā ||

kakāre pātumāṃ devī śamvarāri priyā sadā |
lakārī pātumāṃ devī dharādharaṇi rūpadhṛk ||

hrīṁkārī pātumāṃ devī śaṃkarārddha śaririṇī |
aitairvarṇairmahāmāyā kāmarāja priyāvatu ||

makārī pātumāṃ devī sāvitrī sarvadāyinī |
kakārī pātu sarvatra kalāsvara svarūpiṇī ||

lakārī pātumāṃ devī lakṣmīḥ sarvasulakṣaṇā |
hrīṁkāri pātu sarvatra devī tribhuvaneśvarī ||

etaivarṇairmahāmāyā pātu śaktisvarūpiṇī |
vāgbhavaṃ mastakaṃ pātu vadanaṃ kāmarājikā ||

śakti svarūpiṇī pātu hṛdayaṃ maṃtrasiddhidā |
suṃdarī sarvadā pātu sundarī parirakṣatu ||

raktavarṇā sadā pātu saṃdarī sarvadāyinī |
nānālaṃkāra saṃyuktā suṃdarī pātu sarvadā ||

sarvāṃgasuṃdarī pātu sarvatra śivadāyinī |
jagadāhlāda jananī śaṃbhūrūpāṃ ca māṃ sadā ||

sarvamaṃtramayī pātu sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī |
sarvalakṣmīmayī devī paramānandadāyinī ||

pātumāṃ sarvadā devī nānāśaṃkhanidhiḥ śivā |
tataḥ padmanidhirdevī sarvāṇī sarvadāyinī ||

<p. 204b>

dakṣiṇāmūrti māṃ pātu ṛṣiḥ sarvatra mastake |
paṃkti chaṃdaḥ svarūpā tu sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī sadā ||

sarvasiddhipradā pātu sarvākarṣaṇakāriṇī |
kṣobhiṇī sarvadā pātu vaśinī māṃ sadāvatu ||

ākarṣiṇī sadā pātu saṃmohinī sadāvatu |
ratirdevī sadā pātu bhagā māṃ sarvadāvatu ||

māheśvarī sadā pātu kaumārī sarvadāvatu |
sarvāhlādanakārīyāṃ pātu sarvavaśaṃkarī ||

kṣemaṃkarī sadā patū sarvāṃgasuṃdarī sadā |
sarvāṃga yuvatiḥ pātu sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī ||

vāgdevī sarvadā pātu (****) (?) sadāvatu |
vaśinī sarvadā pātu mahāsiddhipradā sadā ||

sarvavidrāviṇī pātu gaṇanāthaḥ sadāvatu |
durgādevī sadā pātu vaṭuḥkā sarvadāvatu ||

kṣetrapālaḥ sadā pātu pātu cādhāraśaktikā |
anantaḥ sarvadā pātu varāhaḥ sarvadāvatu ||

pṛthivī (*) (?) sadā pātu svarṇasiṃhāsanaṃ tathā |
raktāmṛtaṃ ca satataṃ pātu mā sarvakālataḥ ||

sudhārṇavaḥ sadā pātu kalpavṛkṣaḥ sadāvatu |
madanodyāna satataṃ pātu māṃ sarvasiddhaye ||

dikpālāḥ sarvadā pātuṃ indrādyāḥ sakalāstathā |
vāhanāni sadā pātu astrāṇi pātu sarvadā ||

astrāṇi sarvadā pātu yoginyaḥ pātu sarvadā |
siddhāḥ pātu sadā devī sarvasiddhipradāvatu ||

sarvāṅgasuṃdarī devī sarvatra sarvadāvatu |
ānandarūpiṇī devi nitsvarūpā cidātmakā ||

sarvāṅgasuṃdarī pātu sundarī bhava suṃdarī |
pṛthagdevālaye ghore saṃkaṭe durgame girau ||

araṇye prāṃtare vāpi pātu māṃ suṃdarī śivā |
idaṃ kavacamityuktaṃ maṃtroddhāraśca pārvati ||

yaḥ paṭhet prayato bhūtvā trisaṃdhyaṃ niyataḥ śuciḥ |
tasya sarvārthasiddhiḥ syādyadyanmanasi vartate ||

gocanā kuṃkumena raktacaṃdana kena vā |
svayaṃbhū kusumaiḥ śuklairbhūmiputreśanaiścare ||

śmaśāne prāṃtare vāpi śūnyāgāre śivālaye |
saśaktyā guruṇā yaṃtraṃ pūjayitvā kumārikāḥ ||

tanmanuṃ pūjayitvā ca gurupaṃktiṃ viśeṣataḥ |
pūjayitvā yathā śaktyāstutvā ca vidhināmunāṃ ||

<p. 205a>

dhārayed guruṇā yantra pūjayitvā kumārikā |

tathaiva ca ||

devyai valiṃ nivedyātha naranārjāra sūkaraiḥ |
na kulairmahiṣaiḥ pūjayitvā vidhānataḥ ||

dhṛtvā suvarṇa madhyasthaṃ kaṃṭhe vā mastake bhuje |
sutithau śubhanakṣatre suryasyodayane tathā ||

dhārayitvā ca kavacaṃ sarvasiddhiṃ labhennara |
kavacasya ca māhātmyaṃ nāhaṃ varṣa śatairapi ||

śakromi tu maheśāni vaktuṃ tasya phalaṃ ca yat |
nāsti caurabhayaṃ tasya na tatra vyādhipīḍanaṃ ||

na durbhikṣa bhayaṃ tatra na cāpi pīḍanaṃ sadā |
vighna praśamane sarvaṃ sarvavyādhi vināśanaṃ ||

sarvarakṣākaraṃ taṃtoścaturvarga phalapradaṃ |
yatra tatra na vaktavyaṃ na dātavyaṃ kadācanaṃ ||

maṃtra prāpya vidhānena pūjayet sanataṃ sudhī |
tatrāpi durlabhaṃ manye kavacaṃ devi rūpiṇaṃ ||

guroḥ prasādaṃ māsādya vidyāṃ prāpya sugopitāṃ |
tatrāpi kavacaṃ divyaṃ durlabhaṃ bhuvanatraye ||

ślokaṃ vāstavamenaṃ vāyaḥ paṭhet prayataḥ śuciḥ |
tasya sarvārthasiddhiḥ syācchaṃkareṇa prabhāṣitaṃ ||

guruḥ devo haraḥ sākṣāt patnī tasya ca pārvatī |
abhedena yajedyastu tasya siddhiradūrataḥ ||

iti viśvasārataṃtre tripurabhairavīkavacaṃ samāptaḥ ||

atha vaṭukasya ||

māyā ca vaṭukaṃ ṅentamāpaduddhāraṇāya ca |
kuru dvayaṃ vaṭukāya hrīṁ prakṛtivarṇakaḥ ||

vṛhadāraṇyaka muniñchandonuṣṭupa devatā |
bhairavo hrīṁ vījaśaktībhāḥ kīlakamudāhṛtaṃ ||

atha ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ ||

ṣadīrghayuktayā śaktyā ca kāreṇa ca tadvaye |
anyāni jāti yuktāni praṇavādyāni kalpayet ||

evanyastattanurdhyāyecchuddhasphaṭikasaṃnibhe |
dīptaśubhrāṃ varābhītaṃ kiṃkiṇī jālanūpure ||

yutaṃ ratnaṃ mayaiḥ smeravadanaṃ kuṭilālakaṃ |
dakṣaśūlaṃ pare daṃḍaṃ dadhatī vaṭurūpiṇaṃ ||

dvibhujaṃ saṃsmaredevaṃ kāryārthaṃ sātvikaṃ dvijaiḥ |
vaiṣṇavastu caturvāhuṃ jaṭāmukuṭadhāriṇaṃ ||

triśūlapāśadaṃḍāṃśca dadhaṃtaṃ ca kamaṃḍaluṃ |
vāmī vāme kapālaṃ ca dakṣa daṃḍaṃ viciṃtayat ||

samāptaścāyaṃ tripurebhairavyāḥ kramaḥ ||

atha mahālakṣmī kramolikhyate ||

tataḥ pīṭhanyāsāṃtaṃ karmavidhāya ṛṣyādinyā samācaret ||

<p. 205b>

tadyathā ||

ṛṣyādi brahmagāyatrī mahālakṣmīḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
saṃśodhya manunā pāṇiṃ praṇavādyaṃ hṛdaṃtakaṃ ||

aṃgulīṣu kramāṃnmaṃtrī vinyasedvīja paṃcakaṃ |
mṃtraśeṣaṃ nyasenmaṃtrī talayorubhayorapi ||

mūrddhādi caraṇaṃ yāvanmaṃtreṇa vyāpakanyaset |
śeṣaṃ saptārṇakaṃ maṃtrī vinyaseddhṛdi dhātuṣu ||

paṃcavījaiḥ paṃcamaṃtrī śeṣaiḥ ṣaṣṭhaṃ tu kalpayet |
caturthyaṃ tairjñāna mukhyairyuktaṃ cāpi ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ ||

jñānaiśvaryaśakti valevīryaṃ tejaśca ṣaṭkramāt |
evaṃ nyasya manurmaṃtrī ciṃtayediṣṭadevatāṃ ||

ādau smaret samudyānaṃ sarvartu pratiśobhitaṃ |
maṃjulairbhurjapatraiścarasālaiḥ śrīdrumairapi || 

tāstaistamālairhintālaiḥ śālaiśca vakulairapi |
karkaṃdhu vaṃdhujīvaiśca caṃpakairūpaśobhitaṃ ||

maṃdāndolita karpūrakadalīdalamaṇḍitaṃ |
aśokaśaralānāgaḥ kovidāra manoramaṃ ||

mallikā yuthikākuṃda madayaṃtī sugaṃdhikā |
drākṣāvallī nāgavallī mādhavī devadārubhiḥ ||

namerubhilavaṃgaiśca vakulaistilakaistathā |
śobhitaṃ karṇikāraiśca caṃdanai raktacaṃdanaiḥ ||

vaṃjulairmāttuliṃgaiśca dāḍimīlakucaiḥ śubhaṃ |
nārikelaiśca kharjūraiḥ pūgaiḥ kuravakairvṛttaṃ ||

mālatī ketakī jātī pāraṃtī tulasī vṛtaṃ |
saṃdāvartairdamanakaiḥ sarvartu kusumojvalaṃ ||

pramadaiḥ pijumardaiśca maṃdārairupaśobhitaṃ |
śirīṣaiḥ paṇasairuccaiḥ śākhoṭaiḥ kuṭajairghanaiḥ ||

avega gamanaḥ spṛṣṭaṃ sumanogaṃdhavaṃjulaṃ |
mahāsanaṃ tasya madhye smarenmaṃtrī manorathaṃ ||

bhrama bhramaramālābhīralaṃkṛta caturdiśaṃ |
kekīkekāravākīrṇaṃ lakṣmaṇāsā rasāvṛtaṃ ||

varavya haṃsasaṃghātaṃ cakrakāraṃḍakojjvalaṃ |
phullaiḥ sarasijairanyaiḥ kahlāraiḥ kairavairapi ||

nīleṃdīvarasaṃghaiśca sugaṃdhi kusumairvṛttaṃ |
sarvartu śobhikalpadruvanamaṇḍitamujvalaṃ ||

<p. 206a>

pūritaṃ tatra tanmadhye ratnamaṇḍapa kuṭṭimaṃ |
samudyadarka saṃdoha kiraṇadyuti bhāsvaraṃ ||

himaraśmi karavrātasiktāmṛta suśītalaṃ |
prollasadgālita svarṇaprākāra sumanoharaṃ ||

navaratnamaya prodyat kapālāghalivṛtaṃ |
nūtanodyanmahāratnaracitottuṃga gopuraṃ ||

taptagālita hemaugha daṃḍadhvaja samūhakaṃ |
vaiḍūryādi mahāratnaracitaṃ staṃbharājitaṃ ||

saṃtapta svarṇaracita gavākṣa śatasaṃkulaṃ |
hemaratna sphuraddvīpa sahasra sumanoharaṃ ||

nānāvidhakṣaumavastra racitābhiśca kāṃcanaiḥ |
sa kṣudra ghaṃṭikāyuktaḥ patākābhirathāvṛtaṃ ||

śaradrākā sudhāraśmidukūlaracitaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
vicitra vasanodbhūtairyutaṃ caṃdrātapairapi ||

kāṃcanorvīmaṇi prātakuṭṭimālaṃkṛtaṃ śubhaṃ |
ghanasārā gurunakha kastūrī kuṃkumairapi ||

tamālairdravyajātaiśca sugaṃdhibhirathetaraiḥ |
āmodita caturdvāraṃ maṇḍapaṃ praviciṃtayet ||

tadaṃtaḥ pārijātasya mūlasiṃhāsanaṃ navaṃ |
nānāratnagaṇākīrṇe tato devī viciṃtayet ||

vālabhāskara sat kāṃtiṃ śaśiśekharamaṇḍitaṃ |
muktāhārojvalāṃ ramyāṃ ratnākalpa vibhūṣitāṃ ||

hastāṃbhojaiśca vibhrāṇāṃ nūtanāṃ śālimaṃjarī |
padmadvayaṃ kastubhaṃ ca sasmitāsya saroruhāṃ ||

vikacotpala saṃśobhi locana traya śobhitāṃ |
kvaṇannūpura saṃsphulla raktotpala padadvayāṃ ||

nitaṃva viṃva vilasadrasanādāmamaṃjulāṃ |
valitrayalasaddevī madhye deśe suśobhitāṃ ||

gaṃbhīrāvarta kṛnnābhihradamaṃḍalamaṇḍitāṃ |
yakṣakardama saṃlipta pīnonnata ghaṭastanīṃ ||

kuṃbhīkuṃbhodbhavaḥ prāpya muktādāma virājitāṃ |
kṣaumottarāsaṃgavatīṃ puṣpadāma subhūṣitāṃ ||

māṇikya svarṇakhacita vaiḍūryādyaṃgadojvalāṃ |
kāṃcanodyat padmarāga maṇisaṃvaddhakaṃkaṇāṃ ||

nānāvidhalasadratna mudrikā laṃkṛtāṃguliṃ |
kaṃcukaṇṭha kalārāvāṃ svarṇagraivedyarājitaṃ ||

vicitra nānālaṃkārālaṃkṛtāṃgī suvismitāṃ |
udyadarka prabhābhāsvadratnatātaṃkaśobhitāṃ ||

<p. 206b>

karṇapūrī kṛtaḥ svarṇavaddharatnāṃkurāṃ śubhāṃ |
pravāla vilasat kāṃtirucirādharapallavāṃ ||

sisvaraprollasadramya daśanāvaliśobhitāṃ |
nirlāṃchana śaradrākā tārādhipa śubhānanāṃ ||

paṃcasāyakakodaṃḍavilāsyadhikacillikāṃ |
vibhrāṇānāsikāṃ prodyattila puṣpotvalodyatāṃ ||

śītāṃśu sa kalākāra rucirājikarājitāṃ |
ghanasaugaṃdhyasaṃpanna mṛganābhi viśeṣatāṃ ||

manākkuṃcita sa snigdha nīlamaṃjula mūrddhajāṃ |
pārijātadru kusuma gaṃdhavāhi sumūrddhajāṃ ||

taptahāṭaka saṃvaddha nānāratnaugha śekharāṃ |
sauṃdarya bhūmeravadhiṃ tejasāṃ janmabhūmikāṃ ||

vilāsa lakṣmībhavanaṃ mahālakṣmīṃ viciṃtayet |
vāmādhaḥ karamārabhya dhyāyed dakṣakarāvadhi ||

āyudhāni mahālakṣmyāḥ karāṃvuja gatāni ca |
dharmādi kalpite pīṭhe bhūpura dvāraśobhite ||

dalāṣṭake keśarāḍhye karṇikāyāṃ yajedimāṃ |
vibhūtirunnatiḥ kāṃtiḥ sṛṣṭiḥ kīrtiśca sannatiḥ ||

vyuṣṭirut kṛṣṭi ṛddhiśca saṃproktā navaśaktayaḥ |
dadyādvījenāsanaṃ ca svānunā mūrtikalpanaṃ ||

dakṣabhāge yajeddevyāgaṇa paṃcānyatastathā |
sumanojālahastaṃ ca puṣpābharaṇamarcayet ||

aṃgāni pūjayedādau yathāsthānaṃ ca maṃtravit |
aṣṭapatresthitā pūjyā umāśrī ca sarasvatī ||

durgādharaṇi gāyatryau devyuṣā ceti śaktayaḥ |
nānālaṃkāraṇāḍhyā smaraṃ bhojadvaya pāṇayaḥ ||

aṃghriprakṣālanārthaṃ ca prodyate jahnu sūryaje |
pūjanīya prayatnena karābhyāṃ dhṛta cāmare ||

nidhipūjyau ca varuṇaṃ paścime chatradhāriṇīṃ |
paritaśca yajedrāśīn grahānna ca tatorcayet ||

caturdaṃtāṃ diggajāṃśca yajedāśā sumaṃtravit |
lokapālāṃstadastrāṇi tat tadvāhye yajet punaḥ ||

atha lakṣmī stotraṃ ||

agastiruvāca ||

<p. 207a>

mātarnamāmi kamale kamalāyatākṣī śrīviṣṇuhṛt kamalavāsini viśvamātaḥ |
kṣīrodaje kamalakomala garbhagaurī lakṣmī prasīda satataṃ namatāṃ śaraṇye ||

tvaṃ śrīrūpendra sadane madanaika mātarjyotsnāsi pūrṇatara caṃdra manoharāsya |
sūryaprabhāsi ca jagattritaye prabhāsi lakṣmīprasīda satataṃ namatāṃ śaraṇye ||

tvaṃ jātavedasi sadā dahanātma śaktirvedhastvayā jagaditaṃ sakalaṃ vidadhyāt |
viśvaṃbharopi vibhṛyādakhilaṃ bhavatyā lakṣmīḥ prasīda satataṃ namatāṃ 
śaraṇye ||

tvadbhaktametadamale harate haropitvaṃ pāhi saṃsividadhāsi parāparāsi |
iṃdrovabhūva harirapyamaletvadāptyā lakṣmī prasīda satataṃ namatāṃ śaraṇye ||

śūlaḥ sa eva sa vudhaḥ sa guṇī sa dhanyomānyaḥ sa eva guṇarūpa kalākalāpaiḥ |
ekaḥ śuciḥ sa hi pumāṃ sakalepi loke yatrāpatattava śubhe karuṇā kaṭākṣaḥ ||

yasmin vasekṣaṇa mahopuruṣe gajeśvestraiṇye tṛṇe sarasi devakule gṛhebje |
ratnepatattriṇī paśau śayane dharāyāṃ sa śrīkameva kamale tadihāsti nānyat ||

tvatsṛṣṭameva sakalaṃ śucitāmupaiti tvat tyaktametadakhilaṃ tvaśucīhalakṣmī |
tvannāmayatra ca sumaṃgalameva tatra śrīviṣṇupatni kamalekamalālayeti ||

lakṣmīṃ śriyaṃ ca kamalāṃ kamalālayāṃ ca padmāṃ ramāṃ nalina 
yugmakarāṃ ca māṃ ca |
kṣīrodajāmamṛtakuṃbhakaredvirāṃ ca viṣṇupriyāmiti sadā japatāṃ 
kvaduḥkhaṃ ||

iti stutyā bhagavatīṃ mahālakṣmīṃ haripriyāṃ |
praṇanāma sapatnīkaḥ sāṣṭāṃgaṃ daṃḍavanmuniḥ ||

śrīruvāca ||

uttiṣṭhottiṣṭha bhadraṃte mitrāvaruṇa saṃbhavaṃ |
patite tvaṃ muniśreṣṭha lopāmudre śubhavrate ||

stutyā nayā prasannāhaṃ priyatāṃ yadabhīpsitaṃ ||

vyāsa uvāca ||

iti śrutvātha sa muniḥ pratyuvācaḥ śriyaṃ tataḥ |
praṇipatya mahāvāho bhaktigarbhamidaṃ vaca ||

agasty uvāca ||

yadi deyo varomahyaṃ varayogyosmyahaṃ yadi |
ye paṭhiṣyaṃti te stotraṃ tvadbhaktā satkṛtaṃ sadā ||

<p. 207b>

teṣāṃ kadācit saṃtāpo māstu māstu daridratā |
māstuceṣṭa viyogaśca vicchedomāstu saṃtate ||

sarvatra vijayaścāstu māstu saṃpatti saṃkṣayaḥ ||

śrīruvāca ||

evamastumune sarvaṃ yattvayā paribhāṣitaṃ |
etat stotrasya paṭhanaṃ mama sānnidhyakārakaṃ ||

alakṣmīḥ kālakarṇī ca tadgehena viśet kvacit |
gajāśca paśuśāṃtyarthemetat stotraṃ sadā japet ||

vālagrahābhi bhūtānāṃ vālānāṃ śāṃtikṛtparaṃ |
bhūrjapatre likhitvā ca vadhnīyāt kaṃṭhadeśataḥ ||

idaṃ vījaṃ rahasyaṃte rakṣaṇīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
śraddhāhīne na dātavyaṃ na deyaṃ cā śucau kvacit ||

iti lakṣmīstotraṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ ||

atha lakṣmīkavacaṃ ||

atha vakṣye maheśāni kavacaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ |
yasya vijñāna mātreṇa bhavet sākṣāt sadāśivaḥ ||

arcanaṃ pūjanaṃ tasyā maṃtrajāpaṃ japennaraḥ |
sa bhavet pārvatīputraḥ sarvaśāstra puraskṛtaḥ ||

vidyāvatārthinā sevyā viśeṣe viṣṇuvallabhā ||

asya śrīcaturakṣarī viṣṇuvanitā kavacasya bhagavān śrīśiva 
ṛṣiranuṣṭupchaṃdaḥ vāgbhavīdevatā vāgbhavaṃ vījaṃ lajjāśaktiḥ 
ramākīlakaṃ kāmavījātmakaṃ kavacaṃ mama svakavitva pāṇḍitya sarvasiddhi 
samṛddhaye viniyogaḥ ||

aiṃkāro mastake pātu vāgbhavī sarvasiddhidā |
hrīṁ pātu cakṣuṣormadhye cakṣuryugme ca śāṃkarī ||

jihvāyāṃ mukhavṛtte ca karṇayordaṃtayorabhi |
oṣṭhādhare daṃtapaṃktau tālumūle halau punaḥ ||

pātu māṃ viṣṇuvanitā lakṣmīḥ śrīvarṇarūpiṇī |
karṇayugme bhujadvaṃdvestanadvaṃdve ca pārvatī ||

hṛdaye maṇivaṃdhe ca grīvāyāṃ pārśvayoḥ punaḥ |
pṛṣṭhadeśe tathā guhye vāme ca dakṣiṇe tathā ||

upasthe ca nitaṃve ca nābhau jaṃghadvaye punaḥ |
jānucakre padadvaṃdve guṭikeṅgulimūlake ||

svadhātu prāṇadhāktyāṃ me sīmatyāṃ mastake punaḥ |
sarvāṃge pātu kāmeśī mahādevī samunnati ||

puṣṭiḥ pātu mahāmāyā utkṛṣṭiḥ sarvadāvatu |
ca ṛḍdhi pātu me devī sarvatra śaṃbhuvallabhā ||

<p. 208a>

vāgbhavī sarvadā pātu pātu maṃ haragehinī |
ramā pātu sadā devī pātu māyāsvarāt kṣayaṃ ||

sarvāṃge pātu māṃ lakṣmīrviṣṇu māyā sureśvarī |
vijayā pātu bhavane jayā pātu sadā mama ||

śivadūtī sadā pātu suṃdarī pātu sarvadā |
bhairavī pātu sarvatra bhāruṇḍā sarvadāvatu ||

tvaritā pātu māṃ nitya mugratarā sadāvatu |
pātu māṃ kālikā nityaṃ kālarātriḥ sadāvatu ||

vanadurgā sadā pātu kāmākhyā sarvadāvatu |
yoginyaḥ sarvadā pātu mudrā pātu sadā mama ||

pātrā pātu sadā devyāścakrasthā yogiṇīgaṇāḥ |
sarvatra sarvakāryeṣu sarvakarmasu sarvadā ||

pātu māṃ devadeveśī lakṣmī sarvasamṛddhidā |
iti te kavacaṃ divyaṃ kathitaṃ sarvasiddhaye ||

yatra tatra na vaktavyaṃ yadīcchedātmano hitaṃ |
śaṭhāya bhaktihīnāya niṃdakāya maheśvarī ||

nyūnāṃge nātiriktena darśayenna kadācana |
na stavaṃ darśayed divyaṃ saṃdarśya śivahā bhavet ||

kulīnāya maheśāya durgā bhaktiparāya ca |
vaiṣṇavāya viśuddhāya dadyāt kavacamuttamaṃ ||

nijaśiṣyāya śāṃtāya dharmiṇe jñānine tathā |
śanau maṃgalavāre ca raktacaṃdanakaistathā ||

yāvakaiśca likhenmaṃtraṃ sarvamaṃtra samanvitaṃ |
vilikhet kavacaṃ divyaṃ svayaṃbhu kusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

svaśukraiḥ paraśukraiśca nānāgaṃdha samanvitaiḥ |
gorocanā kuṃkumena raktacaṃdana kena vā ||

su tithau śubhayoge vā śravaṇāyāṃ raverdine |
aśvinyāṃ kṛtikāyāṃ vā phālguṇyāṃ ca maghāsu ca ||

pūrvabhādrapadā yoge svātyāṃ maṃgalavāsare |
vilikhet prapaṭhet stotraṃ śubhayoge surālaye ||

āyuśmān prītiyoge ca brahmayoge viśeṣataḥ |
iṃdrayoge śubhe yoge śuklayoge tathaiva ca ||

kaulave vālave caiva vaṇije caiva sattame |
śūnyāgāre śmaśāne vā vijane ca viśeṣataḥ ||

kumāri pūjayitvā ca yajeddevī sanātanīṃ |
matsyairmāṃsaiḥ śākasūrpaiḥ pūjayet paradevatāṃ ||

<p. 208b>

ghṛtādyaiścopakaraṇairdhūpadīpairviśeṣataḥ |
brāhmaṇān bhojayitvā ca pūjayet parameśvarīṃ ||

āṣeṭakamupākhyānaṃ tatra kuryāddina trayaṃ |
tadā bhaven māhārakṣā śaṃkareṇa ca bhāṣitaṃ ||

māraṇadveṣaṇādīnilaṃbhaṃte nātra saṃśayaḥ |
sa bhavet pārvatī putraḥ sarvaśāstra vahiḥ kṛtaḥ ||

gurudeve haraḥ sākṣāt patnī tasya harapriyā |
abhedena yajedyastu tasya siddhirnadūrataḥ ||

paṭhati ya ihamartyo nityamādrātarātmā japaphala manumenaṃ lapsate sau 
vidhāyaṃ |
sa bhavati padamuccaiḥ saṃpadāṃ pāda namraḥ kṣitipamukuṭa lakṣmī 
lakṣaṇānāṃ virāyaḥ ||

iti śrīviśvasārataṃtre lakṣmīkavacaṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi nārāyaṇa mahāmanuṃ |
namo nārāyaṇāyeti tārādyoṣṭhākṣaro matuḥ ||

chaṃdaśca devīgāyatrī sādhya nārāyaṇo muniḥ |
devatā paramātmāsya paṃcāgavidhirucyate ||

kujolkaśca maholkaśca avīcolkodyulka eva ca |
sahasrolkaścaturthyaṃtaḥ svāhāṃtāheti saṃyutaiḥ ||

paṃcāṃgamaṃtrāḥ saṃproktā aṃguṣṭhādāvapi nyaset |
kirīṭahārakeyūramakarākṛti kuṇḍalaṃ ||

śaṃkhacakragadāpadmahastaṃ pītāṃvarā kṛtiḥ |
śrīvatsālaṃkṛtaṃ vakṣaḥ sthala śrībhūmi saṃyutaṃ ||

ātmajyotiḥ saṃpradīptaḥ sahasrāditya tejasaṃ ||

samāptaścāyaṃ mahālakṣmīṃ kramaḥ ||

atha mātaṃgī kramo likhyate ||

atha vakṣye mahādevī mātaṃgīṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ |
asyāḥ sevanamātreṇa vāksiddhiṃ labhate dhruvaṃ ||

ṛṣiḥ syāddakṣiṇāmūrti virāṭ chanda udīritaḥ |
mātaṅgī devatā devī sarvasiddhiḥ pradāyinī ||

aṅganyāsa karanyāsau kuryānmaṃtrī samāhitaḥ |
ṣaḍdīrghamājā vījena praṇavādyena kalpayet ||

<p. 209a>

ṣaṭkoṇāṣṭadalaṃ padmaṃ likhedyaṃtraṃ manoramaṃ |
etasmin pūjet pīṭhe navaśaktiḥ kramādimāḥ ||

vibhūtirunnatiḥ kāṃtiḥ sṛṣṭiḥ kīrtiśca sannatiḥ |
vyuṣṭirutkṛṣṭi ṛddhiśca mātaṃgī padapaścimāḥ ||

sarvāṃte śakti kamalāsanāya nama ityatha |
vākśakti lakṣmī vījāḍhyo manurāsana saṃjñakaḥ ||

tatra pūjā prakartavyā javāpuṣpeṇa maṃtravit |
aṣṭaśaktiścāṣṭadale prajapet su samāhitaḥ ||

ratiḥ prītirmanobhavā kriyā śraddhā ca śaktayaḥ |
anaṃgakusumānaṃga madanāmadanālasā ||

ityaṣṭa śaktīḥ saṃpūjya upahāraḥ samanvitaḥ |
tato devīṃ parāṃ dhyāyet sādhakaḥ sthiramānasaḥ ||

śyāmāṃgīṃ śaśiśekharāṃ trinayanāṃ sadratnasiṃhāsane saṃsthāṃ ratna 
vicitrabhūṣaṇayutāṃ saṃkṣīṇamadhyasthalīṃ |
āpīnastana maṇḍalāṃ smitamukhīṃ dhyāyed dadhatīṃ 
kramādvedairvāhubhiraṃkuśāsi latike pāśaṃ tathā kheṭakaṃ ||

evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevī gaṃdhapuṣpairmanoharaiḥ |
naivedyaṃ tu mahādevyai pāyasaṃ śarkarānvitaṃ ||

atha mātaṃgī stotraṃ ||

ārādhya mātaścaraṇāṃ vrajaṃte brahmādayo viśruta kīrtimāyuḥ |
anye paraṃ vāgvibhavaṃ munīṃdrāḥ parāṃ śriyaṃ bhaktibhareṇa cānye ||

namāmi devīṃ navacaṃdramaulīṃ mātaṃginīṃ caṃdrakalāvataṃsāṃ |
āmnāyavāgbhiḥ pratipāditārthaṃ pravodhayaṃtīṃ śukamādareṇa ||

vinamra devāsuramauliratvainīrājitaṃ te caraṇāraviṃdaṃ |
bhājaṃti ye devi mahīpatīnāṃ bhajaṃti te saṃpratimādareṇa ||

mātaga leelāgamane bhavatyāsiṃjānamaṃjīramiṣādbhajaṃte |
mātastvadīyaṃ caraṇāraviṃdaṃ akṛtrimāṇāṃ vacasāṃ niguṃphaṃ ||

patātpadaṃsiṃjatanūpurābhyāṃ kṛtārthayaṃtī padavīṃ padābhyāṃ |
āsphālayaṃtīṃ karavallakīṃtāṃ mātaṃgiṇīmaddhṛdayaṃdhunotu ||

nīlāṃdukāvaddha nitaṃvaviṃvāṃtālī dalenārpita kaṇabhūṣāṃ |
mādhvīmadāghūrṇita netra padmāṃghanastanīṃ śaṃbhuvadhuṃ namāmi ||

taḍillatākāṃtama lakṣyabhūṣaṃcireṇa lakṣyaṃ navaromarājyā |
smarāmi bhaktyā jagatāmadhīśe valitrayāṃkaṃ tava madhyaviṃvaṃ ||

<p. 209b>

nīlotpalānāṃ śriyamāvahaṃtīṃ kāṃtyā kaṭākṣaiḥ kamalākarāṇāṃ |
kadamvamālāṃcitakeśapāśāṃmataṃga kanyāṃ hṛdibhāvayāmaḥ ||

dhyāyeyamārakta kapolakāṃtaṃ viṃvādharanyastalanomaranyāṃ |
ālolalāṃlāyatamāyatākṣaṃmarddhasmitaṃ te vadanaṃ maheśi ||

stulyā tayā śaṃkara dharmapatnīṃ mātaṃginīṃ vāgadhi devatāṃtāṃ |
stuvaṃti ye bhaktiyutā manuṣyāḥ parāṃ śriyaṃ nityamupāśrayaṃti ||

iti mātaṃgīstotraṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ ||

athāsyāḥ kavacaṃ ||

śrībhairava uvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi mātaṃgī kavacaṃ śubhaṃ |
vinā dhyānaṃ vinā maṃtra vinā homaṃ vinā valiṃ ||

yena smaraṇa mātreṇa sādhako dharaṇīpatiḥ ||

śrībhairava uvāca ||

mātaṃgī kavacaṃ divyaṃ sarvarakṣākaraṃ nṛṇāṃ |
kavitvaṃ ca dhanitvaṃ ca gajavāji sukhāni ca ||

sukhadaṃ śubhadaṃ satyamaṇimādi pradāyakaṃ |
brahmaviṣṇu maheśānāṃ teṣāmādyā maheśvarī ||

ślokārddhaṃ ślokamekaṃ vā yastu samyak paṭhennaraḥ |
tasya haste sadaivāsti rājalakṣmī na saṃśayaḥ ||

ucchiṣṭa vadano bhūtvā kamalāsana saṃsthitaḥ |
yonimudrāṃ kare vadhvā śakti dhyānaparāyaṇaḥ ||

brahmaraṃdhraṃ samānīya ucchiṣṭa nāma saṃsthitāṃ |
lalāṭaṃ lakṣayennityaṃ mahācāṇḍālinīti ca ||

netrābhyāṃ suṣṇumukhī rakṣeddevī rakṣatu nāsikāṃ |
mahāpiśācinī cāsmān mukhe rakṣa tu sarvadā ||

lajjā rakṣatu māṃ daṃte coṣṭaḥ sanmārjane karāṃ |
civuke kaṃṭhadeśe ca ṭhakāra tritayaṃ tataḥ ||

sa visarga mahādevī hṛdayaṃ pātu sarvadā |
nābhau rakṣa tu māṃ nityaṃ kālikā raktalocanā ||

udare pātu cāmuṇḍā liṃge kātyāyanī tathā |
ugra caṇḍā gude pātu pādau rakṣa tu cāṃvikā ||

bhujau rakṣa tu śarvāṇī hṛdayaṃ caṃḍabhīṣaṇā |
jihvāyāṃ mātṛkā rakṣet pūrvaṃ rakṣa tu puṣṭikā ||

uttare kṛttikā rakṣed vidyā rakṣa tu paścime |
vijayā dakṣiṇe rakṣenmedhā rakṣa tu cāgneye ||

nair(-)ṛtyāṃ prajñayā rakṣed vāyavyāṃ pātu lakṣaṇā |
īśānyāṃ rakṣayeddevī mātaṃgī śubhakāriṇī ||

<p. 210a>

ūrddhvaṃ pātu mahādevī devānāṃ hitakāriṇī |
pātāle pātu māṃ nityaṃ vāsukī viśvarūpiṇī ||

kaṃṭhadeśa svarā pātu ājñācakre tu bhakṣakaiḥ |
kakārādi ṭhakārāṃtaṃ dvādaṃte hṛadye priyāṃ ||

maṇipūraḍādiphāṃtaṃ daśavarṇa svarūpiṇī |
ṣaṭpatre ṣaḍavarṇābhyāṃ vādilāṃtā sadāvatu ||

vādisāṃte sadā devī catuṣpatreṣu rakṣa tu ||

oṃ krāṁ śrīṁ prīṁ chrīṁ chrīṁ ṭhaḥ hrīṁ ṭhaḥ svāhā |
imaṃ maṃtraṃ samuccārya dhārayedvāmake bhuje ||

kaṃṭhe vā dhārayedyastu sa ca devo maheśvaraḥ |
taṃdṛṣṭā devatāḥ sarve praṇamaṃti sa dūrataḥ ||

tasya tejaḥ prabhāvena gaṃtuṃ caiva na śakyate |
iṃdrādīnāṃ bhajet satvabhūpatiḥ sevakopamaḥ ||

icchā siddhirbhavet tasya aṇimādistathaiva ca |
kīrti ca kavitāṃ lakṣmīmāraṇādīni yāni ca ||

saṃsadā bhajate rājñāṃ kadācidbhakti pūjanāt |
ajñātvā kavacaṃ devi sumukhī yojayennaraḥ ||

tasya naśyaṃti deveśi yogiṇyo bhakṣayaṃtitaṃ |
ihaloke duḥkhabhāgīparaṃ mūko bhaviṣyati ||

janmakoṭi sadāmūko maṃtrasiddhiṃ na viṃdati |
gurupādaṃ namaskṛtya yadā maṃtraṃ labhet sudhī ||

tadā tu kavacaṃ devi sa kalā gurusevayā |
ihaloke nṛpo bhūtvā paremuktimavāpunyāt ||

navodhyot paraśiṣyāya durjanāya sureśvarī |
niṃdakāya kuśīlāya śaktihiṃsā parāya ca ||

yo dadāti sa pāpiṣṭho mātaṃgī kavacaṃ śubhaṃ |
pivaṃ tu rudhiraṃ tasya yoginyo bhakṣayaṃtitaṃ ||

tasmād rahasya paramaṃ sarvasiddhi labhaṃtite |
gopyādgopyataraṃ gopyaṃ guhyādguhyataramataṃ ||

na prakāśyamidaṃ bhadre prāṇaiḥ kaṃtha gatairapi |
pūjā koṭisamaṃ stotraṃ stotrakoṭi samo japah ||

japakoṭi samaṃ dhyānaṃ dhyānakoṭi samaṃ layaḥ |
layakoṭi imāṃ vidyā na prakāśyā kadācana ||

iti śrīguhyakālītaṃtre mātaṃgī kavacaṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ ||

atha sadāśivasya ||

tāramāyādharā vījapūrvaḥ paṃcākṣaro manuḥ |
aṣṭavarṇo bhavedasya vāmadevī munirmataḥ ||

<p. 210b>

devaḥ sadāśivaḥ proktaḥ paṃktiśchaṃda udāhṛtaṃ |
māyā prāsāda vījābhyāṃ bheditābhyāṃ ca ṣaṭsvaraiḥ ||

ṣaḍbhistathā maṃtravarṇaiḥ ṣaḍaṃgāni sajātibhiḥ |
dhyāyet tataśce siṃdūrāruṇaṃ smeraṃ trilocanaṃ ||

ṭaṃkaṃ mṛgaṃ tathā devīmāliṃgataṃ varapradaṃ |
hastaiścaturbhirārakta padmaṃ ca dadhatīṃ karaiḥ ||

pīnavṛtta ghanottuṃgastanāṃ vāmāṃka saṃsthitāṃ |
raktapadmasamāsīnaṃ raktasraggaṃdhalepanaṃ ||

samāptaścāyaṃ mātaṃgī kramaḥ ||

atha bhuvaneśvarī kramo likhyate ||

tatra pīṭhanyāsāṃtaṃ karmavidhāya ṛṣyādinyāsaṃ kuryāt ||

ṛṣiḥ śaktirbhavecchaṃdo gāyatrī devatā manoḥ |
kathitā suras'mghena sevitā bhuvaneśvari ||

ṣaṭdīrghayuktavījena kuryādaṃgāni ṣaṭkramāt |
saṃhāra sṛṣṭimārgeṇa mātṛkānyasta vigrahaḥ ||

maṃtranyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryāt devatābhāvasiddhaye |
hṛllekhāṃ mūrddhni vadane gaganāṃ hṛdayāṃvuje ||

raktāṃ karālikāṃ guhye mahocchūṣmāṃ padadvaye |
ūrddhva prāgdakṣiṇodīcya paścimeṣu mukheṣu ca ||

sadyādi hrasva vījāḍhyānyastavyā bhūta sa prabhā |
aṃgāni vinyaset paścājjāti yuktāni ṣaṭkramāt ||

brahmāṇaṃ vinyasedbhāle gāyatryā sahasaṃyutaṃ |
sāvitryā saṃyutaṃ viṣṇuṃ kapāle dakṣiṇe nyaset ||

vāgīśvaryā samāyuktaṃ vāmagaṃḍe maheśvaraṃ |
śriyā dhanapatinyasyed vāmakarṇāgrake punaḥ ||

ratyāsmaraṃ mukhenyasya puṣṭyā gaṇapatiṃ nyaset |
sadyaḥ karṇoparinidhiḥ karṇagaṇḍāṃtarāṃlayoḥ ||

nyastavyau vadane mūlaṃ bhūyaścetāṃtanau nyaset |
kaṃthamūle stanadvaṃdve vāmāṃśe hṛdayāṃbuje ||

savyāṃśe pārśvayugale nābhideśe ca deśikaḥ |
bhālāṃśa pārśvajaṭharapārśvāṃśā parake hṛdi ||

brahmāṇyādyāstatonyasyā vidhinā prokta lakṣaṇā |
mūlena vyāpakaṃ dehe nyaseddevīṃ viciṃtayet ||

udyaddinadyutimiṃdukirīṭāṃ tuṃgakucāṃ nayanatrayayuktāṃ |
smeramukhīṃ varadāṃ kuśapāśāṃbhīti karāṃ prabhaje bhuvaneśīṃ ||

prajapenmaṃtravinmaṃtraṃ dvātriṃśallakṣamāṇataḥ |
triḥ svāhāktaiḥ prajuhuyādaṣṭadravyairdaśāṃśataḥ ||

<p. 211a>

dadyādarghyaṃ dineśāya tatra saṃciṃtya pārvatīṃ |
padmamaṣṭadalaṃ vāhye vṛttaṃ ṣoḍaśabhirdalaiḥ ||

vilikhet karṇikāmadhye ṣaṭkoṇamati suṃdaraṃ |
tataḥ saṃpūjayet pīṭhaṃ navaśakti samanvitaṃ ||

jayākhyā vijayā paścādajitāhvāparājitā |
dityavilāsinī dogdhrī aghorāmaṃgalā nava ||

vījāḍhyamāsanaṃ datvā mūrtiṃ tenaiva kalpayet |
tasyāṃ saṃpūjayeddevī māvāhyāvaraṇaiḥ kramāt ||

madhya prāgyāmya saumyeṣu paścimeṣu yathā kramāt |
hṛllekhādyāḥ samabhyarcyāḥ paṃcabhūta samaprabhāḥ ||

varapāśāṃkuśābhīti dhāriṇyo mitabhūṣaṇāḥ |
sthāneṣu pūrvamukteṣu pūjayedaṃgadevatāḥ ||

ṣaṭkoṇeṣu rājenmaṃtrī paścānmithunadevatāḥ |
iṃdraṃ koṇe lasaddaṇḍa kuṇḍitākṣa guṇābhayaṃ ||

gāyatrīṃ pūjayenmaṃtrī brahmāṇama pitā dṛśaṃ |
rakṣakoṇe cakraśaṃkhagadāpaṃkajadhāriṇīṃ ||

sāvitrīṃ pītavasanāṃ yajedviṣṇuṃ ca tādṛśaṃ |
vāyukoṇeparaśvakṣamālā bhayavarānvitāṃ ||

yajet sarasvatīmacchāṃ rudraṃ tādṛśa lakṣaṇaṃ |
vahnikoṇe yajed ratnakuṃbhaṃ maṇḍikaraṇḍakaṃ ||

karābhyāṃ vibhrataṃ pītaṃ tuṇḍilaṃ dhananāyakaṃ |
āliṃgya savyahastena vāmenāṃvudhadhāriṇīṃ ||

dhanadāṃka samārūḍhāṃ mahālakṣmīṃ prapūjayet |
vāruṇo madanaṃ vāṇapāśāṃkuśaśarāsanaṃ ||

dhārayaṃtaṃjapālakaṃ pūjayedratnabhūṣaṇaṃ |
savyena pratimāśliṣya vāmenotpaladhāriṇīṃ ||

pāṇinā ramaṇāṃkasthīratiṃ samyak samarcayet |
aiśāne pūjayet samyak vighnarājaṃ priyānvitaṃ ||

śṛṇi pāśadharaṃkāṃtā varāṃgasya krūrāṃguliṃ |
mādhvī pūrṇakapālāḍhyaṃ vighnarājaṃ digaṃvaraṃ ||

puṣkale vigaladratna sphuraccakaṣadhāriṇaṃ |
siṃdūrasadṛśākārāmuddāmamadavibhramāṃ ||

dhṛtaraktotpalāmanyapāṇināddhvajo spṛśāṃ |
āśliṣṭhakāṃtā maruṇāṃ puṣṭimarghe digaṃvarāṃ ||

karṇikāyāṃ nidhīpūjyau ṣaṭkoṇo bhayapārśvayoḥ |
aṃgāni keśareṣvetāḥ paścāt patreṣu pūjayet ||

anaṃga kusumā paścādanaṃga kusumāturā |
bhuvanapālā gagaṇairvegā caiva tataḥ paraṃ ||

śaktirekhā gaṇārekhā rekhā caivāṣṭa śuktayaḥ |
pāśāṃkuśa varābhīti dhāriṇyāruṇavigrahāḥ ||

<p. 211b>

tataḥ ṣoḍaśapatreṣu karālī vikarālyumā |
sarasvatī śrīdurgai vā lakṣmī śrutvau smṛtirdhṛtiḥ ||

śraddhā medhāmatiḥ kāṃtiḥ kuryāt ṣoḍaśa śaktayaḥ |
khaḍgakheṭakadhāriṇyaḥ śyāmāḥ pūjyāścamātaraḥ ||

padmādvahiḥ samabhyarcyāḥ śaktayaḥ paricārikāḥ |
prathamānaṃga rupāsyādanaṃgamadanā tataḥ ||

madanāturā bhuvanavegā tathā bhuvanapālikā |
syāt sarvaśaśirānaṃgavedanānaṃgamekhalā ||

caṣakaṃ tālavṛṃtaṃ ca tāṃbūlaṃ chatramujvalāṃ |
cāmare cāṃkuśaṃ puṣpaṃ vibhrāṇāḥ karapaṃkajaiḥ ||

sarvābharaṇa saṃdiṣṭān lokapālān vahiryajet |
vajrādīni ca tadvāhye devīmitthaṃ prapūjayet ||

atha bhuvaneśvarī stotram ||

athānaṃdamayīṃ sākṣācchabda brahmasvarūpiṇīṃ |
iḍesakala saṃpatyai jagatkāraṇamaṃvikāṃ ||

ādyāmaśeṣa jananīmaraviṃda yonerviṣṇoḥ śivasya ca vapuḥ pratimādayitrīṃ |
sṛṣṭiṃ sthitiḥ kṣayakarīṃ jagatī trayāṇāṃ srutvā śivaṃ 
vimalayāmyahamaṃviketvāṃ ||

pṛthvī jalena śikhinyamarutāṃvareṇa hotrendunādinakareṇa ca mūrtibhāja |
devasya manmatha riporapi śaktimattāhetustvameva khalu parvatarājaputrī ||

triḥ srotaśaḥ sakalaloka samarcitāya vaiśiṣṭakāraṇamavaititadevamātaḥ |
tvat pādapaṃkajaparāga pavitratāsuddhyaṃbhorjaṭāsu satataṃ parivartenaṃ yat ||

ānaṃdayet kumudinī madhipaḥ kalānāṃ nānyāsinaḥ kamalinī mathanetarāmvā |
ekasyamodanavidhau parameka īṣṭatvaṃ ca prapaṃcamabhipannayasiḥ sudṛṣṭyā ||

adyāpya śeṣajagatāṃ navayauvanāsiśailādhirājatanāpyati komalāsi |
eṣāṃ prasūrapitayā na samīkṣitā sidhyeyāsi gauriṃ manasā na pathisthitāsi ||

āhlādya janmamanujeṣu cirāddurāpaṃ tatrāpi pāṭavamavāpya nijeṃdriyāṇāṃ |
nābhyarcayaṃti jagatāṃ janayitri yetvāṃ niḥśreyaṃ nikāgramadhiruhya punaḥ 
pataṃti ||

karpūracūrṇa himavāri viloḍite naye caṃdanena kusumaiśca sujāta gaṃdhaiḥ |
ārādhayaṃtihimavāni samutsukāstvāṃ te khalvaśeṣa bhuvanāpi bhuvaḥ prathaṃte 
||

<p. 212a>

āviśya madhya padavīṃ prathame saroje suptābhirāja sadṛśīrivacarya viśvaṃ |
vidyullatāvalayavibhramamudbhavaṃtī padmāni paṃcariha na pṛthumaśruvānā ||

tannirgatā mṛtarasairabhiṣivyagātraṃ mārgeṇa tena vilayaṃ punarapyavāptā |
yeṣāṃ hṛdi sphurasi jātu na te bhaveyurmātarmaheśvara kuṃduṃ 
vinigarbhabhājaḥ ||

ālaṃvikuṃtalabhavāmabhirāmavaktrāmāpīsta varanataṭīṃ tanu vṛttamadhyāṃ |
ciṃtākṣasūtra kalaśā likhitādya hastāmāvartayāmi manasā tava gauramūrti ||

āsthāya yogamavajitya ca vairiṣaṭkamāvadhya ceṃdriyagaṇaṃ manasi prasanne |
pāśāṃkuśā bhayavarāḍhyakārāṃ suvaktrāmālokayaṃti bhuvaneśvari 
yoginastvāṃ ||

uttaptakāṭakanibhaiḥkaribhiścaturbhirāvartitā mṛtaghaṭairabhiṣicyamānā |
hastadvayena naline rucire vahaṃtī padmāpi sā bhavya varābhavasitvameva ||

aṣṭābhirugra vividhāyudhavāhinībhirdevillarībhiradhiruhya mṛgādhirājaṃ |
dūrvādaladyutiramartya vipakṣapakṣānnyakkurvatītvamasi devi bhavāni durgā ||

āvirnnidāghajalaśīkaraśobhivaktrāṃ guṃjāgaṇena parikalpitahārayaṣṭiṃ |
śubhrāṃśukāmamitakāṃtimanaṃgataṃtrāmādyāṃ puliṃda taruṇīṃmasakṛt 
smarāmi ||

haṃsairgatairasita nūpuradūrahastairmurterivāpyu vacaneranugamyamānāṃ |
padmādivorddhamukharūḍhasu jātanālau śrīkaṇṭhapatni 
śirasaivadadhetavāṃghrīṃ ||

dvābhyāṃ samī tu mati dṛptimatena dṛṣṭyāmutpādya bhālanayanaṃ 
vṛṣaketanena |
sāṃdrānurāgataralena nirīkṣyamāṇe jaṃghe ubhe api bhavānitavānatosmi ||

urūpyanāmijitahasti karāvalepausthaulanamārdavatayā paribhūtalastauḥ |
śroṇībharasya sahano parikalpyavartaustaṃbhāvirāvaya sā tava madhyameva ||

śroṇyostanau ca yugapat prathayiṣyatoccairvālyātyavacayasā parihṛṣṭasāraḥ |
romāvalī vilasitena vibhāvya mūrtirmadhyastavasphuratu me hṛdayasya madhye ||

<p. 212b>

sakhyāsmarasya haranetra hutāśabhīrorlāvaṇya vāritanayai navayauvanena |
āpādyadattanivapallalamapradhṛṣyaṃmābhiḥ kadāpi tava devi na vismareyaṃ || 

īśopagūhapi śunaṃbhasitaṃ dadhāna kāśmīrakuṃkuma (*) (?) 
mū svaṃ na paṃkajete |
snānotthitasyakariṇaḥ kṣaṇalakṣaphenau siṃdūraratau smarayataḥ samadasyau 
kuṃbhau ||

kaścātiriktagaladujvalakāṃtidhāraḥ ime bhautujau nijaripormakaradhvajena |
kaṇṭhagrahāya racitau kiladīrghapāśau mātarmamaśrutipathaṃ na vilaṃghayete ||

nātyāyataṃ racitamaṃvubhilāsacaurye bhūṣābhareṇa vividhena virājamānaṃ |
kaṇṭhaṃ manoharaguṇaṃ girirājakanye saṃciṃtya tṛptimupayāni kadāpi nāhaṃ 
||

atyāyatākṣamabhijāta lalātapaṭṭaṃmaṃda smitenadaraphullakapolarekhaṃ |
vidyādharaṃ vadanamunnatadīrghanāsaṃyaste smaratya sakṛtanuḥ sa eva jātaḥ ||

ādistuṣāravaralekha manalpagaṃdhapuṣpoparibhramadalivrajanirviśeṣaṃ |
yaśceta sā kalayate tava keśapāśaṃ tasya svayaṃ galati devi purāśapāśaḥ ||

śruti sucaritapāśaṃdhīmatāṃ stotra me tat paṭhati ya ihamartyo 
nityamārdrāṃtarātmā |

sa bhavati padamuccaiḥ saṃpadāṃ pādanamraḥ 
kṣitipamukuṭalakṣmīrlakṣmaṇācāṃ cirāyaḥ ||

iti śrī bhuvaneśvarī stotraṃ samāptaṃ ||

atha bhuvaneśvarī kavacaṃ ||

devyuvāca ||

bhuvaneśyāśca deveśī yāyā vidyā prakāśitā |
etāścādhitya gatāḥ sarvāḥ śrotumicchāmi sāṃprataṃ ||

trailokya maṃgalaṃ nāma kavacaṃ yatpuroditaṃ ||

īśvarovāca ||

pārvatī śṛṇu vakṣyāmi sāvadhānāvadhāraya |
trailokyamaṃgalaṃ nāma kavacaṃ maṃtra vigrahaṃ ||

siddhavidyāmayaṃ devi sarvaiśvarya pradāyakaṃ |
paṭhanādhāraṇānmartya strailokyaiśvarya bhāgbhavet ||

trailokya maṃgalasyāsya kavacasya ṛṣiḥ śivaḥ |
chaṃdo virāṭ jagaddhātrī devatā bhuvaneśvarī ||

dharmakāmārtha mokṣeṣu viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
hrīṁ vījaṃ me śiraḥ pātu bhuvaneśī lalāṭakaṃ ||

<p. 213a>

aiṁ pātu dakṣanetraṃ me hrīṁ pātu vāmalocanaṃ |
śrīṁ pātu dakṣakarṇaṃ me trivarṇātmā maheśvarī ||

vāmakarṇaṃ sadā pātu aiṃ ghrāṇaṃ tu me sadā |
hrīṁ pātu vadanaṃ devī aiṃ pātu rasanā mama ||

vāk tripuṭā trivarṇātmā kaṇṭhaṃ pātu parāmvikāṃ |
śrīṁ skaṃdhau pātu niyataṃ hrīṁ pātu bhujau sarvadā ||

klīṁ karau tripuṭeśānī tripuṭaiśvarya dāyinī |
āṁ pātu hṛdayaṃ hrīṁ me madhyadeśaṃ sadāvatu ||

kroṁ pātu nābhideśaṃ sā tryakṣarī bhuvaneśvarī |
sarvavījaṃ sadā pṛṣṭe pātu sarvavaśaṃkarī ||

hrīṁ pātu guhyadeśaṃ me namo bhagavatī kaṭiṃ |
māheśvarī sadā pātu śaktinī jānuyugmakaṃ ||

annapūrṇe sadā pātu svāhā pātu padadvayaṃ |
sāmāṃ daśākṣarī pāyādanna purṇākhilaṃ vapuḥ ||

tāraṃ māyā rasā kāmaḥ ṣoḍaśārṇā tataḥ paraṃ |
śirasthāḥ sarvataḥ pātu viṃśatyannāsthikā mudā ||

tāradurge yugaṃ rakṣa svāheti ca daśākṣarī |
jaya durgā ghanaśyāmā pātu māṃ sarvato mudā ||

māyā vījādikā caiṣā daśārṇau ca tataḥ parā |
pratapta kāṃcanā bhāsā jayadurgānaneva tu ||

tāraṃ hrīṃ duṃ durgāyai namoṣṭa varṇātmikā parā |
śaṃkhacakradhanurvāṇadharā māṃ dakṣiṇeva tu ||

mahiṣamardinī svāhā vasuvarṇātmikā parā |
nair(-)ṛtyāṃ sarvadā pātu mahiṣāsuranāśinī ||

māyā padmāvatī svāhā saptārṇā parikīrtitā |
padmāvatī padmasaṃsthā paścime māṃ sadāvatu ||

pāśāṃkuśa puṭāmāyai hi parameśvari svāhā |
trayodaśārṇā tārādyā sāśvārūḍhānaneva tu ||

sarasvatī paṃcaśaro nityaklinne madadrave |
svāhāratpakṣarī nityāmāmuttare sadāvatu ||

tāraṃ māyā ca kavacaṃ khecara kṣatato vadhūḥ |
krūṁ kṣe hrī phaṭ mahāvidyā dvādaśārṇā khilapradā ||

ariṣṭotvādibhiḥ pāyācchivā koṇe sadā ca māṃ |
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ sā tato vālā māmūrddhadeśatovatu ||

viṃdvaṃtāṃ bhairavī vālā bhūmau māṃ sarvadāvatu |
iti te kavacaṃ puṇyaṃ trailokyaṃ maṃgalaṃ paraṃ ||

<p. 213b>

sārāt sārataraṃ puṇyaṃ mahāvidyaugha vigrahaṃ |
asyāpi paṭhanāt sadyaḥ kuveropi dhaneśvaraḥ ||

iṃdrādyāḥ sakalāḥ devādhāraṇāt paṭhanādyataḥ |
sarvasiddhīśvarāḥ saṃtaḥ sarvaiśvaryamavāpnuyuḥ ||

puṣpāṃjalyaṣṭakaṃ dadyānmūlenaiva sathak pṛthak |
saṃvatsaraśatāyāstu pūjāyāḥ phalamāpnuyāt ||

prītimanyonyataḥ kṛtvā kamalā niścalā gṛhe |
vāṇī ca nivasedvaktre satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

yo dhārayati puṇyātmā trailokya maṃgalābhidhaṃ |
kavacaṃ paramaṃ puṇyaṃ sopi puṇyavatāṃ vacaḥ ||

sarvaiśvarya yuto bhūtvā trailokyavijayī bhavet |
puruṣo dakṣiṇe vāhau nārī vā manuje tathā ||

vahu putravatī bhūtvā vaṃdhyāpi labhate sutaṃ |
brahmāstrādīni śastrāṇi naiva daṃśaṃtitaṃjanaṃ ||

etat kavacama jñātvā yo bhajed bhuvaneśvarīṃ |
dāridryaṃ paramaṃ prāpyaso cirānmṛtyumāpnuyāt ||

iti śrīrudrayāmale devīśvarasaṃvāde trailokyamaṃgalaṃnāma kavacaṃ samāptaṃ 
||

atha śivasya ||

namaḥ śivāyeti maṃtraḥ paṃcārṇastārāpūrvakaḥ |
ṣaḍakṣaroyaṃ viprāṇāṃ bhuktimukti prasādhakaḥ ||

vāmadevo muniḥ paṃktiśchaṃdo devaḥ sadāśivaḥ |
ṣaḍvarṇaistu ṣaḍaṃgāni kalpayet sādhakottamaḥ ||

tato dhyāyeta gokṣīra rajatādri samaprabhaṃ |
cārucaṃdra kalārāja jaṭāmukuṭamaṇḍitaṃ ||

paṃcavaktradharaṃ śaṃbhuṃ paṃcavaktraṃ trilocanaṃ |
śārdūla carmavasanaṃ ratnābharaṇabhūṣitaṃ ||

dakṣorddha haste ṭaṃkaṃ ca varaṃ ca dadhataḥ karaiḥ |
vāmorddha haste hariṇaṃ dadhānamabhayaṃ para ||

suprasannamukhāṃbhojaṃ niviṣṭaṃkuśaviṣṭare |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśādyaṃ stutaṃ bhaktyā surāsuraiḥ ||

viśvādyaṃ viśva vapuṣaṃ bhavabhīti haraṃ bhavaṃ ||

samāptaścāyaṃ bhuvaneśvarī kramaḥ ||

atha dhūmāvatī kramaḥ ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi dhūmāvatyā manuṃ paraṃ |
pippalādo muniśchaṃdonivṛjjyeṣṭhāsya devatā ||

ṣaṭdīrgha viṃduyuktena dhakāreṇa ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
ādyavījadvayāṃ tasthaiḥ ṣaḍvarṇairnyā samācaret ||

<p. 214a>

aṃguṣṭhādau ṣaḍaṃgeṣu punardevīṃ viciṃtayet |
vivarṇā caṃcalā kṛṣṇā dīrghā ca malināṃvarā ||

vimukta kuṇḍalā dīrghā vidhavā viraladvijā |
kākadhvajarathārūḍhā vilaṃvita payodharā ||

śūryahastāti rukṣākṣī dhūtahastātvarānvitā |
pravaddharo mātu bhṛśaṃ jaṭilā kuṭilekṣaṇā ||

kṣutpipāsārditā nityaṃ sadā kalaha tatparā |
evaṃ vidhāṃ sadā dhyāyet tataḥ karma samācaret ||

pūrvokte pūjayet pīṭhe jyeṣṭhāṃ śatru nivṛttaye |
keśareṣu ṣaḍaṃgāni patrasthā aṣṭaśaktayaḥ ||

kṣudhātṛṣṇaratirnidrānir(-)ṛtirdurgātīruṣā |
akṣameti tato devā iṃdrādyā āyudhānvitāḥ ||

evaṃ jyeṣṭhāṃ samārādhya siddhamaṃtraḥ prajāyate ||

<p. 214b>

atha dhūmāvatī kavacaṃ ||

pārvatyuvāca ||

devadeva mahādeva bhaktānugrahakārakaḥ |
dhūmāvatyāstu kavacaṃ brūhi me karuṇānidhe ||

mahādeva uvāca ||

asti guhyatamaṃ loke kavacaṃ śatrunigrahaṃ |
sarvepsita pradaṃ devi tava snehāt prakāśyate ||

yacchrutvā rāmacaṃdreṇasaṃgare rāvaṇo hataḥ |
bhārgaveṇāpi yacchrutvā jitaṃ sarvaṃ carācaraṃ ||

tameva kavacaṃ vacmi sāvadhānāvadhāraya |
kavacasya mahādevi pippalāda ṛṣiḥ smṛtaḥ ||

chaṃdo virāṭ devatā ca śrīmaddhūmāvatī priye |
śatrūṇāṃ māraṇe devī viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

oṃ dhūmāvatī sadā pātu śiro me śatrumarddiṇī |
caṇḍarūpā mahādevī lalāṭe pātu māṃ sadā ||

kṣutkāmā nayane pātu pātu bhīmā śrutī mama |
kākadhvajā nāsikāṃ me sarvaśatruvināśinī ||

pralaṃvoṣṭhī sadā pātu vadanaṃ muṇḍamālinī |
vikṛtāsyā sadā pātu galaṃ me ripusūdinī ||

dhūṁ vījākhyā sadā pātu ghāṭaṃ me riṣṭatāriṇī |
skaṃdhau kaṃkālinī pātu nṛmuṇḍasragvibhūṣaṇā ||

śuṣkamāṃsā sadā pātu bhīṣaṇā me bhujaddhayaṃ |
lamvastanī sadā pātu dhūmavarṇāstana dvayaṃ ||

sūryahastā ca hṛdayaṃ pātu bhairavamādinī |
śatru māṃsapriyā pātu pṛṣṭhaṃ me rudhirapriyāṃ ||

madirā ghūrṇanayanā pātu pārśve kirīṭinī |
karālinī sadā pātu kukṣiṃ me śavavāhinī ||

vajratuṇḍā pātu nityaṃ kaṭideśaṃ śiva priyā |
karāla vadanā pātu guhyadeśaṃ digaṃvarāṃ ||

ghorāṭṭahāsinī pātu jānunī viraladvijā |
pādau me pātu satataṃ kṣutpipāsā kulā sadā ||

ghoraghaṇṭhā sadā pātu sarvāṃge śaṃkara priyā |
iti te kathitaṃ devī kavacaṃ ripu nigrahaṃ ||

yasya prapaṭhanāddevī sarvasiddhikare sthitā |
na tasya śatru pīḍāsyādduṣṭapīḍā kadāpi na ||

grahapīḍā bhūtapīḍā na bhavet kulasuṃdarī |
dhūmāvatī samabhyarcya kṛṣṇapuṣpeṇa sādhakaḥ ||

matsyamāṃsā savairdevīṃ pūjayitvā yathā vidhiṃ |
mahāmāṃsasya dhūpena dhūpayettāṃtra maṃtravit ||

<p. 215a>

aṣṭottara śatāvṛttiṃ paṭhedekamanāṃ priye |
pakṣamātreṇa deveśi ripuṃhanyānna saṃśayaḥ ||

etat sarvaṃ maheśāni māraṇeṣu niyojayet |
kavacasmaraṇāddevi ripuryāti yamālayaṃ ||

iti śrīrudrayāmale dhūmāvatīkalpe dhūmāvatīkavacaṃ ||

athāghorasya ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi sā ghorāstrājñayaṃ manuṃ |
māyā sphuradvayaṃ caiva prasphuraddvitayaṃ vadet ||

paścādvadetturutururūpāṃ te ca caṭadvayaṃ |
pracaṭa dvitayaṃ paścāt kahadvayaṃ vamadvayaṃ ||

vaṃdhadvayaṃ ghātaya dvi hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ śaravarṇakaḥ |
manuḥ prokto ghoramuniḥ tirṣṭupchaṃdosya devatā ||

aghorarūpaṃ vaṃ vījaṃ hrīṁ śaktiḥ parikīrtitā |
śaraṃ tu daśadigdaṃti divākaramitairmanāḥ ||

varṇaiḥ kuryāt ṣaḍaṃgāni padanyāsotha vakṣyate |
kaṭau ca vaktragala hṛnmābhyaṃ dhūkarajānuṣu ||

sa jaṃghāpādayoścaivaṃ padānye kādaśanyaset |
śaraṃ tu netravasvaddhira saṃvedāddhi vedakaiḥ ||

rasanetramitairvarṇairmṛtpadāni bhavaṃtyume |
dhyāyet tato meghakālaṃ bhīmadaṃṣṭraṃ trilocanaṃ ||

bhujaṃgabhūṣaṇaṃ raktavasanā lepaśobhitaṃ |
paraśuṃ karavālaṃ ca vāṇīstriśikhameva ca ||

dadhānāṃ dakṣiṇairhastairurddhādi kramataḥ paraiḥ |
ḍamaruṃ kheṭakaṃ cāpaṃ nṛkapālaṃ ca vibhrataṃ ||

samāptaścāyaṃ dhūmāvatī kramaṃ ||

atha vagalāmukhī kramaḥ ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi staṃbhanīṃ vagalāmukhīṃ |
nārāyaṇo muni striṣṭupchandaśca vagalāmukhī ||

devī vījaṃ tu hṛllekhā svāhā śaktiḥ samīritā |
viniyogāsya vikhyātaḥ puruṣārthaścatuṣṭaye ||

hṛllekhā hṛdayaṃ proktaṃ śivaśca vagalāmukhī |
śikhā tu savaduṣṭānāṃ tato vācaṃ mukhaṃ padaṃ ||

staṃbhayeti ca varmoktaṃ jihvāṃ kīlaya netrakaṃ |
buddhirvināśayāstraṃ syāt ṣaḍaṃgaṃ nyāsa īritaḥ ||

mūrdhhni bhāle bhruvormadhye netrayoḥ śotrayo rasoḥ |
gaṇḍadvaye tathā coṣṭhe dharāsya civukeṣu ca ||

gale ca dakṣadormūle tanmadhye maṇivaṃdhake |
aṃgulīnāṃ tathā mūle hastāgre caiva meva hi ||

<p. 215b>

anyed vāmabhujādau ca dakṣoru mūlake tataḥ |
dakṣa jānuni gulphe cāṃguli mūle padāgrataḥ ||

gaṃbhīrā ca madonmattāṃ taptakāṃcana sannibhāṃ |
caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ kamalāsana saṃsthitāṃ ||

mudgaraṃ dakṣiṇe pāśaṃ vāme jihvāṃ ca vajrakaṃ |
pītāṃvaradharā sāṃdra vṛtta pītapayodharāṃ ||

hemakuṃḍalabhūṣāṃ ca pītacaṃdrārddhaśekharāṃ |
pītabhūṣaṇa bhūṣāṃ ca svarṇasiṃhāsana sthitāṃ ||

evaṃ dhyātvā ca deveśīṃ śatrūstaṃbhanakāriṇīṃ |
bhūḥpradośa manoramye puṣpāmoda sudhūpite ||

gomayenātha saṃlipte maṇḍapetvāsanaṃ caret |
sauvarṇe vātharaupye vā paittare vātha bhūrjake ||

karpūrāguru kastūrī śrīkhaṃḍa kuṃkumairapi |
lipedyaṃtraṃ prayatnena lekhanyā hematārayoḥ ||

madhye yoniṃ samālikhya tadvāhye tu ṣaḍasrakaṃ |
tadvāhyeṣṭadalaṃ padmaṃ tadvāhye ṣoḍaśacchadaṃ ||

caturasra trayaṃ vāhye caturdvāropaśobhitaṃ |
yatra noktāṃ devatāyāḥ pīṭhaṃdā pīṭhaśaktayaḥ ||

tatra māyoditaṃ pīṭhaṃ jñeyetā eva śaktayaḥ |
tadvījena yajet pīṭhaṃ yadvā māyāmunātha vā ||

tatrāvāhya yajeddevīṃ su pītairupacārakaiḥ |
yajedaṃgāni ṣaṭkoṇe pūrvadvārādiṣu kramāt ||

gaṇeśaṃ vaṭukaṃ cāpi yoginyaḥ kṣetrapālakaṃ |
īśānādi niṛtyaṃtaṃ gurupaṃktiṃ samarcayet ||

vagalā pūrvapatre tu staṃbhinī ca tataḥ paraṃ |
jaṃbhinī mohinī valyā acalā caṃcalā tathā ||

durddharṣākalmaṣā dhīrā kalpanā kālakarṣiṇī |
bhrāmikā maṃdagamanā bhogākhyā caiva yogikā ||

etāḥ ṣoḍaśapatreṣu gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatairyajet |
ṣoḍaśa svara saṃyuktā saṃpradāyāt kulāgame ||

yajecca patra madhyeṣu kalpite cāṣṭapatrake |
brāhmyādyaṣṭau tu pūrvādau vāhanāyudha saṃyutāḥ ||

lokeśāṃśca tadastrāṇi pūjayed vāhyatastathā |
yonimadhye mūladevīṃ tripuṣpāṃjalibhiryajet ||

dhūpadīpai su naivedyairgaṃdhatāṃvūladīpakaiḥ |
nīrājya vidhivat paścājjapa saṃkhyānnivedayet ||

<p. 216a>

atha vagalāmukhī stotraṃ ||

oṃ pītavastrāṃ su netrāṃ ca dvibhujāṃ dāhaddhojvalāṃ |
śilāparvatahastāṃ ca smaraṃtī vagalāmukhīṃ ||

madhya sudhāddhi maṇimaṇḍapa ratnavedyāṃ siṃhāsano parigatāṃ 
paripītavarṇāṃ |
pītāṃvarābharaṇamālyavibhūṣitāṃgī devī namāmi dhṛtamudgara vairi jihvāṃ ||

jihvāgramādāthakareṇa devīṃ vāmena śatruparipīḍayaṃtī |
gadābhighātena tu dakṣiṇena pītāmvarāḍhyāṃ dvibhujāṃ namāmi ||

triśūladhāriṇīmamvī sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī |
sarvaśṛṃgāraveśāḍhyāṃ devīṃ dhyātvā prapūjayet ||

calat kanaka kuṇḍalollasita cārugaṇḍasthalāṃ lasat kanakacaṃpakadyuti virājita 
caṃdrānanāṃ |
gadāhata vipakṣakāṃ kalita lola jihvā calāṃ smarāmi vagalāmukhīṃ 
vimukhasanmukhastaṃbhinīṃ ||

pīyūṣo dadhimadhya cāru vilasadratnojjvale maṇḍape tat siṃhāsana mauli pāṭita 
ripu pretāsanādhyāsinīṃ |
svarnābhāṃ kalapīḍitāri rasanāṃ bhrāmyadgavā vibhramāṃ yastvāṃ paśyati 
yāṃti tasya vilayaṃ sadyopi sarvāpadaḥ ||

devitvaccaraṇāmvuje vitanuteyaḥ pītapuṣpāṃjaliṃ mudrāṃ vāmakare nidhāya ca 
punarmaṃtrī manojñājñākṣaraṃ |
pītadhyānaparopi kuṃbhaka vaśādvīje smaret pārthivaṃ tasyā mitramukhasya 
vāghṛdayago staṃbho bhavet tatkṣaṇāt ||

maṃtrasthānadalaṃ vipakṣadalane stotraṃ pavitraṃ ca te yaṃtraṃ vādi 
nimaṃtriṇāṃ trijagatāṃ yaṃtraṃ pavitraṃ ca te |
mātaḥ śrīvagalenināma lalitaṃ yaḥ stūyate te mukhe tannāma grahaṇena saṃpadi 
mukhastaṃbho bhavedvairiṇāṃ ||

vādīmūkati śaṃkitaḥ kṣitipatirvaiśvānaraḥ śītatiḥ krodhīśāṃtatidurjanaḥ 
sujanatiḥ kṣipraṃ mukhaṃ khaṃjati ||

garvī kharvati sarva eva jagati tvadyaṃtra yaṃtritāḥ |
śrīnitye vagalāmukhi pratidinaṃ kalyāṇi tubhyaṃ namaḥ ||

duṣṭastaṃbhanakaṃ ca vighnaśamanaṃ dāridrya vidhvaṃsanaṃ 
bhūbhṛtsaṃgamanaṃ ca yanmṛgadṛśāṃ cetaḥ samākarṣaṇaṃ |
saubhāgyaika niketanaṃ mama dṛśo kāruṇya pūrṇe kṣaṇaṃ 
mṛtyormāraṇamāvirastu parato mātastvadīyaṃ vapuḥ ||

tvaṃ vidyā paramā triloka jananī vighnaugha saṃchedinī yogākarṣaṇakāriṇī ca su 
mahadvaṃdaika saṃchedinī |
duṣṭoccāṭanakāriṇīṃ janamanaḥ saṃmohatha saṃdhāyinī jihvākīlana vaibhavā 
vijayate brahmāstrastu vidyā parā ||

<p. 216b>

mātaḥ staṃbhayamadvipakṣavadanaṃ jihvāṃ calaṃ kīlaya brāhmīṃ 
mudrayamudrayāsudhiṣaṇāṃ vahnergatiṃ staṃbhayaḥ |
śatrūṃścūrṇayacūrṇayāśugadayā gaurāṅgi pītāṃvare vighnaughaṃ vagale 
hara pratidinaṃ kāruṇya pūrṇekṣaṇe ||

mātarbhairavi bhadrakāli vijaye vārāhi viśvāśraye śrīnitye samaye maheśi vagale 
kāmeśi vāme rame |
mātaṃgī tripure parātparatare svargāpavargapradedāso haṃśaraṇāgataṃ karuṇayā 
viśveśvari trāhimāṃ ||

śāṅkaghe caurasaṃghe praharaṇasamaye vaṃdhane vārimadhye vahnyai vāde 
vivāde prakupitta nṛpatau divya kāle niśāyāṃ |
vācyātvaṃ staṃbhane vā ripu vadhasamaye nirvipattauraṇe vā gacchaṃstiṣṭhaṃ 
strikālaṃstava paṭhanamidaṃkārya siddhipradaṃ ca ||

mātaryaścanaraḥ sadāstavamidaṃ devyāḥ paṭhet sādhanaṃ dhṛtvā 
yaṃtramidaṃ tathaiva samaye vāhau kare vā gale |
rājāno varayoṣitopi karaṇaḥ sarpāmṛgeṃdrāḥ khalāḥ staṃbhayāṃti niṣīvite 
ripugatā lakṣmīryathā siddhyati ||

anudinamabhirāsaṃ sādhakoya strikāle paṭhati tribhuvaneśaḥ pūjyate devavargaiḥ |
bhavati sakalakṛtyaṃ tasya dṛṣṭvāvaloke bhavati paramasiddhau 
lokamātastathaiva ||

iti śrīnāradaviracite pītāṃ vagalāstotraṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ ||

atha vagalāmukhī kavacaṃ ||

śrīmahogratārovāca ||

rājñā maṇḍalakādīnāṃ maṇḍalo parisarpatāṃ |
sa garvāṇāṃ mahādeva dhanairvikṛta cetasāṃ ||

gajasarpāri jaṃtūnāṃ bhajanaṃ vada śaṃkara ||

śrībhaira uvāca ||

purā kṛta yuge devi vā takṣobhamupasthite |
saptārṇavānāmekatvagamakṣobhaṃ yayuḥ surā ||

seṃdrāssaviṣṇaveḥ sarvesubhayān māmupasthitāḥ ||

devā ūcuḥ ||

śivaśaṃkararudreśa rakṣāsmān śaraṇāgatān |
mahāvātādi vikṣobha kṣudhānasmānmahārṇavāt ||

tacchrutvāhaṃ sureśāni kavacaṃ pūrvanirmitaṃ |
dattavān sarvadevebhyo mahābhaya nikṛṃtanaṃ ||

kavacaṃ vagalāmukhyāḥ śivaprāṇapradaṃ mahat |
pūrvaṃ bhasmāsuratrāsādbhayavidrāvitaḥ svayaṃ ||

paṭhate tacca matprāṇān rakṣatvaṃ parameśvarī |
śivaprāṇapradaṃ tasmād viśrutaṃ rakṣakaṃ paraṃ ||

ṣaṭtrīśaddakṣavāmedhyād vagalā paramāśiraḥ |
sahasrāre guruḥ pātu śaktyā paramayojjvalaḥ ||

<p. 217a>

cidrūpā paramāśaktirlalāṭaṃ śivagehinī |
bhūyugaṃ me mahākālī netrayugmaṃ pareśvarī ||

karṇayugmaṃ pītapuṣpapriyā mevyāt kapolayoḥ |
civuke paramāśaktireṣṭayoḥ paramākalāḥ ||

vadanaṃ sakalā pātu paraṃbrahmasvarūpiṇī |
pītapuṣpārcitā kaṇṭhaṃ skaṃdhau skaṃdastanapradā ||

pītāṃvarā dakṣabhujaṃ vāmāṃ vāmāṃgahāriṇī |
hṛdayaṃ sa stanadvaṃdvaṃ bhānu viṃvamukhaikadhṛk ||

pṛṣṭaṃ caṃdradharaṃ mevyāt kaṭiṃ kaṃdarpya rūpadhṛk |
hṛtpaṃkajaṃ saiva śaktirviśuddhaṃ jīvarūpiṇī ||

ājñā cakraṃ viṃdurūpā paraṃbrahmakuṭuṃbinī |
brahmaraṃdhra sahasrāraṃ paṃkajākhya svarūpadhṛk ||

pātumāṃ paramāśaktiścāmarī kuṭilālakā |
ṣaṭtriṃśadakṣarāvidyā pītāpīta vapurddharā ||

pītapuṣpārcitā pīta naivedyādi valipriyā |
sarvāṅgaṃ me śubhā pātu vairi staṃbhanakāriṇī ||

brahmaraṃdhreṣu paramāsaṃsārārṇavatāriṇī |
tārayen māṃ mahādevī manovāṃchitadāyinī ||

ājñā cakre guraurūpā mahābhayanivāśinī |
sarvavidyā varā pātu jihvā śāstra vapurddharā ||

viśuddhau ṣoḍaśadale jīveśvara vapurddharā |
ṣaṭtriṃśat tatvarūpākhyā kaṃṭhasthā māṃ sadāvatu ||

hṛtpaṃkaje bhavānīśarūpārūpa parātmikā |
iṃdriyādi mahāśatrūn vidārayatu dāruṇā ||

maṇipūre daśadale mahāviṣṇu svarūpadhṛk |
dārayannakhilānmohān māṃ māyā sā parāvatu ||

prajāpati svarūpeyaṃ svādhisthāne ṣaḍdale |
sṛṣṭisthitā parāvidyā māṃ mohādvagalāvatu ||

gaṇeśarūpadhṛk pātutvādhāre māṃ caturdale |
ṣoḍaśa svararūpeyaṃ pātu māṃ paramākalā ||

kaṁ khaṁ gaṁ ghaṁ tathā ṅṁ caṁ chaṁ jaṁ jhaṁ ñṁ tathā vatu |
ṭaṁ ṭhaṁ ḍaṁ ḍhaṁ tvamākārāṇaṃ taṁ thaṁ daṁ tathā vatu ||

dhaṁ naṁ paṁ phaṁ tu śatrubhyaḥ pātu māṃ dhyāna tatparāṃ |
vaṁ bhaṁ maṁ yaṁ vidāyārtha śatrūn māṃ vāktvarūpiṇī ||

raṁ laṁ vaṁ śaṁ tathā ṣaṁ saṁ śatrujihvāṃ vidārya tu |
me vācaṃ me mukhaṃ jihvāṃ sadā rakṣa tu śāṃkarī ||

haṁ laṁ kṣaṁ sakalaṃ pātu rakṣan me paramaṃ yaśaḥ |
praṇavaṃ sthiramāyā ca tṛtīyaṃ tritayaṃ tathā ||

ya stṛtīyaṃ svarādyugmaṃ yādādyaṃ svarapaṃcamaṃ |
kā dvitīyaṃ dakṣanetre sarvaduṣṭa vahu smṛtaṃ ||

ṣaṣṭhyaṃtaṃ ca tathā vācaṃ staṃbhayāthāpi jihvayā |
dvitīyayā kālayeti tathā buddhiṃ vināśaya ||

sthira māyā tathā tāraṃ cāṃte vahni vadhūṃ priye |
eṣā vidyā mahāvidyā śatrunstaṃbhanakāriṇī ||

<p. 217b>

tridhā maṃtraṃ samuccārya sarvāṅge vyāpakaṃ kuru |
jayatyeva na saṃdehaḥ śatrūn śūrānmahāhave ||

kulālamṛtikāṃgṛhya vāmahastena dīpakaṃ |
kṛtvā prajvālya tailena vāme sthāpya manuṃ japet ||

trirātraṃ staṃbhayatyeva śatrusenāṃ mahāhave |
gauravarṇāṃ pītapuṣpairvālāṃ saṃpūjya bhāvataḥ ||

nyāsāṃ vidhāya dehena bhajan yogī japanmanuṃ |
pītopacāraistāṃ śaktiṃ saṃtoṣya parivāraṇāṃ ||

vaśayatyeva lokeśaṃ kiṃ punaḥ kṣudramānuṣaṃ |
vācastaṃbhana kārastu vīraśaktiṃ śubhānanāṃ ||

ṣoḍaśābdāṃ suvarṇāṃ ca alaṃkṛtya yajet priye |
sahasra mūlamaṃtraṃ tu japtvā vācaspaterapi ||

staṃbhayatyeva paramāṃ vācaṃ kiṃ kṣudramānuṣaṃ |
vaśīkaraṇa kāmastu vadvāparikaraṃ dṛḍhaṃ ||

śaktiṃ liṃgopari sthāpya trisahasraṃ japenmanuṃ |
indrāṇīṃ vaśayatyeva kiṃ punaḥ kṣudramānuṣīṃ ||

maṇḍalādhīśa vaśa kṛduttarābhimukhaṃ sthitaḥ |
dakṣānanāṃ suṃdarīṃ tu soḍaśābdāṃ śucismitāṃ ||

kucayostu karairdatvā pītādyāṃ hasitānanāṃ |
liṃge saṃsthāpya saṃcuvanmukhaṃ pītā manuṃ japan ||

trisahasraṃ mahārāja vaśayatyeva nānyathā |
yena kenāpyupāyena vagalābhakti tatparaḥ ||

staṃbhayet sakalāṃllokānvaśayatyeva śāṃkarī |
mārayecchatru saṃghātamuccāṭayati parvatān ||

devānāṃ sthapatiścandraḥ chādayet kiṃ paraṃ janaṃ |
asya pārvati māhātmyaṃ kavacasya kvavarṇitum ||

mahādraudāruṇe cāṃte pralayādāvupasthite |
staṃbhitaṃ ca tadā devi vātasaṃghaṃ sakṛjjapāt ||

evaṃ sā paramā vidyā mahāśatruvidāriṇī |
nāstike taskare duṣṭenmūḍhe paṇḍitamāninī ||

na deyā hṛdayā vidyā dadanvandhamavāpnuyāt |
suśīlāya sudāṃtāya gurubhaktiparāya ca ||

viśuddhāya mahāmaṃtrajāpine deyamuttamaṃ |
kṛtvā purā sukavacaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ samāhitaḥ ||

nānyathā staṃbhinī vidyā siddhāsyāditi niścayaḥ ||

iti śrīekavīrātaṃtre mahogratārāsaṃvāde vagalāmukhīkavacaṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ ||

<p. 218a>

atha mṛtyuñjaya bhairavasya ||

oṃ jūṁsaḥ iti maṃtrasya prokto mṛtyuṃjayābhidhaḥ |
ṛṣiḥ kalāho daityādi gāyatrīchanda īritaṃ ||

mṛtyuñjayo mahādevo devatā parikīrtitaḥ |
ṣaḍdīrghayu tṛguṇā ṣaḍaṃgavidhirīritaḥ ||

padmadvayasthitaṃ smeraṃ caṃdrārkāgni vilocanaṃ |
hasteṣu jñānamudrāṃ ca pāśamakṣākṣimālike ||

karpūrābhaṃ śīrṣacaṃdraḥ karādvāmṛtadhārayā |
arddhāṃgaṃ vahubhūṣāḍhyaṃ kāntyā viśvavimohanaṃ ||

samāptaścāyaṃ vagalāmukhī kramaḥ ||

[iti śrītaṃtracaiṃtāmaṇau tripurabhairavī(-)mahālakṣmī(-)mātaṅgī(##-)
nāma saptaviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 27 ||

atha pratyeka nityārcanaṃ nirṇīya sakalāṣṭa sādhanopa yuktatvāt prathamataścakra 
pūjāmāha ||

cakrapūjāṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ |
abhīṣṭa siddhidānātaḥ paraṃ kiṃcana vidyate ||

sarveṣāmeva devānāṃ śriyā proktepsitapradā |
vaidikairapi kartavyā bhīṣṭasiddhyai purohitaṃ ||

kṛtvā tu kaulikaṃ devi pūrṇāḥ syustanmanorathā ||

śāṃtike pauṣṭike vaśye cākṛṣṭaustaṃbhamāraṇe |
vidveṣoccāṭane māhe parasainya parājaye ||

ājñā siddhau ca mokṣārthe siddhisādhana hetave |
upasarga vināśāya guhadoṣa nivāraṇe ||

rājyaṃ bhraṃśe nareṃdrāṇā sa lakṣmī haraṇāya ca |
apatyalābhe cāniṣṭe upavyādhi nivāraṇe ||

prajā śāṃtā vanāvṛṣṭyāṃ mātṛ cakraṃ pratiṣṭhite |
dīkṣākāle ca madane pavitre guru parvaṇi ||

vipattau deśikendrāṇāmatha vā gotramelane |
prasthāne ca pravāse vā utsavā naṃdasaṃpadau ||

apekṣitaṃ tadā kārya manujaiścakra pūjanaṃ |
sarvadevapriyaṃ gopyaṃ tadvidhiṃ kathayāmyatha ||

samayaścakra pūjāyā aṣṭadhā parikīrtitaḥ |
sahasotyattite kārye kārye vā pūrṇatāṃ gate ||

devatotsāha divase kaulikasyāgamepi vā |
umāmāheśvare yoge yoge vā śaktisaṃgame ||

valirājyaṃ kāmadine cakrapūjāti harṣadā |
pradoṣe vā bhijiti vā niśīthe vāṣṭamīyutā ||

navamyāṃ cedbhavedyoga umāmāheśvarābhidhaḥ |
bhaumāṣṭamyāṃ caturdaśyāṃ yogoyaṃ śaktisaṃgamaḥ ||

āśvinasyāsite pakṣe trayodaśyādi paṃca ca |
valirājyamidaṃ proktaṃ yatheccha krīḍanāya tu ||

tat kāmadinamityāhuḥ somavāre trayodaśī |
pūrvasmindivase snātvā devīmabhyarcya kāmanāṃ ||

<p. 218b>

kṛtvā saṃkalpayeccakrapūjāṃ dayād valiṃ paśoḥ ||

balidānaprakārastu āyavācyaḥ ||

evaṃ datvā valiṃ samyaṅnityakṛtyaṃ vidhāya ca |
tṛtīye praharerāmānarānścārthe nimaṃtrayet ||

amuktyāḥ prītaye devyā manmanoratha siddhaye |
cakrapūjot savārthaṃ tvaṃścomayāmaṃtritāhyasi ||

atha nimaṃtraṇa prakāramāha ||

tato nimaṃtrayet sarvān yoginyo yogināmapi |
puṣpaṃ datvā kare savye saṃbhāṣāvaraṇaṃ tathā ||

adyame gṛhṇa pūjārthaṃ nimaṃtraṇaṃ karomyahaṃ |
tata āgamanaṃ kuryāt pādau prakṣyālya pāṇinā ||

ācāryāya sukhaṃ devi maṃtreṇaiva nimaṃtrayet ||

aṣṭādhikā nimaṃtrāstu striyo nyūnāstu tat kṛte |
strībhyaśca puruṣānyūnā adhikāste tu hānidā ||

sarve kaulavratasthā vā prāgdakṣāya ca varjitāḥ |
bhavaṃti dīkṣā niratā nimaṃtryāścakrapūjane ||

tasyāṃ rātrau tu saṃpūjyā devaṃ svayamataṃdritaḥ |
kulaśabda dvidhā proktā kulajeti piśācinī ||

trayodaśārṇaṃ svāhāṃtamaṣṭottara sahasrakaṃ |
japenniśi tataḥ paśyeccakre vighnaṃ tathā śubhaṃ ||

vighne dṛṣṭe na kartavyaṃ kāryaṃ vā śāṃtipūrvakaṃ |
śāṃtirgaṇeśvaro homo grahāṇāṃ bhairavasya ca ||

tato vahirvaliṃ dadyādimaṃ maṃtramudīrayan ||

oṃ namaśca triruccāryahyamukakṣetrapālakaṃ |
ehyehi bhagavan pūjāṃ gṛhnayugmaṃ valiṃ tathā ||

bhakṣayugmaṃ cakra vighnakarān staṃbhaya yugmakaṃ |
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā saptacaturvarṇonmaṃtraḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

dinasya kṛtyaṃ nirvartya sāyaṃ cakraṃ prapūrayet ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

sāṃprataṃ śrotumicchāmi nirṇayaṃ melakasya tu |
kasmin sthāneṣu kurvīta kulacakraṃ samudbhavaṃ ||

kena cakraṃ prakartavyaṃ kathayasva maheśvaraḥ ||

śrībhairava uvāca ||

kathayāmi varārohe cakrasthāna paraṃ śṛṇu |
śmaśāne ekavṛkṣe ca parvate mātṛkā gṛhe ||

prāsāde śūnya vāseṣu nadītīre araṇyake |
eteṣvekaṃ ca saṃmārjya praliptaṃ gomayena tu ||

tuṣakeśādikaṃ śodhyaṃ kiṃkarī kiṃkareṇa vā |
śmaśānaṃ tu prayogaṃ ca varaṇā ekavṛkṣakaṃ ||

<p. 219a>

parvatāgre bhavet kollāgṛhamātrāṭṭahāsakaṃ |
prāsādastu jayaṃtī ca caritaṃ śūnyaveśma ca ||

srakāhyakaṃ nadītīramaraṇyaṃ devikoṭakaṃ |
sthānaṃ ca kathitaṃ bhadre udbhavaṃ kathayāmite ||

avargaṃ pūrvamuddiṣṭaṃ kavargāgneya saṃsthitaṃ |
ca vargaṃ dakṣiṇe bhāge ṭha vargaṃ nair(-)ṛte smṛtaṃ ||

ta vargaṃ paścime bhadre vāyavye tu pa vargakaṃ |
ya vargamuttarebhāge śavargamīśa saṃsthitaṃ ||

eṣu sthāneṣu suśroṇi cakrasya tu samudbhavaṃ |
utsthānaikaṃ samāgatya kuryādvīrasya yojanaṃ ||

vartanaṃ kathayiṣyāmi ācāryasya tu lakṣaṇaṃ |
vahuśastraśrutā dhīrā daśapacchānugāminaḥ ||

pāraṃparya kramajñāna gurusiddhaḥ prapūjakāḥ |
pūrṇābhiṣeka sampannā advaitācāravartinaḥ ||

lajjānujñāṃ guroḥ samyak syāta ku (*) (?) saṃga gataḥ |
sarvasatva dayā bhūtadaṃbhamātsarya varjitaḥ ||

kṣāṃtodāṃtaṃ śucirnityaḥ putravacchiṣya pālakaḥ |
ebhirguṇaiḥ samāyukta ācāryaḥ sthānu suṃdarī ||

atha maṇḍalamāha ||

kṣaumikena susūtreṇa sumitaṃ kārayet priye |
sureṣāṃ pātayedbhūmau aṣṭakoṇāṣṭa patrikā ||

keśaraṃ ca ṣaḍaṃgulyaṃ karṇikāṣṭāṃgulāni ca |
dvādaśāṃgula patrāṇi dalasaṃdhi dviraṃgulaṃ ||

caturaṃgula caṃdrāṇi vartulākāramaṃḍalaṃ |
tadvāhye dvārabhāgāni dvādaśāṃgulamānataḥ ||

caturdvāraścatuḥkoṇaṃ koṇeṣu padmalāṃchitaṃ |
karṇikā pītavarṇā ca keśaraṃ raktameva ca ||

patraṃ śvetakṛtaṃ bhadre dalasaṃdhi harītakaṃ |
kṛṣṇadvārayutaṃ devi śuklaṃ caṃdrāṃ śumaṇḍalaṃ ||

rogopaśāṃtaśāṃtyarthaṃ bhadramaṇḍalamālikhet ||

śivoktaṃtaṃ vadiṣyāmi śrūyatāṃ varavarṇini |
pītasūtreṇa suśroṇi sumitaṃ kārayet priye ||

ā hūṁṭhāni ca hastāni bhūmau sūtreṇa pātayet |
ṣaḍaṃgulaṃ karṇikā ca caturaṃgulakeśara ||

dvādaśāṃgula patrāṇi śaśimaṇḍalaśobhanaṃ |
pītabhadrairdalaṃ bhadre kṛṣṇena dalasaṃdhiṣu ||

caṃdraṃ śuklena kurvīta raktena dvarāmeva ca |
evaṃ vidhaṃ suśobhaṃ ca surekhe samameva ca ||

pūrve kapālaṃ śuklena kṛṣṇenāsiṃca dakṣiṇe |
paścime haritaṃ bhadre ḍamaruṃ ca suśobhanaṃ ||

uttare śuklapītena triśūlaṃ varasuṃdarī |
śikhāṃśa grahaṇe deviyauṣṭyākarṣaṇa karmaṇi ||

<p. 219b>

viṣot kaṭoyaṃ sarvatra ālikhen maṃḍalāni ca ||

gaṇeśvaraṃ vadiṣyāmi adhunā varavarṇini |
raktasūtreṇa sumitaṃ trihastāyata maṇḍalaṃ ||

karṇikā keśare patre hastamekaṃ tu vāhayet |
sūrya caṃdra jalasthāne hastamekaṃ tu varṇayet ||

dvārakaṃ hastamālikhya caturasraṃ suśobhanaṃ |
karṇikā haritā proktā keśaraṃ pītameva ca ||

jalarūpaṃ site naiva sūryaṃ raktena cālikhet |
caṃdraṃ śvetena darvyeṇa patraṃ rakta suśobhanaṃ ||

dvāraṃ śvetaṃ suśobhāḍhya ma (*) (?) siṃ pūrvakṛṣṇakaṃ |
dakṣiṇe śvetanarakaṃ kṛṣṇaśūlaṃ ca paścime ||

uttare haritākāraṃ ḍamaruṃ ca suśobhanaṃ |
vaśyākarṣaṇa vedheṣu maṃḍalena maheśvarī ||

pratānakaṃ vadiṣyāmi idānīṃ vīramātari |
gocarmarajjunā bhūmyāṃ pātayet saṃitena ca ||

dvihastamārabhyamitaṃ caturdvāra vibhūṣaṇaṃ |
karṇikā paṃca aṃgulyā keśaraṃ caturaṃgulaṃ ||

patraṃ ṣoḍaśamaṃgulyā dvihastaṃ jalabhāgataḥ |
śiraścatvāra maṃgulyā sarvadvārāṇi vāhayet ||

karṇikā haritā bhadre keśaraṃ raktameva ca |
dalaṃ kṛṣṇena kurvīta dalasaṃdhiṃ jalaṃ tathā ||

raktena tu suśobhāni dhūmena dvāra vāhayet |
aśiṃ kapālaṃ paraśuṃ triśūlaṃ ca catuṣṭayaṃ ||

caturdvāra samālikhyaṃ yathā śobhāṃ vrajet priye |
mahāsādhana kāle māraṇe ca viśeṣataḥ ||

pretānakaṃ likhedbhadre maṇḍalaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
śāṃtikaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ vaśyamāraṇaṃ ca sulocanaṃ ||

viśeṣa maṇḍalaṃ yena jñātvā karmasamārabhet ||

punaranya prakāreṇa pravakṣyāmi viśeṣataḥ |
sthūlena kalirityāhuḥ kṛṣṇena maraṇaṃ bhavet ||

vakrehāni bhavedghoraṃ chinnerāja bhayāni ca |
asadṛśaḥ kṛte patre maṃtrasiddhirnna jāyate ||

tasmāt prayatnaṃ kurvīta yadīcchet siddhimuttamaṃ |
evaṃ karmavibhāgāni jñātvā karma samārabhet ||

kimanyat pṛcchase devī kathitaṃ rajjupātanaṃ ||

<p. 220a>

atha pūjā dravyamāha ||

yat sarvaṃ bhakṣapānāni dravyaṃ vittānusārataḥ |
kalpayitvā tu suśroṇi sarvaṃ dravyaṃ kṣamāpayet ||

caṃdanaṃ ca pavitraṃ ca gaṃdhamālyaṃ ca mohinīṃ |
āsanaṃ dhūpa siṃdūra sthāpayecca yathā kramaṃ ||

nānāvidhāni māṃsānihyanekā matsyajātayaḥ |
caturvidhāni bhakṣāṇi upadaṃ śāpadaṃśakāḥ ||

pūrvoktaṃ sakalaṃ dravyaṃ pūrṇamatra prakalpayet ||

atha krameṇa aṣṭakāṣṭakamāha ||

tatrādau vīrādīnāṃ pādaprakṣālana dravyamāha ||

pādaprakṣālanaṃ devi sāṃprataṃ kathayāmi te |
vacaḥ priyaṃgu surabhī uśīraṃ caṃdanaṃ tathā ||

vālaṃ māṃsi tathā cauraṃ samabhāgāni kārayet |
piṣṭodakena bhāgena ślakṣṇaṃ kṛtvā yathārthataḥ ||

uṣṇodaka ghaṭe madhye vahisthāne nidhāpayet |
ekaika vīrapādau ca kṣālayedudakena tu ||

aṭṭahāseva cotpannaṃ caritrāyāṃ priyaṃgukaṃ |
kolāpuryāṃ tu surabhirjayaṃtyāṃ ca uśīrakaṃ ||

ujjenyāṃ vadanaṃ bhadre prayāge vālameva ca |
vārāṇasyāṃ ca māṃsī ca karṇamodyāṃ tu caurakaṃ ||

etadaṣṭau samākhyātā aṣṭau kṣetrasya lāṃchanaṃ ||

upahāravidhiṃ vakṣye śṛṇutvaṃ varavarṇini |
caṃdanaṃ ca pavitraṃ ca gaṃdhamālyaṃ ca mohinī ||

āsanaṃ dhūpa siṃdūraṃ dāpayecca yathā kramaṃ |
caṃdanaṃ virajaṃ bhadre pavitraṃ merukaṃ tathā ||

hādrāpuraṃ bhavedgaṃdhaṃ mālyamelāpuraṃ smṛtaṃ |
kāśmīraṃ mohanī jñeyā āsanaṃ merukaṃ tathā ||

tagaraṃ dhūpamityāhuḥ siṃdūraṃ puṇḍravarddhanaṃ |
etānyaṣṭau bhūṣaṇāni upakṣetrasya lakṣaṇaṃ ||

yathā krameṇa dātavyamācāryādīn vicakṣaṇaḥ |
upahāra vidhānaṃ ca saṃkṣepāt kathitaṃ mayā ||

vali saṃsthāpanaṃ bhadre adhunā kathayāmite |
vṛhadārumaya pātre odanaiḥ paripūrite ||

samucchritaṃ vaijayaṃtyā paṃcaraṃgika kārayet |
achidra aṃtarmālyena dāpayed valibhājane ||

vicitrapuṣpamālyena yathā śobhāṃ vrajet priye |
tathā tena prakartavyaṃ devatālaya śobhanaṃ ||

matsyamāṃsāni dhūpāni tilapiṣṭaṃ ca modakaṃ |
vṛkṣāmlarudhiraṃ bhadre āraktakaṃ tathaiva ca ||

<p. 220b>

etadaṣṭau mayākhyātāḥ saṃdoha valikarmaṇi |
parastīre bhavenmāṃsamatsyaṃ pṛṣṭāpuraṃ tathā ||

kudgaṇḍivo bhaveddhūpaṃ sopānetilaṃ piṣṭakaṃ |
kṣīrake modakaṃ bhadre māyā puryāmlameva ca ||

āmrātake bhavedraktaṃ gṛharāje alaktakaṃ |
samudraṃ dārupātraṃ ca odanaṃ merumeva ca ||

ahirājaṃ tu mālāṃ tu sragdānaṃ raktamālyakaṃ |
brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaṃ ||

paṃcaraṃga patākāṃ ca śuddhā paṃcanivāsinī |
sāmudramudaraṃ bhadre nābhimeruḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

kuṇḍalākhyā hi rājaṃ vannetra romaṃ ca sarvaśaḥ |
prāṇo'pānaḥ samānaṃ ca udānavyā nameva ca ||

devatā paṃcakaṃ bhadre śuddhāsana nivāsinī |
ūrddhvaścāsamadhaḥ śvāsaḥ caṃdrasūryau prakīrtitau ||

trayastriṃśat koṭi devāromakūpe vyavasthitā |
vali saṃsthāpanaṃ bhadre sa vāhyābhyaṃtarāṇi ca ||

kathitaṃ sarvaśāstrāṇi dagdhāghṛtamivoddhṛtaṃ ||

madyaṃ cāṣṭavidhaṃ proktaṃ mahāmāṃsāṣṭakaṃ tathā |
aṣṭau ca bhairavāsteṣāṃ sthāne vīrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

bhairavyastu tathā proktastathā cāṣṭau ca mātaraḥ |
tāsāṃ sthāne śaktayaḥsyure tadvaivāṣṭakāṣṭakaṃ ||

atha pūjāmāha ||

arcācakraṃ svavidyāyāstanmadhye sthāpayedghaṭaṃ |
madyapūrṇaṃ tatra devī māvāhyārcanamācaret ||

nānāvidhāni māṃsānihyanekā matsya jātayaḥ |
caturvidhāni bhakṣāṇi upadaṃśopadaṃśakāḥ ||

ete samyak pūjayitvā sāṃgāṃ sāvaraṇāṃ surāṃ |
śaktayaśca tathā vīrāḥ pūjyāḥ puṣpākṣatādibhiḥ ||

athavā ||

pratyakṣaṃ pūjayeddevī śaktiṃ śaktiḥ svarūpiṇīṃ |
vīraṃ bhairavarūpeṇa puruṣeṣu prayojayet ||

yāvat pramāṇaṃ yoginyaḥ svacakre paripūjitāḥ |
yāvat pramāṇaṃ deveśi guravo bhairavādayaḥ ||

dikpālāntā maheśāni puruṣāṃ yaṃtramadhyagāḥ |
tāvat pramāṇaṃ deveśi nāryaśca puruṣā tathā ||

cakrasthāna vibhāgaiśca tat tadvudhyā niveśeyet |
madhye viṃdau mayāsārddhaṃ tvāṃ vai yugmātmikāṃ yajet ||

<p. 221a>

pūrvoktairmaṃtrarūpaiśca pūjākalpe prakīrtitaiḥ |
sarvaṃ vivicya vidhivadupacāraiḥ prapūjayet ||

cakre yā devatā saṃkhyāḥ saṃjñācārghāsanāni ca |
pātrāṇi pūrṇakumbhāśca pratyakṣāṇi nivedayet ||

nānāvidhairalaṃkārairvastrayugmaiḥ pṛthak pṛthak |
puṣpadhūpākṣataiścaiva sugaṃdhaiśca manoharaiḥ ||

śrīkhaṇḍā gurukarpūrairmṛgamābhi vilepanaiḥ |
mudrābhiśca namaskārairgītavādyaistathaiva ca ||

vinayena mahādeviṃ toṣayediṣṭadevatāṃ |
saṃtarpya japahomādi sarvaṃ pūrvavadācaret ||

atha kāmyādau dhyāna viśeṣamāha ||

varadā bhayahastāstu prasannavadanāḥ śubhāḥ |
śuklāṃ varaparīdhānāḥ śāṃtikarmaṇi ciṃtayet ||

pāśāṃkuśa mahācāpa puṣpavāṇadharāyudhāḥ |
raktāmvaradharā devyāvaśya karmaṇi ciṃtayet ||

kṛṣṇā kṛṣṇāṃvarā raudrā raudrāyudha parigrahāḥ |
bhīmakaṃkāladhāriṇyo maṃtra mālāvarā karāḥ ||

kapālakartṛkāhastā pivaṃtyo rudhirāsavaṃ |
carvaṃtposthīni khādaṃtyo māraṇaivaṃ viciṃtayet ||

pītāṃvara parīdhānā vajrahastā mahābalāḥ |
staṃbhanekari kuṃbhasthā dhyātavyāḥ śrīkulāṃvike ||

uccāṭane mṛgārūḍhāḥ dhvajahastā su caṃcalāḥ |
dhūmravarṇā mahādevyoḥ parvatānyā tapaṃ tyapi ||

mohane nīlarūpāśca ākṛṣṭau kapilāruṇau |
kapotāścaiva vidveṣe citrāroga vivarddhane ||

evaṃ karmānurūpeṇa carkāmnāyamidaṃ priyaṃ |
yaṣṭyaṃ phalapradaṃ samyak bhaviṣyati na cānyathā ||

pūjā japastathā homaṃ maṃtravidyā gaṇasya ca |
dhyānaṃ cakroktamārgeṇa śāṃtikādau yathā vidhiḥ ||

atha balidānaṃ ||

pūjā gṛhāduttaratastrikoṇe bhūgṛhāṃtare |
ucchiṣṭa bhairavaṃ tatra gaṃdha puṣpādibhiryajet ||

ucchiṣṭa doṣo bhavati cakrapūjā mahotsave |
taddoṣa parihārārthaṃ bhairavaṃ pūjayāmyahaṃ ||

tālatrayaṃ tathocchiṣṭa bhairave hi dvayaṃ tathā |
valiṃ gṛhṇayugaṃ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā dvāviṃśadakṣarā ||

anena balidānaṃ tu pūjāṃ tesyāṃ prakalpayet |
pūjāgāraṃ samāgatya praṇameccakra saṃsthitāṃ ||

paṭhet stotramidaṃ bhadre ekākārasubhāvitaḥ |
namaste cakravartistu namaste jñānadāyine ||

namaste śivarūpāya namaste bhavatārakaḥ |
aṣṭāṣṭakāstu yoginyaḥ kṣetrapālāstathaiva ca ||

<p. 221b>

bhairavaṃ ca imaṃ cakraṃ ekākāraṃ namāmyahaṃ |
evaṃ stotraṃ paṭhedādyaṃ niveśya svayamāsane ||

jyeṣṭānu kramataḥ sthāpyaṃ cāsaneṣu yathāvidhiḥ |
strīṇāmanyatamaṃ sthānaṃ puṃsāmanyatamaṃ pṛthak ||

athavā mithunaṃ kṛtvā kramāt samupaveśayet |
paṃktyākāreṇa vā samyak cakrākāreṇa vā punaḥ ||

śivaśaktidhiyāḥ sarvān cakramadhye samarcayet ||

gurupātraṃ samādāya madyāmṛtayutaṃ kare |
pariṣiṃcet sāmayikāṃ nītiṃ śāṃtiṃ svayaṃ paṭhan ||

jayaṃti devyā harapādapaṃkajaṃ prasanna vāmāmṛta mokṣadāyakaṃ |
anaṃta siddhāṃtamati pravodha kṛnnamāmi sāṣṭāṣṭakayoginīgaṇaṃ ||

yoginī cakramadhyasthaṃ mātṛmaṇḍala veṣṭitaṃ |
namāmi śirasānāthaṃ bhairavaṃ bhairavīṃ priyaṃ ||

anādi ghorasaṃsāra dhyāṃta vidhvaṃsakāriṇe ||

namaḥ śrīnāthavaidyāya kulauṣadhavidhāyine |
āpadoduritaṃ rogāḥ samayācāra laṃghanāt ||

yeḥ sarvete vyapohaṃ tu divyacakrasya melanāt |
āyurārogyamaiśvaryaṃ kīrtirlābhaḥ śubhojayaḥ ||

kāṃtiṃ manorathaścāstu pāṃtu sarvāśca devatāḥ ||

saṃpūjakānāṃ pratipālakānāṃ yatīṃdra yogīṃdra tapodhanānāṃ |
viśvasya rāṣṭrasya purasya rājñaḥ karotu śāṃtiṃ bhagavān kuleśaḥ ||

naṃdaṃ tu sādhakakulādapi darśakāye sṛṣṭvāghanākhya caturakta 
mahātvayāye |
naṃdastu sarvakulakaularatāḥ parāyetvanye viśeṣa padabhedaka śāṃbhavāye ||

naṃdaṃ tu siddhaguravastadanukramaughājyeṣṭānujāḥ samayino vaṭukāḥ 
kumāryaḥ |
ṣaṭyoginī pravaravīra kulaiḥ prasūtānaṃdaṃ tu bhūmipati godvija sādhulokāḥ ||

naṃdaṃ tu nītinipuṇā niravadyaniṣṭhāni matsarā nirūpamā nirūpadravāśca |
nityaṃ niraṃjanaratā guravo niraṃtāḥ śāṃtograśāṃtamanaso hṛta 
śokaśaṃkāḥ ||

naṃdaṃ tu yoginiratāḥ kulayogayuktā ācārya sāmayika sādhaka putrakāśca |
bhāvodvijā yuvatayo yatayaḥ kumāryodharme bhavaṃ tu niratā guruśiṣyayuktāḥ ||

naṃdaṃ tu sādhaka kulānyaṇimādyaniṣṭāḥ śāpāḥ pataṃtu samayadyuṣi 
yoginīnāṃ |
sā śāṃbhavī sphuratu kāpi mamāpyavasthā yasyāṃ guroścaraṇa paṃkajameva 
labhyaṃ ||

<p. 222a>

yāścakra krama bhūmikā vasatayo nāḍīṣuyāḥ saṃsthitāyāḥ 
kāyadrumaromakūpanilayāyāḥ saṃsthitā dhātuṣu |
ucchvāsormimaruttaraṃganilayāniśvāsavāsāśvayāstā devyo ripupakṣabhakṣaṇa 
parāstṛpyaṃ tu kaulārcitāḥ ||

yādivyāḥ kulasaṃbhavāḥ kṣitigatāyā devatāstopagāyā nityaṃ prathitaprabhā 
śikhigatāyā mātaraḥ svāśravyāḥ |
yo māmamṛtamaṇḍalāmṛtamayāyāḥ sarvagāḥ sarvadātāḥ sarvāḥ 
kulamārgapālanaparāḥ śāṃtiṃ prayacchaṃtu me ||

ūrddhvaṃ brahmāṇḍake vā divigagaṇatale bhūtale niṣkale vā pātāle vā nale vā 
salila pavanayoryatra kutrasthito vā |
kṣetre pīṭhopapīṭhādiṣu ca kṛtapadā dhūpadīpādi māṃsaiḥ prītādevyaḥ 
sadānaḥ kṛtavalividhināpāṃtu dhīreṃdravaṃghāḥ ||

brahmā śrīśeṣadurgāguhavaṭukagaṇāḥ bhairavāḥ kṣetrapālā vetālāditya rudrā 
grahavasu munayaḥ siddhayo guhyakādyāḥ |
bhūtā gaṃdharvavidyādharaṛṣipitaraḥ kinnarāyakṣanāgāyogīśāścāranāḥ 
kiṃ puruṣamunisurāścakragāḥ pāṃtu sarve ||

dehasthā khiladevatā gajamukhāḥ kṣetrādhipā bhairavāḥ yoginyo vaṭukāśca 
yakṣapitaro bhūtāḥ piśāgrahāḥ |
anye bhūcaradikvarāśca khacarā vetālakāśceṭakāstṛptāḥ syuḥ kulaputrakasya 
pivataḥ pānaṃ madīyaṃ carut ||

satyaṃ cedgurudakṣadevapitaro vedāgamā yoginī prītiścet paradevatā yadi 
bhavedvedāḥ pramāṇaṃ hi cet |
śākteyaṃ yadi darśanaṃ bhavati vedājñāpyamoghāsticetsatpaṃcāpi ca 
kulikāśca yadi cetsyānme jayaḥ sarvadā ||

tṛpyaṃ tu sādhakāḥ sarve sa mudrāḥ sa gaṇādhipāḥ |
yoginyaḥ kṣetrapālāśca mamadehe vyavasthitāḥ ||

śivādya vaniparyetaṃ brahmādi staṃbha saṃyutaṃ |
kālājñādi śivāṃtaṃ ca jagadyajñena tṛpyatāṃ ||

paṭhitvebhyarcanāpātraṃ samudvāsya gurustataḥ |
dadyācchiṣyāya kuṃbhasthaṃ yoginībhyaḥ pṛthak pṛthak ||

pātraṃ tathaiva vīrebhyaścetarebhyaḥ svayaṃ pivet ||

vakṣyetha kaulikācāraṃ lokadvaya phalapradaṃ |
pātramelāpakaṃ carma procyate kārakaṃ ||

na bhrātā na pitā mitraṃ pātramelāpakādṛte |
adīkṣitairanācāraira maṃtrajñaira daivataiḥ ||

dūṣitaiḥ samayarduṣṭaiḥ prapaṃca vratadhāribhiḥ |
strīdviṣṭairgurusaptaiśca bhaktihīnairdurātmabhiḥ ||

<p. 222b>

anabhiścairanya pānaiḥ paśubhiḥ kṣudrakarmabhiḥ |
padavākya pramāṇajñaiḥ śruti smṛtyartha vedibhiḥ ||

strīdviṣṭairguru saptaiśca bhaktihīnairdurātmabhiḥ |
anabhijñairanyayānaiḥ paśubhiḥ kṣudrakramabhiḥ ||

pādavākya pramāṇajñaiḥ śrutismṛtyarthaḥ vedibhiḥ |
kulopadeśahīnaiśca vaiṣṇavavratakāribhiḥ ||

brahmatejo mukhaiḥ pātramelanaṃ naiva kārayet |
tvat pūjā nirataiḥ śāṃtaiḥ paradravya parāṅmukhaiḥ ||

kulopadeśakuśalaiḥ kulamārga pravartakaiḥ |
strīpriyaiḥ strīstutairddhatyaiḥ suṃdarairmṛduvādibhiḥ ||

kulamārgeti guptaiśca vidyāvadbhiḥ surūpakaiḥ |
prayogasiddhairdravyādyairbhāgya vadbhiśca kāmukaiḥ ||

brahmabhaktairājamānyairmilitairdevayogataḥ |
kuryāt pātrasya melāpaṃ saukhya vṛddhirdvayorbhavet ||

ekapātraṃ na kurvīta yadi sākṣāt kuleśvaraḥ |
maṃtrāḥ parāṅmukhāyāṃti vighnāścaiva pade pade ||

na dadyādbhairavāyāpi svapātrasthita hetukaṃ |
yadi dadyācca mohena devatāśāpamāpnuyāt ||

āsanaṃ bhojanaṃ pātraṃ manyavraśayanādikaṃ |
anabhijñairanarhaiśca śaṃkaraṃ naiva kārayet ||

śroto bhedena vā kuryāt kaulikaiḥ pātramelanaṃ |
pūrvadakṣiṇayoraikyamudakpaścimayostathā ||

yogibhiryoginībhiśca pradattaṃ pūrṇapātrakaṃ |
svamaṃtra pādukā mūlamaṃtrajaptaṃ pivet tataḥ ||

kvacidyadicchayā prāpta malipātraṃ tu bhaktitaḥ |
ādāya pūrvavahutvā pivet tacca guruṃ smaret ||

gurubhaktiyutānāṃ ca gurujyeṣṭha kaniṣṭhayoḥ |
svajyeṣṭhasyāpi cocchiṣṭaṃ khādennānyasya karhicit ||

jyeṣṭhe kanīyase yojyaṃ na punargrāhayet tataḥ |
śaktyucchiṣṭaṃ pivenmadyaṃ vīrocchiṣṭaṃ tu carvaṇaṃ ||

ātmocchiṣṭaṃ na dātavyaṃ parakīyaṃ na bhakṣayet |
ucchiṣṭaṃ bhakṣayet strīṇāṃ tābhyāṃ nocchiṣṭamarpayet ||

svasya melāpakasyāpi sthāpayedekamaṇḍale |
pātraṃ tatorcayeddevīṃ tarpaṇādi samācaret ||

utthāpyānyonya pātre ca dadyādanyonya hastayoḥ |
dvayoraikyaṃ smaranyeyamiti pātrasya melanam ||

<p. 223a>

vālopi dīkṣitaḥ pūrve jyeṣṭasya tu kulāgame |
dvijopi dīkṣitaḥ paścādantyajaḥ pūrvadīkṣitaḥ ||

dvijaḥ kaniṣṭhaḥ sa jyeṣṭha iti śāstra viniścayaḥ |
svaśaktiṃ vīraśaktiṃ ca dīkṣitāṃ gururūpiṇīṃ ||

pāyayitvā pivenmadyamiti śāstrasya niścayaḥ |
tasmāt sulakṣaṇāṃ śaktiṃ gaṃdha puṣpākṣatādibhiḥ ||

abhyarcya devatā vuddhyā bhogapātraṃ nivedayet ||

śrīmadbhairava śeṣa vā mṛtalasaccandrāmṛtaplāvitaṃ kṣetrādhīśvarayoginī 
janagaṇaiḥ siddhaiḥ samārādhitaṃ |
ānaṃdārṇavakaṃ na cātyakamidaṃ sākṣāt trikhaṇḍāmṛtaṃ vaṃde 
śrīprathamaṃ karāṃvujayutaṃ pātraṃ viśuddhīpradaṃ ||

sarvāmnāya kalakalāpakalitaṃ kautūhala dyotakaṃ caṃdropendra mahendra 
śambhu varuṇa brahmādibhiḥ sevitaṃ |
dhyātaṃ devagaṇaiḥ paraṃ munigaṇairmokṣārthibhiḥ sarvadā ||

lokānāmativarddhanaṃ sukhakarapātraṃ dvitīyaṃ namaḥ ||

madyaṃ māṃsaka matsyakaṃ harihara brahmādibhiḥ pūritaṃ mudrāmaithuna 
dharmakarma sukhadaṃ kṣārāmlatiktāśrayaṃ |
ācāryārcitamaṣṭabhairava kalānyāsena saṃśodhitaṃ pāyāt paṃcamakāra 
saṃyutamidaṃ pātraṃ tṛtīyaṃ namaḥ ||

āvirbhūta sa golakuṇḍa sukhadaṃ brahmādi rudrārcitaṃ nārājyaṃ prathamoṃ 
gajātakusumaṃ divyādhi kūṭaṃ paraiḥ |
machochaumalamuttamottamarasaṃ saṃsevya divyāmṛtaṃ bhūyaḥ paṃcaka 
muktikāmakamidaṃ pātraṃ caturthaṃmude ||

ādhāre bhujagādhirāja valaye pātraṃ mahīmaṇḍalaṃ madyaṃ saptasamudra vāri 
piśitaṃ cāṣṭau ca digdaṃtinaḥ |
sohaṃ bhairavamarcayan pratidinaṃ tārāgaṇairlakṣitaṃ āditya pramukhaiḥ 
surāsuragaṇairājñākaraiḥ kiṃkaraiḥ ||

chatraṃ cāmara bhadrapīṭha paramānaṃdāyiṃtadāpi rāmārājñya manoharaṃ 
sukhakaraṃ sāyujya sāmrājyadaṃ |
nānāvyādhibhavāṃdhakāra haraṇaṃ janmāṃtaraṃ nāśanaṃ 
śrīmatsuṃdaritarpaṇendra varadaṃ pātraṃ ca ṣaṣṭaṃ bhajet ||

jāgrat svapnasuṣuptituryapurato caitanya sākṣāt pradaṃ vidyudbhāskara vahnicendra 
dhanuṣajyotiḥ kathābhāṣitaṃ |
iḍāpiṃgalamadhyagā trivalayā sat kuṇḍalīcorddhagāpātraṃ saptamapūraṇena 
taruṇānaṃdādhikaḥ pātumāṃ ||

<p. 223b>

khaḍgaṃ pādukamaṃjanaṃ ca guṭikaṃ sārasvataṃ satyadaṃ 
mṛtyorvaṃcanamugrakāryaṃ grahaṇaṃ dehasthireḥ kāraṇaṃ |
pāyāt siddhikaraṃ manaḥ sthirakaraṃ vaśyaṃ jagaghoṣitāṃ pātraṃ 
cāṣṭasiddhikaraṇaṃ prauḍhaḥ prasannaṃ sadā ||

sarvānandakaraṃ sadāśivapadaṃ dvaṃdvaika bhaktipradaṃ sāmrājyaṃ sukhadaṃ 
manorathakaraṃ tvaṃ jñānavidhvaṃsanaṃ |
āyuḥ kīrtiyaśovivarddhanakaraṃ saṃsāra mohachidaṃ pātreyaṃ navanātha śakti 
navakaṃ prauḍha pratāpoditaṃ ||

tripātraṃ paṃcapātraṃ vā saptapātramathāpi vā |
navapātraṃ pivedvāpi ṣoḍaśārddhaṃ pivenna hi ||

yāvanna calate dṛṣṭiryāvanna calate manaḥ |
tāvatpānaṃ prakurvīta paśuyāna mataḥ paraṃ ||

pūrṇābhiṣeka yuktānāmānaṃ devi nigadyate |
karābhyāṃ pātramuddhṛtya smaran mūlaṃ ca pādukāṃ ||

āgalāṃtaṃ pivenmadyaṃ sa mukto nātra saṃśayaḥ |
pītvā pītvā punaḥ pītvā yāvatyatati bhūtale ||

utthāya ca punaḥ pītvā punarjanma na vidyate |
ānaṃdāt tṛpyate devī mūrchayā bhairavaḥ svayaṃ ||

camanāt sarvadevāstu tasmāt tritayamācaret ||

brahmājñānī kulācāre surāṃ pītvā sa balanmuhuḥ |
bhūmau patati tasyāṅgelagaṃti yadi reṇavaḥ ||

tāvat kālaṃ reṇu saṃkhyaṃ brahmaloke samodate |
pītvā pītvā japitvā ca muktaḥ koṭī kulaiḥ saha ||

brahmaloke vaseddevi satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
tatraiva vyāpti māpnoti na punaḥ prapatediha ||

pītvā ca pūjayitvaiśāmīśatvaṃ labhateddhruvaṃ |
tatraiva layamāpnoti punarnnaiva nivartate ||

tatra matteṣu vīreṣu kāryākāryaṃ na vidyate |
tatra yadyat kṛtaṃ karma śubhaṃ vā yadi vā śubhaṃ ||

tatsarvaṃ devatā prītyai jāyate mātra saṃśayaḥ |
jalpo japaphalaṃ taṃdrā samādhirabhidhīyate ||

vikriyā pūjanaṃ proktaṃ charditaṃ bhairavo valiḥ |
mūrchāsyācchakti saṃyoga stotraṃ tatkāla bhāṣaṇaṃ ||

nyāsovayava saṃsparśo bhojanaṃ havanakriyā |
dhyānaṃ vīkṣaṇaṃ proktaṃ śayanaṃ vaṃdanaṃ bhavet ||

tadullā sa kṛtānāṃ ca yā ceṣṭā sā ca satkriyā |
kāryākāryavikāraṃ tu yaḥ karoti sapātakī ||

etaccakragatā vīrā vijñeyāḥ parayoginaḥ |
ye nā sruvaṃti manujāḥ sākṣādbhairavarūpatāṃ ||

saṃmoda kopaśamanaṃ patanodgāṇa nartanaṃ |
veṇuvīṇādivādyaṃ ca kavitā racanādikaṃ ||

rodanaṃ bhāṣaṇaṃ pātaḥ samutthānaṃ vijṛṃbhaṇaṃ |
gamanaṃ vikriyā devī yoga ityabhidhīyate ||

<p. 224a>

vikṛtiṃ manaso hitvā yadollāsaḥ pravartate |
tadā tu devatā bhāvaṃ bhajaṃte yogapuṃgavāḥ ||

kaulikān bhairavāveśān yo vā niṃdati mūḍhadhīḥ |
tannāśayaṃtya saṃdeho yoginyo nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

yadvadbhakimadāveśādadmuktaṃ kauliko mataḥ |
tat tadbhavatya saṃdigdhaṃ śubhaṃ vā yadi vā śubhaṃ ||

tāro namo bhagavati madyamāṃsavihāriṇī |
rati priye cakradevī vada kaulikavallabhe ||

satyaṃ manogatamedyet yuktvā madyaṃ palānvitaṃ |
pradadyāt kaulikebhyastattanmattāḥ pravruvaṃtite ||

tatra kaścidakaulaścenna ca sphurati bhāratī ||

na niṃdenna haset drapyeccakre madhumadā kulān |
etaccakragatāṃ vārtāṃ vahirnaiva prakāśayet ||

tebhyodrohaṃ na kurvīta nāhitaṃ ca samācaret |
baktyā saṃrakṣayettānnai gopayecca prayatnataḥ ||

cakre ca pramadāṃ dṛṣṭvā ciṃtayed devatādhiyā |
modate vaṃdate bhaktyā sa gacched yoginī padaṃ ||

pravṛtte bhairavī cakre sarve varṇād vijātayaḥ |
nivṛtte bhairavī cakre sarve varṇāḥ pṛthak pṛthak ||

striyotha puruṣaḥ paśuścāṇḍālo vā dvijottamaḥ |
cakra madhye na bhedosti sarve deva samāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

cakramadhye gatāḥ sarve puruṣāḥ śivarūpiṇaḥ |
striyaḥ sarvāśca pārvatyā tasmādbhedaṃ na kārayet ||

kāmuko na striyaṃ gaccheda nicchaṃti madīkṣitāṃ |
sadyaḥ saṃskāra saṃśuddhāṃ vihitatvād vrajet striyaṃ ||

sahasracakra pūjātorājyabhraṣṭo nṛpo bhavet |
paṃcāśadbhiśca putrāptirnīrogodaśabhirbhavet ||

yasya cakrasya pūjāyāṃ ratāt skhalati cāṃganā |
avaśyaṃ sārvabhaumo sauvarṣamadhye bhaviṣyati ||

yathepsita priyāprāptyai paṃcadhāpūjanaṃ caret ||

atha kaulikārcanaṃ ||

maheśvaraṃ samālokya pūjayedvidhi pūrvakaṃ |
yathā vibhavarūpeṇa paṃcatatvaṃ navadya ca ||

sadā tuṣṭā bhaveddevī sarvān kāmāṃllabhedapi |
anyathā naiva siddhiḥ syāt kruddhā bhavati yoginī ||

medinīṃ yastu pūrṇāṃ ca brāhmaṇo vedapārage |
datvā yatphalamāpnoti tatphalaṃ kaulikārcane ||

aśvamedha sahasrāṇi vājapeya śatāni ca |
īṣṭvā yat phalamāpnoti tatphalaṃ kaulikārcane ||

<p. 224b>

merutulya suvarṇaṃ tu brāhmaṇe vedapārage |
datvā yatphalamāpnoti tatphalaṃ kaulikārcanāt ||

vāpī kūpa taḍāgidi kṛtvā yatphalamāpnuyāt |
tatphalāllakṣaguṇitaṃ kaulikānāṃ prapūjanāt ||

kapilāṃ ca gavāṃ datvā yatphalaṃ labhate naraḥ |
tatphalaṃ koṭi guṇitaṃ kaulikānāṃ prapūjanāt ||

atha dūtīyāgaḥ ||

puruṣeṇa vinā kiṃcit prakṛtyā kriyate nahi |
tathā śaktiṃ vinā devophalaṃ dātu kṣamo nahi ||

tasmāt puṃśakti saṃyogaṃ kṛtvā maṃtraṃ prasādhayet |
kaulike vāmamārge ca pumāndevo na siddhyati ||

ātmānaṃ tu śivaṃ dhyāyed devatāṃ śaktirūpiṇīṃ |
krīḍetyaṃ ca makāraistu suprītā tasya devatā ||

dakṣamārge mātṛbuddhiḥ strībuddhiḥ kaulike pathi |
yasya tāstā dṛḍhatarātasya tuṣṭāttu devatā ||

etadrahasyamākhyātaṃ gopyaṃ mātari jāravat ||

śaivāḥ smārtā yājñikāśatānna kurvaṃti pārvatī |
kaulānāmāgamajñānāṃ tāṃtrikācāravartināṃ ||

anukalpapradātṝṇāṃ madhyasthānāṃ tathaiva ca |
devīti buddhiryositsuyeṣāmatirar caṃcalā ||

teṣāṃ kālī subhaktānāṃ sarvadā niścitātmanāṃ |
āvaśyakī śaktipūjā pīṭhapūjā vadīśvari ||

kālīvuddhyaiva saṃpūjyā na kāmākulayādhiyā |
caturthāśramiṇā muktāye kālyarcana tatparāḥ ||

kaulikā vāpya kaulā vāme caitanmatavartinaḥ |
teṣāṃ nityā śaktipūjāprāhaivaṃ māṃ puradviṣaḥ ||

sā śaktirdvividhā jñeyā svakīyā ca parāṅganā |
svajātiḥ saṃbhavāyā tu pariṇītā bhavet priye ||

sā svakīyā samuddiṣṭā tathāneyaṃ praśasyate |
parakīyā paṃcavidhātāḥ krameṇa vravīmyahaṃ ||

saṃjīvadbhartṛkā caikā tādṛgeva mṛtapriyā |
dāsī veśyā tathā'nūḍhā praśastā cottarottaraṃ ||

ajātavatsā yuvatītā svādyaiva praśasyate |
kadācijjātavatsāpi sā sarvasadṛśīmatā ||

abhāve pūrvapūrvāyāḥ parāgrāhyā hi sādhakaiḥ |
sādhikāyāstu kaulāyā evameva pumānapi ||

na sādhakaṃ vinā nāryo na puṃsaḥ sādhikāmṛte |
maṃtrāḥ siddhyaṃti deveśi kalpakoṭi śatairapi ||

<p. 225a>

parastrī saṃgamo madyopaśūnvā prāṇimāraṇaṃ |
svārthaṃ cennarakāyaiva devyarthaṃ sukṛtāya hi ||

ko hetunnavijānāmi devīprītikarā ityame |
na pāpa janakaṃ yadvadyajñārthaṃ paśughātanaṃ ||

na kilviṣakarastadvat parastrīsaṃgamādikaḥ ||

atha śaktīnāṃ jātiviśeṣaḥ ||

naṭīkāpālinī veśyā rajakīnāpitāṃgatā |
brāhmaṇī śūdrakanā ca tathā gopālakanyakā ||

mālākārasya kanyā ca na ca kanyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

nānyūnāṃgyonādhikāṃgyo na sthūlānādhikaṃ kṛśā |
na chinnanāsāṃgulikā na dīrghā na ca vāmanā ||

na guṇḍitā na kubjāśca mūkāṃdha vadhirā na ca |
na kekarā na khaṃjāśca bhinnayonirgalātkucā ||

vālāpatyāśca nityebhyo na kāryāḥ śaktayastvimāḥ |
vadāmi yogyāṃ sādhikyāṃ yābhistuṣpatikālikā ||

gaurāṃgī yuvatī ramyāsmerāsyā cāruvigrahā |
viśālalola nayanā pīnonnatapayodharā ||

viśālajamanā bhogāvali traya virājitā |
supārśva tanumadhyā ca susvarā kuṃcitālakā ||

vicitraveśābharaṇā vicitrāṃ varadhāriṇī |
vicitra sraksamākīrṇā vicitraratidāyikā ||

sadā prasannavadanā devyā bhaktiparāyaṇā |
kaulikācaraṇajñā ca sādhake bhakti tatparā ||

bhayahīnā smeramukhī sarvadā priyavādinī |
samayācāra sampannā maṃtrajñā bhayavarjitā ||

vidagdhā cā prasūtā ca dhairya svātaṃtrya saṃyutā |
evaṃ guṇa samāyuktāḥ pūjayet sarvayoṣitaḥ ||

atha vidyāviśeṣe śaktiviśeṣamāha ||

gaṃdharūpā jātibhedairmahāvidyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
tat kramaṃ devadeveśi śṛṇu yatnena sāṃprataṃ ||

rūpagaṃdha krameṇaiva nāmadadyān maheśvarī |
mātṛ pitṛ kṛtaṃ nāmatyaktvā yatnena pārvatī ||

svayaṃ nāmapradadyādvai yathā yogena pārvatī ||

yā kṛṣṇa nīlakṛṣṇābhā madhupiṃgalalocanā |
sādhakā kāṃkṣi hṛdayā puṃgaṃdhāniṃdyagaṃdhikā ||

tasyāṃ kālī samāyojyā sā kālī parikīrtitā ||

<p. 225b>

madyagaṃdhā tu yā nārī raktanetrāti niṣṭhurā |
mahogratārā sā proktā mahāpāpa vināśinī ||

sarvadā bhojanāśaktā vahubhojyāti caṃcalā |
trailokyamohanākārācchinnā vidyāḥ prakīrtitā ||

sarvalakṣaṇa saṃyuktā nānāgaṃdha samākulā |
suṃdarī cārukeśāṃ ca dīrghanetrā manoharā ||

nānāvilāsakuśalā kulaśāstravicariṇī |
guruvakṣaḥ sthalākrāṃtā madhyā viraladarśinī ||

suṃdarī sā bhavedgaurī sarvakārya pravartinī ||

yā sā tṛtīyā gaurāṃgī madhugaṃdhānulepanā |
tripurānāma sā devī svapuṣpa kramasādhinī ||

cārvaṃgī cārunetrā ca kaṃjapadmāsanasthitā |
pītābharaṇabhūṣāṃgī kamalāḥ parikīrtitā ||

guṃjāhāra vibhūṣādyā śyāmā caṃcalalocanā |
cāruhāsā tu mātaṃgī vidyākhyātā maheśvarī ||

divyavarṇā kṛśāṃgī ca divyagaṃdhānulepanā |
bhuvaneśī mayā proktā nānābhūṣaṇabhūṣitā ||

piṃganetrā piṃgakeśā kiṃcidduccāṭihāsinī |
dhūmāvatī ca sā proktā siddhavidyā śṛṇu priye ||

laṃvavaktrā ca laṃvauṣṭhī pītavarṇāti niścalā |
bagalā sā maheśāni kīrtitā tava suvrate ||

daśavidyā imākhyātā śaktirūpeṇa pārvatī |
daśavidyā maheśāni mātṛ strībhaginī kramāt ||

krīḍaṃti satataṃ devi vidyā eva na saṃśayaḥ |
daśakramo maheśāni daśavidyā su yatnataḥ ||

sarvathā kārayeddevi nānyathā yugakoṭibhiḥ |
na hi siddhyaṃti deveśi daśapadma japena vaiḥ ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena sva sva vidyā kramaṃ caret |
ātmīyā ca parā caiva śaktimātraṃ maheśvari ||

maṃtrādhi devatā vuddhyā pūjyāḥ sarvopacārakaiḥ |
vividhaiḥ phalatāṃbūlairvastrālaṃkāra hemabhiḥ ||

saṃpūjya vidhivadbhaktyā vahu hetuṃ pradāpayet |
saṃbhogavāsanāṃ dhṛtvāyaḥ kuryācchakti pūjanaṃ ||

sa dāridryamavāpnoti nārakī ca bhaveddhruvaṃ ||

<p. 226a>

vahubhiḥ kiṃ vaco jālaiḥ samāsāt samayaṃ śṛṇu |
nirdiśyate śaktipūjā kaulikānāṃ dine dine ||

pratyahaṃ ca surādānaṃ tat svīkāro'nvahaṃ tathā |
nityatoktastayorddevi kulamārgarateṣu ca ||

heyāheya vicāropi viralaḥ śaktiṣu priye |
anukalpapradā tṛṇāmapi nityatvameva hi ||

vihāyagarhitā śaktiryogyā eva hi gṛhyate |
itareṣāṃ śaktipūjākāmyā naimittikī tathā || 

samādhisthita cittānāmitarāsāṃ nirākṛtiḥ |
vidhānaṃ kalayedāniṃ maṃtrānapi ca pārvatī ||

snātāṃ divyāṃ varadharāṃ nānālaṃkāra maṇḍitāṃ |
yuvatīṃ pīna vakṣojāṃ tathā cākṛta bhojanāṃ ||

haste gṛhītvā vāmorau sthāpayecchaktimuttamāṃ |
aśaknuvā (*) (?) voḍaṃtāṃ devyā vāmetha cāsane ||

vāmabhāge samālikhya trikoṇaṃ padmavartulaṃ |
śvetarakta samāyuktāṃ nālaṃ siṃdūracarcitaṃ ||

sādhakaḥ prāṅmukho bhūtvā devīṃ pratyuṅmukhīṃ yajet |
uḍḍiyānaṃ tu tretāyāṃ kṛte pūrṇagiriṃ yajet ||

jālaṃdharaṃ dvāpareṣu kāmapīṭhaṃ kalau yuge |
tāni catvāri vakṣyāmi guhyādguhyatarāṇi ca ||

ṛṣyādivaṃ caredādau tataḥ śodhanamācaret ||

ṛṣyādikaṃ śṛṇvidānīṃ etasya suravaṃdite |
śrīśaktipūjanasyāsya gonardda ṛṣirīritaḥ ||

vikṛtiśchaṃda ākhyātaṃ śaktirūpā yadādanu |
mahākālī devatā ca kāmo vījamudāhṛtaṃ ||

śaktirvadhūrbhauvaneśī kīlakaṃ samudāhṛtaṃ |
śivaśaktiḥ sāmarasya prakāśe viniyogatā ||

saṃsarga paṃcadīrghādyairvadhūvījaiḥṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
vidhāyātmaniśaktyaṃgenyāsaṃ vācyamathā caret ||

strīcechakti padasthāne bhairaveti padaṃ vadet |
yoṣidyoni padasthānesyāliṃga padakalpanā ||

gurupadeśataścāpi svavuddhā vā sureśvari |
druhaḥ sarvatra kartavyo liṃge tat tatpadeti ca ||

samānaḥ kiṃtu gāyatryā māsamāno bhayatra hi |
nyāsoddhāramidāniṃ tvaṃ sāvadhānā niśāmaya ||

<p. 226b>

trayākāso ramārāvo yoginī roṣayoṣitā |
ḍākinī pralayohāraḥ phetkārī karṇikāpi ca ||

preto nṛsiṃhaḥ kulikaṃ cichaktiḥ sarvaśeṣagāḥ |
ekaikaṃ parato dadyād vījaṃ nāmnā surārcite ||

tānyapyādau kaulikī ca bhagamālinyanaṃtaraṃ |
ratipriyā tathā'naṃgo'kulā samayapālinī ||

madanonmādinī kāmāveśinī tadanaṃtaraṃ |
vittonmāthinyapi tato mohanyākarṣaṇī tathā ||

smarāturānaṅga rūpānaṅga hṛpramodinyanaṃtaraṃ |
saṃtāpinī tataḥ saṃkṣobhiṇī ca tridaśārcite ||

sarvaśeṣe parijñeyā sāmarasya svarūpiṇī |
etāḥ ṣoḍaśa vaikāryā ṅeṃtāḥ pūrvārṇa saṃyutā ||

strīkartṛkatve puṃliṃgā bhairavārcana karmaṇi |
namaḥ śeṣeṣu sarveṣu sthānāni kalpayādhunā ||

śiraḥ kapolau ca galaḥ skaṃdhau vakṣaḥ kuvau tathā |
pārśvo kukṣiścanābhiścavastirvaṃkṣaṇa eva ca ||

ūrujānū ca jaṃghe ca pādau yoniśca śekhagau |
jīvanyāsa vadetasyāḥ sāmarasyamathā caret ||

eta deveti saṃproktaṃ śaktiśodhanamīśvarī |
kṛtvā prahastu karo datvānu hṛdurojayaoḥ ||

kāmapīṭhetha vā devī nābhau maulīyakīmate |
manuṃ gṛṇanvakṣyamāṇaṃ vāraikaṃ vā trivārakaṃ ||

jīvanyāsātmakamidaṃ śaktiśodhanamācaret |
anena śuddhyate śaktirnānyathā maṃtrakoṭibhiḥ ||

māyākāmo vadhūrlakṣmīḥ kūrcaḥ prāsāda eva ca |
śākinī ḍākinī cāpi vījānyaṣṭaupuraḥ smaret ||

bhogānaṃda kalāśaktirjīvātmā paramātmakāḥ |
prativiṃvādvaitasaṃjñakātmyanāmalayā'bhidhān ||

daśakūṭān kramāt procya brahma tadviparītakaṃ |
dvayaṃ daśāṃta uccāryamevamarddhārddhasammitaṃ ||

tato mamānu hṛdayetavānu hṛdaye vadet |
dadhātu mama vācyuktvāte vācaṃ samudīrayat ||

mameṃdriyeṣu tadanu pravadet kamalānane |
te iṃdriyāṇi ca saṃbhāṣya mama vācaṃ juṣasva ca ||

tataḥ siddhikarālīti tvāṃ mahyaṃ niyunaktu ca |
yaivatvaṃ ca sa evāhaṃ ya evāhamitīrayet ||

<p. 227a>

saivatvaṃ saṃdhināyuktamubhau tadanukīrtayet |
śivaśakti samārasya māpannau tadanaṃtaraṃ ||

tadaikamiti saṃkīrtya sādhayāva itīrayet |
sa saṃdhistāra hṛcchīrṣa maṃtrastadanu suṃdari ||

ayaṃ maṃtraḥ samuddiṣṭaḥ śaktiśodhana karmaṇi |
aṣṭottaraśatārṇādyona nyūnonāpi cādhikaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ pūrvoditaṃ yatte bhagavatyā mayā tava |
śaktiṃ ca tādṛgākāraṃ dhyāyedvīkṣyāṅga saṃcayaṃ ||

bhairavadhyānasadṛśa mātmānaṃ ca vibhāvayet |
tata āvāhayeddevīṃ śaktyaṃge pīṭhasannibhe ||

vakṣyamāṇena maṃtreṇa sādhakoṃjali mudrayā |
māyākāmavadhūrāva kamalā yoginīruṣaḥ ||

ḍākinī cāpi phetkārī na vaitānyādigānihi |
ehyehi bhagavatyuktvā mahākālī samīrayet ||

śaktipīṭhe'nusānnidhyamāveśaya samuddharet |
tatastvāmahamullikhyāvāhayāmi ca kīrtayet ||

sarvaśakti samābhāvya svarūpiṇi tato vadet |
tāraṃ pratiṣṭha śīrṣaṃ ca śakti mūlamanuṃ śṛṇu ||

māyārāvaḥ smaro nārī śaktaye hṛdayaṃ tataḥ |
maṃtro navākṣaraḥ proktaḥ śaktipūjana karmaṇi ||

ṛṣyādirnāsti caitanya na chando vījaśaktayaḥ |
kiṃtu pādyādi sarvopacārādyarpaṇa hetukaḥ ||

japtavyo naiva cāyaṃ hi tripura pravaco yathā |
sarvopacārānye tena pradadyāt kiṃtu śaktaye ||

pādyadānādi naivedyadānāṃtaṃ yadyadiṣyate |
na cānyamaṃtro bhinnāsti manmate jagadīśvari ||

kūrcateyaṃtu mauleyā tadamūlaṃ vibhāvyatāṃ |
śaktipūjā vaśiṣṭaṃ yat puṣpasraganulepanaṃ ||

yadātmane dīyate tat sāmarasyārcanaṃ bhavet |
tadamaṃtraṃ prakartavyaṃ mevamīśāna śāsanaṃ ||

tato datvā karaṃ śaktiryonipīṭhe japaṃ caret |
sādhakaḥ śaktigāyatryā śatamarddhārddhameva vā ||

yonipīṭhe japaprakhyo na japaḥ kvāpi vidyate |
sadyaḥ prabhāvajanako maṃtrāṇāṃ pīṭha uttamaḥ ||

maṃtrāṇāṃ valahīnānāṃ prayoga kṣīṇacetasāṃ |
anuddhṛtānāṃ śāpebhyo nyūnādhikyārṇatājuṣāṃ ||

gurumliṣṭānāmapi ca pradānonaujasāṃ tathā |
ajñānavidhi pūjānāma pātrārpaṇabhagināṃ ||

tyaktānāṃ vismṛtānāṃ ca tathā caivā prabhāvināṃ |
saṃdhukṣaṇārthamubhayaṃ proktaṃ tripuravairiṇā ||

ekaṃ nirvāṇa maṃtreṇa saṃpuṭīṃ kṛtya tajjapaṃ |
kaulāsane nāparaṃ ca yonipīṭhe japakriyā ||

kaulāsanaṃ yonipīṭhe japaḥ strīṇā manugrahaḥ |
gurustrī śaktitā cāpi miśrībhūya japedvayoḥ ||

anyaiḥ samindhanaṃ matrairvījādhikya karaṃ paraṃ ||

<p. 227b>

athātaḥ śaktigāyatrīṃ śṛṇu devi mahāphalaṃ |
kāmavījād bhagavatīṃ ṅentāṃpurata īrayet ||

vidmahe yonimālinyai dhīmahīti tataḥ paraṃ |
tannaḥ śaktiriti procya sarvaśekhe pracodayāt ||

eṣā hi śakti gāyatrī sarvāgama sugopitā |
etāṃ ni nālaśakyarcāna śaktyarcāṅgiko tapaḥ ||

yathāśakti japitvaināṃ tatsamarpya ca śaktaye |
vāmorāvupaveśyaiva kuryān mūlajapaṃ priye ||

pūjayenmadanāgāre raktacaṃdanacarcite |
bhage tadīye vijñeyā nāḍyastisraḥ pravāhikāḥ ||

ekottarāhikā cāṃḍī saurī cānyā tu vāhikāḥ |
āgneyī cāparājñeyā pūjayettāstu sādhakaḥ ||

aṃbu sravati cāṃḍī sā puṣpaṃ sravati bhānavī |
vījaṃ sravati cāgneyītāstu nāmabhirarcayet ||

vāgbhavādyairnamoyuktaiḥ pūjayet suprasannadhīḥ |
dhyānaṃ kuryān maheśāni gahvare makarānane ||

tāmracūḍaśikhākāraṃ gajavaktra samaprabhaṃ |
tatra sthānaṃ ciṃtayeddevīṃ vidyāṃ bhuvanamohinīṃ ||

bhagamālāmaṃtrastu ||

vāgbhavaṃ bhagaśabdāṃte bhagebhagini cālikhet |
bhagodari bhagāṃte tu bhagamāle bhagāvahe ||

bhagaguhye bhagaprāṃte yoniprāṃte bhagāṃtake |
nipātinī ca sarvāṃte tato bhagavaśaṃkarī ||

bhagarūpe tato lekhyaṃ nīrajāyata locane |
nityaklinne bhagaprāṃte svarūpe sarva cālikhet ||

bhagāni mehyā namoṃte varadetha samālikhet |
rete svarete bhagavat klinna klinna drave tataḥ ||

kledaya drāvayaścātha sarvasatvān bhageśvari |
amoghe bhagavīcce cakṣubhaḥ kṣobhaśca sarva ca ||

satvān bhageśvari vrūyādvāgbhavaṃ vrūṁ japādidaṃ |
bhaṁ plūṁ māṁ vlūṁ ca haiṃ klinne tataḥ paraṃ ||

sarvāṇi ca bhagānyaṃte meva śañcānayeti ca |
strīvījaṃ ca haraprāṃte valamātmakamakṣaraṃ ||

bhuvaneśīṃ samālikhya vidyeyaṃ bhagamālinī |
caturthyaṃtaṃ yajeddevī bhage puṣpaṃ viniḥkṣipet ||

prakṣālya kuladravyeṇa gaṃdhapuṣpaiḥ samarcayet |
dhūpadīpādikaṃ kṛtvā paścādāvaraṇaṃ yajet ||

ihāpyā vāhanaṃ nāsti jīvanyāsā maheśvarī |
athaivaṃ ca vidhānenatāḥ ṣoḍaśopacārakaiḥ ||

iṣṭadevīṃ prapūjyātha sarvasiddhīśvarośvaro bhavet ||

<p. 228a>

arcayedgaṃdhapuṣpādyaiḥ svaśivaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ |
athanyāsaṃ pravakṣyāmi śivātmānaṃ vibhāvayet ||

paṃcavaktraṃ mahādevaṃ kalāyuktaṃ nyaset kramāt |
īśānassarvavidyānāṃ śaśinī prathamākalā ||

īśvarassarvabhūtānāmaṅgadā tadanaṃtaraṃ |
brahmādhipati śabdāṃte brahmaṇodhipatiḥ punaḥ ||

brahmeṣṭadā śivomestu marīci saṃpuṭa nyaset |
sadāśivaḥ samuccārya aṃśumālinyathā parā ||

tatpuruṣāya vidmaheṃ kalāśāṃtiritīritā |
mahādevāyadhīmahi kalāvidyā tathaiva ca ||

tanno rudraḥ padaṃ paścāt pratiṣṭā kathitā kalā |
pracodayāt samuccārya nivṛttiḥ syāt tataḥ paraṃ ||

pūrvapaścimayāmyeṣu uttareṣva pāru kramāt |
hṛdaye vinyaseddevī aghorebhyaḥ stamaḥ kalā ||

atha ghorebhyo mohāṃ ca grīvāyāṃ vinyaset tataḥ |
ghorāṃte syāt kriyāpaścād dakṣiṇāṃśe pravinyaset ||

namastestu kṣudhāṃ paścāt kalāṃ pṛṣṭhe nyaset kramāt |
rudrarupebhya ityaṃte tṛṣāntāra namoṃtakāḥ ||

vāmadevāya namoṃte rajāsyād guhyadeśake |
mukha savye pravinyasya rakṣāṃ jyeṣṭhāyavai namaḥ ||

rudrāya namo ratiṃ paścād vāmamukhaṃ kalāmimāṃ |
kālāya nama ityaṃte pālinī urudakṣiṇe ||

kalakāmāya deveśi vāme vikaraṇāya ca |
namaḥ padaṃ samuccārya saṃyamanīndakṣajānuni ||

valakriyā samādiṣṭā vāme vikaraṇāya ca |
namoṃte vṛddhimuccārya dakṣiṇe sphici vinyaset ||

balapramathanāya namo rātriṃ vāme pravinyaset |
sarvabhūtadamanāya namonte brāhmaṇīkalā ||

kaṭideśe pravinyasya manau te mohinīṅkalāṃ |
dakṣiṇe pārśvakenyasya unmanāya namojvalāṃ ||

pādayostana nāsāsu mūrddhni vāhu yugenyaset |
sadyo jātodbhavāssamyagaṣṭau maṃtrī kalāḥ kramāt ||

sadyojātaṃ prapadyāmi siddhiḥ syāt prathamāḥ kalā |
sadyo jātāya vai bhūyo namaḥ syādṛddhirīritā ||

bhavedyutistṛtīyāsyāda bhave tadanaṃtaraṃ |
lakṣmīścaturthī kathitā tato nāti bhave padaṃ ||

medhākhyā paṃcamī proktā kalā bhūyo bhavasvanāṃ |
prajñā samīritā ṣaṣṭī bhavāṃte syāt prabhā kalā ||

<p. 228b>

udbhavāya namaḥ paścāt sudhāsyādaṣṭamī kalā |
praṇavādyāścaturthyaṃtā namoṃtāśca pravinyaset ||

evanyā sa vidhiṃ kṛtvā svayaṃ śaivaṃ vibhāvayet |
paṃcākṣaraṃ puraskṛtya rudra dhyānaparāyaṇaḥ ||

sāmarasyamayaṃ kṛtvā rakṣārthaṃ kavacaṃ paṭhet |
vadhvā tu kṣobhiṇīṃ mudrāṃ yaṃtra madhye viniḥkṣipet ||

bhagaṃ kuṃḍaṃ śruvo liṃgamādyaṃ caiva tu vīryakaṃ |
sarvatatvaṃ samuccārya sahasraṃ japamācaret ||

dharmādharma havirdīpta ātmāgnau manasā śruvā |
suṣumṇā vartmanā nityamakṣa vṛttirjuhomyahaṃ ||

svāhāṃ toyaṃ mahāmaṃtra āraṃbhe parikīrtitaḥ |
śivaśakti samāyogo yoga eva na saṃśayaḥ ||

śītkāro maṃtrarūpaṃ ca vacanaṃ stavanaṃ bhavanaṃ bhavet ||

āliṃganaṃ ca kastūrī karpūraṃ cuṃvanaṃ bhavet |
nakhadaṃṣṭrākṣatādīni puṣpāṇi vividhāni ca ||

mathanaṃ tarpaṇaṃ viddhi vījapāto visarjanaṃ ||

āliṃganaṃ cuṃvanaṃ ca stanayormardanaṃ tathā |
darśanaṃ sparśanaṃ yonirvikāraṃ liṃgagharṣaṇaṃ ||

praveśaṃ sthāpanaṃ śakternnavapuṣpāṇi pūjayet |
na dadyāccumbanaṃ yastu daridro jāyate dhruvaṃ ||

āliṃganaṃ vinā devi kuṣṭī bhavati pārvatī |
vinā daṃtakṣatairdevi loke bhavati niṃditaḥ ||

āliṅgane haredrogān dhanadhānyādi cuṃbane |
nakhadaṃtakṣatādyaiśca tadā mokṣaḥ prajāyate ||

sāyujyaṃ saṃgame tasyāt satyameva na saṃśayaḥ |
prakāśākāśahastābyāmavalaṃvyonmanī śrucā ||

dharmādharma kalā snehapūrṇamagnau juhomyahaṃ |
svāhāṃtoyaṃ mahāmaṃtraḥ śukratyāge prakīrtitaḥ ||

śuddha maṃtrauṣadhe naiva yānaistu maṃthanaṃ caret |
madhyamāne ca tasyā hi jāyate tatvamuttamaṃ ||

gṛhnīyāt tatprayatnena dravyaṃ kuṇḍodbhavaṃ śubhaṃ |
tenāmṛtena divyena kāilkāṃ tarpayet sadā ||

sānnidhyāt tatkṣaṇādvāpi prītā siddhiṃ prayacchati |
samasta devatānāṃ tarpaṇaṃ ca sadāmṛtaiḥ ||

guruṇāṃ sādhakānāṃ ca sarveṣāṃ tarpaṇaṃ caret |
te nāmṛtena divyena sarve tuṣṭā bhavaṃti ca ||

yat kāmaṃ kurute maṃtrī tatkṣaṇādeva siddhyati ||

kulāmṛtaṃ samādoya tatrārghe niḥkṣipedbudhaḥ |
tataḥ somakalāḥ pūjyāḥ sādhakairnirmalāḥśayaiḥ ||

<p. 229a>

madhubhāṇḍa sahasraistu māṃsa bhāraśatairapi |
naiva tuṣṭā bhaveddevi bhagaliṅgāmṛtādṛte ||

kuladravyaṃ ca saṃśodhya śivaśaktimayaṃ priye |
jīvāmṛtaṃ parabrahmarūpaṃ niḥkṣipyasuṃdari ||

arghyapātrāmṛtairyaṣṭvā nirvikalpaḥ sadānaghaḥ |
arghadravyaiśca deveśi yonau devīṃ prapūjayet ||

yonipūjāṃ vinā pūjā kṛtā vāpya kṛtā bhavet |
dutīyāge kṛtaṃ maṃtrī sarvajñāyate dhruvaṃ ||

na tasya punarāvṛttiḥ kalpakoṭi śatairapi |
yaiḥ kṛtayajanaṃ dūtyāstairiṣṭāḥ kratavo'khilā ||

sarvatīrthamayaḥ proktaḥ sarvadevamayo bhavet |
puraścaryādi sakalaṃ kṛtaṃ tena na saṃśayaḥ ||

aśvamedha sahasrāṇi vājapeya śatāni ca |
āsamudrā ca dharaṇī dattā tena sa dakṣiṇā ||

merumaṇḍala tulyāni suvarṇānyarpitāni vai |
go koṭi dānādyat puṇyaṃ tatpuṇyaṃ jāyate priye ||

tasmāt sarvaprayatnena dūtīyāgaṃ samācaret |
pūjā saṃpūrṇade bhadre sarvāriṣṭa pranāśakaṃ ||

yonipūjāyutā pūjākṛtāmapyakṣayā bhavet |
āyurārogya vibhavānamitā labhate naraḥ ||

anenaiva vidhānena viṣārtto nirviṣo bhavet |
putrārthī labhate putraṃ dhanārthī labhate dhanaṃ ||

mātaṃgī śaktimabhyarcya tayāssākaṃ samarcayet |
mātaṃgī manmathopetāṃ sarvakāmārthasiddhaye ||

śaktyā sākaṃ sadā pujyā mātaṃgī maṃtradevatā |
sā devī śaktihīnā tu na dadāti manorathaṃ ||

pūrṇābhiṣeka rahito yaḥ śaktiṃ śodhayennaraḥ |
sodhamaḥ patito rogī paṃcatvaṃ labhate dhruvaṃ ||

iṃdriyāṇāma dhṛṣyatvāt kāmalābhādi saṃbhavāt |
prāyaḥ kalau kaulikeyaṃ paṃthā naraka hetave ||

uttamā nityapūjāsyān madhyamaṃ parvapūjanaṃ |
māsapūjādhamā proktā māsādūrddhaṃ paśurbhavet ||

māse vātha trimāse vā ṣaṇmāse vatsarepi vā |
śrī guruṃ pūjayed bhaktyā prāptai tat strīsutādikān ||

tadabhāve tat kulīnaṃ tacchiṣyaṃ vānyayoginaṃ |
saṃtoṣayet kuladravyaṃścakrapūjā puraḥsaraṃ ||

atha cakrasya viśeṣācāramāha ||

ucchiṣṭo na spṛśeccakraṃ kuladravyaṃ tathā guruṃ |
vahiḥ prakṣālya ca karau kuladravyāṇi dāpayet ||

madyabhāṃḍaṃ samuddhṛtya na pātraṃ paripūrayet |
bhogapātraṃ surākuṃbhaṃ niḥkṣipenna kadācana ||

<p. 229b>

cakramadhye suvidhiṃ vā karāsya kṣālanādikaṃ |
yaḥ karoti hi mūḍhātmā sa bhavedā padāṃ padaṃ ||

niṣṭīvanaṃ malaṃ mūtramadho vāyuvisarjanaṃ |
śrīcakramadhyeyaḥ kuryāt sa bhavedyoginī paśuḥ ||

cakramadhye ghaṭe bhinne pātre vā skhalite tathā |
dīpanāśe rāṣṭrapīḍā tacchāṃtyai cakrapūjanaṃ ||

parihāsaṃ pralāpaṃ ca viḍaṃvaṃ vahubhāṣaṇaṃ |
audāsīnyaṃ bhayaṃ krodhaṃ cakramadhye vivarjayet ||

pātrahastaścakramadhyena bhramet pūrṇapātrakaṃ |
ciraṃ na sthāpayeddhaste nālapetyotrapāṇikaḥ ||

pādābhyāṃ na spṛśet pātraṃ na ca bhidyāt kadācana |
naikahastena dātavyaṃ na viṃduṃ pātayedadhaḥ ||

pātraṃ na cālaye sthānānna mudrāvarjitaṃ pivet |
sa śabdaṃ na pivenmadyaṃ na kuryāt pātrasaṃkaraṃ ||

pātrasyāṃśa dvayaṃ madyapūrṇaṃ tryaṃśaṃ turīyakaṃ |
nānyonyaṃ tāḍayet pātraṃ na pātraṃ tāḍayedadhaḥ ||

sādhāraṃ noddharet pātramanādhāreṇa niḥkṣipet |
riktaṃ pātraṃ na kurvīta na pātraṃ laṃghayet tathā ||

prakṣālya gopayet pātraṃ namoṃto vipramīkṣaye ||

śrīcakrasthaṃ kuladravyaṃ dadyādyo vā kule jane |
phalāni tasya naśyaṃti kruddhā bhavati devatā ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau sakalasādhāraṇacakrārcananirṇayo 
nāmāṣṭāviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 28 ||    

atha yaṃtranirmāṇa pratiṣṭhāmāha ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi yaṃtrasthāpana nirṇayam |
yaṃtraṃ tu gṛhamityuktaṃ yaṃtraṃ pīṭhaṃ prakīrtitaṃ ||

sthirayaṃtre pratikṛtau nāvāhana visarjane |
pratiṣṭāpya mahāyaṃtraṃ tatadyaṃtraṃ visarjayet ||

yaṃtra pratiṣṭhāmāsādya vidyāṃ tatra vibhāvayet |
jīvanyāsaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā vidyāṃ tatra vibhāvayet ||

yaṃtraṃ pratiṣṭhāṃ kṛtvādau devaṃ tatra pratiṣṭhayet |
tadā visarjanaṃ nāsti na cāvāhanameva ca ||

ataḥ kālasya vyatyāsād yaṃtrameva pratiṣṭhayet |
mūrtiṃ svahṛdgatī tatra dhyātvā pūjya visarjayet ||

<p. 230a>

sphāṭikādiṃ svarṇaraupyaṃ yaṃtraṃ ca kārayet priye ||

yāvajjīvaṃ suvarṇesyādraupye dvāviṃśatiṃ priye |
tāmre dvādaśakaṃ varṣaṃ varṇe'naṃta phala (*) (?) ka ||

(********) (?) maṇyādau 
kimvadāmite ||

vidrume racite yaṃtre padmarāgetha vā priye |
indranīletha vaiḍūrye sphāṭike marakaṭepi vā ||

dhanaṃ putra tathā dārān yaśāṃsi labhate dhruvaṃ |
suvarṇa racite pīṭhe bhūpālā ca śavartinaḥ ||

rajate na kṛtaṃ yaṃtraṃ āyurārogyakāṃmadaṃ |
tāmreṇa racite yaṃtraṃ sarvaiśvarya pradaṃ mataṃ ||

yaṃtraṃ tu sphāṭikaṃ svacchaṃ manobhilaṣitapradaṃ |
māṇikyā racitaṃ yaṃtraṃ rājyadaṃ bhuktimuktidaṃ ||

kṛtaṃ marakaṭe yaṃtraṃ sarvaśatruvināśanaṃ |
lauha trayodbhavaṃ yaṃtraṃ sarvasiddhikaraṃ mataṃ ||

śrīkhaṇḍaṃ śāṃtidaṃ jñeyaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ raktacaṃdanaṃ |
śrīparṇī pīṭhamuddiṣṭaṃ pūjārthaṃ dhanarājyadaṃ ||

vaidrumaṃ vahulā saṃpadbhūrjapatre catuḥpadā |
gaṇḍakī bhavapāṣāṇo bhuktirmuktira dūrataḥ ||

bhūmau siṃdūra rajasā racitaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ |
sīsakāṃsyādiṣu kṛte saṃpattiṃ saṃtataṃ haret ||

phalakāyāṃ padebhittau sthāpayenna kadācana |
sthāpitaṃ yadi mohena nāśayet taddhanaṃ kulaṃ ||

teṣāṃ madhye sphāṭikastu sarvasiddhipradaṃ bhavet ||

atha trilohānāṃ saṃkhyāmāha ||

daśabhāgaṃ suvarṇasya tāmrasya dvādaśaṃ tathā |
ṣoḍaśaṃ rajatasyāpi etallohatrayaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

atha parimāṇamāha ||

arddhāṅgulyena homasya rajatasya tathaiva ca |
tāmrasya pūrvasaṃkhyau ca māṇikyādau yathecchayāṃ ||

palapramāṇaṃ kartavyamarcā pīṭhaṃ manoharaṃ ||

agniraṃgula vistāra prāk pratyagdakṣiṇottaraṃ |
parārddhorddhaṃ prakurvīta caturasraṃ samaṃ tataḥ ||

māṇikyādika pīṭhaṃ tu mānanyūnaṃ na doṣakṛt |
śrīparṇā caṃdanādīnāmadhikaṃ cenna doṣakṛt ||

mahāśaṃkhe śilāyāṃ ca na ca yaṃtravicāraṇā ||

athavā ||

ekatolaṃ dvitolaṃ vā tritolaṃ paṃcatolakaṃ |
rasatolaṃ vedatolaṃ saptāṣṭatolakaṃ tathā ||

daśatolaṃ sūryatolaṃ kalāsaṃkhyakatolakaṃ |
radatolaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭhitolakaṃ śatatolakaṃ ||

<p. 230b>

yaṃtraṃ manojñaṃ sukhadaṃ surekhaṃ pīṭhamuttamaṃ ||

atha prastāramāha ||

cāturvidhyā hi cakrasya prastārāśca bhavaṃti hi |
bhūkūrma padmaprastārā meruścāpi tathā vidhaḥ ||

nimnarekhā samāyogo bhūprastāre mayoditeḥ |
kūrmapadmaka prastāra ūrddhvarekhā mayoditā ||

bhūprastāro dvidhā devi ūrddhva pātālabhedataḥ |
tribhiḥ kramādunnataṃ syāt kramot kramamathāpi vā ||

dvitrikramādunnatopi dvidvikramamathāpi vā |
yvāṃtaraṃ yavārddhaṃ vā tilayuktilameva vā ||

taṇḍulārddhaṃ tacca vā syāt tadvaya kramabhedataḥ ||

meruḥ svarge ca kailāśe martyaloke prakīrtitaḥ |
bhūprastārastu pātāle tritayaṃ kīrtitaṃ mayā ||

kaṃjakūrma ratnagarbhāḥ sarvatrapūjane śubhāḥ |
śubhāḥ sarvamaheśāni sarvasiddhi pradāyakāḥ ||

ūrddhvarekhābhidheyaṃ tu pūjārthaṃ mṛtyugocaraṃ |
sthāpanārthaṃ tu pātālarekhā ca kutracinmatā ||

atha yaṃtralikha na karṇikādīnāṃ likhane sthānamāha ||

paṃcavṛttāni saṃlikhya tatra yaṃtraṃ likhedbudhaḥ |
ādyaṃ syāt karṇikā sthānaṃ keśarāṇāṃ dvitīyakaṃ ||

tṛtīyaṃ dalamadhyasya dalāgrāṇāṃ caturthakaṃ |
paṃcame būpuraṃ likhyamevaṃ yaṃtravidhau smṛtaṃ ||

keśara dvayayuktaṃ ca dalaṃ proktaṃ maheśvarī |
daṇḍākāraṃ viṃduvaktraṃ tadvayoktaṃ maheśvari ||

pātālarekhā prastāre keśare mukhyaviṃdunā |
ūrddhvarekhā vidhau devi rekhā keśaratā matā ||

śrīvidyāyāṃ kālikāyāṃ keśarāṇi kvacicca vā |
śrīvidyāyāṃ mahādevi keśarāṇi na kārayet ||

yathā dalaṃ keśareṇa viyuktaṃ karmavarjitaṃ |
tathā trikoṇaṃ deveśi biṃdunāvarjitaṃ bhavet ||

viṃduhīnaṃ tu yadyaṃtraṃśa ca vadbhavet |
tathaivāṣṭa dalayorddhe vṛttaṃ yatnena kārayet ||

vṛttaṃ vinā cāṣṭadalaṃ garbhabhūṣaṇavarjitaṃ |
ṛjurekhā bhavellakṣmīrvakrarekhā daridratā ||

na rātrāvaṃkayedyaṃtraṃ sādhakastu kadācana |
pramādādaṃkite caiva devatāśāpamāpnuyāt ||

yaṃtramātre maheśāni nirṇayaḥ kathito mayā |
ādhirupācca viṃvasya pūjāyāśca viśeṣataḥ ||

<p. 231a>

sādhakasya ca viśvāsāddevaḥ sānnidhyamicchati ||

atha yaṃtrāṇāṃ dhyānamāha ||

devyuvāca ||

pūrve saṃsūcitaṃ nātha yaṃtradhyānaṃ tvayāṃ prabho |
kathaṃ dhyeyaṃ kiṃ viśiṣṭaṃ kiṃ dhyeyādhyeyameva hi ||

vṛttaṃ mūrtisvarūpaṃ vā mekhalāvat svarūpakaṃ |
kiṃvā rekhāmayaṃ dhyeya kiṃvā vai bhūsvarūpakaṃ ||

viśvarūpaṃ smaredvāpi tatsarvamapi kathyatāṃ ||

īśvara uvāca ||

dhyānaṃ tu trividhaṃ proktaṃ yaṃtramātre maheśvarī |
ādau virādviśvarūpaṃ dviścacaṇḍasvarūpiṇaṃ ||

yaṃtraṃ saṃbhāvayeddevi sarvatra kathitaṃ tvidaṃ |
śrīcakrādau mahādevi virādrūpe tu sāmyatā ||

dvitīyaṃ ca kathaṃ dhyeyaṃ tanmevada maheśvari |
tejaḥ puṃjanibhārekhā sarvacaitanyarūpiṇī ||

sarvadarpaṇa vadbhāvyaṃ svaprakāśaḥ svarūpiṇaṃ |
caitanyaṃ bhāvayet sarvaṃ viṃdvādiṃ bhūpurāṃtakaṃ ||

mūlatejaḥ prakāśena abhinnaṃ bhāvayet priye |
rṛtīyaṃ śṛṇu deveśi merurūpaṃ sanātanaṃ ||

uttarottaramuccaṃ syādviṃdvārabhya vibhāvayet |
viṃdvadho bhāvayeddevi ekaikottarataḥ śive ||

navottara krameṇaiva bhāvayedvā maheśvari |
kālīvidyā vidhau devi navaratnaṃ svarūpiṇīṃ ||

rekhāṃ saṃbhāvayeddevi meru prastāravacca vā ||

śrīcakraṃ vījasaṃyuktaṃ niṣphalaṃ parameśvari |
vījahīnaṃ tu yaccakraṃ nirvījaṃ siddhidaṃ na hi ||

sṛṣṭi cakraṃ bhavedādau sthiticakraṃ dvitīyakaṃ |
bījasaṃlekhanaṃ devi tridhātragaditaṃ mayā ||

vījaṃ vinā tu nirvījaṃ tadyaṃtraṃ siddhidāyakaṃ |
dalākāraṃ kalau pūjya nānyathā siddhidaṃ śive ||

maṃtracaitanyakaṃ devi yaṃtracaitanyakaṃ tathā |
gurucaitanyakaṃ devi svasmitritayabhāvanā ||

na tatra dhyānarūpādi tejo yaṃtraṃ vibhāvanā |
sa prapaṃce tu saṃsāre durāvārāmṛtaḥ śive ||

bhāvanaiva tu saṃproktā bhāvanā siddhidā matā ||

atha sarvasādhāraṇa yaṃtra saṃskāramāha ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

cakrabhedo mahādevatvat prasādānmayāśrutaḥ |
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi pratiṣṭhākarma nirṇayam ||

śrī śaṃkara uvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi jagatkāriṇi kaulinī |
tasyodyāpana karmāṃgaṃ sarvavarṇa vinirṇayaṃ ||

lagne śubhagrahopete'nukūle guṇaśālini |
pratiṣṭhāṃ kārayedeṣāmṛkṣatithyādike kṣaṇe ||

snātvā saṃkalpayenmaṃtrī gurorcana mācaret |
gururmaṃtreṇa vilikhedyaṃtraṃ svarṇaśalākayā ||

paṃcagavyaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā śivamaṃtreṇa maṃtritaṃ |
tatra cakraṃ kṣipenmaṃtrī praṇavena samāhitaḥ ||

<p. 231b>

tasmāduddhṛtya taccakraṃ sthāpayet svarṇapaṃkaje |
paṃcāmṛtena dugdhena śītalena jalena ca ||

snāpayeccaṃdanenāpi kastūrī kuṃkumena ca |
hāṭakaiḥ kalaśairdevi aṣṭabhirvāri pūritaiḥ ||

kaṣāya jalasaṃpannaiḥ snāpayen maṃtramuccaran |
sa ta uttolya tadyaṃtraṃ sthāpayeddhema pātrake ||

yaṃtrarājāya vidmahe mahāmaṃtrāya dhīmahī |
uccaredet tadaṃte tu tanno yaṃtraḥ pracodayāt ||

spṛṣṭvā yaṃtraṃ kuśāgreṇa gāyatryā cābhi maṃtrayet |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ devī devatā bhāvasiddhaye ||

ātmaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā ṣaḍaṃgairdevatāṃ yajet |
tatrā vāhya yajeddevīṃ jīvanyāsaṃ ca kārayet ||

upacāraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhirmahāmudrādibhiḥ sadā |
phalatāṃbūla naivedyairdevīṃ tatra samarcayet ||

yadṛ sūtrādikaṃ dadyādvastrālaṃkārameva ca |
mukuraṃ cāmaraṃ ghaṇṭhāṃ yathāyogyaṃ maheśvarī ||

sarva me tat prayatnena dadyādātma hiterataḥ |
trirātraṃ pūjayeddevīṃ trisaṃdhyaṃ ca punaḥ punaḥ ||

tato jape sahasraṃ tu sakalepsina siddhaye |
balidānaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā praṇamedyaṃtra rājakaṃ ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā saṃpātājyaṃ viniḥkṣipet |
homakarmaṇya śaktiścedvimuṇaṃ japamācaret ||

dhenumekāṃ samādāya svarṇa śṛṃgādyalaṃkṛtam |
gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyāt tato devyā visarjanaṃ ||

atha kaulikādevi śeṣamāha ||

devyuvāca ||

deveśa śrotumicchāmi rahasyātirahasyakaṃ |
vāmināṃ caiva kaulānāṃ yaṃtrasaṃskāra karma ca ||

śiva uvāca ||

athocyate mahāyaṃtra saṃskāraḥ sarvasiddhidaḥ |
śubhehni snānamācarya śubhe lagne śubhe kṣaṇe ||

kṛta nityakriyā maṃtrī prāṅmukho vāyudaṅmukhaḥ ||

pūrvokta dhādu dravyaiśca suṃdaraṃ sumanoharaṃ |
surekhe śubhadaṃ yaṃtraṃ lekhayitvā vidhānataḥ ||

pratiṣṭhāṃ ca tataḥ kuryād yathā śāstra pramāṇataḥ |
śubhe lagne puṇyakāle śailādi vihitasthale ||

maṃtrī kalpānusāre tu pūrvedyuradhivāsayet |
sāyaṃ saṃkalpavidhivadghaṃṭasthāpana pūrvakaṃ ||

<p. 232a>

gaṇeśādīn samabhyarcya dikpālān paripūrayet |
madyaṃ māṃsaṃ tathā matsyaṃ mudrāṃ maithunameva ca ||

yaṃtra saṃskāra karmādau dravya me tanmayeritaṃ |
yathāśaktyopacārādyaiḥ pūjayen mūladevatām ||

sugaṃdha tailagaṃdhādyairdravyaistamadhi vāsayet |
caṃdretyādi ca maṃtreṇa japaghoṣa purassaraṃ ||

ityadhi vāsitaṃ kṛtvā saṃyatotiti teṃdriyaḥ |
prātarnityaṃ vidhāyādau tato yāgasthale viśet ||

patākādhvajasaṃkīrṇe divyamaṇḍalamaṇḍite |
vitāna cāmaracchatra puṣpamālā virājite ||

maṃgalāṃkura patrādyaiḥ kalaśaiḥ paribhūṣite |
maṇḍalaṃ sarvato bhadre rekhā sāhasrasaṃyutaṃ ||

sāmānya bhadraṃ vā devi vedyāśco parito likhet ||

athavā dakṣiṇe vāme vakṣye vāruṇamaṇḍalaṃ |
catusraṃ catuḥ ṣaṣṭiḥ koṣṭhaṃ vidyāṃ niveśayet ||

aṃtyoyāṃtima paṃktyostu dikṣu koṣṭāni mārjayet |
madhyastha caturakṣīṇi tadvārākhyāni pūrvavat ||

pītaḥ śyāmaḥ śveta haridrajobhiḥ paripūrayet |
koṇakoṣṭhaṃ vihāyaika paṃcāśatyādasaṃgitāḥ ||

pīṭhasya pāṇḍuro raktaḥpīta kṛṣṇaiḥ prapūrayet |
āgne pītaḥ koṇakoṣṭānyā raktaharitāsitaiḥ ||

śvetavarṇena catvāri madhye vṛttāni kārayet |
pūrayedatha tasyorddhaṃ vitānaṃ vaṃdhayed yathā ||

ṣaṭtriṃśadaṃśavyāsārddhaṃ vṛttamādyaṃ tu pītataḥ |
tat pītaṃ karṇikākāraṃ sitarekhā vṛtaṃ tataḥ ||

dvitīyaṃ dviguṇa vyāsa rūpakeśara saṃyutaṃ |
pītaraktaḥ śvetavarṇa mūlamadhyāgrakeśaraṃ ||

dvisaptatyaṃśikāśvetāṃ tasyāgre kuru rekhikāṃ |
tṛtīyaṃ tu tṛtīyāṃśe tulya vyāsaṃ tu vartulaṃ ||

śvetamaṣṭadalaṃ tatra raktāṃ cāṃtaddalāṃtaraṃ |
śvetaṃ vahiḥ kṛṣṇavarṇā raktāṃgaṃ taddalāṃtare ||

śvetaṃ vahiḥ kṛṣṇā prāgvadrekhāṃ sitāṃ kuru |
tadvahirvṛtta saṃlagnān ṣoḍaśārān prakalpayet ||

śyāmapītāruṇaḥ śvetai tadaṃtastudya vā kṛtī |
śitā pītāruṇaḥ śyāmaharitāḥ paṃcarekhikāḥ ||

kāryāḥ su rucirāḥ paṃcasyāṃtarevaṃ prapūrayet |
vajraśaktirdaṇḍakhaḍgapāśa dhvajagadyaṃ likhet ||

<p. 232b>

pūrvatastu tathaiśānyāṃ śūlacakrāṃvujānvitaṃ |
vāma dakṣiṇayoretanmaṇḍalaṃ vāruṇāhvayaṃ ||

prāṅmukho vāgyato bhūtvā saṃkalpyābhīṣṭasiddhaye |
paṃcaśuddhiṃ samācarya kurvannakṣata saṃyutaṃ ||

saṃsthāpya maṃḍale tatra yajedādhāraśaktitaḥ |
pīṭhamaṃtraṃ samāstīrya sthāpayet kalaśaṃ budhaḥ ||

dīkṣākramokta vidhinābhiṣeka kalaśaṃ tathā |
paṃcagavyaṃ tataḥ kuryācchivamaṃtra vivodhitaṃ ||

tena su snāpayenmaṃtrī yaṃtraṃ ca praṇavaṃ japan |
paṃcāmṛtena haviṣā dadhnā ca payasā kramāt ||

tata udvartanaṃ kṛtvā jelana sthāpayedapi |
paṃcagavyaṃ samānīya taṃtra yaṃtraṃ samāhitaḥ ||

japan kṣipet suvarṇādau vedamūla purassaraṃ |
tata uddhṛtya svarṇādi pātraṃ saṃsthāpya maṃtravit ||

paṃcāmṛtena tīrtheṇa śītalena jalena ca |
sahasraśīrṣāmaṃtreṇa mūlamaṃtra puraḥsaraṃ ||

susnāpyayāvamānena karpūrāgurunīrataḥ |
sarvauṣadhi jalairgaṃdhairjalairyatnena mārjanaṃ ||

tataḥ śuddhadukūlena jalamutsārya sādhakaḥ |
paridhāyadukūledve svarṇanirmitadolayā ||

maṇḍaletaṃ samānīya nṛtyagītairjayasvanaiḥ |
kuṃkumādyairvilipyātha pūjyaḥ sarvopacārakaiḥ ||

pīṭhapūjāṃ tataḥ kuryāt svasvakalpokta mānataḥ |
kuśaiḥ kulīnairvā devi śatamaṣṭottaraṃ japet ||

pūrvoktāṃ yaṃtragāyatrīṃ japtvā devatvamāpnuyāt |
atheṣṭaṃ devatāṃ dhyātvā mudrayā vāhayet tataḥ ||

jīvanyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryāt pūjayediṣṭadevatāṃ |
nṛtyagītaiśca vāditraiḥ paṃcaghoṣa puraḥ saraṃ ||

tato japediṣṭa maṃtramaṣṭottara sahasrakaṃ |
kuṇḍe vā sthaṃḍile maṃtrī haviṣā saṃskṛte nale ||

yathāvidhi vidhānena śruco homaṃ samācaret |
grāsa pramāṇaṃ ca caruṃ mūlenākṛṣya maṃtravit ||

ghṛtaśruvaṃ tato datvā juhuyādagni saṃmukhe |
paṃcaviṃśati tatvaiśca tatvena tarpaṇaṃ caret ||

<p. 233a>

iṃdrādi dikpatibhyaśca dadyāt pūrvoditaṃ valiṃ |
tata āvṛtti devebhyo ghṛtenāhuti mācaret ||

tadaṃte devi maṃtreṇa hunedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
mātṛkā yuktaṃ maṃtraṃ tu japa jaya jayasvanaiḥ ||

gatvā homa samīpe tu datvā pūrṇāhutiṃ tataḥ |
toṣayet svarṇavastrādyaiḥ pradadyād dakṣiṇāmapi ||

kṣakāraiḥ paṃcabhirdevī vīrapūjāṃ samācaret |
śaktiṃ kumārikāṃ vālā pūjayet paṃcapaṃcakaṃ ||

kuryād daśāṣṭakaṃ vāpi kuladravyaiḥ samastakaiḥ |
trailokyanātho bhavati yaṃtrapūjanayogataḥ ||

bhūtaśuddhyādikaṃ kṛtvā kalpoktanyā samācaret |
niśāyāṃ śaktipūjāṃ ca dūtīyāgaṃ ca kaulikā ||

makāraiḥ paṃcabhiryuktaṃ careyurvāminorcanaṃ |
evaṃ dinatrayaṃ kṛtvā tato nityakramaṃ bhajet ||

sṛṣṭisthiti layatvena suṃdarī yaṃtrapūjanaṃ |
sṛṣṭisaṃhāramārgeṇa kālikā yaṃtrapūjanaṃ ||

sṛṣṭisaṃhāramārgeṇa tārācchinnā ca pītabhāḥ |
evaṃ devī pratiṣṭhāyāṃ kramaḥ sānnidhyakārakaḥ ||

strī śūdrāṇāṃ vāmināṃ ca kaulikānāmayaṃ vidhiḥ |
vidhiyuktaṃ prakartavyaṃ vidhihīnaṃ na kārayet ||

vidhihīnasya vighnāni yāni te kathayāmyahaṃ |
kalahodvegadvaṃdvaśca vyādhiśūlaṃ jvaraṃ tathā ||

rājopadravahāniśca dravyanāśaṃ rujaṃ tathā |
cihlākākāśca kākulyo śivo phetkāradāruṇā ||

kapotāśca gṛhe tasya āruhaṃti viśaṃti ca |
vighnaṃ kurvaṃti vai tasya vidhānaṃ gupta saṃsthitā ||

chidraṃti tasya yoginyo nānāvighnaiḥ pravādhyate |
sarpavṛścikalūtāśca kīṭāścaiva tu dāruṇāḥ ||

daśaṃti ca mahā ugrā preritāste marīcibhiḥ |
vṛṣaiścāśvairgajendraiśca meghairvajrāsanistathā ||

upadravaṃti duṣṭāśca jvaro bhūtādayastathā |
lūtāgardabhāpasmārā abhibhavaṃti nānyathā ||

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau 
yaṃtrakarmaṇādipūrvakapratiṣṭhāṃtanirṇayanāmonatriṃśattamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 29 
||  

atha mālāṃ pravakṣyāmi dvividhā sā sthirā calā |
sthirā tu sthiracittānāṃ caṃcalā calacetasāṃ ||

<p. 233b>

tat sādhanaṃ tridhā proktaṃ prathamā varṇamālike |
dvitīyā japamālā syāt tṛtīyāṃguḷimālikā ||

athācalamālāmāha ||

akārādi kṣakārāṃtairviṃdumanmātṛkākṣaraiḥ |
anuloma vilomasthai kḷptayā varṇamālayā ||

ekaikaṃ varṇamuccārya varṇanāṃtaritaṃ manuṃ |
sudhīrevaṃ lakārāṃtaṃ tata āṃtaṃ samānayet ||

kṣakāraṃ merurūpaṃ tu laṃghayenna kadācanā |
sakṛdevoccaretkṣantu tadaṃte noccarenmanuḥ ||

merūhīnā ca yā mālā merūhīnā ca yā bhavet |
aśuddhā ca bhavedatra sā mālāniḥ phalā bhavet ||

citriṇī vistaṃtvābhā brahmanāḍīgatā tu yā |
tayā saṃgrathitā dhyeyāṃ sarvakāma phalapradā ||

aṣṭottaraśate japtetvādau klīvaṃ samuccaret ||

ṛ ṝ ḷ ḹ varṇe catuṣṭāyaṃ klīvaṃ pracakṣate |
varṇānāmaṣṭamaṃ vāpi kāmyabheda krameṇa tu ||

a ka ca ṭa ta pa yadvā ityevaṃ cāṣṭavargakaṃ ||

kiṃ vā mṛta trayaṃ procya praṇavāṃte ca mātṛkā |
anuloma vilomātu tvaṣṭottaraśatī bhavet ||

māyā vākkāma śrīyogāt mātṛkā varṇa yogataḥ |
anuloma vilomābhyāṃ tvaṣṭottaraśatī bhavet ||

trayaṃ gurau trayaṃ devi gāṇape parikīrtitaṃ |
nyūnātirikte dvitayaṃ śeṣamiṣṭāyayo jayet ||

aṣṭottaraśatīmālā sarvakāryārthasiddhidā |
nātṛkā varṇarūpatvā prokteyaṃ sthiramālikā ||

akārādi kṣakārāṃtaṃ saiveyaṃ tvakṣamālikā |
mālā paṃcāśakā proktā sūtraśakti śivātmikā ||

grathanaṃ kuṇḍalī śaktirlaghāṃte merusaṃsthitaḥ |
etadguptataraṃ kuryādakṣa sūtra śivātmakam ||

prakaṭaṃ naiva kartavyaṃ na meruṃ laṃghayet kvacit |
suptakīlita saṃmudrāchinnavyā kīrṇayogataḥ ||

dhanairvairī vīryahīna kāṇakhaṃjādayopi ye |
tepi siddhā bhavaṃtyeva sthiramālā prabhāvataḥ ||

athāsyā dhyānam ||

aṃtarvidruma bhāsamānaṃ bhujagī suptotha varṇojvalāṃ ārohāmavarohikāṃ 
śatamayīṃ vargāṣṭakāṣṭottarāṃ |
sākṣād brahmamayīṃ kṣameruśikharāṃ śrīmātṛkākṣā valīṃ vidyāṃ 
naumisamastamaṃtrajananīṃ jñānaika dīpāṃkurāṃ ||

<p. 234a>

idānīṃ devatābhede mālābhede vadāmyahaṃ |
daṃtākṣamālā śrīkālyāṃ tārāyāṃ naraśaṃkhajā ||

chinnamastāvidhau śastā narāsthimālikā śubhā |
raktacaṃdana vījānāṃ mālāsyāt tripurā vidhau ||

svayaṃbhūmālikādevi bhairavyāṃ bālikā vidhau |
bhujāmālā tu mātaṃgyāṃ dhūmrāyāṃ kharadaṃtajā ||

haridrākṣā tu brahmāstre kapālākṣā tu māvidhau |
vālāyāṃ bhuvaneśvaryā sphāṭikī parikīrtitā ||

śvetaguṃjā siddhividyā vidhau proktā maheśvari |
śaṃkhamālā vaiṣṇave ca iṃdrākṣā śaktamātrake ||

bhadrākṣā śarabhe proktā gaṇeśa gajadaṃtajā |
tripuṭāyāṃ putrajīvī goviṃde tulasī matā ||

ratnasvarṇairaupyamayī tathā tāmramayī śive |
auḍuṃvaro vījamayī vaṭavījamayī tathā ||

pūgī phalamayī mālājātī phalamayī tathā |
madhumatyākarṣaṇārthe vīravidyā vidhāvapi ||

pūrvāmnāya sphāṭikajairdakṣiṇe rudranetrajaiḥ |
pravālairmauktikairdevi paścimāmnāya daivataiḥ ||

uttarāmnāya devānāṃ mahāśaṃkhākhyamālikā |
ūrddhvāmnāya svayaṃ bhūtthā pātāle ratnasaṃbhavā ||

pravālaiḥ sūryamaṃtre ca mauktikaiḥ śaktimātrake |
śivaśaktimayīmālā rudrākṣa sphaṭikairyutā ||

rudrākṣa svarṇasaṃyuktā mālā hariharātmikā |
rudrākṣaraupya saṃyuktā mālāvidhi śivātmikā ||

sarvamaṃtreṣu rudrākṣā śaktimaṃtredivā na hi ||

tathā ca ||

śivaśakti viyogatvānna rudrākṣairdivā japaḥ |
viyoge pūjitā kālī sahasā na prasīdati ||

rudrākṣaiḥ śaktimaṃtrastu divā yo japati priye |
sa durgati mavāpnoti japastasya nirarthakaḥ ||

iti śāpa purādattestatkathā kathyate śṛṇu |
kadācit samaye devi dakṣa yajñaḥ parāyaṇaḥ ||

sakalā ṛṣayo devāyakṣa vidyā dharoragāḥ |
putrī jāmātṛ saṃbaṃdhādgṛheṇākāritā ca tā ||

<p. 234b>

mahādevaḥ satyavatī tena nā kāritā kratau |
satī ca bhartṛ nikaṭe uktā tatra pragamyate ||

śiva uvāca ||

mamaivā kāraṇaṃ tena na kṛtaṃ prāṇavallabhe |
tava lajjā kathaṃ nāsti tvayā tatra pragamyate ||

priyo devaḥ priyaḥ prāṇāpriya eva hi bhūṣaṇaṃ |
māṃ vihāya kathaṃ devi tvayā tatra pragamyate ||

pātivratyamidaṃ kvāsti pratiyogāṃ vihīnataḥ |
tathāpi tava vāṃchā cet śīghraṃ gaṃtuṃ kṛpāṃ kuru ||

bharturājñāṃ gṛhītvā ca prasthitaṃ yāgamaṇḍape |
tat siṃhena kṣaṇānnītaṃ brahmaṇo yāgamaṇḍapaṃ ||

tena nādaritā kanyā duḥkhinā dīnamānasā |
adhomukhī sthitā tatra pārvatī rūpaśā vahan ||

sarve devāścātra saṃti madbhartā nātra dṛśyate |
mahadduḥkhaṃ mama kṛta me tāvad hṛdayasthitaṃ ||

etasminnaṃtaredevi dakṣaprajāpatiḥ svayaṃ |
śivaniṃdo paro bhūtvā punarnindārtha mudyataḥ ||

anācārita rūpo bhūdviṣṇunā vāritopi ca |
muhurnniṃdā paro bhūtvā bhaṃgī vṛṣa bhavāhanaḥ ||

śmaśānavāsī māṃsāśī nagno dhīrataro virāṭ |
kapālī ca triśūlī ca muṇḍamālā vibhūṣitaḥ ||

bhasmoddhūlita sarvāṃgo vyāghrājina samāsthitaḥ |
laṃpaṭo lolupaśceti vahuniṃdā paro bhavet ||

duḥkhitā niṃdayā tvaṃ hi maṇḍapādvahirāgatā |
dūre netrāṃtare gatvā vahni kuṇḍaṃ vidhāya ca ||

satītyaktvā tatra dehaṃ vahni rūpātvatāṃgatā |
śivohaṃ krodharūpeṇa jvālā bhāsvara maṇḍalaḥ ||

sat krodhena maheśāni bhasmībhūtaṃ jagattrayaṃ |
majvālayā samutpanno vīrabhadro mahāvibhuḥ ||

koṭikālāṃta dahano duḥsahaḥ sarvajaṃtuṣu |
dakṣaprajāpateryajñadhvaṃ sā nārthaṃ samudyataḥ ||

triśūla hastī krūraśca yajñadhvaṃ sa parāyaṇaḥ |
śavaddhapāṃ śivāṃ devi gṛhītvā skaṃdhagocarām ||

rodanaṃ cakratustasmāt patitāścā śrūviṃdavaḥ |
tatrā śrūvindavo jātāḥ mahārudrākṣa vṛkṣakāḥ ||

sthāvaratva manuprāpya martyānugrahakāraṇāt |
phalaṃti sarvakālaṃ hi avicchinna phalapradā ||

śrūyate tena rudrākṣaṃ triṣu lokeṣu viśrutaṃ |
netra trayā samutpannā dhanāśrīkaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

<p. 235a>

vāmanetrāt samutpanno moraṃgīyaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
dhanāśrī koṣṭhadaśa ca pārvatīya manurbhavet ||

ekaviṃśati vaktrāṃtaṃ malākī parikīrtitaḥ |
evaṃ vaktrāṇi jātāni rudrarodana saṃbhavāt ||

sphuṭavaktre pārvatīye pratiṣṭhā sphuṭameva ca |
dhanāśrīkeśarākāṃti rekhāyāṃ jāyate prabho ||

malākiye vahnināśastat kālaṃ jalamadhyataḥ |
jalopari samāyātī sa malākīrtitaḥ ||

tena yat kriyate karma tadanaṃtaphalaṃ bhavet |
anyamaṃtre siddhirūpā śaktimaṃtre divā na hi ||

iti kāraṇato devi rātrāveva japasmṛtaḥ |
rātriḥ saṃyogarūpāsyād vidyātvaṃ ca maheśvari ||

vidyogarūpo deveśo maṃtraśāstrai prakīrtitaḥ ||

atha rudrākṣa mahātmyaṃ varṇayāmi samāsataḥ |
rudrākṣa mokṣa kāmastu rudrākṣaṃ śreyasādhanaṃ ||

rudrākṣaṃ harate duḥkhaṃ rudrākṣaṃ pāpanāśanaṃ |
sarvapāpa kṣayakaraṃ paṭhato śṛṇvatāmapi ||

abhakto vāpi bhakto vā nīco nīcaṃtaropi vā |
rudrākṣaṃ dhārayedyastu mucyate sarvapātakaiḥ ||

rudrākṣadhāraṇaṃ puṇyaṃ kena vā sadṛśaṃ bhavet |
mahāvratamidaṃ prāhurmunayastatvadarśinaḥ ||

sahasraṃ dhārayedyastu rudrākṣāṇāṃ dhṛtavrataḥ |
tannamaṃti surāḥ sarve yathā rudrastathaiva saḥ ||

śiromālā tu ṣaṭtriṃśadvātriṃśat kaṃṭhamālikāḥ |
kūrpare ṣoḍaśa prokto dvātriṃśan maṇibaṃdhayoḥ ||

aṣṭottaraśatairyuktamupavītaṃ vidhīyate |
tadūrddha suraso mālā śikhāyāmeka ucyate ||

karṇayoścāpi ṣaṭsaṃkhyādhāraṇa kramamīritaṃ |
saṃkhyā hīnaṃ na kartavyaṃ adhikaṃ naiva duṣpati ||

rudrākṣāṃ dhārayennaiva dehāṃte sa śivo bhavet |
vahulaṃ labhate puṇyaṃ bhāgyavāniha jāyate ||

snāne dāne jape home vaiśvadeve surārcane |
prāyaścitte tathā srāddhe dīkṣākāle viśeṣataḥ ||

rudrādhārī bhūtvā ca yat kiṃcit karma vaidikaṃ |
yo vipraḥ satataṃ kuryāt tatkarma sa phalaṃ bhavet ||

khādanmāṃsaṃ pivanmadyaṃ saṃgacchannaṃtya jātiṣu |
sadyo bhavati pūtātmā rudrākṣaṃ mūrddhni dhārayan ||

devāṃ pūṣṇaṃti ye devāpaśavaste tu vaidikāḥ |
tāt pātayaṃti ye kaule teṣāṃ śāstā svayaṃ śivaḥ ||

teṣāṃ saṃrakṣaṇārthāya nānyo rudrākṣato bhuvi |
rudrākṣāḥ sarvadevānāṃ maṃtrasiddhi vidhāyakāḥ ||

rudrākṣaṃ kaṇṭhamāśritya śunako mriyate yadi |
sopi rudratvamāpnoti kiṃ punarmānuṣādayaḥ ||

<p. 235b>

ucchiṣṭho vā vikarmastho yukto vā sarvapātakaiḥ |
mucyate sarvapāpebhyo naro rudrākṣa dhāraṇāt ||

rudrākṣamālikāṃ kaṃṭhe dhārayan bhaktivarjitaḥ |
pāpakarmāpi yo nityaṃ rudraloke mahīyate ||

yo dhārayati rudrātmā rudravatsopi pūjyate |
muktā pravāla sphaṭikaraupya vaiḍūrya kāṃcanaiḥ ||

samastāddhārayedyastu rudrākṣāt sa śivo bhavet |
kevalān vāpi rudrākṣān yadyālasyā vibhartayaḥ ||

tanna spṛśaṃti pāpānitamāṃsīva vibhāvasuṃ |
rudrākṣamālayā japto maṃtronaṃta phalapradaḥ ||

arudro japataḥ puṃsāṃ tāvanmātrā phalapradaḥ |
yasyāṃge nāsti rudrākṣa ekopi vahu puṇyadaḥ ||

tasya janmanirarthaṃ syān tripuṇḍraṃ rahitasya ca |
rudrākṣaṃ mastake dhṛtvā śiraḥ snānaṃ karoti yaḥ ||

gaṃgāsnānaphalaṃ tasya jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
rudrākṣaṃ pūjyate yastu vinātoyābhi ṣecanaṃ ||

yatphalaṃ liṃgapūjāyāṃ tadavāpnoti niścitaṃ |
bhaktyā saṃpūjito nityaṃ rudrākṣaḥ śaṃkarātmakaḥ ||

daridraṃ cāpi kurute rājarāja samaśriyaṃ |
gaṃgāsnāna samaṃ puṇyaṃ darśanāt phalamāpnuyāt ||

lakṣakoṭi sahasrāṇi lakṣakoṭi śatāni ca |
rudrākṣadhāraṇādvāpi nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

ekavaktraḥ śivastasya mālayā japato haret |
brahmahatyādi pāpāni tathā rājyādikeṣṭadaḥ ||

ekavaktra samāyuktaṃ rudrākṣaṃ yasya tiṣṭhati |
sa sāmrājya mavāpnoti satyaṃjānāṃ hi pārvati ||

umāśaṃkaranāmākhyodvimukhoyaṃ vyapohati |
gohatyādika pāpāni grāhasthyādika saukhyadaḥ ||

trimukhastvagni rūpasyāt strīhatyādika pāpahā |
dharmārthakāmā siddhyaṃti dhāraṇāt tajjapādipe ||

caturmukho bhaved brahmā guruhatyādināśakaḥ |
sphuraṃti sakalā vidyā vāksiddhiścāpi jāyate ||

paṃcavaktra śivaḥ sākṣāt kālāgnirnāmanāmataḥ |
śaivagāṇeśa śāktānāṃ drutaṃ siddhistu tajjapāt ||

agamya gamanaṃ caiva abhakṣasyāpi bhakṣaṇaṃ |
mucyate pātakaṃ ghoraṃ paṃcavaktrasya dhāraṇāt ||

kārtikeyaistu ṣaḍvaktrai skhalate vrata pāpahā |
bhrūṇahatyādibhiḥ pāpairmucyate nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

<p. 236a>

vidhinā dakṣiṇe vāhau dhāraṇāt samare jayaḥ |
saptavaktro mahānāgonaṃto nāmātha tajjapāt ||

anaṃtāḥ siddhayassarya vibhīṣeścana jāyate |
suvarṇaiḥ subhagaścaiva daridropīśvaro bhavet ||

gurutalpādibhiḥ pāpairhatvā vahutarāṇyapi |
mucyate nātra saṃdeho rudrākṣasya tu dhāraṇāt ||

aṣṭavaktro gaṇeśasyāt sarvavighna nivārakaḥ |
naśyaṃti tajjapāt sarve kāmakrodhādi śatravaḥ ||

pṛṣṭhodarakareṇāpi saṃspṛśedvā gurustriyaṃ |
evamādīni pāpāni ati pāpāni sarvaśaḥ ||

vighnāstasya naśyaṃti mukto yāṃṭi parāṃ gatiṃ |
jīvedvarṣaśataṃ sāgraṃ mṛtyurnāsti sa śūlabhṛt ||

guṇāḥ hyeteṣu sarveṣu aṣṭavaktrasya dhāraṇāt |
nava vaktraṃ bhairavaḥ syāt kapilaṃ muktidaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

japo deva prasīdaṃti vāmamārgastha devatāḥ |
dhārayed vāmahaste ca mamatulya varo bhavet ||

lakṣakoṭi sahasrāṇi brahmahatyāṃ karoti yaḥ |
tatsarvaṃ dahate kṣipraṃ navavaktrasya dhāraṇāt ||

daśavaktro (******) (?) devo janārdana |
sahasraiva piśācādyā vetālā brahmarākṣasāḥ ||

ḍākinyo mātaraścaiva tathā vai pretanāyakāḥ |
pannagāśca vinaśyaṃti daśavaktrasya dhāraṇāt ||

vaktraikādaśa rudrākṣaṃ rudraikādaśakaṃ smṛtaṃ |
śikhāyāṃ dhārayannityaṃ tasya puṇyaphalaṃ śṛṇu ||

aśvamedha sahasrāṇi vājapeya śatāni ca |
gavāṃ śata sahasrasya samyagdattasya yatphalaṃ ||

sa tu tatphalamāpnoti rudraikādaśadhāraṇāt |
vaktra dvādaśarudrākṣaṃ bhāskaraṃ dvādaśātmakaṃ ||

dhārayet kaṇṭhadeśe ca japedvāpi samāhitaḥ |
tejasvī ca pratāpi ca āditya sadṛśo bhavet ||

na pīḍyate mahāghorairādityādi navagrahaiḥ |
durbhagāḥ subhagāyāṃti rogīrogāt pramucyate ||

gomedha narabhedhādi sarvakratu phalapradaḥ |
hastyaśva mṛgamārjārān mahiṣān śūkarādikān ||

śvānaṃ śṛṃgālaṣṭakalān vadhvā vahutarāṇyapi |
mucyate nātra saṃdeho dvādaśāditya dhāraṇāt ||

<p. 236b>

vaktraṃ trayodaśaṃ vatsa labdhvā tu yadi dhāraṇāt |
pūjyate satataṃ devaiḥ prāpyate puṇyamuttamaṃ ||

sarvaṃ phalamavāpnoti saubhāgyaṃ cottamaṃ bhavet |
rasaṃ rasāyaṇaṃ khaḍgaṃ dhāturvādamanekadhā ||

kāmadhenuśca rudrākṣaṃ icchāsiddhimavāpnuāt |
siddhyate tena rudrākṣaṃ bhāgyahīnopi yadyasau ||

mātā pitā tathā baṃdhu gurvādapī dahanyate ||

mucyate pātakairghoraistathānyai rūpapātakaiḥ |
puṇyaiścaturdaśaṃ vaktraṃ rudrākṣaṃ yadi labhyate ||

dhārayet tatprayatnena śikhā yajñopavītake |
cāmuṇḍā tu svayaṃ vatsa śaktipiṇḍaṃ śivasya tu ||

arcayitvā dhṛte kaṃthe na punarjāyatehyasau |
siddhyate nātra saṃdeho satyaṃ satyaṃ ca ṣaṇmukhaḥ ||

vicaren martyaloke sau prāsādaśca yathā tathā |
yogī ca dvicaret sarva sarveṣu ca priyo bhavet ||

paśuśca puruṣo cāpi nagaraṃ cā pavitrakaṃ |
rasaṃ rasāyaṇaṃ caiva jarāmṛtyu vināśanaṃ ||

labhedvetālakhaḍgaṃ ca aṣṭasiddhiṃ mahādbhutaṃ |
na puṇya na ca pāpaṃ ca navyādhirna prapīḍitaṃ ||

jīvedvarṣa sahasrāṇi mṛte bhavati śūladhṛk |
aprārthitāllabhedarthānna cārthasya kṣayo bhavet ||

mucyate sarvapāpebhyo jñānī yajña bhavet phalaṃ |
caturdaśamukhairjaptaṃ tadānaṃtyāya jāyate ||

pūjyate deva manujairakṣayā labhate gatiṃ |
yathā hariśca deveṣu sa dehaḥ kṣemamartakaḥ ||

raviryathā grahāṇāṃ ca munīnāṃ kaśyapo yathā |
nadīnāṃ jāhnavī yadvattīrtheṣu ca yathodadhiḥ ||

āyudhānāṃ dhanuryadvaddhutānāṃ ca caturdaśī |
kumārāṇīṃstathā skaṃdo devānāṃ ca maheśvaraḥ ||

devīnāṃ ca umādevī airāvata gajeśvaraḥ |
dhenūnāṃ ca sunaṃdā vai aśvānāṃ haritastathā ||

evaṃ gaṇyeṣu sarveṣu rudrākṣastu viśiṣyate ||

ṣaṇmukhaṃ śirasādhāryaṃ trimukaṃ kaṃthake smṛtaṃ |
paṃcavaktraṃ mataṃ vāhau caturvaktraṃ kare śubhaṃ ||

dvimukhaṃ dhārayet kaṭhyāṃ ekavaktraṃ ca mūrddhani |
navavaktraṃ ca rudrākṣaṃ dhārayed vāmavāhunā ||

carurdaśamukhaṃ caiva śikhāyāṃ dhārayedbudhaḥ |
rudrākṣāṃ dhārayed vipra saṃdhyādiṣu ca karmasu ||

<p. 237a>

tatsarvaṃ saphalaṃ proktaṃ lakṣakoṭiguṇaṃ dhruvaṃ |
liṃgadarśanavat puṇyaṃ bhaved rudrākṣadarśanāt ||

tannu koṭiśataṃ puṇyaṃ labhate dhāraṇānnaraḥ |
śirasā dhārayet koṭiḥ karṇayordaśakoṭayaḥ ||

gale vadhvā koṭiśataṃ mūrddhni koṭi sahasrakaṃ |
ayutaṃ copavītaṃ ca lakṣakoṭi bhujadvaye ||

aprameyaṃ phalaṃ haste sa rudrākṣadharo bhavet ||

niśchidrāścaiva pakvaśca rudrākṣā dhāraṇe smṛtā |
parīkṣā tatra kartavyo rudrākṣasya tu ṣaṇmukha ||

supakvaṃ sudṛḍhaṃ caiva suvedhaṃ susamaṃ smṛtaṃ |
niśchidraṃ nirvraṇaṃ vai kalpokta phalastayakaṃ ||

pāṇḍaraṃ cādhamaṃ jñeyaṃ madhyamaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇakaṃ |
uttamaṃ raktavarṇaṃ tu sarvasiddhi pradāyakaṃ ||

vaktraṃ ca khaṇḍitaṃ caiva chidraścaiva viśeṣataḥ |
kiṃcit kiṃcid bhaved vatsa phalaṃ doṣeṇa hanyate ||

phalaṃ pratyeka meteṣāṃ madhunātvaṃ niśāmaya |
daṃtākhyamālayādevi ṣaṣṭiḥ siddhīśvaro bhavet ||

akasmādīpsitā siddhirmahāśaṃkhākhyamālayā |
racitā cāsthi maṇibhiḥ sarvaśatru vināśinī ||

raktacaṃdanajā mālābhoga mokṣapradāmatā |
svayaṃbhū kusumairdevi sarvavidyeśvaro bhavet ||

guṃjayā mohanaṃ proktaṃ kharadaṃtai ripukṣayaḥ |
hāridryāstaṃbhanaṃ sastaṃ padmākṣaiḥ puṣṭiruttamā ||

vāksiddhiḥ sphāṭikīyā syāt sarvakāmaphalapradā |
dhanārthaṃ śvetaguṃjāyā kīrtiḥ śrīśaṃkhajāmatā ||

indrākṣai rājyadā proktā bhadrākṣairbhogasaṃpadāṃ |
gajadaṃtasya sarvārthaṃ siddhirbhavati sarvadā ||

dhanadhānyasutaḥ prāptirbhavedvai putrajīvakaiḥ |
tulasyā mokṣamāpnoti ratnairbhogāśca yacchati ||

sauvarṇe rājyalakṣmīḥ syā sarva saukhye tu raupyajā |
aṃgulī parvabhiḥ sarvasiddhirājyaṃ sa viṃdati ||

auduṃvarairbhūtanāśoplakṣairdāridranāśane |
vaṭavījairyakṣiṇī syāt kapardībhirmahodayaḥ ||

pravālairvaśyasiddhiḥ syānmauktikāmauktidāmapi |
kilviṣaugha kṣayakarī kuśagraṃthi vinirmitā ||

vidrumotthāvaśyakarā mohane tāmrajāmatā |
kucaṃdanaiḥ samākarṣād vidveṣoriṣṭamālayā ||

<p. 237b>

maricaihlāsine mālāpivumardairvināśanaṃ |
arkasyoccāṭanaścaiva māraṇe cāyasīmatā ||

jvalahartrī tu lākṣāyāḥ khaḍgasya pitṛ tṛpti kṛt |
viṣottāre caṃdanotthāśāṃti kṛcchre tathāṣṭajā ||

padmakāṣṭhodbhavāpuṣpai devadārudbhavairviruk |
kṛṣṇakāṣṭha samudbhūtaistāmasaṃ karmasiddhyati ||

bhūta staṃbhenivajātā janastaṃbhe samīsavā |
mahāniṃvena ḍākinyā bhūniṃvai staṃbhanaṃ rujāṃ ||

iṃdrā vṛkṣādvraṇastaṃbhobhicāro vā narāsthitaḥ |
ṛkṣāsthito vanyasiddhiḥ śārdūlā tasya devatā ||

narāsthyā rākṣasāvaśyā vīrāvaśyā hayāsthibhiḥ |
rāśabhasthyā kṣudrasiddhirmānyatā bhujagāsthibhiḥ ||

mṛttikābhṛṣṭa maṇijāmālā śāvarasiddhidā |
śrīphalairjñānamāpnoti rudrākṣaiḥ sarvasiddhidā ||

athātodyathanaṃ vakṣye mālānāṃ tatra vodhanaṃ |
caturthyāṃ protayenmālāṃ gaṇanāthasya maṃtrakaiḥ ||

madhyāhnārkasya saptamyāṃ ravau vā tasya maṃtrakaiḥ |
dvādaśyāṃ vaiṣṇavī mālā protavyā viṣṇumaṃtrataḥ ||

trayodaśyāṃ tu saṃdhyāyāṃ tanmaṃtraiḥ śivamālikāṃ |
aṣṭamyāṃ vā caturdaśyānnavamyāṃ bhūminaṃdane ||

śaktīnāmapi kartavyā bhuktvā rātrau yathā vidhiḥ |
yena maṃtreṇayā mālā kṛtā taṃtu japet tayā ||

anya maṃtra japācchāpo devatāyāḥ prajāyate ||

athavā mātṛkābhiśca grathanaṃ kārayet priye |
paṃcāśanmaṇibhirmālākṣakāro merusaṃjñakaḥ ||

anuloma vilomena mālā śatamayī bhavet |
aṣṭavarge prakalpyātha mālātvaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ ||

mātṛkāmālayā jāpaḥ sarvamaṃtre praśasyate |
sarvasiddhimayī mālā druta siddhikarī parā ||

tattanmaṃtramayī devī tatra dhyātvā tu yat kṣaṇe |
japaṃ kuryāt prayatnena nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

sarvasiddhipradā mālā sarvakāryakarī parā ||

dhruveṇa prathamaṃ kāryaṃ pratyekaṃ maṇika kramāt |
sarvamaṃtramayī mālā sarvasiddhikarī parā ||

tanmaṃtradevatā rūpaṃ dhyātvā tu mālikāṃtaraṃ |
sarve maṃtrāḥ prajaptavyāḥ sarvakāryārtha siddhaye ||

<p. 238a>

śaktimaṃtreṇa saṃgrathya śivamaṃtraṃ japecchive |
śivamaṃtreṇa saṃgrathya śaktimaṃtraṃ japecchive ||

śivaśaktyora bhedena mālākāryakarī parā ||

yenaiva grathyate devi tameva prajapenmanuṃ |
ityādyuktaṃ tvayā pūrva kiṃ tvayā vismṛtaṃ prabho ||

idānīmanyathā proktaṃ saṃśayosti mama prabho |
mātṛkā tārabhinnāni śivaśakti vihīnake ||

mātṛkāyāmidaṃ noktaṃ anyamālāvidhau mataṃ |
anyaprakāra grathameye naiva grathanaṃ caret ||

tameva prajapanmaṃtraṃ nānyatra japecchive |
mātṛkādāvapi śive mālāṃ tanmaṃtrarūpiṇī ||

grathitā paṭṭasūtreṇa devyāḥ prityai tu mālikā |
kārvyāsairvaiṣṇavī mālā padmasūtrairathāpi vā ||

ūrṇābhirvā valkalairvā śaivī kāryā sa sūtrajāḥ |
kāryā sa dharmakarmādi sādhanaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ ||

prāyaśaḥ sarvadevānāṃ sūtrotpatī vidhiṃ śṛṇu |
sūtraṃ dvijeṃdra puṇyastrī nirmitaṃ graṃthivarjitaṃ ||

yā jīvavatsakā nārī suṃdarī pativallabhā |
tayākartita sūtraṃ ca kumārī kartitaṃ ca vā ||

śvetarakta suvarṇābha kṛṣṇavarṇā dvijāditaḥ |
sarveṣāmeva varṇānāṃ rakta sarvepsita pradaṃ ||

triguṇaṃ triguṇī kṛtya grāhyaṃ prakṣālya yatnataḥ |
maru sūtreṇa paṭṭeṇatra sareṇu vinirmitā ||

nirmitā svarṇarajataiḥ svarṇenāpi śubhā matā ||

hāridraṃ sarvathā sūtraṃ grāmakāryā sa saṃbhavaṃ |
caitra kāryāsajaṃ cātha tyajedgrathanakarmaṇi ||

guruṇā grathitā śreṣṭhā svayaṃ kḷptā tatā'varā |
śaktyā ca grathitā śreṣṭā na śūdrādibhirīśvari ||

eteṣu brāhmaṇaḥ śreṣṭho jalamālā kṛte bhṛśaṃ |
alābhe tu dvijātīnāmapi vā sva sva jātayaḥ ||

kalau tu durlabhā viprā yathā viprā svadharmagā ||

athāsyāḥ śodhanaṃ vakṣye samāsāt parameśvarī |
kulamārgānu sāreṇa smṛtyuktavidhināpi vā ||

kṛta nityakriyaḥ śuddha ukteṣṭhekṣeṣvataṃdriyaḥ |
upavāsaṃ haviṣyaṃ vā tathaika bhakṣameva vā ||

<p. 238b>

vidhāya paṭṭakāryā saḥ śṛtaiḥ sūtraṃ vinirmamet |
upavāsadine devi tāni sarvāṇi pūjayet ||

dviguṇaṃ triguṇaṃ vāpi tṛccatriguṇamācaret |
caṃdanākṣatadhūpādyaiḥ kusumairvalidīpakaiḥ ||

kartavyāṇi samāsāni na sthūlāni kṛśāni ca |
prātastatsūtramādāya kāmanā kāryabhedataḥ ||

śvetaṃ nīlaṃ tathā pītaṃ raktaṃ varṇaṃ ca kārayet ||

rudrākṣa sphāṭikādīnvai samānīya prayatnataḥ |
ekavaktrairdvivaktraiśca caturvaktraiśca paṃcabhiḥ ||

ṣaḍvaktrairvātha kartavyāmitho miśrāstu varjayet |
mukhe mukhaṃ tu kartavyaṃ mukhe mūlaṃ tu varjayet ||

mukhaṃ mukhena saṃyojya pṛṣṭhaṃ pṛṣṭeṇa yojayet |
rudrākṣasyonnataṃ proktaṃ mukhaṃ pucchaṃtu nimnakaṃ ||

dhātṛphalopamaṃ śreṣṭho madhyā vadarasannibhaḥ |
adhamaśca na kābhaḥ syāt tato hīno vipattikṛt ||

atisthūloti sukṣmaśca sphaṭiko bhaṃguro laghuḥ |
bhinnaḥ purādhṛto jīrṇo rudrākṣo na śubhaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

na jīrṇāni na kīṭādi viddhāni sunavāni ca |
ādyaṃ sthūlaṃ tatastasmānyūnaṃ nyūnataraṃ tataḥ ||

eko merustatradeyaḥ sarvebhyaḥ sthūla saṃbhavaḥ |
asyorddha vaktrayānīyānmerostaṃ naiva laṃghayet ||

maṇimekaikamādāya sūtre saṃpātayet sudhīḥ |
sarpākārātha vā kāryā gopuccha sadṛśī tathā ||

ekaikaṃ maṇimadhye tu brahmagraṃthiṃ vikalpayet |
trirāvṛttyātha madhyena cārddha vṛttyāṃ tadeśataḥ ||

graṃthi pradakṣiṇāvartā brahmagraṃthiritīritā ||

athavā graṃthirahitā dṛḍha rajjuḥ samanvitāḥ |
dṛḍhasūtraṃ niyuṃjīta japetrudyatino yathā ||

aṣṭottaraśataiḥ sarvasiddhiruktā manīṣibhiḥ |
paścāśadbhiḥ kāmyasiddhiḥ syāt tathā caturuttaraiḥ ||

sarvārthaḥ saptaviṃśatyā paṃcadaśyābhicārake |
paṃcaviṃśatibhirmokṣaṃ triṃśaḍbhirddhana siddhaye ||

evaṃ nirmāya vai mālāṃ pratiṣṭhāmācaredvudhaḥ |
apratiṣṭhābhirmālābhirmaṃtraṃ japati yo naraḥ ||

sarvaṃ te niṣphalaṃ vidyāt kruddhā bhavati devatā ||

<p. 239a>

atha sāmānya mālāyāḥ saṃskāraṃ pravadāmite ||

tāṃtrikaṃ vaidikaṃ vāpi sadyo jātāhvayaṃ manuṃ |
paṭhitvā paṃcagavyena snāpayenmālikāṃ puraḥ ||

gomūtraṃ gomayaṃ kṣīraṃ dadhisarpiḥ kuśodakaṃ |
paṃcagavyamiti proktaṃ mahāpātakanāśanaṃ ||

dugdhaṃ kāṃcana varṇāyāḥ śvetāyāścaiva gomayaṃ |
gomūtraṃ tāmravarṇā yā nīlāyāśca bhaved dadhi ||

ghṛtaṃ tu kṛṣṇavarṇāyā evaṃ paṃcāmṛtepi ca |
gavāṃ varṇāstu sulabhāḥ saṃti deśeṣu tatra ca ||

tatra varṇavibhāgena paṃcagavyāni cāharet |
varṇā lābhena doṣosti mātrā hīnastu varjayet ||

go śakṛt dviguṇaṃ mūtraṃ sarpidadyāccaturguṇaṃ |
kṣīramaṣṭaguṇaṃ proktaṃ paṃcagavyaṃ tathā dadhi ||

athavā paṃcagavyānāṃ samāno bhāga ucyate |
gāyatryādāya gomūtraṃ gaṃdhadvāreti gomayaṃ ||

āpyāyasveti ca kṣīraṃ dadhikrāma tato dadhiḥ |
tejosi śukramityājyaṃ devasyatvā kuśodakaṃ ||

kṣālayet paṃcagavyādyaiḥ sadyo jāteti maṃtrataḥ |
caṃdanā guru gaṃdhādyairvāma devena gharṣayet ||

dhūpayedapyaghoreṇa kṛṣṇā guru su guggulaiḥ |
tat puruṣākhya maṃtreṇa lepayeccaṃdanādibhiḥ ||

īśānaḥ sarvamiti ca pratyekaṃ maṃtrayecchataṃ |
tenaiva maṃtrayen merumaghoreṇa ca maṃtrayet ||

prāṇapratiṣṭhā me tasyāṃ viśvarūpeṇa cācaret |
evaṃ saṃskṛtya mālāṃ tāṃ guruhaste samarpayet ||

abhivādya guruṃ mūrddhnā gṛhnīyāt tatkarān svayaṃ |
etanmaṃtrasya gāyatrīṃ puraḥ paṃcaśataṃ japet ||

tato japenmūlamaṃtramitye tasya viśeṣataḥ ||

athānyamālā saṃskāraṃ vakṣye'śvatthasya patrakaiḥ |
padmākāreṇa navabhiḥ sthāpitaistatra vinyaset ||

maṇiṃ sūtraṃ ca gaṃdhādyai kṣālayitvātha maṃtrayet ||

oṃ hrīṃ pūrvamātṛkāvarṇaiḥ kramādekaikaśomaṇiṃ |
sūtraṃ ca tatra vinyasya pūjayitvā hunet tataḥ ||

tilājyaiḥ kevalājyairvā sadyojātābhiḥ pṛthak |
paṃcamaṃtraiḥ śataṃ cāṣṭāvaṣṭā viṃśatireva vā ||

homābhāve japaḥ proktaḥ pūrvavat kṣālanādikaṃ |
kaulikādau viśeṣoyaṃ surayāmaṇi tarpaṇaṃ ||

<p. 239b>

saṃskṛtyaivaṃ budhomālāṃ tatprāṇāṃstatra sthāpayet |
mūlamaṃtreṇa deveśi saṃpūjye bhaktibhāvataḥ ||

guruṃ saṃpūjya taddhastād gṛhnīyād dakṣamālikāṃ |
śūdrārthaṃ ca striyāmarthe mālā saṃskāra ucyate ||

gaṇeśa sūrya viṣṇvīśa durgāḥ saṃpūjya bhaktitaḥ |
mālāyāmatha tāṃ mālāṃ hasauṃ vījenābhi maṃtritām ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ paṃcagavye tāṃ sthāpayet tryahaṃ |
caturthe tu samuddhṛtya kṣālayedastra maṃtrataḥ ||

hṛnmaṃtreṇa graṃthayitvā sthaṇḍile tāṃnnidhāpayet |
tatastu tolyatāṃ mālāṃ sthāpayeddhemapātrake ||

paṃcāmṛtena saṃsnāpya śītalena jalena ca |
caṃdanena sugaṃdhena kastūrī kuṃkumādibhiḥ ||

abhiṣekaṃ tataḥ kuryāt hyauṃ maṃtreṇa sādhakaḥ |
navagrahān pūjayi dikpālāṃścāpi pūjayet ||

tilenāmṛte yuktena śaktito homayettata |
svarṇaṃ tu dakṣiṇāṃ dadyād gurave maṇisaṃkhyakān ||

tanmaṃtrajāpino viprān bhojayedvātha vaidikān |
oṃ bhāve svarṇapātrasya grāhyamaśvattha patrakaṃ ||

mālāsaṃskāra ityuktvo japaḥ syāt siddhidāyakaḥ ||

athā paraṃ pravakṣyāmi mālā saṃskāra ucyate |
varṇamānena sā kāryā paṃcagavye tryahaṃ kṣipet ||

sūtraṃ vāpi caturthehni kṣālayedastra maṃtrakaiḥ |
samānavarṇa sūtreṇa grathayeddhṛdayānunā ||

suvarṇādi guṇairvāpi grathayet sādhakottamaḥ |
brahmagraṃthiṃ tato dadyān nāgapāśamathāpi vā ||

sārddhaṃ graṃthidvayaṃ devi nāgapāśaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
sārddhagraṃthi trayaṃ devi brahmagraṃthi prakīrtitaḥ ||

brahmagraṃthyā sarvakarma sādhayet parameśvari |
nāgapāśe krūrakarmadvaividhyaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||

kavacena ca grathnīān mālā dhyānaparāyaṇaḥ |
sarvaśeṣe tato meru sūtradvayasamanvitaṃ ||

grathayettāra yogena vadhnīyāt sādhakottamaḥ |
evaṃ niṣpādya deveśi pratiṣṭhāṃ ca samācaret ||

sthaṇḍile maṇḍale kṛtvā yathā bhāga vidhiḥ kramāt |
pūjayitvā yathānyāyamiṣṭa deva manukramāt ||

<p. 240a>

nyāsapūrvaṃ japenmaṃtramaṣṭottara sahasrakaṃ |
juhuyācca taddaśāṃśena yasya devasya yatpriyaṃ ||

tato maṇḍala madhye tu tāṃ mālāṃ sthāpayebudhaḥ |
astramaṃtraṃ tu tonyasya devavat pariciṃtayet ||

advaitarūpamāsādya mālāṃ kuryāt tathātmikāṃ |
tato valiṃ yathā nyāyaṃ dadyāttaiḥ sādhakottamaiḥ ||

evaṃ pratiṣṭhāmāsādya mālāyāmiṣṭa devatāṃ |
ācāryaṃ pūjayen maṃtrī śilpinaṃ ca yathāvidhi ||

nānyamaṃtraṃ japet tatra yadīcchet siddhimātmanaḥ ||

atha mālāvidhānaṃ ca kaulikānāṃ ca vāmināṃ |
kīkasādika mālānāṃ kathyate śṛṇu pārvatī ||

tatrāpi kālikāttārā vidyāyāṃ śavasaṃbhavā |
mālā vahu vidhā proktā mahāśaṃkhādi bhedataḥ ||

mahāśaṃkhamayī mālā sarvavidyā svarūpiṇī |
daṃtākhya mālikā devī merustu rājadaṃ tataḥ ||

śaivī brahmāṇḍamālā ca dehadehāṃtarācayaḥ |
karāsthi mālikā devi tathā yat parvamālikā ||

jaṃghāsthi kīlakāryepi mālāyāmapi siddhikṛt ||

atha govājibhaṣaṇamṛgavā naraśūkaraiḥ |
bhallūkolūka śārdūla vyāghravāraṇadaṃtajāḥ ||

gavayādi mṛgotthā ca kastūrī mṛgajātijā |
jīvamātrāsthi saṃbhūtā kharoṣṭravāji daṃtajāḥ ||

daṃtā bhāve pratinidhirmahāśaṃkhe navīnakaṃ |
viśvāmitra bhavaṃ tacca sarvasatvamayaṃ bhavet ||

śaṃkhamālā daṃtamālā nārikelamayī tathā |
asthimālā maheśāni vṛddhastrī gomayaṃ vinā ||

mālā tu trividhā proktā uttamādhama madhyamāḥ |
daṃtākhya mālayā caiva rājadaṃtena meruṇā ||

uttamā mālikā proktā kālikā karṣiṇī parā |
karṇanetrāṃtarastho yo mahāśaṃkheti kīrtitaḥ ||

mahāśaṃkhamayī mālā paṃcāśanmaṇi nirmitā |
madhyamā mālikā proktā tārā jāpe prakīrtitā ||

asthibhirvānṛmuṃḍairvā kiṃ vā naralalāṭajā |
dehadehāṃtarasthairvā mālā proktā kaniṣṭhikā ||

chinnā devyā vidhau devī evaṃ hi trividhā matā |
saṃmukhau yau ubhau daṃtau rājadaṃtau prakīrtitau ||

<p. 240b>

karālāsyā mahākālyā dānavāḥ bhakṣitā purā |
trailokyagāminau daṃtau rājadaṃtāviti smṛtau ||

rājadaṃteti saṃjñā vai devyāḥ pūrvakṛtā priye |
yo daitya carvakau daṃtau mama kārya kārāvubhau ||

tasmāt prītena manasā merukārya niyojitau ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

sāmānya mālā kathitā viśeṣavada śaṃkara ||

śrīśiva uvāca ||

caṃdramaṇḍalamārabhya karṇāṃtaṃ parameśvari |
vāmadakṣa yugmake ca mālāsyān merumaṇḍalā ||

merumaṇḍala mālā tu sarvasiddhiḥ parāṃvike |
dvitīyā sārddhayavakairmālā sāmrājyamohinī ||

eka paṃktiraṃdhra saṃkhyaiḥ kapālaṃ parikīrtitaṃ |
karṇanetrāṃtarastho yo mahāśaṃkhaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

mahāśaṃkhamayī mālā sarvasiddhi pradāyinī |
karṇanetragalaprāṃtedaṃtāṃtaṃ parameśvari ||

muṇḍaṃ proktaṃ maheśāni pūjāsādhana karmaṇi |
dakṣabhrūviṃdumārabhya karṇāṃtaṃ parameśvari ||

vāmabhrūviṃdumārabhya vāmaśrutyaṃgaḥ śive |
mālā tripuṇḍra mārgeṇa śivaśaktimayī ca vā ||

arddha tripuṇḍra mārgeṇa tadadhaḥ śaktimālavat |
ūrddhvakrameṇa mālā tu sarvamālottamottamā ||

keśakrameṇa deveśi kapālorddhantu mālikā |
tathaiva maṇayaḥ kāryā śiva eva na cāparaḥ ||

mahāśaṃkhamayī mālā dvitīyā dhruvamaṇḍalā |
unmanī mālikā devī tṛtīyā parikīrtitā ||

merumālā caturthī syāt paṃcamī merumaṇḍalā |
daṃtamālā maheśāni merumaṇḍalamālikā ||

rājadaṃtena merustu tena sānmerumaṇḍalā |
mālā paṃcaka metadvipaṃcatanmātragocaraṃ ||

rājadaṃta dvayaṃ meruniyojya paṃktimārgataḥ |
ūrddhvamūrddhva krameṇaiva daṃṣṭrā daṃṣṭrā karaṃ śive ||

adharoṣṭha lasatpaṃktihāranāyakaṃ vrajet |
rājadaṃtastu merustu kṛśāścaturdaśatyajet ||

evaṃ mālā mahāmālā paṃcāśad daṃtagocarā |
sarvasiddhimayī mālā rājataṃtena meruṇā ||

siddhidā yogadā bhogadā trīrājyaṃ pradātuthā |
catuḥṣaṣṭhiḥ siddhimate mālā tu paṃcamī smṛtā ||

<p. 241a>

brahmāviṣṇuścarudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaṃ |
ete paṃcamahāpretāḥ paṃcamālāmvikāvidhau ||

tārāchinnā tathā kāmakalā kālī ca kālikā |
śrīvidyādāvapi śive mālikā mālikāmayī ||

pūrvoktānāṃ maṇīnāṃ ca svabhāve parameśvarī |
gaṃdharūpāśca maṇayo daṃta sphāṭika sannibhāḥ ||

maṇayo yatnataḥ kāryā sarvasiddhimabhīpsubhiḥ |
mahāśaṃkhepya śaktaścet sphāṭikyā mālayā japet ||

atha mahāmālādhikāriṇamāha ||

sarvāsthimālā saṃśastā adhikāra kramaṃ śṛṇu |
pūrṇārddhāmnāya bhūṣāḍhyastathā caraṇadīkṣitaḥ ||

ṣaḍanvaya kramāśaktaḥ śrīmedhā saṃyutastathā |
mahācīnakramāśakto mahānīlakramī ca vā ||

īdṛgvidhaḥ sādhako hi mālā japa parāyaṇaḥ |
mālādhikāriṇaḥ proktāḥ krameṇa parameśvari ||

rahasyamālārthamuṇḍā dānavidhistu sādhāraṇapūjāprakaraṇeṣuktaḥ ||

atha nirmāṇaprakārastūcyate ||

siddhamuṇḍaṃ purā kṛtvā mālādīn kārayet priye |
śilpinaṃ pūjayedādau vastra gaṃdhānulepanaiḥ ||

saṃhṛṣṭa kārayen mālāṃ maṃtra pūtaṃ pivanmadhuḥ |
yathāyogyaṃ vedhavatī mālāṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

daṃtamālā śaṃkhamālā viśvāmitra kapālajā |
sarvāsthi mālā deveśi jīvamātrāsthi nirmitā ||

aṃguṣṭān mastakāṃtaṃ ca uttarottarataḥ śubhaḥ |
tatra devī sadā tuṣṭā tatra tiṣṭhati pārvatī ||

etadvidyā vidhau devi pūrvokte ca varāsthi ca |
paṃcāśanmaṇibhirmālā mātṛkā varṇataḥ kramāt ||

aṣṭottaraśatī cetsā tadāṣṭa varga kalpanaṃ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ kṛtvā ṛtubhatyā bhage kṣipet ||

niśāmekāṃ samuddhṛtya kāraṇaiḥ kṣālayet tataḥ |
śuddhodairmūlamaṃtreṇābhiṣiṃced vijayārasaiḥ ||

prakṣālya dhūpayet paścāt protayediṣṭa sūtrakaiḥ ||

nāḍyā saṃgrathanaṃ kāryaṃ raktena vāsasā priye |
vāsasā majjayā vāpi nāḍībhirvā śubhāmatā ||

svayaṃbhuvāktāyā nāḍī sā nāḍī sarvatottamāḥ |
svayaṃbhū kusumāktaistutūlakairvīranāyikā ||

<p. 241b>

kumārī kartitaṃ sūtraṃ puṇya strī kartitaṃ ca vā |
tato dvijeṃdra puṇya strī kartitaṃ graṃthi varjitaṃ ||

veśyā hastabhavaṃ vāpi mātaṃgī hastajaṃ paraṃ |
rajasvalā hastabhavaṃ sūtraṃ ca kīrtitaṃ śubhaṃ ||

kuṇḍāktaṃ cai golāktaṃ svajaṃ vāktaṃ tathaiva ca |
svayaṃbhuvāktaṃ yat sūtraṃ tat sūtraṃ sarvatottamaṃ ||

sūtraṃ sveṣṭajapennīlaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ māraṇa karmaṇi |
mohane haritaṃ staṃbhaṃ dhūmābhaṃ dviṣinālabhaṃ ||

śāṃtau pauṣṭau sitaṃ dveṣe raktamuccāṭane bhavet |
vaśye pītaṃ kaṣāyastu vipakṣakaraṇe mataṃ ||

svayaṃ na kartayedgraṃthiṃ japamālā na guṃphayet ||

atha mālā grathinādhikāriṇamāha ||

mahāmālā daṃtamālā sarvāsthimālikāvidhau |
krameṇa kathyate devi grathane cādhikāriṇaḥ ||

mātā putrī tathā bhāryā tathāṣṭakanyakā priye |
ṣaṭtriṃśajjātijāstrīyā svakulāṣṭakajāya vā ||

tārā kulākulaṃ vāpi daśavidyāstriyaiścayāḥ |
paṃcāśat pīṭhajā vā piveśyā saptakameva vā ||

mālāyā grathane devi śakunāśakunaṃ śṛṇu |
dadhimāṃsasurāpiṣṭa śaṃkhavāditriveṇavaḥ ||

mṛdaṃgakāhalodgītaṃ duṃdubhirvādyadarśanaṃ |
gajāśvarathaveśyādi strīṇāṃ pūrṇaghaṭasya vā ||

japasiddherlakṣaṇāni mālāyāṃ parameśvarī |
rodanaṃ gānanaṃ muṇḍaraṇḍā darśanameva ca ||

kalaho guruniṃdā ca devatā vīraniṃdanaṃ |
sūtra truṭirathā prāptirmaṇikāsphoṭanaṃ tathā ||

mālāgrathana kāle tu maṇisphuṭati vedyadi |
putraśoko vinirddiṣṭo duḥkhabhāgī bhaveddhruvaṃ ||

mālāgrathanakāle tu maṇiskhalati cedbhuvi |
tasya śoko vinirdiṣṭo nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

maṇimādāya sūtreṇa grathayen madhyamadhyataḥ |
brahmagraṃthi vidhāyetthaṃ meruśca graṃthi saṃyutaṃ ||

grathayitvā puro mālāṃ tataḥ saṃskāramārabhet ||

siddhyai vakṣyāmi saṃskāraṃ sarvataṃtreṣu gopitaṃ |
kṛta nityakriyaḥ śuddhaḥ śuddharkṣeṣu ca maṃtravit ||

cakrapūjāṃ tataḥ kṛtvā sāṣṭottara sahasrakaṃ |
hunenmadya palābhyāṃ ca mūlamaṃtreṇa sādhakaḥ ||

<p. 242a>

tato valiṃ yathā nyāyaṃ mahiṣādeḥ pradāpayet |
śaktiṃśca sādhakāṃścāpi bhojayen maṇisaṃkhyakān ||

ataḥ paraṃ pṛthak rūpo mālā saṃskāramācaret |
mālārātrividhiṃ vakṣye śṛṇu sā vahitā bhava ||

sudine śubha ṛkṣādi dine śuddhadine śubhe |
mahāmālāṃ samādāya vīrapātraṃ samānayet ||

vīrayaṃtraṃ samāsādya vīramālaṃ ca śodhayet |
devīṃ sāvaraṇāṃ pūjya savalyaṃtaṃ maheśvarī ||

daśaviṃśatyaṃ ca viṃśaddīpāṃ datvā valiṃ caret |
evaṃ mālāṃ śubhāṃ kṛtvā mahāsaṃskāramācaret ||

śubhe muhūrte saṃlagne mālāṃ vā paṃcagavyake |
nimaṃtrya paṃcagavyaṃ ca gomūtraṃ gomayaṃ punaḥ ||

dadhisarpiḥ krameṇaiva paṃcagavyaṃ prakīrtitaṃ |
taduttārya śuddhajalaiḥ saṃkṣālya saṃvidā śavaiḥ ||

mūlamaṃtreṇa saṃkṣālya taddravye sthāpayeddinaṃ |
tṛtīye dinase devi yakṣa karddamakairyajet ||

sarvagaṃdhairaṣṭagaṃdhairaṇimādyaṣṭakairyajet |
aṣṭanīrāśca tārāyāstārāṣṭaurocinīmaṇau ||

caturthadivase devi prāṇān sthāpya yajet kramāt |
rahasya mālāmaṃtrasyāsya ṛṣiḥ parameśvaraḥ ||

śrīmahātāriṇī devī uṣṇikchandaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
krīṁ vījaṃ strīṁ tathā śaktiḥ hūṁ maṃtraḥ kīlakaṃ smṛtaṃ ||

mahāmālā daṃtamālā śodhane viniyojane |
triśaktyā tu ṣaḍaṃgāni dhyānaṃ maṃtravadā caret ||

dhyātvā saṃkalpa yatnenaṃ maṃtreṇānena pārvati |
praṇavaṃ ca tathā lajjāśrīlajā kāmakūrcakaiḥ ||

phaṭ svāheti ca maṃtreṇa vasakemālikau kṣipet |
tatrāvāhanamaṃtrādyaiḥ kālikāṃ kālasāradāṃ ||

sāyudhāṃ parivārāṃśca pūjayet parameśvarī |
mūlamāvṛttya tārtīyaṃ saṃsmarandhenu mudrayā ||

amṛtī kṛtya kavacenāvaguṇya maheśvari |
mahāmudrayā samācchādya devī rūpī vibhāvayet ||

dhyāyet tatra kṣipedviṃduṃ tatra maṃtrān śṛṇu priye |
praṇavaṃ kūrcayugmaṃ ca svāhā praṇavakūrcakau ||

vahnijāyā ca tārāstre vahnijāyā viṣaṃ tathā |
tārā ca vahnijāyāṃ ca tārā lajjā sa kūrcakau ||

vahnijāyā tatastāraṃ lajjā phaṭ vahnijāyayā |
dvitriśṛṃkhalikāvyasta samastamaṃtramālayā ||

<p. 242b>

śatadhānena maṃtreṇa viṃduprakṣepamācaret |
kastūrikā keśaraṃ ca caṃdā gurupradhūpakaiḥ ||

puṣpamālāṃ samuttārya vidyayā cābhimaṃtrayet |
praṇavaṃ ca tathā māyā śrīmahāvajriṇīti ca ||

tato mahāghorarūpe karkaśeti padaṃ vadet |
mahāsthimaṇḍale procya praviśeti padaṃ tathā ||

sarvasiddhiḥ prayaccheti praṇavaṃ kūrcavījakaṃ |
māyāvījaṃ vahnijāyā mahākapālinīti ca ||

tato mahāghorarūpe svāhā praṇava māyayā |
māyā kūrcastri svāhāṃtā vidyoktā cābhimaṃtraṇe ||

durvākṣataiḥ samabhyarcyakāte coddīpanaṃ caret |
upacāraiḥ samabhyarcya mātṛkāṃ mūlamaṃtrataḥ ||

uddīpanaṃ tataḥ kṛtvāhaṃ kāreṇa tu veṣṭayet |
valiṃ dadyādanenaiva tāraṃ māyādvayaṃ vadet ||

vāsudevaṃ viṃduyutaṃ kūrceṇa puṭitaṃ vadet |
kūrcatāre phaṭ ca kūrcaṃ praṇavadvayamuccaret ||

kūrcavījaṃ vahnijāyā praṇavaṃ kūrcavījakaiḥ |
mahāyogini śabdāṃte tatastribhuvanatāriṇī ||

mahāśaṃkhāsthi mālā ca madhye nivāsa kurvati |
kuruśabdaṃ sarvasiddhiṃ dehiyuk ca surāpadaṃ ||

māṃsopahāreṇa gṛhneti yuk gṛhnāya padadvayaṃ |
kullukā phaṭ tataḥ svāhā maṃtreṇānena pārvati ||

yathocitena dravyeṇa valiṃ datvā vidhānataḥ |
paṃcadravyaiḥ paṃcadinaṃ mālāṃ sthāpya ca paṃcame ||

mālā rātrividhiṃ kuryāt tena siddhyati mālikā |
nibhṛte sthāpayet mālāṃ rahasyamālikāvidhiḥ ||

daṃtamālāvidhau devi viśeṣaṃ śṛṇu vā paraṃ |
praṇavaṃ hṛdbhagavatī mānaraṃjini coccaret ||

vicce vicce valocceva haravicce padaṃ vadet |
mālāvicce tathā mālādhāriṇī haralūṁ padaṃ ||

hamavrūṁ mahāśaṃkhāsthidhāriṇīti padaṃ vadet |
karkaśāsthi mahāmālā vāsinīti padaṃ vadet ||

chinne tāre kālike ca tadaṃte japamālike |
kullukāṃ phaṭ mahādaṃtamālā madhye padaṃ vadet ||

nivāsaṃ kuru yugmaṃ ca rājeṃdra mālikāṃ tataḥ |
vāsinīṃ tritayaṃ procya krīṁ trayaṃ hūṁ dvayaṃ tahā ||

māyādvayaṃ ca phaṭ svāhā mālāmaṃtreṇa hṛnmanuḥ |
validāna manuṃ vakṣye śṛṇu sāvahitā bhava ||

<p. 243a>

praṇavaṃ karkaśapadaṃ maṃḍaletyaṃvike padaṃ |
mālinī kaulinī padaṃ gaurāṃ dhāricoccaret ||

girije mālāvati padaṃ kriyāvati padaṃ tataḥ |
gāyatrī ca gāṇapriye śakrapriye ca śāṃkarī ||

kālīkāpālike kṛṣṇamuṇḍadhāriṇi coddharet |
aśidhāriṇīti padaṃ tadaṃte jātavedase ||

śrīkālīkāli ca padaṃ mṛḍāṇī rudrāṇi tathā |
imaṃ valiṃ gṛhnayugmaṃ mālāsiddhiṃ ca cottare ||

dehidāpaya yugmaṃ cakro ṣaṭka sa layāyutaṃ |
valiṃ dadyādane naiva tadaṃte jāgratī kṛtiḥ ||

kapālakajjalaṃ corapādakajjala yugmakaṃ |
viśvamohana nāmānaṃ kajjalaṃ viddhi pārvatī ||

tatpādabhasmadeveśi phālguṇot savajaṃparaṃ |
jagaddhūlīti nāmnā tu vikhyātaṃ śatrunigrahe ||

anena manunā gṛhya udbhrāṃtiṃ dhūlināmikāṃ |
śatru mūrddhni tathā dehegeṇeśayyāṃ gaṇe jale ||

dāpayet parameśāni udbhrāṃtiṃ dhūlirīritā |
udbhrāṃta dhūlyā deveśi bhramākrāṃtaṃ jagadvayaṃ ||

yathā grahaṇayugmaṃ ca tathā parvadvayaṃ bhavet |
nakṣatra rāśi vārādi śuddhā śuddhiṃ na cācaret ||

kāmavījaṃ kṣūṁ tathā vījaṃ śrīṁ śrīṁ phaṭ trayaṃ vadet |
siddhe jāgraddhūli siddhiṃ dehi svāhā manurmataḥ ||

maṃtreṇānena saṃgṛhya udbhrāṃti dhūlimuttamāṃ |
mālyāsiddhyā sarvasiddhirbhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ ||

svajāta kusumaṃ devī kuṇḍagolodbhavaṃ tathā |
anaṃga gaṃdhādeveśi caturthāṃ parikīrtitā ||

evaṃ saṃpādya deveśi jāgratī karaṇaṃ caret |
siṃdūratilakaṃ bhāle vadane saṃvidā savau ||

vīrāsanī vīraveśī dhūpadīpa pramoditaḥ |
saṃviddugdharase mālāṃ kṣiptvā dugdhaṃ tato vadet ||

tato rakte kṣipenmālāṃ dhūpenaiva pradhūpayet |
tato valiṃ pradadyāddhi mālāṃ saṃsiddhaye śive ||

śaktiṃ kumārīṃ mālāṃ vā saṃpūjya siddhibhākkalau |
balidāna vidhau devi valiṃ kṛtvā vidhānataḥ ||

ajāgalastha raktena tarpayet tatramālikāṃ |
raktadhārābhimajjābhiryoni raktairapi priye ||

tarpaṇāt siddhidā mālāyāgadrūpā phalapradā |
pūrvakrameṇa deveśi āveśokta krameṇa vā ||

<p. 243b>

tat taddevī deharūpāmālikā varadā kalau |
evaṃ kṛtvā varāṃ mālāṃ sādhakaḥ siddhimāpnuyāt ||

aśucirnna spṛśedenāṃ na kadāpi prakāśayet |
bhūtarākṣasa vetālā siddha gaṃdharvacāraṇāḥ ||

haraṃti prakaṭī yasmāt tasmādguptāṃ samācaret |
jīrṇasūtraṃ punaḥ sūtraṃ grathayitvā śataṃ japet ||

dvitrimāsaiśca ṣaṇmāsairmālā saṃgrathayecchive |
ṣaṇmāsottaragaṃ devi jīrṇa sūtrasyamālikā ||

yaḥ sthāpayen maheśāni tasya nāśo bhaviṣyati |
chinne sūtre bhavenmṛtyustasmādyatnaparo bhavet ||

mahāśaṃkhamayī mālā tathā daṃtākhyamālikā |
na deyā yasya kasyāpi gopyānu mātṛjāravat ||

athavāṃguli mālābhirjapaṃ kuryāt taducyate |
anāmā madhyamārabhya kaniṣṭhānu krameṇa tu ||

madhyamā mūlaparyaṃtā karamālā prakīrtitā |
madhyamā nāmikā madhye parvayugmaṃ prakalpayet ||

meruṃ vā nāmikā mūlāt kaniṣṭhānu krameṇa ca |
tarjanyagrādito madhyāmūlāṃtaṃ daśasaṃkhyakāḥ ||

athavā kalpayenmeruṃ madhyāmadhyādiparvakaṃ |
anāmā madhyaparvā tu tarjanī mūlakāvadhi ||

daśasaṃkhyā jape proktā tathā yaṃtrividhomataḥ |
tatrādau trividho proktaḥ śatamaṣṭottaraṃ śṛṇu ||

anāmā mūlamārabhya prādakṣiṇya krameṇa tu |
tarjanī mūlaparyaṃtaṃ japenna vasu parvasu ||

madhyamā tritayaṃ grāhyamanāmā mūlameva ca |
anāmā madhyamaṃ caikaṃ meruṃ kṛtvā na laṃghayet ||

idaṃ ca dvādaśāvṛtyā aṣṭottaraśataṃ bhavet |
aṃgulyākhyo japaḥ prokto namatennonnatena ca ||

kaniṣṭhikāṃtaścāṃguṣṭo vadhyeyaṃ daśakaṃ bhavet |
aṃgulīgatarekhābhirjapāllekhā japo bhavet ||

aṃgulirnna viyuṃjīta japamāle kadācanaṃ |
aṃgulīnāṃ viyogena chidreṣu sravate japaḥ ||

nollaṃghaye ca gaṇanāṃ kiṃcit saṃkocayettalaṃ |
na darśayet karaṃ no cetphalalaṃ gṛhnaṃti rākṣasāḥ ||

<p. 244a>

[iti śrītaṃtraciṃtāmaṇau mālābhedādipratiṣṭāṃtanirṇayo nāma triṃśattamaḥ 
prakāśaḥ] || 30 ||




